#: ../../content/developer.rst:6
msgid "Developer"
msgstr "Dasturchi"

#: ../../content/developer.rst:13
msgid ""
"Welcome to the developer documentation of Odoo! Whether you're a seasoned "
"developer or just getting started, you'll find here all the technical "
"guidance and resources you need for developing Odoo applications. Explore "
"our extensive collection of tutorials, how-to guides, and reference "
"materials to achieve your development goals."
msgstr ""
"Odoo dasturchi hujjatlariga xush kelibsiz! Tajribali dasturchi bo'lasizmi "
"yoki endi boshlayapsizmi, bu yerda Odoo ilovalarini ishlab chiqish uchun "
"zarur bo'lgan barcha texnik ko'rsatmalar va resurslarni topasiz. Ishlab "
"chiqish maqsadlaringizga erishish uchun bizning keng qamrovli qo'llanmalar, "
"how-to guide'lar va ma'lumotnoma materiallari to'plamimizni o'rganing."

#: ../../content/developer.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Odoo development ecosystem is built on a modular and extensible "
"architecture that allows you to extend existing applications or create new "
"ones to meet the specific needs of modern businesses. You can make use of "
"the tools and frameworks provided by Odoo to focus on getting your web "
"application up and running quickly, without needing to reinvent the wheel "
"and worry about the underlying infrastructure."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ishlab chiqish ekotizimi modulli va kengaytiriluvchan arxitekturaga "
"asoslangan bo'lib, u sizga mavjud ilovalarni kengaytirish yoki zamonaviy "
"biznesning aniq ehtiyojlariga javob beradigan yangilarini yaratish imkonini "
"beradi. Odoo taqdim etadigan vositalar va framework'lardan foydalanib, "
"g'ildirakni qaytadan ixtiro qilmasdan va asosiy infratuzilma haqida "
"qayg'urmasdan, web ilovangizni tezda ishga tushirishga e'tibor qaratishingiz "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer.rst:24
msgid ""
"If you are new to Odoo or web application development, start with "
"the :doc:`developer/tutorials/server_framework_101` tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz Odoo yoki web ilovalarni ishlab chiqishda yangi "
"bo'lsangiz, :doc:`developer/tutorials/server_framework_101` qo'llanmasidan "
"boshlang."

#: ../../content/developer.rst:29 ../../content/developer/tutorials.rst:6
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "Qo'llanmalar"

#: ../../content/developer.rst:29
msgid ""
"Tutorials take you by the hand through hands-on exercises to build skills "
"and familiarity in Odoo development."
msgstr ""
"Qo'llanmalar sizni amaliy mashqlar orqali bosqichma-bosqich olib borib, Odoo "
"ishlab chiqishda ko'nikma va tajriba shakllantiradi."

#: ../../content/developer.rst:35 ../../content/developer/howtos.rst:6
msgid "How-to guides"
msgstr "How-to qo'llanmalar"

#: ../../content/developer.rst:35
msgid ""
"Recipes that provide a step-by-step guide for addressing real-world problems "
"and use-cases."
msgstr ""
"Real hayotdagi muammolar va foydalanish holatlarini hal qilish uchun "
"bosqichma-bosqich yo'riqnoma beruvchi retseptlar."

