msgstr "external identifiers"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:12
msgid ""
"string identifier stored in ``ir.model.data``, can be used to refer to a "
"record regardless of its database identifier during data imports or export/"
"import roundtrips."
msgstr ""
"``ir.model.data`` da saqlanadigan satrli identifikator; ma'lumotlarni import "
"qilishda yoki export/import sikllarida record'ga uning ma'lumotlar "
"bazasidagi identifikatoridan qat'i nazar murojaat qilish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:16
msgid ""
"External identifiers are in the form :samp:`{module}.{id}` (e.g. "
"``account.invoice_graph``). From within a module, the :samp:`{module}.` "
"prefix can be left out."
msgstr ""
"External identifier'lar :samp:`{module}.{id}` ko'rinishida bo'ladi (masalan "
"``account.invoice_graph``). Module ichidan :samp:`{module}.` prefiksini "
"tushirib qoldirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:20
msgid ""
"Sometimes referred to as \"xml id\" or ``xml_id`` as XML-"
"based :ref:`reference/data` make extensive use of them."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zan \"xml id\" yoki ``xml_id`` deb ataladi, chunki XML "
"asosidagi :ref:`reference/data` ulardan keng foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:22
msgid "format string"
msgstr "format string"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:24
msgid ""
"inspired by `jinja variables`_, format strings allow more easily mixing "
"literal content and computed content (expressions): content between ``{{`` "
"and ``}}`` is interpreted as an expression and evaluated, other content is "
"interpreted as literal strings and displayed as-is"
msgstr ""
"`jinja variables`_ dan ilhomlangan format string'lar literal kontent bilan "
"hisoblanadigan kontentni (ifodalarni) osonroq aralashtirish imkonini beradi: "
"``{{`` va ``}}`` orasidagi kontent ifoda sifatida talqin qilinib "
"hisoblanadi, qolgan kontent esa literal satr sifatida talqin qilinib, o'z "
"holicha ko'rsatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:29
msgid "GIS"
msgstr "GIS"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:30
msgid "Geographic Information System"
msgstr "Geographic Information System"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:32
msgid ""
"any computer system or subsystem to capture, store, manipulate, analyze, "
"manage or present spatial and geographical data."
msgstr ""
"fazoviy va geografik ma'lumotlarni yig'ish, saqlash, o'zgartirish, tahlil "
"qilish, boshqarish yoki taqdim etish uchun mo'ljallangan har qanday "
"kompyuter tizimi yoki quyi tizimi."

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:34
msgid "minified"
msgstr "minified"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:35
msgid "minification"
msgstr "minification"

#: ../../content/developer/glossary.rst:37
msgid ""
"process of removing extraneous/non-necessary sections of files (comments, "
"whitespace) and possibly recompiling them using equivalent but shorter "
"structures (`ternary operator`_ instead of ``if/else``) in order to reduce "
"network traffic"
msgstr ""
"tarmoq trafigini kamaytirish maqsadida fayllarning ortiqcha/keraksiz "
"qismlarini (izohlar, bo'shliqlar) olib tashlash va ularni ekvivalent, ammo "
"qisqaroq strukturalar yordamida qayta kompilyatsiya qilish jarayoni (``if/"
"else`` o'rniga `ternary operator`_)"

