#: ../../content/developer/howtos/accounting_localization.rst:13
msgid "Installation procedure"
msgstr "O'rnatish tartibi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/accounting_localization.rst:15
msgid ""
"On installing the `account <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"account>`_ module, the localization module corresponding to the country code "
"of the company is installed automatically. In case of no country code set or "
"no localization module found, the `l10n_generic_coa <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/blob/19.0/addons/l10n_generic_coa>`_ (US) localization module is "
"installed by default. Check `post init hook <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/19.0/addons/account/__init__.py>`_ for details."
msgstr ""
"`account <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/account>`_ module'i "
"o'rnatilganda, kompaniyaning davlat kodiga mos keluvchi lokalizatsiya "
"module'i avtomatik ravishda o'rnatiladi. Agar davlat kodi belgilanmagan yoki "
"mos lokalizatsiya module'i topilmasa, sukut bo'yicha `l10n_generic_coa "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/l10n_generic_coa>`_ (US) "
"lokalizatsiya module'i o'rnatiladi. Tafsilotlar uchun `post init hook "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/account/__init__.py>`_ ni "
"ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/accounting_localization.rst:19
msgid ""
"For example, `l10n_ch <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"l10n_ch>`_ will be installed if the company has ``Switzerland`` as country."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, agar kompaniyaning davlati ``Switzerland`` bo'lsa, `l10n_ch "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/l10n_ch>`_ o'rnatiladi."

