msgstr ":ref:`Account Tag havolalari <reference/account_account_tag>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/accounting_localization.rst:91
msgid ""
"Tags are a way to sort accounts. For example, imagine you want to create a "
"financial report having multiple lines but you have no way to find a rule to "
"dispatch the accounts according to their ``code``. The solution is the usage "
"of tags, one for each report line, to filter accounts like you want."
msgstr ""
"Tag'lar account'larni saralash usulidir. Masalan, tasavvur qiling, siz bir "
"nechta qatordan iborat moliyaviy hisobot yaratmoqchisiz, lekin account'larni "
"ularning ``code`` qiymatiga qarab taqsimlash uchun qoida topa olmaysiz. "
"Yechim — har bir hisobot qatori uchun bittadan tag ishlatish va shu orqali "
"account'larni xohlaganingizdek filtrlash."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/accounting_localization.rst:95
msgid "Put the tags in the :file:`data/account_account_tag_data.xml` file."
msgstr ""
"Tag'larni :file:`data/account_account_tag_data.xml` fayliga joylashtiring."

