"Odoo interfeysida soliq konfiguratsiyasini ko'rib chiqqaningizda ham "
"oydinlashadi (yoki hujjatlarni tekshiring: :ref:`Tax havolalari <reference/"
"account_tax>`, :ref:`Tax Repartition havolalari <reference/"
"account_tax_repartition>`)."

