#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:6
msgid "Multi-company Guidelines"
msgstr "Multi-company bo'yicha qo'llanmalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:10
msgid ""
"This tutorial requires good knowledge of Odoo. Please refer to the :doc:`../"
"tutorials/server_framework_101` tutorial first if needed."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu qo'llanma Odoo'ni yaxshi bilishni talab qiladi. Kerak bo'lsa, "
"avval :doc:`../tutorials/server_framework_101` qo'llanmasiga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:13
msgid ""
"As of version 13.0, a user can be logged in to multiple companies at once. "
"This allows the user to access information from multiple companies, but also "
"to create/edit records in a multi-company environment."
msgstr ""
"13.0 versiyasidan boshlab foydalanuvchi bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta "
"kompaniyaga kirgan bo'lishi mumkin. Bu foydalanuvchiga bir nechta kompaniya "
"ma'lumotlariga kirish, shuningdek multi-company environment'da record'lar "
"yaratish/tahrirlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:17
msgid ""
"If not managed correctly, it may be the source of a lot of inconsistent "
"multi-company behaviors. For instance, a user logged in to both companies A "
"and B could create a sales order in company A and add products belonging to "
"company B to it. It is only when the user logs out from company B that "
"access errors will occur for the sales order."
msgstr ""
"To'g'ri boshqarilmasa, bu ko'plab nomuvofiq multi-company xatti-harakatlar "
"manbai bo'lishi mumkin. Masalan, A va B kompaniyalarining ikkalasiga ham "
"kirgan foydalanuvchi A kompaniyasida sotuv buyurtmasini yaratib, unga B "
"kompaniyasiga tegishli mahsulotlarni qo'shishi mumkin. Kirish xatolari faqat "
"foydalanuvchi B kompaniyasidan chiqqanidan keyin sotuv buyurtmasi uchun "
"yuzaga keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:22
msgid ""
"To correctly manage multi-company behaviors, Odoo's ORM provides multiple "
"features:"
msgstr ""
"Multi-company xatti-harakatlarini to'g'ri boshqarish uchun Odoo ORM'i bir "
"nechta imkoniyat taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:24
msgid ":ref:`Company-dependent fields <howto/company/company_dependent>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Company-dependent field'lar <howto/company/company_dependent>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:25
msgid ":ref:`Multi-company consistency <howto/company/check_company>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Multi-company muvofiqligi <howto/company/check_company>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:26
msgid ":ref:`Default company <howto/company/default_company>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Standart kompaniya <howto/company/default_company>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:27
msgid ":ref:`Views <howto/company/views>`"
msgstr ":ref:`View'lar <howto/company/views>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:28
msgid ":ref:`Security rules <howto/company/security>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Xavfsizlik qoidalari <howto/company/security>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:33
msgid "Company-dependent fields"
msgstr "Company-dependent field'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:35
msgid ""
"When a record is available from multiple companies, we must expect that "
"different values will be assigned to a given field depending on the company "
"from which the value is set."
msgstr ""
"Record bir nechta kompaniyadan mavjud bo'lganda, qiymat qaysi kompaniyadan "
"belgilanganiga qarab berilgan field'ga turli qiymatlar tayinlanishini kutish "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:38
msgid ""
"For the field of the same record to support several values, it must be "
"defined with the attribute `company_dependent` set to `True`."
msgstr ""
"Bir xil record'ning field'i bir nechta qiymatni qo'llab-quvvatlashi uchun u "
"`company_dependent` atributi `True` ga o'rnatilgan holda aniqlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:57
msgid ""
"The `_compute_display_info` method is decorated with "
"`depends_context('company')` (see :attr:`~odoo.api.depends_context`) to "
"ensure that the computed field is recomputed depending on the current "
"company (`self.env.company`)."
msgstr ""
"`_compute_display_info` method joriy kompaniyaga (`self.env.company`) qarab "
"computed field qayta hisoblanishini ta'minlash uchun "
"`depends_context('company')` bilan dekoratsiyalangan "
"(qarang :attr:`~odoo.api.depends_context`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:61
msgid ""
"When a company-dependent field is read, the current company is used to "
"retrieve its value. In other words, if a user is logged in to companies A "
"and B with A as the main company and creates a record for company B, the "
"value of company-dependent fields will be that of company A."
msgstr ""
"Company-dependent field o'qilganda uning qiymatini olish uchun joriy "
"kompaniya ishlatiladi. Boshqacha aytganda, agar foydalanuvchi A va B "
"kompaniyalariga A asosiy kompaniya sifatida kirgan bo'lsa va B kompaniyasi "
"uchun record yaratsa, company-dependent field'lar qiymati A kompaniyasiniki "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:65
msgid ""
"To read the values of company-dependent fields set by another company than "
"the current one, we need to ensure the company we are using is the correct "
"one.  This can be done with :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.with_company`, which "
"updates the current company."
msgstr ""
"Joriy kompaniyadan boshqa kompaniya tomonidan belgilangan company-dependent "
"field'lar qiymatlarini o'qish uchun ishlatayotgan kompaniyamiz to'g'ri "
"ekanligiga ishonch hosil qilishimiz kerak. Buni joriy kompaniyani "
"yangilaydigan :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.with_company` yordamida amalga "
"oshirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:80
msgid ""
"Whenever you are computing/creating/... things that may behave differently "
"in different companies, you should make sure whatever you are doing is done "
"in the right company. It doesn't cost much to always use `with_company` to "
"avoid problems later."
msgstr ""
"Turli kompaniyalarda har xil ishlashi mumkin bo'lgan narsalarni "
"hisoblayotganingizda/yaratayotganingizda/... qilayotgan ishingiz to'g'ri "
"kompaniyada bajarilishiga ishonch hosil qiling. Keyinchalik muammolarga duch "
"kelmaslik uchun doimo `with_company` dan foydalanish qimmatga tushmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:101
msgid "Multi-company consistency"
msgstr "Multi-company muvofiqligi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:103
msgid ""
"When a record is made shareable between several companies by the means of a "
"`company_id` field, we must take care that it cannot be linked to the record "
"of another company through a relational field. For instance, we do not want "
"to have a sales order and its invoice belonging to different companies."
msgstr ""
"Record `company_id` field yordamida bir nechta kompaniya o'rtasida "
"bo'lishiladigan qilinganda, u relational field orqali boshqa kompaniyaning "
"record'iga bog'lanmasligiga e'tibor berishimiz kerak. Masalan, biz sotuv "
"buyurtmasi va uning hisob-fakturasi turli kompaniyalarga tegishli bo'lishini "
"xohlamaymiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:107
msgid "To ensure this multi-company consistency, you must:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu multi-company muvofiqligini ta'minlash uchun siz quyidagilarni "
"bajarishingiz kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:109
msgid "Set the class attribute `_check_company_auto` to `True`."
msgstr "`_check_company_auto` class atributini `True` ga o'rnating."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:110
msgid ""
"Define relational fields with the attribute `check_company` set to `True` if "
"their model has a `company_id` field."
msgstr ""
"Agar ularning model'ida `company_id` field bo'lsa, relational field'larni "
"`check_company` atributi `True` ga o'rnatilgan holda aniqlang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:113
msgid ""
"On each :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create` "
"and :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.write`, automatic checks will be triggered to "
"ensure the multi-company consistency of the record."
msgstr ""
"Har bir :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create` "
"va :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.write` da record'ning multi-company "
"muvofiqligini ta'minlash uchun avtomatik tekshiruvlar ishga tushiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:127
msgid "The field `company_id` must not be defined with `check_company=True`."
msgstr "`company_id` field'i `check_company=True` bilan aniqlanmasligi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:132
msgid ""
"The `check_company` feature performs a strict check! It means that if a "
"record has no `company_id` (i.e., the field is not required), it cannot be "
"linked to a record whose `company_id` is set."
msgstr ""
"`check_company` imkoniyati qat'iy tekshiruv o'tkazadi! Bu shuni anglatadiki, "
"agar record'da `company_id` bo'lmasa (ya'ni field majburiy bo'lmasa), uni "
"`company_id` belgilangan record'ga bog'lab bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:138
msgid ""
"When no domain is defined on the field and `check_company` is set to `True`, "
"a default domain is added: `['|', '('company_id', '=', False), "
"('company_id', '=', company_id)]`"
msgstr ""
"Field'da hech qanday domain aniqlanmagan va `check_company` `True` ga "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, standart domain qo'shiladi: `['|', '('company_id', '=', "
"False), ('company_id', '=', company_id)]`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:144
msgid "Default company"
msgstr "Standart kompaniya"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:146
msgid ""
"When the field `company_id` is made required on a model, a good practice is "
"to set a default company. It eases the setup flow for the user or even "
"guarantees its validity when the company is hidden from view. Indeed, the "
"company is usually hidden if the user does not have access to multiple "
"companies (i.e., when the user does not have the group "
"`base.group_multi_company`)."
msgstr ""
"`company_id` field model'da majburiy qilinganda, standart kompaniyani "
"belgilash yaxshi amaliyot hisoblanadi. Bu foydalanuvchi uchun sozlash "
"oqimini osonlashtiradi yoki kompaniya ko'rinishdan yashirilgan bo'lsa, uning "
"to'g'riligini kafolatlaydi. Darhaqiqat, agar foydalanuvchining bir nechta "
"kompaniyaga kirish huquqi bo'lmasa (ya'ni foydalanuvchida "
"`base.group_multi_company` guruhi bo'lmasa), kompaniya odatda yashiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:168
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:129
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:91
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:776
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:497
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:294
msgid "Views"
msgstr "View'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:170
msgid ""
"As stated in :ref:`above <howto/company/default_company>`, the company is "
"usually hidden from view if the user does not have access to multiple "
"companies. This is assessed with the group `base.group_multi_company`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`yuqorida <howto/company/default_company>` aytib o'tilganidek, agar "
"foydalanuvchining bir nechta kompaniyaga kirish huquqi bo'lmasa, kompaniya "
"odatda ko'rinishdan yashiriladi. Bu `base.group_multi_company` guruhi bilan "
"baholanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:197
msgid "Security rules"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik qoidalari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:199
msgid ""
"When working with records shared across companies or restricted to a single "
"company, we must take care that a user does not have access to records "
"belonging to other companies."
msgstr ""
"Kompaniyalar o'rtasida bo'lishiladigan yoki bitta kompaniya bilan cheklangan "
"record'lar bilan ishlaganda, foydalanuvchi boshqa kompaniyalarga tegishli "
"record'larga kirish huquqiga ega bo'lmasligiga e'tibor berishimiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/company.rst:202
msgid ""
"This is achieved with security rules based on `company_ids`, which contain "
"the current companies of the user (the companies the user checked in the "
"multi-company widget)."
msgstr ""
"Bunga foydalanuvchining joriy kompaniyalarini (foydalanuvchi multi-company "
"widget'ida belgilagan kompaniyalarni) o'z ichiga olgan `company_ids` ga "
"asoslangan xavfsizlik qoidalari yordamida erishiladi."

