#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:5
msgid ""
"IoT Drivers allow any Odoo module to communicate in real-time with any "
"device connected to the IoT Box. Communication with the IoT Box goes both "
"ways, so the Odoo client can send commands to and receive information from "
"any of the supported devices."
msgstr ""
"IoT Driver'lar istalgan Odoo modulining IoT Box'ga ulangan istalgan qurilma "
"bilan real vaqtda aloqa qilishiga imkon beradi. IoT Box bilan aloqa ikki "
"tomonlama bo'lgani uchun Odoo klienti qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan istalgan "
"qurilmaga buyruqlar yuborishi va undan ma'lumot olishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:10
msgid "To add support for a device, all we need is:"
msgstr ""
"Qurilmani qo'llab-quvvatlashni qo'shish uchun bizga faqat quyidagilar kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:12
msgid "an `Interface`, to detect connected devices of a specific type"
msgstr "ma'lum turdagi ulangan qurilmalarni aniqlash uchun `Interface`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:13
msgid "a `Driver`, to communicate with an individual device"
msgstr "alohida qurilma bilan aloqa qilish uchun `Driver`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:15
msgid ""
"At each boot, the IoT Box will load all of the Interfaces and Drivers that "
"can be located on the connected Odoo instance. Each module can contain an "
"`iot_handlers` directory that will be copied to the IoT Box. The structure "
"of this directory is the following"
msgstr ""
"Har bir yuklanishda IoT Box ulangan Odoo instance'ida topilishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan barcha Interface va Driver'larni yuklaydi. Har bir modul IoT Box'ga "
"nusxalanadigan `iot_handlers` katalogini o'z ichiga olishi mumkin. Ushbu "
"katalogning tuzilishi quyidagicha"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:34
msgid "Detect Devices"
msgstr "Qurilmalarni aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:36
msgid ""
"Devices connected to the IoT Box are detected through `Interfaces`. There is "
"an Interface for each supported connection type (USB, Bluetooth, Video, "
"Printers, Serial, etc.). The interface maintains a list of detected devices "
"and associates them with the right Driver."
msgstr ""
"IoT Box'ga ulangan qurilmalar `Interfaces` orqali aniqlanadi. Qo'llab-"
"quvvatlanadigan har bir ulanish turi (USB, Bluetooth, Video, Printer, Serial "
"va h.k.) uchun alohida Interface mavjud. Interface aniqlangan qurilmalar "
"ro'yxatini yuritadi va ularni to'g'ri Driver bilan bog'laydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:41
msgid ""
"Supported devices will appear both on the IoT Box Homepage that you can "
"access through its IP address and in the IoT module of the connected Odoo "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan qurilmalar IP manzili orqali kirish mumkin bo'lgan "
"IoT Box Homepage'da ham, ulangan Odoo instance'ining IoT modulida ham paydo "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:45
msgid "Interface"
msgstr "Interface"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:47
msgid ""
"The role of the Interface is to maintain a list of devices connected through "
"a determined connection type. Creating a new interface requires"
msgstr ""
"Interface'ning vazifasi — ma'lum bir ulanish turi orqali ulangan qurilmalar "
"ro'yxatini yuritish. Yangi interface yaratish uchun quyidagilar talab "
"qilinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:50
msgid "Extending the `Interface` class"
msgstr "`Interface` class'ini kengaytirish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:51
msgid "Setting the `connection_type` class attribute"
msgstr "`connection_type` class atributini o'rnatish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:52
msgid ""
"Implementing the `get_devices` method, that should return a dictionary "
"containing data about each detected device. This data will be given as "
"argument to the constructors and `supported` method of the Drivers."
msgstr ""
"Har bir aniqlangan qurilma haqidagi ma'lumotlarni o'z ichiga olgan lug'atni "
"qaytarishi kerak bo'lgan `get_devices` method'ini amalga oshirish. Ushbu "
"ma'lumotlar Driver'larning konstruktorlariga va `supported` method'iga "
"argument sifatida beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:57
msgid ""
"Setting the `_loop_delay` attribute will modify the interval between calls "
"to `get_devices`. By default, this interval is set to 3 seconds."
msgstr ""
"`_loop_delay` atributini o'rnatish `get_devices` ga chaqiruvlar orasidagi "
"intervalni o'zgartiradi. Sukut bo'yicha bu interval 3 soniyaga o'rnatilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:74
msgid "Driver"
msgstr "Driver"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:76
msgid ""
"Once the interface has retrieved the list of detected devices, it will loop "
"through all of the Drivers that have the same `connection_type` attribute "
"and test their respective `supported` method on all detected devices. If the "
"supported method of a Driver returns `True`, an instance of this Driver will "
"be created for the corresponding device."
msgstr ""
"Interface aniqlangan qurilmalar ro'yxatini olgach, u bir xil "
"`connection_type` attribute'iga ega barcha Driver'lar bo'ylab aylanadi va "
"ularning `supported` method'ini aniqlangan har bir qurilmada tekshiradi. "
"Agar Driver'ning supported method'i `True` qaytarsa, mos qurilma uchun shu "
"Driver'ning instance'i yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:83
msgid ""
"`supported` methods of drivers are given a priority order. The `supported` "
"method of a child class will always be tested before the one of its parent. "
"This priority can be adjusted by modifying the `priority` attribute of the "
"Driver."
msgstr ""
"Driver'larning `supported` method'lari ustuvorlik tartibiga ega. Child "
"class'ning `supported` method'i har doim uning parent'idagidan oldin "
"tekshiriladi. Bu ustuvorlikni Driver'ning `priority` attribute'ini "
"o'zgartirish orqali sozlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:88
msgid "Creating a new Driver requires:"
msgstr "Yangi Driver yaratish uchun quyidagilar zarur:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:90
msgid "Extending `Driver`"
msgstr "`Driver`'ni extend qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:91
msgid "Setting the `connection_type` class attribute."
msgstr "`connection_type` class attribute'ini belgilash."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:92
msgid ""
"Setting the `device_type`, `device_connection` and `device_name` attributes."
msgstr ""
"`device_type`, `device_connection` va `device_name` attribute'larini "
"belgilash."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:93
msgid "Defining the `supported` method"
msgstr "`supported` method'ini aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:113
msgid "Communicate With Devices"
msgstr "Qurilmalar bilan aloqa qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once your new device is detected and appears in the IoT module, the next "
"step is to communicate with it. Since the box only has a local IP address, "
"it can only be reached from the same local network. Communication, "
"therefore, needs to happen on the browser-side, in JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Yangi qurilmangiz aniqlanib IoT module'da paydo bo'lgach, keyingi qadam — u "
"bilan aloqa qilishdir. Box faqat lokal IP manzilga ega bo'lgani uchun unga "
"faqat shu lokal tarmoq ichidan murojaat qilish mumkin. Shu sababli aloqa "
"browser tomonida, JavaScript'da amalga oshirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:120
msgid ""
"The process depends on the direction of the communication: - From the "
"browser to the box, through `Actions`_ - From the box to the browser, "
"through `Longpolling`_"
msgstr ""
"Jarayon aloqa yo'nalishiga bog'liq: - browser'dan box'ga — `Actions`_ orqali "
"- box'dan browser'ga — `Longpolling`_ orqali"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:124
msgid ""
"Both channels are accessed from the same JS object, the `DeviceProxy`, which "
"is instantiated using the IP of the IoT Box and the device identifier."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala kanalga ham bitta JS object — `DeviceProxy` orqali murojaat qilinadi; "
"u IoT Box'ning IP manzili va qurilma identifikatori yordamida instantiate "
"qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:137
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:1124
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:1535
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:43
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:3
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/05_firstui.rst:45
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Actions"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:139
msgid ""
"Actions are used to tell a selected device to execute a specific action, "
"such as taking a picture, printing a receipt, etc."
msgstr ""
"Action'lar tanlangan qurilmaga muayyan amalni bajarishni buyurish uchun "
"ishlatiladi, masalan rasm olish, chek chiqarish va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:143
msgid ""
"It must be noted that no “answer” will be sent by the box on this route, "
"only the request status. The answer to the action, if any, has to be "
"retrieved via the longpolling."
msgstr ""
"Shuni ta'kidlash kerak: box bu route bo'yicha hech qanday “javob” "
"yubormaydi, faqat request holatini qaytaradi. Action'ga javob, agar bo'lsa, "
"longpolling orqali olinishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:147
msgid "An action can be performed on the DeviceProxy Object."
msgstr "Action'ni DeviceProxy Object ustida bajarish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:153
msgid ""
"In your driver, define an `action` method that will be executed when called "
"from an Odoo module. It takes the data given during the call as argument."
msgstr ""
"Driver'ingizda `action` method'ini aniqlang — u Odoo module'dan "
"chaqirilganda bajariladi. U chaqiruv vaqtida berilgan ma'lumotni argument "
"sifatida oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:162
msgid "Longpolling"
msgstr "Longpolling"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:164
msgid ""
"When any module in Odoo wants to read data from a specific device, it "
"creates a listener identified by the IP/domain of the box and the device "
"identifier and passes it a callback function to be called every time the "
"device status changes. The callback is called with the new data as argument."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'dagi biror module muayyan qurilmadan ma'lumot o'qishni xohlasa, u "
"box'ning IP/domain'i va qurilma identifikatori bilan aniqlanadigan listener "
"yaratadi hamda unga qurilma holati har o'zgarganda chaqiriladigan callback "
"funksiyani beradi. Callback yangi ma'lumot argument sifatida berilgan holda "
"chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/connect_device.rst:177
msgid ""
"In the Driver, an event is released by calling the `device_changed` function "
"from the `event_manager`. All callbacks set on the listener will then be "
"called with `self.data` as argument."
msgstr ""
"Driver'da event `event_manager` dan `device_changed` funksiyasini chaqirish "
"orqali chiqariladi. Shundan so'ng listener'ga o'rnatilgan barcha "
"callback'lar `self.data` argumenti bilan chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:5
msgid ""
"SQL views are a technique for creating customized reports to show data that "
"cannot be shown with existing models' fields and views. In other words, this "
"technique helps avoid unnecessary creation and calculation of additional "
"fields solely for data analysis purposes."
msgstr ""
"SQL view'lar mavjud model'larning field'lari va view'lari bilan ko'rsatib "
"bo'lmaydigan ma'lumotlarni aks ettiruvchi moslashtirilgan report'lar "
"yaratish usulidir. Boshqacha aytganda, bu usul faqat ma'lumotlarni tahlil "
"qilish maqsadida qo'shimcha field'lar yaratish va hisoblashdan qutulishga "
"yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:11
msgid "Create a model"
msgstr "Model yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:13
msgid "A SQL view is created in a similar manner as a standard model:"
msgstr "SQL view standart model'ga o'xshash tarzda yaratiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:26
msgid "Where the attributes:"
msgstr "Bu yerda attribute'lar:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:28
msgid ""
"`_auto = False` indicates that we do not want to store the model in the "
"database"
msgstr ""
"`_auto = False` model'ni ma'lumotlar bazasida saqlashni istamasligimizni "
"bildiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:29
msgid ""
"`_rec_name` indicates which of the model's fields represents a record's name "
"(i.e. the name that will be used in the navigation breadcrumb when opening a "
"record's form view)"
msgstr ""
"`_rec_name` model'ning qaysi field'i record nomini ifodalashini bildiradi "
"(ya'ni record'ning form view'i ochilganda navigatsiya breadcrumb'ida "
"ishlatiladigan nom)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:32
msgid ""
"and its fields are defined in the same way as a standard model, except every "
"field is marked as `readonly=True`."
msgstr ""
"va uning field'lari standart model'dagidek aniqlanadi, faqat har bir field "
"`readonly=True` deb belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:36
msgid "Don't forget to add your new model to your security file."
msgstr "Yangi model'ingizni security faylingizga qo'shishni unutmang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:39
msgid "Populate the model"
msgstr "Model'ni to'ldirish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:41
msgid "There are 2 ways to populate a SQL view's table:"
msgstr "SQL view jadvalini to'ldirishning 2 yo'li mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:43
msgid "override the `BaseModel.init()` method,"
msgstr "`BaseModel.init()` method'ini override qilish,"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:44
msgid "set the `_table_query` property."
msgstr "`_table_query` property'sini belgilash."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:46
msgid ""
"Regardless of which way is used, a SQL query will be executed to populate "
"the model. Therefore, any SQL commands can be used to collect and/or "
"calculate the data needed and you are expected to keep in mind that you are "
"bypassing the ORM (i.e. it is a good idea to read through :ref:`reference/"
"security` if you haven't already). The columns returned from the `SELECT` "
"will populate the model's fields, so ensure that your column names match "
"your field names, or use alias names that match."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi yo'l ishlatilganidan qat'i nazar, model'ni to'ldirish uchun SQL query "
"bajariladi. Shu sababli kerakli ma'lumotni yig'ish va/yoki hisoblash uchun "
"har qanday SQL buyruqlaridan foydalanish mumkin, biroq siz ORM'ni chetlab "
"o'tayotganingizni yodda tutishingiz kerak (ya'ni agar hali o'qimagan "
"bo'lsangiz, :ref:`reference/security` bo'limini o'qib chiqish foydali). "
"`SELECT` dan qaytgan ustunlar model'ning field'larini to'ldiradi, shuning "
"uchun ustun nomlari field nomlaringizga mos kelishini ta'minlang yoki mos "
"alias nomlardan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:55
msgid "Overriding `BaseModel.init()`"
msgstr "`BaseModel.init()`'ni override qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:57
msgid ""
"In most cases, overriding the `BaseModel.init()` method is the standard and "
"better option to use. It requires the import of `tools` and is typically "
"written as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Ko'p hollarda `BaseModel.init()` method'ini override qilish standart va "
"afzal variant hisoblanadi. U `tools`'ni import qilishni talab qiladi va "
"odatda quyidagicha yoziladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:71
msgid ""
"`tools.drop_view_if_exists` ensures that a conflicting view is not created "
"when the SQL query is executed. It is standard to separate the different "
"parts of the query to allow for easier model extension. Exactly how the "
"query is split up across methods is not standardized, but at minimum, the "
"`_select` and `_from` methods are common, and of course, all these methods "
"will return strings."
msgstr ""
"`tools.drop_view_if_exists` SQL query bajarilganda ziddiyatli view "
"yaratilmasligini ta'minlaydi. Model'ni keyinchalik osonroq extend qilish "
"uchun query'ning turli qismlarini ajratib yozish standart amaliyotdir. "
"Query'ni method'lar bo'ylab qanday taqsimlash aniq standartlashtirilmagan, "
"lekin eng kamida `_select` va `_from` method'lari keng tarqalgan va, "
"tabiiyki, bu method'larning barchasi string qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/create_reports.rst:78
msgid ""
