#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:112
msgid ""
"Owl components are rendered entirely in JavaScript by the browser. This can "
"cause some issues:"
msgstr ""
"Owl component'lari to'liq JavaScript yordamida brauzerda render qilinadi. Bu "
"ba'zi muammolarni keltirib chiqarishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:115
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:122
msgid "Layout shift"
msgstr "Layout shift (joylashuv siljishi)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:116
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:147
msgid "Poorer indexing by search engines"
msgstr "Qidiruv tizimlari tomonidan yomonroq indekslanishi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:118
msgid ""
"For these reasons, you should only use Owl components on the portal and "
"website for specific use cases described below."
msgstr ""
"Shu sabablarga ko'ra, portal va website'da Owl component'laridan faqat "
"quyida tavsiflangan maxsus holatlarda foydalanish kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:124
msgid ""
"When a page initially renders content, and that content subsequently moves "
"(\"shifts\") within the page, this is referred to as a layout shift. When "
"using Owl components in the portal or website, all of the HTML that "
"surrounds the Owl component is rendered by the server and is the first thing "
"that will be displayed to the user. When JavaScript starts running, Owl will "
"mount your component, which will likely cause the surrounding elements to "
"move around on the page. This can cause poor user experience: the user sees "
"an element on the page that was initially rendered and with which they want "
"to interact, so they move their cursor or finger above that element. Just as "
"they're about to click, the Owl component is mounted, and the element they "
"want to interact with is moved. They click and interact with the Owl app "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"Sahifa dastlab kontentni render qilib, keyin o'sha kontent sahifa ichida "
"joyini o'zgartirsa (\"siljisa\"), bu layout shift deb ataladi. Portal yoki "
"website'da Owl component'laridan foydalanganda, Owl component'ni o'rab "
"turgan barcha HTML server tomonidan render qilinadi va foydalanuvchiga "
"birinchi bo'lib ko'rsatiladi. JavaScript ishga tushgach, Owl sizning "
"component'ingizni mount qiladi, bu esa ehtimol atrofdagi elementlarning "
"sahifada joyini o'zgartiradi. Bu foydalanuvchi tajribasini yomonlashtirishi "
"mumkin: foydalanuvchi sahifada dastlab render qilingan va u bilan ishlashni "
"xohlagan elementni ko'radi, shuning uchun kursorini yoki barmog'ini o'sha "
"element ustiga olib boradi. Aynan bosmoqchi bo'lgan paytda Owl component "
"mount qilinadi va u ishlashni xohlagan element joyidan siljiydi. Natijada u "
"bosadi va uning o'rniga Owl app bilan ishlab ketadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:135
msgid ""
"This can be a frustrating experience, so you should be careful when "
"designing your page that the Owl component will not move elements around. "
"This can be achieved in various ways, e.g. by positioning it below all other "
"existing elements, not having other interactive elements around, or "
"reserving a fixed space for the Owl component using CSS."
msgstr ""
"Bu foydalanuvchi uchun juda noqulay bo'lishi mumkin, shuning uchun "
"sahifangizni loyihalashda Owl component elementlarni siljitmasligiga e'tibor "
"bering. Bunga turli yo'llar bilan erishish mumkin, masalan uni mavjud barcha "
"boshqa elementlardan pastda joylashtirish, atrofda boshqa interaktiv "
"elementlar qoldirmaslik yoki CSS yordamida Owl component uchun qat'iy joy "
"ajratish orqali."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:143
msgid "`Cumulative Layout Shift on web.dev <https://web.dev/articles/cls>`_"
msgstr "`web.dev'dagi Cumulative Layout Shift <https://web.dev/articles/cls>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:149
msgid ""
"When search engines build their index of the content of the web, they use "
"web crawlers to find pages and analyze their content to show these pages in "
"their search results. While modern search engines are generally capable of "
"executing JavaScript code and should generally be able to view and index "
"content rendered in JavaScript, they may not index the content as fast and "
"penalize the page in search results."
msgstr ""
"Qidiruv tizimlari web kontentining indeksini yaratishda sahifalarni topish "
"va ularning kontentini tahlil qilib qidiruv natijalarida ko'rsatish uchun "
"web crawler'lardan foydalanadi. Zamonaviy qidiruv tizimlari odatda "
"JavaScript kodini bajara oladi va JavaScript'da render qilingan kontentni "
"ko'rib indekslashi kerak bo'lsa-da, ular kontentni tezroq indekslamasligi va "
"qidiruv natijalarida sahifani past baholashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:155
msgid ""
"Because most search engines do not reveal the exact way that they crawl and "
"index web pages, it's not always easy to know the extent of the impact that "
"client-side rendering can have on your search engine scores. While it's "
"unlikely to make or break your SEO strategy, you should still only use Owl "
"components when they are adding real value over server-side rendering."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pchilik qidiruv tizimlari web sahifalarni qanday aylanib chiqishi va "
"indekslashini aniq oshkor qilmagani uchun, client tomonida render qilishning "
"qidiruv tizimidagi ballaringizga qanchalik ta'sir qilishini bilish har doim "
"oson emas. Bu SEO strategiyangizni butunlay o'zgartirib yubormasa ham, Owl "
"component'laridan faqat ular server tomonida render qilishga nisbatan "
"haqiqiy qiymat qo'shganda foydalanish kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:162
msgid "When to use Owl components on the portal and website"
msgstr "Portal va website'da Owl component'laridan qachon foydalanish kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:164
msgid ""
"As explained in the previous sections, using Owl component can slightly "
"degrade user experience if you're not careful and may also hinder your SEO. "
"So when should you choose to use Owl components in these places? Here are "
"some general guidelines."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi bo'limlarda tushuntirilganidek, ehtiyot bo'lmasangiz Owl "
"component'dan foydalanish foydalanuvchi tajribasini bir oz yomonlashtirishi "
"va SEO'ngizga ham to'sqinlik qilishi mumkin. Unda bu joylarda Owl "
"component'laridan qachon foydalanish kerak? Quyida ba'zi umumiy tavsiyalar "
"keltirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:169
msgid "When you don't care about SEO"
msgstr "SEO siz uchun ahamiyatsiz bo'lganda"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:171
msgid ""
"If a page cannot be indexed by search engines because it's not available to "
"the public, e.g. anything in the user portal, SEO performance is not a "
"concern, as web crawlers cannot access these pages anyway. There are also "
"some things that you do not want or care about indexing, e.g. if you want to "
"have a page where the user can choose a date and time for an appointment, "
"you probably don't want search engines to index the dates on which an "
"appointment is possible at a specific moment in time."
msgstr ""
"Agar sahifa ommaga ochiq bo'lmagani uchun qidiruv tizimlari tomonidan "
"indekslanmasa, masalan foydalanuvchi portal'idagi har qanday narsa, SEO "
"samaradorligi muammo emas, chunki web crawler'lar bu sahifalarga baribir "
"kira olmaydi. Shuningdek, siz indekslanishini xohlamaydigan yoki ahamiyat "
"bermaydigan narsalar ham bor, masalan foydalanuvchi uchrashuv uchun sana va "
"vaqtni tanlay oladigan sahifa yaratmoqchi bo'lsangiz, aniq bir paytda "
"uchrashuv mumkin bo'lgan sanalarni qidiruv tizimlari indekslashini ehtimol "
"xohlamaysiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:179
msgid "When you need strong interactivity"
msgstr "Kuchli interaktivlik kerak bo'lganda"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/frontend_owl_components.rst:181
msgid ""
"The decision to use Owl is a trade-off between the previously mentioned "
"disadvantages and the effort that Owl saves you by making it easy to build "
"richly interactive user experiences. The main reason to use Owl is when you "
"want to build an interface that can react in real time to user inputs "
"without requiring the page to reload. If you mainly want to show static "
"content to the user, you probably shouldn't use an Owl component."
msgstr ""
"Owl'dan foydalanish qarori yuqorida aytilgan kamchiliklar va Owl boy "
"interaktiv foydalanuvchi tajribasini yaratishni osonlashtirib tejab "
"beradigan kuch o'rtasidagi murosadir. Owl'dan foydalanishning asosiy sababi "
"— sahifani qayta yuklashni talab qilmasdan foydalanuvchi kiritgan "
"ma'lumotlarga real vaqtda javob bera oladigan interfeys yaratmoqchi "
"bo'lganingizda. Agar asosan foydalanuvchiga statik kontent ko'rsatmoqchi "
"bo'lsangiz, ehtimol Owl component'dan foydalanmasligingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/javascript_client_action.rst:8
msgid ""
"A client action triggers an action that is entirely implemented in the "
"client side. One of the benefits of using a client action is the ability to "
"create highly customized interfaces with ease. A client action is typically "
"defined by an OWL component; we can also use the web framework and use "
"services, core components, hooks,..."
msgstr ""
"Client action to'liq client tomonida amalga oshirilgan action'ni ishga "
"tushiradi. Client action'dan foydalanishning afzalliklaridan biri — yuqori "
"darajada moslashtirilgan interfeyslarni oson yaratish imkoniyati. Client "
"action odatda OWL component bilan aniqlanadi; shuningdek web framework'dan "
"foydalanib service'lar, core component'lar, hook'lar va boshqalarni "
"ishlatish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/javascript_client_action.rst:13
