#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:5
msgid ""
"There are many ways to lean and simplify SCSS. The first step is to "
"establish if custom code is needed at all."
msgstr ""
"SCSS'ni yengillashtirish va soddalashtirishning ko'p usullari mavjud. "
"Birinchi qadam — maxsus kod umuman kerakmi yoki yo'qmi, buni aniqlash."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo's webclient has been designed to be modular, meaning that (potentially "
"all) classes can be shared across views. Check the code before creating a "
"new class. Chances are that there is already a class or an HTML tag doing "
"exactly what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning webclient'i modulli bo'lishi uchun loyihalangan, ya'ni (ehtimol "
"barcha) class'lar view'lar o'rtasida umumiy ishlatilishi mumkin. Yangi class "
"yaratishdan oldin kodni tekshirib ko'ring. Ehtimol siz izlagan narsani aynan "
"bajaradigan class yoki HTML tag allaqachon mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:12
msgid ""
"On top of that, Odoo relies on `Bootstrap <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/"
"getting-started/introduction/>`_ (BS), one of the most complete CSS "
"frameworks available. The framework has been customized in order to match "
"Odoo's design (both community and enterprise versions), meaning that you can "
"use any BS class directly in Odoo and achieve a visual result that is "
"consistent with our UI."
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, Odoo mavjud eng to'liq CSS framework'lardan biri bo'lgan "
"`Bootstrap <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/introduction/"
">`_ (BS) ga tayanadi. Framework Odoo dizayniga mos kelishi uchun sozlangan "
"(community va enterprise versiyalarining ikkalasida ham), ya'ni siz Odoo'da "
"har qanday BS class'ni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ishlatib, bizning UI bilan mos "
"keladigan vizual natijaga erishishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:19
msgid ""
"The fact that a class achieves the desired visual result doesn't necessarily "
"mean that it's the right one for the job. Be aware of classes triggering JS "
"behaviors, for example."
msgstr ""
"Class kerakli vizual natijani beradi degani, u shu ish uchun to'g'ri class "
"ekanini anglatmaydi. Masalan, JS xatti-harakatlarini ishga tushiradigan "
"class'larga e'tibor bering."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:21
msgid ""
"Be careful about class semantics. Applying a **button class** to a **title** "
"is not only semantically wrong, it may also lead to migration issues and "
"visual inconsistencies."
msgstr ""
"Class semantikasiga ehtiyot bo'ling. **button class** ni **title** ga "
"qo'llash nafaqat semantik jihatdan xato, balki migration muammolari va "
"vizual nomuvofiqliklarga ham olib kelishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:24
msgid ""
"The following sections describe tips to strip-down SCSS lines **when custom-"
"code is the only way to go**."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi bo'limlarda **faqat maxsus kod yozish yagona yo'l bo'lganda** SCSS "
"qatorlarini qisqartirish bo'yicha maslahatlar tavsiflanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:30
msgid "Browser defaults"
msgstr "Browser'ning standart qiymatlari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:32
msgid ""
"By default, each browser renders content using a *user agent stylesheet*. To "
"overcome inconsistencies between browsers, some of these rules are "
"overridden by `Bootstrap Reboot <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/content/"
"reboot/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha har bir browser kontentni *user agent stylesheet* yordamida "
"render qiladi. Browser'lar orasidagi nomuvofiqliklarni bartaraf etish uchun "
"bu qoidalarning ba'zilari `Bootstrap Reboot <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/"
"5.1/content/reboot/>`_ tomonidan override qilingan."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:36
msgid ""
"At this stage all \"browser-specific-decoration\" rules have been stripped "
"away, but a big chunk of rules defining basic layout information is "
"maintained (or reinforced by *Reboot* for consistency reasons)."
msgstr ""
"Bu bosqichda barcha \"browser-specific-decoration\" qoidalari olib "
"tashlangan, biroq asosiy layout ma'lumotlarini belgilovchi qoidalarning "
"katta qismi saqlanib qolgan (yoki izchillik uchun *Reboot* tomonidan "
"kuchaytirilgan)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:40
msgid "You can rely on these rules."
msgstr "Siz bu qoidalarga tayanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:44
msgid "Applying `display: block;` to a `<div/>` is normally not necessary."
msgstr "`<div/>` ga `display: block;` qo'llash odatda kerak emas."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:55
msgid ""
"In this instance, you may opt to switching the HTML tag rather than adding a "
"new CSS rule."
msgstr ""
"Bunday holatda yangi CSS qoidasi qo'shish o'rniga HTML tag'ni o'zgartirishni "
"tanlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/scss_tips.rst:65
msgid "Here's a non-comprehensive list of default rules:"
msgstr "Quyida standart qoidalarning to'liq bo'lmagan ro'yxati keltirilgan:"

