#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:9
msgid ""
"If you want to contribute to the translation of Odoo itself, please refer to "
"the `Odoo Wiki page <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/Translations>`_."
msgstr ""
"Agar Odoo'ning o'zini tarjima qilishga hissa qo'shmoqchi bo'lsangiz, `Odoo "
"Wiki sahifasiga <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/Translations>`_ murojaat "
"qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:13
msgid "Exporting translatable term"
msgstr "Tarjima qilinadigan atamalarni eksport qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:15
msgid ""
"A number of terms in your modules are implicitly translatable. As a result, "
"even if you haven't done any specific work towards translation, you can "
"export your module's translatable terms and may find content to work with."
msgstr ""
"Modulingizdagi bir qancha atamalar bilvosita tarjima qilinadigan "
"hisoblanadi. Natijada, tarjima uchun hech qanday maxsus ish qilmagan "
"bo'lsangiz ham, modulingizning tarjima qilinadigan atamalarini eksport "
"qilib, ishlash uchun kontent topishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:19
msgid "needs technical features"
msgstr "texnik imkoniyatlar (technical features) yoqilgan bo'lishi kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:21
msgid ""
"Translations export is performed via the administration interface by logging "
"into the backend interface and opening :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Translations --> Import / Export --> Export Translations`"
msgstr ""
"Tarjimalarni eksport qilish administrator interfeysi orqali bajariladi: "
"backend interfeysiga kirib, :menuselection:`Settings --> Translations --> "
"Import / Export --> Export Translations` ni oching"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:25
msgid "leave the language to the default (new language/empty template)"
msgstr "tilni standart qiymatda qoldiring (new language/empty template)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:26
msgid "select the `PO File`_ format"
msgstr "`PO File`_ formatini tanlang"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:27
msgid "select your module"
msgstr "modulingizni tanlang"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:28
msgid "click :guilabel:`Export` and download the file"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Export` ni bosing va faylni yuklab oling"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:34
msgid ""
"This gives you a file called :file:`{yourmodule}.pot` which should be moved "
"to the :file:`{yourmodule}/i18n/` directory. The file is a *PO Template* "
"which simply lists translatable strings and from which actual translations "
"(PO files) can be created. PO files can be created using msginit_, with a "
"dedicated translation tool like POEdit_ or by simply copying the template to "
"a new file called :file:`{language}.po`. Translation files should be put "
"in :file:`{yourmodule}/i18n/`, next to :file:`{yourmodule}.pot`, and will be "
"automatically loaded by Odoo when the corresponding language is installed "
"(via :menuselection:`Settings --> Translations --> Languages`)"
msgstr ""
"Bu sizga :file:`{yourmodule}.pot` nomli fayl beradi, uni :file:`{yourmodule}/"
"i18n/` papkasiga ko'chirish kerak. Bu fayl — *PO Template*, u shunchaki "
"tarjima qilinadigan matnlar ro'yxatini beradi va undan haqiqiy tarjimalar "
"(PO fayllar) yaratiladi. PO fayllarni msginit_ yordamida, POEdit_ kabi "
"maxsus tarjima vositasi bilan yoki template'ni :file:`{language}.po` nomli "
"yangi faylga oddiy nusxalash orqali yaratish mumkin. Tarjima "
"fayllari :file:`{yourmodule}.pot` yonida, :file:`{yourmodule}/i18n/` ichiga "
"joylanishi kerak; mos til o'rnatilganda (:menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Translations --> Languages` orqali) Odoo ularni avtomatik yuklaydi"

