msgstr ""
"`_` va `_t` ning lazy varianti — "
"python'da :class:`odoo.tools.translate.LazyTranslate` factory, javascript'da "
"esa :js:func:`odoo.web._lt`. Tarjimani izlash faqat render vaqtida "
"bajariladi va global o'zgaruvchilarning class method'larida tarjima "
"qilinadigan xossalarni e'lon qilish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:112
msgid ""
"Translations of a module are **not** exposed to the front end by default and "
"thus are not accessible from JavaScript. In order to achieve that, the "
"module name has to be either prefixed with `website` (just like "
"`website_sale`, `website_event` etc.) or explicitly register by "
"implementing :func:`_get_translation_frontend_modules_name` for the "
"`ir.http` model."
msgstr ""
"Modulning tarjimalari standart holatda front end'ga **ochilmaydi** va shu "
"sababli JavaScript'dan foydalanib bo'lmaydi. Buning uchun modul nomi "
"`website` prefiksi bilan boshlanishi kerak (`website_sale`, `website_event` "
"va h.k. kabi) yoki `ir.http` model'i "
"uchun :func:`_get_translation_frontend_modules_name` ni amalga oshirib, "
"bevosita ro'yxatga olinishi kerak."

