msgid "Context"
msgstr "Context"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:133
msgid ""
"To translate, the translation function needs to know the *language* and the "
"*module* name. When using ``Environment._`` the language is known and you "
"may pass the module name as a parameter, otherwise it's extracted from the "
"caller."
msgstr ""
"Tarjima qilish uchun tarjima funksiyasi *til* va *modul* nomini bilishi "
"kerak. ``Environment._`` dan foydalanganda til ma'lum bo'ladi va modul "
"nomini parametr sifatida uzatishingiz mumkin, aks holda u chaqiruvchidan "
"olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:138
msgid ""
"In case of ``odoo.tools.translate._``, the language and the module are "
"extracted from the context. For this, we inspect the caller's local "
"variables. The drawback of this method is that it is error-prone: we try to "
"find the context variable or ``self.env``, however these may not exist if "
"you use translations outside of model methods; i.e. it does not work inside "
"regular functions or python comprehensions."
msgstr ""
"``odoo.tools.translate._`` holatida til va modul context'dan olinadi. Buning "
"uchun biz chaqiruvchining lokal o'zgaruvchilarini tekshiramiz. Bu usulning "
"kamchiligi — u xatoga moyil: biz context o'zgaruvchisini yoki ``self.env`` "
"ni topishga harakat qilamiz, lekin agar tarjimalarni model method'laridan "
"tashqarida ishlatsangiz, ular mavjud bo'lmasligi mumkin; ya'ni u oddiy "
"funksiyalar yoki python comprehension'lari ichida ishlamaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/translations.rst:145
msgid ""
"Lazy translations are bound to the module during their creation and the "
"language is resolved when evaluating using ``str()``. Note that you can also "
"pass a lazy translation to ``Environment._`` to translate it without any "
"magic language resolution."
msgstr ""
"Lazy tarjimalar yaratilish vaqtida modulga bog'lanadi va til ``str()`` "
"yordamida hisoblash vaqtida aniqlanadi. Shuni yodda tuting: lazy tarjimani "
"``Environment._`` ga uzatib, uni hech qanday \"sehrli\" til aniqlanishisiz "
"tarjima qilishingiz ham mumkin."

