"foydalaning::"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:5
msgid ""
"Upgrading to a new version of Odoo can be challenging, especially if the "
"database you work on contains custom modules. This page intent is to explain "
"the technical process of upgrading a database with customized modules. Refer "
"to :doc:`Upgrade documentation </administration/upgrade>` for guidance on "
"how to upgrade a database without customized modules."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning yangi versiyasiga upgrade qilish murakkab bo'lishi mumkin, ayniqsa "
"siz ishlayotgan ma'lumotlar bazasida custom modullar bo'lsa. Bu sahifaning "
"maqsadi — moslashtirilgan modullarga ega ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade "
"qilishning texnik jarayonini tushuntirishdir. Moslashtirilgan modullarsiz "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade qilish bo'yicha yo'riqnoma uchun :doc:`Upgrade "
"hujjatlari </administration/upgrade>` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:10
msgid ""
"We consider a custom module, any module that extends the standard code of "
"Odoo and that was not built with the Studio app. Before upgrading such a "
"module, or before requesting its upgrade, have a look at the :ref:`upgrade-"
"sla` to make sure who's responsible for it."
msgstr ""
"Biz custom module deb Odoo'ning standart kodini kengaytiruvchi va Studio "
"ilovasi bilan yaratilmagan har qanday modulni tushunamiz. Bunday modulni "
"upgrade qilishdan yoki uning upgrade'ini so'rashdan oldin, kim uchun "
"javobgar ekanini aniqlash uchun :ref:`upgrade-sla` bo'limiga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:14
msgid ""
"While working on what we refer to as the **custom upgrade** of your "
"database, keep in mind the goals of an upgrade:"
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazangizning biz **custom upgrade** deb ataydigan ishi ustida "
"ishlaganda, upgrade maqsadlarini yodda tuting:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:17
msgid "Stay supported"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanishda qolish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:18
msgid "Get the latest features"
msgstr "Eng yangi funksiyalarni olish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:19
msgid "Enjoy the performance improvement"
msgstr "Unumdorlik yaxshilanishidan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:20
msgid "Reduce the technical debt"
msgstr "Texnik qarzni kamaytirish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:21
msgid "Benefit from security improvements"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik yaxshilanishlaridan foyda olish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:23
msgid ""
"With every new version of Odoo, changes are introduced. These changes can "
"impact modules on which customization have been developed. This is the "
"reason why upgrading a database that contains custom modules requires "
"additional steps in order to upgrade the source code."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning har bir yangi versiyasi bilan o'zgarishlar kiritiladi. Bu "
"o'zgarishlar moslashtirishlar ishlab chiqilgan modullarga ta'sir qilishi "
"mumkin. Shu sababli custom modullarga ega ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade "
"qilish manba kodni yangilash uchun qo'shimcha qadamlarni talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:27
msgid "These are the steps to follow to upgrade customized databases:"
msgstr ""
"Moslashtirilgan ma'lumotlar bazalarini upgrade qilish uchun quyidagi "
"qadamlarni bajaring:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:29
msgid ""
":ref:`Stop the developments and challenge them <upgrade_custom/"
"stop_developments>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Ishlab chiqishni to'xtatib, ularni qayta ko'rib chiqing "
"<upgrade_custom/stop_developments>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:30
msgid ":ref:`Request an upgraded database <upgrade_custom/request_upgrade>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasini so'rang <upgrade_custom/"
"request_upgrade>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:31
msgid ""
":ref:`Make your module installable on an empty database <upgrade_custom/"
"empty_database>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Modulingizni bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasiga o'rnatiladigan qiling "
"<upgrade_custom/empty_database>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:32
msgid ""
":ref:`Make your module installable on the upgraded database <upgrade_custom/"
"upgraded_database>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Modulingizni upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasiga o'rnatiladigan "
"qiling <upgrade_custom/upgraded_database>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:33
msgid ""
":ref:`Test extensively and do a rehearsal <upgrade_custom/"
"testing_rehearsal>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Keng qamrovli test qilib, mashq o'tkazing <upgrade_custom/"
"testing_rehearsal>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:34
msgid ":ref:`Upgrade the production database <upgrade_custom/production>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Production ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade qiling <upgrade_custom/"
"production>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:39
msgid "Step 1: Stop the developments"
msgstr "1-qadam: Ishlab chiqishni to'xtatish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:41
msgid ""
"Starting an upgrade requires commitment and development resources. If "
"developments keep being made at the same time, those features will need to "
"be re-upgraded and tested every time you change them. This is why we "
"recommend a complete freeze of the codebase when starting the upgrade "
"process. Needless to say, bug fixing is exempt from this recommendation."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade'ni boshlash sadoqat va ishlab chiqish resurslarini talab qiladi. "
"Agar shu bilan bir vaqtda ishlab chiqish davom etsa, siz ularni o'zgartirgan "
"har safar bu funksiyalarni qaytadan upgrade qilish va test qilish kerak "
"bo'ladi. Shu sababli upgrade jarayonini boshlashda kod bazasini to'liq "
"muzlatishni tavsiya qilamiz. Aytish kerakki, xatolarni tuzatish bu "
"tavsiyadan mustasno."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:46
msgid ""
"Once you have stopped development, it is a good practice to assess the "
"developments made and compare them with the features introduced between your "
"current version and the version you are targeting. Challenge the "
"developments as much as possible and find functional workarounds. Removing "
"redundancy between your developments and the standard version of Odoo will "
"lead to an eased upgrade process and reduce technical debt."
msgstr ""
"Ishlab chiqishni to'xtatganingizdan so'ng, amalga oshirilgan ishlanmalarni "
"baholab, ularni joriy versiyangiz va siz mo'ljallagan versiya o'rtasida "
"kiritilgan funksiyalar bilan solishtirish yaxshi amaliyot hisoblanadi. "
"Ishlanmalarni iloji boricha qayta ko'rib chiqing va funksional yechimlar "
"toping. Ishlanmalaringiz va Odoo standart versiyasi o'rtasidagi "
"takrorlanishni olib tashlash upgrade jarayonini osonlashtiradi va texnik "
"qarzni kamaytiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:53
msgid ""
"You can find information on the changes between versions in the `Release "
"Notes <https:/odoo.com/page/release-notes>`_."
msgstr ""
"Versiyalar o'rtasidagi o'zgarishlar haqidagi ma'lumotni `Release Notes "
"<https:/odoo.com/page/release-notes>`_ sahifasida topishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:59
msgid "Step 2: Request an upgraded database"
msgstr "2-qadam: Upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasini so'rash"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:61
msgid ""
"Once the developments have stopped for the custom modules and the "
"implemented features have been challenged to remove redundancy and "
"unnecessary code, the next step is to request an upgraded test database. To "
"do so, follow the steps mentioned in :ref:`upgrade-request-test`, depending "
"on the hosting type of your database."
msgstr ""
"Custom modullar uchun ishlab chiqish to'xtatilgach va joriy etilgan "
"funksiyalar takrorlanish hamda keraksiz kodni olib tashlash uchun qayta "
"ko'rib chiqilgach, keyingi qadam — upgrade qilingan test ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini so'rash. Buning uchun ma'lumotlar bazangizning hosting turiga "
"qarab :ref:`upgrade-request-test` da keltirilgan qadamlarni bajaring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:66
msgid ""
"The purpose of this stage is not to start working with the custom modules in "
"the upgraded database, but to make sure the standard upgrade process works "
"seamlessly, and the test database is delivered properly. If that's not the "
"case, and the upgrade request fails, request the assistance of Odoo via the "
"`support page <https://odoo.com/help?stage=migration>`_ by selecting the "
"option related to testing the upgrade."
msgstr ""
"Bu bosqichning maqsadi upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasida custom modullar "
"bilan ishlashni boshlash emas, balki standart upgrade jarayoni uzluksiz "
"ishlashiga va test ma'lumotlar bazasi to'g'ri yetkazilishiga ishonch hosil "
"qilishdir. Agar bunday bo'lmasa va upgrade so'rovi muvaffaqiyatsiz tugasa, "
"`support page <https://odoo.com/help?stage=migration>`_ orqali upgrade'ni "
"test qilishga tegishli variantni tanlab, Odoo'dan yordam so'rang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:75
msgid "Step 3: Empty database"
msgstr "3-qadam: Bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:77
msgid ""
"Before working on an upgraded test database, we recommend to make the custom "
"developments work on an empty database in the targeted version of your "
"upgrade. This ensures that the customization is compatible with the new "
"version of Odoo, allows to analyze how it behaves and interacts with the new "
"features, and guarantees that they will not cause any issues when upgrading "
"the database."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade qilingan test ma'lumotlar bazasida ishlashdan oldin, custom "
"ishlanmalarni upgrade'ning maqsadli versiyasidagi bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasida "
"ishlaydigan qilishni tavsiya qilamiz. Bu moslashtirishning Odoo'ning yangi "
"versiyasi bilan mos kelishini ta'minlaydi, uning qanday ishlashini va yangi "
"funksiyalar bilan qanday o'zaro ta'sir qilishini tahlil qilish imkonini "
"beradi hamda ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade qilishda ular hech qanday muammo "
"keltirmasligini kafolatlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:82
msgid ""
"Making the custom modules work in an empty database also helps avoid changes "
"and wrong configurations that might be present in the production database "
"(like studio customization, customized website pages, email templates or "
"translations). They are not intrinsically related to the custom modules and "
"that can raise unwanted issues in this stage of the upgrade process."
msgstr ""
"Custom modullarni bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasida ishlatish, shuningdek, "
"production ma'lumotlar bazasida bo'lishi mumkin bo'lgan o'zgarishlar va "
"noto'g'ri konfiguratsiyalardan (masalan, studio moslashtirishlari, "
"moslashtirilgan veb-sayt sahifalari, email template'lar yoki tarjimalar) "
"qochishga yordam beradi. Ular custom modullar bilan bevosita bog'liq emas va "
"upgrade jarayonining bu bosqichida keraksiz muammolarni keltirib chiqarishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:87
msgid ""
"To make custom modules work on an empty database we advise to follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr ""
"Custom modullarni bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasida ishlatish uchun quyidagi "
"qadamlarni bajarishni tavsiya qilamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:89
msgid ":ref:`upgrade_custom/empty_database/modules_installable`"
msgstr ":ref:`upgrade_custom/empty_database/modules_installable`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:90
msgid ":ref:`upgrade_custom/empty_database/test_fixes`"
msgstr ":ref:`upgrade_custom/empty_database/test_fixes`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:91
msgid ":ref:`upgrade_custom/empty_database/clean_code`"
msgstr ":ref:`upgrade_custom/empty_database/clean_code`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:92
msgid ""
":ref:`Make standard tests run successfully <upgrade_custom/empty_database/"
"standard_test>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Standart testlar muvaffaqiyatli o'tishiga erishing <upgrade_custom/"
"empty_database/standard_test>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:97
msgid "Make custom modules installable"
msgstr "Custom modullarni o'rnatiladigan qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:99
msgid ""
"The first step is to make the custom modules installable in the new Odoo "
"version. This means, starting by ensuring there are no tracebacks or "
"warnings during their installation. For this, install the custom modules, "
"one by one, in an empty database of the new Odoo version and fix the "
"tracebacks and warnings that arise from that."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi qadam — custom modullarni Odoo'ning yangi versiyasida "
"o'rnatiladigan qilish. Bu ularni o'rnatish vaqtida traceback yoki "
"ogohlantirishlar bo'lmasligini ta'minlashdan boshlanadi. Buning uchun custom "
"modullarni yangi Odoo versiyasining bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasiga birma-bir "
"o'rnatib, shundan kelib chiqadigan traceback va ogohlantirishlarni tuzating."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:104
msgid ""
"This process will help detect issues during the installation of the modules. "
"For example:"
msgstr ""
"Bu jarayon modullarni o'rnatish vaqtidagi muammolarni aniqlashga yordam "
"beradi. Masalan:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:106
msgid "Invalid module dependencies."
msgstr "Noto'g'ri module dependency'lari."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:107
msgid "Syntax change: assets declaration, OWL updates, attrs."
msgstr ""
"Sintaksis o'zgarishi: assets deklaratsiyasi, OWL yangilanishlari, attrs."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:108
msgid ""
"References to standard fields, models, views not existing anymore or renamed."
msgstr ""
"Endi mavjud bo'lmagan yoki nomi o'zgartirilgan standart field'lar, "
"model'lar, view'larga havolalar."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:109
msgid "Xpath that moved or were removed from views."
msgstr "View'lardan ko'chirilgan yoki olib tashlangan Xpath'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:110
msgid "Methods renamed or removed."
msgstr "Nomi o'zgartirilgan yoki olib tashlangan method'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:116
msgid "Test and fixes"
msgstr "Test va tuzatishlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:118
msgid ""
"Once there are no more tracebacks when installing the modules, the next step "
"is to test them. Even if the custom modules are installable on an empty "
"database, this does not guarantee there are no errors during their "
"execution. Because of this, we encourage to test thoroughly all the "
"customization to make sure everything is working as expected."
msgstr ""
"Modullarni o'rnatishda traceback'lar qolmagach, keyingi qadam — ularni test "
"qilish. Custom modullar bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasiga o'rnatilsa ham, bu "
"ularning bajarilishi vaqtida xatolar yo'qligini kafolatlamaydi. Shu sababli "
"hamma narsa kutilganidek ishlashiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun barcha "
"moslashtirishlarni sinchkovlik bilan test qilishni tavsiya qilamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:123
msgid ""
"This process will help detect further issues that are not identified during "
"the module installation and can only be detected in runtime. For example, "
"deprecated calls to standard python or OWL functions, non-existing "
"references to standard fields, etc."
msgstr ""
"Bu jarayon modul o'rnatish vaqtida aniqlanmaydigan va faqat runtime'da "
"sezilishi mumkin bo'lgan qo'shimcha muammolarni topishga yordam beradi. "
"Masalan, standart python yoki OWL funksiyalariga eskirgan chaqiruvlar, "
"standart field'larga mavjud bo'lmagan havolalar va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:127
msgid ""
"We recommend to test all the customization, especially the following "
"elements:"
msgstr ""
"Barcha moslashtirishlarni, ayniqsa quyidagi elementlarni test qilishni "
"tavsiya qilamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:130
msgid "Email templates"
msgstr "Email template'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:131
msgid "Reports"
msgstr "Hisobotlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:132
msgid "Server actions and automated actions"
msgstr "Server action'lar va avtomatlashtirilgan action'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:133
msgid "Changes in the standard workflows"
msgstr "Standart workflow'lardagi o'zgarishlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:134
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:716
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:465
msgid "Computed fields"
msgstr "Computed field'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:136
msgid ""
"We also encourage to write automated tests to save time during the testing "
"iterations, increase the test coverage, and ensure that the changes and "
"fixes introduced do not break the existing flows. If there are tests already "
"implemented in the customization, make sure they are upgraded to the new "
"Odoo version and run successfully, fixing issues that might be present."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, testlash iteratsiyalarida vaqtni tejash, test qamrovini oshirish "
"va kiritilgan o'zgarishlar hamda tuzatishlar mavjud oqimlarni buzmasligiga "
"ishonch hosil qilish uchun avtomatlashtirilgan testlar yozishni tavsiya "
"qilamiz. Agar customization'da testlar allaqachon amalga oshirilgan bo'lsa, "
"ular yangi Odoo versiyasiga moslashtirilganiga va muvaffaqiyatli ishlashiga "
"ishonch hosil qiling, mavjud muammolarni tuzatib chiqing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:144
msgid "Clean the code"
msgstr "Kodni tozalang"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:146
msgid ""
"At this stage of the upgrade process, we also suggest to clean the code as "
"much as possible. This includes:"
msgstr ""
"Upgrade jarayonining bu bosqichida kodni imkon qadar tozalashni ham tavsiya "
"qilamiz. Bunga quyidagilar kiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:149
msgid "Remove redundant and unnecessary code."
msgstr "Takrorlanuvchi va keraksiz kodni olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:150
msgid ""
"Remove features that are now part of Odoo standard, as described "
"in :ref:`upgrade_custom/stop_developments`."
msgstr ""
"Hozirda Odoo standartining bir qismiga aylangan funksiyalarni olib tashlang "
"— bu :ref:`upgrade_custom/stop_developments` bo'limida tavsiflangan."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:152
msgid "Clean commented code if it is not needed anymore."
msgstr "Agar endi kerak bo'lmasa, izohga olingan kodni tozalang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:153
msgid "Refactor the code (functions, fields, views, reports, etc.) if needed."
msgstr ""
"Zarur bo'lsa, kodni (funksiyalar, field'lar, view'lar, report'lar va h.k.) "
"refactor qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:158
msgid "Standard tests"
msgstr "Standart testlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:160
msgid ""
"Once the previous steps are completed, we advise to make sure all standard "
"tests associated to the dependencies of the custom module pass. Standard "
"tests ensure the validation of the code logic and prevent data corruption. "
"They will help you identify bugs or unwanted behavior before you work on "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi bosqichlar tugagach, custom module dependency'lari bilan bog'liq "
"barcha standart testlar o'tishiga ishonch hosil qilishni maslahat beramiz. "
"Standart testlar kod logikasining to'g'riligini tekshiradi va ma'lumotlar "
"buzilishini oldini oladi. Ular ma'lumotlar bazasi ustida ishlashdan avval "
"xatolar yoki nomaqbul xatti-harakatlarni aniqlashga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:165
msgid ""
"In case there are standard test failing, we suggest to analyze the reason "
"for their failure:"
msgstr ""
"Agar standart testlardan biri muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lsa, uning sababini tahlil "
"qilishni tavsiya qilamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:167
msgid ""
"The customization changes the standard workflow: Adapt the standard test to "
"your workflow."
msgstr ""
"Customization standart workflow'ni o'zgartiradi: standart testni o'z "
"workflow'ingizga moslashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:168
msgid ""
"The customization did not take into account a special flow: Adapt your "
"customization to ensure it works for all the standard workflows."
msgstr ""
"Customization maxsus oqimni hisobga olmagan: barcha standart workflow'larda "
"ishlashiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun customization'ni moslashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:175
msgid "Step 4: Upgraded database"
msgstr "4-qadam: upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:177
msgid ""
"Once the custom modules are installable and working properly in an empty "
"database, it is time to make them work on an :ref:`upgraded database "
"<upgrade-request-test>`."
msgstr ""
"Custom module'lar o'rnatiladigan va bo'sh ma'lumotlar bazasida to'g'ri "
"ishlaydigan holatga kelgach, ularni :ref:`upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasida <upgrade-request-test>` ishlatish vaqti keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:180
msgid ""
"To make sure the custom code is working flawlessly in the new version, "
"follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"Custom kod yangi versiyada nuqsonsiz ishlashiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun "
"quyidagi qadamlarni bajaring:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:182
msgid ":ref:`upgrade_custom/upgraded_database/migrate_data`"
msgstr ":ref:`upgrade_custom/upgraded_database/migrate_data`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:183
msgid ":ref:`upgrade_custom/upgraded_database/test_custom`"
msgstr ":ref:`upgrade_custom/upgraded_database/test_custom`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:188
msgid "Migrate the data"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlarni migratsiya qiling"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:190
msgid ""
"During the upgrade of the custom modules, you might have to "
"use :doc:`upgrade scripts <../reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts>` to "
"reflect changes from the source code to their corresponding data. Together "
"with the upgrade scripts, you can also make use of the :doc:`../reference/"
"upgrades/upgrade_utils` and its helper functions."
msgstr ""
"Custom module'larni upgrade qilish vaqtida source kod'dagi o'zgarishlarni "
"mos ma'lumotlarda aks ettirish uchun :doc:`upgrade script'lardan <../"
"reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts>` foydalanishingiz kerak bo'lishi mumkin. "
"Upgrade script'lar bilan birga :doc:`../reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils` va "
"uning helper funksiyalaridan ham foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:195
msgid ""
"Any technical data that was renamed during the upgrade of the custom code "
"(models, fields, external identifiers) should be renamed using upgrade "
"scripts to avoid data loss during the module upgrade. See "
"also: :meth:`rename_field`, :meth:`rename_model`, :meth:`rename_xmlid`."
msgstr ""
"Custom kodni upgrade qilish vaqtida nomi o'zgartirilgan har qanday texnik "
"ma'lumot (model'lar, field'lar, external identifier'lar) module upgrade "
"paytida ma'lumot yo'qolishini oldini olish uchun upgrade script'lar "
"yordamida qayta nomlanishi kerak. Shuningdek "
"qarang: :meth:`rename_field`, :meth:`rename_model`, :meth:`rename_xmlid`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:198
msgid ""
"Data from standard models removed from the source code of the newer Odoo "
"version and from the database during the standard upgrade process might need "
"to be recovered from the old model table if it is still present."
msgstr ""
"Yangi Odoo versiyasining source kodidan va standart upgrade jarayonida "
"ma'lumotlar bazasidan olib tashlangan standart model'lardagi ma'lumotlarni, "
"agar eski model jadvali hali mavjud bo'lsa, undan qayta tiklash kerak "
"bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:203
msgid ""
"Custom fields for model ``sale.subscription`` are not automatically migrated "
"from Odoo 15 to Odoo 16 (when the model was merged into ``sale.order``). In "
"this case, a SQL query can be executed on an upgrade script to move the data "
"from one table to the other. Take into account that all columns/fields must "
"already exist, so consider doing this in a ``post-`` script "
"(See :ref:`upgrade-scripts/phases`)."
msgstr ""
"``sale.subscription`` model'i uchun custom field'lar Odoo 15 dan Odoo 16 ga "
"avtomatik migratsiya qilinmaydi (bu versiyada model ``sale.order`` ichiga "
"birlashtirilgan). Bunday holatda ma'lumotlarni bir jadvaldan boshqasiga "
"ko'chirish uchun upgrade script'da SQL query bajarilishi mumkin. Barcha "
"ustunlar/field'lar allaqachon mavjud bo'lishi shartligini hisobga oling, "
"shuning uchun buni ``post-`` script'da bajarishni ko'rib chiqing "
"(:ref:`upgrade-scripts/phases` ga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:223
msgid ""
"Check the documentation for more information on :doc:`../reference/upgrades/"
"upgrade_scripts`."
msgstr ""
"Batafsil ma'lumot uchun :doc:`../reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts` "
"hujjatini ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:225
msgid "Upgrade scripts can also be used to:"
msgstr "Upgrade script'lardan quyidagilar uchun ham foydalanish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:227
msgid ""
"Ease the processing time of an upgrade. For example, to store the value of "
"computed stored fields on models with an excessive number of records by "
"using SQL queries."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade'ning ishlov berish vaqtini qisqartirish. Masalan, juda ko'p "
"record'ga ega model'larda computed stored field'lar qiymatini SQL "
"query'lardan foydalanib saqlash uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:229
msgid ""
"Recompute fields in case the computation of their value has changed. See "
"also :meth:`recompute_fields`."
msgstr ""
"Field'lar qiymatini hisoblash usuli o'zgargan bo'lsa, ularni qayta "
"hisoblash. Shuningdek :meth:`recompute_fields` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:231
msgid "Uninstall unwanted custom modules. See also :meth:`remove_module`."
msgstr ""
"Keraksiz custom module'larni o'chirish. Shuningdek :meth:`remove_module` ga "
"qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:232
msgid "Correct faulty data or wrong configurations."
msgstr "Nuqsonli ma'lumotlarni yoki noto'g'ri konfiguratsiyalarni tuzatish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:235
msgid "Running and testing upgrade scripts"
msgstr "Upgrade script'larni ishga tushirish va testlash"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:239
msgid "Odoo Online"
msgstr "Odoo Online"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:241
msgid ""
"As the instalation of custom modules containing Python files is not allowed "
"on Odoo Online databases, it is not possible to run upgrade scripts on this "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazalarida Python fayllarini o'z ichiga olgan custom "
"module'larni o'rnatishga ruxsat berilmaganligi sababli, bu platformada "
"upgrade script'larni ishga tushirish imkoni yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:244
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:45
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:160
msgid "Odoo.sh"
msgstr "Odoo.sh"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:246
msgid ""
"As explained on the `Odoo.sh` tab of :ref:`upgrade-request-test`, Odoo.sh is "
"integrated with the upgrade platform."
msgstr ""
":ref:`upgrade-request-test` ning `Odoo.sh` tab'ida tushuntirilganidek, "
"Odoo.sh upgrade platformasi bilan integratsiya qilingan."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:249
msgid ""
"Once the upgrade of a staging branch is on \"Update on commit\" mode, each "
"time a commit is pushed on the branch, the upgraded backup is restored and "
"all the custom modules are updated. This update includes the execution of "
"the upgrade scripts."
msgstr ""
"Staging branch'ning upgrade'i \"Update on commit\" rejimida bo'lsa, "
"branch'ga har commit push qilinganda upgrade qilingan backup tiklanadi va "
"barcha custom module'lar yangilanadi. Bu yangilanish upgrade script'larning "
"bajarilishini ham o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:253
msgid ""
"When upgrading the production database, the execution of the upgrade scripts "
"is also part of the update of the custom modules done by the platform when "
"the upgraded database is restored."
msgstr ""
"Production ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade qilishda upgrade script'larning "
"bajarilishi ham upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasi tiklanganda platforma "
"tomonidan amalga oshiriladigan custom module'lar yangilanishining bir qismi "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:256
msgid "On-premise"
msgstr "On-premise"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:258
msgid ""
"Once you receive the upgraded dump of the database from the `Upgrade "
"platform <https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_, deploy the database and update all "
"the custom modules by invoking the command :doc:`odoo-bin </developer/"
"reference/cli>` in the shell. To update the custom modules, use the option: "
"`-u <modules>, --update <modules>`."
msgstr ""
"`Upgrade platformasi <https://upgrade.odoo.com>`_ dan ma'lumotlar bazasining "
"upgrade qilingan dump'ini olgach, ma'lumotlar bazasini deploy qiling va "
"shell'da :doc:`odoo-bin </developer/reference/cli>` buyrug'ini chaqirib "
"barcha custom module'larni yangilang. Custom module'larni yangilash uchun "
"quyidagi opsiyadan foydalaning: `-u <modules>, --update <modules>`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:265
msgid ""
"As mentioned in the :doc:`CLI documentation </developer/reference/cli>`, the "
"command used to call the CLI depends on how you installed Odoo."
msgstr ""
":doc:`CLI hujjatida </developer/reference/cli>` aytilganidek, CLI'ni "
"chaqirish uchun ishlatiladigan buyruq Odoo'ni qanday o'rnatganingizga "
"bog'liq."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:271
msgid "Test the custom modules"
msgstr "Custom module'larni testlang"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:273
msgid ""
"To make sure the custom modules work properly with your data in the upgraded "
"database, they need to be tested as well. This helps ensure both the "
"standard and the custom data stored in the database are consistent and that "
"nothing was lost during the upgrade process."
msgstr ""
"Custom module'lar upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasidagi ma'lumotlaringiz "
"bilan to'g'ri ishlashiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun ular ham testlanishi "
"kerak. Bu ma'lumotlar bazasida saqlangan standart va custom ma'lumotlarning "
"izchilligini, hamda upgrade jarayonida hech narsa yo'qolmaganini "
"tasdiqlashga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:277
msgid "Things to pay attention to:"
msgstr "E'tibor berish kerak bo'lgan jihatlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:279
msgid ""
"Views not working: During the upgrade, if a view causes issues because of "
"its content, it gets disabled. You can find the information on disabled "
"views on the Upgrade report. This view needs to be activated again (or "
"removed if not useful anymore). To achieve this, we recommend the use of "
"upgrade scripts."
msgstr ""
"View'lar ishlamayapti: upgrade vaqtida biror view o'z mazmuni sababli muammo "
"keltirib chiqarsa, u o'chirib qo'yiladi. O'chirilgan view'lar haqidagi "
"ma'lumotni Upgrade report'ida topishingiz mumkin. Bunday view'ni qaytadan "
"faollashtirish kerak (yoki endi foydali bo'lmasa, olib tashlash kerak). Buni "
"amalga oshirish uchun upgrade script'lardan foydalanishni tavsiya qilamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:283
msgid ""
":doc:`Module data <../tutorials/define_module_data>` not updated: Custom "
"records that have the ``noupdate`` flag are not updated when upgrading the "
"module in the new database. For the custom data that needs to be updated due "
"to changes in the new version, we recommend to use upgrade scripts to do so. "
"See also: :meth:`update_record_from_xml`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`Module data <../tutorials/define_module_data>` yangilanmayapti: "
"``noupdate`` flag'iga ega custom record'lar yangi ma'lumotlar bazasida "
"module upgrade qilinganda yangilanmaydi. Yangi versiyadagi o'zgarishlar "
"sababli yangilanishi kerak bo'lgan custom ma'lumotlar uchun buni upgrade "
"script'lar yordamida bajarishni tavsiya qilamiz. Shuningdek "
"qarang: :meth:`update_record_from_xml`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:291
msgid "Step 5: Testing and rehearsal"
msgstr "5-qadam: testlash va mashq o'tkazish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:293
msgid ""
"When the custom modules are working properly in the upgraded database, it is "
"crucial to do another round of testing to assess the database usability and "
"detect any issues that might have gone unnoticed in previous tests. For "
"further information about testing the upgraded database, check :ref:`upgrade-"
"testing`."
msgstr ""
"Custom module'lar upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasida to'g'ri ishlay "
"boshlaganda, ma'lumotlar bazasining foydalanishga yaroqliligini baholash va "
"oldingi testlarda e'tibordan chetda qolgan muammolarni aniqlash uchun yana "
"bir bosqich testlash o'tkazish juda muhim. Upgrade qilingan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini testlash haqida batafsil ma'lumot uchun :ref:`upgrade-testing` ni "
"ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:298
msgid ""
"As mentioned in :ref:`upgrade-production`, both standard upgrade scripts and "
"your database are constantly evolving. Therefore it is highly recommended to "
"frequently request new upgraded test databases and ensure that the upgrade "
"process is still successful."
msgstr ""
":ref:`upgrade-production` da aytilganidek, standart upgrade script'lar ham, "
"sizning ma'lumotlar bazangiz ham doimiy rivojlanib boradi. Shu sababli yangi "
"upgrade qilingan test ma'lumotlar bazalarini tez-tez so'rash va upgrade "
"jarayoni hamon muvaffaqiyatli kechayotganiga ishonch hosil qilish qattiq "
"tavsiya etiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:302
msgid ""
"In addition to that, make a full rehearsal of the upgrade process the day "
"before upgrading the production database to avoid undesired behavior during "
"the upgrade and to detect any issue that might have occurred with the "
"migrated data."
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, upgrade vaqtida nomaqbul xatti-harakatlarning oldini olish "
"va migratsiya qilingan ma'lumotlarda yuzaga kelgan muammolarni aniqlash "
"uchun production ma'lumotlar bazasini upgrade qilishdan bir kun avval "
"upgrade jarayonining to'liq mashqini o'tkazing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:309
msgid "Step 6: Production upgrade"
msgstr "6-qadam: production upgrade"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/upgrade_custom_db.rst:311
msgid ""
"Once you are confident about upgrading your production database, follow the "
"process described on :ref:`upgrade-production`, depending on the hosting "
"type of your database."
msgstr ""
"Production ma'lumotlar bazangizni upgrade qilishga ishonchingiz komil "
"bo'lgach, ma'lumotlar bazangizning hosting turiga qarab :ref:`upgrade-"
"production` da tavsiflangan jarayonni bajaring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:None
msgid "Artistic illustration of \"Web design\""
msgstr "\"Web design\" ning badiiy tasviri"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Odoo Website Builder is an excellent tool for creating a website fully "
"integrated with other Odoo apps. Using the theme's options and building "
"blocks is easy and allows you to personalize your web presence the way you "
"want. However, you can take things even further."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Website Builder boshqa Odoo ilovalari bilan to'liq integratsiyalangan "
"veb-sayt yaratish uchun ajoyib vositadir. Theme opsiyalari va building "
"block'lardan foydalanish oson bo'lib, veb-saytingizni xohlaganingizdek "
"shaxsiylashtirishga imkon beradi. Biroq siz bundan ham uzoqroqqa borishingiz "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:17
msgid ""
"In this documentation, you will learn to completely customize your website "
"without touching Odoo's core files, and this way, preserve the editing "
"options of the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Bu hujjatda siz Odoo'ning core fayllariga tegmasdan veb-saytingizni to'liq "
"customize qilishni va shu yo'l bilan Website Builder'ning tahrirlash "
"opsiyalarini saqlab qolishni o'rganasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes.rst:20
msgid ""
"The information compiled in this documentation is based on our past "
"experiences - both failures and successes. We invite you to use it as a base "
"to build your own website and adapt it to your needs."
msgstr ""
"Bu hujjatda to'plangan ma'lumotlar bizning o'tmishdagi tajribamizga — "
"muvaffaqiyatsizliklarga ham, muvaffaqiyatlarga ham — asoslangan. Uni o'z veb-"
"saytingizni qurish uchun asos sifatida ishlatishga va ehtiyojlaringizga "
"moslashtirishga taklif qilamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:3
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/04_customisation_part2.rst:215
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Animatsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo uses eye-catching animations that can bring your website to life. By "
"default, we can use three kinds of animations:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo veb-saytingizni jonlantiruvchi ko'zga tashlanadigan animatsiyalardan "
"foydalanadi. Sukut bo'yicha uch xil animatsiyadan foydalanish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:8
msgid "Animations on appearance"
msgstr "Paydo bo'lishdagi animatsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:9
msgid "Animations on scroll"
msgstr "Scroll paytidagi animatsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:10
msgid "Animations on hover"
msgstr "Hover paytidagi animatsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:15
msgid "On appearance"
msgstr "Paydo bo'lganda"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:17
msgid ""
"In standard, you can add animations to column, text and image elements when "
"they appear, thanks to the Website Builder. Odoo detects when your element "
"is in the viewport and launches the animation. A large selection of "
"animations is available:"
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda Website Builder yordamida column, text va image "
"element'lariga ular paydo bo'lgan paytda animatsiya qo'shishingiz mumkin. "
"Odoo element'ingiz viewport ichida ekanini aniqlaydi va animatsiyani ishga "
"tushiradi. Animatsiyalarning keng tanlovi mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:21
msgid "Fade in"
msgstr "Fade in"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:22
msgid "Bounce in"
msgstr "Bounce in"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:23
msgid "Rotate in"
msgstr "Rotate in"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:24
msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "Zoom in"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:25
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:67
msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:27
msgid ""
"You can easily define an animation on a column in your custom theme. You "
"need to add two classes: `o_animate` and `o_anim_fade_in`. The second class "
"changes depending on the type of animation you want to use."
msgstr ""
"O'zingizning theme'ingizdagi column uchun animatsiyani osongina "
"aniqlashingiz mumkin. Ikkita class qo'shishingiz kerak: `o_animate` va "
"`o_anim_fade_in`. Ikkinchi class siz ishlatmoqchi bo'lgan animatsiya turiga "
"qarab o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:31
msgid ""
"Add the `o_animate_both_scroll` class to launch the animation every time the "
"column appears on the screen. The animation is only launched once by default."
msgstr ""
"Column ekranda har paydo bo'lganda animatsiya ishga tushishi uchun "
"`o_animate_both_scroll` class'ini qo'shing. Standart holatda animatsiya "
"faqat bir marta ishga tushadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:34
msgid ""
"You should also define an `animation-duration` and an `animation-delay` "
"directly in the `style` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, `animation-duration` va `animation-delay` qiymatlarini "
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri `style` atributida aniqlashingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:37
msgid ""
"Additionally, you can add an animation direction. For instance, to animate "
"the element from the bottom of the screen, add a `o_anim_from_bottom` class "
"and set a `--wanim-intensity` in the `style` attribute to control the "
"animation's direction intensity."
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, animatsiya yo'nalishini qo'shishingiz mumkin. Masalan, "
"element'ni ekranning pastidan animatsiya qilish uchun `o_anim_from_bottom` "
"class'ini qo'shing va animatsiya yo'nalishining intensivligini boshqarish "
"uchun `style` atributida `--wanim-intensity` ni belgilang."

