msgid ""
"In the same way as we have seen above, you can add animations on scroll to "
"column, text and image elements whenever the viewport scrolls through the "
"animated element."
msgstr ""
"Yuqorida ko'rganimizga o'xshab, viewport animatsiyalangan element bo'ylab "
"scroll qilgan har qanday paytda column, text va image element'lariga scroll "
"animatsiyalarini qo'shishingiz mumkin."

