#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/animations.rst:187
msgid ""
"At this point, you can insert images with animations on hover in a module "
"but the effect won't be applied directly after the module installation. As "
"the Website Builder needs to process the image first (transform it then "
"store it as an attachment), the animation on hover will only be visible "
"after you re-select the effect and save the page with the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Shu nuqtada siz module ichiga hover'da animatsiyalanadigan rasmlarni "
"joylashtira olasiz, lekin effekt module o'rnatilgandan keyin darhol "
"qo'llanmaydi. Website Builder avval rasmni qayta ishlashi kerak bo'lgani "
"uchun (uni o'zgartirib, so'ng attachment sifatida saqlaydi), hover'dagi "
"animatsiya faqat siz effektni qaytadan tanlab, sahifani Website Builder "
"bilan saqlaganingizdan keyin ko'rinadi."

