#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:3
msgid "Building blocks"
msgstr "Building block'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:5
msgid ""
"Building blocks, also known as snippets, are how users design and layout "
"pages. They are important XML elements of your design."
msgstr ""
"Building block'lar, ya'ni snippet'lar — foydalanuvchilar sahifalarni shu "
"vosita bilan loyihalashtiradi va joylashtiradi. Ular dizayningizning muhim "
"XML elementlaridir."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:8
msgid "The building blocks are classified into two types:"
msgstr "Building block'lar ikki turga bo'linadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:10
msgid ""
"**Structure blocks**: visually used as \"whole rows\" and distributed into "
"multiples categories "
"(:guilabel:`Intro`, :guilabel:`Columns`, :guilabel:`Content`, :guilabel:`Images`, :guilabel:`People`, "
"etc)"
msgstr ""
"**Structure block'lar**: vizual jihatdan \"to'liq qatorlar\" sifatida "
"ishlatiladi va bir nechta kategoriyalarga taqsimlanadi "
"(:guilabel:`Intro`, :guilabel:`Columns`, :guilabel:`Content`, :guilabel:`Images`, :guilabel:`People`, "
"va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:13
msgid "**Inner Content blocks**: used inside other building blocks"
msgstr ""
"**Inner Content block'lar**: boshqa building block'lar ichida ishlatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:15
msgid ""
"At the end of this chapter, you will be able to :ref:`create custom snippets "
"<website_themes/building_blocks/custom>` and to add them into a dedicated "
"category."
msgstr ""
"Bu bo'lim oxirida siz :ref:`maxsus snippet'lar yaratish <website_themes/"
"building_blocks/custom>` va ularni alohida kategoriyaga qo'shishni bilib "
"olasiz."

