"`Snippets and groups registry in XML <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/"
"addons/website/views/snippets/snippets.xml>`_"
msgstr ""
"`XML'dagi snippet'lar va guruhlar registry'si <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/19.0/addons/website/views/snippets/snippets.xml>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:54
msgid ""
"JS Files under `/snippets` are interactions: `example <https://github.com/"
"odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/website/static/src/snippets/s_floating_blocks/"
"floating_blocks.js>`_ with the `s_floating_blocks` snippet and the base "
"`Interaction <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/src/"
"public/interaction.js>`_ class."
msgstr ""
"`/snippets` ichidagi JS fayllar interaction'lardir: `s_floating_blocks` "
