msgid ""
"`pb*` and `pt*` are the Odoo classes used to control the handlers. Their "
"values are increased by **multiples of 8**, till a **max of 256** (0, 8, 16, "
"24, 32, 40, 48, ...)."
msgstr ""
"`pb*` va `pt*` — handler'larni boshqarish uchun ishlatiladigan Odoo "
"class'lari. Ularning qiymatlari **8 ning karralari** bo'yicha oshadi va "
"**maksimal 256** gacha yetadi (0, 8, 16, 24, 32, 40, 48, ...)."

