msgstr "`--text-highlight-color`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:345
msgid "Color of the SVG object"
msgstr "SVG obyektining rangi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:350
msgid "Grid layout"
msgstr "Grid layout"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:352
msgid ""
"Grid Layout is a powerful and flexible layout system in CSS that enables "
"users to design complex building block layouts with ease."
msgstr ""
"Grid Layout — CSS'dagi kuchli va moslashuvchan joylashtirish tizimi bo'lib, "
"foydalanuvchilarga murakkab building block joylashuvlarini oson loyihalash "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:358
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/media.rst:60
msgid "Use"
msgstr "Foydalanish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:360
msgid ""
"Enable the Grid Layout by adding the `o_grid_mode` CSS class on the `row`. "
"The number of rows in your grid is defined by the `data-row-count` "
"attribute. The grid always contains 12 columns. The grid gap, specified in "
"the `style` attribute, determines the gaps (or gutters) between rows and "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Grid Layout'ni yoqish uchun `row` ustiga `o_grid_mode` CSS class'ini "
"qo'shing. Grid'dagi qatorlar soni `data-row-count` attribute bilan "
"aniqlanadi. Grid har doim 12 ustundan iborat bo'ladi. `style` attribute'da "
"ko'rsatilgan grid gap qatorlar va ustunlar orasidagi bo'shliqlarni (gutter) "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:374
msgid "Items in a grid"
msgstr "Grid ichidagi elementlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:376
msgid ""
"Add items in the grid with the `o_grid_item` class. If the grid item "
"contains an image, use the `o_grid_item_image` class."
msgstr ""
"Grid'ga elementlarni `o_grid_item` class'i bilan qo'shing. Agar grid "
"elementi rasmni o'z ichiga olsa, `o_grid_item_image` class'idan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:391
msgid ""
"The dimensions and position of a grid item are defined by the grid-area that "
"can be explicitly set in the `style` attribute along with the z-index."
msgstr ""
"Grid elementining o'lchamlari va joylashuvi grid-area bilan aniqlanadi, u z-"
"index bilan birga `style` attribute'da bevosita belgilanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:394
msgid ""
"The `g-height-*` and `g-col-lg-*` classes are generated by the Website "
"Builder for editing purposes."
msgstr ""
"`g-height-*` va `g-col-lg-*` class'lari tahrirlash maqsadida Website Builder "
"tomonidan yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:399
msgid "Grid item padding"
msgstr "Grid elementi padding'i"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:417
msgid "`--grid-item-padding-y`"
msgstr "`--grid-item-padding-y`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:418
msgid "Vertical paddings (Y axis)"
msgstr "Vertikal padding'lar (Y o'qi)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:419
msgid "`--grid-item-padding-x`"
msgstr "`--grid-item-padding-x`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:420
msgid "Horizontal paddings (X axis)"
msgstr "Gorizontal padding'lar (X o'qi)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:425
msgid "Compatibility system"
msgstr "Moslik tizimi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:428
msgid ""
"When a snippet has a `data-vcss`, `data-vjs` and/or `data-vxml` attribute, "
"it means it is an updated"
msgstr ""
"Agar snippet'da `data-vcss`, `data-vjs` va/yoki `data-vxml` attribute "
"bo'lsa, bu uning yangilangan"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:428
msgid "version, not the original one."
msgstr "versiyasi ekanini, ya'ni asl versiya emasligini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:436
msgid ""
"These data attributes indicate to the system which file version to load for "
"that snippet (e.g., :file:`001.js`, :file:`002.scss`)."
msgstr ""
"Bu data attribute'lar tizimga o'sha snippet uchun fayl qaysi versiyasini "
"yuklash kerakligini ko'rsatadi (masalan, :file:`001.js`, :file:`002.scss`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:442
msgid "Custom snippet"
msgstr "Maxsus snippet"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:444
msgid ""
"Some more specific needs will require the creation of custom snippets. Here "
"is how to create a custom snippet/"
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi o'ziga xos ehtiyojlar maxsus snippet'lar yaratishni talab qiladi. "
"Maxsus snippet qanday yaratilishi quyida keltirilgan/"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:450
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:42
msgid "Template"
msgstr "Template"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:452
msgid ""
"Create first the snippet template. Then, add it to the list and make it "
"available via the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Avval snippet template'ini yarating. So'ngra uni ro'yxatga qo'shing va "
"Website Builder orqali foydalanish uchun ochiq qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:456
msgid "1. Declaration"
msgstr "1. E'lon qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:458
msgid "First, create the template of the custom snippet:"
msgstr "Avvalo, maxsus snippet'ning template'ini yarating:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:460
msgid "``/website_airproof/views/snippets/s_airproof_snippet.xml``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/views/snippets/s_airproof_snippet.xml``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:475
msgid ""
"`data-name` and `data-snippet` attributes have to be specified when a "
"snippet is declared on a theme page. Otherwise, the snippet won't be "
"recognised by the Website Builder and issues might occur whenever a database "
"upgrade is done. Additionally, remember that the name attribute is shown as "
"the name of your custom snippet in the :guilabel:`Blocks` section of the "
"options panel."
msgstr ""
"Snippet theme sahifasida e'lon qilinganda `data-name` va `data-snippet` "
"attribute'lari ko'rsatilishi shart. Aks holda snippet Website Builder "
"tomonidan tanilmaydi va ma'lumotlar bazasi yangilanganda muammolar yuzaga "
"kelishi mumkin. Bundan tashqari, esda tutingki, name attribute options "
"panelining :guilabel:`Blocks` bo'limida sizning maxsus snippet'ingiz nomi "
"sifatida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:481
msgid "Use Bootstrap native classes as much as possible."
msgstr "Imkon qadar Bootstrap'ning o'z class'laridan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:482
msgid "Prefix all your custom classes."
msgstr "Barcha maxsus class'laringizga prefiks qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:483
msgid ""
"Use underscore lowercase notation to name classes, e.g., `.x_nav`, "
"`.x_nav_item`."
msgstr ""
"Class'larni nomlashda kichik harflar va pastki chiziq yozuvidan foydalaning, "
"masalan, `.x_nav`, `.x_nav_item`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:484
msgid ""
"Avoid using ID attribute within your `section` as several instances of a "
"snippet may appear throughout the page (An ID attribute has to be unique on "
"a page)."
msgstr ""
"`section` ichida ID attribute'idan foydalanmang, chunki bir snippet'ning bir "
"nechta nusxasi sahifada paydo bo'lishi mumkin (ID attribute sahifada yakka-"
"yagona bo'lishi kerak)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:487
msgid ""
"Add the custom snippet to the list of standard snippets, so the user can "
"drag and drop it on the page, directly from the edit panel."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus snippet'ni standart snippet'lar ro'yxatiga qo'shing, shunda "
"foydalanuvchi uni tahrirlash panelidan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri sahifaga sudrab "
"tashlashi mumkin bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:491
msgid "2. Group creation"
msgstr "2. Guruh yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:493
msgid ""
"Add a group at the top of the list (feel free to put it where needed in this "
"list)."
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxatning yuqorisiga guruh qo'shing (uni bu ro'yxatda kerakli joyga "
"qo'yishingiz mumkin)."

