msgid "string"
msgstr "string"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:520
msgid "Group name displayed to the users"
msgstr "Foydalanuvchilarga ko'rsatiladigan guruh nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:521
msgid "t-thumbnail"
msgstr "t-thumbnail"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:522
msgid "The path to the thumbnail of the group"
msgstr "Guruh thumbnail'iga yo'l"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:525
msgid "1. Snippet addition"
msgstr "1. Snippet qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:527
msgid ""
"Then add the custom snippet into the `<snippets id=\"snippet_structure\">` "
"which contains all existing ones on the same level. The Website Builder will "
"split them automatically into categories by reading the `group` attribute on "
"the `<t t-snippet=\"\">`"
msgstr ""
"So'ngra maxsus snippet'ni barcha mavjud snippet'larni bir xil darajada o'z "
"ichiga olgan `<snippets id=\"snippet_structure\">` ichiga qo'shing. Website "
"Builder `<t t-snippet=\"\">` dagi `group` attribute'ini o'qib, ularni "
"avtomatik ravishda kategoriyalarga ajratadi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:559
msgid "The snippet template to use"
msgstr "Foydalanish uchun snippet template'i"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:560
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:159
msgid "group"
msgstr "group"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:561
msgid "The group in which the snippet is added."
msgstr "Snippet qo'shiladigan guruh."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:562
msgid "<keywords>"
msgstr "<keywords>"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:563
msgid "Keywords entered by the user in the search field in the Snippets panel"
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi Snippets panelidagi qidiruv maydoniga kiritgan kalit so'zlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:568
msgid "Inner content snippet"
msgstr "Inner content snippet'i"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:570
msgid ""
"To make a custom snippet appear in the :guilabel:`Inner content` list, add "
"it to `snippet_content` instead:"
msgstr ""
"Maxsus snippet :guilabel:`Inner content` ro'yxatida ko'rinishi uchun uni "
"buning o'rniga `snippet_content` ga qo'shing:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:588
msgid "Inner content selectors"
msgstr "Inner content selector'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:590
msgid ""
"To make a custom snippet \"inner content\" (droppable in another building "
"block), add its selector to the `so_content_addition_selector` resource, "
"which contains all selectors for existing inner content building blocks."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus snippet'ni \"inner content\" qilish uchun (ya'ni uni boshqa building "
"block ichiga tashlash mumkin bo'lishi uchun), uning selector'ini "
"`so_content_addition_selector` resursiga qo'shing; bu resurs mavjud inner "
"content building block'lari uchun barcha selector'larni saqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:594
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:634
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:1192
msgid ""
"``/website_airproof/static/src/website_builder/"
"airproof_snippet_option_plugin.js``"
msgstr ""
"``/website_airproof/static/src/website_builder/"
"airproof_snippet_option_plugin.js``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:605
msgid ""
"Don't forget to add a `t-thumbnail` and remove the `group` attribute as this "
"kind of building blocks is directly available in the right options panel of "
"the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"`t-thumbnail` qo'shishni va `group` atributini olib tashlashni yodda tuting, "
"chunki bu turdagi building block'lar Website Builder'ning o'ng tomonidagi "
"options panelida bevosita mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:607
msgid ""
"Don't forget to :ref:`add the snippet to the list of all available \"Inner "
"content\" snippets <website_themes/building_blocks/custom/"
"inner_content_snippet>`."
msgstr ""
"Snippet'ni :ref:`barcha mavjud \"Inner content\" snippet'lari ro'yxatiga "
"qo'shishni <website_themes/building_blocks/custom/inner_content_snippet>` "
"unutmang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:613
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:207
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Options"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:615
msgid ""
"Options allow users to edit a snippet's appearance and behavior using the "
"Website Builder. Options are OWL components defined in JavaScript and "
"rendered with XML templates. Each option is registered through a builder "
"plugin and loaded in the editor assets."
msgstr ""
"Option'lar foydalanuvchilarga Website Builder yordamida snippet'ning "
"ko'rinishi va xatti-harakatini tahrirlash imkonini beradi. Option'lar "
"JavaScript'da aniqlanadigan va XML template'lar bilan render qilinadigan OWL "
"component'laridir. Har bir option builder plugin orqali ro'yxatga olinadi va "
"editor asset'larida yuklanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:620
msgid ""
"Add the JavaScript and XML files to the `website.website_builder_assets` "
"bundle in your module."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript va XML fayllarini modulingizdagi `website.website_builder_assets` "
"bundle'iga qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:623
msgid ""
"`HTML Builder options <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"html_builder/static/src/plugins>`_"
msgstr ""
"`HTML Builder option'lari <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"html_builder/static/src/plugins>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:624
msgid ""
"`Website Builder options <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"website/static/src/builder/plugins>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Website Builder option'lari <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"website/static/src/builder/plugins>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:625
msgid ""
"`Alert option example <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
