#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:696
msgid "Plugin API"
msgstr "Plugin API"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:698
msgid ""
"Builder plugins register option components, actions, and editor hooks "
"through the `resources` object. They are added to the `website-plugins` "
"registry category to be accessible by the editor. Plugin instances are "
"created when the editor starts and destroyed when the editor closes, they "
"live for the whole editor session."
msgstr ""
"Builder plugin'lari option component'larini, action'larni va editor "
"hook'larini `resources` obyekti orqali ro'yxatga oladi. Editor ular bilan "
"ishlashi uchun ular `website-plugins` registry kategoriyasiga qo'shiladi. "
"Plugin instance'lari editor ishga tushganda yaratiladi va editor yopilganda "
"yo'q qilinadi, ya'ni ular butun editor sessiyasi davomida yashaydi."

