#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:755
msgid "BaseOptionComponent API"
msgstr "BaseOptionComponent API"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:757
msgid ""
"Option components inherit from `BaseOptionComponent` and define static "
"metadata plus optional component behavior. They are instantiated when the "
"current selection matches their selector, and destroyed when the selection "
"changes and no longer matches, resulting in a short lifecycle."
msgstr ""
"Option component'lari `BaseOptionComponent` dan meros oladi va static "
"metama'lumotlarni, shuningdek ixtiyoriy component xatti-harakatini "
"aniqlaydi. Ular joriy tanlov o'z selector'iga mos kelganda yaratiladi va "
"tanlov o'zgarib, endi mos kelmay qolganda yo'q qilinadi — natijada ularning "
"hayot davri qisqa bo'ladi."

