msgid ""
"`selector` binds the option component to elements matching a CSS selector "
"(class, ID, etc). The option appears when a matching element is selected."
msgstr ""
"`selector` option component'ni CSS selector'ga (class, ID va h.k.) mos "
"keladigan element'larga bog'laydi. Mos element tanlanganda option ko'rinadi."

