#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/building_blocks.rst:1244
msgid ""
"By default, Dynamic Content blocks have a selection of templates available "
"in the Website Builder. Custom templates can also be added to the list "
"automatically by use the same naming convention for the template id "
"attribute."
