#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:3
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/04_customisation_part2.rst:266
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Form'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:5
msgid ""
"Forms in Odoo are very powerful. They are directly integrated with other "
"applications and can be used for many different purposes."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'dagi form'lar juda kuchli. Ular boshqa ilovalar bilan bevosita "
"integratsiyalangan va juda turli maqsadlarda ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:8
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/gradients.rst:5
msgid "In this chapter, you will discover how to:"
msgstr "Bu bo'limda siz quyidagilarni qanday bajarishni o'rganasiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:10
msgid "Add a form in your custom theme."
msgstr "O'zingizning custom theme'ingizga form qo'shish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:11
msgid "Change the action of the form."
msgstr "Form'ning action'ini o'zgartirish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:12
msgid "Stylize the form thanks to Bootstrap variables."
msgstr "Bootstrap o'zgaruvchilari yordamida form'ni stillash."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:17
msgid "Default form"
msgstr "Standart form"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:19
msgid ""
"To add a form to a page, copy and paste the code generated by the Website "
"Builder in the page."
msgstr ""
"Sahifaga form qo'shish uchun Website Builder generatsiya qilgan kodni "
"nusxalab, sahifaga joylashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:21
msgid "It should look something like the following."
msgstr "U taxminan quyidagicha ko'rinishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:45
msgid ""
"There is a `data-model_name` in the form tag. It enables you to define "
"different actions for your form."
msgstr ""
"Form tag'ida `data-model_name` mavjud. U form uchun turli action'larni "
"aniqlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:48
msgid "Send an email (this action is used by default)."
msgstr "Email yuborish (bu action standart sifatida ishlatiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:54
msgid "Apply for a job."
msgstr "Vakansiyaga ariza topshirish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:60
msgid "Create a customer."
msgstr "Mijoz yaratish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:66
msgid "Create a ticket."
msgstr "Ticket yaratish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:72
msgid "Create an opportunity."
msgstr "Opportunity yaratish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:78
msgid "Create a task."
msgstr "Task yaratish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:86
msgid ""
"The default action is :guilabel:`Send an E-mail` but following the Apps "
"installed on the database, some other options can be found, such as: Apply "
"for a job, create a customer, create a ticket, create an opportunity, etc."
msgstr ""
"Standart action — :guilabel:`Send an E-mail`, lekin ma'lumotlar bazasiga "
"o'rnatilgan Apps'ga qarab boshqa opsiyalar ham topilishi mumkin, masalan: "
"vakansiyaga ariza topshirish, mijoz yaratish, ticket yaratish, opportunity "
"yaratish va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:90
msgid ""
"Please, note that some of these actions may need specific required fields in "
"order to be functional. To not forget some requirements, we highly recommend "
"to preset the form snippet with the Website Builder and copy/paste the "
"generated source code."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bu action'lardan ba'zilari ishlashi uchun muayyan majburiy "
"field'lar talab qilinishi mumkin. Talablardan birini o'tkazib yubormaslik "
"uchun form snippet'ini Website Builder yordamida oldindan sozlashni va "
"generatsiya qilingan manba kodini nusxalab joylashtirishni qat'iy tavsiya "
"qilamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:97
#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:187
#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:289
msgid "Success"
msgstr "Muvaffaqiyat"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:99
msgid ""
"Define what happens once the form is submitted thanks to the `data-success-"
"mode` attribute."
msgstr ""
"`data-success-mode` atributi yordamida form yuborilgandan keyin nima sodir "
"bo'lishini aniqlang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:101
msgid "Redirect the user to a page defined in the `data-success-page`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchini `data-success-page` da aniqlangan sahifaga yo'naltirish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:107
msgid "Show a message (on the same page)."
msgstr "Xabar ko'rsatish (xuddi shu sahifada)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/forms.rst:113
msgid ""
"Add a success message directly under the form tag. Always add the `d-none` "
"class to make sure that the success message is hidden if the form hasn't "
"been submitted."
msgstr ""
"Muvaffaqiyat xabarini bevosita form tag'i ostiga qo'shing. Form yuborilmagan "
"bo'lsa, muvaffaqiyat xabari yashirin bo'lishiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun "
"har doim `d-none` class'ini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:3
msgid "Going live"
msgstr "Ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once all the web design and development work finished, it's time to deploy "
"it on a development or production database."
msgstr ""
"Barcha web dizayn va ishlab chiqish ishlari tugagach, uni development yoki "
"production ma'lumotlar bazasiga joylashtirish vaqti keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:11
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/06_going_live.rst:68
msgid "Module import"
msgstr "Module'ni import qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:16
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:152
msgid "Odoo SaaS"
msgstr "Odoo SaaS"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:18
msgid "Follow these steps the first time you import a module:"
msgstr ""
"Module'ni birinchi marta import qilayotganda quyidagi qadamlarni bajaring:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:20
msgid "Create a ZIP file of your module."
msgstr "Module'ingizning ZIP faylini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:21
msgid "Connect to the project database."
msgstr "Loyiha ma'lumotlar bazasiga ulaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:22
msgid "Enable the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr ":ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` ni yoqing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:23
msgid ""
"Go to :guilabel:`Apps`, search for `base_import_module`, and install it if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Apps` bo'limiga o'ting, `base_import_module` ni qidiring va zarur "
"bo'lsa o'rnating."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:24
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Import Module` in the menu."
msgstr "Menyudagi :guilabel:`Import Module` ni bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:25
msgid ""
"Upload your ZIP file, tick :guilabel:`Force init`, and click "
"the :guilabel:`Import App` button."
msgstr ""
"ZIP faylingizni yuklang, :guilabel:`Force init` ni belgilang "
"va :guilabel:`Import App` tugmasini bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:None
msgid "Import a module on Odoo Online"
msgstr "Odoo Online'da module import qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:30
msgid ""
"If you need to re-import a module after making some changes, follow the same "
"steps, but before importing the module, open the developer menu and "
"select :guilabel:`Become Superuser`. To leave the Superuser mode, log out "
"and log back in."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi o'zgartirishlardan keyin module'ni qayta import qilish kerak bo'lsa, "
"xuddi shu qadamlarni bajaring, lekin module'ni import qilishdan oldin "
"developer menyusini ochib, :guilabel:`Become Superuser` ni tanlang. "
"Superuser rejimidan chiqish uchun tizimdan chiqib, qaytadan kiring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:35
msgid ""
"Don't forget to untick :guilabel:`Force init` if you import a module for the "
"second time. Otherwise, existing data might be lost. (:ref:`Related to "
"noupdate=1 <website_themes/pages/theme_pages/noupdate>`)."
msgstr ""
"Module'ni ikkinchi marta import qilsangiz, :guilabel:`Force init` belgisini "
"olib tashlashni unutmang. Aks holda mavjud ma'lumotlar yo'qolishi mumkin. "
"(:ref:`noupdate=1 bilan bog'liq <website_themes/pages/theme_pages/"
"noupdate>`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:37
msgid "The ZIP file size must be less than 50 MB."
msgstr "ZIP fayl hajmi 50 MB dan kichik bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/going_live.rst:40
msgid ""
"`Odoo eLearning: Register a Free Domain Name <https://www.odoo.com/slides/"
"slide/register-a-free-domain-name-1663>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo eLearning: Bepul domen nomini ro'yxatdan o'tkazish <https://"
"www.odoo.com/slides/slide/register-a-free-domain-name-1663>`_"

