msgid "Default"
msgstr "Odatiy"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:18
msgid ""
"An Odoo page combines cross-page and unique elements. Cross-page elements "
"are the same on every page, while unique elements are only related to a "
"specific page. By default, a page has two cross-page elements, the header "
"and the footer, and a unique main element that contains the specific content "
"of that page."
msgstr ""
"Odoo sahifasi sahifalararo (cross-page) va noyob elementlarni birlashtiradi. "
"Sahifalararo elementlar har bir sahifada bir xil bo'ladi, noyob elementlar "
"esa faqat muayyan sahifaga tegishli. Odatiy holda sahifada ikkita "
"sahifalararo element — header va footer, hamda o'sha sahifaning maxsus "
"kontentini o'z ichiga olgan noyob main element bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:35
msgid ""
"Any Odoo XML file starts with encoding specifications. After that, you must "
"write your code inside an `<odoo>` tag."
msgstr ""
"Har qanday Odoo XML fayli encoding spetsifikatsiyalari bilan boshlanadi. "
"Shundan so'ng kodingizni `<odoo>` tag'i ichida yozishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:46
msgid ""
"Using precise template names is important to find information through all "
"modules quickly. Template names should only contain lowercase alphanumerics "
"and underscores."
msgstr ""
"Aniq template nomlaridan foydalanish barcha modullar orasidan ma'lumotni tez "
"topish uchun muhim. Template nomlari faqat kichik harflar, raqamlar va "
"pastki chiziqlardan iborat bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:49
msgid ""
"Always add an empty line at the end of your file. This can be done "
"automatically by configuring your IDE."
msgstr ""
"Faylingiz oxiriga har doim bo'sh qator qo'shing. Buni IDE'ingizni sozlash "
"orqali avtomatik bajarish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:55
msgid "XPath"
msgstr "XPath"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:57
msgid ""
"XPath (XML Path Language) is an expression language that enables you to "
"navigate through elements and attributes in an XML document easily. XPath is "
"used to extend standard Odoo templates."
msgstr ""
"XPath (XML Path Language) — XML hujjatdagi elementlar va attribute'lar "
"orasida osongina harakatlanish imkonini beruvchi ifoda tili. XPath standart "
"Odoo template'larini kengaytirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:60
msgid "A view is coded the following way."
msgstr "View quyidagi tarzda kodlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:76
msgid "ID of the modified view"
msgstr "O'zgartirilgan view'ning ID'si"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:77
msgid "inherited_id"
msgstr "inherited_id"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:78
msgid ""
"ID of the standard view (using the following pattern: `module.template`)"
msgstr ""
"Standart view'ning ID'si (quyidagi shablon bo'yicha: `module.template`)"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:80
msgid "Human-readable name of the modified view"
msgstr "O'zgartirilgan view'ning inson o'qishi uchun qulay nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:82
msgid ""
"For each XPath, you modify two attributes: **expression** and **position**."
msgstr ""
"Har bir XPath uchun siz ikkita attribute'ni o'zgartirasiz: **expression** va "
"**position**."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:85
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:533
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:761
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:781
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/navigation.rst:244
msgid "``/website_airproof/views/website_templates.xml``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/views/website_templates.xml``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:94
msgid "This XPath adds a welcome message right before the page content."
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath sahifa kontentidan bevosita oldin xush kelibsiz xabarini qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:97
msgid ""
"Be careful when replacing default elements' attributes. As your theme "
"extends the default one, your changes will take priority over any future "
"Odoo update."
msgstr ""
"Odatiy elementlarning attribute'larini almashtirishda ehtiyot bo'ling. "
"Sizning theme'ingiz odatiy theme'ni kengaytirgani uchun o'zgarishlaringiz "
"kelgusidagi har qanday Odoo yangilanishidan ustun bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:101
msgid ""
"You should update your module every time you create a new template or record."
msgstr ""
"Har safar yangi template yoki record yaratganingizda modulingizni "
"yangilashingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:102
msgid ""
"*XML IDs* of inheriting views should use the same *ID* as the original "
"record. It helps to find all inheritance at a glance. As final *XML IDs* are "
"prefixed by the module that creates them, there is no overlap."
msgstr ""
"Inherit qiluvchi view'larning *XML ID*'lari asl record bilan bir xil "
"*ID*'dan foydalanishi kerak. Bu barcha inheritance'ni bir qarashda topishga "
"yordam beradi. Yakuniy *XML ID*'lar ularni yaratgan modul nomi bilan "
"prefikslangani uchun to'qnashuv bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:109
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "Ifodalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:111
msgid ""
"XPath uses path expressions to select nodes in an XML document. Selectors "
"are used inside the expression to target the right element. The most useful "
"ones are listed below."
msgstr ""
"XPath XML hujjatdagi node'larni tanlash uchun yo'l ifodalaridan foydalanadi. "
"Kerakli elementni nishonga olish uchun ifoda ichida selector'lar "
"ishlatiladi. Eng foydalilari quyida keltirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:119
msgid "Descendent selectors"
msgstr "Avlod (descendent) selector'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:121
msgid "/"
msgstr "/"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:122
msgid "Selects from the root node."
msgstr "Root node'dan boshlab tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:123
msgid "//"
msgstr "//"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:124
msgid ""
"Selects nodes in the document from the current node that matches the "
"selection no matter where they are."
msgstr ""
"Hujjatdagi node'larni joriy node'dan boshlab, qayerda bo'lishidan qat'i "
"nazar, tanlovga mos keladiganlarini tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:132
msgid "Attribute selectors"
msgstr "Attribute selector'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:134
msgid "\\*"
msgstr "\\*"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:135
msgid ""
"Selects any XML tag. `*` can be replaced by a specific tag if the selection "
"needs to be more precise."
msgstr ""
"Har qanday XML tag'ini tanlaydi. Agar tanlov aniqroq bo'lishi kerak bo'lsa, "
"`*` o'rniga muayyan tag yozilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:137
msgid "\\*[@id=\"id\"]"
msgstr "\\*[@id=\"id\"]"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:138
msgid "Selects a specific ID."
msgstr "Muayyan ID'ni tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:139
msgid "\\*[hasclass(\"class\")]"
msgstr "\\*[hasclass(\"class\")]"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:140
msgid "Selects a specific class."
msgstr "Muayyan class'ni tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:141
msgid "\\*[@name=\"name\"]"
msgstr "\\*[@name=\"name\"]"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:142
msgid "Selects a tag with a specific name."
msgstr "Muayyan nomga ega tag'ni tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:143
msgid "\\*[@t-call=\"t-call\"]"
msgstr "\\*[@t-call=\"t-call\"]"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:144
msgid "Selects a specific t-call."
msgstr "Muayyan t-call'ni tanlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:149
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:159
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Joylashuv"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:151
msgid ""
"The position defines where the code is placed inside the template. The "
"possible values are listed below:"
msgstr ""
"Joylashuv kod template ichida qayerga qo'yilishini aniqlaydi. Mumkin bo'lgan "
"qiymatlar quyida keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:161
msgid "replace"
msgstr "replace"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:162
msgid "Replaces the targeted node with the XPath content."
msgstr "Mo'ljallangan node'ni XPath tarkibi bilan almashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:163
msgid "inside"
msgstr "inside"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:164
msgid "Adds the XPath content inside the targeted node."
msgstr "XPath tarkibini mo'ljallangan node ichiga qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:165
msgid "before"
msgstr "before"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:166
msgid "Adds the XPath content before the targeted node."
msgstr "XPath tarkibini mo'ljallangan node'dan oldin qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:167
msgid "after"
msgstr "after"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:168
msgid "Adds the XPath content after the targeted node."
msgstr "XPath tarkibini mo'ljallangan node'dan keyin qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:169
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:196
msgid "attributes"
msgstr "attributes"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:170
msgid "Adds the XPath content inside an attribute."
msgstr "XPath tarkibini attribute ichiga qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:173
msgid "This XPath removes the first element with a `.breadcrumb` class."
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath `.breadcrumb` class'iga ega birinchi elementni olib tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:179
msgid ""
"This XPath adds an extra `<li>` element after the last child of the `<ul>` "
"element."
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath `<ul>` elementining oxirgi child'idan keyin qo'shimcha `<li>` "
"elementini qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:187
msgid ""
"This XPath adds a `<div>` before the `<nav>` that is a direct child of the "
"`<header>`."
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath `<header>`ning bevosita child'i bo'lgan `<nav>`dan oldin `<div>` "
"qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:195
msgid ""
"This XPath removes `x_airproof_header` in the class attribute of the header. "
"In this case, you don't need to use the `separator` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath header'ning class attribute'idan `x_airproof_header`ni olib "
"tashlaydi. Bu holatda `separator` attribute'idan foydalanish shart emas."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:204
msgid ""
"This XPath adds `x_airproof_header` in the class attribute of the header. "
"You also need to define a `separator` attribute to add a space before the "
"class you are adding."
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath header'ning class attribute'iga `x_airproof_header`ni qo'shadi. "
"Shuningdek, qo'shilayotgan class'dan oldin bo'sh joy qo'yish uchun "
"`separator` attribute'ini aniqlashingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:214
msgid ""
"This XPath moves the element with `.o_footer_scrolltop_wrapper` class before "
"the element with the"
msgstr ""
"Bu XPath `.o_footer_scrolltop_wrapper` class'iga ega elementni quyidagiga "
"ega elementdan oldinga ko'chiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:214
msgid "`footer` ID attribute."
msgstr "`footer` ID attribute'i."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:223
msgid ""
"Using `move` directives inside an other XPath forces you to use only this "
"kind of directives."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa XPath ichida `move` directive'laridan foydalanish sizni faqat shu "
"turdagi directive'lardan foydalanishga majbur qiladi."

