msgstr "Front-end"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:352
msgid ""
"The field value can be shown somewhere in a page by calling "
"`model_name.field_name` like this:"
msgstr ""
"Field qiymatini sahifaning biror joyida ko'rsatish uchun "
"`model_name.field_name`ni quyidagicha chaqirish mumkin:"

