#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:867
msgid ""
"Bootstrap uses a grid made of rows and columns to layout a page. Thanks to "
"this structure, columns can be sized differently on mobile and desktop. In "
"this version, the Website Builder allows to set mobile sizes (`col-12` for "
"example) and desktop ones (`col-lg-4` for example) but not the medium "
"breakpoints (`col-md-4` for example)."
msgstr ""
"Bootstrap sahifani joylashtirish uchun qatorlar va ustunlardan tashkil "
"topgan grid'dan foydalanadi. Bu tuzilma tufayli ustunlar mobil va desktop "
"qurilmalarda turli o'lchamda bo'lishi mumkin. Bu versiyada Website Builder "
"mobil o'lchamlarni (masalan `col-12`) va desktop o'lchamlarini (masalan `col-"
"lg-4`) belgilashga imkon beradi, lekin o'rta breakpoint'larni (masalan `col-"
"md-4`) emas."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:873
msgid ""
"The medium sizes can be set but the end-user is not able to edit them within "
"the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"O'rta o'lchamlarni belgilash mumkin, lekin oxirgi foydalanuvchi ularni "
"Website Builder ichida tahrirlay olmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:876
msgid ""
"`Bootstrap documentation on responsive breakpoints <https://getbootstrap.com/"
"docs/5.3/layout/breakpoints/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Moslashuvchan breakpoint'lar haqida Bootstrap hujjatlari <https://"
"getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/layout/breakpoints/>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/layout.rst:877
msgid ""
"`Bootstrap documentation about the grid <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.3/"
"layout/grid/>`_"
