#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:235
msgid "**Use case**"
msgstr "**Foydalanish holati**"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:237
msgid ""
"There are several static pages created in the module. This one has been "
"installed on the database and the end-user has updated some of those pages. "
"Some bug fixes must be applied on the static pages while avoiding any loss "
"of changes made by the end-user."
msgstr ""
"Modulda bir nechta statik sahifalar yaratilgan. Ushbu modul ma'lumotlar "
"bazasiga o'rnatilgan va oxirgi foydalanuvchi bu sahifalarning ba'zilarini "
"o'zgartirgan. Statik sahifalarga ba'zi tuzatishlarni qo'llash kerak, lekin "
"oxirgi foydalanuvchi kiritgan o'zgarishlar yo'qolmasligi lozim."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:241
msgid "**Problem**"
msgstr "**Muammo**"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:243
msgid ""
"In case of a module update on the database, every record declared into the "
"module will overwrite those existing in the database even if the end-user "
"has changed some of these records."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasida modul yangilanganda, modulda e'lon qilingan har bir "
"record bazada mavjud record'lar ustidan yoziladi — hatto oxirgi "
"foydalanuvchi ularning ba'zilarini o'zgartirgan bo'lsa ham."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:246
msgid "**Solution**"
msgstr "**Yechim**"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:248
msgid ""
"By wrapping the record (or all records declared in the file) into a `<data "
"noupdate=\"1\"></data>` tag, the record declared is created at the first "
"module installation but not updated after a module update."
msgstr ""
"Record'ni (yoki fayldagi barcha e'lon qilingan record'larni) `<data "
"noupdate=\"1\"></data>` tagiga o'rash orqali e'lon qilingan record modul "
"birinchi marta o'rnatilganda yaratiladi, lekin modul yangilangandan keyin "
"yangilanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/pages.rst:254
msgid ""
"The system detects that this record doesn't exist and will re-create it."
msgstr "Tizim bu record mavjud emasligini aniqlaydi va uni qaytadan yaratadi."

