#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:459
msgid "Relational fields"
msgstr "Relational field'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:74
msgid ""
"Relational fields call a field from another model. They allow you to link "
"models together and make them interact easily. In other words, when you use "
"a relational field, you link a record with another one (located on another "
"model), enabling you to retrieve the content of the fields located on this "
"linked record."
msgstr ""
"Relational field'lar boshqa model'dagi field'ni chaqiradi. Ular model'larni "
"bir-biriga bog'lash va ularning oson o'zaro ishlashini ta'minlash imkonini "
"beradi. Boshqacha aytganda, relational field'dan foydalanganda siz bir "
"record'ni boshqasi bilan (boshqa model'da joylashgan) bog'laysiz va bu "
"bog'langan record'dagi field'lar mazmunini olishingiz mumkin bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:79
msgid ""
"**Many2one** fields are filled in by choosing one record from a list of "
"records on another model (from *many* records, you select *one*). For "
"example, the *customer* field on a quotation makes you choose one customer "
"from a list of several customers on the *contact* model."
msgstr ""
"**Many2one** field'lari boshqa model'dagi record'lar ro'yxatidan bitta "
"record tanlash orqali to'ldiriladi (*ko'p* record ichidan *bittasini* "
"tanlaysiz). Masalan, kotirovkadagi *customer* field'i sizga *contact* "
"model'idagi bir nechta mijozlar ro'yxatidan bitta mijozni tanlashga imkon "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:82
msgid ""
"**One2many** fields are reverse searches of existing many2one relations. For "
"example, you could list on a contact all their existing quotations (from "
"*one* record, you display *many*)."
msgstr ""
"**One2many** field'lari mavjud many2one bog'lanishlarning teskari "
"izlanishidir. Masalan, contact ustida uning barcha mavjud kotirovkalarini "
"ro'yxatlashingiz mumkin (*bitta* record'dan *ko'p* narsani ko'rsatasiz)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:84
msgid ""
"**Many2many** fields are filled in by choosing one or several records from a "
"list of records on another model. For example, you can put several tags on "
"one product, and several products can use the same tags (from *many* "
"records, you can select *many*)."
msgstr ""
"**Many2many** field'lari boshqa model'dagi record'lar ro'yxatidan bitta yoki "
"bir nechta record tanlash orqali to'ldiriladi. Masalan, bitta mahsulotga bir "
"nechta tag qo'yishingiz mumkin va bir nechta mahsulot bir xil tag'lardan "
"foydalanishi mumkin (*ko'p* record ichidan *ko'p* record tanlashingiz "
"mumkin)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:93
msgid ""
"Views define how records should be displayed to end-users. They are "
"specified in XML, meaning they can be edited independently from the models "
"they represent. They are flexible and allow deep customization of the "
"screens they control."
msgstr ""
"View'lar record'lar oxirgi foydalanuvchilarga qanday ko'rsatilishini "
"aniqlaydi. Ular XML'da belgilanadi, ya'ni o'zlari ifodalaydigan model'lardan "
"mustaqil ravishda tahrirlanishi mumkin. Ular moslashuvchan bo'lib, o'zlari "
"boshqaradigan ekranlarni chuqur sozlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:100
msgid "Backend vs. Frontend"
msgstr "Backend vs. Frontend"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:102
msgid "**Backend views**: Kanban, List, Form, etc."
msgstr "**Backend view'lar**: Kanban, List, Form va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:103
msgid "**Frontend view**: QWeb"
msgstr "**Frontend view**: QWeb"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:108
msgid "Static vs. Dynamic"
msgstr "Statik vs. Dinamik"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:110
msgid ""
"**Static pages** have stable content, such as the homepage. You can define "
"their URL and set some properties like published, indexed, etc."
msgstr ""
"**Statik sahifalar** barqaror mazmunga ega, masalan homepage. Ularning URL "
"manzilini aniqlashingiz va published, indexed kabi ba'zi xususiyatlarni "
"belgilashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:112
msgid ""
"**Dynamic pages** are dynamically generated, such as the product page. Their "
"URL is dynamic and is accessible to all by default (this can be changed by "
"configuring access rights)."
msgstr ""
"**Dinamik sahifalar** dinamik ravishda generatsiya qilinadi, masalan "
"mahsulot sahifasi. Ularning URL manzili dinamik va sukut bo'yicha hamma "
"uchun ochiq (bu access rights'ni sozlash orqali o'zgartirilishi mumkin)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:118
msgid "Base vs. Inherited vs. Duplicated"
msgstr "Base vs. Inherited vs. Duplicated"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:120
msgid ""
"**Base view:** View natively implemented by Odoo. It is directly derived "
"from their model. A base view should never be altered as it allows updating "
"an Odoo database without overwriting a client's modification."
msgstr ""
"**Base view:** Odoo tomonidan asl holda amalga oshirilgan view. U to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri o'z model'idan kelib chiqadi. Base view hech qachon "
"o'zgartirilmasligi kerak, chunki u mijozning o'zgartirishlarini qayta "
"yozmasdan Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasini yangilash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:124
msgid ""
"Modifications always take place in either a duplicated or inherited view "
"with some differences:"
msgstr ""
"O'zgartirishlar doim yoki nusxa olingan, yoki inherited view'da amalga "
"oshiriladi va ular o'rtasida ba'zi farqlar bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Inherited view** always has an `inherit_id` and applies modifications "
"based on the source code of the base view it inherits from."
msgstr ""
"**Inherited view** doim `inherit_id`ga ega bo'ladi va o'zi meros olgan base "
"view'ning source kodiga asoslanib o'zgartirishlarni qo'llaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/setup.rst:128
msgid ""
"**Duplicated view** is a duplication from another one. Most of the time this "
"kind of view is created by Odoo when the end-user applies modifications "
"through the Website Builder. This mechanism prevents data loss when the "
"module is updated because only the source view will be updated, not the "
"duplicated one. If a duplicated view exists, both the original view and the "
"duplicated one are visible in the list but only the duplicated one has an "
"`external_id` (an `external_id` set means that the view has been created by "
"the source code of a module)."
msgstr ""
"**Duplicated view** — boshqa view'dan olingan nusxa. Ko'p hollarda bunday "
"view Odoo tomonidan, oxirgi foydalanuvchi Website Builder orqali "
"o'zgartirishlar kiritganda yaratiladi. Bu mexanizm modul yangilanganda "
"ma'lumot yo'qolishining oldini oladi, chunki faqat manba view yangilanadi, "
"nusxa olingani esa yangilanmaydi. Agar nusxa olingan view mavjud bo'lsa, "
"ro'yxatda ham asl view, ham nusxa olingani ko'rinadi, lekin faqat nusxa "
"olinganida `external_id` bo'ladi (`external_id` belgilangani view modul "
"source kodi tomonidan yaratilganini bildiradi)."

