"have an impact on the loading performances of the website."
msgstr ""
"Shuni yodda tuting: rasm Website Builder bilan qo'lda saqlanmagunicha, u "
"ma'lumotlar bazasida record sifatida saqlanmaydi, **u sahifani ko'rayotgan "
"har bir tashrifchi uchun real vaqtda yaratiladi**. Shu sababli bu "
"website'ning yuklanish unumdorligiga ta'sir qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/shapes.rst:487
msgid ""
"The image shapes can include up to 5 colors. As the SVG file contains colors "
"related to the Odoo default colors palette, the system is able to map the "
"colors existing in the file and match the ones called in the `data-shape-"
"colors` attribute of the image."
msgstr ""
"Image shape'lar 5 tagacha rangni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin. SVG fayl Odoo "
"standart ranglar palitrasiga tegishli ranglarni saqlagani uchun, tizim "
"fayldagi mavjud ranglarni xaritalab, rasmning `data-shape-colors` atributida "
"chaqirilgan ranglarga moslashtira oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/shapes.rst:507
msgid ""
"In the example above, the color `#0B8EE6` is applied as the first color of "
"the palette. Considering the first color in the default palette is "
"`#3AADAA`, the Website Builder replaces `#3AADAA` by `#0B8EE6`."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi misolda `#0B8EE6` rangi palitraning birinchi rangi sifatida "
"qo'llaniladi. Standart palitradagi birinchi rang `#3AADAA` ekanini hisobga "
"olsak, Website Builder `#3AADAA` ni `#0B8EE6` bilan almashtiradi."

