"controllers or `/views/backend` for backend views, etc."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi fayl strukturasi shunchaki tavsiya.  Loyihada kerak bo'lganicha "
"boshqa papkalar qo'shish mumkin, masalan controller'larni joylash uchun `/"
"controllers` yoki backend view'lar uchun `/views/backend` va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:159
msgid ""
"To create a website theme, you only need to install the Website app. If you "
"need other apps (Blogs, Events, eCommerce, ...), you can also add them."
msgstr ""
"Vebsayt theme'i yaratish uchun faqat Website ilovasini o'rnatish kifoya. "
"Agar boshqa ilovalar kerak bo'lsa (Blogs, Events, eCommerce, ...), ularni "
"ham qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:161
msgid ""
"Odoo version and major number are mandatory. However, patch number is "
"optional. If you want to specify the required version of Odoo to run your "
"module, you should use a five arguments structure, using the first two "
"arguments to indicate your current Odoo version (`* = 19.0`)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo versiyasi va major raqami majburiy. Ammo patch raqami ixtiyoriy. "
"Module'ingizni ishga tushirish uchun talab qilinadigan Odoo versiyasini "
"ko'rsatmoqchi bo'lsangiz, besh argumentli strukturadan foydalanishingiz "
"kerak: dastlabki ikki argument joriy Odoo versiyangizni bildiradi (`* = "
"19.0`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
msgid "Module versioning"
msgstr "Module versiyalash"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:169
msgid ""
"Example: `19.0.1.0.0` "
"`odoo_major.odoo_minor.module_major.module_minor.module_patch`"
msgstr ""
"Misol: `19.0.1.0.0` "
"`odoo_major.odoo_minor.module_major.module_minor.module_patch`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:174
msgid ""
"Automated file inclusion using wildcard notations `(ex.: /myfolder/*.scss)` "
"doesn't work in Odoo SaaS databases. In this case, include each file "
"manually in the manifest."
msgstr ""
"Wildcard belgilari yordamida fayllarni avtomatik qo'shish `(ex.: /myfolder/"
"*.scss)` Odoo SaaS ma'lumotlar bazalarida ishlamaydi. Bunday holatda har bir "
"faylni manifest'ga qo'lda qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:180
msgid "Default options"
msgstr "Standart opsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:182
msgid ""
"First, try to construct your theme by using Odoo's default options. This "
"ensures two things:"
msgstr ""
"Avvalo, mavzuingizni Odoo'ning standart opsiyalari yordamida qurishga "
"harakat qiling. Bu ikki narsani ta'minlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:184
msgid ""
"You do not re-invent something which already exists. For example, as Odoo "
"provides an option to add a border on the footer, you shouldn't recode it "
"yourself. Instead, enable the default option first, then extend it if needed."
msgstr ""
"Allaqachon mavjud narsani qaytadan o'ylab topmaysiz. Masalan, Odoo footer'ga "
"border qo'shish opsiyasini taqdim etadi, shuning uchun uni o'zingiz qaytadan "
"kodlashingiz shart emas. Buning o'rniga avval standart opsiyani yoqing, "
"so'ng zarur bo'lsa uni kengaytiring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:187
msgid ""
"The user can still use all of Odoo's features with your theme. For example, "
"if you recode the border on the footer, you may break the default option or "
"make it useless, giving the user a bad experience. Also, your recode might "
"not work as well as the default option, as other Odoo features may rely on "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi sizning mavzuingiz bilan ham Odoo'ning barcha imkoniyatlaridan "
"foydalanishda davom etadi. Masalan, agar footer'dagi border'ni qaytadan "
"kodlasangiz, standart opsiyani buzishingiz yoki uni foydasiz qilib "
"qo'yishingiz mumkin, bu esa foydalanuvchiga yoqimsiz tajriba beradi. Bundan "
"tashqari, sizning kodingiz standart opsiya kabi yaxshi ishlamasligi mumkin, "
"chunki Odoo'ning boshqa imkoniyatlari unga tayanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:193
msgid "Use four spaces per indentation level."
msgstr "Har bir chekinish darajasi uchun to'rtta bo'sh joydan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:194
msgid "Do not use tabs."
msgstr "Tab belgilaridan foydalanmang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:195
msgid "Never mix spaces and tabs."
msgstr "Bo'sh joy va tab belgilarini hech qachon aralashtirmang."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:198
msgid ""
":doc:`Odoo coding guidelines <../../../contributing/development/"
"coding_guidelines>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Odoo kodlash yo'riqnomalari <../../../contributing/development/"
"coding_guidelines>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:203
msgid "Odoo variables"
msgstr "Odoo o'zgaruvchilari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:205
msgid ""
"Odoo declares many CSS rules, most entirely customizable by overriding the "
"related SCSS variables. To do so, create a :file:`primary_variables.scss` "
"file and add it to the `_assets_primary_variables` bundle."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ko'plab CSS qoidalarini e'lon qiladi va ularning ko'pchiligini tegishli "
"SCSS o'zgaruvchilarini override qilish orqali to'liq sozlash mumkin. Buning "
"uchun :file:`primary_variables.scss` faylini yarating va uni "
"`_assets_primary_variables` bundle'iga qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:220
msgid ""
"By reading the source code, variables related to options are easily "
"noticeable."
msgstr ""
"Manba kodini o'qib chiqsangiz, opsiyalarga tegishli o'zgaruvchilarni "
"osongina sezish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:241
msgid ""
"These variables can be overridden through the `$o-website-value-palettes` "
"map, for example."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, bu o'zgaruvchilarni `$o-website-value-palettes` map'i orqali "
"override qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:246
msgid "Global"
msgstr "Global"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:264
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:564
msgid ""
"That file must only contain definitions and overrides of SCSS variables and "
"mixins."
msgstr ""
"Bu fayl faqat SCSS o'zgaruvchilari va mixin'larning ta'riflari hamda "
"override'larini o'z ichiga olishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:267
msgid ""
"`Primary variables SCSS <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"62cad846a5c8adf52fc0450bc3f5cfd0492d0622/addons/website/static/src/scss/"
"primary_variables.scss#L2096>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Primary variables SCSS <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"62cad846a5c8adf52fc0450bc3f5cfd0492d0622/addons/website/static/src/scss/"
"primary_variables.scss#L2096>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:273
msgid "Fonts"
msgstr "Shriftlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:275
msgid ""
"You can embed any font on your website. The Website Builder automatically "
"makes them available in the font selector."
msgstr ""
"Veb-saytingizga har qanday shriftni joylashtirishingiz mumkin. Website "
"Builder ularni shrift tanlagichida avtomatik ravishda mavjud qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:313
msgid "Google fonts"
msgstr "Google shriftlari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:333
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:280
msgid "Custom fonts"
msgstr "Maxsus shriftlar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:335
msgid "First, create a specific SCSS file to declare your custom font(s)."
msgstr ""
"Avvalo, maxsus shriftlaringizni e'lon qilish uchun alohida SCSS fayl "
"yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:346
msgid ""
"Then, use the `@font-face` rule to allow you custom font(s) to be loaded on "
"your website."
msgstr ""
"So'ng, maxsus shriftlaringiz veb-saytingizda yuklanishi uchun `@font-face` "
"qoidasidan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:348
msgid "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/fonts.scss``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/fonts.scss``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:374
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use the `.woff` and/or `.woff2` format for your fonts."
msgstr ""
"Shriftlaringiz uchun `.woff` va/yoki `.woff2` formatidan foydalanish tavsiya "
"etiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:381
msgid ""
"The Website Builder relies on palettes composed of five named colors. "
"Defining those in your theme ensures it stays consistent."
msgstr ""
"Website Builder beshta nomlangan rangdan tashkil topgan palitralarga "
"tayanadi. Ularni mavzuingizda aniqlash uning izchil bo'lib qolishini "
"ta'minlaydi."

