#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:423
msgid ""
"Add the created palette to the list of palettes offered by the Website "
"Builder."
msgstr ""
"Yaratilgan palitrani Website Builder taklif qiladigan palitralar ro'yxatiga "
