#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
msgid "Theme colors Airproof"
msgstr "Airproof mavzu ranglari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:444
msgid "**Color combinations**"
msgstr "**Rang kombinatsiyalari**"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:446
msgid ""
"Based on the previously defined five color palettes, the Website Builder "
"automatically generates five color combinations, each defining a color for "
"the background, text, headings, links, primary buttons, and secondary "
"buttons. These colors can be customized later by the user."
msgstr ""
"Oldin aniqlangan beshta rang palitrasi asosida Website Builder beshta rang "
"kombinatsiyasini avtomatik hosil qiladi; ularning har biri fon, matn, "
"sarlavhalar, havolalar, asosiy tugmalar va ikkilamchi tugmalar uchun rang "
"belgilaydi. Bu ranglarni keyinchalik foydalanuvchi o'zi sozlashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:454
msgid ""
"The colors used in a color combination are accessible and can be overridden "
"through `$o-color-palettes` using a specific prefix (`o-cc` for `color "
"combination`)."
msgstr ""
"Rang kombinatsiyasida ishlatilgan ranglarga murojaat qilish mumkin va ularni "
"maxsus prefiks (`color combination` uchun `o-cc`) yordamida `$o-color-"
"palettes` orqali override qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:483
msgid ""
"For each `o-cc*`, replace the `*` with the digit (1 - 5) corresponding to "
"the desired color combination."
msgstr ""
"Har bir `o-cc*` uchun `*` belgisini kerakli rang kombinatsiyasiga mos raqam "
"(1 - 5) bilan almashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:486
msgid ""
"The default text color is `o-color-5`. If the background is too dark, it "
"will automatically change to the `o-color-4` color."
msgstr ""
"Standart matn rangi — `o-color-5`. Agar fon juda to'q bo'lsa, u avtomatik "
"ravishda `o-color-4` rangiga o'zgaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:490
msgid ""
"`Color combinations SCSS <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"944d7c8d5d6bf97cba71644b615e081e4fff6595/addons/html_editor/static/src/scss/"
"html_editor.common.scss#L16>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Color combinations SCSS <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"944d7c8d5d6bf97cba71644b615e081e4fff6595/addons/html_editor/static/src/scss/"
"html_editor.common.scss#L16>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:495
msgid ""
"The Website Builder automatically generates a page to view the color "
"combinations of the theme color palette: http://localhost:8069/website/demo/"
"color-combinations"
msgstr ""
"Website Builder mavzu rang palitrasining rang kombinatsiyalarini ko'rish "
"uchun sahifani avtomatik hosil qiladi: http://localhost:8069/website/demo/"
"color-combinations"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:503
msgid ""
"You can also define gradients for the menu, header, footer and copyright "
"bar, directly in your `primary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, menu, header, footer va copyright bar uchun gradientlarni "
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri `primary_variables.scss` faylingizda aniqlashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:523
msgid "Bootstrap variables"
msgstr "Bootstrap o'zgaruvchilari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:525
msgid ""
"Odoo includes Bootstrap by default. You can use all variables and mixins of "
"the framework."
msgstr ""
"Odoo sukut bo'yicha Bootstrap'ni o'z ichiga oladi. Framework'ning barcha "
"o'zgaruvchilari va mixin'laridan foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:527
msgid ""
"If Odoo does not provide the variable you are looking for, there could be a "
"Bootstrap variable that allows it. Indeed all Odoo layouts respect Bootstrap "
"structures and use Bootstrap components or their extensions. If you "
"customize a Bootstrap variable, you add a generic style for the whole user "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Agar Odoo siz izlagan o'zgaruvchini taqdim etmasa, buni imkon beradigan "
"Bootstrap o'zgaruvchisi bo'lishi mumkin. Darhaqiqat, Odoo'ning barcha "
"layout'lari Bootstrap strukturalariga rioya qiladi va Bootstrap "
"component'lari yoki ularning kengaytmalaridan foydalanadi. Bootstrap "
"o'zgaruvchisini sozlaganingizda, butun foydalanuvchi veb-sayti uchun umumiy "
"uslub qo'shasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:532
msgid ""
"Use a dedicated file added to the :file:`_assets_frontend_helpers` bundle to "
"override Bootstrap values and *not* the :file:`primary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Bootstrap qiymatlarini override qilish "
"uchun :file:`_assets_frontend_helpers` bundle'iga qo'shilgan alohida fayldan "
"foydalaning, :file:`primary_variables.scss` faylidan *emas*."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:548
msgid "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/bootstrap_overridden.scss``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/bootstrap_overridden.scss``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:567
msgid ""
"Don't override Bootstrap variables that depend on Odoo variables. Otherwise, "
"you might break the possibility for the user to customize them using the "
"Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Odoo o'zgaruvchilariga bog'liq bo'lgan Bootstrap o'zgaruvchilarini override "
"qilmang. Aks holda, foydalanuvchining ularni Website Builder yordamida "
"sozlash imkoniyatini buzib qo'yishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:570
msgid ""
"When an option is defined by a variable in `primary_variables.scss` and by a "
"Boostrap variable, you should always go for an override through the primary "
"variables. Do it via `bootstrap_overridden.scss` only if nothing exists in "
"the primary variables."
msgstr ""
"Agar opsiya `primary_variables.scss` dagi o'zgaruvchi bilan ham, Bootstrap "
"o'zgaruvchisi bilan ham aniqlangan bo'lsa, har doim primary variables orqali "
"override qilishni tanlang. `bootstrap_overridden.scss` orqali esa faqat "
"primary variables'da hech narsa mavjud bo'lmaganda bajaring."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:575
msgid ""
"`Bootstrap overridden SCSS <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"web/static/lib/bootstrap/scss/_variables.scss>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Bootstrap overridden SCSS <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"web/static/lib/bootstrap/scss/_variables.scss>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:580
msgid "http://localhost:8069/website/demo/bootstrap"
msgstr "http://localhost:8069/website/demo/bootstrap"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:587
msgid ""
"Odoo has CSS font size classes to separate style (font sizes) and semantic "
"(tag and styles in general). Both logic can be combined to be more flexible."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da uslubni (shrift o'lchamlari) va semantikani (umuman tag va uslublar) "
"ajratish uchun CSS shrift o'lchami class'lari mavjud. Ko'proq moslashuvchan "
"bo'lish uchun ikkala mantiqni birlashtirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:591
msgid ""
"`Bootstrap documentation about display headings <https://getbootstrap.com/"
"docs/5.3/content/typography/#display-headings>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Display headings haqida Bootstrap hujjatlari <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/"
"5.3/content/typography/#display-headings>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:597
msgid "Text style"
msgstr "Matn uslubi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:599
msgid ""
"Odoo's Website Builder allows to select a style for your text. Some are just "
"tag related like the `Header` with no extra CSS class. Other combine tag and "
"style directly applied on them like the `Header 1 Display`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning Website Builder'i matningiz uchun uslub tanlash imkonini beradi. "
"Ba'zilari faqat tag bilan bog'liq, masalan qo'shimcha CSS class'i bo'lmagan "
"`Header`. Boshqalari esa tag va unga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri qo'llanilgan uslubni "
"birlashtiradi, masalan `Header 1 Display`."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
msgid "Header styles"
msgstr "Header uslublari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:624
#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:None
msgid "Sizing classes"
msgstr "O'lcham class'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:626
msgid ""
"The sizing classes are added on a freshly created `span` tag inside the "
"targeted element (See examples below)."
msgstr ""
"O'lcham class'lari maqsadli element ichida yangi yaratilgan `span` tag'iga "
"qo'shiladi (quyidagi misollarga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:636
msgid "Heading and body text"
msgstr "Sarlavha va asosiy matn"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:638
msgid ""
"Assuming these classes can be applied on any text element, take `h2` as an "
"example below:"
msgstr ""
"Bu class'lar har qanday matn elementiga qo'llanishi mumkin deb hisoblab, "
"quyida misol sifatida `h2` ni olamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:661
msgid "Display headings"
msgstr "Display sarlavhalari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:663
msgid ""
"If larger titles are needed, Odoo uses Bootstrap's Display Headings classes, "
"from `display-1` to `6`."
msgstr ""
"Agar kattaroq sarlavhalar kerak bo'lsa, Odoo Bootstrap'ning Display Headings "
"class'laridan foydalanadi — `display-1` dan `6` gacha."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:673
msgid ""
"The Website Builder allows the user to configure only sizes from `Display 1` "
"to `Display 4`. You can set the other sizes (`5` and `6`) to use them in "
"your code but the user won't be able to modify them directly within the "
"Website Builder interface."
msgstr ""
"Website Builder foydalanuvchiga faqat `Display 1` dan `Display 4` gacha "
"o'lchamlarni sozlash imkonini beradi. Qolgan o'lchamlarni (`5` va `6`) "
"kodingizda ishlatish uchun belgilashingiz mumkin, lekin foydalanuvchi ularni "
"Website Builder interfeysida bevosita o'zgartira olmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:680
msgid "Website settings"
msgstr "Website sozlamalari"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:682
msgid ""
"Global options related to the website can be set through the website record "
"by following the structure below."
msgstr ""
"Website'ga tegishli global opsiyalar quyidagi struktura asosida website "
"record'i orqali belgilanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:687
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/02_build_website.rst:189
msgid "``/website_airproof/data/website.xml``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/data/website.xml``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:725
msgid ""
"`Website model <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"51036f87a8753c9ecb9cd370342bd38e841c3d2c/addons/website_sale/models/"
"website.py#L116>`_ from the eCommerce App:"
msgstr ""
"eCommerce App'dagi `Website model <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"51036f87a8753c9ecb9cd370342bd38e841c3d2c/addons/website_sale/models/"
"website.py#L116>`_:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:728
msgid ""
"Fields prefixed with `shop_` are related to the `/shop` page configuration;"
msgstr ""
"`shop_` prefiksli field'lar `/shop` sahifasi konfiguratsiyasiga tegishli;"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:729
msgid ""
"Fields prefixed with `product_page_` are related to the product page "
