msgid "Assets"
msgstr "Assets"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:856
msgid ""
"For this part, we will refer to the `assets_frontend` bundle located in the "
"web module. This bundle specifies the list of assets loaded on the website "
"frontend (public pages), and the goal is to add your SCSS and JS files to "
"the bundle. The Website Builder uses its own bundles (for example: "
"`website.website_builder_assets` and `website.assets_wysiwyg`)."
msgstr ""
"Bu qismda web module ichidagi `assets_frontend` bundle'iga murojaat qilamiz. "
"Ushbu bundle website frontend'ida (ommaviy sahifalarda) yuklanadigan "
"asset'lar ro'yxatini belgilaydi va maqsad — SCSS va JS fayllaringizni shu "
"bundle'ga qo'shish. Website Builder o'zining alohida bundle'laridan "
"foydalanadi (masalan: `website.website_builder_assets` va "
"`website.assets_wysiwyg`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:861
msgid ""
"This is a non-exhaustive list of the frequently used bundles for a website:"
msgstr ""
"Bu website uchun tez-tez ishlatiladigan bundle'larning to'liq bo'lmagan "
"ro'yxati:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:868
msgid "Bundle"
msgstr "Bundle"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:870
msgid "web._assets_primary_variables"
msgstr "web._assets_primary_variables"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:871
msgid ""
"Defines the primary SCSS variables (colors, fonts, spacing, etc) used as the "
"main theming layer across all bundles. Mainly used for "
"the :file:`primary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Barcha bundle'larda asosiy theming qatlami sifatida ishlatiladigan birlamchi "
"SCSS o'zgaruvchilarini (ranglar, shriftlar, oraliqlar va h.k.) aniqlaydi. "
"Asosan :file:`primary_variables.scss` fayli uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:873
msgid "web._assets_secondary_variables"
msgstr "web._assets_secondary_variables"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:874
msgid ""
"Defines secondary SCSS variables that depend on and extend the primary "
"variables. Mainly used for the :file:`secondary_variables.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Primary variable'larga bog'liq bo'lgan va ularni kengaytiruvchi ikkilamchi "
"SCSS variable'larni aniqlaydi. Asosan :file:`secondary_variables.scss` fayli "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:876
msgid "web._assets_frontend_helpers"
msgstr "web._assets_frontend_helpers"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:877
msgid ""
"Provides frontend-specific Bootstrap overrides to be included before any "
"frontend SCSS compilation. Mainly used for "
"the :file:`bootstrap_overridden.scss` file."
msgstr ""
"Har qanday frontend SCSS kompilyatsiyasidan oldin qo'shiladigan frontend'ga "
"xos Bootstrap override'larini taqdim etadi. "
"Asosan :file:`bootstrap_overridden.scss` fayli uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:879
msgid "web.assets_frontend"
msgstr "web.assets_frontend"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:880
msgid ""
"Provides the base assets required to render and interact with Odoo's "
"frontend. You can add all your custom SCSS, JS or client-side QWeb templates."
msgstr ""
"Odoo frontend'ini render qilish va u bilan ishlash uchun kerak bo'lgan "
"asosiy asset'larni taqdim etadi. Bunga barcha maxsus SCSS, JS yoki client-"
"side QWeb template'laringizni qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:882
msgid "website.website_builder_assets"
msgstr "website.website_builder_assets"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:883
msgid ""
"Provides the assets loaded into the Website Builder context, including edit-"
"mode styles, custom method for a custom building block, etc)."
msgstr ""
"Website Builder context'iga yuklanadigan asset'larni taqdim etadi: edit-mode "
"uslublari, maxsus building block uchun maxsus method va h.k.)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:885
msgid "web._assets_bootstrap"
msgstr "web._assets_bootstrap"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:886
msgid ""
"If you need to extend Boostrap through the Bootstrap Utilities API, for "
"example"
msgstr ""
"Masalan, Bootstrap Utilities API orqali Bootstrap'ni kengaytirish kerak "
"bo'lsa"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:891
msgid "Styles"
msgstr "Uslublar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:893
msgid ""
"The Website Builder together with Bootstrap are great for defining the basic "
"styles of your website. But to design something unique, you should go a step "
"further. For this, you can easily add any SCSS file to your theme."
msgstr ""
"Website Builder Bootstrap bilan birgalikda veb-saytingizning asosiy "
"uslublarini aniqlash uchun juda qulay. Ammo o'ziga xos narsa yaratish uchun "
"bir qadam oldinga borishingiz kerak. Buning uchun theme'ingizga istalgan "
"SCSS faylini osongina qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:908
msgid ""
"Feel free to reuse the variables from your Bootstrap file and the ones used "
"by Odoo in your :file:`theme.scss` file."
msgstr ""
":file:`theme.scss` faylingizda Bootstrap faylingizdagi variable'lardan va "
"Odoo ishlatadigan variable'lardan erkin foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:912
msgid "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/theme.scss``"
msgstr "``/website_airproof/static/src/scss/theme.scss``"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:924
msgid "Interactivity"
msgstr "Interaktivlik"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:926
msgid "Odoo supports three different kinds of JavaScript files:"
msgstr "Odoo uch xil JavaScript fayl turini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:928
msgid ""
":ref:`plain JavaScript files <frontend/modules/plain_js>` (no module system),"
msgstr ""
":ref:`oddiy JavaScript fayllar <frontend/modules/plain_js>` (module "
"system'siz),"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:929
msgid ":ref:`native JavaScript module <frontend/modules/native_js>`, and"
msgstr ":ref:`native JavaScript module <frontend/modules/native_js>` va"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:930
msgid ""
":ref:`Odoo modules <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` (using a custom module "
"system)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Odoo modullari <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` (maxsus module "
"system'dan foydalanadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:932
msgid ""
"Most new Odoo JavaScript codes should use the native JavaScript module "
"system. It's simpler and brings the benefit of a better developer experience "
"with better integration with the IDE."
msgstr ""
"Yangi Odoo JavaScript kodlarining ko'pchiligi native JavaScript module "
"system'dan foydalanishi kerak. U soddaroq va IDE bilan yaxshiroq "
"integratsiya hisobiga qulayroq dasturchi tajribasini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:947
msgid ""
"If you want to include files from an external library, you can add them to "
"the :file:`/lib` folder of your module."
msgstr ""
"Tashqi library'dan fayllarni qo'shmoqchi bo'lsangiz, ularni "
"modulingizning :file:`/lib` papkasiga joylashtirishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:951
msgid ""
"Use a linter (`ESLint <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/"
"tooling/_eslintrc.json>`_, ...)."
msgstr ""
"Linter ishlating (`ESLint <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/"
"tooling/_eslintrc.json>`_, ...)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:952
msgid "Always add minified JavaScript libraries"
msgstr "Doim minifikatsiya qilingan JavaScript library'larni qo'shing"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:953
msgid "Use `js_` prefixed CSS classes on elements you target with JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript bilan ishlaydigan elementlarda `js_` prefiksli CSS class'lardan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:954
msgid ""
"Variables and functions should be *camelCased* (`myVariable`) instead of "
"*snake_cased* (`my_variable`)."
msgstr ""
"Variable va funksiyalar *snake_cased* (`my_variable`) emas, *camelCased* "
"(`myVariable`) bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:956
msgid "JavaScript classes use *PascalCase* (`MyClass`)."
msgstr "JavaScript class'lari *PascalCase* (`MyClass`) ishlatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:957
msgid ""
"Do not name a variable `event`; use `ev` instead. This is to avoid bugs on "
"non-Chrome browsers, as Chrome is magically assigning a global `event` "
"variable (so if you use the `event` variable without declaring it, it will "
"work fine on Chrome but crash on every other browser)."
msgstr ""
"Variable'ga `event` deb nom bermang; uning o'rniga `ev` ishlating. Bu "
"Chrome'dan boshqa browser'lardagi bug'larni oldini oladi, chunki Chrome "
"global `event` variable'ini sehrli tarzda o'zi belgilaydi (ya'ni `event` "
"variable'ini e'lon qilmasdan ishlatsangiz, Chrome'da yaxshi ishlaydi, lekin "
"boshqa barcha browser'larda ishdan chiqadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:961
msgid "Use strict comparisons (`===` instead of `==`)."
msgstr "Qat'iy taqqoslashdan foydalaning (`==` emas, `===`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:962
msgid ""
"Use double quotes for all strings (such as `\"Hello\"`, `\".x_nav_item\"`)."
msgstr ""
"Barcha string'lar uchun qo'shtirnoq ishlating (masalan, `\"Hello\"`, "
"`\".x_nav_item\"`)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:963
msgid ""
"If you're using native standard JS functions (`start()`, `willStart()`, "
"`cleanForSave()`, etc), make sure you call the parent implementation (for "
"example, `super.start(...arguments)`; check if it's necessary in the "
"standard code)."
msgstr ""
"Agar native standart JS funksiyalarini (`start()`, `willStart()`, "
"`cleanForSave()` va h.k.) ishlatsangiz, parent implementatsiyasini "
"chaqirishni unutmang (masalan, `super.start(...arguments)`; standart kodda "
"bu zarur ekanligini tekshirib ko'ring)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:968
msgid ""
"`Odoo JavaScript coding guidelines <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/"
"Javascript-coding-guidelines>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo JavaScript kod yozish qoidalari <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/wiki/"
"Javascript-coding-guidelines>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:969
msgid ""
":doc:`Overview of the Odoo JavaScript framework <../../reference/frontend/"
"javascript_reference>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`Odoo JavaScript framework haqida umumiy ma'lumot <../../reference/"
"frontend/javascript_reference>`"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/theming.rst:971
msgid ""
"`Odoo Experience Talk: Best practices to use the Website Builder like a "
"professional designer <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-"
"YPy5GqmUbc&ab_channel=Odoo>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Experience Talk: Website Builder'dan professional dizayner kabi "
"foydalanishning eng yaxshi amaliyotlari <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-"
"YPy5GqmUbc&ab_channel=Odoo>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:3
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/pdf_reports.rst:282
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/web.rst:1221
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/website_theme/06_going_live.rst:8
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "Tarjimalar"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:5
msgid "With Odoo, you can translate your website into different languages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo yordamida veb-saytingizni turli tillarga tarjima qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:9
msgid "Translate the content of a module."
msgstr "Modul kontentini tarjima qilish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:10
msgid "Import and export translations."
msgstr "Tarjimalarni import va eksport qilish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:11
msgid "Integrate translations to a module."
msgstr "Tarjimalarni modulga integratsiya qilish."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:16
msgid "Frontend"
msgstr "Frontend"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:18
msgid ""
"To translate your pages with the Website Builder, go to your website and "
"click on the language selector to switch to it. If your website was never "
"translated to the target language, click :guilabel:`Add a language...`, "
"select it in the pop-up window, and click :guilabel:`Add`."
msgstr ""
"Sahifalaringizni Website Builder bilan tarjima qilish uchun veb-saytingizga "
"o'ting va til tanlagichni bosib kerakli tilga o'ting. Agar veb-saytingiz "
"hali maqsadli tilga tarjima qilinmagan bo'lsa, :guilabel:`Add a language...` "
"ni bosing, ochilgan oynada tilni tanlang va :guilabel:`Add` ni bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:22
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Translate` to start translating. Depending on the language, "
"some text is automatically translated and highlighted in green, while "
"everything that should be translated manually is highlighted in yellow."
msgstr ""
"Tarjimani boshlash uchun :guilabel:`Translate` ni bosing. Tilga qarab, ba'zi "
"matnlar avtomatik tarjima qilinadi va yashil rangda ajratiladi, qo'lda "
"tarjima qilinishi kerak bo'lgan hamma narsa esa sariq rangda ajratiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:None
msgid "Translate button"
msgstr "Translate tugmasi"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:29
msgid ""
"However, you have to understand what's happening under the hood when you "
"translate something through the Website Builder."
msgstr ""
"Biroq, Website Builder orqali biror narsani tarjima qilganingizda ichkarida "
"nima sodir bo'layotganini tushunishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:37
msgid ""
"Odoo creates a base view once the Website is installed. If you edit the page "
"with the Builder, a duplicated view will be created and all your "
"modifications will be saved into this one (and your translations also). The "
"only exception concerns the homepage (by default, Odoo creates a base and "
"duplicated view even before you've edited anything)."
msgstr ""
"Website o'rnatilgandan so'ng Odoo asosiy (base) view yaratadi. Agar sahifani "
"Builder bilan tahrirlasangiz, view'ning dublikati yaratiladi va barcha "
"o'zgartirishlaringiz (tarjimalaringiz ham) shu dublikatga saqlanadi. Faqat "
"bosh sahifa bundan mustasno (sukut bo'yicha Odoo hech narsani tahrirlashdan "
"oldin ham base va dublikat view yaratadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:None
msgid "Translations dupliclated page"
msgstr "Tarjimalar uchun dublikat sahifa"

#: ../../content/developer/howtos/website_themes/translations.rst:45
msgid ""
"We recommend to be very careful about the order in which you will carry out "
"translations or modifications in the source language, either if you created "
"the page through the Website Builder or through the source code with a "
"record. Note that every single modification of the source language (`Edit "
"master`) will break the link between the source language and the existing "
"translations. In other words, you'll have to re-create the translations if "
"you edit the source language."
msgstr ""
"Sahifani Website Builder orqali yoki source kod orqali record bilan yaratgan "
"bo'lishingizdan qat'i nazar, tarjimalarni va manba tildagi o'zgartirishlarni "
"qanday tartibda bajarishingizga juda ehtiyot bo'lishni tavsiya qilamiz. "
"E'tibor bering, manba tilning har bir o'zgartirishi (`Edit master`) manba "
"til va mavjud tarjimalar o'rtasidagi bog'lanishni uzadi. Boshqacha aytganda, "
"manba tilni tahrirlasangiz, tarjimalarni qaytadan yaratishingizga to'g'ri "
"keladi."

