"processing so that each call makes progress on some of the work to be done."
msgstr ""
"Scheduled action ishga tushirilganda, worker'ni uzoq vaqt band qilib "
"qo'ymaslik va timeout xatolariga duch kelmaslik uchun ishni bo'laklarga "
"(batch) ajratish tavsiya etiladi. Shuning uchun ishlov berishni shunday "
"taqsimlang-ki, har bir chaqiruv bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan ishning bir "
"qismini oldinga suradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:455
msgid ""
"When writing such a function, you should focus on processing a single batch. "
"A batch should process one or many records and should generally take no more "
"than *a few seconds*."
msgstr ""
"Bunday funksiyani yozayotganda faqat bitta batch'ga ishlov berishga e'tibor "
"qaratishingiz kerak. Batch bir yoki bir nechta record'ga ishlov berishi "
"lozim va odatda *bir necha soniya*dan ko'proq vaqt olmasligi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:459
msgid ""
"Work is committed by the framework after each batch. The framework will call "
"the function as many times as necessary to process the remaining work. Do "
"not reschedule yourself the job."
msgstr ""
"Ish har bir batch'dan keyin framework tomonidan commit qilinadi. Framework "
"qolgan ishni bajarish uchun funksiyani zarur bo'lgancha marta chaqiradi. "
"Vazifani o'zingiz qayta rejalashtirmang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:475
msgid ""
"In some cases, you may want to share resources between multiple batches or "
"manage the loop yourself to handle exceptions. In this case, you should "
"inform the scheduler of the progress of your work by "
"calling :func:`IrCron._commit_progress` and checking the result. The "
"progress function returns the number of seconds remaining for the call; if "
"it is 0, you must return as soon as possible."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi hollarda bir nechta batch o'rtasida resurslarni bo'lishishni yoki "
"xatolarni qayta ishlash uchun tsiklni o'zingiz boshqarishni xohlashingiz "
"mumkin. Bu holda :func:`IrCron._commit_progress` ni chaqirib va natijani "
"tekshirib, scheduler'ni ishingiz jarayoni haqida xabardor qilishingiz kerak. "
"Progress funksiyasi chaqiruv uchun qolgan soniyalar sonini qaytaradi; agar u "
"0 bo'lsa, imkon qadar tezroq qaytishingiz shart."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:482
msgid ""
"The following is an example of how to commit after each record that is "
"processed, while keeping the connection open."
msgstr ""
"Quyida ulanishni ochiq holda saqlab, ishlov berilgan har bir record'dan "
"keyin qanday commit qilish misoli keltirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:515
msgid "Running cron functions"
msgstr "Cron funksiyalarini ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:517
msgid ""
"You should not call cron functions directly. There are two ways to run "
"functions:"
msgstr ""
"Cron funksiyalarini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri chaqirmasligingiz kerak. "
"Funksiyalarni ishga tushirishning ikki usuli bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:523
msgid ""
"Testing of a cron function should be done by "
"calling :func:`IrCron.method_direct_trigger` in the registry test mode."
msgstr ""
"Cron funksiyasini test qilish registry test "
"rejimida :func:`IrCron.method_direct_trigger` ni chaqirish orqali amalga "
"oshirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:527
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1063
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:276
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Xavfsizlik"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:529
msgid ""
"To maintain a fair usage of resources among scheduled actions, some security "
"measures ensure the correct functioning of your scheduled actions."
msgstr ""
"Scheduled action'lar o'rtasida resurslardan adolatli foydalanishni saqlab "
"turish uchun ba'zi xavfsizlik choralari sizning scheduled action'laringiz "
"to'g'ri ishlashini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:532
msgid ""
"If a scheduled action encounters an error or a timeout three consecutive "
"times, it will skip its current execution and be considered as failed."
msgstr ""
"Agar scheduled action ketma-ket uch marta xato yoki timeout'ga duch kelsa, u "
"joriy bajarilishini o'tkazib yuboradi va muvaffaqiyatsiz deb hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:534
msgid ""
"If a scheduled action fails its execution five consecutive times over a "
"period of at least seven days, it will be deactivated and will notify the DB "
"admin."
msgstr ""
"Agar scheduled action kamida yetti kunlik davr ichida ketma-ket besh marta "
"muvaffaqiyatsiz bajarilsa, u o'chiriladi va DB administratoriga xabar "
"beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/actions.rst:536
msgid ""
"A hard-limit exists for the cron execution at the database level after which "
"the process executing cron jobs is killed."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi darajasida cron bajarilishi uchun qat'iy limit mavjud; "
"undan keyin cron vazifalarini bajaruvchi jarayon to'xtatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:6
msgid "Data Files"
msgstr "Ma'lumot fayllari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo is greatly data-driven, and a big part of modules definition is thus "
"the definition of the various records it manages: UI (menus and views), "
"security (access rights and record rules), reports and plain data are all "
"defined via records."
msgstr ""
"Odoo asosan ma'lumotlarga tayanadi, shuning uchun modullarni aniqlashning "
"katta qismi u boshqaradigan turli record'larni aniqlashdan iborat: UI "
"(menyular va view'lar), xavfsizlik (kirish huquqlari va record rule'lar), "
"hisobotlar va oddiy ma'lumotlar — barchasi record'lar orqali aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:16
msgid ""
"The main way to define data in Odoo is via XML data files: The broad "
"structure of an XML data file is the following:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da ma'lumotni aniqlashning asosiy usuli — XML ma'lumot fayllari. XML "
"ma'lumot faylining umumiy tuzilishi quyidagicha:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:19
msgid "Any number of operation elements within the root element ``odoo``"
msgstr ""
"``odoo`` ildiz elementi ichida ixtiyoriy sondagi operatsiya elementlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:30
msgid ""
"Data files are executed sequentially, operations can only refer to the "
"result of operations defined previously"
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumot fayllari ketma-ket bajariladi, operatsiyalar faqat oldin aniqlangan "
"operatsiyalar natijasiga murojaat qilishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:35
msgid ""
"If the content of the data file is expected to be applied only once, you can "
"specify the odoo flag ``noupdate`` set to 1.  If part of the data in the "
"file is expected to be applied once, you can place this part of the file in "
"a <data noupdate=\"1\"> domain."
msgstr ""
"Agar ma'lumot faylining mazmuni faqat bir marta qo'llanishi kutilsa, odoo "
"flag'i ``noupdate`` ni 1 ga teng qilib ko'rsatishingiz mumkin.  Agar "
"fayldagi ma'lumotning bir qismi bir marta qo'llanishi kutilsa, faylning shu "
"qismini <data noupdate=\"1\"> domain ichiga joylashtirishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:53
msgid "Core operations"
msgstr "Asosiy operatsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:58
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3580
msgid "``record``"
msgstr "``record``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:60
msgid ""
"``record`` appropriately defines or updates a database record, it has the "
"following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"``record`` ma'lumotlar bazasi record'ini tegishli ravishda aniqlaydi yoki "
"yangilaydi, u quyidagi atributlarga ega:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:63
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:153
msgid "``model`` (required)"
msgstr "``model`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:64
msgid "name of the model to create (or update)"
msgstr "yaratiladigan (yoki yangilanadigan) model nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:66
msgid ""
"the :term:`external identifier` for this record. It is strongly recommended "
"to provide one"
msgstr ""
"bu record uchun :term:`external identifier`. Uni ko'rsatish qat'iy tavsiya "
"etiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:69
msgid ""
"for record creation, allows subsequent definitions to either modify or refer "
"to this record"
msgstr ""
"record yaratishda keyingi aniqlanishlarga bu record'ni o'zgartirish yoki "
"unga murojaat qilish imkonini beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:71
msgid "for record modification, the record to modify"
msgstr "record'ni o'zgartirishda — o'zgartiriladigan record"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:72
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:853
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3012
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:936
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/web.rst:1704
msgid "``context``"
msgstr "``context``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:73
msgid "context to use when creating the record"
msgstr "record yaratishda ishlatiladigan context"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:77
msgid "``forcecreate``"
msgstr "``forcecreate``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:75
msgid "in update mode whether the record should be created if it doesn't exist"
msgstr ""
"update rejimida record mavjud bo'lmasa, u yaratilishi kerakmi yoki yo'qmi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:77
msgid "Requires an :term:`external id`, defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ":term:`external id` talab qiladi, standart qiymati ``True``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:80
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3560
msgid "``field``"
msgstr "``field``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:82
msgid ""
"Each record can be composed of ``field`` tags, defining values to set when "
"creating the record. A ``record`` with no ``field`` will use all default "
"values (creation) or do nothing (update)."
msgstr ""
"Har bir record ``field`` teglaridan tashkil topishi mumkin; ular record "
"yaratilganda o'rnatiladigan qiymatlarni aniqlaydi. ``field``ga ega bo'lmagan "
"``record`` barcha standart qiymatlardan foydalanadi (yaratish) yoki hech "
"narsa qilmaydi (yangilash)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:86
msgid ""
"A ``field`` has a mandatory ``name`` attribute, the name of the field to "
"set, and various methods to define the value itself:"
msgstr ""
"``field`` majburiy ``name`` atributiga ega — bu o'rnatiladigan field nomi, "
"hamda qiymatning o'zini aniqlash uchun turli usullar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:91
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Hech narsa"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:90
msgid ""
"if no value is provided for the field, an implicit ``False`` will be set on "
"the field. Can be used to clear a field, or avoid using a default value for "
"the field."
msgstr ""
"agar field uchun qiymat berilmasa, field'ga yashirin ``False`` o'rnatiladi. "
"Field'ni tozalash yoki field uchun standart qiymatdan foydalanishni oldini "
"olish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:98
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:159
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:265
msgid "``search``"
msgstr "``search``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:94
msgid ""
"for :ref:`relational fields <reference/fields/relational>`, should be "
"a :ref:`domain <reference/orm/domains>` on the field's model."
msgstr ""
":ref:`relational field'lar <reference/fields/relational>` uchun bu "
"field'ning model'i bo'yicha :ref:`domain <reference/orm/domains>` bo'lishi "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:97
msgid ""
"Will evaluate the domain, search the field's model using it and set the "
"search's result as the field's value. Will only use the first result if the "
"field is a :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`"
msgstr ""
"Domain'ni hisoblab chiqadi, u bilan field'ning model'ida qidiruv o'tkazadi "
"va qidiruv natijasini field qiymati sifatida o'rnatadi. Agar "
"field :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` bo'lsa, faqat birinchi natijadan "
"foydalanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:104
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:216
msgid "``ref``"
msgstr "``ref``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:101
msgid ""
"if a ``ref`` attribute is provided, its value must be a "
"valid :term:`external id`, which will be looked up and set as the field's "
"value."
msgstr ""
"agar ``ref`` atributi berilgan bo'lsa, uning qiymati yaroqli :term:`external "
"id` bo'lishi kerak; u topiladi va field qiymati sifatida o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:104
msgid ""
"Mostly for :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` "
"and :class:`~odoo.fields.Reference` fields"
msgstr ""
"Asosan :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` va :class:`~odoo.fields.Reference` "
"field'lari uchun"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:107
msgid ""
"if a ``type`` attribute is provided, it is used to interpret and convert the "
"field's content. The field's content can be provided through an external "
"file using the ``file`` attribute, or through the node's body."
msgstr ""
"agar ``type`` atributi berilgan bo'lsa, u field mazmunini talqin qilish va "
"konvertatsiya qilish uchun ishlatiladi. Field mazmuni ``file`` atributi "
"yordamida tashqi fayl orqali yoki node tanasi orqali berilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:111
msgid "Available types are:"
msgstr "Mavjud turlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:115
msgid "``xml``, ``html``"
msgstr "``xml``, ``html``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:114
msgid ""
"extracts the ``field``'s children as a single document, evaluates "
"any :term:`external id` specified with the form ``%(external_id)s``. ``%%`` "
"can be used to output actual *%* signs."
msgstr ""
"``field``ning bola elementlarini yagona hujjat sifatida ajratib oladi, ``%"
"(external_id)s`` shaklida ko'rsatilgan har qanday :term:`external id` ni "
"hisoblab chiqadi. Haqiqiy *%* belgilarini chiqarish uchun ``%%`` "
"ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:118
msgid "``file``"
msgstr "``file``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:118
msgid ""
"ensures that the field content is a valid file path in the current model, "
"saves the pair :samp:`{module},{path}` as the field value"
msgstr ""
"field mazmuni joriy model'da yaroqli fayl yo'li ekanligini "
"ta'minlaydi, :samp:`{module},{path}` juftligini field qiymati sifatida "
"saqlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:121
msgid "``char``"
msgstr "``char``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:121
msgid ""
"sets the field content directly as the field's value without alterations"
msgstr ""
"field mazmunini o'zgartirishlarsiz to'g'ridan-to'g'ri field qiymati sifatida "
"o'rnatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:124
msgid "``base64``"
msgstr "``base64``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:124
msgid ""
"base64_-encodes the field's content, useful combined with the ``file`` "
"*attribute* to load e.g. image data into attachments"
msgstr ""
"field mazmunini base64_ kodlashda foydali; masalan, rasm ma'lumotlarini "
"attachment'larga yuklash uchun ``file`` *atributi* bilan birga ishlatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:127
msgid "``int``"
msgstr "``int``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:127
msgid ""
"converts the field's content to an integer and sets it as the field's value"
msgstr ""
"field mazmunini butun songa aylantiradi va uni field qiymati sifatida "
"o'rnatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:130
msgid "``float``"
msgstr "``float``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:130
msgid ""
"converts the field's content to a float and sets it as the field's value"
msgstr ""
"field mazmunini float turiga aylantiradi va uni field qiymati sifatida "
"o'rnatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:135
msgid "``list``, ``tuple``"
msgstr "``list``, ``tuple``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:133
msgid ""
"should contain any number of ``value`` elements with the same properties as "
"``field``, each element resolves to an item of a generated tuple or list, "
"and the generated collection is set as the field's value"
msgstr ""
"``field`` bilan bir xil xususiyatlarga ega ixtiyoriy sondagi ``value`` "
"elementlarini o'z ichiga olishi kerak; har bir element yaratilgan tuple yoki "
"list elementiga aylanadi va yaratilgan to'plam field qiymati sifatida "
"o'rnatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:145
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:246
msgid "``eval``"
msgstr "``eval``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:138
msgid ""
"for cases where the previous methods are unsuitable, the ``eval`` attributes "
"simply evaluates whatever Python expression it is provided and sets the "
"result as the field's value."
msgstr ""
"oldingi usullar mos kelmaydigan holatlar uchun ``eval`` atributi unga "
"berilgan har qanday Python ifodasini hisoblab chiqadi va natijani field "
"qiymati sifatida o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:142
msgid ""
"The evaluation context contains various modules (``time``, ``datetime``, "
"``timedelta``, ``relativedelta``), a function to resolve :term:`external "
"identifiers` (``ref``) and the model object for the current field if "
"applicable (``obj``)"
msgstr ""
"Hisoblash context'i turli modullarni (``time``, ``datetime``, ``timedelta``, "
"``relativedelta``), :term:`external identifiers` ni aniqlaydigan funksiyani "
"(``ref``) va, agar qo'llansa, joriy field uchun model obyektini (``obj``) "
"o'z ichiga oladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:148
msgid "``delete``"
msgstr "``delete``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:150
msgid ""
"The ``delete`` tag can remove any number of records previously defined. It "
"has the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"``delete`` tegi ilgari aniqlangan ixtiyoriy sondagi record'larni o'chirishi "
"mumkin. U quyidagi atributlarga ega:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:154
msgid "the model in which a specified record should be deleted"
msgstr "ko'rsatilgan record o'chirilishi kerak bo'lgan model"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:156
msgid "the :term:`external id` of a record to remove"
msgstr "o'chirilishi kerak bo'lgan record'ning :term:`external id`si"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:158
msgid ""
"a :ref:`domain <reference/orm/domains>` to find records of the model to "
"remove"
msgstr ""
"o'chirilishi kerak bo'lgan model record'larini topish uchun :ref:`domain "
"<reference/orm/domains>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:161
msgid "``id`` and ``search`` are exclusive"
msgstr "``id`` va ``search`` o'zaro istisno qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:164
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:284
msgid "``function``"
msgstr "``function``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:166
msgid ""
"The ``function`` tag calls a method on a model, with provided parameters. It "
"has two mandatory parameters ``model`` and ``name`` specifying respectively "
"the model and the name of the method to call."
msgstr ""
"``function`` tegi model'dagi method'ni berilgan parametrlar bilan chaqiradi. "
"U ikkita majburiy parametrga ega: ``model`` va ``name`` — ular tegishlicha "
"model'ni va chaqiriladigan method nomini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:170
msgid ""
"Parameters can be provided using ``eval`` (should evaluate to a sequence of "
"parameters to call the method with) or ``value`` elements (see ``list`` "
"values)."
msgstr ""
"Parametrlar ``eval`` yordamida (method'ni chaqirish uchun parametrlar ketma-"
"ketligiga hisoblanishi kerak) yoki ``value`` elementlari orqali berilishi "
"mumkin (``list`` qiymatlariga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:200
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "Qisqa yozuvlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:202
msgid ""
"Because some important structural models of Odoo are complex and involved, "
"data files provide shorter alternatives to defining them using :ref:`record "
"tags <reference/data/record>`:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo'ning ba'zi muhim strukturaviy model'lari murakkab bo'lgani uchun, data "
"fayllar ularni :ref:`record tags <reference/data/record>` orqali aniqlashga "
"qaraganda qisqaroq muqobillarni taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:207
msgid "``menuitem``"
msgstr "``menuitem``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:209
msgid ""
"Defines an ``ir.ui.menu`` record with a number of defaults and fallbacks:"
msgstr ""
"Bir qancha standart va zaxira qiymatlar bilan ``ir.ui.menu`` record'ini "
"aniqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:220
msgid "``parent``"
msgstr "``parent``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:214
msgid ""
"If a ``parent`` attribute is set, it should be the :term:`external id` of an "
"other menu item, used as the new item's parent"
msgstr ""
"Agar ``parent`` atributi berilgan bo'lsa, u boshqa menu "
"element'ining :term:`external id`si bo'lishi kerak va yangi element'ning "
"parent'i sifatida ishlatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:216
msgid ""
"If no ``parent`` is provided, tries to interpret the ``name`` attribute as a "
"``/``-separated sequence of menu names and find a place in the menu "
"hierarchy. In that interpretation, intermediate menus are automatically "
"created"
msgstr ""
"Agar ``parent`` berilmagan bo'lsa, ``name`` atributini ``/`` bilan "
"ajratilgan menu nomlari ketma-ketligi sifatida talqin qilishga va menu "
"ierarxiyasida joy topishga harakat qiladi. Bu talqinda oraliq menular "
"avtomatik yaratiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:220
msgid ""
"Otherwise the menu is defined as a \"top-level\" menu item (*not* a menu "
"with no parent)"
msgstr ""
"Aks holda menu \"top-level\" menu element'i sifatida aniqlanadi (parent'i "
"yo'q menu *emas*)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:223
msgid ""
"If no ``name`` attribute is specified, tries to get the menu name from a "
"linked action if any. Otherwise uses the record's ``id``"
msgstr ""
"Agar ``name`` atributi ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, mavjud bo'lgan taqdirda "
"bog'langan action'dan menu nomini olishga harakat qiladi. Aks holda "
"record'ning ``id``sidan foydalanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:228
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:254
#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1291
msgid "``groups``"
msgstr "``groups``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/data.rst:226
msgid ""
