#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:25
msgid ""
"Integrating messaging features to your model is extremely easy. Simply "
"inheriting the ``mail.thread`` mixin and adding the chatter ``<chatter/>`` "
"element to your form view will get you up and running in no time. The "
"chatter element supports some options to control form behavior:"
msgstr ""
"Model'ingizga xabar almashish imkoniyatlarini qo'shish juda oson. Shunchaki "
"``mail.thread`` mixin'ini inherit qilish va form view'ingizga chatter "
"``<chatter/>`` elementini qo'shish bilan tezda ishga tushirasiz. chatter "
"elementi form xatti-harakatini boshqarish uchun bir nechta opsiyani qo'llab-"
"quvvatlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:30
msgid "``open_attachments``: Shows attachment section expanded by default"
msgstr ""
"``open_attachments``: ilovalar bo'limini sukut bo'yicha yoyilgan holda "
"ko'rsatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:31
msgid ""
"``reload_on_attachment``: Reloads form view when attachments are added/"
"removed"
msgstr ""
"``reload_on_attachment``: ilovalar qo'shilganda yoki olib tashlanganda form "
"view'ni qayta yuklaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:32
msgid "``reload_on_follower``: Reloads form view when followers are updated"
msgstr ""
"``reload_on_follower``: kuzatuvchilar yangilanganda form view'ni qayta "
"yuklaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:33
msgid "``reload_on_post``: Reloads form view when new messages are posted"
msgstr ""
"``reload_on_post``: yangi xabarlar joylanganda form view'ni qayta yuklaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:37
msgid ""
"Let's create a simplistic model representing a business trip. Since "
"organizing this kind of trip usually involves a lot of people and a lot of "
"discussion, let's add support for message exchange on the model."
msgstr ""
"Keling, xizmat safarini ifodalovchi oddiy model yaratamiz. Bunday safarni "
"tashkil qilish odatda ko'p odam va ko'p muhokamani talab qilgani uchun, "
"model'ga xabar almashish qo'llab-quvvatlashini qo'shamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:52
msgid "In the form view:"
msgstr "Form view'da:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:69
msgid ""
"Once you've added chatter support on your model, users can easily add "
"messages or internal notes on any record of your model; every one of those "
"will send a notification (to all followers for messages, to employee "
"(*base.group_user*) users for internal notes). If your mail gateway and "
"catchall address are correctly configured, these notifications will be sent "
