#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:282
msgid "First, let's define our subtype:"
msgstr "Avvalo, subtype'imizni aniqlaymiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:294
msgid ""
"Then, we need to override the ``track_subtype()`` function. This function is "
"called by the tracking system to know which subtype should be used depending "
"on the change currently being applied. In our case, we want to use our shiny "
"new subtype when the ``state`` field changes from *draft* to *confirmed*:"
msgstr ""
"So'ngra ``track_subtype()`` funksiyasini override qilishimiz kerak. Bu "
"funksiya tracking tizimi tomonidan chaqiriladi va hozirda qo'llanilayotgan "
"o'zgarishga qarab qaysi subtype ishlatilishi kerakligini aniqlaydi. Bizning "
"holatda ``state`` field'i *draft* dan *confirmed* ga o'zgarganda yangi "
"subtype'imizni ishlatmoqchimiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:324
msgid "Customizing notifications"
msgstr "Notification'larni sozlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:326
msgid ""
"When sending notifications to followers, it can be quite useful to add "
"buttons in the template to allow quick actions directly from the e-mail. "
"Even a simple button to link directly to the record's form view can be "
"useful; however in most cases you don't want to display these buttons to "
"portal users."
msgstr ""
"Follower'larga notification yuborilganda, template'ga tugmalar qo'shish juda "
"foydali bo'lishi mumkin — bu e-mail'dan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri tezkor "
"action'larni bajarish imkonini beradi. Hatto record'ning form view'iga "
"bevosita havola qiluvchi oddiy tugma ham foydali bo'ladi; ammo ko'p hollarda "
"bu tugmalarni portal foydalanuvchilariga ko'rsatishni istamaysiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:331
msgid ""
"The notification system allows customizing notification templates in the "
"following ways:"
msgstr ""
"Notification tizimi notification template'larini quyidagi yo'llar bilan "
"sozlash imkonini beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:334
msgid ""
"Display *Access Buttons*: these buttons are visible at the top of the "
"notification e-mail and allow the recipient to directly access the form view "
"of the record"
msgstr ""
"*Access Buttons* ni ko'rsatish: bu tugmalar notification e-mail'ining "
"yuqorisida ko'rinadi va qabul qiluvchiga record'ning form view'iga bevosita "
"kirish imkonini beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:336
msgid ""
"Display *Follow Buttons*: these buttons allow the recipient to directly "
"quickly subscribe from the record"
msgstr ""
"*Follow Buttons* ni ko'rsatish: bu tugmalar qabul qiluvchiga record'ga "
"bevosita va tez obuna bo'lish imkonini beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:338
msgid ""
"Display *Unfollow Buttons*: these buttons allow the recipient to directly "
"quickly unsubscribe from the record"
msgstr ""
"*Unfollow Buttons* ni ko'rsatish: bu tugmalar qabul qiluvchiga record'dan "
"bevosita va tez obunani bekor qilish imkonini beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:340
msgid ""
"Display *Custom Action Buttons*: these buttons are calls to specific routes "
"and allow you to make some useful actions directly available from the e-mail "
"(i.e. converting a lead to an opportunity, validating an expense sheet for "
"an Expense Manager, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"*Custom Action Buttons* ni ko'rsatish: bu tugmalar muayyan route'larga "
"murojaat qiladi va ba'zi foydali action'larni bevosita e-mail'dan bajarish "
"imkonini beradi (masalan, lead'ni opportunity'ga aylantirish, Expense "
"Manager uchun expense sheet'ni tasdiqlash va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:345
msgid ""
"These buttons settings can be applied to different groups that you can "
"define yourself by overriding the function ``_notify_get_groups``."
msgstr ""
"Bu tugma sozlamalari turli guruhlarga qo'llanishi mumkin — guruhlarni "
"``_notify_get_groups`` funksiyasini override qilib o'zingiz aniqlashingiz "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:353
msgid "``mail.message`` record currently being sent"
msgstr "hozirda yuborilayotgan ``mail.message`` record'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:354
msgid ""
"list of tuple of the form (group_name, group_func,group_data) where:  "
"group_name   is an identifier used only to be able to override and "
"manipulate   groups. Default groups are ``user`` (recipients linked to an "
"employee user),   ``portal`` (recipients linked to a portal user) and "
"``customer`` (recipients not   linked to any user). An example of override "
"use would be to add a group   linked to a res.groups like Hr Officers to set "
"specific action buttons to   them. group_func   is a function pointer taking "
"a partner record as parameter. This   method will be applied on recipients "
"to know whether they belong to a given   group or not. Only first matching "
"group is kept. Evaluation order is the   list order. group_data   is a dict "
"containing parameters for the notification email with the following   "
"possible keys - values:    - has_button_access       whether to display "
"Access <Document> in email. True by default for       new groups, False for "
"portal / customer.   - button_access       dict with url and title of the "
"button   - has_button_follow       whether to display Follow in email (if "
"recipient is not currently       following the thread). True by default for "
"new groups, False for       portal / customer.   - button_follow       dict "
"with url and title of the button   - has_button_unfollow       whether to "
"display Unfollow in email (if recipient is currently following the "
"thread).       True by default for new groups, False for portal / "
"customer.   - button_unfollow       dict with url and title of the button   "
"- actions       list of action buttons to display in the notification "
"email.       Each action is a dict containing url and title of the button."
msgstr ""
"(group_name, group_func, group_data) shaklidagi tuple'lar ro'yxati, bunda:  "
"group_name   faqat guruhlarni override qilish va ular bilan ishlash uchun "
"ishlatiladigan identifikator.   Sukut bo'yicha guruhlar: ``user`` (xodim "
"foydalanuvchiga bog'langan qabul qiluvchilar),   ``portal`` (portal "
"foydalanuvchiga bog'langan qabul qiluvchilar) va ``customer`` (hech qanday "
"foydalanuvchiga   bog'lanmagan qabul qiluvchilar). Override qo'llashning "
"misoli: Hr Officers kabi res.groups'ga   bog'langan guruh qo'shib, ularga "
"maxsus action tugmalarini belgilash. group_func   parameter sifatida partner "
"record'ini qabul qiluvchi funksiya ko'rsatkichi. Bu   method qabul "
"qiluvchilarga qo'llaniladi va ular berilgan guruhga tegishli ekanini "
"aniqlaydi.   Faqat birinchi mos kelgan guruh saqlanadi. Baholash tartibi "
"ro'yxat tartibi bilan bir xil. group_data   notification email uchun "
"parametrlarni o'z ichiga olgan dict, quyidagi   mumkin bo'lgan kalit - "
"qiymatlar bilan:    - has_button_access       email'da Access <Document> "
"ko'rsatilsinmi. Yangi guruhlar uchun sukut bo'yicha True,       portal / "
"customer uchun False.   - button_access       tugmaning url va title'ini o'z "
"ichiga olgan dict   - has_button_follow       email'da Follow ko'rsatilsinmi "
"(agar qabul qiluvchi hozirda thread'ni       kuzatmayotgan bo'lsa). Yangi "
"guruhlar uchun sukut bo'yicha True,       portal / customer uchun False.   - "
"button_follow       tugmaning url va title'ini o'z ichiga olgan dict   - "
"has_button_unfollow       email'da Unfollow ko'rsatilsinmi (agar qabul "
"qiluvchi hozirda thread'ni kuzatayotgan bo'lsa).       Yangi guruhlar uchun "
"sukut bo'yicha True, portal / customer uchun False.   - "
"button_unfollow       tugmaning url va title'ini o'z ichiga olgan dict   - "
"actions       notification email'da ko'rsatiladigan action tugmalari "
"ro'yxati.       Har bir action tugmaning url va title'ini o'z ichiga olgan "
"dict."

