"maqsadida ikkinchisi o'rniga birinchisini tanladim."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:473
msgid "Overriding defaults"
msgstr "Standart qiymatlarni override qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:475
msgid ""
"There are several ways you can customize the behaviour of ``mail.thread`` "
"models, including (but not limited to):"
msgstr ""
"``mail.thread`` model'larining xatti-harakatini sozlashning bir nechta usuli "
"mavjud, ular quyidagilarni o'z ichiga oladi (lekin ular bilan cheklanmaydi):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:480
msgid "``_mail_post_access`` - :class:`~odoo.models.Model`  attribute"
msgstr "``_mail_post_access`` - :class:`~odoo.models.Model`  attribute"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:479
msgid ""
"the required access rights to be able to post a message on the model; by "
"default a ``write`` access is needed, can be set to ``read`` as well"
msgstr ""
"model'da xabar joylash uchun talab qilinadigan huquqlar; standart holatda "
"``write`` huquqi kerak, shuningdek ``read`` deb ham belgilanishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:500
msgid "Context keys:"
msgstr "Context kalitlari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:483
msgid ""
"These context keys can be used to somewhat control ``mail.thread`` features "
"like auto-subscription or field tracking during calls to ``create()`` or "
"``write()`` (or any other method where it may be useful)."
msgstr ""
"Bu context kalitlari ``create()`` yoki ``write()`` (yoki foydali bo'lishi "
"mumkin bo'lgan boshqa har qanday method) chaqirilishi vaqtida "
"``mail.thread`` imkoniyatlarini, masalan avtomatik obuna yoki field "
"tracking'ini ma'lum darajada boshqarish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:487
msgid ""
"``mail_create_nosubscribe``: at create or message_post, do not subscribe the "
"current user to the record thread"
msgstr ""
"``mail_create_nosubscribe``: create yoki message_post vaqtida joriy "
"foydalanuvchini record thread'iga obuna qilmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:489
msgid ""
"``mail_create_nolog``: at create, do not log the automatic '<Document> "
"created' message"
msgstr ""
"``mail_create_nolog``: create vaqtida avtomatik '<Document> created' "
"xabarini log qilmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:491
msgid ""
"``mail_notrack``: at create and write, do not perform the value tracking "
"creating messages"
msgstr ""
"``mail_notrack``: create va write vaqtida xabarlar yaratadigan qiymat "
"tracking'ini bajarmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:493
msgid ""
"``tracking_disable``: at create and write, perform no MailThread features "
"(auto subscription, tracking, post, ...)"
msgstr ""
"``tracking_disable``: create va write vaqtida hech qanday MailThread "
"imkoniyatini bajarmaydi (avtomatik obuna, tracking, post, ...)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:495
msgid "``mail_auto_delete``: auto delete mail notifications; True by default"
msgstr ""
"``mail_auto_delete``: email bildirishnomalarini avtomatik o'chiradi; "
"standart holatda True"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:496
msgid ""
"``mail_notify_force_send``: if less than 50 email notifications to send, "
"send them directly instead of using the queue; True by default"
msgstr ""
"``mail_notify_force_send``: yuborilishi kerak bo'lgan email bildirishnomalar "
"soni 50 dan kam bo'lsa, navbatdan foydalanmasdan ularni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"yuboradi; standart holatda True"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:498
msgid ""
"``mail_notify_user_signature``: add the current user signature in email "
"notifications; True by default"
msgstr ""
"``mail_notify_user_signature``: email bildirishnomalariga joriy "
"foydalanuvchi imzosini qo'shadi; standart holatda True"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:505
msgid "Mail alias"
msgstr "Mail alias"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:507
msgid ""
"Aliases are configurable email addresses that are linked to a specific "
"record (which usually inherits the ``mail.alias.mixin`` model) that will "
"create new records when contacted via e-mail. They are an easy way to make "
"your system accessible from the outside, allowing users or customers to "
"quickly create records in your database without needing to connect to Odoo "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"Alias'lar — muayyan record'ga (u odatda ``mail.alias.mixin`` model'ini "
"inherit qiladi) bog'langan, sozlanadigan email manzillar bo'lib, email "
"orqali murojaat qilinganda yangi record'lar yaratadi. Ular tizimingizni "
"tashqaridan foydalanish uchun ochishning oson yo'li bo'lib, foydalanuvchilar "
"yoki mijozlarga Odoo'ga bevosita ulanmasdan ma'lumotlar bazangizda tez "
"record yaratish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:514
msgid "Aliases vs. Incoming Mail Gateway"
msgstr "Alias'lar va Incoming Mail Gateway"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:516
msgid ""
"Some people use the Incoming Mail Gateway for this same purpose. You still "
"need a correctly configured mail gateway to use aliases, however a single "
"catchall domain will be sufficient since all routing will be done inside "
"Odoo. Aliases have several advantages over Mail Gateways:"
msgstr ""
"Ba'zilar xuddi shu maqsadda Incoming Mail Gateway'dan foydalanadi. Alias'lar "
"ishlatish uchun ham to'g'ri sozlangan mail gateway kerak bo'ladi, biroq "
"barcha routing Odoo ichida bajarilgani uchun bitta catchall domen yetarli "
"bo'ladi. Alias'larning Mail Gateway'larga nisbatan bir qancha afzalliklari "
"bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:524
msgid "Easier to configure"
msgstr "Sozlash osonroq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:522
msgid ""
"A single incoming gateway can be used by many aliases; this avoids having to "
"configure multiple emails on your domain name (all configuration is done "
"inside Odoo)"
msgstr ""
"Bitta kiruvchi gateway'dan ko'plab alias'lar foydalanishi mumkin; bu domen "
"nomingizda bir nechta email sozlash zaruratini yo'q qiladi (barcha sozlash "
"Odoo ichida bajariladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:525
msgid "No need for System access rights to configure aliases"
msgstr "Alias'larni sozlash uchun System huquqlari talab qilinmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:526
msgid "More coherent"
msgstr "Yaxlitroq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:527
msgid "Configurable on the related record, not in a Settings submenu"
msgstr ""
"Settings ichki menyusida emas, balki bog'liq record'da to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"sozlanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:532
msgid "Easier to override server-side"
msgstr "Server tomonida override qilish osonroq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:529
msgid ""
"Mixin model is built to be extended from the start, allowing you to extract "
"useful data from incoming e-mails more easily than with a mail gateway."
msgstr ""
"Mixin model boshidanoq kengaytirish uchun qurilgan, bu esa kiruvchi "
"email'lardan foydali ma'lumotni mail gateway'ga qaraganda osonroq ajratib "
"olish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:535
msgid "Alias support integration"
msgstr "Alias qo'llab-quvvatlashini integratsiya qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:537
msgid ""
"Aliases are usually configured on a parent model which will then create "
"specific record when contacted by e-mail. For example, Project have aliases "
"to create tasks or issues, Sales Team have aliases to generate Leads."
msgstr ""
"Alias'lar odatda parent model'da sozlanadi, so'ngra email orqali murojaat "
"qilinganda muayyan record yaratadi. Masalan, Project'da task yoki issue "
"yaratish uchun alias'lar bor, Sales Team'da Lead'lar yaratish uchun "
"alias'lar bor."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:541
msgid ""
"The model that will be created by the alias **must** inherit the "
"``mail_thread`` model."
msgstr ""
"Alias tomonidan yaratiladigan model ``mail_thread`` model'ini **albatta** "
"inherit qilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:544
msgid ""
"Alias support is added by inheriting ``mail.alias.mixin``; this mixin will "
"generate a new ``mail.alias`` record for each record of the parent class "
"that gets created (for example, every ``project.project`` record having its "
"``mail.alias`` record initialized on creation)."
msgstr ""
"Alias qo'llab-quvvatlashi ``mail.alias.mixin`` inherit qilish orqali "
"qo'shiladi; bu mixin parent class'ning yaratilgan har bir record'i uchun "
"yangi ``mail.alias`` record'ini generatsiya qiladi (masalan, har bir "
"``project.project`` record'i yaratilishida uning ``mail.alias`` record'i "
"initsializatsiya qilinadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:549
msgid ""
"Aliases can also be created manually and supported by a "
"simple :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field. This guide assumes you wish a "
"more complete integration with automatic creation of the alias, record-"
"specific default values, etc."
msgstr ""
"Alias'lar qo'lda ham yaratilishi va oddiy :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` "
"field bilan qo'llab-quvvatlanishi mumkin. Bu qo'llanmada siz alias'ning "
"avtomatik yaratilishi, record'ga xos standart qiymatlar va shu kabilar bilan "
"to'liqroq integratsiyani xohlaysiz deb hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:554
msgid ""
"Unlike ``mail.thread`` inheritance, the ``mail.alias.mixin`` **requires** "
"some specific overrides to work correctly. These overrides will specify the "
"values of the created alias, like the kind of record it must create and "
"possibly some default values these records may have depending on the parent "
"object:"
msgstr ""
"``mail.thread`` inheritance'idan farqli, ``mail.alias.mixin`` to'g'ri "
"ishlashi uchun ba'zi maxsus override'larni **talab qiladi**. Bu override'lar "
"yaratilgan alias'ning qiymatlarini, masalan u qanday record yaratishi "
"kerakligini va parent object'ga qarab bu record'lar ega bo'lishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan ba'zi standart qiymatlarni belgilaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:561
msgid ""
"Return the model name for the alias. Incoming emails that are not replies to "
"existing records will cause the creation of a new record of this alias "
"model. The value may depend on ``vals``, the dict of values passed to "
"``create`` when a record of this model is created."
msgstr ""
"Alias uchun model nomini qaytaradi. Mavjud record'larga javob bo'lmagan "
"kiruvchi email'lar bu alias model'ining yangi record'i yaratilishiga olib "
"keladi. Qiymat ``vals`` ga bog'liq bo'lishi mumkin — bu model'ning record'i "
"yaratilganda ``create`` ga uzatiladigan qiymatlar dict'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:566
msgid "values of the newly created record that will holding the alias"
msgstr "alias'ni saqlab turadigan yangi yaratilgan record'ning qiymatlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:568
msgid "model name"
msgstr "model nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:573
msgid ""
"Return values to create an alias, or to write on the alias after its "
"creation. While not completely mandatory, it is usually required to make "
"sure that newly created records will be linked to the alias' parent (i.e. "
"tasks getting created in the right project) by setting a dictionary of "
"default values in the alias' ``alias_defaults`` field."
msgstr ""
"Alias yaratish yoki yaratilgandan keyin alias'ga yozish uchun qiymatlarni "
"qaytaradi. To'liq majburiy bo'lmasa-da, odatda alias'ning ``alias_defaults`` "
"field'ida standart qiymatlar dictionary'sini belgilash orqali yangi "
"yaratilgan record'lar alias'ning parent'iga bog'lanishini (ya'ni task'lar "
"to'g'ri project'da yaratilishini) ta'minlash kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:579
msgid "dictionary of values that will be written to the new alias"
msgstr "yangi alias'ga yoziladigan qiymatlar dictionary'si"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:582
msgid ""
"The ``_get_alias_values()`` override is particularly interesting as it "
"allows you to modify the behaviour of your aliases easily. Among the fields "
"that can be set on the alias, the following are of particular interest:"
msgstr ""
"``_get_alias_values()`` override'i alohida qiziqarli, chunki u "
"alias'laringiz xatti-harakatini osongina o'zgartirish imkonini beradi. "
"Alias'da belgilanishi mumkin bo'lgan field'lar orasida quyidagilari ayniqsa "
"muhim:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:587
msgid "``alias_name`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Char`"
msgstr "``alias_name`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Char`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:587
msgid ""
"name of the email alias, e.g. 'jobs' if you want to catch emails for "
"<jobs@example.odoo.com>"
msgstr ""
"email alias'ining nomi, masalan <jobs@example.odoo.com> uchun email'larni "
"qabul qilmoqchi bo'lsangiz 'jobs'"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:592
msgid "``alias_user_id`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` (``res.users``)"
msgstr "``alias_user_id`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` (``res.users``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:590
msgid ""
"owner of records created upon receiving emails on this alias; if this field "
"is not set the system will attempt to find the right owner based on the "
"sender (From) address, or will use the Administrator account if no system "
"user is found for that address"
msgstr ""
"bu alias'ga email kelganda yaratiladigan record'lar egasi; agar bu field "
"belgilanmagan bo'lsa, tizim yuboruvchi (From) manzili asosida to'g'ri egani "
"topishga harakat qiladi yoki bu manzil uchun hech qanday tizim "
"foydalanuvchisi topilmasa Administrator hisobidan foydalanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:595
msgid "``alias_defaults`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Text`"
msgstr "``alias_defaults`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Text`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:595
msgid ""
"Python dictionary that will be evaluated to provide default values when "
"creating new records for this alias"
msgstr ""
"bu alias uchun yangi record'lar yaratilganda standart qiymatlarni berish "
"uchun hisoblanadigan Python dictionary'si"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:599
msgid "``alias_force_thread_id`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Integer`"
msgstr "``alias_force_thread_id`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Integer`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:598
msgid ""
"optional ID of a thread (record) to which all incoming messages will be "
"attached, even if they did not reply to it; if set, this will disable the "
"creation of new records completely"
msgstr ""
"barcha kiruvchi xabarlar, hatto ular unga javob bo'lmasa ham, "
"biriktiriladigan thread'ning (record'ning) majburiy bo'lmagan ID'si; agar "
"belgilangan bo'lsa, bu yangi record'lar yaratilishini to'liq o'chiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:606
msgid "``alias_contact`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Selection`"
msgstr "``alias_contact`` - :class:`~odoo.fields.Selection`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:602
msgid "Policy to post a message on the document using the mailgateway"
msgstr "mailgateway yordamida document'ga message joylash siyosati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:604
msgid "*everyone*: everyone can post"
msgstr "*everyone*: hamma joylashi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:605
msgid "*partners*: only authenticated partners"
msgstr "*partners*: faqat autentifikatsiya qilingan partner'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:606
msgid ""
"*followers*: only followers of the related document or members of following "
"channels"
msgstr ""
"*followers*: faqat tegishli document'ning follower'lari yoki kuzatilayotgan "
"channel'lar a'zolari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:608
msgid ""
"Note that aliases make use of :ref:`delegation inheritance <reference/orm/"
"inheritance>`, which means that while the alias is stored in another table, "
"you have access to all these fields directly from your parent object. This "
"allows you to make your alias easily configurable from the record's form "
"view."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, alias'lar :ref:`delegation inheritance <reference/orm/"
"inheritance>`dan foydalanadi, ya'ni alias boshqa jadvalda saqlansa ham, siz "
"bu field'larning barchasiga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri parent object'ingizdan kira "
"olasiz. Bu alias'ni record'ning form view'idan osongina sozlash imkonini "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:615
msgid ""
"Let's add aliases on our business trip class to create expenses on the fly "
"via e-mail."
msgstr ""
"E-mail orqali tezkor tarzda expense'lar yaratish uchun business trip "
"class'imizga alias'lar qo'shamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:663
msgid ""
"We would like our alias to be easily configurable from the form view of our "
"business trips, so let's add the following to our form view:"
msgstr ""
"Alias'imiz business trip'larimizning form view'idan osongina sozlanishini "
"xohlaymiz, shuning uchun form view'imizga quyidagini qo'shamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:688
msgid ""
"Now we can change the alias address directly from the form view and change "
"who can send e-mails to the alias."
msgstr ""
"Endi alias manzilini to'g'ridan-to'g'ri form view'dan o'zgartirishimiz va "
"alias'ga kim e-mail yuborishi mumkinligini belgilashimiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:691
msgid ""
"We can then override ``message_new()`` on our expense model to fetch the "
"values from our email when the expense will be created:"
msgstr ""
"So'ngra expense yaratilganda email'imizdan qiymatlarni olish uchun expense "
"model'imizda ``message_new()`` ni override qilishimiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:728
msgid "Activities tracking"
msgstr "Activity'larni kuzatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:730
msgid ""
"Activities are actions users have to take on a document like making a phone "
"call or organizing a meeting. Activities come with the mail module as they "
"are integrated in the Chatter but are *not bundled with mail.thread*. "
"Activities are records of the ``mail.activity`` class, which have a type "
"(``mail.activity.type``), name, description, scheduled time (among others). "
"Pending activities are visible above the message history in the chatter "
"widget."
msgstr ""
"Activity'lar — foydalanuvchilar document bo'yicha bajarishi kerak bo'lgan "
"harakatlar, masalan telefon qilish yoki uchrashuv tashkil etish. "
"Activity'lar mail module bilan keladi, chunki ular Chatter'ga integratsiya "
"qilingan, biroq *mail.thread bilan birga kelmaydi*. Activity'lar "
"``mail.activity`` class'ining record'lari bo'lib, ularda type "
"(``mail.activity.type``), name, description, rejalashtirilgan vaqt va "
"boshqalar mavjud. Kutilayotgan activity'lar chatter widget'ida message "
"tarixidan yuqorida ko'rinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:737
msgid ""
"You can integrate activities using the ``mail.activity.mixin`` class on your "
"object and the specific widgets to display them (via the field "
"``activity_ids``) in the form view and kanban view of your records "
"(``mail_activity`` and ``kanban_activity`` widgets, respectively)."
msgstr ""
"Activity'larni object'ingizda ``mail.activity.mixin`` class'i va ularni "
"record'laringizning form view hamda kanban view'ida (``activity_ids`` field "
"orqali) ko'rsatuvchi maxsus widget'lar (tegishlicha ``mail_activity`` va "
"``kanban_activity`` widget'lari) yordamida integratsiya qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:744
msgid ""
"Organizing a business trip is a tedious process and tracking needed "
"activities like ordering plane tickets or a cab for the airport could be "
"useful. To do so, we will add the activities mixin on our model and display "
"the next planned activities in the message history of our trip."
msgstr ""
"Business trip tashkil etish mashaqqatli jarayon bo'lib, samolyot "
"chiptalarini buyurtma qilish yoki aeroportga taksi chaqirish kabi kerakli "
"activity'larni kuzatish foydali bo'lishi mumkin. Buning uchun model'imizga "
"activities mixin'ini qo'shamiz va safarimizning message tarixida keyingi "
"rejalashtirilgan activity'larni ko'rsatamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:759
msgid "We modify the form view of our trips to display their next activities:"
msgstr ""
"Safarlarimizning keyingi activity'larini ko'rsatish uchun ularning form "
"view'ini o'zgartiramiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:778
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:854
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1073
msgid "You can find concrete examples of integration in the following models:"
msgstr ""
"Integratsiyaning aniq misollarini quyidagi model'larda topishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:780
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:856
msgid "``crm.lead`` in the CRM (*crm*) Application"
msgstr "``crm.lead`` — CRM (*crm*) ilovasida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:781
msgid "``sale.order`` in the Sales (*sale*) Application"
msgstr "``sale.order`` — Sales (*sale*) ilovasida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:782
msgid "``project.task`` in the Project (*project*) Application"
msgstr "``project.task`` — Project (*project*) ilovasida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:788
msgid "Website features"
msgstr "Website imkoniyatlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:793
msgid "Visitor tracking"
msgstr "Tashrifchilarni kuzatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:795
msgid ""
"The ``utm.mixin`` class can be used to track online marketing/communication "
"campaigns through arguments in links to specified resources. The mixin adds "
"3 fields to your model:"
msgstr ""
"``utm.mixin`` class'i belgilangan resurslarga havolalardagi argumentlar "
"orqali onlayn marketing/kommunikatsiya kampaniyalarini kuzatish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Mixin model'ingizga 3 ta field qo'shadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:799
msgid ""
"``campaign_id``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field to a ``utm.campaign`` "
"object (i.e. Christmas_Special, Fall_Collection, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"``campaign_id``: ``utm.campaign`` object'iga "
"yo'naltirilgan :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field (masalan "
"Christmas_Special, Fall_Collection va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:801
msgid ""
"``source_id``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field to a ``utm.source`` "
"object (i.e. Search Engine, mailing list, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"``source_id``: ``utm.source`` object'iga "
"yo'naltirilgan :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field (masalan Search Engine, "
"mailing list va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:803
msgid ""
"``medium_id``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field to a ``utm.medium`` "
"object (i.e. Snail Mail, e-Mail, social network update, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"``medium_id``: ``utm.medium`` object'iga "
"yo'naltirilgan :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field (masalan Snail Mail, e-"
"Mail, ijtimoiy tarmoq yangilanishi va h.k.)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:806
msgid ""
"These models have a single field ``name`` (i.e. they are simply there to "
"distinguish campaigns but don't have any specific behaviour)."
msgstr ""
"Bu model'larda faqat bitta ``name`` field mavjud (ya'ni ular shunchaki "
"kampaniyalarni farqlash uchun kerak va hech qanday maxsus xatti-harakatga "
"ega emas)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:809
msgid ""
"Once a customer visits your website with these parameters set in the url "
"(i.e. https://www.odoo.com/?"
"campaign_id=mixin_talk&source_id=www.odoo.com&medium_id=website), three "
"cookies are set in the visitor's website for these parameters. Once a object "
"that inherits the utm.mixin is created from the website (i.e. lead form, job "
"application, etc.), the utm.mixin code kicks in and fetches the values from "
"the cookies to set them in the new record. Once this is done, you can then "
"use the campaign/source/medium fields as any other field when defining "
"reports and views (group by, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Mijoz sizning website'ingizga url'da ushbu parametrlar o'rnatilgan holda "
"kirganda (masalan https://www.odoo.com/?"
"campaign_id=mixin_talk&source_id=www.odoo.com&medium_id=website), "
"tashrifchining website'ida bu parametrlar uchun uchta cookie o'rnatiladi. "
"utm.mixin'dan meros olgan object website'dan yaratilgach (masalan lead "
"formasi, ishga ariza va h.k.), utm.mixin kodi ishga tushadi va yangi "
"record'da o'rnatish uchun cookie'lardan qiymatlarni oladi. Shundan so'ng siz "
"report va view'larni aniqlashda campaign/source/medium field'laridan boshqa "
"har qanday field kabi foydalanishingiz mumkin (group by va h.k.)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:818
msgid ""
"To extend this behaviour, simply add a relational field to a simple model "
"(the model should support the *quick create* (i.e. call to ``create()`` with "
"a single ``name`` value) and extend the function ``tracking_fields()``:"
msgstr ""
"Bu xatti-harakatni kengaytirish uchun oddiy model'ga relational field "
"qo'shing (model *quick create*ni qo'llab-quvvatlashi kerak (ya'ni bitta "
"``name`` qiymati bilan ``create()`` chaqirilishi) va ``tracking_fields()`` "
"funksiyasini kengaytiring:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:847
msgid ""
"This will tell the system to create a cookie named *odoo_utm_my_field* with "
"the value found in the url parameter ``my_field``; once a new record of this "
"model is created by a call from a website form, the generic override of the "
"``create()`` method of ``utm.mixin`` will fetch the default values for this "
"field from the cookie (and the ``my_module.my_track`` record will be "
"creatwed on the fly if it does not exist yet)."
msgstr ""
"Bu tizimga url parametri ``my_field``da topilgan qiymat bilan "
"*odoo_utm_my_field* nomli cookie yaratishni buyuradi; website formasidan "
"chaqiruv orqali bu model'ning yangi record'i yaratilganda, ``utm.mixin`` "
"ning ``create()`` method'i uchun umumiy override bu field'ning standart "
"qiymatlarini cookie'dan oladi (va agar ``my_module.my_track`` record hali "
"mavjud bo'lmasa, u tezkor tarzda yaratiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:857
msgid ""
"``hr.applicant`` in the Recruitment Process (*hr_recruitment*) Application"
msgstr "``hr.applicant`` — Recruitment Process (*hr_recruitment*) ilovasida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:858
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1076
msgid ""
"``helpdesk.ticket`` in the Helpdesk (*helpdesk* - Odoo Enterprise only) "
"Application"
msgstr ""
"``helpdesk.ticket`` — Helpdesk (*helpdesk* - faqat Odoo Enterprise) ilovasida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:863
msgid "Website visibility"
msgstr "Website'da ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:865
msgid ""
"You can quite easily add a website visibility toggle on any of your record. "
"While this mixin is quite easy to implement manually, it is the most often-"
"used after the ``mail.thread`` inheritance; a testament to its usefulness. "
"The typical use case for this mixin is any object that has a frontend-page; "
"being able to control the visibility of the page allows you to take your "
"time while editing the page and only publish it when you're satisfied."
msgstr ""
"Har qanday record'ingizga website'da ko'rinishini boshqaruvchi tugmani juda "
"oson qo'shishingiz mumkin. Bu mixin'ni qo'lda amalga oshirish ancha oson "
"bo'lsa-da, u ``mail.thread`` merosidan keyin eng ko'p ishlatiladigan mixin — "
"bu uning foydaliligidan dalolat. Bu mixin uchun tipik qo'llanish holati — "
"frontend sahifasi bo'lgan har qanday object; sahifaning ko'rinishini "
"boshqarish sahifani tahrirlashda shoshilmaslik va faqat natijadan "
"qoniqqaningizda uni nashr qilish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:872
msgid ""
"To include the functionality, you only need to inherit "
"``website.published.mixin``:"
msgstr ""
"Bu funksionallikni qo'shish uchun faqat ``website.published.mixin``dan meros "
"olishingiz kifoya:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:881
msgid "This mixin adds 2 fields on your model:"
msgstr "Bu mixin model'ingizga 2 ta field qo'shadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:883
msgid ""
"``website_published``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Boolean` field which represents "
"the status of the publication"
msgstr ""
"``website_published``: nashr holatini "
"ifodalovchi :class:`~odoo.fields.Boolean` field"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:885
msgid ""
"``website_url``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field which represents the URL "
"through which the object is accessed"
msgstr ""
"``website_url``: object'ga kirish uchun ishlatiladigan URL manzilni "
"ifodalovchi :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:888
msgid ""
"Note that this last field is a computed field and must be implemented for "
"your class:"
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bu oxirgi field computed field bo'lib, uni class'ingiz uchun "
"amalga oshirishingiz shart:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:896
msgid ""
"Once the mechanism is in place, you just have to adapt your frontend and "
"backend views to make it accessible. In the backend, adding a button in the "
"button box is usually the way to go:"
msgstr ""
"Mexanizm joyiga qo'yilgach, uni foydalanishga ochish uchun frontend va "
"backend view'laringizni moslashtirishingiz kifoya. Backend'da odatda button "
"box'ga button qo'shish eng qulay yo'l hisoblanadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:907
msgid ""
"In the frontend, some security checks are needed to avoid showing 'Editing' "
"buttons to website visitors:"
msgstr ""
"Frontend'da website tashrifchilariga 'Editing' button'lari ko'rinmasligi "
"uchun ba'zi xavfsizlik tekshiruvlari kerak bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:921
msgid ""
"Note that you must pass your object as the variable ``object`` to the "
"template; in this example, the ``blog.post`` record was passed as the "
"``blog_post`` variable to the ``qweb`` rendering engine, it is necessary to "
"specify this to the publish management template. The ``publish_edit`` "
"variable allow the frontend button to link to the backend (allowing you to "
"switch from frontend to backend and vice-versa easily); if set, you must "
"specify the full external id of the action you want to call in the backend "
"in the ``action`` variable (note that a Form View must exist for the model)."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, object'ingizni template'ga ``object`` o'zgaruvchisi sifatida "
"uzatishingiz shart; bu misolda ``blog.post`` record'i ``qweb`` rendering "
"engine'iga ``blog_post`` o'zgaruvchisi sifatida uzatilgan, buni publish "
"management template'iga ko'rsatish zarur. ``publish_edit`` o'zgaruvchisi "
"frontend button'ining backend'ga havola qilishiga imkon beradi (bu "
"frontend'dan backend'ga va aksincha osongina o'tish imkonini beradi); agar u "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, backend'da chaqirmoqchi bo'lgan action'ning to'liq "
"external id'sini ``action`` o'zgaruvchisida ko'rsatishingiz shart (e'tibor "
"bering, model uchun Form View mavjud bo'lishi kerak)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:930
msgid ""
"The action ``website_publish_button`` is defined in the mixin and adapts its "
"behaviour to your object: if the class has a valid ``website_url`` compute "
"function, the user is redirected to the frontend when he clicks on the "
"button; the user can then publish the page directly from the frontend. This "
"ensures that no online publication can happen by accident. If there is not "
"compute function, the boolean ``website_published`` is simply triggered."
msgstr ""
"``website_publish_button`` action'i mixin'da aniqlangan va o'z xatti-"
"harakatini object'ingizga moslashtiradi: agar class'da yaroqli "
"``website_url`` compute funksiyasi bo'lsa, foydalanuvchi button'ni bosganda "
"frontend'ga yo'naltiriladi; so'ngra foydalanuvchi sahifani to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri frontend'dan nashr qilishi mumkin. Bu tasodifan onlayn nashr "
"qilinishining oldini oladi. Agar compute funksiyasi bo'lmasa, "
"``website_published`` boolean shunchaki o'zgartiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:940
msgid "Website metadata"
msgstr "Website metadata'si"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:942
msgid ""
"This simple mixin simply allows you to easily inject metadata in your "
"frontend pages."
msgstr ""
"Bu oddiy mixin frontend sahifalaringizga metadata'ni osongina joylash "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:952
msgid "This mixin adds 3 fields on your model:"
msgstr "Bu mixin model'ingizga 3 ta field qo'shadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:954
msgid ""
"``website_meta_title``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field that allow you to "
"set an additional title to your page"
msgstr ""
"``website_meta_title``: sahifangizga qo'shimcha sarlavha belgilash imkonini "
"beruvchi :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:956
msgid ""
"``website_meta_description``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field that contains "
"a short description of the page (sometimes used in search engines results)"
msgstr ""
"``website_meta_description``: sahifaning qisqa tavsifini o'z ichiga "
"oluvchi :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field (ba'zan qidiruv tizimlari "
"natijalarida ishlatiladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:958
msgid ""
"``website_meta_keywords``: :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field that contains "
"some keywords to help your page to be classified more precisely by search "
"engines; the \"Promote\" tool will help you select lexically-related "
"keywords easily"
msgstr ""
"``website_meta_keywords``: sahifangiz qidiruv tizimlari tomonidan aniqroq "
"tasniflanishiga yordam beruvchi kalit so'zlarni o'z ichiga "
"oluvchi :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field; \"Promote\" vositasi leksik "
"jihatdan bog'liq kalit so'zlarni osongina tanlashga yordam beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:962
msgid ""
"These fields are editable in the frontend using the \"Promote\" tool from "
"the Editor toolbar. Setting these fields can help search engines to better "
"index your pages. Note that search engines do not base their results only on "
"these metadata; the best SEO practice should still be to get referenced by "
"reliable sources."
msgstr ""
"Bu field'lar frontend'da Editor toolbar'idagi \"Promote\" vositasi yordamida "
"tahrirlanadi. Ushbu field'larni to'ldirish qidiruv tizimlariga "
"sahifalaringizni yaxshiroq indekslashga yordam beradi. E'tibor bering, "
"qidiruv tizimlari natijalarini faqat bu metadata'ga asoslamaydi; eng yaxshi "
"SEO amaliyoti hamon ishonchli manbalar tomonidan havola qilinishdir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:970
msgid "Others"
msgstr "Boshqalar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:975
msgid "Customer Rating"
msgstr "Mijoz reytingi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:977
msgid ""
"The rating mixin allows sending email to ask for customer rating, automatic "
"transitioning in a kanban processes and aggregating statistics on your "
"ratings."
msgstr ""
"Rating mixin mijozdan reyting so'rash uchun email yuborish, kanban "
"jarayonlarida avtomatik o'tish va reytinglaringiz bo'yicha statistikani "
"jamlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:981
msgid "Adding rating on your model"
msgstr "Model'ingizga rating qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:983
msgid "To add rating support, simply inherit the ``rating.mixin`` model:"
msgstr ""
"Rating qo'llab-quvvatlashini qo'shish uchun ``rating.mixin`` model'idan "
"meros oling:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:994
msgid "The behaviour of the mixin adapts to your model:"
msgstr "Mixin'ning xatti-harakati model'ingizga moslashadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:996
msgid ""
"The ``rating.rating`` record will be linked to the ``partner_id`` field of "
"your model (if the field is present)."
msgstr ""
"``rating.rating`` record'i model'ingizning ``partner_id`` field'iga "
"bog'lanadi (agar bu field mavjud bo'lsa)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:999
msgid ""
"this behaviour can be overridden with the function "
"``rating_get_partner_id()`` if you use another field than ``partner_id``"
msgstr ""
"agar ``partner_id``dan boshqa field ishlatsangiz, bu xatti-harakatni "
"``rating_get_partner_id()`` funksiyasi bilan override qilish mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1002
msgid ""
"The ``rating.rating`` record will be linked to the partner of the "
"``user_id`` field of your model (if the field is present) (i.e. the partner "
"who is rated)"
msgstr ""
"``rating.rating`` record'i model'ingizning ``user_id`` field'idagi "
"partner'ga bog'lanadi (agar bu field mavjud bo'lsa) (ya'ni reyting "
"beriladigan partner)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1005
msgid ""
"this behaviour can be overridden with the function "
"``rating_get_rated_partner_id()`` if you use another field than ``user_id`` "
"(note that the function must return a ``res.partner``, for ``user_id`` the "
"system automatically fetches the partner of the user)"
msgstr ""
"agar ``user_id``dan boshqa field ishlatsangiz, bu xatti-harakatni "
"``rating_get_rated_partner_id()`` funksiyasi bilan override qilish mumkin "
"(e'tibor bering, funksiya ``res.partner`` qaytarishi shart, ``user_id`` "
"uchun tizim foydalanuvchining partner'ini avtomatik oladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1010
msgid ""
"The chatter history will display the rating event (if your model inherits "
"from ``mail.thread``)"
msgstr ""
"Chatter tarixi rating event'ini ko'rsatadi (agar model'ingiz "
"``mail.thread``dan meros olsa)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1014
msgid "Send rating requests by e-mail"
msgstr "Rating so'rovlarini e-mail orqali yuborish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1016
msgid ""
"If you wish to send emails to request a rating, simply generate an e-mail "
"with links to the rating object. A very basic email template could look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Agar rating so'rash uchun email yubormoqchi bo'lsangiz, rating object'iga "
"havolalar bilan e-mail yaratishning o'zi kifoya. Eng oddiy email template "
"quyidagicha ko'rinishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1040
msgid ""
"Your customer will then receive an e-mail with links to a simple webpage "
"allowing them to provide a feedback on their interaction with your users "
"(including a free-text feedback message)."
msgstr ""
"Shundan so'ng mijozingiz oddiy veb-sahifaga havolalar bilan e-mail oladi va "
"u sizning foydalanuvchilaringiz bilan bo'lgan muloqoti haqida fikr "
"qoldirishi mumkin (erkin matnli izoh xabari ham kiradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1044
msgid ""
"You can then quite easily integrate your ratings with your form view by "
"defining an action for the ratings:"
msgstr ""
"Keyin rating'lar uchun action aniqlab, ularni form view'ingizga ancha oson "
"integratsiya qilishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1070
msgid ""
"Note that there are default views (kanban,pivot,graph) for ratings which "
"allow you a quick bird's eye view of your customer ratings."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, rating'lar uchun standart view'lar (kanban,pivot,graph) "
"mavjud bo'lib, ular mijozlaringiz rating'lariga umumiy nazar tashlash "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/mixins.rst:1075
msgid "``project.task`` in the Project (*rating_project*) Application"
msgstr "Project (*rating_project*) ilovasidagi ``project.task``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:4
msgid "Module Manifests"
msgstr "Module manifest'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:11
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:65
msgid "Manifest"
msgstr "Manifest"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:13
msgid ""
"The manifest file serves to declare a python package as an Odoo module and "
"to specify module metadata."
msgstr ""
"Manifest fayli python package'ni Odoo module'i sifatida e'lon qilish va "
"module metadata'sini ko'rsatish uchun xizmat qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:16
msgid ""
"It is a file called ``__manifest__.py`` and contains a single Python "
"dictionary, where each key specifies module metadatum."
msgstr ""
"Bu ``__manifest__.py`` deb nomlangan fayl bo'lib, u bitta Python dictionary "
"saqlaydi, unda har bir key module metadatum'ini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:40
msgid "Available manifest fields are:"
msgstr "Mavjud manifest field'lari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:42
msgid "``name`` (``str``, required)"
msgstr "``name`` (``str``, majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:43
msgid "the human-readable name of the module"
msgstr "module'ning inson o'qiy oladigan nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:44
msgid "``version`` (``str``)"
msgstr "``version`` (``str``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:45
msgid "this module's version, should follow `semantic versioning`_ rules"
msgstr ""
"ushbu module'ning versiyasi, `semantic versioning`_ qoidalariga amal qilishi "
"kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:46
msgid "``description`` (``str``)"
msgstr "``description`` (``str``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:47
msgid "extended description for the module, in reStructuredText"
msgstr "module uchun kengaytirilgan tavsif, reStructuredText formatida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:48
msgid "``author`` (``str``)"
msgstr "``author`` (``str``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:49
msgid "name of the module author"
msgstr "module muallifining nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:50
msgid "``website`` (``str``)"
msgstr "``website`` (``str``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:51
msgid "website URL for the module author"
msgstr "module muallifining veb-sayt URL manzili"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:65
msgid "``license`` (``str``, defaults: ``LGPL-3``)"
msgstr "``license`` (``str``, standart: ``LGPL-3``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:53
msgid "distribution license for the module. Possible values:"
msgstr "module uchun tarqatish litsenziyasi. Mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:56
msgid "`GPL-2`"
msgstr "`GPL-2`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:57
msgid "`GPL-2 or any later version`"
msgstr "`GPL-2 or any later version`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:58
msgid "`GPL-3`"
msgstr "`GPL-3`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:59
msgid "`GPL-3 or any later version`"
msgstr "`GPL-3 or any later version`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:60
msgid "`AGPL-3`"
msgstr "`AGPL-3`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:61
msgid "`LGPL-3`"
msgstr "`LGPL-3`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:62
msgid "`Other OSI approved licence`"
msgstr "`Other OSI approved licence`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:63
msgid "`OEEL-1` (Odoo Enterprise Edition License v1.0)"
msgstr "`OEEL-1` (Odoo Enterprise Edition License v1.0)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:64
msgid "`OPL-1` (Odoo Proprietary License v1.0)"
msgstr "`OPL-1` (Odoo Proprietary License v1.0)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:65
msgid "`Other proprietary`"
msgstr "`Other proprietary`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:73
msgid "``category`` (``str``, default: ``Uncategorized``)"
msgstr "``category`` (``str``, standart: ``Uncategorized``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:68
msgid ""
"classification category within Odoo, rough business domain for the module."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ichidagi klassifikatsiya kategoriyasi, module uchun taxminiy biznes "
"sohasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:70
msgid ""
"Although using `existing categories`_ is recommended, the field is freeform "
"and unknown categories are created on-the-fly. Category hierarchies can be "
"created using the separator ``/`` e.g. ``Foo / Bar`` will create a category "
"``Foo``, a category ``Bar`` as child category of ``Foo``, and will set "
"``Bar`` as the module's category."
msgstr ""
"`existing categories`_ dan foydalanish tavsiya etilsa-da, bu field erkin "
"shaklda bo'lib, noma'lum kategoriyalar shu zahoti yaratiladi. Kategoriya "
"iyerarxiyasini ``/`` ajratuvchisi bilan yaratish mumkin, masalan ``Foo / "
"Bar`` ``Foo`` kategoriyasini, ``Foo``ning child kategoriyasi sifatida "
"``Bar`` kategoriyasini yaratadi va ``Bar``ni module kategoriyasi qilib "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:81
msgid "``depends`` (``list(str)``)"
msgstr "``depends`` (``list(str)``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:76
msgid ""
"Odoo modules which must be loaded before this one, either because this "
"module uses features they create or because it alters resources they define."
msgstr ""
"Bundan oldin yuklanishi shart bo'lgan Odoo module'lari — chunki ushbu module "
"ular yaratgan imkoniyatlardan foydalanadi yoki ular aniqlagan resurslarni "
"o'zgartiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:80
msgid ""
"When a module is installed, all of its dependencies are installed before it. "
"Likewise dependencies are loaded before a module is loaded."
msgstr ""
"Module o'rnatilganda, uning barcha dependency'lari undan oldin o'rnatiladi. "
"Xuddi shunday, dependency'lar module yuklanishidan oldin yuklanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:84
msgid ""
"Module `base` is always installed in any Odoo instance. But you still need "
"to specify it as dependency to make sure your module is updated when `base` "
"is updated."
msgstr ""
"`base` module'i har qanday Odoo instance'ida doimo o'rnatilgan bo'ladi. "
"Shunga qaramay, `base` yangilanganda module'ingiz ham yangilanishini "
"kafolatlash uchun uni dependency sifatida ko'rsatishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:88
msgid "``data`` (``list(str)``)"
msgstr "``data`` (``list(str)``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:88
msgid ""
"List of data files which must always be installed or updated with the "
"module. A list of paths from the module root directory"
msgstr ""
"Module bilan birga doimo o'rnatilishi yoki yangilanishi shart bo'lgan data "
"fayllar ro'yxati. Module ildiz papkasidan boshlangan yo'llar ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:91
msgid "``demo`` (``list(str)``)"
msgstr "``demo`` (``list(str)``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:91
msgid ""
"List of data files which are only installed or updated in *demonstration "
"mode*"
msgstr ""
"Faqat *demonstration mode* da o'rnatiladigan yoki yangilanadigan data "
"fayllar ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:109
msgid "``auto_install`` (``bool`` or ``list(str)``, default: ``False``)"
msgstr "``auto_install`` (``bool`` yoki ``list(str)``, standart: ``False``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:94
msgid ""
"If ``True``, this module will automatically be installed if all of its "
"dependencies are installed."
msgstr ""
"Agar ``True`` bo'lsa, barcha dependency'lari o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, ushbu "
"module avtomatik ravishda o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:97
msgid ""
"It is generally used for \"link modules\" implementing synergetic "
"integration between two otherwise independent modules."
msgstr ""
"U odatda mustaqil bo'lgan ikki module o'rtasida sinergetik integratsiyani "
"amalga oshiruvchi \"link modules\" uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:100
msgid ""
"For instance ``sale_crm`` depends on both ``sale`` and ``crm`` and is set to "
"``auto_install``. When both ``sale`` and ``crm`` are installed, it "
"automatically adds CRM campaigns tracking to sale orders without either "
"``sale`` or ``crm`` being aware of one another."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, ``sale_crm`` ham ``sale``, ham ``crm``ga bog'liq va "
"``auto_install`` qilib belgilangan. ``sale`` va ``crm`` ikkalasi "
"o'rnatilganda, u ``sale`` yoki ``crm`` bir-biridan xabardor bo'lmagan holda "
"sale order'larga CRM kampaniyalarini kuzatishni avtomatik qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:105
msgid ""
"If it is a list, it must contain a subset of the dependencies. This module "
"will automatically be installed as soon as all the dependencies in the "
"subset are installed. The remaining dependencies will be automatically "
"installed as well. If the list is empty, this module will always be "
"automatically installed regardless of its dependencies and these will be "
"installed as well."
msgstr ""
"Agar u list bo'lsa, unda dependency'larning bir qismi bo'lishi kerak. Ushbu "
"module bu qismdagi barcha dependency'lar o'rnatilishi bilanoq avtomatik "
"o'rnatiladi. Qolgan dependency'lar ham avtomatik o'rnatiladi. Agar list "
"bo'sh bo'lsa, ushbu module dependency'laridan qat'i nazar doimo avtomatik "
"o'rnatiladi va ular ham o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:122
msgid "``external_dependencies`` (``dict(key=list(str))``)"
msgstr "``external_dependencies`` (``dict(key=list(str))``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:112
msgid "A dictionary containing python and/or binary dependencies."
msgstr "python va/yoki binary dependency'larni saqlovchi dictionary."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:114
msgid ""
"For python dependencies, the ``python`` key must be defined for this "
"dictionary and a list of python modules to be imported should be assigned to "
"it."
msgstr ""
"python dependency'lari uchun bu dictionary'da ``python`` key aniqlangan "
"bo'lishi va unga import qilinadigan python module'lari ro'yxati "
"biriktirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:118
msgid ""
"For binary dependencies, the ``bin`` key must be defined for this dictionary "
"and a list of binary executable names should be assigned to it."
msgstr ""
"binary dependency'lar uchun bu dictionary'da ``bin`` key aniqlangan bo'lishi "
"va unga binary bajariluvchi fayl nomlari ro'yxati biriktirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:121
msgid ""
"The module won't be installed if either the python module is not installed "
"in the host machine or the binary executable is not found within the host "
"machine's PATH environment variable."
msgstr ""
"Agar python module host mashinada o'rnatilmagan bo'lsa yoki binary "
"bajariluvchi fayl host mashinaning PATH environment variable'ida topilmasa, "
"module o'rnatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:126
msgid "``application`` (``bool``, default: ``False``)"
msgstr "``application`` (``bool``, standart: ``False``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:125
msgid ""
"Whether the module should be considered as a fully-fledged application "
"(``True``) or is just a technical module (``False``) that provides some "
"extra functionality to an existing application module."
msgstr ""
"Module to'laqonli ilova sifatida qaralishi (``True``) yoki mavjud ilova "
"module'iga qo'shimcha funksionallik beruvchi oddiy texnik module (``False``) "
"bo'lishini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:130
msgid "``assets`` (``dict``)"
msgstr "``assets`` (``dict``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:129
msgid ""
"A definition of how all static files are loaded in various assets bundles. "
"See the :ref:`assets <reference/assets>` page for more details on how to "
"describe bundles."
msgstr ""
"Barcha statik fayllar turli asset bundle'larida qanday yuklanishini "
"belgilash. Bundle'larni tavsiflash haqida batafsil ma'lumot "
"uchun :ref:`assets <reference/assets>` sahifasiga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:132
msgid "``installable`` (``bool`` default: ``True``)"
msgstr "``installable`` (``bool`` standart: ``True``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:133
msgid ""
"Whether a user should be able to install the module from the Web UI or not."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi module'ni Web UI'dan o'rnatishi mumkinligini yoki yo'qligini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:135
msgid "``maintainer`` (``str``)"
msgstr "``maintainer`` (``str``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/module.rst:135
msgid ""
"Person or entity in charge of the maintenance of this module, by default it "
"is assumed that the author is the maintainer."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu module'ni qo'llab-quvvatlash uchun mas'ul shaxs yoki tashkilot; sukut "
