#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:184
msgid "Date fields can **only** be compared to date objects."
msgstr "Date field'lari **faqat** date obyektlari bilan taqqoslanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:185
msgid "Datetime fields can **only** be compared to datetime objects."
msgstr ""
"Datetime field'lari **faqat** datetime obyektlari bilan taqqoslanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:187
msgid ""
"Strings representing dates and datetimes can be compared between each other, "
"however the result may not be the expected result, as a datetime string will "
"always be greater than a date string, therefore this practice is **heavily** "
"discouraged."
msgstr ""
"Date va datetime'ni ifodalovchi satrlarni bir-biri bilan taqqoslash mumkin, "
