"tavsiya etilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:193
msgid ""
"Common operations with dates and datetimes such as addition, subtraction or "
"fetching the start/end of a period are exposed through "
"both :class:`~odoo.fields.Date` and :class:`~odoo.fields.Datetime`. These "
"helpers are also available by importing `odoo.tools.date_utils`."
msgstr ""
"Date va datetime bilan bajariladigan keng tarqalgan amallar — qo'shish, "
"ayirish yoki davrning boshi/oxirini olish — ham :class:`~odoo.fields.Date`, "
"ham :class:`~odoo.fields.Datetime` orqali taqdim etilgan. Bu yordamchilar "
"`odoo.tools.date_utils` ni import qilish orqali ham mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:198
msgid "Timezones"
msgstr "Vaqt zonalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:200
msgid ""
"Datetime fields are stored as `timestamp without timezone` columns in the "
"database and are stored in the UTC timezone. This is by design, as it makes "
"the Odoo database independent from the timezone of the hosting server "
"system. Timezone conversion is managed entirely by the client side."
msgstr ""
"Datetime field'lari ma'lumotlar bazasida `timestamp without timezone` "
"ustunlari sifatida va UTC vaqt zonasida saqlanadi. Bu ataylab shunday "
"qilingan, chunki u Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasini hosting server tizimining vaqt "
"zonasidan mustaqil qiladi. Vaqt zonasini o'girish to'liq client tomonida "
"boshqariladi."

