"computed field, use the ``inverse`` parameter. It is the name of a function "
"reversing the computation and setting the relevant fields::"
msgstr ""
"computed field'lar sukut bo'yicha faqat o'qish uchun. computed field'ga "
"qiymat *o'rnatish*ga ruxsat berish uchun ``inverse`` parametridan "
