#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:595
msgid "Record cache and prefetching"
msgstr "Record cache va prefetching"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:597
msgid ""
"Odoo maintains a cache for the fields of the records, so that not every "
"field access issues a database request, which would be terrible for "
"performance. The following example queries the database only for the first "
"statement::"
msgstr ""
"Odoo record field'lari uchun cache saqlaydi, shuning uchun har bir field'ga "
"murojaat ma'lumotlar bazasiga so'rov yubormaydi — bu unumdorlik uchun juda "
"yomon bo'lardi. Quyidagi misolda ma'lumotlar bazasiga faqat birinchi ifodada "
"so'rov yuboriladi::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:604
msgid ""
"To avoid reading one field on one record at a time, Odoo *prefetches* "
"records and fields following some heuristics to get good performance. Once a "
"field must be read on a given record, the ORM actually reads that field on a "
"larger recordset, and stores the returned values in cache for later use. The "
"prefetched recordset is usually the recordset from which the record comes by "
"iteration. Moreover, all simple stored fields (boolean, integer, float, "
"char, text, date, datetime, selection, many2one) are fetched altogether; "
"they correspond to the columns of the model's table, and are fetched "
"efficiently in the same query."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtda bitta record'da bitta field'ni o'qishdan qochish uchun Odoo "
"yaxshi unumdorlikka erishish maqsadida ma'lum evristikalarga amal qilib "
"record va field'larni *oldindan yuklaydi* (prefetch). Berilgan record'da "
"field o'qilishi kerak bo'lganda, ORM aslida bu field'ni kattaroq "
"recordset'da o'qiydi va qaytgan qiymatlarni keyinchalik ishlatish uchun "
"cache'da saqlaydi. Oldindan yuklangan recordset odatda record iteratsiya "
"orqali kelib chiqqan recordset'dir. Bundan tashqari, barcha oddiy "
"saqlanadigan field'lar (boolean, integer, float, char, text, date, datetime, "
"selection, many2one) birgalikda olinadi; ular model jadvalining ustunlariga "
"mos keladi va bitta so'rovda samarali olinadi."

