"recordset. Prefetching bo'lmasa, tsikl ma'lumotlar bazasiga 2000 so'rov "
"yuborardi. Prefetching bilan esa faqat bitta so'rov yuboriladi::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:622
msgid ""
"The prefetching also works on *secondary records*: when relational fields "
"are read, their values (which are records) are  subscribed for future "
"prefetching. Accessing one of those secondary records prefetches all "
"secondary records from the same model. This makes the following example "
"generate only two queries, one for partners and one for countries::"
msgstr ""
"Prefetching *ikkilamchi record'lar* uchun ham ishlaydi: relational field'lar "
"o'qilganda ularning qiymatlari (bular record'lardir) kelgusi prefetching "
"uchun ro'yxatga olinadi. Ushbu ikkilamchi record'lardan biriga murojaat "
"qilish bir xil model'dagi barcha ikkilamchi record'larni oldindan yuklaydi. "
"Buning natijasida quyidagi misol faqat ikkita so'rov hosil qiladi: biri "
"partner'lar uchun, ikkinchisi country'lar uchun::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:634
msgid ""
"The methods :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_fetch` "
"and :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fetch` can be used to populate the cache of "
"records, typically in cases where the prefetching mechanism does not work "
"well."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_fetch` va :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fetch` "
"method'lari record'lar cache'ini to'ldirish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin — "
"odatda prefetching mexanizmi yaxshi ishlamagan hollarda."

