#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:897
msgid ""
"A search domain is a first-order logical predicate used for filtering and "
"searching recordsets. You combine simple conditions on a field expression "
"with logical operators."
msgstr ""
"Search domain — recordset'larni filtrlash va qidirish uchun ishlatiladigan "
"birinchi tartibli mantiqiy predikat. Siz field ifodasi ustidagi oddiy "
"shartlarni mantiqiy operatorlar bilan birlashtirasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:901
msgid ":class:`~odoo.fields.Domain` can be used as a builder for domains."
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Domain` domain'lar uchun builder sifatida ishlatilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:922
msgid ""
"A domain can be a simple condition ``(field_expr, operator, value)`` where:"
msgstr ""
"Domain oddiy shart ``(field_expr, operator, value)`` bo'lishi mumkin, bunda:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:932
msgid "``field_expr`` (``str``)"
msgstr "``field_expr`` (``str``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:925
msgid ""
"a field name of the current model, or a relationship traversal through "
"a :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` using dot-notation e.g. ``'street'`` or "
"``'partner_id.country'``. If the field is a date(time) field, you can also "
"specify a part of the date using ``'field_name.granularity'``. The supported "
"granularities are ``'year_number'``, ``'quarter_number'``, "
"``'month_number'``, ``'iso_week_number'``, ``'day_of_week'``, "
"``'day_of_month'``, ``'day_of_year'``, ``'hour_number'``, "
"``'minute_number'``, ``'second_number'``. They all use an integer as value."
msgstr ""
"joriy model'ning field nomi yoki nuqtali yozuv (dot-notation) yordamida "
"a :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` orqali munosabat bo'ylab o'tish, masalan "
"``'street'`` yoki ``'partner_id.country'``. Agar field date(time) field "
"bo'lsa, ``'field_name.granularity'`` yordamida sananing bir qismini ham "
"ko'rsatish mumkin. Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan granularity'lar: "
"``'year_number'``, ``'quarter_number'``, ``'month_number'``, "
"``'iso_week_number'``, ``'day_of_week'``, ``'day_of_month'``, "
"``'day_of_year'``, ``'hour_number'``, ``'minute_number'``, "
"``'second_number'``. Ularning hammasi qiymat sifatida butun sondan "
"foydalanadi."

