"yoki elementlar ro'yxati bo'lishi mumkin)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:971
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:978
msgid ""
"Takes the semantics of the model into account (i.e following the "
"relationship field named by :attr:`~odoo.models.Model._parent_name`)."
msgstr ""
"Model semantikasini hisobga oladi "
"(ya'ni :attr:`~odoo.models.Model._parent_name` bilan nomlangan munosabat "
"field'i bo'ylab boradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:979
msgid "``parent_of``"
msgstr "``parent_of``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:975
msgid ""
"is a parent (ascendant) of a ``value`` record (value can be either one item "
"or a list of items)."
msgstr ""
"``value`` record'ining ota-onasi (ajdodi) hisoblanadi (qiymat bitta element "
"yoki elementlar ro'yxati bo'lishi mumkin)."

