msgid "``any`` (and ``not any``)"
msgstr "``any`` (va ``not any``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:982
msgid ""
"matches if any record in the relationship traversal through ``field_expr`` "
"(:class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`, :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many`, "
"or :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many`) satisfies the provided domain ``value``. "
"The ``field_expr`` should be a field name."
msgstr ""
"agar ``field_expr`` "
"(:class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`, :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` "
"yoki :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many`) orqali munosabat bo'ylab o'tishdagi "
"biror record berilgan ``value`` domain'ini qanoatlantirsa, mos keladi. "
"``field_expr`` field nomi bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:988
msgid "``any!`` (and ``not any!``)"
msgstr "``any!`` (va ``not any!``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:988
msgid "like ``any``, but bypasses access checks."
msgstr "``any`` kabi, lekin access check'larni chetlab o'tadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:991
