#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1012
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Domain` can be used to serialize the domain as a "
"``list`` of simple conditions represented by 3-item ``tuple`` (or a "
"``list``). Such a serialized form may be sometimes faster to read or write. "
"Domain conditions can be combined using logical operators in a *prefix* "
"notation. You can combine 2 domains using ``'&'`` (AND), ``'|'`` (OR) and "
"you can negate 1 using ``'!'`` (NOT)."
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Domain` domain'ni 3 elementli ``tuple`` (yoki ``list``) "
"bilan ifodalangan sodda shartlarning ``list``i sifatida serializatsiya "
"qilish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin. Bunday serializatsiya qilingan shakl "
"ba'zan o'qish yoki yozish uchun tezroq bo'ladi. Domain shartlarini *prefix* "
"notatsiyadagi logik operatorlar yordamida birlashtirish mumkin. 2 domain'ni "
"``'&'`` (AND), ``'|'`` (OR) yordamida birlashtirishingiz va 1 tasini ``'!'`` "
"(NOT) yordamida inkor qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1040
msgid "Dynamic time values"
msgstr "Dinamik vaqt qiymatlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1042
msgid ""
"In the context of search domains, for :ref:`date and datetime fields "
"<reference/fields/date>`, the value can be a moment relative to *now* in the "
"timezone of the user. A simple language is provided to specify these dates. "
"It is a space-separated string of terms. The first term is optional and is "
"\"today\" (at midnight) or \"now\". Then, each term starts with \"+\" (add), "
"\"-\" (subtract) or \"=\" (set), followed by an integer and date unit or a "
"lower-case weekday."
msgstr ""
"Search domain'lar kontekstida, :ref:`date va datetime field'lar <reference/"
"fields/date>` uchun qiymat foydalanuvchining timezone'idagi *hozir*ga "
"nisbatan olingan moment bo'lishi mumkin. Bu sanalarni ko'rsatish uchun sodda "
"til taqdim etilgan. U bo'shliq bilan ajratilgan termlar satridan iborat. "
"Birinchi term majburiy emas va u \"today\" (yarim tunda) yoki \"now\" "
"bo'ladi. Keyin har bir term \"+\" (qo'shish), \"-\" (ayirish) yoki \"=\" "
"(o'rnatish) bilan boshlanadi, ulardan so'ng butun son va sana birligi yoki "
"kichik harflardagi hafta kuni keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1050
msgid ""
"The date units are: \"d\" (days), \"w\" (weeks), \"m\" (months), \"y\" "
"(years), \"H\" (hours), \"M\" (minutes), \"S\" (seconds). For weekdays, \"+"
"\" and \"-\" mean next and previous weekday (unless we are already in that "
"weekday) and \"=\" means in current week starting on Monday. When setting a "
"date, the lower-units (hours, minutes and seconds) are set to 0."
msgstr ""
"Sana birliklari: \"d\" (kunlar), \"w\" (haftalar), \"m\" (oylar), \"y\" "
"(yillar), \"H\" (soatlar), \"M\" (minutlar), \"S\" (sekundlar). Hafta "
"kunlari uchun \"+\" va \"-\" keyingi va oldingi hafta kunini bildiradi (agar "
"biz allaqachon o'sha hafta kunida bo'lmasak), \"=\" esa dushanbadan "
"boshlanadigan joriy haftani bildiradi. Sana o'rnatilganda kichik birliklar "
"(soat, minut va sekund) 0 ga o'rnatiladi."

