msgstr "Amallar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1099
msgid ""
"Recordsets are immutable, but sets of the same model can be combined using "
"various set operations, returning new recordsets."
msgstr ""
"Recordset'lar o'zgarmas (immutable), lekin bir xil model'ga tegishli "
"to'plamlarni turli to'plam amallari yordamida birlashtirib, yangi "
"recordset'lar olish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1104
msgid ""
"``record in set`` returns whether ``record`` (which must be a 1-element "
"recordset) is present in ``set``. ``record not in set`` is the inverse "
"operation"
msgstr ""
"``record in set`` ``record`` (u 1 elementli recordset bo'lishi shart) "
"``set`` ichida mavjudligini qaytaradi. ``record not in set`` esa teskari amal"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1107
msgid ""
"``set1 <= set2`` and ``set1 < set2`` return whether ``set1`` is a subset of "
"``set2`` (resp. strict)"
msgstr ""
"``set1 <= set2`` va ``set1 < set2`` ``set1`` ``set2``ning qism to'plami "
"ekanini qaytaradi (mos ravishda qat'iy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1109
msgid ""
"``set1 >= set2`` and ``set1 > set2`` return whether ``set1`` is a superset "
"of ``set2`` (resp. strict)"
msgstr ""
"``set1 >= set2`` va ``set1 > set2`` ``set1`` ``set2``ning ustki to'plami "
"ekanini qaytaradi (mos ravishda qat'iy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1111
msgid ""
"``set1 | set2`` returns the union of the two recordsets, a new recordset "
"containing all records present in either source"
msgstr ""
"``set1 | set2`` ikki recordset'ning birlashmasini qaytaradi — bu har ikki "
"manbadan birida mavjud bo'lgan barcha record'larni o'z ichiga olgan yangi "
"recordset"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1113
msgid ""
"``set1 & set2`` returns the intersection of two recordsets, a new recordset "
"containing only records present in both sources"
msgstr ""
"``set1 & set2`` ikki recordset'ning kesishmasini qaytaradi — faqat ikkala "
"manbada ham mavjud record'larni o'z ichiga olgan yangi recordset"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1115
msgid ""
"``set1 - set2`` returns a new recordset containing only records of ``set1`` "
"which are *not* in ``set2``"
msgstr ""
"``set1 - set2`` ``set1`` ning faqat ``set2`` da *bo'lmagan* record'larini "
"o'z ichiga olgan yangi recordset qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1118
msgid ""
"Recordsets are iterable so the usual Python tools are available for "
"transformation "
"(:func:`python:map`, :func:`python:sorted`, :func:`~python:itertools.ifilter`, ...) "
"however these return either a :class:`python:list` or "
"an :term:`python:iterator`, removing the ability to call methods on their "
"result, or to use set operations."
msgstr ""
"Recordset'lar iterable, shuning uchun ularni o'zgartirish uchun odatiy "
"Python vositalari mavjud "
"(:func:`python:map`, :func:`python:sorted`, :func:`~python:itertools.ifilter`, ...), "
"biroq ular yoki :class:`python:list`, yoki :term:`python:iterator` qaytaradi "
"va bu natija ustida method chaqirish yoki set amallaridan foydalanish "
"imkonini yo'qotadi."

