"`_name` aniq ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, :attr:`~odoo.models.Model._name` ham "
"xuddi shu qiymatga tenglashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1260
msgid ""
"It will also yield the various :ref:`automatic fields <reference/fields/"
"automatic>` unless they've been disabled"
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, u turli :ref:`automatic field'lar <reference/fields/automatic>` "
"ni ham beradi, agar ular o'chirilmagan bo'lsa"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1264
msgid "Delegation"
msgstr "Delegation"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1266
msgid ""
"The third inheritance mechanism provides more flexibility (it can be altered "
"at runtime) but less power: using the :attr:`~odoo.models.Model._inherits` a "
"model *delegates* the lookup of any field not found on the current model to "
"\"children\" models. The delegation is performed "
"via :class:`~odoo.fields.Reference` fields automatically set up on the "
"parent model."
msgstr ""
"Uchinchi inheritance mexanizmi ko'proq moslashuvchanlik beradi (uni runtime "
"vaqtida o'zgartirish mumkin), lekin kuchi "
"kamroq: :attr:`~odoo.models.Model._inherits` yordamida model joriy model'da "
"topilmagan har qanday field'ni izlashni \"children\" model'larga "
"*topshiradi*. Delegation parent model'da avtomatik "
"sozlanadigan :class:`~odoo.fields.Reference` field'lari orqali amalga "
"oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1273
msgid ""
"The main difference is in the meaning. When using Delegation, the model "
"**has one** instead of **is one**, turning the relationship in a composition "
"instead of inheritance"
msgstr ""
"Asosiy farq ma'noda. Delegation ishlatilganda model **is one** emas, balki "
"**has one** bo'ladi va bu munosabatni inheritance o'rniga composition ga "
"aylantiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1317
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:25
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:35
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:329
msgid "will result in::"
msgstr "natijada quyidagi hosil bo'ladi::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1322
msgid "and it's possible to write directly on the delegated field::"
msgstr "va delegate qilingan field'ga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri yozish mumkin::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1326
msgid ""
"when using delegation inheritance, methods are *not* inherited, only fields"
msgstr ""
"delegation inheritance ishlatilganda method'lar meros *olinmaydi*, faqat "
"field'lar meros olinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1331
msgid "`_inherits` is more or less implemented, avoid it if you can;"
msgstr ""
"`_inherits` u yoki bu darajada amalga oshirilgan, imkon bo'lsa undan "
"foydalanmang;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1332
msgid ""
"chained `_inherits` is essentially not implemented, we cannot guarantee "
"anything on the final behavior."
msgstr ""
"zanjirli (chained) `_inherits` aslida amalga oshirilmagan, yakuniy xatti-"
"harakat bo'yicha hech narsani kafolatlab bera olmaymiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1336
msgid "Fields Incremental Definition"
msgstr "Field'larni bosqichma-bosqich aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1338
msgid ""
"A field is defined as class attribute on a model class. If the model is "
"extended, one can also extend the field definition by redefining a field "
"with the same name and same type on the subclass. In that case, the "
"attributes of the field are taken from the parent class and overridden by "
"the ones given in subclasses."
msgstr ""
"Field model class'ida class attribute sifatida aniqlanadi. Agar model extend "
"qilinsa, subclass'da xuddi shu nom va shu turdagi field'ni qayta aniqlash "
"orqali field ta'rifini ham extend qilish mumkin. Bu holda field'ning "
"attribute'lari parent class'dan olinadi va subclass'larda berilgan qiymatlar "
"bilan override qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1344
msgid ""
"For instance, the second class below only adds a tooltip on the field "
"``state``"
msgstr ""
"Masalan, quyidagi ikkinchi class ``state`` field'iga faqat tooltip qo'shadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm.rst:1364
msgid "Error management"
msgstr "Xatolarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:5
msgid "Changelog"
msgstr "O'zgarishlar tarixi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:8
msgid "Odoo version 19.0"
msgstr "Odoo 19.0 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:10
msgid ""
"Add support for ``GROUPING SETS`` for pivot views. See `#194413 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/194413>`_."
msgstr ""
"Pivot view'lar uchun ``GROUPING SETS`` qo'llab-quvvatlashi qo'shildi. "
"Qarang: `#194413 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/194413>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:12
msgid ""
"Adding support for dynamic dates in domains. See `#216665 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/216665>`_."
msgstr ""
"Domain'larda dinamik sanalarni qo'llab-quvvatlash qo'shildi. Qarang: "
"`#216665 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/216665>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:14
msgid ""
"Deprecated `odoo.osv` in `#217708 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/"
"217708>`_."
msgstr ""
"`odoo.osv` deprecated qilindi — `#217708 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/"
"217708>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:15
msgid ""
"Deprecated `record._cr`, `record._context`, `record._uid` in `#193636 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/193636>`_."
msgstr ""
"`record._cr`, `record._context`, `record._uid` deprecated qilindi — `#193636 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/193636>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:19
msgid "Odoo Online version 18.4"
msgstr "Odoo Online 18.4 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:21
msgid ""
"The `reinit` option is added to the CLI to reinitialize modules. See "
"`#206408 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/206408>`_."
msgstr ""
"Module'larni qayta initsializatsiya qilish uchun CLI'ga `reinit` option "
"qo'shildi. Qarang: `#206408 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/206408>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:23
msgid ""
"Possibility to write and combine custom domains for injecting arbitrary SQL. "
"See `#205208 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/205208>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy SQL kiritish uchun custom domain'lar yozish va ularni "
"birlashtirish imkoniyati. Qarang: `#205208 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"pull/205208>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:27
msgid "Odoo Online version 18.3"
msgstr "Odoo Online 18.3 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:29
msgid ""
"Domain optimization is applied before executing `Fields.search` methods. All "
"equalities are handled consistently: `=` is equivalent to `in`. See `#191549 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/191549>`_."
msgstr ""
"Domain optimizatsiyasi `Fields.search` method'lari bajarilishidan oldin "
"qo'llanadi. Barcha tenglik shartlari bir xilda ishlanadi: `=` `in` ga "
"ekvivalent. Qarang: `#191549 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/191549>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:32
msgid ""
"New cron API for notifying progress with batch commits. See `#197781 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/197781>`_."
msgstr ""
"Batch commit'lar bilan progress haqida xabar berish uchun yangi cron API. "
"Qarang: `#197781 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/197781>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:34
msgid ""
"Demo data no longer loaded by default. See `#194585 <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/pull/194585>`_."
msgstr ""
"Demo ma'lumotlar endi default holda yuklanmaydi. Qarang: `#194585 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/194585>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:38
msgid "Odoo Online version 18.2"
msgstr "Odoo Online 18.2 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:40
msgid ""
"`read_group` has been deprecated in favor of `_read_group` for backend usage "
"and of `formatted_read_group` as formatted public API. See `#163300 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/163300>`_."
msgstr ""
"`read_group` deprecated qilindi: backend'da ishlatish uchun `_read_group`, "
"formatlangan public API sifatida esa `formatted_read_group` ishlatiladi. "
"Qarang: `#163300 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/163300>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:42
msgid ""
"`@api.private` is added to distinguish public Python methods from methods "
"exposed for RPC calls. See `#195402 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/"
"195402>`_."
msgstr ""
"RPC chaqiruvlari uchun ochilgan method'larni public Python method'laridan "
"ajratish uchun `@api.private` qo'shildi. Qarang: `#195402 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/195402>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:44
msgid ""
"Native namespaces for ``odoo`` module `PEP-420 <https://peps.python.org/"
"pep-0420/>`_. See `#195664 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/195664>`_."
msgstr ""
"``odoo`` module uchun native namespace'lar `PEP-420 <https://peps.python.org/"
"pep-0420/>`_. Qarang: `#195664 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/195664>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:48
msgid "Odoo Online version 18.1"
msgstr "Odoo Online 18.1 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:50
msgid ""
"New `odoo.domain` and `odoo.Domain` API for domain manipulation. See "
"`#170009 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/170009>`_."
msgstr ""
"Domain bilan ishlash uchun yangi `odoo.domain` va `odoo.Domain` API. Qarang: "
"`#170009 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/170009>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:52
msgid ""
"Declare constraints and indexes as model attributes with `#175783 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/175783>`_."
msgstr ""
"constraint'lar va index'larni model attribute'lari sifatida e'lon qilish — "
"`#175783 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/175783>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:53
msgid ""
"The `json` controllers have been renamed to `jsonrpc`. They are called the "
"same, only the `type` in the python files changed. See `#183636 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/183636>`_."
msgstr ""
"`json` controller'lar `jsonrpc` deb qayta nomlandi. Ular xuddi shunday "
"chaqiriladi, faqat python fayllardagi `type` o'zgardi. Qarang: `#183636 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/183636>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:57
msgid "Odoo version 18.0"
msgstr "Odoo 18.0 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:59
msgid ""
"Searching by name is now implemented as `_search_display_name` like all "
"other fields. See `#174967 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/174967>`_."
msgstr ""
"Nom bo'yicha qidirish endi barcha boshqa field'lar kabi "
"`_search_display_name` sifatida amalga oshirilgan. Qarang: `#174967 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/174967>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:61
msgid ""
"New methods to check access rights and rules now combine both access rights "
"and rules: `check_access`, `has_access` and `_filtered_access`. See `#179148 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/179148>`_."
msgstr ""
"Access rights va rule'larni tekshirish uchun yangi method'lar endi access "
"rights va rule'larni birgalikda qamrab oladi: `check_access`, `has_access` "
"va `_filtered_access`. `#179148 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/179148>`_ "
"ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:64
msgid ""
"Translations are made available from the `Environment` with `#174844 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/174844>`_."
msgstr ""
"`#174844 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/174844>`_ bilan tarjimalar "
"`Environment` orqali mavjud bo'ldi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:67
msgid "Odoo Online version 17.4"
msgstr "Odoo Online 17.4 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:69
msgid ""
"The internal operator `inselect` is removed. The alternative is to use `in` "
"with a Query or SQL object. `#171371 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/"
"171371>`_."
msgstr ""
"Ichki `inselect` operatori olib tashlandi. Uning o'rniga Query yoki SQL "
"object bilan `in` dan foydalanish mumkin. `#171371 <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/pull/171371>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:74
msgid "Odoo Online version 17.3"
msgstr "Odoo Online 17.3 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:76
msgid ""
"We can now group by date parts numbers in `read_group`, `_read_group` and "
"domains with `#159528 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/159528>`_."
msgstr ""
"`#159528 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/159528>`_ bilan endi "
"`read_group`, `_read_group` va domain'larda sana qismlari raqamlari bo'yicha "
"guruhlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:80
msgid "Odoo Online version 17.2"
msgstr "Odoo Online 17.2 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:82
msgid ""
"The :attr:`group_operator` attribute of :class:`~odoo.fields.Field` is "
"renamed into :attr:`aggregator` with `#127353 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"pull/127353>`_."
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Field` ning :attr:`group_operator` atributi `#127353 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/127353>`_ bilan :attr:`aggregator` deb "
"qayta nomlandi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:84
msgid ""
"We can now group/aggregate/order by related no-store field with `#127353 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/127353>`_."
msgstr ""
"`#127353 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/127353>`_ bilan endi related no-"
"store field bo'yicha group/aggregate/order qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:88
msgid "Odoo Online version 17.1"
msgstr "Odoo Online 17.1 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:90
msgid ""
"Method :meth:`~odoo.models.Model._flush_search` has been deprecated with "
"`#144747 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/144747>`_. The flushing of "
"fields is now done by :meth:`~odoo.api.Environment.execute_query`, and is "
"based on metadata put in the :class:`~odoo.tools.SQL` object "
"by :meth:`~odoo.models.BaseModel._search` and other low-level ORM methods "
"that build such objects.  Those methods are also responsible for checking "
"the access rights on the fields that are used in the SQL object."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model._flush_search` method'i `#144747 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/144747>`_ bilan deprecated qilindi. Field'larni "
"flush qilish endi :meth:`~odoo.api.Environment.execute_query` tomonidan "
"bajariladi va :meth:`~odoo.models.BaseModel._search` hamda shunday "
"object'larni tuzuvchi boshqa quyi darajali ORM "
"method'lari :class:`~odoo.tools.SQL` object'iga joylagan metadata'ga "
"asoslanadi. Shu method'lar SQL object'ida ishlatiladigan field'lar uchun "
"access rights'ni tekshirish uchun ham javobgardir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:99
msgid "Odoo version 17.0"
msgstr "Odoo 17.0 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:101
msgid ""
"Introduce an :class:`~odoo.tools.SQL` wrapper object to make SQL composition "
"easier and safer with respect to SQL injections. Methods of the ORM now use "
"it internally. Introduced by `#134677 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/"
"134677>`_."
msgstr ""
"SQL tuzishni osonlashtirish va SQL injection'larga nisbatan xavfsizroq "
"qilish uchun :class:`~odoo.tools.SQL` wrapper object'i joriy etildi. ORM "
"method'lari endi undan ichki tarzda foydalanadi. `#134677 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/134677>`_ bilan joriy etilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:106
msgid "Odoo Online version 16.4"
msgstr "Odoo Online 16.4 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:108
msgid ""
"Method :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.name_get` has been deprecated with `#122085 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/122085>`_. Read field `display_name` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.name_get` method'i `#122085 <https://github.com/"
"odoo/odoo/pull/122085>`_ bilan deprecated qilindi. Uning o'rniga "
"`display_name` field'ini o'qing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:113
msgid "Odoo Online version 16.3"
msgstr "Odoo Online 16.3 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:115
msgid ""
"Method :meth:`~odoo.models.Model._read_group` has a new signature with "
"`#110737 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/110737>`_"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model._read_group` method'i `#110737 <https://github.com/"
"odoo/odoo/pull/110737>`_ bilan yangi signature'ga ega bo'ldi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:119
msgid "Odoo Online version 16.2"
msgstr "Odoo Online 16.2 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:121
msgid ""
"Refactor the implementation of searching and reading methods to be able to "
"combine both in a minimal number of SQL queries. We introduce two new "
"methods :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_fetch` "
"and :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fetch` that take advantage of the combination. "
"More details can be found on the pull request `#112126 <https://github.com/"
"odoo/odoo/pull/112126>`_."
msgstr ""
"Search va read method'larining implementatsiyasi ikkalasini minimal sonli "
"SQL query'larda birlashtirish imkonini berishi uchun refactor qilindi. Bu "
"birlashtirishdan foyda oladigan ikki yangi method joriy "
"etildi: :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_fetch` "
"va :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fetch`. Batafsil ma'lumotni `#112126 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/112126>`_ pull request'ida topish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:128
msgid "Odoo version 16.0"
msgstr "Odoo 16.0 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:130
msgid ""
"Translations for translated fields are stored as JSONB values with `#97692 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/97692>`_ and `#101115 <https://github.com/"
"odoo/odoo/pull/101115>`_. Code translations are no longer stored into the "
"database. They become static and are extracted from the PO files when needed."
msgstr ""
"`#97692 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/97692>`_ va `#101115 <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/101115>`_ bilan tarjima qilinadigan field'larning "
"tarjimalari JSONB qiymatlar sifatida saqlanadi. Kod tarjimalari endi "
"ma'lumotlar bazasida saqlanmaydi. Ular statik bo'lib qoladi va kerak "
"bo'lganda PO fayllardan ajratib olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:135
msgid ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_count` takes the :attr:`limit` argument "
"into account with `#95589 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/95589>`_. It "
"limits the number of records to count, improving performance when a partial "
"result is acceptable."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_count` `#95589 <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/pull/95589>`_ bilan :attr:`limit` argumentini hisobga oladi. U "
"sanaladigan record'lar sonini cheklaydi va qismiy natija maqbul bo'lganda "
"unumdorlikni yaxshilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:139
msgid "Odoo Online version 15.4"
msgstr "Odoo Online 15.4 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:141
msgid ""
"New API for flushing to the database and invalidating the cache with `#87527 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/87527>`_. New methods have been added to "
"`odoo.models.Model` and `odoo.api.Environment`, and are less confusing about "
"what is actually done in each case. See the section :ref:`SQL Execution "
"<reference/orm/sql>`."
msgstr ""
"`#87527 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/87527>`_ bilan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasiga flush qilish va cache'ni invalidate qilish uchun yangi API paydo "
"bo'ldi. `odoo.models.Model` va `odoo.api.Environment` ga yangi method'lar "
"qo'shildi va ular har bir holatda aslida nima bajarilishi haqida kamroq "
"chalkashlik tug'diradi. :ref:`SQL Execution <reference/orm/sql>` bo'limiga "
"qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:148
msgid "Odoo Online version 15.3"
msgstr "Odoo Online 15.3 versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:150
msgid ""
"The argument `args` is renamed to `domain` "
"for :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search`, :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_count` "
"and :meth:`~odoo.models.Model._search`. `#83687 <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/pull/83687>`_"
msgstr ""
"`args` "
"argumenti :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search`, :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_count` "
"va :meth:`~odoo.models.Model._search` uchun `domain` deb qayta nomlandi. "
"`#83687 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83687>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:152
msgid ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.filtered_domain` conserves the order of the "
"current recordset. `#83687 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83687>`_"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.filtered_domain` joriy recordset tartibini "
"saqlaydi. `#83687 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83687>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:153
msgid ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.browse` does not accept :class:`str` as `ids`. "
"`#83687 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83687>`_"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.browse` `ids` sifatida :class:`str` ni qabul "
"qilmaydi. `#83687 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83687>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:154
msgid ""
"The methods :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fields_get_keys` "
"and :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.get_xml_id` on :class:`~odoo.models.Model` are "
