#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:161
msgid ""
"Specific index types on fields:  With `#83274 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"pull/83274>`_ and `#83015 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83015>`_, "
"developers can now define what type of indexes can be used on fields by "
"PostgreSQL. See the :ref:`index property <reference/fields>` of "
"`odoo.fields.Field`."
msgstr ""
"Field'lardagi maxsus index turlari: `#83274 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"pull/83274>`_ va `#83015 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/83015>`_ bilan "
"dasturchilar endi PostgreSQL field'larda qanday turdagi index'lardan "
"foydalanishi mumkinligini aniqlay oladi. `odoo.fields.Field` "
"ning :ref:`index property <reference/fields>` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:165
msgid ""
"The :attr:`_sequence` attribute of :class:`~odoo.models.Model` is removed. "
"Odoo lets PostgreSQL use the default sequence of the primary key. `#82727 "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/82727>`_"
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.models.Model` ning :attr:`_sequence` atributi olib tashlandi. "
"Odoo PostgreSQL'ga primary key'ning standart sequence'idan foydalanish "
"imkonini beradi. `#82727 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/82727>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:166
msgid ""
"The method :meth:`~odoo.models.Model._write` does not raise an error for non-"
"existing records. `#82727 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/82727>`_"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model._write` method'i mavjud bo'lmagan record'lar uchun "
"xato chiqarmaydi. `#82727 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/82727>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/orm/changelog.rst:167
msgid ""
"The :attr:`column_format` and :attr:`deprecated` attributes "
"of :class:`~odoo.fields.Field` are removed. `#82727 <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/pull/82727>`_"
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Field` ning :attr:`column_format` va :attr:`deprecated` "
"atributlari olib tashlandi. `#82727 <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/pull/"
"82727>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:5
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "Unumdorlik"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:10
msgid "Profiling"
msgstr "Profiling"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:14
msgid ""
"Profiling is about analysing the execution of a program and measure "
"aggregated data. These data can be the elapsed time for each function, the "
"executed SQL queries..."
msgstr ""
"Profiling — bu programma bajarilishini tahlil qilish va yig'ma ma'lumotlarni "
"o'lchashdir. Bu ma'lumotlar har bir funksiya uchun ketgan vaqt, bajarilgan "
"SQL query'lar va shunga o'xshashlar bo'lishi mumkin..."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:17
msgid ""
"While profiling does not improve the performance of a program by itself, it "
"can prove very helpful in finding performance issues and identifying which "
"part of the program is responsible for them."
msgstr ""
"Profiling o'z-o'zidan programma unumdorligini oshirmasa-da, unumdorlik "
"muammolarini topishda va programmaning qaysi qismi ularga sabab "
"bo'layotganini aniqlashda juda foydali bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:20
msgid ""
"Odoo provides an integrated profiling tool that allows recording all "
"executed queries and stack traces during execution. It can be used to "
"profile either a set of requests of a user session, or a specific portion of "
"code. Profiling results can be either inspected with the integrated "
"`speedscope <https://github.com/jlfwong/speedscope>`_ :dfn:`open source app "
"allowing to visualize a flamegraph` view or analyzed with custom tools by "
"first saving them in a JSON file or in the database."
msgstr ""
"Odoo bajarilish vaqtidagi barcha query'lar va stack trace'larni yozib olish "
"imkonini beruvchi integratsiyalangan profiling vositasini taqdim etadi. "
"Undan foydalanuvchi sessiyasidagi so'rovlar to'plamini yoki kodning muayyan "
"qismini profiling qilish uchun foydalanish mumkin. Profiling natijalarini "
"integratsiyalangan `speedscope <https://github.com/jlfwong/"
"speedscope>`_ :dfn:`flamegraph ko'rinishini vizuallashtirish imkonini "
"beruvchi ochiq kodli ilova` ko'rinishida ko'rish yoki avval ularni JSON "
"faylga yoxud ma'lumotlar bazasiga saqlab, maxsus vositalar bilan tahlil "
"qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:29
msgid "Enable the profiler"
msgstr "Profiler'ni yoqish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:31
msgid ""
"The profiler can either be enabled from the user interface, which is the "
"easiest way to do so but allows profiling only web requests, or from Python "
"code, which allows profiling any piece of code including tests."
msgstr ""
"Profiler'ni foydalanuvchi interfeysidan yoqish mumkin — bu eng oson yo'l, "
"biroq faqat web request'larni profiling qilishga imkon beradi — yoki Python "
"koddan yoqish mumkin, bu esa test'lar bilan birga kodning har qanday qismini "
"profiling qilishga imkon beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:37
msgid "Enable from the user interface"
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi interfeysidan yoqish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:39
msgid ":ref:`Enable the developer mode <developer-mode>`."
msgstr ":ref:`Developer mode'ni yoqing <developer-mode>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:40
msgid ""
"Before starting a profiling session, the profiler must be enabled globally "
"on the database. This can be done in two ways:"
msgstr ""
"Profiling sessiyasini boshlashdan oldin profiler ma'lumotlar bazasida global "
"tarzda yoqilgan bo'lishi kerak. Buni ikki yo'l bilan bajarish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:43
msgid ""
"Open the :ref:`developer mode tools <developer-mode/tools>`, then toggle "
"the :guilabel:`Enable profiling` button. A wizard suggests a set of expiry "
"times for the profiling. Click on :guilabel:`ENABLE PROFILING` to enable the "
"profiler globally."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Developer mode vositalarini <developer-mode/tools>` oching, "
"so'ng :guilabel:`Enable profiling` tugmasini yoqing. Wizard profiling uchun "
"bir nechta amal qilish muddatini taklif qiladi. Profiler'ni global tarzda "
"yoqish uchun :guilabel:`ENABLE PROFILING` ni bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:49
msgid ""
"Go to :guilabel:`Settings --> General Settings --> Performance` and set the "
"desired time to the field :guilabel:`Enable profiling until`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Settings --> General Settings --> Performance` ga o'ting "
"va :guilabel:`Enable profiling until` field'iga kerakli vaqtni belgilang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:52
msgid ""
"After the profiler is enabled on the database, users can enable it on their "
"session. To do so, toggle the :guilabel:`Enable profiling` button in "
"the :ref:`developer mode tools <developer-mode/tools>` again. By default, "
"the recommended options :guilabel:`Record sql` and :guilabel:`Record traces` "
"are enabled. To learn more about the different options, head over "
"to :ref:`performance/profiling/collectors`."
msgstr ""
"Profiler ma'lumotlar bazasida yoqilgandan so'ng foydalanuvchilar uni o'z "
"sessiyasida yoqishi mumkin. Buning uchun :ref:`developer mode vositalaridagi "
"<developer-mode/tools>` :guilabel:`Enable profiling` tugmasini yana yoqing. "
"Standart holatda tavsiya etilgan :guilabel:`Record sql` va :guilabel:`Record "
"traces` variantlari yoqilgan bo'ladi. Turli variantlar haqida batafsil "
"bilish uchun :ref:`performance/profiling/collectors` ga o'ting."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:60
msgid ""
"When the profiler is enabled, all the requests made to the server are "
"profiled and saved into an `ir.profile` record. Such records are grouped "
"into the current profiling session which spans from when the profiler was "
"enabled until it is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Profiler yoqilganda serverga yuborilgan barcha request'lar profiling "
"qilinadi va `ir.profile` record'iga saqlanadi. Bunday record'lar profiler "
"yoqilgan paytdan o'chirilgan paytgacha davom etadigan joriy profiling "
"sessiyasiga guruhlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:65
msgid "Odoo Online databases cannot be profiled."
msgstr "Odoo Online ma'lumotlar bazalarini profiling qilish mumkin emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:67
msgid "Enable from Python code"
msgstr "Python koddan yoqish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:69
msgid ""
"Starting the profiler manually can be convenient to profile a specific "
"method or a part of the code. This code can be a test, a compute method, the "
"entire loading, etc."
msgstr ""
"Profiler'ni qo'lda ishga tushirish muayyan method yoki kodning bir qismini "
"profiling qilish uchun qulay bo'lishi mumkin. Bu kod test, compute method, "
"butun yuklanish jarayoni va h.k. bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:72
msgid ""
"To start the profiler from Python code, call it as a context manager. You "
"may specify *what* you want to record through the parameters. A shortcut is "
"available for profiling test classes: :code:`self.profile()`. "
"See :ref:`performance/profiling/collectors` for more information on the "
"`collectors` parameter."
msgstr ""
"Profiler'ni Python koddan ishga tushirish uchun uni context manager sifatida "
"chaqiring. Parametrlar orqali *nimani* yozib olishni ko'rsatishingiz mumkin. "
"Test class'larni profiling qilish uchun qisqa yo'l "
"mavjud: :code:`self.profile()`. `collectors` parametri haqida batafsil "
"ma'lumot uchun :ref:`performance/profiling/collectors` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:100
msgid ""
"The profiler is called outside of the `assertQueryCount` in order to catch "
"queries made when exiting the context manager (e.g., flush)."
msgstr ""
"Profiler `assertQueryCount` tashqarisida chaqiriladi — bu context "
"manager'dan chiqishda bajarilgan query'larni (masalan, flush) ushlash uchun "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:106
msgid ""
"When the profiler is enabled, all executions of a test method are profiled "
"and saved into an `ir.profile` record. Such records are grouped into a "
"single profiling session. This is especially useful when using "
"the :code:`@warmup` and :code:`@users` decorators."
msgstr ""
"Profiler yoqilganda test method'ining barcha bajarilishlari profiling "
"qilinadi va `ir.profile` record'iga saqlanadi. Bunday record'lar bitta "
"profiling sessiyasiga guruhlanadi. Bu ayniqsa :code:`@warmup` "
"va :code:`@users` decorator'laridan foydalanganda foydalidir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:111
msgid ""
"It can be complicated to analyze profiling results of a method that is "
"called several times because all the calls are grouped together in the stack "
"trace. Add an **execution context** as a context manager to break down the "
"results into multiple frames."
msgstr ""
"Bir necha marta chaqiriladigan method'ning profiling natijalarini tahlil "
"qilish murakkab bo'lishi mumkin, chunki barcha chaqiruvlar stack trace'da "
"birga guruhlanadi. Natijalarni bir nechta frame'ga ajratish uchun context "
"manager sifatida **execution context** qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:126
msgid "Analyse the results"
msgstr "Natijalarni tahlil qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:128
msgid ""
"To browse the profiling results, make sure that the :ref:`profiler is "
"enabled globally on the database <performance/profiling/enable>`, then open "
"the :ref:`developer mode tools <developer-mode/tools>` and click on the "
"button in the top-right corner of the profiling section. A list view of the "
"`ir.profile` records grouped by profiling session opens."
msgstr ""
"Profiling natijalarini ko'rish uchun :ref:`profiler ma'lumotlar bazasida "
"global tarzda yoqilganiga <performance/profiling/enable>` ishonch hosil "
"qiling, so'ng :ref:`developer mode vositalarini <developer-mode/tools>` "
"ochib, profiling bo'limining yuqori o'ng burchagidagi tugmani bosing. "
"Profiling sessiyasi bo'yicha guruhlangan `ir.profile` record'larining list "
"view'i ochiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:136
msgid ""
"Each record has a clickable link that opens the speedscope results in a new "
"tab."
msgstr ""
"Har bir record'da speedscope natijalarini yangi tab'da ochadigan bosiladigan "
"havola mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:141
msgid ""
"Speedscope falls out of the scope of this documentation but there are a lot "
"of tools to try: search, highlight of similar frames, zoom on frame, "
"timeline, left heavy, sandwich view..."
msgstr ""
"Speedscope bu hujjat doirasidan tashqarida, biroq unda sinab ko'rish uchun "
"juda ko'p vositalar mavjud: qidiruv, o'xshash frame'larni ajratib "
"ko'rsatish, frame'ga yaqinlashtirish, timeline, left heavy, sandwich view..."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:144
msgid ""
"Depending on the profiling options that were activated, Odoo generates "
"different view modes that you can access from the top menu."
msgstr ""
"Yoqilgan profiling parametrlariga qarab, Odoo yuqoridagi menyudan kirish "
"mumkin bo'lgan turli ko'rinish rejimlarini yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:150
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Combined` view shows all the SQL queries and traces merged "
"togethers."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Combined` ko'rinishi barcha SQL so'rovlari va trace'larni "
"birlashtirilgan holda ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:151
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Combined no context` view shows the same result but ignores "
"the saved execution context <performance/profiling/enable>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Combined no context` ko'rinishi xuddi shu natijani ko'rsatadi, "
"lekin saqlangan bajarilish context'ini <performance/profiling/enable>` "
"inobatga olmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:153
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`sql (no gap)` view shows all the SQL queries as if they were "
"executed one after another, without any Python logic. This is useful for "
"optimizing SQL only."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`sql (no gap)` ko'rinishi barcha SQL so'rovlarini, hech qanday "
"Python logikasi bo'lmagandek, birin-ketin bajarilgan holda ko'rsatadi. Bu "
"faqat SQL'ni optimallashtirish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:155
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`sql (density)` view shows only all the SQL queries, leaving "
"gap between them. This can be useful to spot if eiter SQL or Python code is "
"the problem, and to identify zones in where many small queries could be "
"batched."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`sql (density)` ko'rinishi faqat barcha SQL so'rovlarini, ular "
"orasida bo'shliq qoldirib ko'rsatadi. Bu muammo SQL'da yoki Python kodida "
"ekanini aniqlash, hamda ko'p mayda so'rovlarni batch qilib bajarish mumkin "
"bo'lgan joylarni topish uchun foydali bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:158
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`frames` view shows the results of only the :ref:`periodic "
"collector <performance/profiling/collectors/periodic>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`frames` ko'rinishi faqat :ref:`periodic collector <performance/"
"profiling/collectors/periodic>` natijalarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:162
msgid ""
"Even though the profiler has been designed to be as light as possible, it "
"can still impact performance, especially when using the :ref:`Sync collector "
"<performance/profiling/collectors/sync>`. Keep that in mind when analyzing "
"speedscope results."
msgstr ""
"Profiler imkon qadar yengil bo'lishi uchun ishlab chiqilgan bo'lsa-da, u "
"hamon unumdorlikka ta'sir qilishi mumkin, ayniqsa :ref:`Sync collector "
"<performance/profiling/collectors/sync>` ishlatilganda. Speedscope "
"natijalarini tahlil qilishda buni yodda tuting."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:169
msgid "Collectors"
msgstr "Collector'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:171
msgid ""
"Whereas the profiler is about the *when* of profiling, the collectors take "
"care of the *what*."
msgstr ""
"Profiler profiling'ning *qachon* tomoni bilan shug'ullansa, collector'lar "
"*nima* tomoniga javob beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:173
msgid ""
"Each collector specializes in collecting profiling data in its own format "
"and manner. They can be individually enabled from the user interface through "
"their dedicated toggle button in the :ref:`developer mode tools <developer-"
"mode/tools>`, or from Python code through their key or class."
msgstr ""
"Har bir collector profiling ma'lumotlarini o'ziga xos format va usulda "
"yig'ishga ixtisoslashgan. Ularni :ref:`developer mode tools <developer-mode/"
"tools>` ichidagi maxsus toggle tugmasi orqali foydalanuvchi interfeysidan, "
"yoki Python kodida ularning kaliti yoki class'i orqali alohida-alohida "
"yoqish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/performance.rst:178
