"the current website object, if any (this item can be present but ``None``)"
msgstr ""
"joriy website object'i, agar mavjud bo'lsa (bu element mavjud bo'lib, ammo "
"``None`` bo'lishi mumkin)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:37
msgid "``web_base_url``"
msgstr "``web_base_url``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:38
msgid "the base url for the webserver"
msgstr "webserver uchun asosiy url"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:41
msgid "``context_timestamp``"
msgstr "``context_timestamp``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:40
msgid ""
"a function taking :class:`python:datetime.datetime` in UTC\\ [#unzoned]_ and "
