msgstr ""
"UTC\\ [#unzoned]_ dagi :class:`python:datetime.datetime` ni qabul qilib, uni "
"report'ni chop etayotgan foydalanuvchining timezone'iga o'tkazadigan funksiya"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:44
msgid "Minimal viable template"
msgstr "Minimal ishlaydigan template"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:46
msgid "A minimal template would look like::"
msgstr "Minimal template quyidagicha ko'rinadi::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:61
msgid ""
"Calling ``external_layout`` will add the default header and footer on your "
"report. The PDF body will be the content inside the ``<div "
"class=\"page\">``. The template's ``id`` must be the name specified in the "
"report declaration; for example ``account.report_invoice`` for the above "
"report. Since this is a QWeb template, you can access all the fields of the "
"``docs`` objects received by the template."
msgstr ""
"``external_layout`` ni chaqirish report'ingizga standart header va footer "
