"template bo'lgani uchun, template qabul qilgan ``docs`` object'larining "
"barcha field'lariga murojaat qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/reports.rst:68
msgid "By default, the rendering context will also expose the following items:"
msgstr "Odatiy holda rendering context quyidagi elementlarni ham taqdim etadi:"

