msgstr "Maxsus tag'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:232
msgid ""
"``standard``: All Odoo tests that inherit from :class:`~odoo.tests.BaseCase` "
"are implicitly tagged standard. :option:`--test-tags <odoo-bin --test-tags>` "
