"Har bir qadam kamida bitta trigger'ga ega. Siz yoki `predefined steps "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web_tour/static/src/"
"tour_service/tour_utils.js#L426>`_ dan foydalanishingiz, yoki o'zingizning "
"shaxsiy qadamingizni yozishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:368
msgid "Here are some example of steps:"
msgstr "Quyida qadamlarga bir nechta misol keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:408
msgid "Here are some possible arguments for your personalized steps:"
msgstr ""
"Quyida shaxsiy qadamlaringiz uchun ishlatilishi mumkin bo'lgan argumentlar "
"keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:410
msgid ""
"**trigger**: Required, Selector/element to ``run`` an action on. The tour "
"will wait until the element exists and is visible before ``run``-ing the "
"action *on it*."
msgstr ""
"**trigger**: Majburiy, action ``run`` qilinadigan selector/element. Tour "
"action'ni *unda* ``run`` qilishdan avval element mavjud bo'lishini va "
"ko'rinishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:413
msgid ""
"**run**: Optional, Action to perform on the *trigger* element. If no "
"``run``, no action."
msgstr ""
"**run**: Ixtiyoriy, *trigger* elementida bajariladigan action. Agar ``run`` "
"berilmasa, hech qanday action bajarilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:416
msgid "The action can be:"
msgstr "Action quyidagilardan biri bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:418
msgid ""
"A function, asynchronous, executed with the trigger's ``Tip`` as context "
"(``this``) and the action helpers as parameter."
msgstr ""
"Funksiya, asinxron, trigger'ning ``Tip`` obyekti context (``this``) sifatida "
"va action helper'lari parametr sifatida berilib bajariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:420
msgid ""
"The name of one of the action helpers, which will be run on the trigger "
"element:"
msgstr "Action helper'laridan birining nomi — u trigger elementida bajariladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:426
msgid "``check``"
msgstr "``check``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:426
msgid ""
"Ensures that the **trigger** element is checked. This helper is intended for "
"`<input[type=checkbox]>` elements only."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementi belgilangan (checked) bo'lishini ta'minlaydi. Bu helper "
"faqat `<input[type=checkbox]>` elementlari uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:429
msgid "``clear``"
msgstr "``clear``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:429
msgid ""
"Clears the value of the **trigger** element. This helper is intended for "
"`<input>` or `<textarea>` elements only."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementining qiymatini tozalaydi. Bu helper faqat `<input>` yoki "
"`<textarea>` elementlari uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:432
msgid "``click``"
msgstr "``click``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:432
msgid ""
"Clicks the **trigger** element, performing all the relevant intermediate "
"events."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementini bosadi va barcha tegishli oraliq event'larni bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:434
msgid "``dblclick``,"
msgstr "``dblclick``,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:435
msgid "Same as ``click`` with two repetitions."
msgstr "``click`` bilan bir xil, faqat ikki marta takrorlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:436
msgid ":samp:`drag_and_drop {target}`"
msgstr ":samp:`drag_and_drop {target}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:437
msgid ""
"Simulates the dragging of the **trigger** element over to the ``target``."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementini ``target`` ustiga sudrab olib borishni simulyatsiya "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:438
msgid ":samp:`edit {content}`"
msgstr ":samp:`edit {content}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:439
msgid "``clear`` the element and then ``fill`` the ``content``."
msgstr "Elementni ``clear`` qiladi, so'ngra ``content`` ni ``fill`` qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:440
msgid ":samp:`editor {content}`"
msgstr ":samp:`editor {content}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:441
msgid ""
"Focus the **trigger** element (wysiwyg) and then ``press`` the ``content``."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementini (wysiwyg) fokuslaydi, so'ngra ``content`` ni "
"``press`` qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:443
msgid ":samp:`fill {content}`"
msgstr ":samp:`fill {content}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:443
msgid ""
"Focus the **trigger** element and then ``press`` the ``content``. This "
"helper is intended for `<input>` or `<textarea>` elements only."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementini fokuslaydi, so'ngra ``content`` ni ``press`` qiladi. "
"Bu helper faqat `<input>` yoki `<textarea>` elementlari uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:445
msgid "``hover``"
msgstr "``hover``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:446
msgid "Performs a hover sequence on the **trigger** element."
msgstr "**trigger** elementida hover ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:447
msgid ":samp:`press {content}`"
msgstr ":samp:`press {content}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:448
msgid "Performs a keyboard event sequence."
msgstr "Klaviatura event'lari ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:450
msgid ":samp:`range {content}`"
msgstr ":samp:`range {content}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:450
msgid ""
"Focus the **trigger** element and set ``content`` as value. This helper is "
"intended for `<input[type=range]>` elements only."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementini fokuslaydi va ``content`` ni qiymat sifatida "
"o'rnatadi. Bu helper faqat `<input[type=range]>` elementlari uchun "
"mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:453
msgid ":samp:`select {value}`"
msgstr ":samp:`select {value}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:453
msgid ""
"Performs a selection event sequence on **trigger** element. Select the "
"option by its ``value``. This helper is intended for `<select>` elements "
"only."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** elementida tanlash event'lari ketma-ketligini bajaradi. Option "
"uning ``value`` qiymati bo'yicha tanlanadi. Bu helper faqat `<select>` "
"elementlari uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:456
msgid ":samp:`selectByIndex {index}`"
msgstr ":samp:`selectByIndex {index}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:456
msgid ""
"Same as ``select`` but select the option by its ``index``. Note that first "
"option has index 0."
msgstr ""
"``select`` bilan bir xil, faqat option uning ``index`` qiymati bo'yicha "
"tanlanadi. E'tibor bering, birinchi option'ning index'i 0 ga teng."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:458
msgid ":samp:`selectByLabel {label}`"
msgstr ":samp:`selectByLabel {label}`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:459
msgid "Same as ``select`` but select the option by its ``label``."
msgstr ""
"``select`` bilan bir xil, faqat option uning ``label`` qiymati bo'yicha "
"tanlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:463
msgid "``uncheck``"
msgstr "``uncheck``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:461
msgid ""
"Ensures that the **trigger** element is unchecked. This helper is intended "
"for `<input[type=checkbox]>` elements only."
msgstr ""
"**trigger** element'idan belgi olib tashlanganiga ishonch hosil qiladi. Bu "
"helper faqat `<input[type=checkbox]>` element'lari uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:465
msgid ""
"**isActive**: Optional, Activates the step only if all conditions of "
"isActive array are met. - Browser is in either **desktop** or **mobile** "
"mode. - The tour concerns either **community** or **enterprise** edition. - "
"The tour is run in either **auto** (runbot) or **manual** (onboarding) mode."
msgstr ""
"**isActive**: Ixtiyoriy, step'ni faqat isActive massividagi barcha shartlar "
"bajarilgan bo'lsa faollashtiradi. - Browser **desktop** yoki **mobile** "
"rejimida. - Tour **community** yoki **enterprise** nashriga tegishli. - Tour "
"**auto** (runbot) yoki **manual** (onboarding) rejimida ishga tushiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:470
msgid ""
"**tooltipPosition**: Optional, ``\"top\"``, ``\"right\"``, ``\"bottom\"``, "
"or ``\"left\"``. Where to position the tooltip relative to the **target** "
"when running interactive tours."
msgstr ""
"**tooltipPosition**: Ixtiyoriy, ``\"top\"``, ``\"right\"``, ``\"bottom\"`` "
"yoki ``\"left\"``. Interaktiv tour'lar ishga tushirilganda tooltip'ni "
"**target**'ga nisbatan qayerga joylashtirish kerakligi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:473
msgid ""
"**content**: Optional but recommended, the content of the tooltip in "
"interactive tours, also logged to the console so very useful to trace and "
"debug automated tours."
msgstr ""
"**content**: Ixtiyoriy, lekin tavsiya etiladi — interaktiv tour'lardagi "
"tooltip mazmuni; shuningdek console'ga log qilinadi, shu sababli "
"avtomatlashtirilgan tour'larni kuzatish va debug qilish uchun juda foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:476
msgid ""
"**timeout**: How long to wait until the step can ``run``, in milliseconds, "
"10000 (10 seconds)."
msgstr ""
"**timeout**: Step ``run`` bo'lishi mumkin bo'lguncha qancha kutish "
"kerakligi, millisekundlarda, 10000 (10 sekund)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:481
msgid ""
"The last step(s) of a tour should always return the client to a \"stable\" "
"state (e.g. no ongoing editions) and ensure all side-effects (network "
"requests) have finished running to avoid race conditions or errors during "
"teardown."
msgstr ""
"Tour'ning oxirgi step(lar)i client'ni har doim \"stable\" holatga qaytarishi "
"(masalan, tugallanmagan tahrirlar qolmasligi) va barcha side-effect'lar "
"(network so'rovlari) bajarilib bo'lganiga ishonch hosil qilishi kerak — bu "
"teardown vaqtida race condition yoki xatolarning oldini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:487
msgid "`jQuery documentation about find <https://api.jquery.com/find/>`_"
msgstr "`find haqida jQuery hujjatlari <https://api.jquery.com/find/>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:492
msgid ""
"To start a tour from a python test, make the class inherit "
"from :class:`~odoo.tests.HTTPCase`, and call `start_tour`:"
msgstr ""
"Tour'ni python test'dan ishga tushirish uchun "
"class'ni :class:`~odoo.tests.HTTPCase` dan inherit qildiring va `start_tour` "
"ni chaqiring:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:503
msgid "Writing an onboarding tour"
msgstr "Onboarding tour yozish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:508
msgid ""
"To write an onboarding tour for `your_module`, start with creating the "
"required files:"
msgstr ""
"`your_module` uchun onboarding tour yozish uchun avval kerakli fayllarni "
"yaratishdan boshlang:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:519
msgid ""
"You can then update :file:`__manifest__.py` to add :file:`your_tour.js` in "
"the assets and :file:`your_tour.xml` in the data."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra :file:`__manifest__.py` ni yangilab, assets'ga :file:`your_tour.js` "
"ni va data'ga :file:`your_tour.xml` ni qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:535
msgid ""
"The javascript part is the same as for :ref: `the test tour <testing/"
"javascript/test>`."
msgstr ""
"javascript qismi :ref: `test tour <testing/javascript/test>` dagi bilan bir "
"xil."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:538
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:148
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/website_theme.rst:16
msgid "XML"
msgstr "XML"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:540
msgid ""
"When you have your tour in the javascript registry, you can create a record "
"`web_tour.tour` in the xml, like that:"
msgstr ""
"Tour'ingiz javascript registry'da bo'lgach, xml'da `web_tour.tour` "
"record'ini quyidagicha yaratishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:553
msgid ""
"`name`: Required, the name must be the same as the one in the javascript "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"`name`: Majburiy, nom javascript registry'dagi nom bilan bir xil bo'lishi "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:555
msgid ""
"`sequence`: Optional; determines the order to execute the onboarding tours. "
"Defaults to 1000."
msgstr ""
"`sequence`: Ixtiyoriy; onboarding tour'larni bajarish tartibini aniqlaydi. "
"Standart qiymati 1000."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:557
msgid ""
"`url`: Optional; the url where to start the tour. If ``url`` is ``False``, "
"take the url from the registry. Defaults to \"/odoo\"."
msgstr ""
"`url`: Ixtiyoriy; tour qayerdan boshlanishini ko'rsatuvchi url. Agar ``url`` "
"``False`` bo'lsa, url registry'dan olinadi. Standart qiymati \"/odoo\"."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:559
msgid ""
"`rainbow_man_message`: Optional; will show the message in the rainbow man "
"effect at the completion of the tour. If ``rainbow_man_message`` is "
"``False``, there is no rainbow effect. Defaults to ``<b>Good job!</b> You "
"went through all steps of this tour.``"
msgstr ""
"`rainbow_man_message`: Ixtiyoriy; tour tugagach xabarni rainbow man "
"effektida ko'rsatadi. Agar ``rainbow_man_message`` ``False`` bo'lsa, rainbow "
"effekti bo'lmaydi. Standart qiymati ``<b>Good job!</b> You went through all "
"steps of this tour.``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:564
msgid "Running onboarding tours"
msgstr "Onboarding tour'larni ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:566
msgid ""
"They can all be started in their sequence order by toggling "
"the :guilabel:`Onboarding` option in the user menu. You can run specific "
"onboarding tours by going to the :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> "
"User Interface --> Tours` and clicking on :guilabel:`Onboarding` "
"or :guilabel:`Testing`."
msgstr ""
"Ularning barchasini foydalanuvchi menyusidagi :guilabel:`Onboarding` "
"opsiyasini yoqish orqali sequence tartibida ishga tushirish mumkin. Muayyan "
"onboarding tour'larni ishga tushirish uchun :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Technical --> User Interface --> Tours` ga o'ting va :guilabel:`Onboarding` "
"yoki :guilabel:`Testing` ni bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:570
msgid ""
"**Onboarding**: will execute the tour in interactive mode. That means the "
"tour will show what to do and wait for interactions from the user."
msgstr ""
"**Onboarding**: tour'ni interaktiv rejimda bajaradi. Ya'ni tour nima qilish "
"kerakligini ko'rsatadi va foydalanuvchidan harakat kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:572
msgid ""
"**Testing**: will execute the tour automatically. That means the tour will "
"be executing all the step in front of the user."
msgstr ""
"**Testing**: tour'ni avtomatik bajaradi. Ya'ni tour barcha step'larni "
"foydalanuvchi ko'z o'ngida bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:576
msgid "Tour recorder"
msgstr "Tour recorder"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:578
msgid ""
"You can also create tours easily with the tour recorder. To do so, click "
"on :guilabel:`Record` on the onboarding tours view. When started, this tool "
"will record all your interactions in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Tour recorder yordamida tour'larni osongina yaratishingiz ham mumkin. Buning "
"uchun onboarding tour'lar view'ida :guilabel:`Record` ni bosing. Ishga "
"tushirilgach, bu vosita Odoo'dagi barcha harakatlaringizni yozib oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:581
msgid ""
"The created tours are flagged in the onboarding tours view as **Custom**. "
"These tours can also be exported to a javascript file, ready to be put in "
"your module."
msgstr ""
"Yaratilgan tour'lar onboarding tour'lar view'ida **Custom** deb belgilanadi. "
"Bu tour'larni javascript fayliga eksport qilish ham mumkin — modulingizga "
"joylashga tayyor holda."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:585
msgid "Debugging tips"
msgstr "Debug qilish bo'yicha maslahatlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:588
msgid "Observing test tours in a browser"
msgstr "Test tour'larni browser'da kuzatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:590
msgid "There are three ways with different tradeoffs:"
msgstr "Har birining o'z afzallik va kamchiligi bo'lgan uchta usul mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:593
msgid "``watch=True``"
msgstr "``watch=True``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:595
msgid ""
"When running a tour locally via the test suite, the ``watch=True`` parameter "
"can be added to the ``browser_js`` or ``start_tour`` call::"
msgstr ""
"Tour'ni test suite orqali lokal ishga tushirganda ``browser_js`` yoki "
"``start_tour`` chaqiruviga ``watch=True`` parametrini qo'shish mumkin::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:601
msgid ""
"This will automatically open a Chrome window with the tour being run inside "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Bu avtomatik ravishda Chrome oynasini ochadi va tour uning ichida ishga "
"tushiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:606
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:627
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:648
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:703
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:716
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:725
msgid "**Advantages**"
msgstr "**Afzalliklari**"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:605
msgid ""
"always works if the tour has Python setup / surrounding code, or multiple "
"steps"
msgstr ""
"tour'da Python setup / atrofdagi kod yoki bir nechta step bo'lsa ham har "
"doim ishlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:606
msgid ""
"runs entirely automatically (just select the test which launches the tour)"
msgstr ""
"to'liq avtomatik ishlaydi (shunchaki tour'ni ishga tushiruvchi test'ni "
"tanlang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:607
msgid "transactional (*should* always be runnable multiple times)"
msgstr ""
"transactional (har doim bir necha marta ishga tushirilishi mumkin bo'lishi "
"*kerak*)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:610
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:631
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:652
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:706
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:730
msgid "**Drawbacks**"
msgstr "**Kamchiliklari**"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:609
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:630
msgid "only works locally"
msgstr "faqat lokal ishlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:610
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:631
msgid "only works if the test / tour can run correctly locally"
msgstr "faqat test / tour lokalda to'g'ri ishlay olsa ishlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:613
msgid "``debug=True``"
msgstr "``debug=True``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:615
msgid ""
"When running a tour locally via the test suite, the ``debug=True`` parameter "
"can be added to the ``browser_js`` or ``start_tour`` call::"
msgstr ""
"Tour'ni test suite orqali lokal ishga tushirganda ``browser_js`` yoki "
"``start_tour`` chaqiruviga ``debug=True`` parametrini qo'shish mumkin::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:621
msgid ""
"This will automatically open a fullscreen Chrome window with opened devtools "
"and a debugger breakpoint set at the start of the tour. The tour is ran with "
"the debug=assets query parameter. When an error is thrown, the debugger "
"stops on the exception."
msgstr ""
"Bu avtomatik ravishda to'liq ekranli Chrome oynasini ochadi: devtools "
"ochilgan va tour boshida debugger breakpoint o'rnatilgan holatda. Tour "
"debug=assets query parametri bilan ishga tushiriladi. Xato yuzaga kelganda "
"debugger exception'da to'xtaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:627
msgid "Same advantages as mode `watch=True`"
msgstr "`watch=True` rejimi bilan bir xil afzalliklar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:628
msgid "Easier to debug steps"
msgstr "Step'larni debug qilish osonroq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:634
msgid "Run via browser"
msgstr "Browser orqali ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:636
msgid "Test tours can also be launched via the browser UI by calling"
msgstr ""
"Test tour'larni browser UI orqali ham ishga tushirish mumkin — buning uchun "
"quyidagini chaqiring"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:642
msgid ""
"in the javascript console, or by enabling :ref:`tests mode <frontend/"
"framework/tests_debug_mode>` by setting ``?debug=tests`` in the URL."
msgstr ""
"javascript console'da, yoki URL'da ``?debug=tests`` ni belgilash "
"orqali :ref:`tests mode <frontend/framework/tests_debug_mode>` ni yoqib."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:647
msgid "easier to run"
msgstr "ishga tushirish osonroq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:648
msgid "can be used on production or test sites, not just local instances"
msgstr ""
"faqat lokal instance'larda emas, production yoki test saytlarida ham "
"ishlatish mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:649
msgid "allows running in \"Onboarding\" mode (manual steps)"
msgstr ""
"\"Onboarding\" rejimida ishga tushirishga imkon beradi (qo'lda bajariladigan "
"step'lar)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:651
msgid "harder to use with test tours involving Python setup"
msgstr "Python setup talab qiladigan test tour'lar bilan ishlatish qiyinroq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:652
msgid "may not work multiple times depending on tour side-effects"
msgstr "tour'ning side-effect'lariga qarab bir necha marta ishlamasligi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:656
msgid ""
"It's possible to use this method to observe or interact with tours which "
"require Python setup:"
msgstr ""
"Bu usuldan Python setup talab qiladigan tour'larni kuzatish yoki ular bilan "
"ishlash uchun foydalanish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:659
msgid ""
"add a *python* breakpoint before the relevant tour is started "
"(``start_tour`` or ``browser_js`` call)"
msgstr ""
"kerakli tour ishga tushirilishidan oldin *python* breakpoint qo'shing "
"(``start_tour`` yoki ``browser_js`` chaqiruvi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:661
msgid "when the breakpoint is hit, open the instance in your browser"
msgstr "breakpoint'ga yetilganda instance'ni browser'ingizda oching"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:662
msgid "run the tour"
msgstr "tour'ni ishga tushiring"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:664
msgid ""
"At this point the Python setup will be visible to the browser, and the tour "
"will be able to run."
msgstr ""
"Shu nuqtada Python setup browser'ga ko'rinadi va tour ishga tushishi mumkin "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:667
msgid ""
"You may want to comment the ``start_tour`` or ``browser_js`` call if you "
"also want the test to continue afterwards, depending on the tour's side-"
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Agar tour'ning side-effect'lariga qarab test keyin ham davom etishini "
"xohlasangiz, ``start_tour`` yoki ``browser_js`` chaqiruvini comment qilib "
"qo'yishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:672
msgid "Screenshots and screencasts during browser_js tests"
msgstr "browser_js test'lari vaqtidagi screenshot va screencast'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:674
msgid ""
"When running tests that use ``HttpCase.browser_js`` from the command line, "
"the Chrome browser is used in headless mode. By default, if a test fails, a "
"PNG screenshot is taken at the moment of the failure and written in"
msgstr ""
"``HttpCase.browser_js`` dan foydalanadigan test'larni buyruq satridan ishga "
"tushirganda Chrome browser headless rejimida ishlatiladi. Standart holatda, "
"agar test muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lsa, xatolik yuz bergan paytda PNG screenshot "
"olinadi va quyidagi joyga yoziladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:682
msgid ""
"Two new command line arguments were added since Odoo 13.0 to control this "
"behavior: :option:`--screenshots <odoo-bin --screenshots>` and :option:`--"
"screencasts <odoo-bin --screencasts>`"
msgstr ""
"Odoo 13.0 dan boshlab bu xatti-harakatni boshqarish uchun ikkita yangi "
"command line argumenti qo'shildi: :option:`--screenshots <odoo-bin --"
"screenshots>` va :option:`--screencasts <odoo-bin --screencasts>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:686
msgid "Introspecting / debugging steps"
msgstr "Step'larni tekshirish / debug qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:688
msgid ""
"When trying to fix / debug a tour, the screenshots (on failure) are not "
"necessarily sufficient. In that case it can be useful to see what's "
"happening at some or each step."
msgstr ""
"Tour'ni tuzatish / debug qilishga urinayotganda (xatolik yuz berganda "
"olinadigan) screenshot'lar har doim yetarli bo'lmaydi. Bunday holatda ba'zi "
"yoki har bir step'da nima sodir bo'layotganini ko'rish foydali bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:692
msgid ""
"While this is pretty easy when in an \"onboarding\" (as they're mostly "
"driven explicitly by the user) it's more complicated when running \"test\" "
"tours, or when running tours through the test suite. In that case there are "
"two main tricks:"
msgstr ""
"\"onboarding\" holatida buni bajarish ancha oson (chunki ular ko'p hollarda "
"foydalanuvchi tomonidan bevosita boshqariladi), lekin \"test\" tour'larini "
"yoki test suite orqali tour'larni ishga tushirganda vaziyat murakkablashadi. "
"Bunday holatda ikkita asosiy usul mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:697
msgid "A step property ``break: true,`` in debug mode (debug=True)."
msgstr "debug rejimida (debug=True) ``break: true,`` step property'si."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:699
msgid ""
"This adds a debugger breakpoint at the start of the step. You can then add "
"your own wherever you need."
msgstr ""
"Bu step boshida debugger breakpoint qo'shadi. So'ngra kerakli joyga "
"o'zingizning breakpoint'laringizni qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:703
msgid "very simple"
msgstr "juda oddiy"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:704
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:726
msgid "the tour continues as soon as you resume execution"
msgstr "bajarilishni davom ettirganingizdan so'ng tour darhol davom etadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:706
#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:728
msgid "page interaction is limited as all javascript is blocked"
msgstr ""
"barcha javascript bloklanganligi uchun page bilan o'zaro aloqa cheklangan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:708
msgid "A step property ``pause: true,`` in debug mode (debug=True)."
msgstr "debug rejimida (debug=True) ``pause: true,`` step property'si."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:710
msgid ""
"The tour will stop at the end of the step. This allows inspecting and "
"interacting with the page until the developer is ready to resume by typing "
"**play();** in the browser console."
msgstr ""
"Tour step oxirida to'xtaydi. Bu dasturchi browser console'da **play();** deb "
"yozib davom ettirishga tayyor bo'lguncha page'ni tekshirish va u bilan "
"ishlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:715
msgid "allows interacting with the page"
msgstr "page bilan ishlash imkonini beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:716
msgid "no useless (for this situation) debugger UI"
msgstr "(bu holat uchun) keraksiz debugger UI yo'q"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:718
msgid "A step with a ``run() { debugger; }`` action."
msgstr "``run() { debugger; }`` action'iga ega step."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:720
msgid ""
"This can be added to an existing step, or can be a new dedicated step. Once "
"the step's **trigger** is matched, the execution will stop all javascript "
"execution."
msgstr ""
"Bu mavjud step'ga qo'shilishi yoki alohida yangi step bo'lishi mumkin. "
"Step'ning **trigger**'i mos kelgach, bajarilish barcha javascript ishlashini "
"to'xtatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:725
msgid "simple"
msgstr "oddiy"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:729
msgid ""
"the debugger is triggered after trying to find targeted element defined in "
"the step."
msgstr ""
"debugger step'da aniqlangan maqsadli element'ni topishga urinishdan keyin "
"ishga tushadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:733
msgid "Performance Testing"
msgstr "Performance testlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:736
msgid "Query counts"
msgstr "Query soni"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/backend/testing.rst:738
msgid ""
"One of the ways to test performance is to measure database queries. "
"Manually, this can be tested with the `--log-sql` CLI parameter. If you want "
"to establish the maximum number of queries for an operation, you can use "
"the :meth:`~odoo.tests.BaseCase.assertQueryCount` method, integrated in Odoo "
"test classes."
msgstr ""
"Performance'ni tekshirishning usullaridan biri — ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"query'larini o'lchash. Qo'lda buni `--log-sql` CLI parametri bilan sinab "
"ko'rish mumkin. Agar biror operatsiya uchun query'larning maksimal sonini "
"belgilamoqchi bo'lsangiz, Odoo test class'lariga integratsiya "
"qilingan :meth:`~odoo.tests.BaseCase.assertQueryCount` method'idan "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:5
msgid "Command-line interface (CLI)"
msgstr "Command-line interface (CLI)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:7
msgid ""
"The CLI :dfn:`command-line interface` offers several functionalities related "
"to Odoo. You can use it to :ref:`run the server <reference/cmdline/"
"server>`, :ref:`launch Odoo as a Python console environment <reference/"
"cmdline/shell>`, :ref:`scaffold an Odoo module <reference/cmdline/"
"scaffold>`, :ref:`populate a database <reference/cmdline/populate>` "
"or :ref:`count the number of lines of code <reference/cmdline/cloc>`."
msgstr ""
"CLI :dfn:`command-line interface` Odoo bilan bog'liq bir nechta "
"funksiyalarni taklif qiladi. Undan :ref:`server'ni ishga tushirish "
"<reference/cmdline/server>`, :ref:`Odoo'ni Python console environment "
"sifatida ishga tushirish <reference/cmdline/shell>`, :ref:`Odoo module'ini "
"scaffold qilish <reference/cmdline/scaffold>`, :ref:`ma'lumotlar bazasini "
"to'ldirish <reference/cmdline/populate>` yoki :ref:`kod qatorlari sonini "
"hisoblash <reference/cmdline/cloc>` uchun foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:13
msgid ""
"The command to use to call the CLI depends on how you installed Odoo. In the "
"examples below, we assume that you are :doc:`running Odoo from source </"
"administration/on_premise/source>` with the :file:`odoo-bin` file. If you "
"installed Odoo :doc:`from a distribution package </administration/on_premise/"
"packages>` or with `Docker <https://hub.docker.com/_/odoo/>`_, you must "
"adapt the command."
msgstr ""
"CLI'ni chaqirish uchun ishlatiladigan buyruq Odoo'ni qanday o'rnatganingizga "
"bog'liq. Quyidagi misollarda siz :file:`odoo-bin` fayli bilan :doc:`Odoo'ni "
"manbadan ishga tushirasiz </administration/on_premise/source>` deb taxmin "
"qilinadi. Agar Odoo'ni :doc:`distribution package'dan </administration/"
"on_premise/packages>` yoki `Docker <https://hub.docker.com/_/odoo/>`_ bilan "
"o'rnatgan bo'lsangiz, buyruqni moslashtirishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:21
msgid "Run Odoo from source"
msgstr "Odoo'ni manbadan ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:23
msgid ""
"Navigate to the root of the directory where you downloaded the source files "
"of Odoo Community."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Community manba fayllarini yuklab olgan papkaning ildiziga o'ting."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:25
msgid "Run all CLI commands with :command:`./odoo-bin`"
msgstr "Barcha CLI buyruqlarini :command:`./odoo-bin` bilan bajaring"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:27
msgid "Odoo was installed from a distribution package"
msgstr "Odoo distribution package'dan o'rnatilgan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:29
msgid ""
"When Odoo was installed, an executable named `odoo` was added to your user's "
"PATH. Replace all occurrences of :command:`odoo-bin` with :command:`odoo` in "
"the examples below."
msgstr ""
"Odoo o'rnatilganda `odoo` nomli bajariladigan fayl foydalanuvchingizning "
"PATH'iga qo'shildi. Quyidagi misollarda :command:`odoo-bin` ning barcha "
"uchrashini :command:`odoo` bilan almashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:32
msgid "Odoo was installed with Docker"
msgstr "Odoo Docker bilan o'rnatilgan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:34
msgid ""
"Please refer to the `documentation of the official Docker image of Odoo "
"<https://hub.docker.com/_/odoo/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Iltimos, `Odoo rasmiy Docker image'i hujjatlariga <https://hub.docker.com/_/"
"odoo/>`_ murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:40
#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:34
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versiya"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:46
msgid ""
"it can be used in combination with any command available, and it displays "
"the options of the current command."
msgstr ""
"u mavjud har qanday buyruq bilan birga ishlatilishi mumkin va joriy "
"buyruqning option'larini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:49
msgid ""
"If no command is used, it will act as per the `help` command :ref:`below "
"<reference/cmdline/help>`."
msgstr ""
"Agar hech qanday buyruq ishlatilmasa, u :ref:`quyidagi <reference/cmdline/"
"help>` `help` buyrug'i kabi ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:54
msgid "shows Odoo version e.g. \"Odoo Server 19.0\""
msgstr "Odoo versiyasini ko'rsatadi, masalan \"Odoo Server 19.0\""

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:56
msgid "You can enable auto-completion in your shell by running"
msgstr ""
"Shell'ingizda auto-completion'ni quyidagini bajarish orqali yoqishingiz "
"mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:66
msgid "`help` - Show available commands"
msgstr "`help` - Mavjud buyruqlarni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:70
msgid "This command shows all the available commands for Odoo."
msgstr "Bu buyruq Odoo uchun mavjud barcha buyruqlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:72
msgid "It has no options."
msgstr "Uning option'lari yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:77
msgid "`server` - Run the Server"
msgstr "`server` - Server'ni ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:81
msgid ""
"This command is the default one: you can omit it, and it will be chosen "
"anyway."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq standart hisoblanadi: uni tashlab ketishingiz mumkin, u har holda "
"tanlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:85
msgid ""
"database(s) used when installing or updating modules. Providing a comma-"
"separated list restrict access to databases provided in list."
msgstr ""
"module'larni o'rnatish yoki yangilash vaqtida ishlatiladigan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi(lari). Vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxat berilishi kirishni ro'yxatda "
"ko'rsatilgan ma'lumotlar bazalari bilan cheklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:89
msgid ""
"For advanced database options, take a look :ref:`below <reference/cmdline/"
"server/database>`."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasining qo'shimcha option'lari uchun :ref:`quyidagiga "
"<reference/cmdline/server/database>` qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:93
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of modules to install before running the server "
"(requires :option:`-d`)."
msgstr ""
"server'ni ishga tushirishdan oldin o'rnatiladigan module'larning vergul "
"bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati (:option:`-d` talab qiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:97
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of modules to update before running the server. Use "
"``all`` for all modules. (requires :option:`-d`)."
msgstr ""
"server'ni ishga tushirishdan oldin yangilanadigan module'larning vergul "
"bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati. Barcha module'lar uchun ``all`` dan foydalaning. "
"(:option:`-d` talab qiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:102
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of modules to reinitialize before starting the "
"server. (requires :option:`-d`)."
msgstr ""
"server'ni ishga tushirishdan oldin qayta initsializatsiya qilinadigan "
"module'larning vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati. (:option:`-d` talab qiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:105
msgid ""
"The reinitialization is similar to a simple upgrade without executing any "
"upgrade script. It loads data in ``init`` mode instead of ``update`` mode, "
"primarily affecting records marked as ``'noupdate'``. All modules that "
"depend directly or indirectly on the specified ones will also be "
"reinitialized."
msgstr ""
"Qayta initsializatsiya hech qanday upgrade script'ini bajarmasdan oddiy "
"upgrade'ga o'xshaydi. U ma'lumotlarni ``update`` rejimi o'rniga ``init`` "
"rejimida yuklaydi, bu asosan ``'noupdate'`` deb belgilangan record'larga "
"ta'sir qiladi. Ko'rsatilgan module'larga bevosita yoki bilvosita bog'liq "
"barcha module'lar ham qayta initsializatsiya qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:109
msgid ""
"This option is intended for debugging or development purposes only. **Do not "
"use it with a production database.**"
msgstr ""
"Bu option faqat debug qilish yoki development maqsadlari uchun "
"mo'ljallangan. **Uni production ma'lumotlar bazasi bilan ishlatmang.**"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:114
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of directories in which modules are stored. These "
"directories are scanned for modules."
msgstr ""
"module'lar saqlanadigan papkalarning vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati. Bu "
"papkalar module'lar mavjudligi uchun skanerlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:121
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of directories from which additional upgrade scripts "
"are loaded."
msgstr ""
"qo'shimcha upgrade script'lari yuklanadigan papkalarning vergul bilan "
"ajratilgan ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:126
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of paths to upgrade scripts. The scripts are run before "
"loading base module when an upgrade of any module is requested. This is "
"useful to perform some actions during custom modules upgrade after a major "
"upgrade."
msgstr ""
"upgrade script'lariga olib boruvchi yo'llarning vergul bilan ajratilgan "
"ro'yxati. Script'lar biror module'ning upgrade'i so'ralganda base module "
"yuklanishidan oldin bajariladi. Bu katta upgrade'dan keyin custom "
"module'larning upgrade'i vaqtida ba'zi amallarni bajarish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:133
msgid ""
"list of server-wide modules to load. Those modules are supposed to provide "
"features not necessarily tied to a particular database. This is in contrast "
"to modules that are always bound to a specific database when they are "
"installed (i.e. the majority of Odoo addons). Default is ``base,web``."
msgstr ""
"yuklanadigan server-wide module'lar ro'yxati. Bu module'lar muayyan "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga bog'lanmagan imkoniyatlarni taqdim etishi kutiladi. Bu "
"o'rnatilganda har doim muayyan ma'lumotlar bazasiga bog'lanadigan "
"module'lardan (ya'ni Odoo addon'larining ko'pchiligidan) farq qiladi. "
"Standart qiymat ``base,web``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:140
msgid ""
"path to an alternate :ref:`configuration file <reference/cmdline/config>`. "
"If not defined, Odoo checks ``ODOO_RC`` environmental variable and default "
"location :file:`{$HOME}/.odoorc`. See configuration file section :ref:`below "
"<reference/cmdline/config>`."
msgstr ""
"alternativ :ref:`configuration file <reference/cmdline/config>` ga yo'l. "
"Agar aniqlanmagan bo'lsa, Odoo ``ODOO_RC`` environment o'zgaruvchisini va "
"standart joylashuvni — :file:`{$HOME}/.odoorc` ni tekshiradi. Configuration "
"file bo'limini :ref:`quyida <reference/cmdline/config>` ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:147
msgid ""
"directory path where to store Odoo data (eg. filestore, sessions). If not "
"specified, Odoo will fallback to a predefined path. On Unix systems its one "
"defined in ``$XDG_DATA_HOME`` environmental variable or :file:`~/.local/"
"share/Odoo` or :file:`/var/lib/Odoo`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ma'lumotlari saqlanadigan papka yo'li (masalan filestore, session'lar). "
"Agar ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, Odoo oldindan belgilangan yo'lga qaytadi. Unix "
"tizimlarida bu ``$XDG_DATA_HOME`` environment o'zgaruvchisida aniqlangan "
"yo'l yoki :file:`~/.local/share/Odoo` yoki :file:`/var/lib/Odoo`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:155
msgid ""
"saves the server configuration to the current configuration file "
"(:file:`{$HOME}/.odoorc` by default, and can be overridden using :option:`-"
"c`)."
msgstr ""
"server konfiguratsiyasini joriy configuration file'ga saqlaydi (standart "
"holda :file:`{$HOME}/.odoorc`, va :option:`-c` yordamida override qilinishi "
"mumkin)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:161
msgid "install demo data in new databases."
msgstr "yangi ma'lumotlar bazalarida demo ma'lumotlarni o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:165
msgid ""
"don't install demo data nor in new databases nor when installing new modules "
"in a database that uses demo data, this is the default."
msgstr ""
"demo ma'lumotlarni na yangi ma'lumotlar bazalarida, na demo ma'lumotlardan "
"foydalanadigan ma'lumotlar bazasiga yangi module'lar o'rnatilganda "
"o'rnatmaydi; bu standart holat."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:170
msgid ""
"skips auto-installing modules when a new module installation is requested. "
"This option is useful for development. It serves to check if the installed "
"modules do not indirectly depend on auto-installed modules."
msgstr ""
"yangi module o'rnatish so'ralganda auto-install module'larni o'tkazib "
"yuboradi. Bu option development uchun foydali. U o'rnatilgan module'lar auto-"
"install qilinadigan module'larga bilvosita bog'liq emasligini tekshirishga "
"xizmat qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:176
msgid "path to a file where the server pid will be stored"
msgstr "server pid'i saqlanadigan faylga yo'l"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:180
msgid "stops the server after its initialization."
msgstr "initsializatsiyadan keyin server'ni to'xtatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:184
msgid "Absolute path to the GeoIP City database file."
msgstr "GeoIP City ma'lumotlar bazasi fayliga absolut yo'l."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:188
msgid "Absolute path to the GeoIP Country database file."
msgstr "GeoIP Country ma'lumotlar bazasi fayliga to'liq (absolyut) yo'l."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:194
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "Testlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:198
msgid "runs tests after module installation"
msgstr "module o'rnatilgandan keyin testlarni ishga tushiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:202
msgid "runs a python test file"
msgstr "python test faylini ishga tushiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:206
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of specs to filter which tests to execute. Enable unit "
"tests if set."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi testlar bajarilishini filtrlash uchun vergul bilan ajratilgan spec'lar "
"ro'yxati. Belgilangan bo'lsa, unit testlarni yoqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:208
msgid "Example: `--test-tags :TestClass.test_func,/test_module,external`"
msgstr "Misol: `--test-tags :TestClass.test_func,/test_module,external`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:210
msgid ""
"The `-` specifies if we want to include or exclude tests matching this spec."
msgstr ""
"`-` belgisi shu spec'ga mos testlarni qo'shishni yoki chiqarib tashlashni "
"bildiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:211
msgid ""
"The tag will match tags added on a class with "
"a :func:`~odoo.tests.common.tagged` decorator (all :ref:`test classes "
"<reference/testing>` have `standard` and `at_install` tags until explicitly "
"removed, see the decorator documentation)."
msgstr ""
"Tag class'ga :func:`~odoo.tests.common.tagged` decorator bilan qo'shilgan "
"taglarga mos keladi (barcha :ref:`test class'lari <reference/testing>` aniq "
"olib tashlanmaguncha `standard` va `at_install` taglariga ega bo'ladi, "
"decorator hujjatlarini ko'ring)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:214
msgid "`*` will match all tags."
msgstr "`*` barcha taglarga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:215
msgid "If tag is omitted on include mode, its value is `standard`."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shish (include) rejimida tag ko'rsatilmasa, uning qiymati `standard` "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:216
msgid "If tag is omitted on exclude mode, its value is `*`."
msgstr ""
"Chiqarib tashlash (exclude) rejimida tag ko'rsatilmasa, uning qiymati `*` "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:217
msgid ""
"The module, class, and method will respectively match the module name, test "
"class name and test method name."
msgstr ""
"module, class va method mos ravishda module nomiga, test class nomiga va "
"test method nomiga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:219
msgid ""
"Filtering and executing the tests happens twice: right after each module "
"installation/update and at the end of the modules loading. At each stage "
"tests are filtered by `--test-tags` specs and additionally by dynamic specs "
"`at_install` and `post_install` correspondingly."
msgstr ""
"Testlarni filtrlash va bajarish ikki marta sodir bo'ladi: har bir module "
"o'rnatilgan/yangilangandan so'ng darhol va modullarni yuklash oxirida. Har "
"bir bosqichda testlar `--test-tags` spec'lari bo'yicha, shuningdek mos "
"ravishda `at_install` va `post_install` dinamik spec'lari bo'yicha "
"filtrlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:227
msgid ""
"Specify directory where to write screenshots when an HttpCase.browser_js "
"test fails. It defaults to :file:`/tmp/odoo_tests/{db_name}/screenshots`"
msgstr ""
"HttpCase.browser_js testi muvaffaqiyatsiz tugaganda skrinshotlar yoziladigan "
"papkani ko'rsatadi. Standart qiymati :file:`/tmp/odoo_tests/{db_name}/"
"screenshots`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:232
msgid ""
"Enable screencasts and specify directory where to write screencasts files. "
"The ``ffmpeg`` utility needs to be installed to encode frames into a video "
"file. Otherwise frames will be kept instead of the video file."
msgstr ""
"Screencast'larni yoqadi va screencast fayllari yoziladigan papkani "
"ko'rsatadi. Kadrlarni video faylga kodlash uchun ``ffmpeg`` utilitasi "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lishi kerak. Aks holda video fayl o'rniga kadrlar saqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:239
#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:406
msgid "Database"
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:243
msgid "database username, used to connect to PostgreSQL."
msgstr ""
"ma'lumotlar bazasi foydalanuvchi nomi, PostgreSQL'ga ulanish uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:247
msgid "database password, if using `password authentication`_."
msgstr "ma'lumotlar bazasi paroli, agar `password authentication`_ ishlatilsa."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:251
msgid "host for the database server"
msgstr "ma'lumotlar bazasi serveri uchun host"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:253
msgid "``localhost`` on Windows"
msgstr "Windows'da ``localhost``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:254
msgid "UNIX socket otherwise"
msgstr "aks holda UNIX socket"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:258
msgid "port the database listens on, defaults to 5432"
msgstr "ma'lumotlar bazasi tinglaydigan port, standart qiymati 5432"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:262
msgid "host for the replica database server, disabled when not set / empty"
msgstr ""
"replika ma'lumotlar bazasi serveri uchun host, belgilanmagan / bo'sh bo'lsa "
"o'chirilgan bo'ladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:266
msgid ""
"the port the replica database listens on, defaults to :option:`--db_port`"
msgstr ""
"replika ma'lumotlar bazasi tinglaydigan port, standart qiymati :option:`--"
"db_port`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:270
msgid ""
"hides databases that do not match ``<filter>`` for the Web UI. The filter is "
"a `regular expression`_, with the additions that:"
msgstr ""
"Web UI uchun ``<filter>``ga mos kelmaydigan ma'lumotlar bazalarini "
"yashiradi. Filtr `regular expression`_ bo'lib, quyidagi qo'shimchalar bilan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:273
msgid "``%h`` is replaced by the whole hostname the request is made on."
msgstr "``%h`` so'rov yuborilgan to'liq hostname bilan almashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:274
msgid ""
"``%d`` is replaced by the subdomain the request is made on, with the "
"exception of ``www`` (so domain ``odoo.com`` and ``www.odoo.com`` both match "
"the database ``odoo``)."
msgstr ""
"``%d`` so'rov yuborilgan subdomain bilan almashtiriladi, ``www`` bundan "
"mustasno (shuning uchun ``odoo.com`` va ``www.odoo.com`` domenlari ikkisi "
"ham ``odoo`` ma'lumotlar bazasiga mos keladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:278
msgid ""
"These operations are case sensitive. Add option ``(?i)`` to match all "
"databases (so domain ``odoo.com`` using ``(?i)%d`` matches the database "
"``Odoo``)."
msgstr ""
"Bu amallar harf registriga sezgir. Barcha ma'lumotlar bazalariga mos kelishi "
"uchun ``(?i)`` opsiyasini qo'shing (shunda ``(?i)%d`` ishlatgan ``odoo.com`` "
"domeni ``Odoo`` ma'lumotlar bazasiga mos keladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:282
msgid ""
"Since version 11, it's also possible to restrict access to a given database "
"listen by using the --database parameter and specifying a comma-separated "
"list of databases"
msgstr ""
"11-versiyadan boshlab --database parametridan foydalanib va vergul bilan "
"ajratilgan ma'lumotlar bazalari ro'yxatini ko'rsatib, ma'lum ma'lumotlar "
"bazalariga kirishni cheklash ham mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:286
msgid ""
"When combining the two parameters, db-filter supersedes the comma-separated "
"database list for restricting database list, while the comma-separated list "
"is used for performing requested operations like upgrade of modules."
msgstr ""
"Ikki parametr birgalikda ishlatilganda, ma'lumotlar bazalari ro'yxatini "
"cheklashda db-filter vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxatdan ustun turadi, vergul "
"bilan ajratilgan ro'yxat esa modullarni yangilash kabi so'ralgan amallarni "
"bajarish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:294
msgid "Restrict access to databases whose name starts with 11"
msgstr "Nomi 11 bilan boshlanadigan ma'lumotlar bazalariga kirishni cheklash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:300
msgid ""
"Restrict access to only two databases, 11firstdatabase and 11seconddatabase"
msgstr ""
"Faqat ikki ma'lumotlar bazasiga — 11firstdatabase va 11seconddatabase'ga "
"kirishni cheklash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:306
msgid ""
"Restrict access to only two databases, 11firstdatabase and 11seconddatabase, "
"and update base module on one database: 11firstdatabase. If database "
"11seconddatabase doesn't exist, the database is created and base modules is "
"installed"
msgstr ""
"Faqat ikki ma'lumotlar bazasiga — 11firstdatabase va 11seconddatabase'ga "
"kirishni cheklash va bitta ma'lumotlar bazasida — 11firstdatabase'da base "
"module'ni yangilash. Agar 11seconddatabase ma'lumotlar bazasi mavjud "
"bo'lmasa, ma'lumotlar bazasi yaratiladi va base modullari o'rnatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:315
msgid ""
"Restrict access to databases whose name starts with 11, and update base "
"module on one database: 11firstdatabase. If database 11seconddatabase "
"doesn't exist, the database is created and base modules is installed"
msgstr ""
"Nomi 11 bilan boshlanadigan ma'lumotlar bazalariga kirishni cheklash va "
"bitta ma'lumotlar bazasida — 11firstdatabase'da base module'ni yangilash. "
"Agar 11seconddatabase ma'lumotlar bazasi mavjud bo'lmasa, ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"yaratiladi va base modullari o'rnatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:320
msgid ""
"This option does not affect cron workers, if no --database is given, cron "
"workers will run on every available database"
msgstr ""
"Bu opsiya cron worker'larga ta'sir qilmaydi; agar --database berilmagan "
"bo'lsa, cron worker'lar mavjud har bir ma'lumotlar bazasida ishlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:324
msgid ""
"when creating new databases from the database-management screens, use the "
"specified `template database`_. Defaults to ``template0``."
msgstr ""
"ma'lumotlar bazasini boshqarish ekranlaridan yangi ma'lumotlar bazalari "
"yaratilganda ko'rsatilgan `template database`_ dan foydalanadi. Standart "
"qiymati ``template0``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:329
msgid ""
"Path to the PostgreSQL binaries that are used by the database manager to "
"dump and restore databases. You have to specify this option only if these "
"binaries are located in a non-standard directory."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumotlar bazasi menejeri ma'lumotlar bazalarini dump qilish va tiklash "
"uchun ishlatadigan PostgreSQL binary fayllariga yo'l. Bu opsiyani faqat "
"ushbu binary fayllar nostandart papkada joylashgan bo'lsa ko'rsatishingiz "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:335
msgid "Suppresses the ability to list databases available on the system"
msgstr ""
"Tizimda mavjud ma'lumotlar bazalari ro'yxatini ko'rish imkoniyatini o'chiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:339
msgid ""
"Control the SSL security of the connection between Odoo and PostgreSQL. "
"Value should be one of 'disable', 'allow', 'prefer', 'require', 'verify-ca' "
"or 'verify-full' Default value is 'prefer'"
msgstr ""
"Odoo va PostgreSQL orasidagi ulanishning SSL xavfsizligini boshqaradi. "
"Qiymat 'disable', 'allow', 'prefer', 'require', 'verify-ca' yoki 'verify-"
"full' dan biri bo'lishi kerak. Standart qiymati 'prefer'"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:346
msgid "Try to enable the unaccent extension when creating new databases"
msgstr ""
"Yangi ma'lumotlar bazalari yaratilganda unaccent extension'ini yoqishga "
"harakat qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:351
msgid "Emails"
msgstr "Elektron pochta"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:355
msgid "Email address used as <FROM> when Odoo needs to send mails"
msgstr ""
"Odoo xat yuborishi kerak bo'lganda <FROM> sifatida ishlatiladigan elektron "
"pochta manzili"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:359
msgid ""
"Define which email address the SMTP configuration will apply to. The field "
"can be a domain name or an entire email address, or it can remain empty. If "
"the sender's email address does not match this set filter, then the email "
"will be encapsulated using a combination of the two system parameters: "
"``mail.default.from`` and ``mail.catchall.domain``. For example, \"Admin\" "
"<admin\\@example.com> => \"Admin\" <notifications\\@mycompany.com>."
msgstr ""
"SMTP konfiguratsiyasi qaysi elektron pochta manziliga qo'llanishini "
"aniqlaydi. Field domen nomi yoki to'liq elektron pochta manzili bo'lishi "
"mumkin, yoki bo'sh qolishi mumkin. Agar jo'natuvchining elektron pochta "
"manzili bu belgilangan filtrga mos kelmasa, xat ikki tizim parametri "
"kombinatsiyasi yordamida qadoqlanadi: ``mail.default.from`` va "
"``mail.catchall.domain``. Masalan, \"Admin\" <admin\\@example.com> => "
"\"Admin\" <notifications\\@mycompany.com>."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:367
msgid "Address of the SMTP server to connect to in order to send mails"
msgstr "Xat yuborish uchun ulanadigan SMTP server manzili"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:373
msgid "If set, odoo should use SSL/STARTSSL SMTP connections"
msgstr ""
"Belgilangan bo'lsa, odoo SSL/STARTSSL SMTP ulanishlaridan foydalanishi kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:377
msgid "Username to connect to the SMTP server"
msgstr "SMTP serverga ulanish uchun foydalanuvchi nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:381
msgid "Password to connect to the SMTP server"
msgstr "SMTP serverga ulanish uchun parol"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:385
msgid ""
"An SSL certificate is to be used for authentication. If set, then `smtp-ssl-"
"private-key` is required."
msgstr ""
"Autentifikatsiya uchun SSL sertifikati ishlatiladi. Belgilangan bo'lsa, "
"`smtp-ssl-private-key` talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:390
msgid ""
"An SSL private key is used for authentication. If set, then `smtp-ssl-"
"certificate` is required."
msgstr ""
"Autentifikatsiya uchun SSL maxfiy kaliti ishlatiladi. Belgilangan bo'lsa, "
"`smtp-ssl-certificate` talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:395
msgid "Internationalisation"
msgstr "Xalqarolashtirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:399
msgid ""
"specifies the languages (separated by commas) for the translations you want "
"to be loaded"
msgstr ""
"yuklamoqchi bo'lgan tarjimalar uchun tillarni (vergul bilan ajratilgan) "
"ko'rsatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:404
msgid ""
"overwrites existing translation terms on updating a module or importing a "
"CSV or a PO file."
msgstr ""
"module yangilanganda yoki CSV yoki PO fayl import qilinganda mavjud tarjima "
"atamalarini qayta yozadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:410
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Qo'shimcha opsiyalar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:415
msgid "Developer features"
msgstr "Dasturchi imkoniyatlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:419
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of features. For development purposes only. Do not use "
"it in production. Possible features are:"
msgstr ""
"vergul bilan ajratilgan imkoniyatlar ro'yxati. Faqat ishlab chiqish "
"maqsadlarida. Uni production'da ishlatmang. Mumkin bo'lgan imkoniyatlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:422
msgid "``all``: alias for xml,reload,qweb,access"
msgstr "``all``: xml,reload,qweb,access uchun alias"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:424
msgid ""
"``xml``: read QWeb template from xml file directly instead of database. Once "
"a template has been modified in database, it will be not be read from the "
"xml file until the next update/init. Particularly, templates are not "
"translated on using this option."
msgstr ""
"``xml``: QWeb template'ni ma'lumotlar bazasi o'rniga to'g'ridan-to'g'ri xml "
"fayldan o'qiydi. Template ma'lumotlar bazasida o'zgartirilgandan so'ng, u "
"keyingi update/init gacha xml fayldan o'qilmaydi. Xususan, bu opsiyadan "
"foydalanilganda template'lar tarjima qilinmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:429
msgid ""
"``reload``: restart server when python file are updated (may not be detected "
"depending on the text editor used)"
msgstr ""
"``reload``: python fayllar yangilanganda serverni qayta ishga tushiradi "
"(ishlatilgan matn muharririga qarab aniqlanmasligi mumkin)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:432
msgid ""
"``qweb``: break in the evaluation of QWeb template when a node contains ``t-"
"debug='debugger'``"
msgstr ""
"``qweb``: node ``t-debug='debugger'`` ni o'z ichiga olganda QWeb template "
"hisoblanishini to'xtatadi (break)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:434
msgid ""
"``werkzeug``: display the full traceback on the frontend page in case of "
"exception"
msgstr ""
"``werkzeug``: exception yuz berganda frontend sahifasida to'liq traceback'ni "
"ko'rsatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:436
msgid ""
"``replica``: simulate :option:`--db_replica_host` but connect to the same "
"datbase server as :option:`--db_host`, this makes it possible to test read-"
"only features without the need to set up a replicated database."
msgstr ""
"``replica``: :option:`--db_replica_host` ni simulyatsiya qiladi, "
"lekin :option:`--db_host` bilan bir xil ma'lumotlar bazasi serveriga "
"ulanadi; bu replikatsiyalangan ma'lumotlar bazasini sozlamasdan faqat o'qish "
"uchun mo'ljallangan imkoniyatlarni sinash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:440
msgid ""
"``access``: log the traceback next to the AccessError when it results in a "
"403 - Forbidden HTTP response."
msgstr ""
"``access``: AccessError 403 - Forbidden HTTP javobiga olib kelganda, uning "
"yonida traceback'ni ham logga yozadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:447
#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:102
msgid "HTTP"
msgstr "HTTP"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:451
msgid ""
"do not start the HTTP or long-polling workers (may still start :ref:`cron "
"<reference/actions/cron>` workers)"
msgstr ""
"HTTP yoki long-polling worker'larini ishga tushirmaydi (:ref:`cron "
"<reference/actions/cron>` worker'lari baribir ishga tushishi mumkin)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:454
msgid ""
"has no effect if :option:`--test-enable` is set, as tests require an "
"accessible HTTP server"
msgstr ""
"agar :option:`--test-enable` o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, ta'sir qilmaydi, chunki "
"testlar uchun mavjud HTTP server talab qilinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:459
msgid ""
"TCP/IP address on which the HTTP server listens, defaults to ``0.0.0.0`` "
"(all addresses)"
msgstr ""
"HTTP server tinglaydigan TCP/IP manzil, sukut bo'yicha ``0.0.0.0`` (barcha "
"manzillar)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:465
msgid "Port on which the HTTP server listens, defaults to 8069."
msgstr "HTTP server tinglaydigan port, sukut bo'yicha 8069."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:469
msgid ""
"TCP port for websocket connections in multiprocessing or gevent mode, "
"defaults to 8072. Not used in default (threaded) mode."
msgstr ""
"Multiprocessing yoki gevent rejimida websocket ulanishlari uchun TCP port, "
"sukut bo'yicha 8072. Sukutdagi (threaded) rejimda ishlatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:474
msgid ""
"enables the use of ``X-Forwarded-*`` headers through `Werkzeug's proxy "
"support`_."
msgstr ""
"`Werkzeug's proxy support`_ orqali ``X-Forwarded-*`` header'laridan "
"foydalanishni yoqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:477
msgid ""
"It ignores all ``X-Forwarded-*`` headers in case ``X-Forwarded-Host`` is "
"missing from the request."
msgstr ""
"Agar so'rovda ``X-Forwarded-Host`` bo'lmasa, u barcha ``X-Forwarded-*`` "
"header'larini e'tiborsiz qoldiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:480
msgid ""
"It always gets the real IP from the last entry of the ``X-Forwarded-For`` "
"chain. Configure your web server accordingly using directives such as "
"nginx's `set_real_ip_from <https://nginx.org/en/docs/http/"
"ngx_http_realip_module.html>`_ in case there are other trusted proxies along "
"the chain that must be ignored."
msgstr ""
"U haqiqiy IP'ni har doim ``X-Forwarded-For`` zanjirining oxirgi yozuvidan "
"oladi. Agar zanjirda e'tiborsiz qoldirilishi kerak bo'lgan boshqa ishonchli "
"proxy'lar bo'lsa, web serveringizni nginx'ning `set_real_ip_from <https://"
"nginx.org/en/docs/http/ngx_http_realip_module.html>`_ kabi direktivalari "
"yordamida mos ravishda sozlang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:485
msgid ""
"``X-Forwarded-Proto`` and ``X-Forwarded-Host`` are used to update the "
"request root URL, which in turn is used to update the ``web.base.url`` "
"system parameter upon a successful admin authentication. This system "
"parameter is used to generate all links for the current database; "
"see :ref:`domain-name/existing/db-map/web-base-url`."
msgstr ""
"``X-Forwarded-Proto`` va ``X-Forwarded-Host`` so'rovning root URL'ini "
"yangilash uchun ishlatiladi, u esa o'z navbatida admin muvaffaqiyatli "
"autentifikatsiyadan o'tgach ``web.base.url`` tizim parametrini yangilash "
"uchun ishlatiladi. Bu tizim parametri joriy ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun barcha "
"havolalarni yaratishda qo'llaniladi; :ref:`domain-name/existing/db-map/web-"
"base-url` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:492
msgid "proxy mode *must not* be enabled outside of a reverse proxy scenario"
msgstr ""
"proxy rejimi reverse proxy stsenariysidan tashqarida *yoqilmasligi kerak*"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:497
msgid ""
"delegates serving attachments files to the static web server and sets both "
"``X-Sendfile`` (apache) and ``X-Accel-*`` (nginx) http headers on stream "
"responses. See :ref:`deploy/streaming` for web server configuration."
msgstr ""
"biriktirma fayllarni uzatishni statik web serverga yuklaydi va stream "
"javoblarida ``X-Sendfile`` (apache) hamda ``X-Accel-*`` (nginx) http "
"header'larining ikkalasini ham o'rnatadi. Web server sozlamalari "
"uchun :ref:`deploy/streaming` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:504
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "Logging"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:506
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo displays all logging of level_ ``INFO``, ``WARNING`` and "
"``ERROR``. All logs independently of the level are output on ``stderr``. "
"Various options are available to redirect logging to other destinations and "
"to customize the verbosity."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha Odoo level_ ``INFO``, ``WARNING`` va ``ERROR`` darajasidagi "
"barcha loglarni ko'rsatadi. Barcha loglar darajasidan qat'i nazar ``stderr`` "
"ga chiqariladi. Logging'ni boshqa manzillarga yo'naltirish va batafsillik "
"darajasini moslashtirish uchun turli opsiyalar mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:512
msgid ""
"sends logging output to the specified file instead of ``stderr``. On Unix, "
"the file `can be managed by external log rotation programs <https://"
"docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#watchedfilehandler>`_ and "
"will automatically be reopened when replaced"
msgstr ""
"logging natijasini ``stderr`` o'rniga ko'rsatilgan faylga yuboradi. Unix'da "
"fayl `tashqi log rotatsiya programmalari bilan boshqarilishi mumkin <https://"
"docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#watchedfilehandler>`_ va "
"almashtirilganda avtomatik ravishda qayta ochiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:519
msgid ""
"logs to the system's event logger: `syslog on unices <https://"
"docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#sysloghandler>`_ and `the "
"Event Log on Windows <https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"logging.handlers.html#nteventloghandler>`_."
msgstr ""
"tizimning event logger'iga yozadi: `unix tizimlarida syslog <https://"
"docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#sysloghandler>`_ va "
"`Windows'da Event Log <https://docs.python.org/3/library/"
"logging.handlers.html#nteventloghandler>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:522
msgid "Neither is configurable"
msgstr "Ikkalasi ham sozlanmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:526
msgid ""
"logs to the ``ir.logging`` model (``ir_logging`` table) of the specified "
"database. The database can be the name of a database in the \"current\" "
"PostgreSQL, or `a PostgreSQL URI`_ for e.g. log aggregation."
msgstr ""
"ko'rsatilgan ma'lumotlar bazasining ``ir.logging`` model'iga (``ir_logging`` "
"jadvaliga) yozadi. Ma'lumotlar bazasi \"joriy\" PostgreSQL'dagi baza nomi "
"bo'lishi mumkin yoki, masalan, loglarni jamlashtirish uchun `a PostgreSQL "
"URI`_ bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:532
msgid ""
":samp:`{LOGGER}:{LEVEL}`, enables ``LOGGER`` at the provided ``LEVEL`` e.g. "
"``odoo.models:DEBUG`` will enable all logging messages at or above ``DEBUG`` "
"level in the models."
msgstr ""
":samp:`{LOGGER}:{LEVEL}`, ``LOGGER`` ni berilgan ``LEVEL`` darajasida "
"yoqadi; masalan, ``odoo.models:DEBUG`` model'lardagi ``DEBUG`` darajasi va "
"undan yuqori barcha logging xabarlarini yoqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:536
msgid "The colon ``:`` is mandatory"
msgstr "Ikki nuqta ``:`` majburiy"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:537
msgid "The logger can be omitted to configure the root (default) handler"
msgstr ""
"root (sukutdagi) handler'ni sozlash uchun logger'ni tushirib qoldirish mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:538
msgid "If the level is omitted, the logger is set to ``INFO``"
msgstr "Agar daraja ko'rsatilmasa, logger ``INFO`` ga o'rnatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:540
msgid "The option can be repeated to configure multiple loggers e.g."
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta logger'ni sozlash uchun opsiyani takrorlash mumkin, masalan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:548
msgid ""
"enables DEBUG logging of HTTP requests and responses, equivalent to ``--log-"
"handler=odoo.http:DEBUG``"
msgstr ""
"HTTP so'rov va javoblarining DEBUG logging'ini yoqadi, ``--log-"
"handler=odoo.http:DEBUG`` ga teng"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:553
msgid ""
"enables DEBUG logging of SQL querying, equivalent to ``--log-"
"handler=odoo.sql_db:DEBUG``"
msgstr ""
"SQL so'rovlarining DEBUG logging'ini yoqadi, ``--log-"
"handler=odoo.sql_db:DEBUG`` ga teng"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:558
msgid ""
"Shortcut to more easily set predefined levels on specific loggers. \"real\" "
"levels (``critical``, ``error``, ``warn``, ``debug``) are set on the "
"``odoo`` and ``werkzeug`` loggers (except for ``debug`` which is only set on "
"``odoo``)."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan logger'larga oldindan belgilangan darajalarni osonroq o'rnatish "
"uchun qisqartma. \"haqiqiy\" darajalar (``critical``, ``error``, ``warn``, "
"``debug``) ``odoo`` va ``werkzeug`` logger'lariga o'rnatiladi (faqat "
"``odoo`` ga o'rnatiladigan ``debug`` bundan mustasno)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:563
msgid ""
"Odoo also provides debugging pseudo-levels which apply to different sets of "
"loggers:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo shuningdek turli logger to'plamlariga qo'llaniladigan debugging psevdo-"
"darajalarini ham taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:568
msgid "``debug_sql``"
msgstr "``debug_sql``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:567
msgid "sets the SQL logger to ``debug``"
msgstr "SQL logger'ini ``debug`` ga o'rnatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:569
msgid "equivalent to ``--log-sql``"
msgstr "``--log-sql`` ga teng"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:572
msgid "``debug_rpc``"
msgstr "``debug_rpc``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:571
msgid "sets the ``odoo`` and HTTP request loggers to ``debug``"
msgstr "``odoo`` va HTTP so'rov logger'larini ``debug`` ga o'rnatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:573
msgid "equivalent to ``--log-level debug --log-request``"
msgstr "``--log-level debug --log-request`` ga teng"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:578
msgid "``debug_rpc_answer``"
msgstr "``debug_rpc_answer``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:575
msgid "sets the ``odoo`` and HTTP request and response loggers to ``debug``"
msgstr ""
"``odoo`` hamda HTTP so'rov va javob logger'larini ``debug`` ga o'rnatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:578
msgid "equivalent to ``--log-level debug --log-request --log-response``"
msgstr "``--log-level debug --log-request --log-response`` ga teng"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:582
msgid ""
"In case of conflict between :option:`--log-level` and :option:`--log-"
"handler`, the latter is used"
msgstr ""
":option:`--log-level` va :option:`--log-handler` o'rtasida ziddiyat yuzaga "
"kelsa, ikkinchisi ishlatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:588
msgid "Multiprocessing"
msgstr "Multiprocessing"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:592
msgid ""
"if ``count`` is not 0 (the default), enables multiprocessing and sets up the "
"specified number of HTTP workers (sub-processes processing HTTP and RPC "
"requests)."
msgstr ""
"agar ``count`` 0 ga teng bo'lmasa (sukutdagi qiymat), multiprocessing'ni "
"yoqadi va ko'rsatilgan sondagi HTTP worker'larini (HTTP va RPC so'rovlarini "
"qayta ishlaydigan sub-protsesslarni) sozlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:596
msgid "multiprocessing mode is only available on Unix-based systems"
msgstr "multiprocessing rejimi faqat Unix asosidagi tizimlarda mavjud"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:598
msgid "A number of options allow limiting and recycling workers:"
msgstr ""
"Bir qancha opsiyalar worker'larni cheklash va qayta ishga tushirish imkonini "
"beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:602
msgid ""
"Number of requests a worker will process before being recycled and restarted."
msgstr ""
"Worker qayta ishga tushirilishidan oldin qayta ishlaydigan so'rovlar soni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:605
msgid "Defaults to *8196*."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha *8196*."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:609
msgid ""
"Maximum allowed virtual memory per worker in bytes. If the limit is "
"exceeded, the worker is killed and recycled at the end of the current "
"request."
msgstr ""
"Har bir worker uchun ruxsat etilgan maksimal virtual xotira (baytlarda). "
"Agar chek oshib ketsa, worker joriy so'rov tugagach to'xtatiladi va qayta "
"ishga tushiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:612
msgid "Defaults to *2048MiB (2048\\*1024\\*1024B)*."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha *2048MiB (2048\\*1024\\*1024B)*."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:616
msgid ""
"Hard limit on virtual memory in bytes, any worker exceeding the limit will "
"be immediately killed without waiting for the end of the current request "
"processing."
msgstr ""
"Virtual xotira uchun qat'iy chek (baytlarda); chekdan oshgan har qanday "
"worker joriy so'rovning qayta ishlanishi tugashini kutmasdan darhol "
"to'xtatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:620
msgid "Defaults to *2560MiB (2560\\*1024\\*1024B)*."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha *2560MiB (2560\\*1024\\*1024B)*."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:624
msgid ""
"Prevents the worker from using more than <limit> CPU seconds for each "
"request. If the limit is exceeded, the worker is killed."
msgstr ""
"Worker'ning har bir so'rov uchun <limit> CPU sekundidan ko'proq "
"foydalanishiga yo'l qo'ymaydi. Agar chek oshib ketsa, worker to'xtatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:627
msgid "Defaults to *60*."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha *60*."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:631
msgid ""
"Prevents the worker from taking longer than <limit> seconds to process a "
"request. If the limit is exceeded, the worker is killed."
msgstr ""
"Worker'ning so'rovni qayta ishlashga <limit> sekunddan ko'proq vaqt "
"sarflashiga yo'l qo'ymaydi. Agar chek oshib ketsa, worker to'xtatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:634
msgid ""
"Differs from :option:`--limit-time-cpu` in that this is a \"wall time\" "
"limit including e.g. SQL queries."
msgstr ""
":option:`--limit-time-cpu` dan farqi shundaki, bu \"wall time\" cheki "
"bo'lib, masalan SQL so'rovlarini ham o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:637
msgid "Defaults to *120*."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha *120*."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:641
msgid ""
"number of workers dedicated to :ref:`cron <reference/actions/cron>` jobs. "
"Defaults to *2*. The workers are threads in multi-threading mode and "
"processes in multi-processing mode."
msgstr ""
":ref:`cron <reference/actions/cron>` vazifalari uchun ajratilgan worker'lar "
"soni. Sukut bo'yicha *2*. Worker'lar multi-threading rejimida thread'lar, "
"multi-processing rejimida esa protsesslar hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:644
msgid ""
"For multi-processing mode, this is in addition to the HTTP worker processes."
msgstr ""
"Multi-processing rejimida bu HTTP worker protsesslariga qo'shimcha "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:648
msgid ""
"Soft limit on how long a :ref:`cron <reference/actions/cron>` thread/worker "
"is allowed to live before is is restarted, in seconds."
msgstr ""
":ref:`cron <reference/actions/cron>` thread/worker'i qayta ishga "
"tushirilishidan oldin qancha vaqt yashashi mumkinligi uchun yumshoq chek "
"(sekundlarda)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:651
msgid "Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "O'chirish uchun 0 ga o'rnating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:653
msgid "Defaults to *0*."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha *0*."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:658
msgid "Configuration file"
msgstr "Konfiguratsiya fayli"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:662
msgid ""
"Most of the command-line options can also be specified via a configuration "
"file. Most of the time, they use similar names with the prefix ``-`` removed "
"and other ``-`` are replaced by ``_`` e.g. :option:`--db-template` becomes "
"``db_template``."
msgstr ""
"Buyruq satri opsiyalarining ko'pchiligini configuration fayl orqali ham "
"ko'rsatish mumkin. Ko'p hollarda ular o'xshash nomlardan foydalanadi: "
"boshidagi ``-`` prefiksi olib tashlanadi, qolgan ``-`` belgilari esa ``_`` "
"bilan almashtiriladi, masalan :option:`--db-template` ``db_template`` ga "
"aylanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:667
msgid "Some conversions don't match the pattern:"
msgstr "Ba'zi o'girishlar bu qoidaga mos kelmaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:669
msgid ":option:`--db-filter` becomes ``dbfilter``"
msgstr ":option:`--db-filter` ``dbfilter`` ga aylanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:670
msgid ":option:`--no-http` corresponds to the ``http_enable`` boolean"
msgstr ":option:`--no-http` ``http_enable`` boolean qiymatiga mos keladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:671
msgid ""
"logging presets (all options starting with ``--log-`` except for :option:`--"
"log-handler` and :option:`--log-db`) just add content to ``log_handler``, "
"use that directly in the configuration file"
msgstr ""
"logging presetlari (:option:`--log-handler` va :option:`--log-db` dan "
"tashqari ``--log-`` bilan boshlanadigan barcha opsiyalar) shunchaki "
"``log_handler`` ga qiymat qo'shadi; configuration faylda to'g'ridan-to'g'ri "
"shundan foydalaning"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:674
msgid ":option:`--smtp` is stored as ``smtp_server``"
msgstr ":option:`--smtp` ``smtp_server`` sifatida saqlanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:675
msgid ":option:`--database` is stored as ``db_name``"
msgstr ":option:`--database` ``db_name`` sifatida saqlanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:679
msgid ""
"The default configuration file is :file:`{$HOME}/.odoorc` which can be "
"overridden using :option:`--config <odoo-bin -c>`. Specifying :option:`--"
"save <odoo-bin -s>` will save the current configuration state back to that "
"file. The configuration items relative to the command-line are to be "
"specified in the section ``[options]``."
msgstr ""
"Standart configuration fayl :file:`{$HOME}/.odoorc` bo'lib, uni :option:`--"
"config <odoo-bin -c>` yordamida o'zgartirish mumkin. :option:`--save <odoo-"
"bin -s>` ko'rsatilsa, joriy configuration holati shu faylga qaytib "
"saqlanadi. Buyruq satriga tegishli configuration elementlari ``[options]`` "
"bo'limida ko'rsatilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:685
msgid "Here is a sample file:"
msgstr "Namuna fayl:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:711
msgid "`shell` - Open a Shell"
msgstr "`shell` - Shell ochish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:713
msgid ""
"The Odoo command line also allows launching Odoo as a Python console "
"environment, enabling direct interaction with the :ref:`orm <reference/orm>` "
"and its functionalities. Since running a shell involves starting the server, "
"the configuration file options do apply."
msgstr ""
"Odoo buyruq satri Odoo'ni Python console environment sifatida ishga "
"tushirish imkonini ham beradi — bu :ref:`orm <reference/orm>` va uning "
"funksionalligi bilan bevosita ishlashga yo'l ochadi. Shell'ni ishga "
"tushirish server'ni ham ishga tushirishni talab qilgani uchun configuration "
"fayl opsiyalari amal qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:723
msgid "Adding an exclamation mark to all contacts' names:"
msgstr "Barcha contact'lar nomiga undov belgisi qo'shish:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:739
msgid ""
"By default, the shell is running in transaction mode. This means that any "
"change made to the database is rolled back when exiting the shell. To commit "
"changes, use `env.cr.commit()`."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha shell transaction rejimida ishlaydi. Bu shuni bildiradi: "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga kiritilgan har qanday o'zgarish shell'dan chiqishda "
"bekor qilinadi. O'zgarishlarni commit qilish uchun `env.cr.commit()` dan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:745
msgid ""
"Specify a Python script to be run after the start of the shell. Overrides "
"the environment variable `PYTHONSTARTUP`."
msgstr ""
"Shell ishga tushgandan keyin bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan Python script'ni "
"ko'rsatadi. `PYTHONSTARTUP` environment o'zgaruvchisini override qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:750
msgid ""
"Specify a preferred `REPL` to use in shell mode. This shell is started with "
"the `env` variable already initialized to be able to access the `ORM` and "
"other Odoo modules."
msgstr ""
"Shell rejimida ishlatish uchun afzal ko'rilgan `REPL` ni ko'rsatadi. Bu "
"shell `env` o'zgaruvchisi allaqachon initsializatsiya qilingan holda ishga "
"tushiriladi, shuning uchun `ORM` va boshqa Odoo modullariga murojaat qilish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:755
msgid ":ref:`reference/orm/environment`"
msgstr ":ref:`reference/orm/environment`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:761
msgid "`db` - Manage a Database"
msgstr "`db` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini boshqarish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:765
msgid ""
"This command lets you manage databases through a command-line interface. The "
"operations are specified using subcommands."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq ma'lumotlar bazalarini buyruq satri interfeysi orqali boshqarish "
"imkonini beradi. Amallar subcommand'lar yordamida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:768
#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:969
msgid ""
"For all subcommands, these options to configure your environment are "
"available:"
msgstr ""
"Barcha subcommand'lar uchun environment'ni sozlash bo'yicha quyidagi "
"opsiyalar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:771
#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:972
#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1093
msgid ":option:`--config <odoo-bin -c>`"
msgstr ":option:`--config <odoo-bin -c>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:772
msgid ":option:`--data-dir <odoo-bin -d>`"
msgstr ":option:`--data-dir <odoo-bin -d>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:773
msgid ":option:`--db_user <odoo-bin --db_user>`"
msgstr ":option:`--db_user <odoo-bin --db_user>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:774
msgid ":option:`--db_password <odoo-bin --db_password>`"
msgstr ":option:`--db_password <odoo-bin --db_password>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:775
msgid ":option:`--db_host <odoo-bin --db_host>`"
msgstr ":option:`--db_host <odoo-bin --db_host>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:776
msgid ":option:`--db_port <odoo-bin --db_port>`"
msgstr ":option:`--db_port <odoo-bin --db_port>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:777
msgid ":option:`--db_sslmode <odoo-bin --db_sslmode>`"
msgstr ":option:`--db_sslmode <odoo-bin --db_sslmode>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:778
msgid ":option:`--pg_path <odoo-bin --pg_path>`"
msgstr ":option:`--pg_path <odoo-bin --pg_path>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:784
msgid "`db init` - Initialize a Database"
msgstr "`db init` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini initsializatsiya qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:788
msgid ""
"This command creates a new database and installs the `base` module. You can "
"specify the language and country of the main company."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq yangi ma'lumotlar bazasini yaratadi va `base` modulini o'rnatadi. "
"Asosiy kompaniyaning tili va davlatini ko'rsatishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:797
msgid "Name of the database to be initialized."
msgstr "Initsializatsiya qilinadigan ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:801
msgid "Install demo data in the initialized database."
msgstr ""
"Initsializatsiya qilingan ma'lumotlar bazasiga demo ma'lumotlarni o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:805
msgid ""
"Delete the database if it already exists, before initializing the new one."
msgstr ""
"Yangisini initsializatsiya qilishdan oldin, agar ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"allaqachon mavjud bo'lsa, uni o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:809
msgid "Code of the country to be set on the main company"
msgstr "Asosiy kompaniyaga o'rnatiladigan davlat kodi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:813
msgid "Default language for the instance, default `en_US`"
msgstr "Instance uchun standart til, sukut bo'yicha `en_US`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:817
msgid "Username for the new database, default `admin`"
msgstr ""
"Yangi ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun foydalanuvchi nomi, sukut bo'yicha `admin`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:821
msgid "Password for the new database, default `admin`"
msgstr "Yangi ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun parol, sukut bo'yicha `admin`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:827
msgid "`db dump` - Save a Database Dump"
msgstr "`db dump` - Ma'lumotlar bazasi dump'ini saqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:831
msgid "Creates a dump file."
msgstr "Dump fayl yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:839
msgid "Name of the database to dump."
msgstr "Dump qilinadigan ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:843
msgid ""
"(Optional) Database is dumped to specified path. By default it is dumped to "
"`stdout`."
msgstr ""
"(Ixtiyoriy) Ma'lumotlar bazasi ko'rsatilgan yo'lga dump qilinadi. Sukut "
"bo'yicha `stdout` ga dump qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:848
msgid ""
"If provided, database is dumped used the specified format. Supported formats "
"are `zip` (default), `dump` (pg_dump format)."
msgstr ""
"Agar ko'rsatilsa, ma'lumotlar bazasi berilgan formatda dump qilinadi. "
"Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan formatlar: `zip` (sukut bo'yicha), `dump` (pg_dump "
"formati)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:853
msgid "If provided, zip database is dumped without filestore"
msgstr "Agar ko'rsatilsa, zip ma'lumotlar bazasi filestore'siz dump qilinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:859
msgid "`db load` - Load a Database Dump"
msgstr "`db load` - Ma'lumotlar bazasi dump'ini yuklash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:863
msgid "Loads a dump file into an Odoo database, the dump file can be a URL."
msgstr ""
"Dump faylni Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasiga yuklaydi; dump fayl URL ham bo'lishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:871
msgid ""
"(Optional) Name of the database to create from the dump. If not provided, "
"the dump filename without extension is used."
msgstr ""
"(Ixtiyoriy) Dump'dan yaratiladigan ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi. Agar "
"ko'rsatilmasa, dump faylining kengaytmasiz nomi ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:876
msgid "`.zip` or `pg_dump` file to be loaded."
msgstr "Yuklanadigan `.zip` yoki `pg_dump` fayl."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:880
msgid "Delete the database if it already exists, before loading the new one."
msgstr ""
"Yangisini yuklashdan oldin, agar ma'lumotlar bazasi allaqachon mavjud "
"bo'lsa, uni o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:884
msgid "Neutralize the database after restoring it."
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasini tiklagandan keyin neytrallashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:890
msgid "`db duplicate` - Duplicate a Database"
msgstr "`db duplicate` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini nusxalash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:894
msgid "Duplicate a database including filestore."
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasini filestore bilan birga nusxalaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:902
msgid "Name of the source database."
msgstr "Manba ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:906
msgid "Name of the target database."
msgstr "Maqsadli ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:910
msgid "Neutralize the database, after restoring it."
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasini tiklagandan keyin neytrallashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:914
msgid ""
"Delete the target database if it already exists, before initializing the new "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Yangisini initsializatsiya qilishdan oldin, agar maqsadli ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"allaqachon mavjud bo'lsa, uni o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:920
msgid "`db rename` - Rename a Database"
msgstr "`db rename` - Ma'lumotlar bazasi nomini o'zgartirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:924
msgid "Rename a database from an old name to a new one."
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasining eski nomini yangisiga o'zgartiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:932
msgid "Current name of the database."
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasining joriy nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:936
msgid "New name for the database."
msgstr "Ma'lumotlar bazasi uchun yangi nom."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:940
msgid ""
"Delete the target database if it already exists, before renaming the source "
"one."
msgstr ""
"Manba ma'lumotlar bazasi nomini o'zgartirishdan oldin, agar maqsadli "
"ma'lumotlar bazasi allaqachon mavjud bo'lsa, uni o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:946
msgid "`db drop` - Delete a Database"
msgstr "`db drop` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini o'chirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:956
msgid "Name of the database to drop."
msgstr "O'chirilishi kerak bo'lgan ma'lumotlar bazasi nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:962
msgid "`i18n` - Internationalization"
msgstr "`i18n` - Xalqarolashtirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:966
msgid ""
"This command has subcommands that enable you to import or export "
"internationalization files and setup languages on the Odoo instance."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq internationalization fayllarini import yoki export qilish va Odoo "
"instance'da tillarni sozlash imkonini beruvchi subcommand'larga ega."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:977
msgid "Language codes must follow the XPG (POSIX) locale format."
msgstr "Til kodlari XPG (POSIX) locale formatiga mos bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:979
msgid "To list available codes, you can search them querying the database:"
msgstr ""
"Mavjud kodlar ro'yxatini ko'rish uchun ularni ma'lumotlar bazasiga so'rov "
"berib qidirishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:987
msgid ""
"`GNU libc Locale Names <https://www.gnu.org/software/libc/manual/html_node/"
"Locale-Names.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`GNU libc Locale Names <https://www.gnu.org/software/libc/manual/html_node/"
"Locale-Names.html>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1000
msgid "`i18n import` - Import i18n files"
msgstr "`i18n import` - i18n fayllarini import qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1004
msgid ""
"This command imports provided translation files in the `.po` or `.csv` "
"formats. By default, only new entries will be added, but you can choose to "
"overwrite existing terms. All the files must refer to the specified language."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq berilgan tarjima fayllarini `.po` yoki `.csv` formatlarida import "
"qiladi. Sukut bo'yicha faqat yangi yozuvlar qo'shiladi, lekin mavjud "
"atamalarni qayta yozishni ham tanlashingiz mumkin. Barcha fayllar "
"ko'rsatilgan tilga tegishli bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1014
msgid "List of files to be imported."
msgstr "Import qilinadigan fayllar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1015
msgid "Allowed extensions: `.po`, `.csv`."
msgstr "Ruxsat etilgan kengaytmalar: `.po`, `.csv`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1019
msgid "(Required) Language code of the translations in the files."
msgstr "(Majburiy) Fayllardagi tarjimalarning til kodi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1023
msgid "Overwrite existing translation when importing."
msgstr "Import qilishda mavjud tarjimani qayta yozish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1029
msgid "`i18n export` - Export i18n files"
msgstr "`i18n export` - i18n fayllarini export qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1033
msgid ""
"This command exports existing translation terms for modules in the Odoo "
"database to a range of formats: `.po`, `.pot`, `.tgz`, `.csv`. In case of "
"`.po` and `.pot` files, they will be created under the `i18n/` folder of the "
"module they belong to. If you specify an output parameter, only one language "
"can be selected, and all the output will refer to that language. The `.tgz` "
"output format makes all output be archived in a single file."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasidagi modullar uchun mavjud tarjima "
"atamalarini bir qator formatlarga export qiladi: `.po`, `.pot`, `.tgz`, "
"`.csv`. `.po` va `.pot` fayllari holatida ular o'zlari tegishli bo'lgan "
"modulning `i18n/` papkasi ostida yaratiladi. Agar output parametrini "
"ko'rsatsangiz, faqat bitta tilni tanlash mumkin va butun chiqish shu tilga "
"tegishli bo'ladi. `.tgz` chiqish formati barcha chiqishni yagona faylga "
"arxivlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1046
msgid "List of modules you want to export the internationalization files from."
msgstr ""
"Internationalization fayllarini export qilmoqchi bo'lgan modullar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1050
msgid ""
"List of language codes you want to export, `pot` for template (default)."
msgstr ""
"Export qilmoqchi bo'lgan til kodlari ro'yxati, shablon uchun `pot` (sukut "
"bo'yicha)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1054
msgid ""
"Path of an only output file with translations from all provided modules."
msgstr ""
"Barcha berilgan modullardan olingan tarjimalarni o'z ichiga oluvchi yagona "
"chiqish faylining yo'li."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1055
msgid "Allowed extensions: `.po`, `.pot`, `.tgz`, `.csv`"
msgstr "Ruxsat etilgan kengaytmalar: `.po`, `.pot`, `.tgz`, `.csv`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1056
msgid "If `-` is provided, the content is written as a `.po` file to stdout."
msgstr "Agar `-` berilsa, kontent stdout'ga `.po` fayl sifatida yoziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1058
msgid "Only one language is allowed when this option is active."
msgstr "Bu option faol bo'lganda faqat bitta tilga ruxsat beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1064
msgid "`i18n loadlang` - Load language"
msgstr "`i18n loadlang` - Tilni yuklash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1068
msgid ""
"This command loads one of the available languages into the Odoo database and "
"activates it."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq mavjud tillardan birini Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasiga yuklaydi va uni "
"faollashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1076
msgid "language codes of the languages to be installed."
msgstr "o'rnatilishi kerak bo'lgan tillarning til kodlari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1082
msgid "`module` - Manage modules"
msgstr "`module` - Modullarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1086
msgid ""
"This command has subcommands that enable you to install, uninstall and "
"upgrade modules on the Odoo instance. There's also a command to force "
"install the demo data into the database."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq Odoo instance'da modullarni o'rnatish, o'chirish va yangilash "
"imkonini beruvchi subcommand'larga ega. Shuningdek, ma'lumotlar bazasiga "
"demo ma'lumotlarni majburiy o'rnatish buyrug'i ham mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1090
msgid "For all subcommands, these options are available:"
msgstr "Barcha subcommand'lar uchun quyidagi option'lar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1100
msgid "`module install` - Install modules"
msgstr "`module install` - Modullarni o'rnatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1104
msgid "This command installs all selected modules straight away."
msgstr "Bu buyruq tanlangan barcha modullarni darhol o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1106
msgid ""
"Before installing modules, the Odoo database needs to be created and "
"initialized on your PostgreSQL instance, e.g. using the :ref:`reference/"
"cmdline/db/init` command."
msgstr ""
"Modullarni o'rnatishdan oldin Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasi PostgreSQL "
"instance'ingizda yaratilgan va initsializatsiya qilingan bo'lishi kerak, "
"masalan :ref:`reference/cmdline/db/init` buyrug'i yordamida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1115
msgid "List of modules you want to install."
msgstr "O'rnatmoqchi bo'lgan modullar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1121
msgid "`module uninstall` - Uninstall modules"
msgstr "`module uninstall` - Modullarni o'chirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1125
msgid "This command uninstalls all selected modules straight away."
msgstr "Bu buyruq tanlangan barcha modullarni darhol o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1133
msgid "List of modules you want to uninstall."
msgstr "O'chirmoqchi bo'lgan modullar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1139
msgid "`module upgrade` - Upgrade modules"
msgstr "`module upgrade` - Modullarni yangilash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1143
msgid "This command upgrades all selected modules straight away."
msgstr "Bu buyruq tanlangan barcha modullarni darhol yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1151
msgid ""
"List of modules you want to upgrade. Use ``base`` or ``all`` for all "
"installed modules."
msgstr ""
"Yangilamoqchi bo'lgan modullar ro'yxati. Barcha o'rnatilgan modullar uchun "
"``base`` yoki ``all`` dan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1156
msgid ""
"Only update modules that have a newer version on disk. If ``all`` is used as "
"``modules`` argument, this applies to all installed modules."
msgstr ""
"Faqat diskda yangiroq versiyasi bo'lgan modullarni yangilaydi. Agar "
"``modules`` argumenti sifatida ``all`` ishlatilsa, bu barcha o'rnatilgan "
"modullarga tegishli bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1163
msgid "`module forcedemo` - Force demo data install"
msgstr "`module forcedemo` - Demo ma'lumotlarni majburiy o'rnatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1167
msgid ""
"This command forces the installation of :ref:`Demo Data <tutorials/"
"define_module_data/demo_data>`"
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq :ref:`Demo Data <tutorials/define_module_data/demo_data>` "
"o'rnatilishini majburlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1171
msgid ""
"Once installed, there is no way to undo it, so you might want to save a "
"backup of the database first with the command :ref:`db dump <reference/"
"cmdline/db/dump>`"
msgstr ""
"O'rnatilgandan so'ng uni bekor qilish imkoni yo'q, shuning uchun "
"avval :ref:`db dump <reference/cmdline/db/dump>` buyrug'i bilan ma'lumotlar "
"bazasining zaxira nusxasini saqlashni xohlashingiz mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1174
msgid "There are no additional options to this command."
msgstr "Bu buyruq uchun qo'shimcha option'lar yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1180
msgid "`neutralize` - Neutralize a Database"
msgstr "`neutralize` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini neutralize qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1184
msgid ""
"The Odoo command line allows for neutralizing a database as well. The "
"command must be run with a database option."
msgstr ""
"Odoo command line ma'lumotlar bazasini neutralize qilish imkonini ham "
"beradi. Buyruq database option bilan ishga tushirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1193
msgid "Specify the database name that you would like to neutralize."
msgstr "Neutralize qilmoqchi bo'lgan ma'lumotlar bazasi nomini ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1198
msgid "Output the neutralization SQL instead of applying it"
msgstr "Neutralizatsiya SQL'ini qo'llash o'rniga uni chiqarish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1201
msgid ":doc:`../../administration/neutralized_database`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../administration/neutralized_database`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1206
msgid "`scaffold` - Scaffold a Module"
msgstr "`scaffold` - Modulni scaffold qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1210
msgid ""
"Scaffolding is the automated creation of a skeleton structure to simplify "
"bootstrapping (of new modules, in the case of Odoo). While not necessary it "
"avoids the tedium of setting up basic structures and looking up what all "
"starting requirements are."
msgstr ""
"Scaffolding — bu bootstrapping'ni soddalashtirish uchun skelet strukturasini "
"avtomatik yaratish (Odoo holatida yangi modullar uchun). Bu shart bo'lmasa-"
"da, asosiy strukturalarni sozlash va barcha boshlang'ich talablarni izlash "
"kabi zerikarli ishlardan qutqaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1215
msgid ""
"Scaffolding is available via the :command:`odoo-bin scaffold` subcommand."
msgstr "Scaffolding :command:`odoo-bin scaffold` subcommand'i orqali mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1223
msgid ""
"the name of the module to create, may munged in various manners to generate "
"programmatic names (e.g. module directory name, model names, …)"
msgstr ""
"yaratilishi kerak bo'lgan modul nomi; programmatik nomlarni (masalan modul "
"papkasi nomi, model nomlari, …) generatsiya qilish uchun turli usullarda "
"o'zgartirilishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1228
msgid ""
"directory in which to create the new module, defaults to the current "
"directory"
msgstr "yangi modul yaratiladigan papka, sukut bo'yicha joriy papka"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1233
msgid ""
"a template directory, files are passed through jinja2_ then copied to the "
"``destination`` directory"
msgstr ""
"shablon papkasi; fayllar jinja2_ orqali o'tkaziladi, so'ngra ``destination`` "
"papkasiga ko'chiriladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1237
msgid "This will create module *my_module* in directory */addons/*."
msgstr "Bu */addons/* papkasida *my_module* modulini yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1242
msgid "`populate` - Populate a Database"
msgstr "`populate` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini to'ldirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1246
msgid ""
"Odoo Populate allows to duplicate existing data in a given database. This "
"can be used for testing and benchmarking when large tables are needed. The "
"duplication process introduces variation for some fields to respect `UNIQUE` "
"constraints, among other things. It also follows x2Many relationships."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Populate berilgan ma'lumotlar bazasidagi mavjud ma'lumotlarni nusxalash "
"imkonini beradi. Bundan katta jadvallar kerak bo'lganda test va benchmarking "
"uchun foydalanish mumkin. Nusxalash jarayoni, boshqa narsalar qatorida, "
"`UNIQUE` constraint'larga rioya qilish uchun ba'zi field'larga o'zgarish "
"kiritadi. Shuningdek, u x2Many aloqalarini ham kuzatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1257
msgid "name of the database to populate"
msgstr "to'ldiriladigan ma'lumotlar bazasi nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1261
msgid ""
"list of models to populate. Models appearing twice will only be populated "
"once."
msgstr ""
"to'ldiriladigan modellar ro'yxati. Ikki marta uchraydigan modellar faqat bir "
"marta to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1265
msgid ""
"list of populate factors. In case a factor is missing for a model, the last "
"factor in the list will be used."
msgstr ""
"populate faktorlari ro'yxati. Agar model uchun faktor ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, "
"ro'yxatdagi oxirgi faktor ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1270
msgid "separator used to generate record names"
msgstr "record nomlarini generatsiya qilish uchun ishlatiladigan ajratuvchi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1275
msgid "`cloc` - Count Lines of Code"
msgstr "`cloc` - Kod qatorlarini sanash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1279
msgid ""
"Odoo Cloc is a tool to count the number of relevant lines of code written in "
"Python, Javascript, CSS, SCSS, or XML. This can be used as a rough metric "
"for pricing maintenance of extra modules."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Cloc — Python, Javascript, CSS, SCSS yoki XML tilida yozilgan tegishli "
"kod qatorlari sonini hisoblash uchun vosita. Undan qo'shimcha module'lar "
"texnik xizmatini narxlash uchun taxminiy metrika sifatida foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1292
msgid ""
"Process the code of all extra modules installed on the provided database, "
"and of all server actions and computed fields manually created in the "
"provided database."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan ma'lumotlar bazasiga o'rnatilgan barcha qo'shimcha module'lar "
"kodini, shuningdek shu ma'lumotlar bazasida qo'lda yaratilgan barcha server "
"action'lar va computed field'lar kodini qayta ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1294
msgid ""
"The :option:`--addons-path` option is required to specify the path(s) to the "
"module folder(s)."
msgstr ""
"module papka(lar)iga yo'l(lar)ni ko'rsatish uchun :option:`--addons-path` "
"option'i talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1297
msgid ""
"If combined with :option:`--path`, the count will be that of the sum of both "
"options' results (with possible overlaps). At least one of these two options "
"is required to specify which code to process."
msgstr ""
"Agar :option:`--path` bilan birga ishlatilsa, hisob ikkala option natijalari "
"yig'indisi bo'ladi (takrorlanishlar bo'lishi mumkin). Qaysi kodni qayta "
"ishlashni ko'rsatish uchun bu ikki option'dan kamida bittasi talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1304
msgid ":ref:`reference/cmdline/cloc/database-option`"
msgstr ":ref:`reference/cmdline/cloc/database-option`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1309
msgid "Process the files in the provided path."
msgstr "Berilgan yo'ldagi fayllarni qayta ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1312
msgid ""
"If combined with :option:`--database`, the count will be that of the sum of "
"both options' results (with possible overlaps). At least one of these two "
"options is required to specify which code to process."
msgstr ""
"Agar :option:`--database` bilan birga ishlatilsa, hisob ikkala option "
"natijalari yig'indisi bo'ladi (takrorlanishlar bo'lishi mumkin). Qaysi kodni "
"qayta ishlashni ko'rsatish uchun bu ikki option'dan kamida bittasi talab "
"qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1319
msgid "Multiple paths can be provided by repeating the option."
msgstr "Option'ni takrorlash orqali bir nechta yo'l berish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1326
msgid ":ref:`reference/cmdline/cloc/path-option`"
msgstr ":ref:`reference/cmdline/cloc/path-option`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1333
msgid "Required if the :option:`--database` option is used."
msgstr "Agar :option:`--database` option'i ishlatilsa, talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1338
msgid ""
"Specify a configuration file to use in place of the :option:`--addons-path` "
"option."
msgstr ""
":option:`--addons-path` option'i o'rniga ishlatiladigan konfiguratsiya "
"faylini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1343
msgid "Show the details of lines counted for each file."
msgstr "Har bir fayl uchun hisoblangan qatorlar tafsilotlarini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1347
msgid "Processed files"
msgstr "Qayta ishlangan fayllar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1352
msgid "With the :option:`--database` option"
msgstr ":option:`--database` option'i bilan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1354
msgid ""
"Odoo Cloc counts the lines in each file of extra installed modules in a "
"given database. In addition, it counts the Python lines of server actions "
"and custom computed fields that have been directly created in the database "
"or imported. Finally, it counts the lines of code of Javascript, CSS, and "
"SCSS files, and of QWeb views from imported modules."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Cloc berilgan ma'lumotlar bazasida o'rnatilgan qo'shimcha "
"module'larning har bir faylidagi qatorlarni hisoblaydi. Bundan tashqari, u "
"ma'lumotlar bazasida bevosita yaratilgan yoki import qilingan server "
"action'lar va maxsus computed field'larning Python qatorlarini hisoblaydi. "
"Nihoyat, u import qilingan module'lardagi Javascript, CSS va SCSS fayllari "
"hamda QWeb view'larning kod qatorlarini hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1360
msgid "Some files are excluded from the count by default:"
msgstr "Ba'zi fayllar sukut bo'yicha hisobdan chiqarib tashlanadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1362
msgid "The manifest (:file:`__manifest__.py` or :file:`__openerp__.py`)"
msgstr "manifest (:file:`__manifest__.py` yoki :file:`__openerp__.py`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1363
msgid "The contents of the folder :file:`static/lib`"
msgstr ":file:`static/lib` papkasining mazmuni"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1364
msgid "The tests defined in the folder :file:`tests` and :file:`static/tests`"
msgstr ":file:`tests` va :file:`static/tests` papkalarida aniqlangan testlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1365
msgid ""
"The migrations scripts defined in the folder :file:`migrations` and "
"`upgrades`"
msgstr ""
":file:`migrations` va `upgrades` papkalarida aniqlangan migration skriptlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1366
msgid ""
"The XML files declared in the ``demo`` or ``demo_xml`` sections of the "
"manifest"
msgstr ""
"manifest'ning ``demo`` yoki ``demo_xml`` bo'limlarida e'lon qilingan XML "
"fayllar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1368
msgid ""
"For special cases, a list of files that should be ignored by Odoo Cloc can "
"be defined per module. This is specified by the ``cloc_exclude`` entry of "
"the manifest:"
msgstr ""
"Maxsus holatlar uchun Odoo Cloc e'tiborsiz qoldirishi kerak bo'lgan fayllar "
"ro'yxatini har bir module uchun aniqlash mumkin. Bu manifest'ning "
"``cloc_exclude`` yozuvi bilan ko'rsatiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1381
msgid ""
"The pattern ``**/*`` can be used to ignore an entire module. This can be "
"useful to exclude a module from maintenance service costs."
msgstr ""
"``**/*`` shabloni butun module'ni e'tiborsiz qoldirish uchun ishlatilishi "
"mumkin. Bu module'ni texnik xizmat ko'rsatish xarajatlaridan chiqarib "
"tashlash uchun foydali bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1383
msgid ""
"For more information about the pattern syntax, see `glob <https://"
"docs.python.org/3/library/pathlib.html#pathlib.Path.glob>`_."
msgstr ""
"Shablon sintaksisi haqida ko'proq ma'lumot olish uchun `glob <https://"
"docs.python.org/3/library/pathlib.html#pathlib.Path.glob>`_ ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1388
msgid "With the :option:`--path` option"
msgstr ":option:`--path` option'i bilan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1390
msgid ""
"This method works the same as with the :ref:`--database option <reference/"
"cmdline/cloc/database-option>` if a manifest file is present in the given "
"folder. Otherwise, it counts all files."
msgstr ""
"Agar berilgan papkada manifest fayli mavjud bo'lsa, bu usul :ref:`--database "
"option <reference/cmdline/cloc/database-option>` bilan bo'lgani kabi "
"ishlaydi. Aks holda, u barcha fayllarni hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1396
msgid "Identifying Extra Modules"
msgstr "Qo'shimcha module'larni aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1398
msgid ""
"To distinguish between standard and extra modules, Odoo Cloc uses the "
"following heuristic: modules that are located (real file system path, after "
"following symbolic links) in the same parent directory as the ``base``, "
"``web`` or ``web_enterprise`` standard modules are considered standard. "
"Other modules are treated as extra modules."
msgstr ""
"Standart va qo'shimcha module'larni ajratish uchun Odoo Cloc quyidagi "
"evristikadan foydalanadi: ``base``, ``web`` yoki ``web_enterprise`` standart "
"module'lari bilan bir xil ota-papkada joylashgan (symbolic link'lardan "
"keyingi haqiqiy fayl tizimi yo'li) module'lar standart deb hisoblanadi. "
"Boshqa module'lar qo'shimcha module sifatida ko'rib chiqiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1405
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:662
msgid "Error Handling"
msgstr "Xatolarni qayta ishlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1407
msgid ""
"Some file cannot be counted by Odoo Cloc. Those file are reported at the end "
"of the output."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi fayllarni Odoo Cloc hisoblay olmaydi. Bunday fayllar chiqish "
"natijasining oxirida qayd etiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1411
msgid "Max file size exceeded"
msgstr "Fayl maksimal hajmidan oshib ketdi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1413
msgid ""
"Odoo Cloc rejects any file larger than 25MB. Usually, source files are "
"smaller than 1 MB. If a file is rejected, it may be:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo Cloc 25MB dan katta har qanday faylni rad etadi. Odatda, manba fayllari "
"1 MB dan kichik bo'ladi. Agar fayl rad etilsa, u quyidagilardan biri "
"bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1416
msgid ""
"A generated XML file that contains lots of data. It should be excluded in "
"the manifest."
msgstr ""
"Ko'p ma'lumot saqlaydigan generatsiya qilingan XML fayl. U manifest'da "
"chiqarib tashlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1417
msgid ""
"A JavaScript library that should be placed in the :file:`static/lib` folder."
msgstr ""
":file:`static/lib` papkasiga joylashtirilishi kerak bo'lgan JavaScript "
"kutubxonasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1420
msgid "Syntax Error"
msgstr "Sintaksis xatosi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1422
msgid ""
"Odoo Cloc cannot count the lines of code of a Python file with a syntax "
"problem. If an extra module contains such files, they should be fixed to "
"allow the module to load. If the module works despite the presence of those "
"files, they are probably not loaded and should therefore be removed from the "
"module, or at least excluded in the manifest via ``cloc_exclude``."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Cloc sintaksis muammosi bo'lgan Python faylining kod qatorlarini "
"hisoblay olmaydi. Agar qo'shimcha module shunday fayllarni saqlasa, module "
"yuklanishi uchun ular tuzatilishi kerak. Agar module bu fayllar mavjudligiga "
"qaramay ishlasa, ular yuklanmayotgan bo'lishi ehtimoli katta, shu sababli "
"ular module'dan olib tashlanishi yoki hech bo'lmaganda manifest'da "
"``cloc_exclude`` orqali chiqarib tashlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1432
msgid "`obfuscate` - Obfuscate database"
msgstr "`obfuscate` - Ma'lumotlar bazasini obfuscate qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1436
msgid ""
"This command provides a quick and easy way to obfuscate some of the data in "
"the Odoo instance, mainly used for instructional purposes or to make quick "
"videos for the support team helping technicians avoid leaking sensitive "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq Odoo instance'idagi ba'zi ma'lumotlarni obfuscate qilishning tez "
"va oson usulini beradi; asosan o'quv maqsadlarida yoki qo'llab-quvvatlash "
"guruhi uchun tezkor videolar tayyorlashda ishlatiladi hamda texnik "
"xodimlarga maxfiy ma'lumotlarning oshkor bo'lishidan saqlanishga yordam "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1442
msgid ""
"This command must be used carefully, as it is **not** considered a safe "
"method for full anonymizing data before transfer to a third party. Images, "
"PDF attachments, amounts, many other informations may not be obfuscated and "
"cause sensitive information leaks. A thorough review is required before "
"sharing data to ensure that no sensitive information is exposed."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruqdan ehtiyotkorlik bilan foydalanish kerak, chunki u ma'lumotlarni "
"uchinchi tomonga uzatishdan oldin to'liq anonimlashtirishning xavfsiz usuli "
"**hisoblanmaydi**. Rasmlar, PDF ilovalar, summalar va boshqa ko'p "
"ma'lumotlar obfuscate qilinmasligi va maxfiy ma'lumotlarning oshkor "
"bo'lishiga olib kelishi mumkin. Ma'lumotlarni ulashishdan oldin hech qanday "
"maxfiy ma'lumot oshkor bo'lmasligiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun sinchkovlik "
"bilan tekshirish talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1448
msgid ""
"Obfuscation is symmetric, so content can be unobfuscated using the same "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Obfuscation simmetrik, shuning uchun kontentni xuddi shu parol yordamida "
"unobfuscate qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1450
msgid ""
"All the configurations available for the :ref:`server <reference/cmdline/"
"server>` command are available here too."
msgstr ""
":ref:`server <reference/cmdline/server>` buyrug'i uchun mavjud barcha "
"konfiguratsiyalar bu yerda ham mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1459
msgid ""
"(Required) the password that will be used to symmetrically obfuscate content."
msgstr ""
"(Talab qilinadi) kontentni simmetrik obfuscate qilish uchun ishlatiladigan "
"parol."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1463
msgid "if you want to unobfuscate instead of obfuscate."
msgstr "agar obfuscate qilish o'rniga unobfuscate qilishni istasangiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1467
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of `table.column` entries to obfuscate/unobfuscate."
msgstr ""
"obfuscate/unobfuscate qilinadigan `table.column` yozuvlarining vergul bilan "
"ajratilgan ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1471
msgid ""
"file containing the list of `table.column` entries to obfuscate/unobfuscate."
msgstr ""
"obfuscate/unobfuscate qilinadigan `table.column` yozuvlari ro'yxatini "
"saqlovchi fayl."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1475
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of `table.column` entries not to obfuscate/unobfuscate."
msgstr ""
"obfuscate/unobfuscate qilinmaydigan `table.column` yozuvlarining vergul "
"bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1479
#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1485
msgid "used only when :option:`--unobfuscate` is selected."
msgstr "faqat :option:`--unobfuscate` tanlanganda ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1481
msgid ""
"Try to unobfuscate all fields. It's slower than specifying the fields "
"manually."
msgstr ""
"Barcha field'larni unobfuscate qilishga harakat qiladi. Bu field'larni "
"qo'lda ko'rsatishdan sekinroq."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1487
msgid ""
"After unobfuscation, completely clear the obfuscated tables and reclaim "
"unused disk space."
msgstr ""
"Unobfuscation'dan keyin obfuscate qilingan jadvallarni to'liq tozalaydi va "
"ishlatilmagan disk maydonini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1491
msgid "commit once per table, after obfuscation."
msgstr "obfuscation'dan keyin har bir jadval uchun bir marta commit qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1493
msgid ""
"It avoids big transactions that might get a timeout or face rollback after "
"an error."
msgstr ""
"Bu timeout'ga uchrashi yoki xatodan keyin rollback bo'lishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"katta tranzaksiyalardan saqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1497
msgid "don't ask for manual confirmation."
msgstr "qo'lda tasdiqlashni so'ramaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1499
msgid ""
"Only use if you're sure that you're not going to leak sensible information "
"by sharing the database to third party without a review."
msgstr ""
"Faqat tekshirmasdan ma'lumotlar bazasini uchinchi tomonga ulashish orqali "
"maxfiy ma'lumotlarni oshkor qilmasligingizga ishonchingiz komil bo'lsa "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1506
msgid "`deploy` - Deploy module remotely"
msgstr "`deploy` - Module'ni masofadan deploy qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1510
msgid ""
"This command uploads a module to a remote Odoo server and installs it. It's "
"simpler than manually connecting to the remote server, and it does not "
"require full access to the machine that hosts the Odoo instance, only the "
"Odoo administrative credentials."
msgstr ""
"Bu buyruq module'ni masofadagi Odoo serveriga yuklaydi va uni o'rnatadi. U "
"masofadagi serverga qo'lda ulanishdan soddaroq va Odoo instance'i joylashgan "
"mashinaga to'liq kirishni talab qilmaydi — faqat Odoo administrator hisob "
"ma'lumotlari kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1520
msgid "Prerequisites:"
msgstr "Talablar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1522
msgid "The server must have the module `base_import_module` installed."
msgstr "Serverda `base_import_module` module'i o'rnatilgan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1523
msgid ""
"The user selected with the `--login` option must have administrative rights."
msgstr ""
"`--login` option'i bilan tanlangan foydalanuvchi administrator huquqlariga "
"ega bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1527
msgid "path of the module to be deployed"
msgstr "deploy qilinadigan module'ning yo'li"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1531
msgid ""
"(Optional) url of the server where the module must be deployed (default "
"`http://localhost:8069`)"
msgstr ""
"(Ixtiyoriy) module deploy qilinishi kerak bo'lgan server url'i (sukut "
"bo'yicha `http://localhost:8069`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1536
msgid "database name (if the server does not use the `--db-filter` option)"
msgstr ""
"ma'lumotlar bazasi nomi (agar server `--db-filter` option'idan foydalanmasa)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1540
msgid "name of the user with admin rights (default `admin`)"
msgstr "admin huquqlariga ega foydalanuvchi nomi (standart `admin`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1544
msgid "password of the user with admin rights (default `admin`)"
msgstr "admin huquqlariga ega foydalanuvchi paroli (standart `admin`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1548
msgid ""
"verify the server's SSL certificate, to ensure the target instance is legit."
msgstr ""
"server'ning SSL sertifikatini tekshiring, bu maqsadli instance haqiqiy "
"ekanligiga ishonch hosil qilish uchun kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1552
msgid ""
"re-initialize the module in case it's already installed. It will update "
"`noupdate=\"1\"` records."
msgstr ""
"module allaqachon o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, uni qayta initsializatsiya qiladi. U "
"`noupdate=\"1\"` record'larini yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1559
msgid "`upgrade_code` - Rewrite source code"
msgstr "`upgrade_code` - Manba kodini qayta yozish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1563
msgid ""
"This command rewrites the entire source code using the scripts found in the "
"`odoo/upgrade_code` folder. It is used for doing the heavy-lifting when "
"dealing with big code migrations and forward ports."
msgstr ""
"Bu command `odoo/upgrade_code` papkasidagi script'lar yordamida butun manba "
"kodini qayta yozadi. U katta kod migration'lari va forward port'lar bilan "
"ishlashda asosiy og'ir ishni bajarish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1569
msgid ""
"All the scripts are doing a best-effort at migrating the source code, but "
"they are not silver bullets."
msgstr ""
"Barcha script'lar manba kodini migratsiya qilishga imkon qadar harakat "
"qiladi, lekin ular hamma muammoni hal qiluvchi vosita emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1572
msgid "It accepts the :option:`--addons-path <odoo-bin --addons-path>` option."
msgstr ""
"U :option:`--addons-path <odoo-bin --addons-path>` option'ini qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1580
msgid "run a single script"
msgstr "bitta script'ni ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1584
msgid "run all script starting from this version included"
msgstr ""
"shu versiyadan boshlab (shu versiya ham kiritilgan) barcha script'larni "
"ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1588
msgid ""
"to be used with :option:`--from`. Run all scripts up to this version "
"included. Default is `odoo.release.version`."
msgstr ""
":option:`--from` bilan birga ishlatiladi. Shu versiyagacha (shu versiya ham "
"kiritilgan) barcha script'larni ishga tushiradi. Standart qiymat — "
"`odoo.release.version`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1593
msgid "filter the files to be rewritten, default is every file (`\\*\\*/\\*`)"
msgstr ""
"qayta yozilishi kerak bo'lgan fayllarni filtrlaydi, standart holatda barcha "
"fayllar (`\\*\\*/\\*`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1597
msgid "list the files that would be re-written, but do not apply changes"
msgstr ""
"qayta yozilishi mumkin bo'lgan fayllar ro'yxatini ko'rsatadi, lekin "
"o'zgarishlarni qo'llamaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1600
msgid "Code upgrade scripts"
msgstr "Kodni upgrade qilish script'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1602
msgid ""
"The scripts must be named `{version}-{name}.py`, and must expose an "
"`upgrade` function that takes a single `file_manager` argument and have no "
"return."
msgstr ""
"Script'lar `{version}-{name}.py` shaklida nomlanishi kerak va bitta "
"`file_manager` argumentini qabul qiladigan hamda hech narsa qaytarmaydigan "
"`upgrade` funksiyasini taqdim etishi shart."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1605
msgid ""
"The `file_manager` argument is a sequence of `files`, which have 3 "
"attributes and some helper methods:"
msgstr ""
"`file_manager` argumenti `files` ketma-ketligi bo'lib, ularning 3 ta "
"atributi va bir nechta yordamchi method'lari bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1608
msgid "`path`: the `pathlib.Path` where the file is on the file system."
msgstr "`path`: fayl tizimidagi fayl joylashuvi, `pathlib.Path` ko'rinishida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1609
msgid "`addon`: the addon the file belongs to."
msgstr "`addon`: fayl tegishli bo'lgan addon."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1610
msgid "`content`: the re-writtable content of the file (lazy)."
msgstr "`content`: faylning qayta yozilishi mumkin bo'lgan tarkibi (lazy)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/cli.rst:1611
msgid "`print_progress(current, total)`: outputs the current progress."
msgstr "`print_progress(current, total)`: joriy jarayon holatini chiqaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:3
msgid "External JSON-2 API"
msgstr "Tashqi JSON-2 API"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo is usually extended internally via modules, but many of its features "
"and all of its data are also available externally for analysis or "
"integration with various other softwares. Part of the :ref:`reference/orm/"
"model` API is easily available over HTTP via the ``/json/2`` endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Odoo odatda modullar orqali ichdan kengaytiriladi, biroq uning ko'plab "
"imkoniyatlari va barcha ma'lumotlari tahlil qilish yoki boshqa turli "
"dasturlar bilan integratsiya uchun tashqaridan ham mavjud. :ref:`reference/"
"orm/model` API'ning bir qismi ``/json/2`` endpoint'i orqali HTTP ustidan "
"bemalol foydalanish uchun ochiq."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:12
msgid ""
"The actual models, fields and methods available are specific to every "
"database and can be consulted on their ``/doc`` page."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud bo'lgan aniq model, field va method'lar har bir ma'lumotlar bazasi "
"uchun o'ziga xosdir va ularning ``/doc`` sahifasida ko'rib chiqilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:16
#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:25
msgid ""
"Access to data via the external API is only available on *Custom* Odoo "
"pricing plans. Access to the external API is not available on *One App Free* "
"or *Standard* plans. For more information visit the `Odoo pricing page "
"<https://www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ or reach out to your Customer Success "
"Manager."
msgstr ""
"Tashqi API orqali ma'lumotlarga kirish faqat *Custom* Odoo narx rejalarida "
"mavjud. *One App Free* yoki *Standard* rejalarida tashqi API'ga kirish "
"mumkin emas. Qo'shimcha ma'lumot uchun `Odoo narxlar sahifasi <https://"
"www.odoo.com/pricing-plan>`_ ga tashrif buyuring yoki Customer Success "
"Manager'ga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:29
msgid "Post a JSON object at the ``/json/2/<model>/<method>`` URL."
msgstr "``/json/2/<model>/<method>`` URL manziliga JSON obyektini yuboring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:31
msgid "**HTTP Headers**"
msgstr "**HTTP header'lar**"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "Host"
msgstr "Host"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:33
msgid "Required, the hostname of the server."
msgstr "Majburiy, server'ning hostname'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "Autorization"
msgstr "Autorization"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:34
msgid ""
"Required, ``bearer`` followed by an :ref:`API key <reference/external_api/"
"api_key>`."
msgstr ""
"Majburiy, ``bearer`` va undan keyin :ref:`API kaliti <reference/external_api/"
"api_key>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "Content-Type"
msgstr "Content-Type"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:35
msgid "Required, ``application/json``, a charset is recommended."
msgstr "Majburiy, ``application/json``, charset ko'rsatish tavsiya etiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "X-Odoo-Database"
msgstr "X-Odoo-Database"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:36
msgid "Optional, the name of the database to connect to."
msgstr "Ixtiyoriy, ulanadigan ma'lumotlar bazasining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "User-Agent"
msgstr "User-Agent"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:37
msgid "Recommended, the name of your software."
msgstr "Tavsiya etiladi, dasturingizning nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:39
msgid "**URL Path**"
msgstr "**URL yo'li**"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "model"
msgstr "model"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:41
msgid "Required, the technical model name."
msgstr "Majburiy, model'ning texnik nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "method"
msgstr "method"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:42
msgid "Required, the method to execute."
msgstr "Majburiy, bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan method."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:44
msgid "**Body JSON object**"
msgstr "**Body JSON obyekti**"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "ids"
msgstr "ids"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:46
msgid ""
"An array of record ids on which to execute the method. Empty or omitted when "
"calling an ``@api.model``-decorated method."
msgstr ""
"Method bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan record id'larining massivi. ``@api.model`` "
"bilan decorate qilingan method chaqirilganda bo'sh qoldiriladi yoki "
"ko'rsatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "context"
msgstr "context"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:48
msgid ""
"Optional, an object of additional values. e.g. ``{\"lang\": \"en_US\"}``."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, qo'shimcha qiymatlar obyekti. Masalan ``{\"lang\": \"en_US\"}``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "*param*"
msgstr "*param*"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:49
msgid "As many time as needed, the method's parameters."
msgstr "Zarur bo'lgancha ko'p marta, method'ning parametrlari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:77
msgid ""
"In case of **success**, a **200** status with the JSON-serialized return "
"value of the called method in the body."
msgstr ""
"**Muvaffaqiyatli** bo'lganda, **200** status va body'da chaqirilgan "
"method'ning JSON formatiga serialize qilingan qaytarish qiymati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:90
msgid ""
"In case of **error**, a **4xx**/**5xx** status with a JSON-serialized error "
"object in the body."
msgstr ""
"**Xato** bo'lganda, **4xx**/**5xx** status va body'da JSON formatiga "
"serialize qilingan xato obyekti."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:92
msgid "The fully qualified name of the Python exception that occured."
msgstr "Yuz bergan Python exception'ining to'liq nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "message"
msgstr "message"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:93
msgid "The exception message, usually the same as `arguments[0]`."
msgstr "Exception xabari, odatda `arguments[0]` bilan bir xil bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "arguments"
msgstr "arguments"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:94
msgid "All the exception arguments."
msgstr "Exception'ning barcha argumentlari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:95
msgid "The context used by the request."
msgstr "Request tomonidan ishlatilgan context."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:0
msgid "debug"
msgstr "debug"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:96
msgid "The exception traceback, for debugging purpose."
msgstr "Exception'ning traceback'i, debug qilish maqsadida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:116
msgid "Debug"
msgstr "Debug"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:135
#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:34
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:53
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguratsiya"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:140
#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:99
msgid "API Keys"
msgstr "API kalitlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:143
msgid "Manual Key Generation"
msgstr "Kalitni qo'lda yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:145
msgid ""
"An API key must be set in the ``Authorization`` request header, as a bearer "
"token."
msgstr ""
"API kaliti ``Authorization`` request header'ida bearer token sifatida "
"ko'rsatilishi shart."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:147
msgid ""
"Create a new API key for a user via :menuselection:`Preferences --> Account "
"Security --> New API Key`."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi uchun yangi API kalitini :menuselection:`Preferences --> "
"Account Security --> New API Key` orqali yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:162
msgid ""
"Both a description and a duration are needed to create a new API key. The "
"description makes it possible to identify the key, and to determine later "
"whether the key is still in use or should be removed. The duration "
"determines the lifetime of the key, after which the key becomes invalid. It "
"is recommended to set a short duration (typically one day) for interactive "
"usage. For security reasons, it is not possible to create keys that last for "
"more than three months. This means that long lasting keys must be rotated at "
"least once every three months."
msgstr ""
"Yangi API kalitini yaratish uchun tavsif ham, muddat ham talab qilinadi. "
"Tavsif kalitni aniqlash va keyinchalik uning hali ham ishlatilayotganini "
"yoki o'chirilishi kerakligini bilish imkonini beradi. Muddat kalitning amal "
"qilish vaqtini belgilaydi, u tugagach kalit yaroqsiz bo'lib qoladi. "
"Interaktiv foydalanish uchun qisqa muddat (odatda bir kun) belgilash tavsiya "
"etiladi. Xavfsizlik nuqtai nazaridan, uch oydan uzoq muddatga ega kalitlar "
"yaratish mumkin emas. Bu esa uzoq muddatli kalitlar hech bo'lmaganda har uch "
"oyda bir marta almashtirilishi kerakligini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:169
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Generate Key` button creates a strong 160-bits random key. "
"The key value is displayed only once during creation and cannot be retrieved "
"later. Copy the key immediately and store it securely. If the key is "
"compromised or lost, delete it immediately and generate a new one."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Generate Key` tugmasi kuchli 160-bitli tasodifiy kalit yaratadi. "
"Kalit qiymati faqat yaratilish vaqtida bir marta ko'rsatiladi va keyinchalik "
"uni olish mumkin emas. Kalitni darhol nusxalab, xavfsiz joyda saqlang. Agar "
"kalit oshkor bo'lsa yoki yo'qolsa, uni darhol o'chirib, yangisini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:173
msgid ""
"Please refer to `OWASP's Secrets Management Cheat Sheet <https://"
"cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/"
"Secrets_Management_Cheat_Sheet.html#secrets-management-cheat-sheet>`_ for "
"further guidance on the management of API keys."
msgstr ""
"API kalitlarini boshqarish bo'yicha qo'shimcha ko'rsatmalar uchun `OWASP's "
"Secrets Management Cheat Sheet <https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/"
"cheatsheets/Secrets_Management_Cheat_Sheet.html#secrets-management-cheat-"
"sheet>`_ ga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:180
msgid "Programmatic Key Management"
msgstr "Kalitlarni programmatik boshqarish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:182
msgid ""
"Odoo provides RPC methods to generate and revoke API keys programmatically."
msgstr ""
"Odoo API kalitlarini programmatik tarzda yaratish va bekor qilish uchun RPC "
"method'larini taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:185
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Zaruriy shartlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:187
msgid ""
"By default, programmatic API key management is restricted to users with the "
"*Settings* administration access right."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda API kalitlarini programmatik boshqarish faqat *Settings* "
"administratsiya kirish huquqiga ega foydalanuvchilar uchun ruxsat etilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:190
msgid ""
"To allow other users to manage API keys programmatically, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System Parameters` and set the "
"parameter ``base.enable_programmatic_api_keys`` to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa foydalanuvchilarga API kalitlarini programmatik boshqarishga ruxsat "
"berish uchun :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System Parameters` "
"bo'limiga o'ting va ``base.enable_programmatic_api_keys`` parametrini "
"``True`` qilib belgilang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:195
msgid "Key Generation"
msgstr "Kalit yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:197
msgid "API keys can be generated with :meth:`res.users.apikeys.generate`."
msgstr ""
"API kalitlarini :meth:`res.users.apikeys.generate` yordamida yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:199
msgid "The method accepts the following parameters:"
msgstr "Bu method quyidagi parametrlarni qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:201
msgid "``key`` (string): an existing valid API key"
msgstr "``key`` (string): mavjud yaroqli API kaliti"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:202
msgid "``scope`` (string or ``null``): the scope assigned to the new key"
msgstr "``scope`` (string yoki ``null``): yangi kalitga tayinlanadigan scope"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:203
msgid "``name`` (string): a human-readable label"
msgstr "``name`` (string): odam o'qishi uchun tushunarli yorliq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:204
msgid ""
"``expiration_date`` (string): the expiration date formatted as ISO 8601 "
"(e.g. ``\"2026-05-19\"``)"
msgstr ""
"``expiration_date`` (string): ISO 8601 formatida yozilgan amal qilish "
"muddati (masalan ``\"2026-05-19\"``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:207
msgid "A scope restricts where an API key can be used."
msgstr "Scope API kalitining qayerda ishlatilishini cheklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:209
msgid ""
"The ``rpc`` scope is the generic scope used for RPC access through "
"controllers with ``auth='bearer'``."
msgstr ""
"``rpc`` scope — ``auth='bearer'`` bilan controller'lar orqali RPC kirish "
"uchun ishlatiladigan umumiy scope."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:211
msgid ""
"The new key should generally use the same scope as the existing key. "
"However, it is possible to create a scoped key from an unscoped key when "
"needed. Unscoped keys use ``null`` as their scope value (``None`` in Python)."
msgstr ""
"Yangi kalit odatda mavjud kalit bilan bir xil scope'dan foydalanishi kerak. "
"Biroq, zarur bo'lganda scope'siz kalitdan scope'li kalit yaratish mumkin. "
"Scope'siz kalitlar scope qiymati sifatida ``null`` dan foydalanadi "
"(Python'da ``None``)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:215
msgid ""
"The expiration date is validated against the maximum API key duration "
"allowed by the roles assigned to the user."
msgstr ""
"Amal qilish muddati foydalanuvchiga tayinlangan rollar ruxsat bergan "
"maksimal API kalit muddatiga qarab tekshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:218
msgid ""
"Use shorter expiration periods for high-privilege or externally exposed "
"integrations, and longer periods only for tightly controlled internal "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"Yuqori huquqli yoki tashqariga ochiq integratsiyalar uchun qisqaroq amal "
"qilish muddatlarini ishlating, uzoqroq muddatlarni esa faqat qattiq nazorat "
"ostidagi ichki tizimlar uchun qo'llang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:293
msgid ""
"The method returns the newly generated API key as a string that cannot be "
"retrieved otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Bu method yangi yaratilgan API kalitini string sifatida qaytaradi va uni "
"boshqa yo'l bilan olish imkoni yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:295
msgid ""
"By default, a user can generate up to 10 API keys programmatically. This "
"limit can be configured with the system parameter "
"``base.programmatic_api_keys_limit``."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha foydalanuvchi programmatik ravishda 10 tagacha API kaliti "
"yaratishi mumkin. Bu chekni ``base.programmatic_api_keys_limit`` tizim "
"parametri bilan sozlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:298
msgid ""
"Attempting to exceed the configured limit fails with an HTTP ``422 "
"Unprocessable Content`` status code."
msgstr ""
"Sozlangan chekdan oshib ketishga urinish HTTP ``422 Unprocessable Content`` "
"status kodi bilan xatoga uchraydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:302
msgid "Key Revocation"
msgstr "Kalitni bekor qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:304
msgid "API keys can be revoked with :meth:`res.users.apikeys.revoke`."
msgstr ""
"API kalitlarini :meth:`res.users.apikeys.revoke` yordamida bekor qilish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:306
msgid "The method accepts the following parameter:"
msgstr "Bu method quyidagi parametrni qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:308
msgid "``key`` (string): the API key to revoke"
msgstr "``key`` (string): bekor qilinadigan API kaliti"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:363
msgid ""
"If the key is valid, it is revoked immediately and becomes unusable for "
"subsequent requests. Otherwise, the request fails with an HTTP ``403 "
"Forbidden`` status code."
msgstr ""
"Agar kalit yaroqli bo'lsa, u darhol bekor qilinadi va keyingi so'rovlar "
"uchun ishlatib bo'lmaydi. Aks holda so'rov HTTP ``403 Forbidden`` status "
"kodi bilan xatoga uchraydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:366
msgid ""
"Note that the key being revoked and the one given in the Authorization "
"header don't need to match. A good practice during rotation is to "
"authenticate with the new key to revoke the old key."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bekor qilinayotgan kalit va Authorization header'da berilgan "
"kalit bir xil bo'lishi shart emas. Almashtirish (rotation) vaqtida yaxshi "
"amaliyot — eski kalitni bekor qilish uchun yangi kalit bilan "
"autentifikatsiya qilishdir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:370
msgid "Key Rotation Best Practices"
msgstr "Kalitni almashtirishning eng yaxshi amaliyotlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:372
msgid ""
"Rotating API keys regularly reduces the risk of unauthorized access if a key "
"is compromised."
msgstr ""
"API kalitlarini muntazam almashtirish kalit oshkor bo'lgan holatda ruxsatsiz "
"kirish xavfini kamaytiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:374
msgid "When rotating API keys:"
msgstr "API kalitlarini almashtirganda:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:376
msgid "Generate a new key before revoking the previous one."
msgstr "Avvalgi kalitni bekor qilishdan oldin yangi kalit yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:377
msgid "Store the new key securely before deployment."
msgstr "Yangi kalitni joylashtirishdan oldin xavfsiz saqlang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:378
msgid "Verify that all services are using the new key."
msgstr ""
"Barcha service'lar yangi kalitdan foydalanayotganini tekshirib ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:379
msgid "Revoke the previous key only after the transition is complete."
msgstr "Avvalgi kalitni faqat o'tish to'liq tugagandan keyin bekor qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:380
msgid ""
"Use expiration dates appropriate for the security requirements of the system."
msgstr ""
"Tizimning xavfsizlik talablariga mos amal qilish muddatlarini ishlating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:381
msgid ""
"Prefer dedicated API keys per service or integration to simplify auditing "
"and revocation."
msgstr ""
"Audit va bekor qilishni osonlashtirish uchun har bir service yoki "
"integratsiya uchun alohida API kalitlaridan foydalanishni afzal ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:388
msgid ""
"The JSON-2 API uses the standard :ref:`security models of Odoo <reference/"
"security>`. All operations are validated against the access rights, record "
"rules and field accesses of the user."
msgstr ""
"JSON-2 API standart :ref:`Odoo xavfsizlik modellaridan <reference/security>` "
"foydalanadi. Barcha operatsiyalar foydalanuvchining access rights, record "
"rules va field access'lariga qarab tekshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:391
msgid ""
"For **interactive usage**, such as discovering the API or running one-time "
"scripts, it is fine to use a **personal account**."
msgstr ""
"**Interaktiv foydalanish** uchun, masalan API bilan tanishish yoki bir "
"martalik skriptlarni ishga tushirish uchun, **shaxsiy hisob**'dan "
"foydalanish maqbul."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:394
msgid ""
"For **extended automated usage**, such as an integration with another "
"software, it is recommended to create and use **dedicated bot users**. Using "
"dedicated bot users has several benefits:"
msgstr ""
"**Uzoq muddatli avtomatlashtirilgan foydalanish** uchun, masalan boshqa "
"dastur bilan integratsiya qilishda, **maxsus bot foydalanuvchilarini** "
"yaratish va ishlatish tavsiya etiladi. Maxsus bot foydalanuvchilaridan "
"foydalanishning bir nechta afzalliklari bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:397
msgid ""
"The minimum required permissions can be granted to the bot, limiting the "
"impact if the API key gets compromised."
msgstr ""
"Bot'ga faqat zarur bo'lgan minimal huquqlar berilishi mumkin, bu esa API "
"kaliti oshkor bo'lgan holatdagi ta'sirni cheklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:399
msgid ""
"The password can be set empty to disable login/password authentication, "
"limiting the likelihood of the account getting compromised."
msgstr ""
"Login/parol autentifikatsiyasini o'chirish uchun parolni bo'sh qoldirish "
"mumkin, bu hisobning oshkor bo'lish ehtimolini kamaytiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:401
msgid ""
"The :ref:`reference/fields/automatic/log_access` use the bot account. No "
"user is impersonalized."
msgstr ""
":ref:`reference/fields/automatic/log_access` bot hisobidan foydalanadi. Hech "
"bir foydalanuvchi nomidan ish yuritilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:408
msgid ""
"Depending on the deployment, the ``Host`` and/or ``X-Odoo-Database`` request "
"headers might be required. The ``Host`` header is required by HTTP/1.1 and "
"is needed on servers where Odoo is installed next to other web applications, "
"so that a web-server/reverse-proxy is able to route the request to the Odoo "
"server. The ``X-Odoo-Database`` header is required when a single Odoo server "
"hosts multiple databases and the :ref:`dbfilter` wasn't configured to use "
"the ``Host`` header."
msgstr ""
"Joylashtirishga qarab ``Host`` va/yoki ``X-Odoo-Database`` so'rov "
"header'lari talab qilinishi mumkin. ``Host`` header HTTP/1.1 tomonidan talab "
"qilinadi va Odoo boshqa veb-ilovalar bilan yonma-yon o'rnatilgan serverlarda "
"kerak bo'ladi — shunda veb-server/reverse-proxy so'rovni Odoo serveriga "
"yo'naltira oladi. ``X-Odoo-Database`` header bitta Odoo serveri bir nechta "
"ma'lumotlar bazasini joylashtirganda va :ref:`dbfilter` ``Host`` header'idan "
"foydalanishga sozlanmaganda talab qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:414
msgid ""
"Most HTTP client libraries automatically set the ``Host`` header using the "
"connection URL."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pchilik HTTP klient kutubxonalari ``Host`` header'ini ulanish URL "
"manzilidan foydalanib avtomatik o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:419
msgid "Transaction"
msgstr "Transaction"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:421
msgid ""
"All calls to the JSON-2 endpoint run in their own SQL transaction. The "
"transaction is committed in case of success and is discarded in case of "
"error. Using the JSON-2 API, it is not possible to chain multiple calls "
"inside a single transaction. It means that one must be cautious when making "
"multiple consecutive calls, as the database might be modified by other "
"concurrent transactions. This is especially dangerous when performing "
"operations related to reservations, payments, and such."
msgstr ""
"JSON-2 endpoint'ga qilingan barcha chaqiruvlar o'zining alohida SQL "
"transaction'ida bajariladi. Muvaffaqiyatli bo'lsa transaction commit "
"qilinadi, xato bo'lsa bekor qilinadi. JSON-2 API'da bir nechta chaqiruvni "
"bitta transaction ichida zanjirlash mumkin emas. Ya'ni ketma-ket bir nechta "
"chaqiruv qilganda ehtiyot bo'lish kerak, chunki ma'lumotlar bazasi boshqa "
"parallel transaction'lar tomonidan o'zgartirilgan bo'lishi mumkin. Bu "
"ayniqsa rezervatsiya, to'lov va shunga o'xshash operatsiyalarni bajarishda "
"xavflidir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:427
msgid ""
"The solution is to always call a single method that performs all the related "
"operations in a single transaction. This way, the data is guaranteed to stay "
"consistent: either everything is done (success, commit), or nothing is done "
"(error, rollback)."
msgstr ""
"Yechim — barcha bog'liq operatsiyalarni bitta transaction ichida bajaradigan "
"yagona method'ni chaqirishdir. Bu holda ma'lumotlar izchil qolishi "
"kafolatlanadi: yoki hammasi bajariladi (muvaffaqiyat, commit), yoki hech "
"narsa bajarilmaydi (xato, rollback)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:431
msgid ""
"In the ORM, the ``search_read`` method is an example of a single method that "
"performs multiple operations (``search`` then ``read``) in a single "
"transaction. If a concurrent request removes one of the records ``search`` "
"retrieves, then there is a risk that subsequent calls to ``read`` fail for a "
"missing record error. Such a problem cannot occur in ``search_read``, as the "
"system guarantees proper isolation between transactions."
msgstr ""
"ORM'da ``search_read`` method'i bitta transaction ichida bir nechta "
"operatsiyani (``search``, so'ngra ``read``) bajaradigan yagona method'ga "
"misoldir. Agar parallel so'rov ``search`` qaytargan record'lardan birini "
"o'chirib tashlasa, keyingi ``read`` chaqiruvlari mavjud bo'lmagan record "
"xatosi bilan yakunlanish xavfi bor. ``search_read`` da bunday muammo yuzaga "
"kelmaydi, chunki tizim transaction'lar orasida to'g'ri izolyatsiyani "
"kafolatlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:437
msgid ""
"In business models, those methods are often prefixed by ``action_``, such as "
"``sale.order``'s ``action_confirm`` method, which verifies that a sales "
"order is valid before confirming it."
msgstr ""
"Biznes model'larda bunday method'lar ko'pincha ``action_`` prefiksi bilan "
"nomlanadi, masalan ``sale.order`` model'ining ``action_confirm`` method'i — "
"u sotuv buyurtmasini tasdiqlashdan oldin uning yaroqliligini tekshiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:441
msgid ""
"When no method exists for a set of related operations, a new one can be "
"created in a dedicated module."
msgstr ""
"Bog'liq operatsiyalar to'plami uchun method mavjud bo'lmasa, alohida "
"module'da yangisini yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:445
