#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:601
msgid "Common service"
msgstr "Common service"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:603
msgid "The common service defines 3 functions:"
msgstr "Common service 3 ta funksiyani aniqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:605
msgid "``version()``"
msgstr "``version()``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:606
msgid "``login(db, login, password)``"
msgstr "``login(db, login, password)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:607
msgid "``authenticate(db, login, password, user_agent_env)``"
msgstr "``authenticate(db, login, password, user_agent_env)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:609
msgid "The version function is replaced by the ``/web/version`` endpoint."
msgstr "version funksiyasi ``/web/version`` endpoint'i bilan almashtirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:622
msgid ""
"The two ``login`` and ``authenticate`` functions return the user ID "
"corresponding to the user after a successful login. The user ID and password "
"are necessary for subsequent RPC calls to the *object* service. The JSON-2 "
"API uses a different authentication scheme where neither the user ID nor the "
"password are used. It is still possible to retrieve the user's own ID by "
"sending a JSON-2 request to ``res.users/context_get`` with no ID (the "
"current user is extracted from the API key)."
msgstr ""
"``login`` va ``authenticate`` funksiyalari muvaffaqiyatli kirishdan so'ng "
"foydalanuvchiga mos user ID'ni qaytaradi. User ID va parol *object* "
"service'iga keyingi RPC chaqiruvlari uchun zarur. JSON-2 API boshqa "
"autentifikatsiya sxemasidan foydalanadi — unda na user ID, na parol "
"ishlatiladi. Shunga qaramay, ``res.users/context_get`` ga ID'siz JSON-2 "
"so'rovi yuborib, foydalanuvchining o'z ID'sini olish mumkin (joriy "
"foydalanuvchi API key'dan aniqlanadi)."

