#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:656
msgid ""
"``/web/database/create`` takes inputs ``master_pwd``, ``name``, ``login``, "
"``password``, ``demo``, ``lang``, and ``phone``."
msgstr ""
"``/web/database/create`` quyidagi input'larni oladi: ``master_pwd``, "
"``name``, ``login``, ``password``, ``demo``, ``lang`` va ``phone``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:658
msgid ""
"``/web/database/duplicate`` takes inputs ``master_pwd``, ``name``, "
"``new_name``, and ``neutralize_database`` (not neutralized by default)."
msgstr ""
"``/web/database/duplicate`` quyidagi input'larni oladi: ``master_pwd``, "
