msgstr "``/web/database/drop`` ``master_pwd`` va ``name`` input'larini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:661
msgid ""
"``/web/database/backup`` takes inputs ``master_pwd``, ``name``, and "
"``backup_format`` (zip by default), and returns the backup in the http "
