msgstr ""
"``/web/database/backup`` ``master_pwd``, ``name`` va ``backup_format`` "
"(standart holatda zip) input'larini oladi va zaxira nusxani http response'da "
"qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:663
msgid ""
"``/web/database/change_password`` takes inputs ``master_pwd`` and "
"``master_pwd_new``."
msgstr ""
"``/web/database/change_password`` ``master_pwd`` va ``master_pwd_new`` "
"input'larini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:665
msgid ""
"The following controller uses the verb ``POST`` and content-type ``multipart/"
"form-data``."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi controller ``POST`` verb'i va ``multipart/form-data`` content-"
"type'idan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:667
msgid ""
"``/web/database/restore`` takes inputs ``master_pwd``, ``name``, ``copy`` "
"(not copied by default) and ``neutralize`` (not neutralized by default), it "
"takes a file input ``backup_file``."
msgstr ""
"``/web/database/restore`` ``master_pwd``, ``name``, ``copy`` (standart "
"holatda nusxalanmaydi) va ``neutralize`` (standart holatda neytrallanmaydi) "
"input'larini oladi, shuningdek ``backup_file`` fayl input'ini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:670
msgid ""
"The following controller uses the verb ``POST`` and content-type "
"``application/json-rpc``."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi controller ``POST`` verb'i va ``application/json-rpc`` content-"
"type'idan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:672
msgid ""
"``/web/database/list`` takes an empty JSON object as input, and returns the "
"database list under the JSON response's ``result`` entry."
msgstr ""
"``/web/database/list`` input sifatida bo'sh JSON object oladi va ma'lumotlar "
"bazalari ro'yxatini JSON response'ning ``result`` yozuvida qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:675
msgid ""
"The remaining function are: ``server_version``, which exists under ``/web/"
"version``, ``list_lang``, and ``list_countries``, which exist via JSON-2 on "
"the ``res.lang`` and ``res.country`` models, and ``migrate_databases``, "
"which as non-programmable API at the moment."
msgstr ""
"Qolgan funksiyalar: ``server_version`` — u ``/web/version`` ostida mavjud; "
"``list_lang`` va ``list_countries`` — ular ``res.lang`` va ``res.country`` "
"model'larida JSON-2 orqali mavjud; hamda ``migrate_databases`` — u hozircha "
"programmable API'ga ega emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:680
msgid "Object service"
msgstr "Object service'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:682
msgid "The object service defines 2 functions:"
msgstr "object service'i 2 ta funksiyani aniqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:684
msgid "``execute(db, uid, passwd, model, method, *args)``"
msgstr "``execute(db, uid, passwd, model, method, *args)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:685
msgid "``execute_kw(db, uid, passwd, model, method, args, kw={})``"
msgstr "``execute_kw(db, uid, passwd, model, method, args, kw={})``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:687
msgid ""
"They both give for access to all public model methods, including the generic "
"ORM ones."
msgstr ""
"Ikkisi ham barcha public model method'lariga, shu jumladan umumiy ORM "
"method'lariga kirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:689
msgid ""
"Both functions are stateless. It means that the database, user ID and user "
"password are to be provided for each call. The model, method and arguments "
"must be provided, too. The ``execute`` function takes as many extra "
"positional arguments as necessary. The ``execute_kw`` function takes an "
"``args`` list of positional arguments and an optional ``kw`` dict of keyword "
"arguments."
msgstr ""
"Ikkala funksiya ham stateless. Bu shuni bildiradi: ma'lumotlar bazasi, user "
"ID va foydalanuvchi paroli har bir chaqiruvda berilishi kerak. Model, method "
"va argumentlar ham berilishi shart. ``execute`` funksiyasi kerak bo'lgancha "
"qo'shimcha pozitsion argumentlarni oladi. ``execute_kw`` funksiyasi "
"pozitsion argumentlarning ``args`` ro'yxatini va keyword argumentlarning "
"ixtiyoriy ``kw`` dict'ini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:694
msgid ""
"The records IDs are extracted from the first ``args``. When the called "
"method is decorated with ``@api.model``, no record ID is extracted, and "
"``args`` is left as-is. It is only possible to give a context with "
"``execute_kw``, as it is extracted from the keyword argument named "
"``context``."
msgstr ""
"Record'lar ID'lari birinchi ``args`` dan ajratib olinadi. Chaqirilgan method "
"``@api.model`` bilan decoratsiya qilingan bo'lsa, hech qanday record ID "
"ajratilmaydi va ``args`` o'z holida qoladi. Context'ni faqat ``execute_kw`` "
"bilan berish mumkin, chunki u ``context`` nomli keyword argumentdan olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:699
msgid "To run the following:"
msgstr "Quyidagini ishga tushirish uchun:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:710
msgid "Using XML-RPC (JSON-RPC would be similar):"
msgstr "XML-RPC yordamida (JSON-RPC ham shunga o'xshash bo'ladi):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:729
msgid ""
"The JSON-2 API replaces the object service with a few differences. The "
"database must only be provided (via the ``X-Odoo-Database`` HTTP header) on "
"systems where there are multiple databases available for a same domain. The "
"login/password authentication scheme is replaced by an API key (via the "
"``Authorization: bearer`` HTTP header). The ``model`` and ``method`` are "
"placed in the URL. The request body is a JSON object with all the methods "
"arguments, plus ``ids`` and ``context``. All the arguments are named; there "
"is no way in JSON-2 to call a function with positional arguments."
msgstr ""
"JSON-2 API object service'ini bir necha farq bilan almashtiradi. Ma'lumotlar "
"bazasi faqat bir xil domen uchun bir nechta ma'lumotlar bazasi mavjud "
"bo'lgan tizimlarda ko'rsatilishi kerak (``X-Odoo-Database`` HTTP header "
"orqali). Login/parol autentifikatsiya sxemasi API key bilan almashtirilgan "
"(``Authorization: bearer`` HTTP header orqali). ``model`` va ``method`` URL "
"ichida joylashadi. So'rov tanasi barcha method argumentlari, shuningdek "
"``ids`` va ``context`` bilan JSON object'dan iborat. Barcha argumentlar "
"nomlangan; JSON-2 da funksiyani pozitsion argumentlar bilan chaqirishning "
"yo'li yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_api.rst:737
msgid "Using JSON-2:"
msgstr "JSON-2 yordamida:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:3
msgid "External RPC API"
msgstr "Tashqi RPC API"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:9
msgid ""
"Both the XML-RPC and JSON-RPC APIs at endpoints ``/xmlrpc``, ``/xmlrpc/2`` "
"and ``/jsonrpc`` are scheduled for removal in Odoo 22 (fall 2028) and Online "
"21.1 (winter 2027). The :doc:`external_api` acts as a replacement."
msgstr ""
"``/xmlrpc``, ``/xmlrpc/2`` va ``/jsonrpc`` endpoint'laridagi XML-RPC va JSON-"
"RPC API'lari Odoo 22 (2028 kuz) va Online 21.1 (2027 qish) versiyalarida "
"olib tashlanishi rejalashtirilgan. :doc:`external_api` ularning o'rnini "
"bosadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:16
msgid ""
"Odoo is usually extended internally via modules, but many of its features "
"and all of its data are also available from the outside for external "
"analysis or integration with various tools. Part of the :ref:`reference/orm/"
"model` API is easily available over XML-RPC_ and accessible from a variety "
"of languages."
msgstr ""
"Odoo odatda ichki tarzda modullar orqali kengaytiriladi, biroq uning ko'plab "
"imkoniyatlari va barcha ma'lumotlari tashqi tahlil yoki turli vositalar "
"bilan integratsiya uchun tashqaridan ham mavjud. :ref:`reference/orm/model` "
"API'ining bir qismi XML-RPC_ orqali osongina mavjud va turli tillardan "
"foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:21
msgid ""
"Starting with PHP8, the XML-RPC extension may not be available by default. "
"Check out the `manual <https://www.php.net/manual/en/"
"xmlrpc.installation.php>`_ for the installation steps."
msgstr ""
"PHP8 dan boshlab XML-RPC extension standart holatda mavjud bo'lmasligi "
"mumkin. O'rnatish qadamlari uchun `qo'llanma <https://www.php.net/manual/en/"
"xmlrpc.installation.php>`_ ni ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:31
msgid "Connection"
msgstr "Ulanish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:36
msgid ""
"If you already have an Odoo server installed, you can just use its "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Agar sizda Odoo server allaqachon o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, uning parametrlaridan "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:40
msgid ""
"For Odoo Online instances (<domain>.odoo.com), users are created without a "
"*local* password (as a person you are logged in via the Odoo Online "
"authentication system, not by the instance itself). To use XML-RPC on Odoo "
"Online instances, you will need to set a password on the user account you "
"want to use:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo Online instance'lari (<domain>.odoo.com) uchun foydalanuvchilar *local* "
"parolsiz yaratiladi (shaxs sifatida siz instance'ning o'zi emas, Odoo Online "
"autentifikatsiya tizimi orqali kirasiz). Odoo Online instance'larida XML-RPC "
"dan foydalanish uchun ishlatmoqchi bo'lgan foydalanuvchi hisobiga parol "
"o'rnatishingiz kerak bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:46
msgid "Log in your instance with an administrator account."
msgstr "Instance'ingizga administrator hisobi bilan kiring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:47
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Users`."
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Users` bo'limiga o'ting."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:48
msgid "Click on the user you want to use for XML-RPC access."
msgstr ""
"XML-RPC orqali kirish uchun ishlatmoqchi bo'lgan foydalanuvchini bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:49
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Action` and select :guilabel:`Change Password`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Action` ni bosing va :guilabel:`Change Password` ni tanlang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:50
msgid ""
"Set a :guilabel:`New Password` value then click :guilabel:`Change Password`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`New Password` qiymatini kiriting, so'ng :guilabel:`Change "
"Password` ni bosing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:52
msgid ""
"The *server url* is the instance's domain (e.g. *https://"
"mycompany.odoo.com*), the *database name* is the name of the instance (e.g. "
"*mycompany*). The *username* is the configured user's login as shown by the "
"*Change Password* screen."
msgstr ""
"*server url* — instance'ning domeni (masalan *https://mycompany.odoo.com*), "
"*database name* — instance nomi (masalan *mycompany*). *username* — *Change "
"Password* ekranida ko'rsatilgan, sozlangan foydalanuvchining login'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:103
msgid ""
"Odoo has support for **api keys** and (depending on modules or settings) may "
"**require** these keys to perform webservice operations."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **api key**'larni qo'llab-quvvatlaydi va (modullar yoki sozlamalarga "
"qarab) webservice operatsiyalarini bajarish uchun bu key'larni **talab "
"qilishi** mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:106
msgid ""
"The way to use API Keys in your scripts is to simply replace your "
"**password** by the key. The login remains in-use. You should store the API "
"Key as carefully as the password as they essentially provide the same access "
"to your user account (although they can not be used to log-in via the "
"interface)."
msgstr ""
"Script'laringizda API Key'lardan foydalanish uchun **parol**ingizni key "
"bilan almashtirish kifoya. Login o'z holida ishlatilishda qoladi. API Key'ni "
"parol kabi ehtiyotkorlik bilan saqlashingiz kerak, chunki ular sizning "
"foydalanuvchi hisobingizga aslida xuddi shunday kirish imkonini beradi "
"(garchi ular interface orqali kirish uchun ishlatilmaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:111
msgid ""
"In order to add a key to your account, simply go to "
"your :guilabel:`Preferences` (or :guilabel:`My Profile`):"
msgstr ""
"Hisobingizga key qo'shish uchun :guilabel:`Preferences` (yoki :guilabel:`My "
"Profile`) bo'limiga o'ting:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:117
msgid ""
"then open the :guilabel:`Account Security` tab, and click :guilabel:`New API "
"Key`:"
msgstr ""
"so'ng :guilabel:`Account Security` tab'ini oching va :guilabel:`New API Key` "
"ni bosing:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:123
msgid ""
"Input a description for the key, **this description should be as clear and "
"complete as possible**: it is the only way you will have to identify your "
"keys later and know whether you should remove them or keep them around."
msgstr ""
"Key uchun tavsif kiriting, **bu tavsif imkon qadar aniq va to'liq bo'lishi "
"kerak**: keyinchalik key'laringizni aniqlash va ularni o'chirish yoki saqlab "
"qolish kerakligini bilishning yagona yo'li shu."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:127
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Generate Key`, then copy the key provided. **Store this key "
"carefully**: it is equivalent to your password, and just like your password "
"the system will not be able to retrieve or show the key again later on. If "
"you lose this key, you will have to create a new one (and probably delete "
"the one you lost)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Generate Key` ni bosing, so'ngra berilgan kalitni ko'chirib "
"oling. **Bu kalitni ehtiyotkorlik bilan saqlang**: u parolingizga teng va "
"parolingiz kabi tizim keyinchalik kalitni qayta olib berishga yoki "
"ko'rsatishga qodir bo'lmaydi. Agar bu kalitni yo'qotsangiz, yangisini "
"yaratishingiz kerak bo'ladi (va ehtimol yo'qotganini o'chirishingiz kerak)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:133
msgid ""
"Once you have keys configured on your account, they will appear above "
"the :guilabel:`New API Key` button, and you will be able to delete them:"
msgstr ""
"Hisobingizda kalitlar sozlangandan so'ng, ular :guilabel:`New API Key` "
"tugmasi ustida ko'rinadi va siz ularni o'chirib tashlashingiz mumkin bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:139
msgid ""
"**A deleted API key can not be undeleted or re-set**. You will have to "
"generate a new key and update all the places where you used the old one."
msgstr ""
"**O'chirilgan API kalitini tiklash yoki qayta o'rnatish mumkin emas**. Siz "
"yangi kalit yaratishingiz va eski kalitdan foydalangan barcha joylarni "
"yangilashingiz kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:143
msgid "Test database"
msgstr "Test ma'lumotlar bazasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:145
msgid ""
