"Bu misollarda oddiy XML-RPC API taqdim etuvchi `Ripcord <https://"
"code.google.com/p/ripcord/>`_ kutubxonasi ishlatiladi. Ripcord sizning PHP "
"o'rnatmangizda `XML-RPC qo'llab-quvvatlashi yoqilgan bo'lishini <https://"
"php.net/manual/en/xmlrpc.installation.php>`_ talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:177
