"Since calls are performed over `HTTPS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"HTTP_Secure>`_, it also requires that the `OpenSSL extension <https://"
"php.net/manual/en/openssl.installation.php>`_ be enabled."
msgstr ""
"Chaqiriqlar `HTTPS <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTTP_Secure>`_ orqali "
"amalga oshirilganligi sababli, u shuningdek `OpenSSL extension <https://"
"php.net/manual/en/openssl.installation.php>`_ yoqilgan bo'lishini talab "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:182
