msgid "Go"
msgstr "Go"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:220
msgid ""
"These examples use the `github.com/kolo/xmlrpc library <https://github.com/"
"kolo/xmlrpc>`_."
msgstr ""
"Bu misollarda `github.com/kolo/xmlrpc library <https://github.com/kolo/"
