msgid "Result:"
msgstr "Natija:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:316
msgid "Calling methods"
msgstr "Method'larni chaqirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:318
msgid ""
"The second endpoint is ``xmlrpc/2/object``. It is used to call methods of "
"odoo models via the ``execute_kw`` RPC function."
msgstr ""
"Ikkinchi endpoint — ``xmlrpc/2/object``. U odoo model'larining method'larini "
"``execute_kw`` RPC funksiyasi orqali chaqirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:321
msgid "Each call to ``execute_kw`` takes the following parameters:"
msgstr "``execute_kw`` ga har bir chaqiriq quyidagi parametrlarni oladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:323
msgid "the database to use, a string"
msgstr "ishlatiladigan ma'lumotlar bazasi, satr"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:324
msgid "the user id (retrieved through ``authenticate``), an integer"
msgstr "foydalanuvchi id'si (``authenticate`` orqali olinadi), butun son"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:325
msgid "the user's password, a string"
msgstr "foydalanuvchining paroli, satr"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:326
msgid "the model name, a string"
msgstr "model nomi, satr"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:327
msgid "the method name, a string"
msgstr "method nomi, satr"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:328
msgid "an array/list of parameters passed by position"
msgstr "pozitsiya bo'yicha uzatiladigan parametrlar massivi/ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:329
msgid "a mapping/dict of parameters to pass by keyword (optional)"
msgstr ""
"kalit so'z bo'yicha uzatiladigan parametrlar mapping'i/dict'i (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:333
msgid ""
"For instance, to search for records in the ``res.partner`` model, we can "
"call ``name_search`` with ``name`` passed by position and ``limit`` passed "
"by keyword (in order to get maximum 10 results):"
msgstr ""
"Masalan, ``res.partner`` model'ida record'larni qidirish uchun "
"``name_search`` ni chaqirishimiz mumkin: ``name`` pozitsiya bo'yicha, "
"``limit`` esa kalit so'z bo'yicha uzatiladi (ko'pi bilan 10 natija olish "
"uchun):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:391
msgid "List records"
msgstr "Record'larni ro'yxatlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:393
msgid ""
"Records can be listed and filtered via :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search`."
msgstr ""
"Record'larni :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` orqali ro'yxatlash va "
"filtrlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:395
msgid ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` takes a mandatory :ref:`domain <reference/"
"orm/domains>` filter (possibly empty), and returns the database identifiers "
"of all records matching the filter."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` majburiy :ref:`domain <reference/orm/"
"domains>` filtrini oladi (u bo'sh ham bo'lishi mumkin) va filtrga mos "
"keladigan barcha record'larning ma'lumotlar bazasi identifikatorlarini "
"qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:401
msgid "To list customer companies, for instance:"
msgstr "Masalan, mijoz kompaniyalarni ro'yxatlash uchun:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:446
msgid "Pagination"
msgstr "Sahifalash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:448
msgid ""
"By default a search will return the ids of all records matching the "
"condition, which may be a huge number. ``offset`` and ``limit`` parameters "
"are available to only retrieve a subset of all matched records."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha qidiruv shartga mos keladigan barcha record'larning id'larini "
"qaytaradi, bu esa juda katta son bo'lishi mumkin. Mos kelgan record'larning "
"faqat bir qismini olish uchun ``offset`` va ``limit`` parametrlari mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:499
msgid "Count records"
msgstr "Record'larni sanash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:501
msgid ""
"Rather than retrieve a possibly gigantic list of records and count "
"them, :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_count` can be used to retrieve only "
"the number of records matching the query. It takes the same :ref:`domain "
"<reference/orm/domains>` filter as :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` and no "
"other parameter."
msgstr ""
"Record'larning ehtimoliy juda katta ro'yxatini olib, keyin ularni sanash "
"o'rniga, so'rovga mos keladigan record'lar sonini olish "
"uchun :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_count` dan foydalanish mumkin. "
"U :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` bilan bir xil :ref:`domain <reference/"
"orm/domains>` filtrini oladi va boshqa hech qanday parametr olmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:552
msgid ""
"Calling ``search`` then ``search_count`` (or the other way around) may not "
"yield coherent results if other users are using the server: stored data "
"could have changed between the calls."
msgstr ""
"Agar boshqa foydalanuvchilar serverdan foydalanayotgan bo'lsa, ``search`` "
"ni, so'ngra ``search_count`` ni chaqirish (yoki teskarisi) o'zaro mos "
"natijalar bermasligi mumkin: saqlangan ma'lumotlar chaqiriqlar orasida "
"o'zgargan bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:557
msgid "Read records"
msgstr "Record'larni o'qish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:559
msgid ""
"Record data are accessible via the :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.read` method, "
"which takes a list of ids (as returned "
"by :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search`), and optionally a list of fields to "
"fetch. By default, it fetches all the fields the current user can read, "
"which tends to be a huge amount."
msgstr ""
"Record ma'lumotlari :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.read` method'i orqali "
"o'qiladi; u id'lar ro'yxatini (:meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` "
"qaytaradigan ro'yxat kabi) va ixtiyoriy ravishda olinadigan field'lar "
"ro'yxatini oladi. Sukut bo'yicha u joriy foydalanuvchi o'qishi mumkin "
"bo'lgan barcha field'larni oladi, bu esa odatda juda katta hajmda bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:639
msgid "Conversely, picking only three fields deemed interesting."
msgstr "Aksincha, faqat qiziqarli deb topilgan uchta field'ni tanlash."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:687
msgid "Even if the ``id`` field is not requested, it is always returned."
msgstr "``id`` field'i so'ralmagan bo'lsa ham, u har doim qaytariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:690
msgid "List record fields"
msgstr "Record field'larini ro'yxatlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:692
msgid ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fields_get` can be used to inspect a model's "
"fields and check which ones seem to be of interest."
msgstr ""
"Model field'larini tekshirish va qaysilari qiziqarli ekanini bilish "
"uchun :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fields_get` dan foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:695
msgid ""
"Because it returns a large amount of meta-information (it is also used by "
"client programs) it should be filtered before printing, the most interesting "
"items for a human user are ``string`` (the field's label), ``help`` (a help "
"text if available) and ``type`` (to know which values to expect, or to send "
"when updating a record)."
msgstr ""
"U katta hajmdagi meta-ma'lumotni qaytarganligi sababli (u client "
"programmalar tomonidan ham ishlatiladi), chop etishdan oldin filtrlanishi "
"kerak; odam foydalanuvchi uchun eng qiziqarli elementlar — ``string`` (field "
"yorlig'i), ``help`` (agar mavjud bo'lsa, yordam matni) va ``type`` (qanday "
"qiymatlarni kutish yoki record'ni yangilashda yuborish kerakligini bilish "
"uchun)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:784
msgid "Search and read"
msgstr "Qidirish va o'qish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:786
msgid ""
"Because it is a very common task, Odoo provides "
"a :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_read` shortcut which, as its name "
"suggests, is equivalent to a :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` followed by "
"a :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.read`, but avoids having to perform two requests "
"and keep ids around."
msgstr ""
"Bu juda keng tarqalgan vazifa bo'lganligi uchun "
"Odoo :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search_read` yorlig'ini taqdim etadi; nomidan "
"ko'rinib turganidek, u :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` dan "
"keyin :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.read` ni bajarishga teng, lekin ikki marta "
"so'rov yuborish va id'larni saqlab turish zaruratini yo'qotadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:792
msgid ""
"Its arguments are similar to :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search`'s, but it can "
"also take a list of ``fields`` (like :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.read`, if "
"that list is not provided it will fetch all fields of matched records)."
msgstr ""
"Uning argumentlari :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.search` argumentlariga "
"o'xshaydi, lekin u ``fields`` ro'yxatini ham olishi mumkin "
"(:meth:`~odoo.models.Model.read` kabi, agar bu ro'yxat berilmasa, u mos "
"kelgan record'larning barcha field'larini oladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:880
msgid "Create records"
msgstr "Record'lar yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:882
msgid ""
"Records of a model are created using :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create`. The "
"method creates a single record and returns its database identifier."
msgstr ""
"Model record'lari :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create` yordamida yaratiladi. Bu "
"method bitta record yaratadi va uning ma'lumotlar bazasi identifikatorini "
"qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:885
msgid ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create` takes a mapping of fields to values, used "
"to initialize the record. For any field which has a default value and is not "
"set through the mapping argument, the default value will be used."
msgstr ""
":meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create` record'ni initsializatsiya qilish uchun "
"ishlatiladigan field'lar va qiymatlar mapping'ini oladi. Sukut bo'yicha "
"qiymatga ega bo'lgan va mapping argumenti orqali o'rnatilmagan har qanday "
"field uchun sukut bo'yicha qiymat ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:933
msgid ""
"While most value types are what would expect (integer "
"for :class:`~odoo.fields.Integer`, string for :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` "
"or :class:`~odoo.fields.Text`),"
msgstr ""
"Qiymat turlarining ko'pchiligi kutilganidek bo'lsa-da "
"(:class:`~odoo.fields.Integer` uchun butun son, :class:`~odoo.fields.Char` "
"yoki :class:`~odoo.fields.Text` uchun satr),"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:937
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Date`, :class:`~odoo.fields.Datetime` "
"and :class:`~odoo.fields.Binary` fields use string values"
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Date`, :class:`~odoo.fields.Datetime` "
"va :class:`~odoo.fields.Binary` field'lari satr qiymatlaridan foydalanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:939
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` and :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` use a "
"special command protocol detailed in :meth:`the documentation to the write "
"method <odoo.models.Model.write>`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` "
"va :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` :meth:`write method hujjatlarida "
"<odoo.models.Model.write>` batafsil tavsiflangan maxsus buyruq protokolidan "
"foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:944
msgid "Update records"
msgstr "Record'larni yangilash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:946
msgid ""
"Records can be updated using :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.write`. It takes a "
"list of records to update and a mapping of updated fields to values similar "
"to :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create`."
msgstr ""
"Record'larni :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.write` yordamida yangilash mumkin. U "
"yangilanadigan record'lar ro'yxatini va :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.create` "
"dagiga o'xshash yangilangan field'lar va qiymatlar mapping'ini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:950
msgid ""
"Multiple records can be updated simultaneously, but they will all get the "
"same values for the fields being set. It is not possible to perform "
"\"computed\" updates (where the value being set depends on an existing value "
"of a record)."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta record'ni yangilash mumkin, lekin ularning "
"barchasi o'rnatilayotgan field'lar uchun bir xil qiymatlarni oladi. "
"\"Hisoblangan\" yangilanishlarni bajarish mumkin emas (bunda o'rnatilayotgan "
"qiymat record'ning mavjud qiymatiga bog'liq bo'ladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1027
msgid "Delete records"
msgstr "Record'larni o'chirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1029
msgid ""
"Records can be deleted in bulk by providing their ids "
"to :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.unlink`."
msgstr ""
"Record'larni ularning id'larini :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.unlink` ga berish "
"orqali ommaviy ravishda o'chirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1100
msgid "Inspection and introspection"
msgstr "Tekshirish va introspeksiya"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1102
msgid ""
"While we previously used :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fields_get` to query a "
"model and have been using an arbitrary model from the start, Odoo stores "
"most model metadata inside a few meta-models which allow both querying the "
"system and altering models and fields (with some limitations) on the fly "
"over XML-RPC."
msgstr ""
"Ilgari model'ni so'rash uchun :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.fields_get` dan "
"foydalanganimiz va boshidan ixtiyoriy model bilan ishlaganimizga qaramay, "
"Odoo model metama'lumotlarining ko'pchiligini bir nechta meta-model ichida "
"saqlaydi; bu esa XML-RPC orqali tizimni so'rash, shuningdek model va "
"field'larni (ba'zi cheklovlar bilan) darhol o'zgartirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1111
msgid "``ir.model``"
msgstr "``ir.model``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1113
msgid "Provides information about Odoo models via its various fields."
msgstr ""
"O'zining turli field'lari orqali Odoo model'lari haqida ma'lumot beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1116
msgid "a human-readable description of the model"
msgstr "model'ning odam o'qiy oladigan tavsifi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1117
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3008
msgid "``model``"
msgstr "``model``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1118
msgid "the name of each model in the system"
msgstr "tizimdagi har bir model'ning nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1120
msgid ""
"whether the model was generated in Python code (``base``) or by creating an "
"``ir.model`` record (``manual``)"
msgstr ""
"model Python kodida (``base``) yaratilganmi yoki ``ir.model`` record'ini "
"yaratish orqali (``manual``) yaratilganmi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1123
msgid "``field_id``"
msgstr "``field_id``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1123
msgid ""
"list of the model's fields through a :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` "
"to :ref:`reference/webservice/inspection/fields`"
msgstr ""
"model field'larining ro'yxati — :ref:`reference/webservice/inspection/"
"fields` ga :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` orqali"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1126
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` to the :doc:`../reference/user_interface/"
"view_architectures` defined for the model"
msgstr ""
"model uchun aniqlangan :doc:`../reference/user_interface/view_architectures` "
"ga :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1130
msgid "``access_ids``"
msgstr "``access_ids``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1129
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` relation to the :ref:`reference/security/acl` "
"set on the model"
msgstr ""
"model'da o'rnatilgan :ref:`reference/security/acl` "
"ga :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` bog'lanish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1132
msgid "``ir.model`` can be used to"
msgstr "``ir.model`` quyidagilar uchun ishlatilishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1134
msgid ""
"Query the system for installed models (as a precondition to operations on "
"the model or to explore the system's content)."
msgstr ""
"O'rnatilgan model'larni bilish uchun tizimga so'rov yuborish (model ustidagi "
"amallar uchun oldingi shart sifatida yoki tizim tarkibini o'rganish uchun)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1136
msgid ""
"Get information about a specific model (generally by listing the fields "
"associated with it)."
msgstr ""
"Muayyan model haqida ma'lumot olish (odatda unga bog'liq field'lar "
"ro'yxatini olish orqali)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1138
msgid "Create new models dynamically over RPC."
msgstr "RPC orqali yangi model'larni dinamik ravishda yaratish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1141
msgid "Custom model names must start with ``x_``."
msgstr "Maxsus model nomlari ``x_`` bilan boshlanishi shart."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1142
msgid ""
"The ``state`` must be provided and set to ``manual``, otherwise the model "
"will not be loaded."
msgstr ""
"``state`` ko'rsatilishi va ``manual`` qilib belgilanishi shart, aks holda "
"model yuklanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1144
msgid "It is not possible to add new *methods* to a custom model, only fields."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus model'ga yangi *method*'lar qo'shish mumkin emas, faqat field'lar "
"qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1148
msgid ""
"A custom model will initially contain only the \"built-in\" fields available "
"on all models:"
msgstr ""
"Maxsus model boshida faqat barcha model'larda mavjud bo'lgan \"built-in\" "
"field'larni o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1271
msgid "``ir.model.fields``"
msgstr "``ir.model.fields``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1273
msgid ""
"Provides information about the fields of Odoo models and allows adding "
"custom fields without using Python code."
msgstr ""
"Odoo model'lari field'lari haqida ma'lumot beradi va Python kodidan "
"foydalanmasdan maxsus field'lar qo'shish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1277
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` to :ref:`reference/webservice/inspection/"
"models` to which the field belongs"
msgstr ""
"field tegishli bo'lgan :ref:`reference/webservice/inspection/models` "
"ga :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1280
msgid "the field's technical name (used in ``read`` or ``write``)"
msgstr "field'ning texnik nomi (``read`` yoki ``write`` da ishlatiladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1281
msgid "``field_description``"
msgstr "``field_description``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1282
msgid "the field's user-readable label (e.g. ``string`` in ``fields_get``)"
msgstr ""
"field'ning foydalanuvchi o'qiy oladigan yorlig'i (masalan ``fields_get`` "
"dagi ``string``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1283
msgid "``ttype``"
msgstr "``ttype``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1284
msgid "the :ref:`type <reference/orm/fields>` of field to create"
msgstr "yaratiladigan field'ning :ref:`turi <reference/orm/fields>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1286
msgid ""
"whether the field was created via Python code (``base``) or via "
"``ir.model.fields`` (``manual``)"
msgstr ""
"field Python kodi orqali (``base``) yaratilganmi yoki ``ir.model.fields`` "
"orqali (``manual``) yaratilganmi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1288
msgid "``required``, ``readonly``, ``translate``"
msgstr "``required``, ``readonly``, ``translate``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1289
msgid "enables the corresponding flag on the field"
msgstr "field'da mos flag'ni yoqadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1291
msgid ""
":ref:`field-level access control <reference/security/fields>`, "
"a :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` to ``res.groups``"
msgstr ""
":ref:`field darajasidagi kirish nazorati <reference/security/fields>`, "
"``res.groups`` ga :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1295
msgid ""
"``selection``, ``size``, ``on_delete``, ``relation``, ``relation_field``, "
"``domain``"
msgstr ""
"``selection``, ``size``, ``on_delete``, ``relation``, ``relation_field``, "
"``domain``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1294
msgid ""
"type-specific properties and customizations, see :ref:`the fields "
"documentation <reference/orm/fields>` for details"
msgstr ""
"turga xos xususiyatlar va sozlamalar, batafsil ma'lumot "
"uchun :ref:`field'lar hujjatlariga <reference/orm/fields>` qarang"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1298
msgid ""
"Like custom models, only new fields created with ``state=\"manual\"`` are "
"activated as actual fields on the model."
msgstr ""
"Maxsus model'lar kabi, faqat ``state=\"manual\"`` bilan yaratilgan yangi "
"field'lar model'da haqiqiy field sifatida faollashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/external_rpc_api.rst:1300
msgid ""
"Computed fields can not be added via ``ir.model.fields``, some field meta-"
"information (defaults, onchange) can not be set either."
msgstr ""
"Computed field'larni ``ir.model.fields`` orqali qo'shish mumkin emas, ba'zi "
"field meta-ma'lumotlarini (defaults, onchange) ham o'rnatib bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:3
msgid "Extract API"
msgstr "Extract API"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:8
msgid ""
"Odoo provides a service to automate the processing of documents of type "
"**invoices**, **bank statements**, **expenses** or **resumes**."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **invoices**, **bank statements**, **expenses** yoki **resumes** "
"turidagi hujjatlarni qayta ishlashni avtomatlashtirish uchun xizmat taqdim "
"etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:11
msgid ""
"The service scans documents using an |OCR| engine and then "
"uses :abbr:`AI(Artificial Intelligence)`-based algorithms to extract fields "
"of interest such as the total, due date, or invoice lines for *invoices*, "
"the initial and final balances, the date for *bank statements*, the total, "
"date for *expenses*, or the name, email, phone number for *resumes*."
msgstr ""
"Xizmat hujjatlarni |OCR| dvigateli yordamida skanerlaydi, so'ngra kerakli "
"field'larni ajratib olish uchun :abbr:`AI(Artificial Intelligence)` ga "
"asoslangan algoritmlardan foydalanadi: *invoices* uchun jami summa, to'lov "
"muddati yoki invoice qatorlari, *bank statements* uchun boshlang'ich va "
"yakuniy balanslar hamda sana, *expenses* uchun jami summa va sana, *resumes* "
"uchun esa ism, email va telefon raqami."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:16
msgid ""
"This service is a paid service. Each document processing will cost you one "
"credit from your document digitization |IAP| account. More information about "
"|IAP| accounts can be found :doc:`here </applications/essentials/"
"in_app_purchase>`."
msgstr ""
"Bu xizmat pullik. Har bir hujjatni qayta ishlash sizning hujjatlarni "
"raqamlashtirish |IAP| hisobingizdan bitta kredit yechadi. |IAP| hisoblari "
"haqida batafsil ma'lumotni :doc:`bu yerda </applications/essentials/"
"in_app_purchase>` topish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:20
msgid ""
"You can either use this service directly in the Accounting, Expense, or "
"Recruitment App or through the API. The Extract API, which is detailed in "
"the next section, allows you to integrate our service directly into your own "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"Bu xizmatdan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri Accounting, Expense yoki Recruitment "
"ilovasida yoki API orqali foydalanishingiz mumkin. Keyingi bo'limda batafsil "
"bayon etilgan Extract API bizning xizmatimizni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri o'z "
"loyihalaringizga integratsiya qilish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:28
msgid ""
"The extract API uses the JSON-RPC2_ protocol; its endpoint routes are "
"located at `https://extract.api.odoo.com`."
msgstr ""
"Extract API JSON-RPC2_ protokolidan foydalanadi; uning endpoint route'lari "
"`https://extract.api.odoo.com` manzilida joylashgan."

