#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:100
msgid ""
"The document must be provided as a Base64 string in the ASCII encoding. The "
"list should contain only one document. This field is a list only for legacy "
"reasons. The supported formats are *pdf*, *png* and *jpg*."
msgstr ""
"Hujjat ASCII kodlashdagi Base64 satri sifatida berilishi kerak. Ro'yxat "
"faqat bitta hujjatni o'z ichiga olishi lozim. Bu field faqat legacy "
"sabablarga ko'ra ro'yxat shaklida. Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan formatlar: *pdf*, "
"*png* va *jpg*."

