msgstr "``webhook_url`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:106
msgid ""
"A webhook URL can be provided. An empty POST request will be sent to "
"``webhook_url/document_token`` when the result is ready."
msgstr ""
"Webhook URL manzilini ko'rsatish mumkin. Natija tayyor bo'lganda "
"``webhook_url/document_token`` manziliga bo'sh POST request yuboriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:135
msgid "``user_infos`` (optional)"
msgstr "``user_infos`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:109
msgid ""
"Information concerning the person sending the document to the extract "
"service. It can be the client or the supplier (depending on the "
"``perspective``). This information is not required in order for the service "
"to work but it greatly improves the quality of the result."
msgstr ""
"Hujjatni extract service'ga yuborayotgan shaxs haqidagi ma'lumot. Bu "
"``perspective`` ga qarab client yoki supplier bo'lishi mumkin. Bu ma'lumot "
"service ishlashi uchun majburiy emas, biroq natija sifatini sezilarli "
"darajada yaxshilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:115
msgid "``user_company_vat`` (optional)"
msgstr "``user_company_vat`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:116
msgid "VAT number of the user."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchining VAT raqami."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:117
msgid "``user_company_name`` (optional)"
msgstr "``user_company_name`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:118
msgid "Name of the user’s company."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi kompaniyasining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:120
msgid "``user_company_country_code`` (optional)"
msgstr "``user_company_country_code`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:120
msgid ""
"Country code of the user. Format: `ISO3166 alpha-2 <https://www.iban.com/"
"country-codes>`_."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchining davlat kodi. Format: `ISO3166 alpha-2 <https://"
"www.iban.com/country-codes>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:122
msgid "``user_lang`` (optional)"
msgstr "``user_lang`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:123
msgid ""
"The user language. Format: *language_code + _ + locale* (e.g. fr_FR, en_US)."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi tili. Format: *language_code + _ + locale* (masalan, fr_FR, "
"en_US)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:124
msgid "``user_email`` (optional)"
msgstr "``user_email`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:125
msgid "The user email."
msgstr "Foydalanuvchining email manzili."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:126
msgid "``purchase_order_regex`` (optional)"
msgstr "``purchase_order_regex`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:127
msgid ""
"Regex for purchase order identification. Will default to Odoo PO format if "
"not provided."
msgstr ""
"Purchase order'ni aniqlash uchun regex. Ko'rsatilmasa, sukut bo'yicha Odoo "
"PO formati ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:135
msgid "``perspective`` (optional)"
msgstr "``perspective`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:131
msgid ""
"Can be ``client`` or ``supplier``. This field is useful for invoices only. "
"``client`` means that the user information provided are related to the "
"client of the invoice. ``supplier`` means that it's related to the supplier. "
"If not provided, client will be used."
msgstr ""
"``client`` yoki ``supplier`` bo'lishi mumkin. Bu field faqat invoice'lar "
"uchun foydali. ``client`` berilgan foydalanuvchi ma'lumotlari invoice'ning "
"client'iga tegishli ekanini bildiradi. ``supplier`` esa u supplier'ga "
"tegishli ekanini bildiradi. Ko'rsatilmasa, client ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:162
msgid ""
"The ``user_infos`` parameter is optional but it greatly improves the quality "
"of the result, especially for invoices. The more information you can "
"provide, the better."
msgstr ""
"``user_infos`` parametri ixtiyoriy, biroq u natija sifatini, ayniqsa "
"invoice'lar uchun, sezilarli darajada yaxshilaydi. Qancha ko'p ma'lumot "
"bersangiz, shuncha yaxshi."

