#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:329
msgid ""
"Each field of interest we want to extract from the document such as the "
"total or the due date are also called **features**. An exhaustive list of "
"all the extracted features associated to a type of document can be found in "
"the sections below."
msgstr ""
"Hujjatdan ajratib olishni istagan har bir muhim field, masalan jami summa "
"yoki to'lov muddati, **features** deb ham ataladi. Muayyan hujjat turiga "
"tegishli ajratib olinadigan barcha feature'larning to'liq ro'yxatini "
"quyidagi bo'limlarda topishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/extract_api.rst:333
msgid ""
"For each feature, we return a list of candidates and we spotlight the "
"candidate our model predicts to be the best fit for the feature."
msgstr ""
"Har bir feature uchun candidate'lar ro'yxati qaytariladi va model ushbu "
"feature uchun eng mos deb hisoblagan candidate ajratib ko'rsatiladi."

