#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:309
msgid ""
"This hook is useful when components need to load some assets in their "
"`onWillStart` method. It internally calls `loadAssets`."
msgstr ""
"Bu hook component'lar o'zlarining `onWillStart` method'ida ba'zi asset'larni "
"yuklashi kerak bo'lganda foydali. U ichkarida `loadAssets` ni chaqiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:315
msgid "The asset model (`ir.asset`)"
msgstr "Asset model'i (`ir.asset`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:317
msgid ""
"In most cases the assets declared in the manifest will largely suffice. Yet "
"for more flexibility, the framework also supports dynamic assets declared in "
"the database."
msgstr ""
"Ko'p hollarda manifest'da e'lon qilingan asset'lar to'liq yetarli bo'ladi. "
"Ammo ko'proq moslashuvchanlik uchun framework ma'lumotlar bazasida e'lon "
"qilingan dinamik asset'larni ham qo'llab-quvvatlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/assets.rst:321
msgid ""
"This is done by creating `ir.asset` records. Those will be processed as if "
"they were found in a module manifest, and they give the same expressive "
"power as their manifest counterparts."
msgstr ""
"Bu `ir.asset` record'larini yaratish orqali amalga oshiriladi. Ular modul "
"manifest'ida topilgandek qayta ishlanadi va manifest'dagi variantlari bilan "
"bir xil imkoniyatlarni beradi."

