msgstr "WebClient arxitekturasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:67
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, the web client is an owl application. Here is a slightly "
"simplified version of its template:"
msgstr ""
"Yuqorida aytilganidek, web client — owl application. Uning template'ining "
"biroz soddalashtirilgan versiyasi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:80
msgid ""
"As we can see, it basically is a wrapper for a navbar, the current action "
"and some additional components. The ``ActionContainer`` is a higher order "
"component that will display the current action controller (so, a client "
"action, or a specific view in the case of actions of type ``act_window``). "
"Managing actions is a huge part of its work: the action service keeps in "
"memory a stack of all active actions (represented in the breadcrumbs), and "
"coordinates each change."
msgstr ""
"Ko'rib turganimizdek, u asosan navbar, joriy action va bir nechta qo'shimcha "
"component'lar uchun wrapper hisoblanadi. ``ActionContainer`` — joriy action "
"controller'ini ko'rsatadigan yuqori darajadagi component (ya'ni client "
"action, yoki ``act_window`` turidagi action'lar holatida muayyan view). "
"Action'larni boshqarish uning ishining katta qismini tashkil etadi: action "
"service barcha aktiv action'lar stack'ini xotirada saqlaydi (u breadcrumb'da "
"ko'rsatiladi) va har bir o'zgarishni muvofiqlashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:88
msgid ""
"Another interesting thing to note is the ``MainComponentsContainer``: it is "
"simply a component that displays all components registered in the "
"``main_components`` registry. This is how other parts of the system can "
"extend the web client."
msgstr ""
"E'tiborga loyiq yana bir narsa — ``MainComponentsContainer``: bu shunchaki "
"``main_components`` registry'sida ro'yxatga olingan barcha component'larni "
"ko'rsatadigan component. Tizimning boshqa qismlari web client'ni aynan shu "
"yo'l bilan kengaytiradi."

