msgstr ""
"Masalan, component ichidagi satrni tarjima qilish uchun (e'tibor bering: "
"template'lar avtomatik tarjima qilinadi, shuning uchun u holatda maxsus "
"harakat talab qilinmaydi) quyidagicha yozish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:133
msgid ""
"Having a reference to the environment is quite powerful, because it provides "
"access to all services. This is useful in many cases: for example, user menu "
"items are mostly defined as a string, and a function taking the `env` as "
"unique argument. This is enough to express all user menu needs."
msgstr ""
"Environment'ga havolaga ega bo'lish juda qulay, chunki u barcha "
"service'larga kirish imkonini beradi. Bu ko'p holatlarda foydali: masalan, "
"user menu element'lari asosan satr va `env` ni yagona argument sifatida "
"qabul qiladigan funksiya ko'rinishida aniqlanadi. Bu user menu'ning barcha "
"ehtiyojlarini ifodalash uchun yetarli."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:139
msgid "Building Blocks"
msgstr "Qurilish bloklari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:141
msgid ""
"Most of the web client is built with a few types of abstractions: "
"registries, services, components and hooks."
msgstr ""
"Web client'ning ko'p qismi bir nechta turdagi abstraksiyalar asosida "
"qurilgan: registry'lar, service'lar, component'lar va hook'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:145
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:177
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:5
msgid "Registries"
msgstr "Registry'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:147
msgid ""
":ref:`Registries <frontend/registries>` are basically a simple key/value "
"mapping that stores some specific kind of objects. They are an important "
"part of the extensibility of the UI: once some object is registered, the "
"rest of the web client can use it. For example, the field registry contains "
"all field components (or widgets) that can be used in views."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Registries <frontend/registries>` — asosan muayyan turdagi obyektlarni "
"saqlaydigan oddiy key/value mapping. Ular UI kengaytiriluvchanligining muhim "
"qismi hisoblanadi: biror obyekt ro'yxatga olinganidan keyin web client'ning "
"qolgan qismi undan foydalanishi mumkin. Masalan, field registry view'larda "
"ishlatilishi mumkin bo'lgan barcha field component'lari (yoki widget'lari)ni "
"o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:164
msgid ""
"Note that we import the main registry from ``@web/core/registry`` then open "
"the sub registry ``fields``."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, biz asosiy registry'ni ``@web/core/registry`` dan import "
"qilamiz, so'ngra ``fields`` sub registry'sini ochamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:168
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:217
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:6
msgid "Services"
msgstr "Service'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:170
msgid ""
":ref:`Services <frontend/services>` are long lived pieces of code that "
"provide a feature. They may be imported by components (with ``useService``) "
"or by other services. Also, they can declare a set of dependencies. In that "
"sense, services are basically a DI (dependency injection) system. For "
"example, the ``notification`` service provides a way to display a "
"notification, or the ``rpc`` service is the proper way to perform a request "
"to the Odoo server."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Services <frontend/services>` — biror imkoniyatni ta'minlaydigan uzoq "
"muddat yashaydigan kod bo'laklari. Ularni component'lar (``useService`` "
"yordamida) yoki boshqa service'lar import qilishi mumkin. Shuningdek, ular "
"bir qator dependency'larni e'lon qilishi mumkin. Shu ma'noda service'lar "
"asosan DI (dependency injection) tizimidir. Masalan, ``notification`` "
"service notification ko'rsatish imkonini beradi, ``rpc`` service esa Odoo "
"serveriga so'rov yuborishning to'g'ri usuli hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:177
msgid ""
"The following example registers a simple service that displays a "
"notification every 5 second:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misolda har 5 sekundda notification ko'rsatadigan oddiy service "
"ro'yxatga olinadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:199
msgid "Components and Hooks"
msgstr "Component'lar va hook'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:201
msgid ""
":ref:`Components <frontend/components>` and :ref:`hooks <frontend/hooks>` "
"are ideas coming from the `Owl component system <https://github.com/odoo/owl/"
"blob/master/doc/v2/readme.md>`_. Odoo components are simply owl components "
"that are part of the web client."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Components <frontend/components>` va :ref:`hooks <frontend/hooks>` "
"g'oyalari `Owl component system <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/readme.md>`_ dan kelib chiqqan. Odoo component'lari shunchaki web "
"client'ning bir qismi bo'lgan owl component'laridir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:205
msgid ""
"`Hooks <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_ "
"are a way to factorize code, even if it depends on lifecycle. This is a "
"composable/functional way to inject a feature in a component. They can be "
"seen as a kind of mixin."
msgstr ""
"`Hooks <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_ "
"— kodni umumlashtirish usuli bo'lib, hatto u lifecycle'ga bog'liq bo'lsa ham "
"ishlaydi. Bu component'ga biror imkoniyatni qo'shishning "
"kompozitsiyalanadigan/funksional usuli. Ularni mixin'ning bir turi deb "
"qarash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:224
msgid ""
"An important concept in the Odoo javascript is the *context*: it provides a "
"way for code to give more context to a function call or a rpc, so other "
"parts of the system can properly react to that information. In some way, it "
"is like a bag of information that is propagated everywhere. It is useful in "
"some situations, such as letting the Odoo server know that a model rpc comes "
"from a specific form view, or activating/disabling some features in a "
"component."
msgstr ""
"Odoo javascript'idagi muhim tushunchalardan biri — *context*: u kodga "
"funksiya chaqirig'i yoki rpc'ga qo'shimcha kontekst berish imkonini beradi, "
"shunda tizimning boshqa qismlari bu ma'lumotga to'g'ri javob berishi mumkin. "
"Ma'lum ma'noda, bu hamma joyga tarqatiladigan ma'lumotlar to'plamiga "
"o'xshaydi. U ba'zi holatlarda foydali, masalan Odoo serveriga model rpc'si "
"muayyan form view'dan kelganini bildirish yoki component'da ba'zi "
"imkoniyatlarni yoqish/o'chirish uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:231
msgid ""
"There are two different contexts in the Odoo web client: the *user context* "
"and the *action context* (so, we should be careful when using the word "
"*context*: it could mean a different thing depending on the situation)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo web client'da ikki xil context bor: *user context* va *action context* "
"(shuning uchun *context* so'zini ishlatishda ehtiyot bo'lish kerak: "
"vaziyatga qarab u turli ma'nolarni bildirishi mumkin)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:236
msgid ""
"The `context` object may be useful in many cases, but one should be careful "
"not to overuse it! Many problems can be solved in a standard way without "
"modifying the context."
msgstr ""
"`context` obyekti ko'p holatlarda foydali bo'lishi mumkin, biroq undan "
"haddan tashqari foydalanmaslik kerak! Ko'p muammolarni context'ni "
"o'zgartirmasdan, standart yo'l bilan hal qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:243
msgid "User Context"
msgstr "User context"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:245
msgid ""
"The *user context* is a small object containing various informations related "
"to the current user. It is available through the `user` service:"
msgstr ""
"*user context* — joriy foydalanuvchiga tegishli turli ma'lumotlarni o'z "
"ichiga olgan kichik obyekt. U `user` service orqali mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:257
msgid "It contains the following information:"
msgstr "U quyidagi ma'lumotlarni o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:267
msgid "`allowed_company_ids`"
msgstr "`allowed_company_ids`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:268
msgid "`number[]`"
msgstr "`number[]`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:269
msgid "the list of active company ids for the user"
msgstr "foydalanuvchi uchun aktiv company id'lar ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:270
msgid "`lang`"
msgstr "`lang`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:271
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:274
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:150
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:176
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:179
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:182
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:185
