msgstr "foydalanuvchining joriy timezone'i (masalan \"Europe/Brussels\")"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:277
msgid ""
"In practice, the `orm` service automatically adds the user context to each "
"of its requests. This is why it is usually not necessary to import it "
"directly in most cases."
msgstr ""
"Amalda `orm` service o'zining har bir so'roviga user context'ni avtomatik "
"qo'shadi. Shu sababli ko'p holatlarda uni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri import qilish "
"talab etilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:282
msgid ""
"The first element of the `allowed_company_ids` is the main company of the "
"user."
msgstr ""
"`allowed_company_ids` ning birinchi elementi — foydalanuvchining asosiy "
"kompaniyasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:285
msgid "Action Context"
msgstr "Action context"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:287
msgid ""
"The :ref:`ir.actions.act_window<reference/actions/window>` "
"and :ref:`ir.actions.client<reference/actions/client>` support an optional "
"`context` field. This field is a `char` that represents an object. Whenever "
"the corresponding action is loaded in the web client, this context field "
"will be evaluated as an object and given to the component that corresponds "
"to the action."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ir.actions.act_window<reference/actions/window>` "
"va :ref:`ir.actions.client<reference/actions/client>` ixtiyoriy `context` "
"field'ini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi. Bu field obyektni ifodalovchi `char` "
"hisoblanadi. Mos action web client'da yuklanganda, bu context field obyekt "
"sifatida hisoblanadi va action'ga mos keladigan component'ga beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:297
msgid ""
"It can be used in many different ways. For example, the views add the action "
"context to every requests made to the server. Another important use is to "
"activate some search filter by default (see example above)."
msgstr ""
"Undan turli xil usullarda foydalanish mumkin. Masalan, view'lar serverga "
"yuborilgan har bir so'rovga action context'ni qo'shadi. Yana bir muhim "
"qo'llanilishi — ba'zi search filter'ni sukut bo'yicha yoqish (yuqoridagi "
"misolga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:301
msgid ""
"Sometimes, when we execute new actions manually (so, programmatically, in "
"javascript), it is useful to be able to extend the action context. This can "
"be done with the `additional_context` argument."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zan yangi action'larni qo'lda (ya'ni javascript'da, programmatik "
"ravishda) bajarganimizda, action context'ni kengaytirish imkoniyati foydali "
"bo'ladi. Buni `additional_context` argumenti bilan amalga oshirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:317
msgid ""
"In this example, the action with xml_id `addon_name.something` will be "
"loaded, and its context will be extended with the `default_period_id` value. "
"This is a very important usecase that lets developers combine actions "
"together by providing some information to the next action."
msgstr ""
"Bu misolda xml_id'si `addon_name.something` bo'lgan action yuklanadi va "
"uning context'i `default_period_id` qiymati bilan kengaytiriladi. Bu juda "
"muhim holat bo'lib, dasturchilarga keyingi action'ga ma'lum ma'lumot berish "
"orqali action'larni birlashtirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:325
msgid "Python Interpreter"
msgstr "Python interpretatori"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:327
msgid ""
"The Odoo framework features a built-in small python interpreter. Its purpose "
"is to evaluate small python expressions. This is important, because views in "
"Odoo have modifiers written in python, but they need to be evaluated by the "
"browser."
msgstr ""
"Odoo framework'i o'ziga xos kichik python interpretatoriga ega. Uning "
"maqsadi — kichik python ifodalarini hisoblash. Bu muhim, chunki Odoo'dagi "
"view'larda python'da yozilgan modifier'lar bo'ladi, lekin ular browser "
"tomonidan hisoblanishi kerak."

