"yoki `!`), yoki satr ifodalari sifatida ifodalanadi. Ular normalizatsiya "
"qilinishi shart emas (kerak bo'lsa `&` operator'i nazarda tutiladi). Masalan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:395
