#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:503
msgid ""
"The web client :ref:`environment <frontend/framework/environment>` object "
"contains an event bus, named `bus`. Its purpose is to allow various parts of "
"the system to properly coordinate themselves, without coupling them. The "
"`env.bus` is an owl `EventBus <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/event_bus.md>`_, that should be used for global events of "
"interest."
msgstr ""
"Web client :ref:`environment <frontend/framework/environment>` object'i "
"`bus` deb nomlangan event bus'ni o'z ichiga oladi. Uning maqsadi — tizimning "
"turli qismlariga bir-biriga bog'lanmasdan o'zaro to'g'ri muvofiqlashish "
"imkonini berish. `env.bus` bu owl `EventBus <https://github.com/odoo/owl/"
"blob/master/doc/v2/reference/event_bus.md>`_ bo'lib, u qiziqish uyg'otadigan "
"global event'lar uchun ishlatilishi kerak."

