#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:603
msgid "Debug mode"
msgstr "Debug rejimi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:605
msgid ""
"Odoo can sometimes operate in a special mode called the `debug` mode. It is "
"used for two main purposes:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo ba'zan `debug` rejimi deb ataladigan maxsus rejimda ishlashi mumkin. U "
"ikkita asosiy maqsadda ishlatiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:608
msgid "display additional information/fields for some particular screens,"
msgstr "ayrim ekranlar uchun qo'shimcha ma'lumot/field'larni ko'rsatish,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:609
msgid ""
"provide some additional tools to help developer debug the Odoo interface."
msgstr ""
"dasturchiga Odoo interfeysini debug qilishda yordam beradigan qo'shimcha "
"vositalarni taqdim etish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:611
msgid ""
"The `debug` mode is described by a string. An empty string means that the "
"`debug` mode is not active. Otherwise, it is active.  If the string contains "
"`assets` or `tests`, then the corresponding specific sub modes are activated "
"(see below). Both modes can be active at the same time, for example with the "
"string `assets,tests`."
msgstr ""
"`debug` rejimi satr bilan tavsiflanadi. Bo'sh satr `debug` rejimi faol emas "
"degan ma'noni bildiradi. Aks holda u faol hisoblanadi.  Agar satrda `assets` "
"yoki `tests` bo'lsa, mos keluvchi maxsus quyi rejimlar faollashadi (pastga "
"qarang). Ikkala rejim bir vaqtda faol bo'lishi mumkin, masalan "
"`assets,tests` satri bilan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:616
msgid ""
"The `debug` mode current value can be read in the :ref:`environment<frontend/"
"framework/environment>`: `env.debug`."
msgstr ""
"`debug` rejimining joriy qiymatini :ref:`environment<frontend/framework/"
"environment>` ichida o'qish mumkin: `env.debug`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:621
msgid ""
"To show menus, fields or view elements only in debug mode, you should target "
"the group `base.group_no_one`:"
msgstr ""
"Menyular, field'lar yoki view elementlarini faqat debug rejimida ko'rsatish "
"uchun `base.group_no_one` guruhini belgilashingiz kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:629
msgid ":ref:`Activate the debug mode <developer-mode>`"
msgstr ":ref:`debug rejimini faollashtirish <developer-mode>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:635
msgid "Assets mode"
msgstr "Assets rejimi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:637
msgid ""
"The `debug=assets` sub mode is useful to debug javascript code: once "
"activated, the :ref:`assets<reference/assets>` bundles are no longer "
"minified, and source-maps are generated as well. This makes it useful to "
"debug all kind of javascript code."
msgstr ""
"`debug=assets` quyi rejimi JavaScript kodini debug qilish uchun foydali: u "
"faollashtirilgandan so'ng :ref:`assets<reference/assets>` bundle'lari "
"minifikatsiya qilinmaydi va source-map'lar ham generatsiya qilinadi. Bu har "
"qanday turdagi JavaScript kodini debug qilishni qulaylashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:644
msgid "Tests mode"
msgstr "Tests rejimi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/framework_overview.rst:646
msgid ""
"There is another sub mode named `tests`: if enabled, the server injects the "
"bundle `web.assets_tests` in the page. This bundle contains mostly test "
"tours (tours whose purpose is to test a feature, not to show something "
"interesting to users). The `tests` mode is then useful to be able to run "
"these tours."
msgstr ""
"`tests` deb nomlangan yana bir quyi rejim mavjud: agar yoqilgan bo'lsa, "
"server sahifaga `web.assets_tests` bundle'ini joylashtiradi. Bu bundle "
"asosan test tur'larini o'z ichiga oladi (maqsadi foydalanuvchilarga "
"qiziqarli biror narsani ko'rsatish emas, balki funksiyani tekshirish bo'lgan "
"tur'lar). Shunday qilib, `tests` rejimi ushbu tur'larni ishga tushirish "
"uchun foydali."

