#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:7
msgid ""
"`Owl hooks <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"hooks.md>`_ are a way to factorize code, even if it depends on some "
"component lifecycle. Most hooks provided by Owl are related to the lifecycle "
"of a component, but some of them (such as `useComponent <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#usecomponent>`_) provide a "
"way to build specific hooks."
msgstr ""
"`Owl hooks <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"hooks.md>`_ — kodni umumlashtirish usuli bo'lib, hatto u component "
"lifecycle'iga bog'liq bo'lsa ham ishlaydi. Owl taqdim etadigan ko'pchilik "
"hook'lar component lifecycle'i bilan bog'liq, ammo ularning ba'zilari "
"(masalan `useComponent <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/hooks.md#usecomponent>`_) maxsus hook'lar yaratish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:13
msgid ""
"Using these hooks, it is possible to build many customized hooks that help "
"solve a specific problem, or make some common tasks easier. The rest of this "
"page documents the list of hooks provided by the Odoo web framework."
msgstr ""
"Bu hook'lardan foydalanib, muayyan muammoni hal qilishga yordam beradigan "
"yoki ba'zi keng tarqalgan vazifalarni osonlashtiradigan ko'plab "
"moslashtirilgan hook'lar yaratish mumkin. Ushbu sahifaning qolgan qismida "
"Odoo web framework taqdim etadigan hook'lar ro'yxati keltirilgan."

