"`popper` elementingizni `t-ref directive <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/v2/doc/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_ yordamida ko'rsatishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:219
msgid "the target HTMLElement to be positioned from"
msgstr "nisbatan joylashtirish uchun maqsadli HTMLElement"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:221
msgid "the positioning options (see table below)"
msgstr "joylashtirish options'lari (quyidagi jadvalga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:230
