msgstr "`popper`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:232
msgid ""
"this is a `useRef reference <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/hooks.md#useref>`_ for the element that will get positioned. "
"Default is `\"popper\"`."
msgstr ""
"bu joylashtiriladigan element uchun `useRef reference <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_ havolasi. Standart "
"qiymat — `\"popper\"`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:234
msgid "`container`"
msgstr "`container`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:235
msgid "HTMLElement"
msgstr "HTMLElement"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:236
msgid ""
"the container from which the popper is expected not to overflow. If "
"overflowing occurs, other popper positions are tried until a not overflowing "
"one is found. (default: the `<html/>` node)"
msgstr ""
"popper undan tashqariga chiqmasligi kutilayotgan container. Agar tashqariga "
"chiqish yuz bersa, chiqmaydigani topilguncha popper'ning boshqa "
"pozitsiyalari sinab ko'riladi. (standart: `<html/>` node'i)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:239
msgid "`margin`"
msgstr "`margin`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:240
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:456
msgid "number"
msgstr "number"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:241
msgid "added margin between popper and reference elements (default: `0`)"
msgstr ""
"popper va reference elementlar orasiga qo'shiladigan margin (standart: `0`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:242
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:487
msgid "`position`"
msgstr "`position`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:243
msgid "Direction[-Variant]"
msgstr "Direction[-Variant]"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:244
msgid ""
"the desired position. It is a string composed of one `Direction` and one "
"`Variant` separated by a dash character. `Direction` could be: `top`, "
"`bottom`, `right`, `left`. `Variant` could be: `start`, `middle`, `end`, "
"`fit`. The variant can be omitted (default variant is `middle`). The `fit` "
"variant means that the popper would have the exact same width or height, "
"depending on the chosen direction. Examples of valid positions: `right-end`, "
"`top-start`, `left-middle`, `left`, `bottom-fit`. (default position: "
"`bottom`)"
msgstr ""
"kerakli pozitsiya. Bu bitta `Direction` va bitta `Variant` dan tashkil "
"topgan, tire belgisi bilan ajratilgan satr. `Direction` quyidagilardan biri "
"bo'lishi mumkin: `top`, `bottom`, `right`, `left`. `Variant` quyidagilardan "
"biri bo'lishi mumkin: `start`, `middle`, `end`, `fit`. Variant tushirib "
"qoldirilishi mumkin (standart variant — `middle`). `fit` varianti popper "
"tanlangan yo'nalishga qarab aynan bir xil kenglik yoki balandlikka ega "
"bo'lishini bildiradi. To'g'ri pozitsiyalarga misollar: `right-end`, `top-"
"start`, `left-middle`, `left`, `bottom-fit`. (standart pozitsiya: `bottom`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:253
msgid "`onPositioned`"
msgstr "`onPositioned`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:254
msgid "(el: HTMLElement, position: PositioningSolution) => void"
msgstr "(el: HTMLElement, position: PositioningSolution) => void"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:255
msgid ""
"a callback that will be called everytime a positioning occurs (e.g. on "
"component mounted/patched, document scroll, window resize...). Can be used "
"i.e. for dynamic styling regarding the current position. The "
"`PositioningSolution` is an object having the following type: `{ direction: "
"Direction, variant: Variant, top: number, left: number }`."
msgstr ""
"har safar joylashtirish sodir bo'lganda chaqiriladigan callback (masalan, "
"component mounted/patched bo'lganda, document scroll, oyna o'lchami "
"o'zgarganda...). Masalan, joriy pozitsiyaga qarab dinamik styling uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. `PositioningSolution` — quyidagi turga ega object: "
"`{ direction: Direction, variant: Variant, top: number, left: number }`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:297
msgid "useSpellCheck"
msgstr "useSpellCheck"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:307
msgid ""
"Activate the spellcheck state to an input or textarea on focus by a `t-"
"ref=\"spellcheck\"` in the current component. This state is then removed on "
"blur, as well as the red outline, which improves readability of the content."
msgstr ""
"Joriy component'da `t-ref=\"spellcheck\"` yordamida input yoki textarea'ga "
"fokus tushganda spellcheck holatini yoqadi. Keyin blur paytida bu holat, "
"shuningdek qizil chiziq ham olib tashlanadi, bu esa kontentning o'qilishini "
"yaxshilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:311
msgid ""
"The hook can also be used on any HTML element with the `contenteditable` "
"attribute. To disable spellcheck completely on elements that might be "
"enabled by the hook, set explicitly the `spellcheck` attribute as `false` on "
"the element."
msgstr ""
"Hook `contenteditable` atributiga ega har qanday HTML element uchun ham "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. Hook tomonidan yoqilishi mumkin bo'lgan elementlarda "
"spellcheck'ni butunlay o'chirish uchun elementda `spellcheck` atributini "
"aniq ravishda `false` qilib belgilang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/hooks.rst:317
msgid ""
"In the following example, the spellcheck will be enabled on the first input, "
