":ref:`Odoo modullari <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` (custom module "
"system'dan foydalanadi),"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:13
msgid ""
"As described in the :ref:`assets management page <reference/assets>`, all "
"javascript files are bundled together and served to the browser. Note that "
"native javascript files are processed by the Odoo server and transformed "
"into Odoo custom modules."
msgstr ""
":ref:`assets boshqaruvi sahifasida <reference/assets>` tasvirlanganidek, "
"barcha javascript fayllar birgalikda bundle qilinadi va browser'ga "
"yetkaziladi. E'tibor bering, native javascript fayllar Odoo server tomonidan "
"qayta ishlanadi va Odoo custom module'lariga aylantiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:17
msgid ""
"Let us briefly explain the purpose behind each kind of javascript file. "
"Plain javascript files should be reserved only for external libraries and "
"some small specific low level purposes. All new javascript files should be "
"created in the native javascript module system. The custom module system is "
"only useful for old, not yet converted files."
msgstr ""
"Har bir javascript fayl turining maqsadini qisqacha tushuntiramiz. Oddiy "
"javascript fayllar faqat tashqi kutubxonalar va ba'zi kichik, aniq quyi "
"darajali maqsadlar uchun ajratilishi kerak. Barcha yangi javascript fayllar "
"native javascript module system'da yaratilishi kerak. Custom module system "
"faqat eski, hali o'girilmagan fayllar uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:26
msgid "Plain Javascript files"
msgstr "Oddiy Javascript fayllar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:28
msgid ""
"Plain javascript files can contain arbitrary content. It is advised to use "
"the *iife* :dfn:`immediately invoked function execution` style when writing "
"such a file:"
msgstr ""
"Oddiy javascript fayllar ixtiyoriy kontentni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin. "
"Bunday faylni yozishda *iife* :dfn:`immediately invoked function execution` "
"uslubidan foydalanish tavsiya etiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:39
msgid ""
"The advantages of such files is that we avoid leaking local variables to the "
"global scope."
msgstr ""
"Bunday fayllarning afzalligi shundaki, biz lokal o'zgaruvchilarning global "
"scope'ga chiqib ketishidan qochamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:42
msgid ""
"Clearly, plain javascript files do not offer the benefits of a module "
"system, so one needs to be careful about the order in the bundle (since the "
"browser will execute them precisely in that order)."
msgstr ""
"Shubhasiz, oddiy javascript fayllar module system afzalliklarini bermaydi, "
"shuning uchun bundle'dagi tartibga e'tibor berish kerak (chunki browser "
"ularni aynan shu tartibda bajaradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:47
msgid "In Odoo, all external libraries are loaded as plain javascript files."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da barcha tashqi kutubxonalar oddiy javascript fayllar sifatida "
"yuklanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:52
msgid "Native Javascript Modules"
msgstr "Native Javascript Module'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:54
msgid ""
"Odoo javascript code uses the native javascript module system. This is "
"simpler, and brings the benefits of a better developer experience with a "
"better integration with the IDE."
msgstr ""
"Odoo javascript kodi native javascript module tizimidan foydalanadi. Bu "
"soddaroq va IDE bilan yaxshiroq integratsiya orqali dasturchi uchun qulaylik "
"keltiradi."

