#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:146
msgid "Aliased modules"
msgstr "Alias berilgan module'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:148
msgid ""
"Because :ref:`Odoo modules <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` follow a "
"different module naming pattern, a system exists to allow a smooth "
"transition towards the new system. Currently, if a file is converted to a "
"module (and therefore follow the new naming convention), other files not yet "
"converted to ES6-like syntax in the project won't be able to require the "
"module. Aliases are here to map old names with new ones by creating a small "
"proxy function. The module can then be called by its new *and* old name."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Odoo module'lari <frontend/modules/odoo_module>` boshqacha nomlash "
"qoidasiga amal qilgani uchun, yangi tizimga bosqichma-bosqich o'tishga imkon "
"beruvchi mexanizm mavjud. Hozirda, agar fayl module'ga aylantirilgan bo'lsa "
"(va shu bilan yangi nomlash qoidasiga amal qilsa), loyihadagi hali ES6 "
"uslubidagi sintaksisga o'tkazilmagan boshqa fayllar bu module'ni require "
"qila olmaydi. Alias'lar kichik proxy funksiya yaratib, eski nomlarni "
"yangilariga moslash uchun xizmat qiladi. Shundan so'ng module'ni uning yangi "
"*va* eski nomi bilan chaqirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:154
