"\"klassik\" module'lar odatda bevosita ishlatiladigan bitta qiymatni eksport "
"qiladi va bu taxminan default eksport semantikasiga to'g'ri keladi. Biroq "
"bevosita delegatsiya qilib, alias qilingan module'ning aynan xatti-"
"harakatini takrorlash ham mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:189
msgid ""
"In that case, this will define an alias with exactly the values exported by "
"the original module:"
msgstr ""
"Bunday holda, bu asl module eksport qilgan qiymatlarning aynan o'zi bilan "
"alias aniqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:199
msgid ""
"Only one alias can be defined using this method. If you were to need another "
"one to have, for example, three names to call the same module, you would "
"have to add a proxy manually. This is not good practice and should be "
"avoided unless there is no other options."
msgstr ""
"Bu usul bilan faqat bitta alias aniqlash mumkin. Agar sizga yana bittasi "
"kerak bo'lsa — masalan, bitta module'ni chaqirish uchun uchta nom — proxy'ni "
"qo'lda qo'shishingiz kerak bo'ladi. Bu yaxshi amaliyot emas va boshqa yo'l "
"bo'lmasa, undan foydalanmaslik lozim."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:204
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3680
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Cheklovlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:206
msgid ""
"For performance reasons, Odoo does not use a full javascript parser to "
"transform native modules. There are, therefore, a number of limitations "
"including but not limited to:"
msgstr ""
"Unumdorlik nuqtai nazaridan Odoo native module'larni o'zgartirish uchun "
"to'liq javascript parser'dan foydalanmaydi. Shu sababli bir qancha "
"cheklovlar mavjud, ular quyidagilar bilan chegaralanmaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:210
msgid ""
"an `import` or `export` keyword cannot be preceded by a non-space character,"
msgstr ""
"`import` yoki `export` kalit so'zidan oldin bo'sh joydan boshqa belgi "
"kelishi mumkin emas,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:211
msgid ""
"a multiline comment or string cannot have a line starting by `import` or "
"`export`"
msgstr ""
"ko'p qatorli izoh yoki satrda `import` yoki `export` bilan boshlanadigan "
"qator bo'lishi mumkin emas"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:237
msgid "when you export an object, it can't contain a comment"
msgstr "obyektni eksport qilganingizda, u izohni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin emas"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:264
msgid ""
"Odoo needs a way to determine if a module is described by a path "
"(like :file:`./views/form_view`) or a name (like `web.FormView`). It has to "
"use a heuristic to do just that: if there is a `/` in the name, it is "
"considered a path.  This means that Odoo does not really support module "
"names with a `/` anymore."
msgstr ""
"Odoo module path bilan (masalan :file:`./views/form_view`) yoki nom bilan "
"(masalan `web.FormView`) tavsiflanganini aniqlay olishi kerak. Buning uchun "
"u evristikadan foydalanadi: agar nomda `/` bo'lsa, u path deb hisoblanadi. "
"Bu shuni bildiradi: Odoo endi ichida `/` bo'lgan module nomlarini amalda "
"qo'llab-quvvatlamaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:269
msgid ""
"As \"classic\" modules are not deprecated and there is currently no plan to "
"remove them, you can and should keep using them if you encounter issues "
"with, or are constrained by the limitations of, native modules. Both styles "
"can coexist within the same Odoo addon."
msgstr ""
"\"Klassik\" module'lar eskirgan deb belgilanmagan va hozircha ularni olib "
"tashlash rejasi yo'q, shuning uchun native module'lar bilan muammoga duch "
"kelsangiz yoki ularning cheklovlari to'sqinlik qilsa, klassik module'lardan "
"foydalanishni davom ettirishingiz mumkin va kerak. Ikkala uslub bitta Odoo "
"addon'i ichida birga mavjud bo'la oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:277
msgid "Odoo Module System"
msgstr "Odoo module tizimi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:279
msgid ""
"Odoo has defined a small module system (located in the file :file:`addons/"
"web/static/src/js/boot.js`, which needs to be loaded first). The Odoo module "
"system, inspired by AMD, works by defining the function `define` on the "
"global odoo object. We then define each javascript module by calling that "
"function.  In the Odoo framework, a module is a piece of code that will be "
"executed as soon as possible.  It has a name and potentially some "
"dependencies.  When its dependencies are loaded, a module will then be "
"loaded as well.  The value of the module is then the return value of the "
"function defining the module."
msgstr ""
"Odoo kichik module tizimini aniqlagan (u :file:`addons/web/static/src/js/"
"boot.js` faylida joylashgan va birinchi bo'lib yuklanishi kerak). AMD'dan "
"ilhomlangan Odoo module tizimi global odoo obyektida `define` funksiyasini "
"aniqlash orqali ishlaydi. So'ngra har bir javascript module'ni shu "
"funksiyani chaqirib aniqlaymiz. Odoo framework'ida module — imkon qadar "
"tezroq bajariladigan kod bo'lagi. U nomga va ehtimol ba'zi bog'liqliklarga "
"(dependencies) ega. Uning bog'liqliklari yuklangach, module ham yuklanadi. "
"Module'ning qiymati esa uni aniqlovchi funksiyaning qaytargan qiymatidir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:288
msgid "As an example, it may look like this:"
msgstr "Misol uchun, u quyidagicha ko'rinishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:313
msgid ""
"If some dependencies are missing/non ready, then the module will simply not "
"be loaded.  There will be a warning in the console after a few seconds."
msgstr ""
"Agar ba'zi bog'liqliklar yo'q bo'lsa yoki tayyor bo'lmasa, module shunchaki "
"yuklanmaydi. Bir necha soniyadan so'ng konsolda ogohlantirish paydo bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:316
msgid ""
"Note that circular dependencies are not supported. It makes sense, but it "
"means that one needs to be careful."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, aylanma bog'liqliklar qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi. Bu mantiqan "
"tushunarli, lekin ehtiyot bo'lish kerakligini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:320
msgid "Defining a module"
msgstr "Module aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:322
msgid "The `odoo.define` method is given three arguments:"
msgstr "`odoo.define` method'iga uchta argument beriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:324
msgid ""
"`moduleName`: the name of the javascript module.  It should be a unique "
"string. The convention is to have the name of the odoo addon followed by a "
"specific description. For example, `web.Widget` describes a module defined "
"in the `web` addon, which exports a `Widget` class (because the first letter "
"is capitalized)"
msgstr ""
"`moduleName`: javascript module'ning nomi. U takrorlanmas (unique) satr "
"bo'lishi kerak. Qoidaga ko'ra, avval odoo addon nomi, so'ngra aniq tavsif "
"keladi. Masalan, `web.Widget` — `web` addon'ida aniqlangan va `Widget` "
"class'ini eksport qiladigan module'ni tavsiflaydi (birinchi harf bosh harf "
"bo'lgani uchun)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:329
msgid ""
"If the name is not unique, an exception will be thrown and displayed in the "
"console."
msgstr ""
"Agar nom takrorlanmas bo'lmasa, exception ko'tariladi va konsolda "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:332
msgid ""
"`dependencies`: It should be a list of strings, each corresponding to a "
"javascript module.  This describes the dependencies that are required to be "
"loaded before the module is executed."
msgstr ""
"`dependencies`: bu satrlar ro'yxati bo'lishi kerak, ularning har biri bitta "
"javascript module'ga mos keladi. Bu module bajarilishidan oldin yuklanishi "
"shart bo'lgan bog'liqliklarni tavsiflaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:336
msgid ""
"finally, the last argument is a function which defines the module. Its "
"return value is the value of the module, which may be passed to other "
"modules requiring it."
msgstr ""
"va oxirgi argument — module'ni aniqlovchi funksiya. Uning qaytargan qiymati "
"module'ning qiymati bo'ladi va u module'ni talab qiladigan boshqa "
"module'larga uzatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:351
msgid "If an error happens, it will be logged (in debug mode) in the console:"
msgstr "Agar xato yuz bersa, u (debug rejimida) konsolda qayd etiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:353
msgid ""
"`Missing dependencies`: These modules do not appear in the page. It is "
"possible that the JavaScript file is not in the page or that the module name "
"is wrong"
msgstr ""
"`Missing dependencies`: bu module'lar sahifada mavjud emas. Ehtimol, "
"JavaScript fayli sahifaga qo'shilmagan yoki module nomi xato"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:356
msgid "`Failed modules`: A javascript error is detected"
msgstr "`Failed modules`: javascript xatosi aniqlandi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:358
msgid ""
"`Rejected modules`: The module returns a rejected Promise. It (and its "
"dependent modules) is not loaded."
msgstr ""
"`Rejected modules`: module rad etilgan Promise qaytaradi. U (va unga bog'liq "
"module'lar) yuklanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:361
msgid "`Rejected linked modules`: Modules who depend on a rejected module"
msgstr "`Rejected linked modules`: rad etilgan module'ga bog'liq module'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_modules.rst:363
msgid ""
"`Non loaded modules`: Modules who depend on a missing or a failed module"
msgstr ""
"`Non loaded modules`: yo'q bo'lgan yoki xato bergan module'ga bog'liq "
"module'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:7
msgid "Javascript Reference"
msgstr "Javascript bo'yicha ma'lumotnoma"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:9
msgid ""
"This document presents the Odoo Javascript framework. This framework is not "
"a large application in term of lines of code, but it is quite generic, "
"because it is basically a machine to turn a declarative interface "
"description into a live application, able to interact with every model and "
"records in the database.  It is even possible to use the web client to "
"modify the interface of the web client."
msgstr ""
"Bu hujjat Odoo Javascript framework'ini tanishtiradi. Bu framework kod "
"qatorlari soni jihatidan katta ilova emas, lekin ancha universal, chunki u "
"asosan deklarativ interfeys tavsifini ma'lumotlar bazasidagi har qanday "
"model va record'lar bilan ishlay oladigan tirik ilovaga aylantiruvchi "
"mexanizmdir. Hatto web client interfeysini web client'ning o'zi yordamida "
"o'zgartirish ham mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:19
msgid "The Javascript framework is designed to work with three main use cases:"
msgstr ""
"Javascript framework uchta asosiy foydalanish holati bilan ishlashga "
"mo'ljallangan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:21
msgid ""
"the *web client*: this is the private web application, where one can view "
"and edit business data. This is a single page application (the page is never "
"reloaded, only the new data is fetched from the server whenever it is needed)"
msgstr ""
"*web client*: bu shaxsiy (yopiq) web ilova bo'lib, unda biznes "
"ma'lumotlarini ko'rish va tahrirlash mumkin. Bu single page application "
"(sahifa hech qachon qayta yuklanmaydi, kerak bo'lganda serverdan faqat yangi "
"ma'lumotlar olinadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:24
msgid ""
"the *website*: this is the public part of Odoo.  It allows an unidentified "
"user to browse some content, to shop or to perform many actions, as a "
"client. This is a classical website: various routes with controllers and "
"some javascript to make it work."
msgstr ""
"*website*: bu Odoo'ning ommaviy qismi. U aniqlanmagan foydalanuvchiga "
"kontentni ko'rish, xarid qilish yoki mijoz sifatida ko'plab amallarni "
"bajarish imkonini beradi. Bu klassik veb-sayt: controller'lar bilan turli "
"route'lar va ularni ishlatish uchun ozgina javascript."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:28
msgid ""
"the *point of sale*: this is the interface for the point of sale. It is a "
"specialized single page application."
msgstr ""
"*point of sale*: bu savdo nuqtasi interfeysi. Bu maxsuslashtirilgan single "
"page application."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:31
msgid ""
"Some javascript code is common to these three use cases, and is bundled "
"together (see below in the assets section).  This document will focus mostly "
"on the architecture of the web client."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi javascript kodlar bu uchta holat uchun umumiy bo'lib, birgalikda "
"bundle qilinadi (pastdagi asset'lar bo'limiga qarang). Bu hujjat asosan web "
"client arxitekturasiga qaratilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:36
msgid "Web client"
msgstr "Web client"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:39
msgid "Single Page Application"
msgstr "Single Page Application"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:41
msgid ""
"The web client is a single-page application: instead of requesting a full "
"page from the server each time the user performs an action, it only loads "
"what is needed to update the user interface (UI) as a result of that action. "
"While doing this, it also takes care of updating information in the URL, so "
"that, in most cases, refreshing the page or closing the browser and opening "
"it again shows you the same thing."
msgstr ""
"Web client — single-page application: foydalanuvchi har bir amalni "
"bajarganda serverdan to'liq sahifa so'rash o'rniga, u faqat shu amal "
"natijasida foydalanuvchi interfeysini (UI) yangilash uchun kerak bo'lgan "
"narsani yuklaydi. Shu bilan birga u URL'dagi ma'lumotni yangilab boradi, "
"shuning uchun ko'p hollarda sahifani yangilash yoki brauzerni yopib qaytadan "
"ochish sizga aynan o'sha holatni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:49
msgid "Overview of web client JS code"
msgstr "Web client JS kodiga umumiy nazar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:51
msgid ""
"Here, we give a very quick overview of the web client code, in "
"the :file:`web` addon. The paths will be described relative to :file:`web/"
"static/src`. The following description is deliberately not exhaustive; the "
"goal is only to give the reader a bird's eye view of the architecture."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda :file:`web` addon'idagi web client kodiga juda qisqa nazar "
"tashlaymiz. Yo'llar :file:`web/static/src` ga nisbatan ko'rsatiladi. "
"Quyidagi tavsif ataylab to'liq emas; maqsad — o'quvchiga arxitekturaning "
"umumiy manzarasini ko'rsatishdan iborat."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:56
msgid ""
":file:`module_loader.js`: this is the file that defines the Odoo javascript "
"module system.  It needs to be loaded before any other JS module."
msgstr ""
":file:`module_loader.js`: bu Odoo javascript module tizimini aniqlaydigan "
"fayl. U boshqa har qanday JS module'dan oldin yuklanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:58
msgid ""
":file:`core/`: this folder contains code that forms the lowest level of the "
"javascript framework and that can be used in the web client as well as the "
"website, portal, and point of sale application."
msgstr ""
":file:`core/`: bu papkada javascript framework'ining eng past darajasini "
"tashkil etuvchi kod bor; undan web client'da, shuningdek website, portal va "
"point of sale ilovasida ham foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:61
msgid ""
":file:`weblient/`: this folder contains files that are specific to the web "
"client and cannot be used in the website or point of sale, such as the "
"action manager and the action service."
msgstr ""
":file:`weblient/`: bu papkada faqat web client'ga xos va website yoki point "
"of sale'da ishlatib bo'lmaydigan fayllar bor, masalan action manager va "
"action service."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:64
msgid ""
":file:`webclient/webclient.js`: this is the webclient component proper. It "
"is mostly a wrapper for the action container and the navbar, and does a few "
"things that are required upon starting the application, such as loading the "
"state of the url."
msgstr ""
":file:`webclient/webclient.js`: bu bevosita webclient component'i. U asosan "
"action container va navbar uchun o'ram (wrapper) bo'lib, ilovani ishga "
"tushirishda talab qilinadigan bir nechta ishni bajaradi, masalan url "
"holatini yuklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:67
msgid ""
":file:`webclient/actions/`: this folder contains the code responsible for "
"displaying and switching between actions."
msgstr ""
":file:`webclient/actions/`: bu papkada action'larni ko'rsatish va ular "
"orasida almashish uchun javob beradigan kod bor."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:69
msgid ""
":file:`views/`: this folder contains the code for the view infrastructure, "
"as well as most of the views (some types of views are added by other addons)."
msgstr ""
":file:`views/`: bu papkada view infratuzilmasi kodi, shuningdek ko'pchilik "
"view'lar bor (ba'zi view turlari boshqa addon'lar tomonidan qo'shiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:71
msgid ""
":file:`views/fields/`: contains the definition of the various field "
"components, as well as some utilities used by multiple fields."
msgstr ""
":file:`views/fields/`: turli field component'larining aniqlanishini, "
"shuningdek bir nechta field tomonidan ishlatiladigan ba'zi yordamchi "
"vositalarni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:73
msgid ""
":file:`search/` all these files define the search view (it is not a view in "
"the point of view of the web client, only from the server point of view)"
msgstr ""
":file:`search/` bu fayllarning barchasi search view'ni aniqlaydi (bu web "
"client nuqtai nazaridan view emas, faqat server nuqtai nazaridan)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:78
msgid "What to do if a file is not loaded/updated"
msgstr "Fayl yuklanmasa yoki yangilanmasa nima qilish kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:80
msgid ""
"There are many different reasons why a file may not be properly loaded.  "
"Here are a few things you can try to solve the issue:"
msgstr ""
"Fayl to'g'ri yuklanmasligining ko'plab turli sabablari bo'lishi mumkin. "
"Muammoni hal qilish uchun quyidagilarni sinab ko'rishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:83
msgid ""
"Make sure you saved your file; forgetting to do that happens to the best of "
"us."
msgstr ""
"Faylni saqlaganingizga ishonch hosil qiling; buni unutish har kimda uchraydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:84
msgid ""
"Take a look at the console (in the dev tools, usually opened with F12) and "
"check for errors."
msgstr ""
"Console'ga qarang (dev tools ichida, odatda F12 bilan ochiladi) va xatolarni "
"tekshiring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:86
msgid ""
"Try adding a `console.log()` at the beginning of your file so you can see if "
"a file has been loaded or not. If it is not loaded, if may not be in the "
"proper assets bundle, or the asset bundle may not be up to date."
msgstr ""
"Faylingiz boshiga `console.log()` qo'shib ko'ring — shunda fayl yuklanganini "
"yoki yuklanmaganini bilib olasiz. Agar yuklanmagan bo'lsa, u kerakli assets "
"bundle ichida bo'lmasligi yoki asset bundle eskirgan bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:89
msgid ""
"Depending on your settings, the server may not regenerate the assets bundles "
"after a file has been modified; there are a few options to solve this:"
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalaringizga qarab, server fayl o'zgartirilgandan keyin assets "
"bundle'larni qayta yaratmasligi mumkin; buni hal qilishning bir necha yo'li "
"bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:92
msgid ""
"restarting the server will force it to check if the asset bundle is up to "
"date the next time it is requested"
msgstr ""
"serverni qayta ishga tushirish uni keyingi so'rov vaqtida asset bundle "
"yangilanganini tekshirishga majbur qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:94
msgid ""
"in debug mode, there is an option in the debug menu (:icon:`fa-bug` button "
"in the navbar) to force the server to regenerate the assets bundle on the "
"fly without restarting."
msgstr ""
"debug rejimida, debug menyusida (navbar'dagi :icon:`fa-bug` tugmasi) "
"serverni qayta ishga tushirmasdan assets bundle'ni darhol qayta yaratishga "
"majbur qiluvchi variant mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:96
msgid ""
"starting the server with the `--dev=xml` option will force the server to "
"check if an asset bundle is up to date every time it is requested. We advise "
"you to use this option when actively developing, but not in production."
msgstr ""
"serverni `--dev=xml` opsiyasi bilan ishga tushirish serverni har bir "
"so'rovda asset bundle yangilanganini tekshirishga majbur qiladi. Bu opsiyani "
"faol dasturlash vaqtida ishlatishni tavsiya qilamiz, lekin production'da "
"emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:100
msgid ""
"Make sure you refresh your page after changing the code. Odoo currently does "
"not have any hot module reloading mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Kodni o'zgartirgandan so'ng sahifani yangilaganingizga ishonch hosil qiling. "
"Odoo'da hozircha hot module reloading mexanizmi yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:105
msgid "Loading Javascript Code"
msgstr "Javascript kodini yuklash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:107
msgid ""
"Large applications are usually broken up into smaller files, that need to be "
"connected together.  Some file may need to use code defined in another file. "
"There are two ways of sharing code between files:"
msgstr ""
"Katta ilovalar odatda kichikroq fayllarga bo'linadi va ular bir-biriga "
"bog'lanishi kerak. Ba'zi fayl boshqa faylda aniqlangan koddan foydalanishi "
"mumkin. Fayllar o'rtasida kodni ulashishning ikki yo'li bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:111
msgid ""
"using the global scope (the *window* object) to read/write references to "
"some objects or functions,"
msgstr ""
"ba'zi obyekt yoki funksiyalarga havolalarni o'qish/yozish uchun global "
"scope'dan (*window* obyektidan) foydalanish,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:114
msgid ""
"using a module system that will provide a way for each modules to export or "
"import values, and will make sure that they are loaded in a proper order."
msgstr ""
"har bir module'ga qiymatlarni export yoki import qilish imkonini beruvchi va "
"ularning to'g'ri tartibda yuklanishini ta'minlovchi module tizimidan "
"foydalanish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:117
msgid ""
"While it's possible to work in the global scope, this has a number of issues:"
msgstr ""
"Global scope'da ishlash mumkin bo'lsa-da, bunda bir qancha muammolar mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:119
msgid ""
"It is difficult to ensure that implementation details are not exposed: "
"function declarations in the global scope are accessible to all other code."
msgstr ""
"Implementatsiya tafsilotlari ochib qo'yilmasligini ta'minlash qiyin: global "
"scope'dagi funksiya deklaratsiyalari boshqa barcha kod uchun ochiq bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:122
msgid ""
"There is a single namespace, creating great potential for naming conflicts."
msgstr ""
"Yagona namespace mavjud, bu esa nomlar to'qnashuvi uchun katta ehtimol "
"yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:124
msgid ""
"Dependencies are implicit: if a piece of code depends on another, the order "
"in which they are loaded is important, but difficult to guarantee."
msgstr ""
"Bog'liqliklar yashirin: agar bir kod parchasi boshqasiga bog'liq bo'lsa, "
"ularning yuklanish tartibi muhim, lekin buni kafolatlash qiyin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:127
msgid ""
"Using a module system helps resolve these issues: because modules specify "
"their dependencies, the module system can load them in the proper order or "
"emit an error if dependencies are missing or circular. Modules also form "
"their own namespace, and can choose what to export, preventing exposure of "
"implementation detail and naming collisions."
msgstr ""
"Module tizimidan foydalanish bu muammolarni hal qilishga yordam beradi: "
"module'lar o'z bog'liqliklarini ko'rsatgani uchun module tizimi ularni "
"to'g'ri tartibda yuklashi yoki bog'liqliklar yo'q bo'lsa yoki aylanma bo'lsa "
"xato berishi mumkin. Module'lar shuningdek o'z namespace'ini hosil qiladi va "
"nimani export qilishni tanlashi mumkin, bu esa implementatsiya "
"tafsilotlarining ochilishi va nomlar to'qnashuvining oldini oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:133
msgid ""
"While we could use ECMAScript (ES) modules directly, there are a number of "
"disadvantages to that approach: each ES module requires a network round "
"trip, which becomes very slow when you have hundreds of files, and many "
"files in Odoo need to be present despite not being imported by anything "
"because they simply add code that the framework will use instead of the "
"other way around."
msgstr ""
"ECMAScript (ES) module'larini bevosita ishlatishimiz mumkin bo'lsa-da, bu "
"yondashuvning bir qancha kamchiliklari bor: har bir ES module tarmoq orqali "
"alohida murojaatni talab qiladi, yuzlab fayl bo'lganda bu juda sekin bo'lib "
"qoladi; bundan tashqari, Odoo'dagi ko'p fayllar hech narsa tomonidan import "
"qilinmasa ham mavjud bo'lishi kerak, chunki ular shunchaki framework "
"ishlatadigan kodni qo'shadi, teskarisi emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:139
msgid ""
"Because of this, Odoo has a system of asset bundles. In these bundles, "
"JavaScript files are ES modules with a special annotation at the top. These "
"modules will be bundled together and transpiled to be usable by our module "
"loader. While you can write code that doesn't use this module system, it is "
"generally not recommended."
msgstr ""
"Shu sababli Odoo'da asset bundle tizimi mavjud. Bu bundle'larda JavaScript "
"fayllari yuqorisida maxsus annotatsiyaga ega ES module'lar hisoblanadi. Bu "
"module'lar birga to'planadi va bizning module loader'imiz uchun yaroqli "
"bo'lishi uchun transpile qilinadi. Bu module tizimini ishlatmaydigan kod "
"yozishingiz mumkin bo'lsa-da, bu odatda tavsiya etilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:144
msgid "(see :ref:`frontend/modules/native_js`)"
msgstr "(qarang :ref:`frontend/modules/native_js`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:148
msgid "Patching classes"
msgstr "Class'larni patch qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:150
msgid ""
"While we do our best to provide extension points that don't require it, it "
"is sometimes necessary to modify the behavior of an existing class *in "
"place*. The goal is to have a mechanism to change a class and all future/"
"present instances. This is done by using the `patch` utility function:"
msgstr ""
"Buni talab qilmaydigan kengaytirish nuqtalarini taqdim etishga bor kuchimiz "
"bilan harakat qilsak ham, ba'zan mavjud class xatti-harakatini *joyida* "
"o'zgartirish zarur bo'ladi. Maqsad — class'ni va uning barcha kelgusi/mavjud "
"instance'larini o'zgartirish mexanizmiga ega bo'lish. Bu `patch` yordamchi "
"funksiyasi orqali amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:167
msgid ""
"When patching methods, you need to patch the class' prototype, but if you "
"would like to patch a static property of the class, you need to patch the "
"class itself."
msgstr ""
"Method'larni patch qilganda class'ning prototype'ini patch qilishingiz "
"kerak, lekin class'ning static xossasini patch qilmoqchi bo'lsangiz, "
"class'ning o'zini patch qilishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:170
msgid ""
"Patching is a dangerous operation and should be done with care as it will "
"modify all instances of the class, even if they have already been created. "
"To avoid weird issues, patches should be applied as soon as possible, at the "
"top-level of your module. Patching classes at runtime can result in "
"extremely difficult to debug issues if the class has already been "
"instanciated."
msgstr ""
"Patch qilish xavfli amal bo'lib, ehtiyotkorlik bilan bajarilishi kerak, "
"chunki u class'ning barcha instance'larini, hatto allaqachon "
"yaratilganlarini ham o'zgartiradi. G'alati muammolardan qochish uchun "
"patch'lar module'ingiz eng yuqori darajasida, imkon qadar tezroq qo'llanishi "
"kerak. Class'larni runtime vaqtida patch qilish, agar class allaqachon "
"instance qilingan bo'lsa, debug qilish o'ta qiyin muammolarga olib kelishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:179
msgid ""
"A common need in the Odoo ecosystem is to extend/change the behaviour of the "
"base system from the outside (by installing an application, i.e. a different "
"module).  For example, one may need to add a new field widget in some views. "
"In that case, and many others, the usual process is to create the desired "
"component, then add it to a registry (registering step), to make the rest of "
"the web client aware of its existence."
msgstr ""
"Odoo ekotizimida keng tarqalgan ehtiyoj — asosiy tizimning xatti-harakatini "
"tashqaridan (ilovani, ya'ni boshqa module'ni o'rnatish orqali) kengaytirish/"
"o'zgartirish. Masalan, ba'zi view'larga yangi field widget qo'shish kerak "
"bo'lishi mumkin. Bunday holatda va boshqa ko'p hollarda odatiy jarayon — "
"kerakli component'ni yaratish, so'ngra uni registry'ga qo'shish "
"(registratsiya qadami), shunda web client'ning qolgan qismi uning "
"mavjudligidan xabardor bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:186
msgid ""
"There are a few registries available in the system. The registries that are "
"used by the framework are categories on the main registry, that can be "
"imported from :js:data:`@web/core/registry`"
msgstr ""
"Tizimda bir necha registry mavjud. Framework tomonidan ishlatiladigan "
"registry'lar asosiy registry'dagi kategoriyalar bo'lib, "
"ularni :js:data:`@web/core/registry` dan import qilish mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:204
msgid "field registry"
msgstr "field registry"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:191
msgid ""
"The field registry contains all field widgets known to the web client. "
"Whenever a view (typically form or list/kanban) needs a field widget, this "
"is where it will look. A typical use case look like this:"
msgstr ""
"field registry web client'ga ma'lum bo'lgan barcha field widget'larni o'z "
"ichiga oladi. View (odatda form yoki list/kanban) field widget'ga muhtoj "
"bo'lganda, u aynan shu yerdan qidiradi. Odatiy foydalanish holati "
"quyidagicha ko'rinadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:207
msgid "view registry"
msgstr "view registry"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:207
msgid "This registry contains all JS views known to the web client."
msgstr ""
"Bu registry web client'ga ma'lum bo'lgan barcha JS view'larni o'z ichiga "
"oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:214
msgid "action registry"
msgstr "action registry"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:210
msgid ""
"We keep track of all client actions in this registry.  This is where the "
"action manager looks up whenever it needs to create a client action. Client "
"actions can be a function - the function will be called when the action is "
"invoked, and the returned value will be executed as a follow up action if "
"needed - or an Owl component that will be displayed when executing that "
"action."
msgstr ""
"Barcha client action'larni bu registry'da kuzatib boramiz. Action manager "
"client action yaratishi kerak bo'lganda aynan shu yerdan qidiradi. Client "
"action'lar funksiya bo'lishi mumkin — action chaqirilganda funksiya ishga "
"tushiriladi va qaytarilgan qiymat kerak bo'lsa keyingi action sifatida "
"bajariladi — yoki o'sha action bajarilganda ko'rsatiladigan Owl component "
"bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:219
msgid ""
"Within the webclient, there are some concerns that cannot be handled by a "
"single component, as the concern is transversal, involves many components, "
"or needs to maintain some state for as long as the application is alive."
msgstr ""
"Webclient ichida bitta component tomonidan hal qilib bo'lmaydigan ba'zi "
"masalalar bor, chunki masala ko'ndalang xarakterga ega, ko'plab "
"component'larni qamrab oladi yoki ilova ishlab turgan butun davr mobaynida "
"biror holatni saqlab turishni talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:223
msgid ""
"Services are a solution to these problems: they are created during "
"application startup, are available to components through the hook "
"`useService`, and stay alive for the entire lifetime of the application."
msgstr ""
"Service'lar bu muammolarning yechimi: ular ilova ishga tushishi vaqtida "
"yaratiladi, component'lar uchun `useService` hook'i orqali ochiq bo'ladi va "
"ilovaning butun hayoti davomida faol qoladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:227
msgid ""
"For example, we have the *orm* service whose job is to allow interacting "
"with business objects on the server."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, bizda *orm* service mavjud bo'lib, uning vazifasi serverdagi "
"business obyektlar bilan o'zaro ishlash imkonini berishdir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:230
msgid "Here is a simplified example on how the orm service is implemented:"
msgstr ""
"Quyida orm service qanday amalga oshirilganining soddalashtirilgan misoli "
"keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:248
msgid "Using services"
msgstr "Service'lardan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:250
msgid ""
"Services are available in the environment, but should generally be used "
"through the `useService` hook, which prevents calling methods on the service "
"after a component has been destroyed, and prevents further code from "
"executing after a method call if the component was destroyed during the call."
msgstr ""
"Service'lar environment'da mavjud, lekin odatda `useService` hook'i orqali "
"ishlatilishi kerak: u component yo'q qilingandan keyin service method'larini "
"chaqirishning oldini oladi va agar component chaqiruv davomida yo'q qilingan "
"bo'lsa, method chaqiruvidan keyin kodning bajarilishiga yo'l qo'ymaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:268
msgid "Talking to the server"
msgstr "Server bilan aloqa qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:270
msgid ""
"There are typically two use cases when working on Odoo: one may need to call "
"a method on a (python) model (this goes through the controller `/web/dataset/"
"call_kw`), or one may need to directly call a controller (available on some "
"route)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo bilan ishlashda odatda ikkita foydalanish holati bo'ladi: (python) "
"model'da method chaqirish kerak bo'lishi mumkin (bu `/web/dataset/call_kw` "
"controller'i orqali o'tadi) yoki controller'ni bevosita chaqirish kerak "
"bo'lishi mumkin (biror route'da mavjud)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:274
msgid "Calling a method on a python model is done through the orm service:"
msgstr "python model'da method chaqirish orm service orqali amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:280
msgid "Directly calling a controller is done through the rpc service:"
msgstr "Controller'ni bevosita chaqirish rpc service orqali amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:289
msgid ""
"The rpc service doesn't really perform what is generally understood as a "
"remote procedure call (RPC), but for historical reasons, within Odoo we "
"generally call any network request performed in JavaScript an RPC. As "
"highlighted in the previous paragraph, if you want to call a method on a "
"model, you should use the orm service."
msgstr ""
"rpc service odatda remote procedure call (RPC) deb tushuniladigan amalni "
"aslida bajarmaydi, lekin tarixiy sabablarga ko'ra Odoo ichida JavaScript'da "
"bajarilgan har qanday tarmoq so'rovini biz odatda RPC deb ataymiz. Oldingi "
"paragrafda ta'kidlanganidek, agar model'da method chaqirmoqchi bo'lsangiz, "
"orm service'dan foydalanishingiz kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:296
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "Notification'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:298
msgid ""
"The Odoo framework has a standard way to communicate various information to "
"the user: notifications, which are displayed on the top right of the user "
"interface. The types of notification follow the bootstrap toasts:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo framework'ida foydalanuvchiga turli ma'lumotlarni yetkazishning "
"standart usuli bor: notification'lar, ular foydalanuvchi interfeysining "
"yuqori o'ng burchagida ko'rsatiladi. Notification turlari bootstrap "
"toast'lariga mos keladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:302
msgid ""
"*info*: useful to display some informational feedback as a consequence of an "
"action that cannot fail."
msgstr ""
"*info*: muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lishi mumkin bo'lmagan amal natijasida ma'lumot "
"beruvchi qaytim ko'rsatish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:305
msgid ""
"*success*: the user performed an action that can sometimes fail but didn't."
msgstr ""
"*success*: foydalanuvchi ba'zan muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"amalni bajardi, lekin bu marta muvaffaqiyatsizlik yuz bermadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:307
msgid ""
"*warning*: the user performed an action that could only be partially "
"completed. Also useful if something is wrong but wasn't caused by the user "
"directly, or is not particularly actionable."
msgstr ""
"*warning*: foydalanuvchi faqat qisman bajarilishi mumkin bo'lgan amalni "
"bajardi. Shuningdek, biror narsa noto'g'ri bo'lsa-yu, bu bevosita "
"foydalanuvchi tufayli yuzaga kelmagan bo'lsa yoki alohida chora talab "
"qilmasa ham foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:311
msgid ""
"*success*: the user tried to performed an action but it couldn't be "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"*success*: foydalanuvchi amalni bajarishga harakat qildi, lekin u "
"yakunlanmadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:314
msgid ""
"Notifications can also be used to ask a question to the user without "
"disturbing their workflow: e.g. a phone call received through VOIP: a sticky "
"notification could be displayed with two buttons to *Accept* or *Decline*."
msgstr ""
"Notification'lar foydalanuvchining ish jarayonini buzmasdan unga savol "
"berish uchun ham ishlatilishi mumkin: masalan, VOIP orqali qabul qilingan "
"telefon qo'ng'irog'i: *Accept* yoki *Decline* uchun ikkita tugmali yopishqoq "
"notification ko'rsatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:319
msgid "Displaying notifications"
msgstr "Notification'larni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:321
msgid "There are two ways to display notifications in Odoo:"
msgstr "Odoo'da notification'larni ko'rsatishning ikki yo'li bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:323
msgid ""
"The *notification* service allows component to display notifications from JS "
"code by calling the add method."
msgstr ""
"*notification* service component'ga add method'ini chaqirish orqali JS "
"koddan notification ko'rsatish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:326
msgid ""
"The *display_notification* client action allows to trigger the display of a "
"notification from python (e.g. in the method called when the user clicked on "
"a button of type object). This client action uses the notification service."
msgstr ""
"*display_notification* client action python'dan notification ko'rsatishni "
"ishga tushirish imkonini beradi (masalan, foydalanuvchi object turidagi "
"tugmani bosganda chaqiriladigan method ichida). Bu client action "
"notification service'dan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:331
msgid "Notifications have a few *options*:"
msgstr "Notification'lar bir necha *options*'ga ega:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:333
msgid ""
"*title*: string, optional. This will be displayed on the top as a title."
msgstr ""
"*title*: string, majburiy emas. Bu yuqorida sarlavha sifatida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:335
msgid ""
"*message*: string, optional. The content of the notification. Can be a "
"markup object to display formatted text."
msgstr ""
"*message*: string, majburiy emas. Notification mazmuni. Formatlangan matnni "
"ko'rsatish uchun markup obyekti bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:338
msgid ""
"*sticky*: boolean, optional (default false). If true, the notification will "
"stay until the user dismisses it.  Otherwise, the notification will be "
"automatically closed after a short delay."
msgstr ""
"*sticky*: boolean, ixtiyoriy (default false). Agar true bo'lsa, notification "
"foydalanuvchi uni yopmaguncha ekranda qoladi. Aks holda notification qisqa "
"kechikishdan so'ng avtomatik yopiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:342
msgid ""
"*type*: string, optional (default \"warning\"). Determines the style of the "
"notification. Possible values: \"info\", \"success\", \"warning\", \"danger\""
msgstr ""
"*type*: string, ixtiyoriy (default \"warning\"). Notification uslubini "
"aniqlaydi. Mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar: \"info\", \"success\", \"warning\", "
"\"danger\""

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:345
msgid ""
"*className*: string, optional.  This is a css class name that will be "
"automatically added to the notification. This could be useful for styling "
"purpose, even though its use is discouraged."
msgstr ""
"*className*: string, ixtiyoriy. Bu notification'ga avtomatik qo'shiladigan "
"css class nomi. U styling uchun foydali bo'lishi mumkin, lekin uni ishlatish "
"tavsiya etilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:349
msgid "Here are some examples on how to display notifications in JS:"
msgstr "JS'da notification'larni ko'rsatishning ba'zi misollari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:364
msgid "And in Python:"
msgstr "Python'da esa:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:381
msgid "Systray"
msgstr "Systray"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:383
msgid ""
"The Systray is the right part of the navbar in the interface, where the web "
"client displays a few widgets, such as the messaging menu."
msgstr ""
"Systray — interfeysdagi navbar'ning o'ng qismi bo'lib, unda web client bir "
"nechta widget'ni, masalan messaging menyusini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:386
msgid ""
"When the systray is created by the navbar, it will look for all registered "
"systray items and display them."
msgstr ""
"Systray navbar tomonidan yaratilganda, u ro'yxatga olingan barcha systray "
"item'larini topib ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:389
msgid ""
"There is currently no specific API for systray items.  They are Owl "
"components, and can communicate with their environment just like other "
"components, e.g. by interacting with services."
msgstr ""
"Hozircha systray item'lari uchun maxsus API mavjud emas. Ular Owl "
"component'lari bo'lib, boshqa component'lar kabi o'z environment'i bilan "
"muloqot qilishi mumkin, masalan service'lar bilan ishlash orqali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:394
msgid "Adding a new Systray Item"
msgstr "Yangi Systray Item qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:396
msgid ""
"Items can be added to the systray by adding them to the \"systray\" registry:"
msgstr ""
"Item'larni \"systray\" registry'siga qo'shish orqali systray'ga qo'shish "
"mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:406
msgid ""
"The items are ordered in the systray according to their sequence in the "
"systray registry."
msgstr ""
"Item'lar systray'da systray registry'sidagi sequence'iga muvofiq "
"tartiblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:410
msgid "Translation management"
msgstr "Tarjimalarni boshqarish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:412
msgid ""
"Some translations are made on the server side (basically all text strings "
"rendered or processed by the server), but there are strings in the static "
"files that need to be translated. The way it currently works is the "
"following:"
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi tarjimalar server tomonida bajariladi (asosan server render qilgan "
"yoki qayta ishlagan barcha matn satrlari), lekin statik fayllarda ham "
"tarjima qilinishi kerak bo'lgan satrlar bor. Hozirda bu quyidagicha ishlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:416
msgid "each translatable string is tagged with the special function *_t*"
msgstr ""
"har bir tarjima qilinadigan satr maxsus *_t* funksiyasi bilan belgilanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:417
msgid "these strings are used by the server to generate the proper PO files"
msgstr ""
"bu satrlardan server kerakli PO fayllarni generatsiya qilish uchun "
"foydalanadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:418
msgid ""
"whenever the web client is loaded, it will call the route */web/webclient/"
"translations*, which returns a list of all translatable terms"
msgstr ""
"web client yuklanganda, u */web/webclient/translations* route'ini chaqiradi "
"va u barcha tarjima qilinadigan atamalar ro'yxatini qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:420
msgid ""
"at runtime, whenever the function `_t` is called, it will look up in this "
"list in order to find a translation, and return it or the original string if "
"none is found."
msgstr ""
"runtime'da `_t` funksiyasi chaqirilganda, u tarjimani topish uchun shu "
"ro'yxatdan qidiradi va uni qaytaradi, agar topilmasa asl satrni qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:424
msgid ""
"Note that translations are explained in more details, from the server point "
"of view, in the document :doc:`/developer/howtos/translations`."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, tarjimalar server nuqtai nazaridan :doc:`/developer/howtos/"
"translations` hujjatida batafsil tushuntirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:439
msgid ""
"Note that using the translation function requires some care: the string "
"given as an argument cannot be dynamic, as it is extracted statically from "
"the code to generate the PO files and serves as the identifier for the term "
"to translate. If you need to inject some dynamic content in the string, `_t` "
"supports placeholders:"
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, tarjima funksiyasidan foydalanishda ehtiyot bo'lish kerak: "
"argument sifatida berilgan satr dinamik bo'lishi mumkin emas, chunki u PO "
"fayllarni generatsiya qilish uchun koddan statik tarzda ajratib olinadi va "
"tarjima qilinadigan atama uchun identifikator vazifasini bajaradi. Agar "
"satrga dinamik kontent qo'shish kerak bo'lsa, `_t` placeholder'larni qo'llab-"
"quvvatlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:449
msgid ""
"Notice how the string itself is fixed. This allows the translation function "
"to retrieve the translated string *before* using it for interpolation."
msgstr ""
"Satrning o'zi qanday qat'iy qolganiga e'tibor bering. Bu tarjima "
"funksiyasiga tarjima qilingan satrni interpolatsiya uchun ishlatishdan "
"*oldin* olish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:454
msgid "Session"
msgstr "Session"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:456
msgid ""
"The webclient needs some information from the python to function properly. "
"To avoid an extra round-trip with the server by making a network request in "
"JavaScript, this information is serialized directly in the page, and can be "
"accessed in JS through the `@web/session` module."
msgstr ""
"Web client to'g'ri ishlashi uchun python tomonidan ba'zi ma'lumotlarga "
"muhtoj. JavaScript'da tarmoq so'rovini yuborib server bilan qo'shimcha round-"
"trip qilmaslik uchun bu ma'lumot to'g'ridan-to'g'ri sahifada serializatsiya "
"qilinadi va JS'da `@web/session` module orqali olinishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:462
msgid "Adding information to the session"
msgstr "Session'ga ma'lumot qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:464
msgid ""
"When the `/web` route is loaded, the server injects this information in a "
"script tag. The information is obtained by calling the method `session_info` "
"of the model `ir.http`. You can override this method to add information to "
"the returned dictionary."
msgstr ""
"`/web` route yuklanganda server bu ma'lumotni script tegiga joylashtiradi. "
"Ma'lumot `ir.http` model'ining `session_info` method'ini chaqirish orqali "
"olinadi. Qaytarilgan dictionary'ga ma'lumot qo'shish uchun bu method'ni "
"override qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:482
msgid ""
"Now, the value can be obtained in javascript by reading it in the session:"
msgstr "Endi qiymatni javascript'da session'dan o'qish orqali olish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:490
msgid ""
"Note that this mechanism is designed to reduce the amount of communication "
"needed by the web client to be ready.  It is only appropriate for data which "
"is cheap to compute (a slow session_info call will delay the loading for the "
"web client for everyone), and for data which is required early in the "
"initialization process."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bu mexanizm web client tayyor bo'lishi uchun zarur bo'lgan "
"muloqot hajmini kamaytirish uchun mo'ljallangan. U faqat hisoblash arzon "
"bo'lgan ma'lumotlar uchun (sekin session_info chaqiruvi hamma uchun web "
"client yuklanishini kechiktiradi) va initsializatsiya jarayonining boshida "
"talab qilinadigan ma'lumotlar uchun mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:499
msgid ""
"The word \"view\" has more than one meaning. This section is about the "
"design of the javascript code of the views, not the structure of the *arch* "
"or anything else."
msgstr ""
"\"view\" so'zi bir nechta ma'noga ega. Bu bo'lim view'larning javascript "
"kodi dizayni haqida, *arch* strukturasi yoki boshqa narsa haqida emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:503
msgid ""
"While views are just owl components, the built-in views generally have the "
"same structure: a component called \"SomethingController\" which is the root "
"of the view. This component creates an instance of some \"model\" (an object "
"responsible for managing the data), and has a subcomponent called a "
"\"renderer\" that handles the display logic."
msgstr ""
"View'lar shunchaki owl component'lari bo'lsa-da, ichki view'lar odatda bir "
"xil strukturaga ega: view'ning root'i bo'lgan \"SomethingController\" nomli "
"component. Bu component qandaydir \"model\" instance'ini yaratadi "
"(ma'lumotlarni boshqarish uchun javob beruvchi obyekt) va ko'rsatish "
"logikasini boshqaradigan \"renderer\" nomli subcomponent'ga ega."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:514
msgid ""
"A good part of the web client experience is about editing and creating data. "
"Most of that work is done with the help of field widgets, which are aware of "
"the field type and of the specific details on how a value should be "
"displayed and edited."
msgstr ""
"Web client tajribasining katta qismi ma'lumotlarni tahrirlash va yaratishga "
"bog'liq. Bu ishning ko'p qismi field widget'lari yordamida bajariladi — ular "
"field turini va qiymat qanday ko'rsatilishi va tahrirlanishi kerakligi "
"haqidagi aniq tafsilotlarni biladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:521
msgid "Decorations"
msgstr "Decoration'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:523
msgid ""
"Like the list view, field widgets have a simple support for decorations. The "
"goal of decorations is to have a simple way to specify a text color "
"depending on the record current state.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"List view kabi, field widget'lari ham decoration'larni oddiy tarzda qo'llab-"
"quvvatlaydi. Decoration'larning maqsadi — record'ning hozirgi holatiga qarab "
"matn rangini oson belgilash. Masalan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:531
msgid "The valid decoration names are:"
msgstr "Yaroqli decoration nomlari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:533
msgid "`decoration-bf`"
msgstr "`decoration-bf`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:534
msgid "`decoration-it`"
msgstr "`decoration-it`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:535
msgid "`decoration-danger`"
msgstr "`decoration-danger`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:536
msgid "`decoration-info`"
msgstr "`decoration-info`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:537
msgid "`decoration-muted`"
msgstr "`decoration-muted`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:538
msgid "`decoration-primary`"
msgstr "`decoration-primary`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:539
msgid "`decoration-success`"
msgstr "`decoration-success`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:540
msgid "`decoration-warning`"
msgstr "`decoration-warning`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:542
msgid ""
"Each decoration *decoration-X* will be mapped to a css class *text-X*, which "
"is a standard bootstrap css class (except for *text-it* and *text-bf*, which "
"are handled by odoo and correspond to italic and bold, respectively).  Note "
"that the value of the decoration attribute should be a valid python "
"expression, which will be evaluated with the record as evaluation context."
msgstr ""
"Har bir *decoration-X* decoration standart bootstrap css class'i bo'lgan "
"*text-X* css class'iga moslanadi (*text-it* va *text-bf* bundan mustasno — "
"ular odoo tomonidan boshqariladi va mos ravishda italic va bold'ga to'g'ri "
"keladi). E'tibor bering, decoration atributining qiymati yaroqli python "
"ifodasi bo'lishi kerak va u record evaluation context sifatida olinib "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:549
msgid "Non-relational fields"
msgstr "Relational bo'lmagan field'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:551
msgid ""
"We document here all non relational fields available by default, in no "
"particular order."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda default bo'yicha mavjud bo'lgan barcha relational bo'lmagan "
"field'lar hech qanday tartibsiz keltirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:585
msgid "Integer (`integer`)"
msgstr "Integer (`integer`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:555
msgid "This is the default field type for fields of type `integer`."
msgstr "Bu `integer` turidagi field'lar uchun default field turi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:557
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:844
msgid "Supported field types: `integer`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `integer`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:559
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:600
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:693
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:726
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:767
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:799
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:828
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:874
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:892
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:922
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:952
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:985
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1021
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1047
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1083
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1168
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1198
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1268
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1283
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1294
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1349
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1378
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "Option'lar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:561
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:602
msgid ""
"`type`: setting the input type (`\"text\"` by default, can be set on "
"`\"number\"`)"
msgstr ""
"`type`: input turini belgilaydi (default `\"text\"`, `\"number\"` qilib "
"belgilash mumkin)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:563
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:604
msgid ""
"In edit mode, the field is rendered as an input with the HTML attribute type "
"set on `\"number\"` (so user can benefit the native support, especially on "
"mobile). In this case, the default formatting is disabled to avoid "
"incompability."
msgstr ""
"Tahrirlash rejimida field HTML type atributi `\"number\"` qilib belgilangan "
"input sifatida render qilinadi (shunda foydalanuvchi, ayniqsa mobil "
"qurilmada, native qo'llab-quvvatlashdan foyda oladi). Bunday holda "
"nomuvofiqlikni oldini olish uchun default formatlash o'chiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:571
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:612
msgid ""
"`step`: set the step to the value up and down when the user click on buttons "
"(only for input of type number, `1` by default)"
msgstr ""
"`step`: foydalanuvchi tugmalarni bosganda qiymatning oshish va kamayish "
"qadamini belgilaydi (faqat number turidagi input uchun, default `1`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:578
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:619
msgid "`format`: should the number be formatted. (`true` by default)"
msgstr "`format`: son formatlanishi kerakmi. (default `true`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:580
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:621
msgid ""
"By default, numbers are formatted according to locale parameters. This "
"option will prevent the field's value from being formatted."
msgstr ""
"Default holatda sonlar locale parametrlariga muvofiq formatlanadi. Bu option "
"field qiymatining formatlanishiga to'sqinlik qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:643
msgid "Float (`float`)"
msgstr "Float (`float`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:588
msgid "This is the default field type for fields of type `float`."
msgstr "Bu `float` turidagi field'lar uchun default field turi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:590
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:650
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:657
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:666
msgid "Supported field types: `float`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `float`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:592
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:942
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1117
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1151
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1191
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1262
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1396
msgid "Attributes:"
msgstr "Atributlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:594
msgid "`digits`: displayed precision"
msgstr "`digits`: ko'rsatiladigan aniqlik"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:628
msgid "`min_display_digits`: The minimum number of decimal digits to display."
msgstr "`min_display_digits`: Ko'rsatiladigan kasr raqamlarining minimal soni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:630
msgid ""
"For example, if set to 3 and no decimal precision is provided: `1.2` becomes "
"`\"1.200\"`, `1.123` becomes `\"1.123\"` and `1.1234` becomes `\"1.1234\"`."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, agar 3 qilib belgilansa va kasr aniqligi berilmasa: `1.2` "
"`\"1.200\"` ga, `1.123` `\"1.123\"` ga va `1.1234` `\"1.1234\"` ga aylanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:638
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:807
msgid ""
"`hide_trailing_zeros`: hide zeros to the right of the last non-zero digit, "
"e.g. `1.20` becomes `1.2` (`false` by default)."
msgstr ""
"`hide_trailing_zeros`: oxirgi nolga teng bo'lmagan raqamdan keyingi nollarni "
"yashiradi, masalan `1.20` `1.2` ko'rinishiga o'tadi (birlamchi qiymati "
"`false`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:650
msgid "Time (`float_time`)"
msgstr "Vaqt (`float_time`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:646
msgid ""
"The goal of this widget is to display properly a float value that represents "
"a time interval (in hours).  So, for example, `0.5` should be formatted as "
"`0:30`, or `4.75` correspond to `4:45`."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget'ning maqsadi — vaqt oralig'ini (soatlarda) ifodalovchi float "
"qiymatni to'g'ri ko'rsatish. Masalan, `0.5` `0:30` shaklida formatlanadi, "
"`4.75` esa `4:45` ga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:657
msgid "Float Factor (`float_factor`)"
msgstr "Float Factor (`float_factor`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:653
msgid ""
"This widget aims to display properly a float value that converted using a "
"factor given in its options. So, for example, the value saved in database is "
"`0.5` and the factor is `3`, the widget value should be formatted as `1.5`."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget o'z option'larida berilgan koeffitsient yordamida aylantirilgan "
"float qiymatni to'g'ri ko'rsatish uchun mo'ljallangan. Masalan, ma'lumotlar "
"bazasida saqlangan qiymat `0.5` va koeffitsient `3` bo'lsa, widget qiymati "
"`1.5` shaklida formatlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:670
msgid "Float Toggle (`float_toggle`)"
msgstr "Float Toggle (`float_toggle`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:660
msgid ""
"The goal of this widget is to replace the input field by a button containing "
"a range of possible values (given in the options). Each click allows the "
"user to loop in the range. The purpose here is to restrict the field value "
"to a predefined selection. Also, the widget support the factor conversion as "
"the `float_factor` widget (Range values should be the result of the "
"conversion)."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget'ning maqsadi — kirish maydonini mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar "
"oralig'ini (option'larda berilgan) o'z ichiga olgan tugma bilan "
"almashtirish. Har bir bosishda foydalanuvchi oraliq bo'ylab aylanib o'tadi. "
"Bu yerda maqsad field qiymatini oldindan belgilangan tanlov bilan "
"cheklashdir. Shuningdek, widget `float_factor` widget'i kabi koeffitsient "
"bilan aylantirishni qo'llab-quvvatlaydi (oraliq qiymatlari aylantirish "
"natijasi bo'lishi kerak)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:675
msgid "Boolean (`boolean`)"
msgstr "Boolean (`boolean`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:673
msgid "This is the default field type for fields of type `boolean`."
msgstr "Bu `boolean` turidagi field'lar uchun birlamchi field turi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:675
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1033
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1039
msgid "Supported field types: `boolean`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `boolean`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:680
msgid "Char (`char`)"
msgstr "Char (`char`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:678
msgid "This is the default field type for fields of type `char`."
msgstr "Bu `char` turidagi field'lar uchun birlamchi field turi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:680
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:851
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:859
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:868
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:890
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:911
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1115
msgid "Supported field types: `char`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `char`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:714
msgid "Date (`date`)"
msgstr "Date (`date`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:685
msgid ""
"This is the default field type for fields of type `date`. It consists of a "
"text box and a date picker. The field will show the date in a readable "
"format like this: `Dec 19, 1997`. The year will be hidden if it's the "
"current one. When editing the field, the numeric format will be shown. This "
"format corresponds to the one set in the current language."
msgstr ""
"Bu `date` turidagi field'lar uchun birlamchi field turi. U matn maydoni va "
"sana tanlagichdan tashkil topgan. Field sanani o'qishga qulay formatda "
"ko'rsatadi, masalan: `Dec 19, 1997`. Agar yil joriy yil bo'lsa, u "
"yashiriladi. Field tahrirlanganda raqamli format ko'rsatiladi. Bu format "
"joriy tilda belgilangan formatga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:691
msgid "Supported field types: `date`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `date`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:695
msgid ""
"`min_date` / `max_date`: sets limit dates for accepted values. By default, "
"the earliest accepted date is **1000-01-01** and the latest is "
"**9999-12-31**. Accepted values are SQL-formatted dates (`yyyy-MM-dd "
"HH:mm:ss`) or `\"today\"`."
msgstr ""
"`min_date` / `max_date`: qabul qilinadigan qiymatlar uchun chegara sanalarni "
"belgilaydi. Birlamchi holatda eng erta qabul qilinadigan sana "
"**1000-01-01**, eng kechi esa **9999-12-31**. Qabul qilinadigan qiymatlar — "
"SQL formatidagi sanalar (`yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss`) yoki `\"today\"`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:703
msgid ""
"`warn_future`: displays a warning if the value is in the future (based on "
"today)."
msgstr ""
"`warn_future`: agar qiymat kelajakka tegishli bo'lsa (bugungi kunga "
"nisbatan), ogohlantirish ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:709
msgid ""
"`numeric`: when set to true, it shows the date in the format set on the "
"current language. (default: `false`)."
msgstr ""
"`numeric`: true qilib belgilansa, sanani joriy tilda belgilangan formatda "
"ko'rsatadi (birlamchi: `false`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:760
msgid "Date & Time (`datetime`)"
msgstr "Date & Time (`datetime`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:719
msgid ""
"This is the default field type for fields of type `datetime`. The values are "
"always in the client's timezone. The displayed format has the same behaviour "
"as the date field, see :ref:`Date Field <reference/javascript_reference/"
"date_field>` description. The readable format looks like this: `Dec 19, "
"1997, 10:45 AM`."
msgstr ""
"Bu `datetime` turidagi field'lar uchun birlamchi field turi. Qiymatlar doimo "
"client'ning vaqt zonasida bo'ladi. Ko'rsatiladigan format date field bilan "
"bir xil ishlaydi, :ref:`Date Field <reference/javascript_reference/"
"date_field>` tavsifiga qarang. O'qishga qulay format shunday ko'rinadi: `Dec "
"19, 1997, 10:45 AM`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:724
msgid "Supported field types: `datetime`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `datetime`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:728
msgid ""
"see :ref:`Date Field <reference/javascript_reference/date_field>` options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Date Field <reference/javascript_reference/date_field>` option'lariga "
"qarang"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:730
msgid ""
"`rounding`: increment used to generate available minutes in the time picker. "
"This does not affect the actual value, just the amount of available options "
"in the select dropdown (default: `5`)."
msgstr ""
"`rounding`: vaqt tanlagichda mavjud daqiqalarni yaratish uchun "
"ishlatiladigan qadam. Bu haqiqiy qiymatga ta'sir qilmaydi, faqat tanlash "
"ro'yxatidagi mavjud variantlar sonini belgilaydi (birlamchi: `5`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:738
msgid ""
"`show_seconds`: when set to true, it shows the seconds from the datetime "
"field. The field will still accept datetime values, but the seconds will be "
"shown in the UI (default: `false`)."
msgstr ""
"`show_seconds`: true qilib belgilansa, datetime field'idagi sekundlarni "
"ko'rsatadi. Field baribir datetime qiymatlarini qabul qiladi, lekin "
"sekundlar UI'da ko'rinadi (birlamchi: `false`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:746
msgid ""
"`show_time`: when set to false, it hides the time part from the datetime "
"field. The field will still accept datetime values, but the time part will "
"be hidden in the UI (default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`show_time`: false qilib belgilansa, datetime field'idagi vaqt qismini "
"yashiradi. Field baribir datetime qiymatlarini qabul qiladi, lekin vaqt "
"qismi UI'da yashirin bo'ladi (birlamchi: `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:754
msgid ""
"`show_date`: when set to false, it hides the date part from the datetime "
"field. The field will still accept datetime values, but the date part will "
"be hidden in the UI (default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`show_date`: false qilib belgilansa, datetime field'idagi sana qismini "
"yashiradi. Field baribir datetime qiymatlarini qabul qiladi, lekin sana "
"qismi UI'da yashirin bo'ladi (birlamchi: `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:783
msgid "Date Range (`daterange`)"
msgstr "Date Range (`daterange`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:763
msgid ""
"This widget allows the user to select start and end date from a single "
"picker."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget foydalanuvchiga bitta tanlagichdan boshlanish va tugash sanasini "
"tanlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:765
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:790
msgid "Supported field types: `date`, `datetime`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `date`, `datetime`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:769
msgid ""
"see :ref:`Date Field <reference/javascript_reference/date_field>` "
"or :ref:`Date & Time Field <reference/javascript_reference/datetime_field>` "
"options"
msgstr ""
":ref:`Date Field <reference/javascript_reference/date_field>` "
"yoki :ref:`Date & Time Field <reference/javascript_reference/"
"datetime_field>` option'lariga qarang"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:771
msgid ""
"`start_date_field`: field used to get/set the start value of the date range "
"(cannot be used with `end_date_field`)."
msgstr ""
"`start_date_field`: sana oralig'ining boshlanish qiymatini olish/belgilash "
"uchun ishlatiladigan field (`end_date_field` bilan birga ishlatilmaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:778
msgid ""
"`end_date_field`: field used to get/set the end value of the date range "
"(cannot be used with `start_date_field`)."
msgstr ""
"`end_date_field`: sana oralig'ining tugash qiymatini olish/belgilash uchun "
"ishlatiladigan field (`start_date_field` bilan birga ishlatilmaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:790
msgid "Remaining Days (`remaining_days`)"
msgstr "Remaining Days (`remaining_days`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:786
msgid ""
"This widget can be used on date and datetime fields. In readonly, it "
"displays the delta (in days) between the value of the field and today. The "
"widget turns into a regular date or datetime field in edit mode."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget date va datetime field'larida ishlatilishi mumkin. Readonly "
"holatida u field qiymati va bugungi kun orasidagi farqni (kunlarda) "
"ko'rsatadi. Tahrirlash rejimida widget oddiy date yoki datetime field'iga "
"aylanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:812
msgid "Monetary (`monetary`)"
msgstr "Monetary (`monetary`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:793
msgid ""
"This is the default field type for fields of type `monetary`. It is used to "
"display a currency.  If there is a currency fields given in option, it will "
"use that, otherwise it will fall back to the default currency (in the "
"session)"
msgstr ""
"Bu `monetary` turidagi field'lar uchun birlamchi field turi. U valyutani "
"ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Agar option'da valyuta field'i berilgan "
"bo'lsa, shundan foydalanadi, aks holda birlamchi valyutaga (session'dagi) "
"qaytadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:797
msgid "Supported field types: `monetary`, `float`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `monetary`, `float`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:801
msgid ""
"`currency_field`: another field name which should be a many2one on currency."
msgstr ""
"`currency_field`: valyutaga many2one bo'lishi kerak bo'lgan boshqa field "
"nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:817
msgid "Text (`text`)"
msgstr "Text (`text`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:815
msgid "This is the default field type for fields of type `text`."
msgstr "Bu `text` turidagi field'lar uchun birlamchi field turi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:817
msgid "Supported field types: `text`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `text`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:835
msgid "Password (`password`)"
msgstr "Password (`password`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:820
msgid ""
"This widget renders the field value inside an input with "
"``type=\"password\"``, hiding the real value. An eye button next to the "
"input allows the user to reveal or hide the value. This widget is useful "
"when a field must store sensitive data (e.g. API keys, tokens) and the value "
"should not be visible by default."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget field qiymatini ``type=\"password\"`` bo'lgan input ichida chizadi "
"va haqiqiy qiymatni yashiradi. Input yonidagi ko'z tugmasi foydalanuvchiga "
"qiymatni ko'rsatish yoki yashirish imkonini beradi. Bu widget field maxfiy "
"ma'lumotlarni (masalan API kalitlari, token'lar) saqlashi kerak bo'lganda va "
"qiymat birlamchi holatda ko'rinmasligi lozim bo'lganda foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:826
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1129
msgid "Supported field types: `char`, `text`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `char`, `text`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:830
msgid ""
"`placeholder`: placeholder text displayed in the input when the field is "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"`placeholder`: field bo'sh bo'lganda input ichida ko'rsatiladigan "
"placeholder matni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:845
msgid "Handle (`handle`)"
msgstr "Handle (`handle`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:838
msgid ""
"This field's job is to be displayed as a `handle`, and allows reordering the "
"various records by drag and dropping them."
msgstr ""
"Bu field'ning vazifasi `handle` sifatida ko'rsatilish va record'larni tortib-"
"tashlash orqali tartibini o'zgartirish imkonini berishdir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:841
msgid "It has to be specified on the field by which records are sorted."
msgstr "U record'lar saralanadigan field'da ko'rsatilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:842
msgid ""
"Having more than one field with a handle widget on the same list is not "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"Bitta list'da handle widget'iga ega bir nechta field bo'lishi qo'llab-"
"quvvatlanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:851
msgid "Email (`email`)"
msgstr "Email (`email`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:848
msgid ""
"This field displays email address.  The main reason to use it is that it is "
"rendered as an anchor tag with the proper href, in readonly mode."
msgstr ""
"Bu field elektron pochta manzilini ko'rsatadi. Uni ishlatishning asosiy "
"sababi shundaki, readonly rejimida u to'g'ri href bilan anchor tag sifatida "
"chiziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:859
msgid "Phone (`phone`)"
msgstr "Phone (`phone`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:854
msgid ""
"This field displays a phone number.  The main reason to use it is that it is "
"rendered as an anchor tag with the proper href, in readonly mode, but only "
"in some cases: we only want to make it clickable if the device can call this "
"particular number."
msgstr ""
"Bu field telefon raqamini ko'rsatadi. Uni ishlatishning asosiy sababi "
"shundaki, readonly rejimida u to'g'ri href bilan anchor tag sifatida "
"chiziladi, lekin faqat ba'zi hollarda: uni bosiladigan qilishni faqat "
"qurilma ushbu raqamga qo'ng'iroq qila olsa xohlaymiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:878
msgid "URL (`url`)"
msgstr "URL (`url`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:862
msgid ""
"This field displays an url (in readonly mode). The main reason to use it is "
"that it is rendered as an anchor tag with the proper css classes and href."
msgstr ""
"Bu field url manzilini ko'rsatadi (readonly rejimida). Uni ishlatishning "
"asosiy sababi shundaki, u to'g'ri css class'lari va href bilan anchor tag "
"sifatida chiziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:865
msgid ""
"Also, the text of the anchor tag can be customized with the *text* attribute "
"(it won't change the href value)."
msgstr ""
"Bundan tashqari, anchor tag matni *text* atributi bilan moslashtirilishi "
"mumkin (bu href qiymatini o'zgartirmaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:876
msgid ""
"`website_path`: (default: `false`) by default, the widget forces (if not "
"already the case) the href value to begin with `\"http://\"` except if this "
"option is set to `true`, thus allowing redirections to the database's own "
"website."
msgstr ""
"`website_path`: (birlamchi: `false`) birlamchi holatda widget href qiymatini "
"`\"http://\"` bilan boshlanishga majbur qiladi (agar allaqachon shunday "
"bo'lmasa), bu option `true` qilib belgilangan holatdan tashqari — bu esa "
"ma'lumotlar bazasining o'z website'iga yo'naltirishga imkon beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:904
msgid "Domain (`domain`)"
msgstr "Domain (`domain`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:881
msgid ""
"The `domain` field allows the user to construct a technical-prefix domain "
"thanks to a tree-like interface and see the selected records in real time. "
"In debug mode, an input is also there to be able to enter the prefix char "
"domain directly (or to build advanced domains the tree-like interface does "
"not allow to)."
msgstr ""
"`domain` field'i foydalanuvchiga daraxtsimon interfeys yordamida technical-"
"prefix domain tuzish va tanlangan record'larni real vaqtda ko'rish imkonini "
"beradi. Debug rejimida prefix char domain'ni bevosita kiritish uchun (yoki "
"daraxtsimon interfeys imkon bermaydigan murakkab domain'larni qurish uchun) "
"input ham mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:887
msgid ""
"Note that this is limited to **static** domains (no dynamic expressions, or "
"access to context variable)."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bu faqat **static** domain'lar bilan cheklangan (dinamik "
"ifodalar yoki context o'zgaruvchisiga murojaat yo'q)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:894
msgid ""
"`model`: the name of the char field encoding the `res_model` on which the "
"domain applies."
msgstr ""
"`model`: domain qo'llaniladigan `res_model` ni kodlaydigan char field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:896
msgid ""
"`foldable` (default: `false`): if true, the domain field is rendered "
"compactly and unfolds itself upon user interaction."
msgstr ""
"`foldable` (standart: `false`): agar true bo'lsa, domain field ixcham "
"ko'rinishda render qilinadi va foydalanuvchi bilan o'zaro ta'sirda o'zi "
"ochiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:899
msgid ""
"`in_dialog` (default: `false`): if true, the widget opens a dialog when the "
"user wants to edit the domain whereas by default, the domain editor is "
"rendered just below the value."
msgstr ""
"`in_dialog` (standart: `false`): agar true bo'lsa, foydalanuvchi domain'ni "
"tahrirlamoqchi bo'lganda widget dialog oynasini ochadi; standart holatda esa "
"domain editor to'g'ridan-to'g'ri qiymat ostida render qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:902
msgid ""
"`count_limit` (default: `10000`): the domain widget performs search_count "
"requests to validate the domain, and to indicate the number of records "
"matching it. This requests might be costly on large tables, so by default, "
"the search_count is limited to 10000."
msgstr ""
"`count_limit` (standart: `10000`): domain widget domain'ni tekshirish va "
"unga mos keladigan record'lar sonini ko'rsatish uchun search_count "
"request'larini bajaradi. Bu request'lar katta jadvallarda qimmatga tushishi "
"mumkin, shuning uchun standart holatda search_count 10000 bilan cheklangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:911
msgid "Link button (`link_button`)"
msgstr "Havola tugmasi (`link_button`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:907
msgid ""
"The `LinkButton` widget actually simply displays a span with an icon and the "
"text value as content. The link is clickable and will open a new browser "
"window with its value as url."
msgstr ""
"`LinkButton` widget aslida shunchaki icon va matn qiymatini o'z ichiga olgan "
"span ko'rsatadi. Havolani bosish mumkin va u qiymatini url sifatida ishlatib "
"yangi brauzer oynasini ochadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:935
msgid "Image File (`image`)"
msgstr "Rasm fayli (`image`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:914
msgid ""
"This widget is used to represent a binary value as an image. In some cases, "
"the server returns a `bin_size` instead of the real image (a `bin_size` is a "
"string representing a file size, such as `\"6.5kb\"`).  In that case, the "
"widget will make an image with a source attribute corresponding to an image "
"on the server."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget binary qiymatni rasm sifatida ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Ba'zi "
"hollarda server haqiqiy rasm o'rniga `bin_size` qaytaradi (`bin_size` — fayl "
"hajmini ifodalovchi satr, masalan `\"6.5kb\"`).  Bu holda widget serverdagi "
"rasmga mos keladigan source atributi bilan rasm yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:920
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:940
msgid "Supported field types: `binary`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `binary`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:924
msgid ""
"`preview_image`: if the image is only loaded as a `bin_size`, then this "
"option is useful to inform the web client that the default field name is not "
"the name of the current field, but the name of another field."
msgstr ""
"`preview_image`: agar rasm faqat `bin_size` sifatida yuklangan bo'lsa, bu "
"option web client'ga standart field nomi joriy field nomi emas, balki boshqa "
"field nomi ekanini bildirish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:932
msgid ""
"`accepted_file_extensions`: the file extension the user can pick from the "
"file input dialog box (default value is `\"image/\\*\"`)"
msgstr ""
"`accepted_file_extensions`: foydalanuvchi fayl tanlash dialog oynasidan "
"tanlashi mumkin bo'lgan fayl kengaytmasi (standart qiymat `\"image/\\*\"`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:935
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:956
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1287
msgid "(cf: ``accept`` attribute on `<input type=\"file\" />`)"
msgstr "(qarang: `<input type=\"file\" />` dagi ``accept`` atributi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:956
msgid "Binary File (`binary`)"
msgstr "Binary fayl (`binary`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:938
msgid "Generic widget to allow saving/downloading a binary file."
msgstr "Binary faylni saqlash/yuklab olish imkonini beradigan umumiy widget."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:944
msgid ""
"`filename`: saving a binary file will lose its file name, since it only "
"saves the binary value. The file name can be saved in another field. To do "
"that, a `filename` attribute should be set to a field present in the view."
msgstr ""
"`filename`: binary faylni saqlashda uning fayl nomi yo'qoladi, chunki faqat "
"binary qiymat saqlanadi. Fayl nomini boshqa field'da saqlash mumkin. Buning "
"uchun `filename` atributi view'da mavjud bo'lgan field'ga o'rnatilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:954
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1285
msgid ""
"`accepted_file_extensions`: the file extension the user can pick from the "
"file input dialog box"
msgstr ""
"`accepted_file_extensions`: foydalanuvchi fayl tanlash dialog oynasidan "
"tanlashi mumkin bo'lgan fayl kengaytmasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:965
msgid "Priority (`priority`)"
msgstr "Muhimlik (`priority`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:959
msgid ""
"This widget is rendered as a set of stars, allowing the user to click on it "
"to select a value or not. This is useful for example to mark a task as high "
"priority."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget yulduzchalar to'plami sifatida render qilinadi va foydalanuvchiga "
"ularni bosib qiymat tanlash yoki tanlamaslik imkonini beradi. Bu, masalan, "
"vazifani yuqori muhimlikda belgilash uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:963
msgid "Note that this widget also works in `readonly` mode, which is unusual."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bu widget `readonly` rejimda ham ishlaydi, bu esa "
"g'ayrioddiy holat."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:965
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:983
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1010
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1019
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1149
msgid "Supported field types: `selection`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `selection`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:977
msgid "Image Attachment (`attachment_image`)"
msgstr "Rasm ilovasi (`attachment_image`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:968
msgid ""
"Image widget for `many2one` fields. If the field is set, this widget will be "
"rendered as an image with the proper src url. This widget does not have a "
"different behaviour in edit or readonly mode, it is only useful to view an "
"image."
msgstr ""
"`many2one` field'lar uchun rasm widget'i. Agar field o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, bu "
"widget mos src url bilan rasm sifatida render qilinadi. Bu widget edit yoki "
"readonly rejimda boshqacha ishlamaydi, u faqat rasmni ko'rish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:973
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1189
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1234
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1243
msgid "Supported field types: `many2one`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `many2one`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1001
msgid "Label Selection (`label_selection`)"
msgstr "Yorliqli tanlov (`label_selection`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:980
msgid ""
"This widget renders a simple non-editable label. This is only useful to "
"display some information, not to edit it."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget oddiy, tahrirlanmaydigan yorliqni render qiladi. U faqat biror "
"ma'lumotni ko'rsatish uchun foydali, uni tahrirlash uchun emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:987
msgid "`classes`: a mapping from a selection value to a CSS class name"
msgstr "`classes`: selection qiymatidan CSS class nomiga moslik"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1014
msgid "State Selection (`state_selection`)"
msgstr "Holat tanlovi (`state_selection`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1004
msgid ""
"This is a specialized selection widget. It assumes that the record has some "
"hardcoded fields, present in the view: `stage_id`, `legend_normal`, "
"`legend_blocked`, `legend_done`. This is mostly used to display and change "
"the state of a task in a project, with additional information displayed in "
"the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Bu maxsuslashgan selection widget. U record'da view'da mavjud bo'lgan bir "
"nechta qat'iy belgilangan field'lar borligini nazarda tutadi: `stage_id`, "
"`legend_normal`, `legend_blocked`, `legend_done`. U asosan loyihadagi vazifa "
"holatini ko'rsatish va o'zgartirish uchun ishlatiladi, qo'shimcha ma'lumot "
"esa dropdown'da ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1027
msgid "State Selection - List View (`list.state_selection`)"
msgstr "Holat tanlovi - List view (`list.state_selection`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1017
msgid ""
"In list views, the `state_selection` field displays by default the label "
"next to the icon."
msgstr ""
"List view'larda `state_selection` field standart holatda icon yonida "
"yorliqni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1023
msgid "`hide_label`: hide the label next to the icon"
msgstr "`hide_label`: icon yonidagi yorliqni yashiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1033
msgid "Favorite (`boolean_favorite`)"
msgstr "Sevimli (`boolean_favorite`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1030
msgid ""
"This widget is displayed as an empty (or not) star, depending on a boolean "
"value. Note that it also can be edited in readonly mode."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget boolean qiymatga qarab bo'sh (yoki to'ldirilgan) yulduzcha "
"sifatida ko'rsatiladi. E'tibor bering, uni readonly rejimda ham tahrirlash "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1039
msgid "Toggle (`boolean_toggle`)"
msgstr "Almashtirgich (`boolean_toggle`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1036
msgid ""
"Displays a toggle switch to represent a boolean. This is a subfield of the "
"`boolean` field, mostly used to have a different look."
msgstr ""
"Boolean qiymatni ifodalash uchun almashtirish tugmasini ko'rsatadi. Bu "
"`boolean` field'ining subfield'i bo'lib, asosan boshqacha ko'rinish berish "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1064
msgid "Stat Info (`statinfo`)"
msgstr "Statistik ma'lumot (`statinfo`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1042
msgid ""
"This widget is meant to represent statistical information in a `stat "
"button`. It is basically just a label with a number."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget `stat button` ichida statistik ma'lumotni ko'rsatish uchun "
"mo'ljallangan. U asosan raqam bilan birga keladigan yorliqdan iborat."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1045
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1072
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1081
msgid "Supported field types: `integer`, `float`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `integer`, `float`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1049
msgid ""
"`label_field`: if given, the widget will use the value of the `label_field` "
"as text."
msgstr ""
"`label_field`: agar berilgan bo'lsa, widget matn sifatida `label_field` "
"qiymatini ishlatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1076
msgid "Percent Pie (`percentpie`)"
msgstr "Foizli doira diagramma (`percentpie`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1067
msgid ""
"This widget is meant to represent statistical information in a `stat "
"button`. This is similar to a statinfo widget, but the information is "
"represented in a **pie chart** (empty to full).  Note that the value is "
"interpreted as a percentage (a number between `0` and `100`)."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget `stat button` ichida statistik ma'lumotni ko'rsatish uchun "
"mo'ljallangan. U statinfo widget'iga o'xshaydi, biroq ma'lumot **doira "
"diagramma** shaklida ifodalanadi (bo'shdan to'liqqa).  E'tibor bering, "
"qiymat foiz sifatida talqin qilinadi (`0` va `100` orasidagi son)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1107
msgid "Progress Bar (`progressbar`)"
msgstr "Jarayon paneli (`progressbar`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1079
msgid "Represent a value as a progress bar (from `0` to some value)"
msgstr "Qiymatni progress bar sifatida ifodalaydi (`0` dan biror qiymatgacha)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1085
msgid "`editable`: boolean determining whether the `value` is editable"
msgstr "`editable`: `value` tahrirlanadigan yoki yo'qligini aniqlovchi boolean"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1087
msgid ""
"`current_value`: get the current value from the field that must be present "
"in the view"
msgstr ""
"`current_value`: view'da mavjud bo'lishi shart bo'lgan field'dan joriy "
"qiymatni oladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1089
msgid ""
"`max_value`: get the maximum value from the field that must be present in "
"the view"
msgstr ""
"`max_value`: view'da mavjud bo'lishi shart bo'lgan field'dan maksimal "
"qiymatni oladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1091
msgid ""
"`edit_max_value`: boolean determining whether the `max_value` is editable"
msgstr ""
"`edit_max_value`: `max_value` tahrirlanadigan yoki yo'qligini aniqlovchi "
"boolean"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1093
msgid "`title`: title of the bar, displayed on top of the bar"
msgstr "`title`: panel sarlavhasi, panel ustida ko'rsatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1095
msgid ""
"-> not translated, use `title` attribute (not option) instead if the term "
"must be translated"
msgstr ""
"-> tarjima qilinmaydi; agar atama tarjima qilinishi kerak bo'lsa, uning "
"o'rniga `title` atributidan (option emas) foydalaning"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1123
msgid "Journal Dashboard Graph (`dashboard_graph`)"
msgstr "Journal dashboard grafigi (`dashboard_graph`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1110
msgid ""
"This is a more specialized widget, useful to display a graph representing a "
"set of data. For example, it is used in the accounting dashboard kanban view."
msgstr ""
"Bu ko'proq maxsuslashgan widget bo'lib, ma'lumotlar to'plamini ifodalovchi "
"grafikni ko'rsatish uchun foydali. Masalan, u accounting dashboard kanban "
"view'ida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1113
msgid "It assumes that the field is a JSON serialization of a set of data."
msgstr ""
"U field ma'lumotlar to'plamining JSON serializatsiyasi ekanini nazarda "
"tutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1119
msgid "`graph_type`: string, can be either `\"line\"` or `\"bar\"`"
msgstr "`graph_type`: satr, `\"line\"` yoki `\"bar\"` bo'lishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1129
msgid "Ace Editor (`ace`)"
msgstr "Ace Editor (`ace`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1126
msgid ""
"This widget is intended to be used on Text fields. It provides Ace Editor "
"for editing XML and Python."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget Text field'larda ishlatish uchun mo'ljallangan. U XML va Python'ni "
"tahrirlash uchun Ace Editor'ni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1142
msgid "Badge (`badge`)"
msgstr "Badge (`badge`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1132
msgid "Displays the value inside a bootstrap badge pill."
msgstr "Qiymatni bootstrap badge pill ichida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1134
msgid "Supported field types: `char`, `selection`, `many2one`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `char`, `selection`, `many2one`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1136
msgid ""
"By default, the badge has a light grey background, but it can be customized "
"by using the :ref:`Decoration <reference/javascript_reference/"
"field_decoration>` mechanism. For instance, to display a red badge under a "
"given condition:"
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda badge och kulrang fonga ega, biroq uni :ref:`Decoration "
"<reference/javascript_reference/field_decoration>` mexanizmi yordamida "
"moslashtirish mumkin. Masalan, berilgan shart bajarilganda qizil badge "
"ko'rsatish uchun:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1147
msgid "Selection (`selection`)"
msgstr "Selection (`selection`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1153
msgid ""
"`placeholder`: a string which is used to display some info when no value is "
"selected"
msgstr ""
"`placeholder`: qiymat tanlanmaganda qandaydir ma'lumotni ko'rsatish uchun "
"ishlatiladigan satr"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1174
msgid "Radio (`radio`)"
msgstr "Radio (`radio`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1160
msgid ""
"This is a subfield of `FielSelection`, but specialized to display all the "
"valid choices as radio buttons."
msgstr ""
"Bu `FielSelection` ning subfield'i, lekin barcha yaroqli tanlovlarni radio "
"button'lar sifatida ko'rsatishga moslashtirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1163
msgid ""
"Note that if used on a many2one records, then more rpcs will be done to "
"fetch the name_gets of the related records."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, agar many2one record'larda ishlatilsa, bog'liq "
"record'larning name_get'larini olish uchun ko'proq rpc bajariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1166
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1180
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1369
msgid "Supported field types: `selection`, `many2one`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `selection`, `many2one`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1170
msgid "`horizontal`: if `true`, radio buttons will be displayed horizontally."
msgstr ""
"`horizontal`: agar `true` bo'lsa, radio button'lar gorizontal ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1184
msgid "Badge Selection (`selection_badge`)"
msgstr "Badge Selection (`selection_badge`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1177
msgid ""
"This is a subfield of `selection` field, but specialized to display all the "
"valid choices as rectangular badges."
msgstr ""
"Bu `selection` field'ining subfield'i, lekin barcha yaroqli tanlovlarni "
"to'rtburchak badge'lar sifatida ko'rsatishga moslashtirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1223
msgid "Many2one (`many2one`)"
msgstr "Many2one (`many2one`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1187
msgid "Default widget for many2one fields."
msgstr "many2one field'lar uchun standart widget."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1193
msgid ""
"`can_create`: allow the creation of related records (takes precedence over "
"`no_create` option)"
msgstr ""
"`can_create`: bog'liq record'lar yaratishga ruxsat beradi (`no_create` "
"opsiyasidan ustun turadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1196
msgid "`can_write`: allow the editing of related records (default: `true`)"
msgstr ""
"`can_write`: bog'liq record'larni tahrirlashga ruxsat beradi (standart: "
"`true`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1200
msgid ""
"`quick_create`: allow the quick creation of related records (default: `true`)"
msgstr ""
"`quick_create`: bog'liq record'larni tez yaratishga ruxsat beradi (standart: "
"`true`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1202
msgid ""
"`no_create`: prevent the creation of related records - hide both the "
"**Create \"xxx\"** and **Create and Edit** dropdown menu items (default: "
"`false`)"
msgstr ""
"`no_create`: bog'liq record'lar yaratilishiga yo'l qo'ymaydi - **Create "
"\"xxx\"** va **Create and Edit** dropdown menyu elementlarini yashiradi "
"(standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1205
msgid ""
"`no_quick_create`: prevent the quick creation of related records - hide the "
"**Create \"xxx\"** dropdown menu item (default: `false`)"
msgstr ""
"`no_quick_create`: bog'liq record'larni tez yaratishga yo'l qo'ymaydi - "
"**Create \"xxx\"** dropdown menyu elementini yashiradi (standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1208
msgid ""
"`no_create_edit`: hide the **Create and Edit** dropdown menu item (default: "
"`false`)"
msgstr ""
"`no_create_edit`: **Create and Edit** dropdown menyu elementini yashiradi "
"(standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1210
msgid ""
"`create_name_field`: when creating a related record, if this option is set, "
"the value of the `create_name_field` will be filled with the value of the "
"input (default: `name`)"
msgstr ""
"`create_name_field`: bog'liq record yaratilganda, agar bu opsiya belgilangan "
"bo'lsa, `create_name_field` qiymati input qiymati bilan to'ldiriladi "
"(standart: `name`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1214
msgid ""
"`always_reload`: boolean, default to `false`. If `true`, the widget will "
"always do an additional `name_get` to fetch its name value. This is used for "
"the situations where the `name_get` method is overridden (please do not do "
"that)"
msgstr ""
"`always_reload`: boolean, standart qiymati `false`. Agar `true` bo'lsa, "
"widget nom qiymatini olish uchun har doim qo'shimcha `name_get` bajaradi. Bu "
"`name_get` method'i override qilingan holatlar uchun ishlatiladi (iltimos, "
"bunday qilmang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1218
msgid ""
"`no_open`: boolean, default to `false`. If set to `true`, the many2one will "
"not redirect on the record when clicking on it (in readonly mode)"
msgstr ""
"`no_open`: boolean, standart qiymati `false`. Agar `true` qilib belgilansa, "
"many2one bosilganda record'ga o'tmaydi (readonly rejimda)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1234
msgid "Many2one Barcode (`many2one_barcode`)"
msgstr "Many2one Barcode (`many2one_barcode`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1226
msgid ""
"Widget for `many2one` fields allows to open the camera from a mobile device "
"(Android/iOS) to scan a barcode."
msgstr ""
"`many2one` field'lar uchun widget mobil qurilmada (Android/iOS) kamerani "
"ochib barcode skanerlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1228
msgid ""
"Specialization of `many2one` field where the user is allowed to use the "
"native camera to scan a barcode. Then it uses `name_search` to search this "
"value."
msgstr ""
"`many2one` field'ining maxsus turi, unda foydalanuvchiga barcode skanerlash "
"uchun qurilmaning o'z kamerasidan foydalanishga ruxsat beriladi. Keyin bu "
"qiymatni izlash uchun `name_search` ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1231
msgid ""
"If this widget is set and user is not using the mobile application, it will "
"fallback to regular `many2one` (`Many2OneField`)"
msgstr ""
"Agar bu widget belgilangan bo'lsa va foydalanuvchi mobil ilovadan "
"foydalanmasa, u oddiy `many2one` (`Many2OneField`) ga qaytadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1243
msgid "Many2one Avatar (`many2one_avatar`)"
msgstr "Many2one Avatar (`many2one_avatar`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1237
msgid ""
"This widget is only supported on `many2one` fields pointing to a model which "
"inherits from `image.mixin`. In readonly, it displays the image of the "
"related record next to its `display_name`. Note that the `display_name` "
"isn't a clickable link in this case. In edit, it behaves exactly like the "
"regular `many2one`."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget faqat `image.mixin` dan inherit qiluvchi model'ga ishlovchi "
"`many2one` field'larda qo'llab-quvvatlanadi. Readonly holatda u bog'liq "
"record rasmini uning `display_name` qiymati yonida ko'rsatadi. E'tibor "
"bering, bu holatda `display_name` bosiladigan havola emas. Tahrirlash "
"holatida u aynan oddiy `many2one` kabi ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1250
msgid "Many2one Avatar User (`many2one_avatar_user`)"
msgstr "Many2one Avatar User (`many2one_avatar_user`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1246
msgid ""
"This widget is a specialization of the `Many2OneAvatar`. When the avatar is "
"clicked, we open a chat window with the corresponding user. This widget can "
"only be set on `many2one` fields pointing to the `res.users` model."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget `Many2OneAvatar` ning maxsus turi. Avatar bosilganda mos "
"foydalanuvchi bilan chat oynasi ochiladi. Bu widget faqat `res.users` "
"model'iga ishlovchi `many2one` field'larda belgilanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1250
msgid "Supported field types: `many2one` (pointing to `res.users`)"
msgstr ""
"Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `many2one` (`res.users` ga ishlovchi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1255
msgid "Many2one Avatar Employee (`many2one_avatar_employee`)"
msgstr "Many2one Avatar Employee (`many2one_avatar_employee`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1253
msgid ""
"Same as `many2one_avatar_user`, but for `many2one` fields pointing to "
"`hr.employee`."
msgstr ""
"`many2one_avatar_user` bilan bir xil, lekin `hr.employee` ga ishlovchi "
"`many2one` field'lar uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1255
msgid "Supported field types: `many2one` (pointing to `hr.employee`)"
msgstr ""
"Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `many2one` (`hr.employee` ga "
"ishlovchi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1274
msgid "Many2many (`many2many`)"
msgstr "Many2many (`many2many`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1258
msgid "Default widget for `many2many` fields."
msgstr "`many2many` field'lar uchun standart widget."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1260
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1281
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1292
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1327
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1332
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1341
msgid "Supported field types: `many2many`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `many2many`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1264
msgid "`mode`: string, default view to display"
msgstr "`mode`: satr, ko'rsatiladigan standart view"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1266
msgid "`domain`: restrict the data to a specific domain"
msgstr "`domain`: ma'lumotlarni muayyan domain bilan cheklaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1270
msgid ""
"`create_text`: allow the customization of the text displayed when adding a "
"new record"
msgstr ""
"`create_text`: yangi record qo'shilganda ko'rsatiladigan matnni sozlash "
"imkonini beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1272
msgid ""
"`link`: domain determining whether records can be added to the relation "
"(default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`link`: record'larni relation'ga qo'shish mumkinligini aniqlovchi domain "
"(standart: `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1274
msgid ""
"`unlink`: domain determining whether records can be removed from the "
"relation (default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`unlink`: record'larni relation'dan olib tashlash mumkinligini aniqlovchi "
"domain (standart: `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1287
msgid "Many2many Binary File (`many2many_binary`)"
msgstr "Many2many Binary File (`many2many_binary`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1277
msgid ""
"This widget helps the user to upload or delete one or more files at the same "
"time."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget foydalanuvchiga bir vaqtning o'zida bir yoki bir nechta faylni "
"yuklash yoki o'chirish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1279
msgid "Note that this widget is specific to the model `ir.attachment`."
msgstr "E'tibor bering, bu widget `ir.attachment` model'iga xosdir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1321
msgid "Many2many Tags (`many2many_tags`)"
msgstr "Many2many Tags (`many2many_tags`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1290
msgid "Display a `many2many` field as a list of tags."
msgstr "`many2many` field'ini teglar ro'yxati sifatida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1296
msgid ""
"`create`: domain determining whether or not new tags can be created "
"(default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`create`: yangi teglar yaratish mumkinligini aniqlovchi domain (standart: "
"`true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1302
msgid ""
"`color_field`: the name of a numeric field, which should be present in the "
"view. A color will be chosen depending on its value."
msgstr ""
"`color_field`: view'da mavjud bo'lishi kerak bo'lgan raqamli field nomi. "
"Rang uning qiymatiga qarab tanlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1309
msgid ""
"`no_edit_color`: set to `true` to remove the possibility to change the color "
"of the tags (default: `false`)."
msgstr ""
"`no_edit_color`: teglar rangini o'zgartirish imkonini olib tashlash uchun "
"`true` qilib belgilang (standart: `false`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1316
msgid ""
"`edit_tags`: set to `true` to add the possibility to update tag related "
"record by clicking on the tags. (default: `false`)."
msgstr ""
"`edit_tags`: teglarni bosish orqali tegga bog'liq record'ni yangilash "
"imkonini qo'shish uchun `true` qilib belgilang. (standart: `false`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1327
msgid "Many2many Tags - Form View (`form.many2many_tags`)"
msgstr "Many2many Tags - Form View (`form.many2many_tags`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1324
msgid ""
"Specialization of `many2many_tags` widget for form views. It has some extra "
"code to allow editing the color of a tag."
msgstr ""
"Form view'lar uchun `many2many_tags` widget'ining maxsus turi. Unda teg "
"rangini tahrirlash imkonini beruvchi qo'shimcha kod mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1332
msgid "Many2many Tags - Kanban View (`kanban.many2many_tags`)"
msgstr "Many2many Tags - Kanban View (`kanban.many2many_tags`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1330
msgid "Specialization of `many2many_tags` widget for kanban views."
msgstr "Kanban view'lar uchun `many2many_tags` widget'ining maxsus turi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1341
msgid "Many2many Checkboxes (`many2many_checkboxes`)"
msgstr "Many2many Checkboxes (`many2many_checkboxes`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1335
msgid ""
"This field displays a list of checkboxes and allows the user to select a "
"subset of the choices. Note that the number of displayed values is limited "
"to `100`. This limit isn't customizable. It simply allows to handle extreme "
"cases where this widget is wrongly set on a field with a huge comodel. In "
"those cases, a list view is more adequate as it allows pagination and "
"filtering."
msgstr ""
"Bu field checkbox'lar ro'yxatini ko'rsatadi va foydalanuvchiga tanlovlarning "
"bir qismini belgilash imkonini beradi. E'tibor bering, ko'rsatiladigan "
"qiymatlar soni `100` ta bilan cheklangan. Bu chek sozlanmaydi. U shunchaki "
"bu widget juda katta comodel'ga ega field'da xato belgilangan chekka "
"holatlarni boshqarish imkonini beradi. Bunday holatlarda list view ko'proq "
"mos keladi, chunki u pagination va filtrlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1363
msgid "One2many (`one2many`)"
msgstr "One2many (`one2many`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1344
msgid ""
"Default widget for `one2many` fields. It usually displays data in a sub list "
"view, or a sub kanban view."
msgstr ""
"`one2many` field'lar uchun standart widget. U odatda ma'lumotlarni sub list "
"view yoki sub kanban view'da ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1347
msgid "Supported field types: `one2many`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `one2many`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1351
msgid ""
"`create`: domain determining whether or not related records can be created "
"(default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`create`: bog'liq record'lar yaratish mumkinligini aniqlovchi domain "
"(standart: `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1353
msgid ""
"`delete`: domain determining whether or not related records can be deleted "
"(default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`delete`: bog'liq record'larni o'chirish mumkinligini aniqlovchi domain "
"(standart: `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1359
msgid "`create_text`: a string that is used to customize the 'Add' label/text."
msgstr ""
"`create_text`: 'Add' yorlig'i/matnini moslashtirish uchun ishlatiladigan "
"satr."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1369
msgid "Status Bar (`statusbar`)"
msgstr "Status Bar (`statusbar`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1366
msgid ""
"This is a field specific to the form views. It is the bar on top of many "
"forms which represent a flow, and allow selecting a specific state."
msgstr ""
"Bu form view'larga xos field. U ko'plab form'larning yuqori qismidagi panel "
"bo'lib, oqimni (flow) ifodalaydi va ma'lum bir holatni tanlash imkonini "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1381
msgid "Reference (`reference`)"
msgstr "Reference (`reference`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1372
msgid ""
"The `reference` field is a combination of a select (for the model) and a "
"`many2one` field (for its value).  It allows the selection of a record on an "
"arbitrary model."
msgstr ""
"`reference` field select (model uchun) va `many2one` field (uning qiymati "
"uchun) birlashmasidan iborat. U ixtiyoriy model'dagi record'ni tanlash "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1376
msgid "Supported field types: `char`, `reference`"
msgstr "Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari: `char`, `reference`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1380
msgid ""
"`model_field`: name of an `ir.model` containing the model of the records "
"that can be selected. When this option is set, the select part of the "
"`reference` field isn't displayed."
msgstr ""
"`model_field`: tanlanishi mumkin bo'lgan record'larning model'ini saqlovchi "
"`ir.model` nomi. Bu option belgilanganda, `reference` field'ning select "
"qismi ko'rsatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1386
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2742
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/11_sprinkles.rst:93
msgid "Widgets"
msgstr "Widget'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1400
msgid "Ribbon (`web_ribbon`)"
msgstr "Ribbon (`web_ribbon`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1389
msgid ""
"This widget displays a ribbon at the top right corner of the kanban card or "
"the form view sheet, for instance, to indicate archived records."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget kanban kartasi yoki form view varag'ining yuqori o'ng burchagida "
"lenta (ribbon) ko'rsatadi — masalan, arxivlangan record'larni belgilash "
"uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1398
msgid "`title`: text displayed in the ribbon."
msgstr "`title`: lentada ko'rsatiladigan matn."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1399
msgid "`tooltip`: text displayed in the ribbon's tooltip."
msgstr "`tooltip`: lentaning tooltip'ida ko'rsatiladigan matn."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1400
msgid ""
"`bg-class`: classname to set on the ribbon, typically to define the ribbon's "
"color."
msgstr ""
"`bg-class`: lentaga belgilanadigan class nomi, odatda lentaning rangini "
"aniqlash uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1408
msgid "Week Days (`week_days`)"
msgstr "Week Days (`week_days`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1403
msgid ""
"This widget displays a list of checkboxes for week days, 1 checkbox for each "
"day and allow the user to select a subset of the choices."
msgstr ""
"Bu widget hafta kunlari uchun checkbox'lar ro'yxatini ko'rsatadi — har bir "
"kun uchun 1 checkbox — va foydalanuvchiga tanlovlarning bir qismini "
"belgilash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1411
msgid "Client actions"
msgstr "Client action'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1413
msgid ""
"A client action is a component that can be displayed as the main element in "
"the webclient, occupying all the space below the navbar, just like an "
"`act_window_action`. This is useful when you need a component that is not "
"closely linked to an existing view or a specific model.  For example, the "
"Discuss application is a client action."
msgstr ""
"Client action — webclient'da asosiy element sifatida ko'rsatiladigan "
"component bo'lib, `act_window_action` kabi navbar ostidagi butun joyni "
"egallaydi. Bu sizga mavjud view yoki ma'lum bir model bilan zich "
"bog'lanmagan component kerak bo'lganda foydali. Masalan, Discuss ilovasi — "
"client action."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1418
msgid ""
"A client action is a term that has various meanings, depending on the "
"context:"
msgstr "Client action — kontekstga qarab turli ma'nolarga ega bo'lgan atama:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1420
msgid ""
"from the perspective of the server, it is a record of the model *ir_action*, "
"with a field *tag* of type char"
msgstr ""
"server nuqtai nazaridan bu *ir_action* model'ining record'i bo'lib, char "
"turidagi *tag* field'iga ega"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1422
msgid ""
"from the perspective of the web client, it is an Owl component registered in "
"the action registry under the same key its tag"
msgstr ""
"web client nuqtai nazaridan bu action registry'da o'zining tag'i bilan bir "
"xil kalit ostida ro'yxatga olingan Owl component"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1425
msgid ""
"Whenever a menu item is associated with a client action, opening it will "
"simply fetch the action definition from the server, then lookup its tag in "
"the action registry to get the component definition. This component will "
"then be rendered by the action container."
msgstr ""
"Menu elementi client action bilan bog'langan bo'lsa, uni ochish server'dan "
"action ta'rifini oladi, so'ngra component ta'rifini olish uchun action "
"registry'da uning tag'ini izlaydi. Keyin bu component action container "
"tomonidan render qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1431
msgid "Adding a client action"
msgstr "Client action qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1433
msgid ""
"A client action is a component that will control the part of the screen "
"below the navbar. Defining a client action is as simple as creating an Owl "
"component and adding it to the action registry."
msgstr ""
"Client action — navbar ostidagi ekran qismini boshqaradigan component. "
"Client action'ni aniqlash Owl component yaratib, uni action registry'ga "
"qo'shish kabi oddiy."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/javascript_reference.rst:1443
msgid ""
"Then, to use the client action in the web client, we need to create a client "
"action record (a record of the model ``ir.actions.client``) with the proper "
"``tag`` attribute:"
msgstr ""
"So'ngra client action'ni web client'da ishlatish uchun mos ``tag`` atributi "
"bilan client action record'ini (``ir.actions.client`` model'ining record'i) "
"yaratishimiz kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:5
msgid "Mobile JavaScript"
msgstr "Mobile JavaScript"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:10
msgid ""
"In Odoo 10.0 we released a mobile app which allows you to access all **Odoo "
"apps** (even your customized modules)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 10.0 da biz barcha **Odoo apps** (hatto sizning moslashtirilgan "
"modul'laringiz ham) ga kirish imkonini beruvchi mobil ilovani chiqardik."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:13
msgid ""
"The application is a combination of **Odoo Web** and **Native Mobile "
"components**. In other words it is a Odoo Web instance loaded inside a "
"native, mobile, WebView container."
msgstr ""
"Ilova **Odoo Web** va **Native Mobile components** birlashmasidan iborat. "
"Boshqacha aytganda, bu native mobil WebView container ichida yuklangan Odoo "
"Web instance'idir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:16
msgid ""
"This page documents how you can access mobile native components like Camera, "
"Vibration, Notification and Toast through Odoo Web (via JavaScript). For "
"this, you do not need to be a mobile developer, if you know Odoo JavaScript "
"API you can access all available mobile features."
msgstr ""
"Bu sahifada Camera, Vibration, Notification va Toast kabi mobil native "
"component'larga Odoo Web orqali (JavaScript yordamida) qanday murojaat "
"qilish tasvirlangan. Buning uchun mobil dasturchi bo'lishingiz shart emas: "
"Odoo JavaScript API'ni bilsangiz, mavjud barcha mobil imkoniyatlardan "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:22
msgid "These features work with **Odoo Enterprise 10.0+** only"
msgstr "Bu imkoniyatlar faqat **Odoo Enterprise 10.0+** bilan ishlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:25
msgid "How does it work?"
msgstr "Bu qanday ishlaydi?"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:27
msgid "Internal workings of the mobile application:"
msgstr "Mobil ilovaning ichki ishlash tartibi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:31
msgid ""
"Of course, it is a web page that loads on a Mobile Native Web container. But "
"it is integrated in such a way that you can access native resources from "
"your web JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Albatta, bu Mobile Native Web container'da yuklanadigan web sahifa. Lekin u "
"shunday integratsiya qilingan bo'lib, web JavaScript'ingizdan native "
"resurslarga murojaat qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:35
msgid ""
"WebPages (Odoo Web) is on the top of each layer, where the second layer is a "
"Bridge between Odoo Web (JS) and the native mobile components."
msgstr ""
"WebPages (Odoo Web) barcha qatlamlarning eng yuqorisida joylashgan, ikkinchi "
"qatlam esa Odoo Web (JS) va native mobil component'lar o'rtasidagi Bridge "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:38
msgid ""
"When any call from JavaScript is triggered it passes through Bridge and "
"Bridge passes it to the native invoker to perform that action."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript'dan biror chaqiruv ishga tushganda, u Bridge orqali o'tadi va "
"Bridge uni o'sha action'ni bajarish uchun native invoker'ga uzatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:41
msgid ""
"When the native component has done its work, it is passed to the Bridge "
"again and you get the output in JavaScript."
msgstr ""
"Native component ishini tugatgach, natija yana Bridge'ga uzatiladi va siz "
"chiqishni JavaScript'da olasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:44
msgid ""
"Process time taken by the Native component depends on what you are "
"requesting from the Native resources. For example the Camera or GPS Location."
msgstr ""
"Native component sarflaydigan ishlov berish vaqti Native resurslardan nima "
"so'rayotganingizga bog'liq. Masalan, Camera yoki GPS Location."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:48
msgid "How to use it?"
msgstr "Undan qanday foydalanish kerak?"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:50
msgid ""
"Just like the Odoo Web Framework, the Mobile API can be used anywhere by "
"getting the object from **web_mobile.rpc**"
msgstr ""
"Odoo Web Framework kabi, Mobile API'dan ham **web_mobile.rpc** dan obyektni "
"olish orqali istalgan joyda foydalanish mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:55
msgid ""
"The mobile RPC object provides a list of methods that are available (this "
"only works with the mobile app)."
msgstr ""
"Mobil RPC obyekti mavjud method'lar ro'yxatini beradi (bu faqat mobil ilova "
"bilan ishlaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:58
msgid "Check if the method is available and then execute it."
msgstr "Method mavjudligini tekshiring va so'ngra uni bajaring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:61
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "Method'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:63
msgid ""
"Each of the methods returns a JQuery Deferred object which returns a data "
"JSON dictionary"
msgstr ""
"Har bir method JQuery Deferred obyektini qaytaradi, u esa JSON dictionary "
"ma'lumotini qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:67
msgid "Show Toast in device"
msgstr "Qurilmada Toast ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:71
msgid "**message** text to display"
msgstr "ko'rsatiladigan **message** matni"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:73
msgid ""
"A toast provides simple feedback about an operation in a small popup. It "
"only fills the amount of space required for the message and the current "
"activity remains visible and interactive."
msgstr ""
"Toast kichik popup'da amal haqida oddiy qaytar aloqa beradi. U faqat xabar "
"uchun kerakli joyni egallaydi va joriy activity ko'rinib turadi hamda "
"interaktiv qoladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:84
msgid "Vibrating device"
msgstr "Qurilmani tebratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:88
msgid "Vibrates constantly for the specified period of time (in milliseconds)."
msgstr "Ko'rsatilgan vaqt oralig'ida (millisekundlarda) uzluksiz tebranadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:91
msgid "Vibrate mobile device with given duration."
msgstr "Mobil qurilmani berilgan davomiylikda tebratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:98
msgid "Show snackbar with action"
msgstr "Action bilan snackbar ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:102
msgid ""
"(*required*) **Message** to show in snackbar and action **button label** in "
"Snackbar (optional)"
msgstr ""
"(*required*) Snackbar'da ko'rsatiladigan **Message** va Snackbar'dagi action "
"**button label** (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:103
msgid ""
"``True`` if the user clicks on the Action button, ``False`` if SnackBar auto "
"dismissed after some time."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi Action tugmasini bosgan bo'lsa ``True``, SnackBar bir muncha "
"vaqtdan keyin o'zi yopilgan bo'lsa ``False``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:105
msgid ""
"Snackbars provide lightweight feedback about an operation. They show a brief "
"message at the bottom of the screen on mobile or in the lower left corner on "
"larger devices. Snackbars appear above all the other elements on the screen "
"and only one can be displayed at a time."
msgstr ""
"Snackbar'lar amal haqida yengil qaytar aloqa beradi. Ular mobil qurilmada "
"ekranning pastida, kattaroq qurilmalarda esa quyi chap burchakda qisqa xabar "
"ko'rsatadi. Snackbar'lar ekrandagi barcha boshqa elementlar ustida paydo "
"bo'ladi va bir vaqtda faqat bittasi ko'rsatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:123
msgid "Showing notification"
msgstr "Notification ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:127
msgid ""
"**title** (first row) of the notification, **message** (second row) of the "
"notification, in a standard notification."
msgstr ""
"standart notification'da notification'ning **title** (birinchi qatori) va "
"**message** (ikkinchi qatori)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:129
msgid ""
"A notification is a message you can display to the user outside of your "
"application's normal UI. When you tell the system to issue a notification, "
"it first appears as an icon in the notification area. To see the details of "
"the notification, the user opens the notification drawer. Both the "
"notification area and the notification drawer are system-controlled areas "
"that the user can view at any time."
msgstr ""
"Notification — foydalanuvchiga ilovangizning oddiy UI'sidan tashqarida "
"ko'rsatishingiz mumkin bo'lgan xabar. Tizimga notification chiqarishni "
"aytganingizda, u birinchi navbatda notification maydonida icon sifatida "
"paydo bo'ladi. Notification tafsilotlarini ko'rish uchun foydalanuvchi "
"notification tortmasini ochadi. Notification maydoni ham, notification "
"tortmasi ham tizim tomonidan boshqariladigan maydonlar bo'lib, foydalanuvchi "
"ularni istalgan vaqtda ko'rishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:144
msgid "Create contact in device"
msgstr "Qurilmada kontakt yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:148
msgid ""
"Dictionary with contact details. Possible keys (name, mobile, phone, fax, "
"email, website, street, street2, country_id, state_id, city, zip, parent_id, "
"function and image)"
msgstr ""
"Kontakt tafsilotlari bilan dictionary. Mumkin bo'lgan kalitlar (name, "
"mobile, phone, fax, email, website, street, street2, country_id, state_id, "
"city, zip, parent_id, function va image)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:150
msgid "Create a new device contact with the given contact details."
msgstr "Berilgan kontakt tafsilotlari bilan qurilmada yangi kontakt yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:177
msgid "Scanning barcodes"
msgstr "Barcode'larni skanerlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:181
msgid "Scanned ``code`` from any barcode"
msgstr "Istalgan barcode'dan skanerlangan ``code``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:183
msgid ""
"The barcode API detects barcodes in real-time, on the device, in any "
"orientation."
msgstr ""
"Barcode API barcode'larni qurilmada, real vaqtda va har qanday yo'nalishda "
"aniqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:185
msgid "The barcode API can read the following barcode formats:"
msgstr "Barcode API quyidagi barcode formatlarini o'qiy oladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:187
msgid ""
"1D barcodes: EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, Code-39, Code-93, Code-128, ITF, "
"Codabar"
msgstr ""
"1D barcode'lar: EAN-13, EAN-8, UPC-A, UPC-E, Code-39, Code-93, Code-128, "
"ITF, Codabar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:188
msgid "2D barcodes: QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF-417, AZTEC"
msgstr "2D barcode'lar: QR Code, Data Matrix, PDF-417, AZTEC"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:199
msgid "Switching account in device"
msgstr "Qurilmada account'ni almashtirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/mobile.rst:203
msgid "Use switchAccount to switch from one account to another on the device."
msgstr ""
"Qurilmada bir account'dan boshqasiga o'tish uchun switchAccount'dan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:3
msgid "Odoo Editor"
msgstr "Odoo Editor"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo Editor is Odoo's own rich text editor. Its sources can be found in the "
"`odoo-editor directory <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"web_editor/static/src/js/editor/odoo-editor>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Editor — Odoo'ning o'z rich text editori. Uning manba kodlarini `odoo-"
"editor directory <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web_editor/"
"static/src/js/editor/odoo-editor>`_ ichida topish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:10
msgid "Powerbox"
msgstr "Powerbox"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:12
msgid ""
"The Powerbox is a piece of user interface that contains :ref:`commands "
"<reference/frontend/odoo_editor/powerbox/command>` organized "
"into :ref:`categories <reference/frontend/odoo_editor/powerbox/category>`. "
"It appears when typing `/` in the editor. The commands can be filtered when "
"the user inputs text, and navigated with the arrow keys."
msgstr ""
"Powerbox — bu :ref:`categories <reference/frontend/odoo_editor/powerbox/"
"category>` bo'yicha guruhlangan :ref:`commands <reference/frontend/"
"odoo_editor/powerbox/command>` ni o'z ichiga olgan interfeys qismi. U "
"editorda `/` belgisi kiritilganda paydo bo'ladi. Foydalanuvchi matn "
"kiritganda command'lar filtrlanadi, ular orasida strelka tugmalari bilan "
"harakatlanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:None
msgid "The Powerbox opened after typing \"/\"."
msgstr "\"/\" kiritilgandan so'ng ochilgan Powerbox."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:23
msgid "Modifying the Powerbox"
msgstr "Powerbox'ni o'zgartirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:25
msgid ""
"Only one Powerbox should be instantiated at the time, and that job is done "
"by the editor itself. Its Powerbox instance can be found in its `powerbox` "
"instance variable. To change the Powerbox's contents and options, change the "
"options passed to the editor before it gets instantiated."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida faqat bitta Powerbox instance'i yaratilishi kerak va bu "
"vazifani editorning o'zi bajaradi. Uning Powerbox instance'ini `powerbox` "
"instance o'zgaruvchisida topish mumkin. Powerbox'ning tarkibi va "
"option'larini o'zgartirish uchun editor instance'i yaratilishidan oldin unga "
"uzatiladigan option'larni o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:32
msgid ""
"Never instantiate the Powerbox yourself. Always use the current editor's own "
"instance instead."
msgstr ""
"Powerbox instance'ini hech qachon o'zingiz yaratmang. Buning o'rniga doimo "
"joriy editorning o'z instance'idan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:36
msgid ""
"Say we want to add a new command `Document` to the Powerbox, just for the "
"`mass_mailing` module. We want to add it to a new category called "
"`Documentation` and we want it all the way at the top of the Powerbox."
msgstr ""
"Aytaylik, biz Powerbox'ga faqat `mass_mailing` moduli uchun yangi `Document` "
"command'ini qo'shmoqchimiz. Uni `Documentation` deb nomlangan yangi "
"category'ga qo'shishni va Powerbox'ning eng yuqorisida turishini xohlaymiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:40
msgid ""
"`mass_mailing` `extends <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"mass_mailing/static/src/js/wysiwyg.js>`_ `web_editor`'s `Wysiwyg class "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web_editor/static/src/js/"
"wysiwyg/wysiwyg.js>`_, which instantiates the editor in its `start` method. "
"Before doing so, it calls its own `_getPowerboxOptions` method, which can "
"conveniently be overridden to add our new commands."
msgstr ""
"`mass_mailing` `web_editor`'ning `Wysiwyg class <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web_editor/static/src/js/wysiwyg/wysiwyg.js>`_ ini "
"`extends <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/mass_mailing/static/"
"src/js/wysiwyg.js>`_ qiladi, u esa editor instance'ini o'zining `start` "
"method'ida yaratadi. Buning oldidan u o'zining `_getPowerboxOptions` "
"method'ini chaqiradi, uni yangi command'larimizni qo'shish uchun qulay "
"tarzda override qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:48
msgid ""
"Since `mass_mailing` already overrides `_getPowerboxOptions`, let's just add "
"our new command to it:"
msgstr ""
"`mass_mailing` allaqachon `_getPowerboxOptions` ni override qilgani uchun, "
"yangi command'imizni shunchaki unga qo'shamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:71
msgid ""
"In order to allow the names and descriptions of your commands and categories "
"to be translated, make sure to wrap them in the `_t` function."
msgstr ""
"Command va category'laringizning nomlari va tavsiflari tarjima qilinishi "
"uchun ularni `_t` funksiyasiga o'rashni unutmang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:75
msgid ""
"To avoid out-of-control escalations, don't use random numbers for your "
"priorities: look at which other priorities already exist and choose your "
"value accordingly (like you would do for a `z-index`)."
msgstr ""
"Nazoratdan chiqib ketishning oldini olish uchun priority'lar sifatida "
"tasodifiy raqamlardan foydalanmang: qanday priority'lar allaqachon "
"mavjudligini ko'rib chiqing va qiymatingizni shunga qarab tanlang (`z-index` "
"uchun qilganingiz kabi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:80
msgid "Opening a custom Powerbox"
msgstr "Maxsus Powerbox'ni ochish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:82
msgid ""
"It is possible to open the Powerbox with a custom set of categories and "
"commands, bypassing all pre-existing ones. To do that, call the `open` "
"method of the Powerbox and pass it your custom commands and categories."
msgstr ""
"Powerbox'ni mavjud barchasini chetlab o'tib, maxsus category va command'lar "
"to'plami bilan ochish mumkin. Buning uchun Powerbox'ning `open` method'ini "
"chaqiring va unga o'z command va category'laringizni uzatib yuboring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:None
msgid ""
"The Powerbox opened with custom categories and commands when pasting an\n"
"image URL."
msgstr ""
"Rasm URL manzili qo'yilganda maxsus category va command'lar bilan ochilgan\n"
"Powerbox."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:92
msgid ""
"We need the current instance of the Powerbox, which can be found in the "
"current editor. In the `Wysiwyg class <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"19.0/addons/web_editor/static/src/js/wysiwyg/wysiwyg.js>`_, you will find it "
"as `this.odooEditor.powerbox`."
msgstr ""
"Bizga Powerbox'ning joriy instance'i kerak, uni joriy editorda topish "
"mumkin. `Wysiwyg class <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"web_editor/static/src/js/wysiwyg/wysiwyg.js>`_ ichida uni "
"`this.odooEditor.powerbox` sifatida ko'rasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:97
msgid ""
"Now to open it with our custom \"Document\" command in a custom "
"\"Documentation\" category:"
msgstr ""
"Endi uni maxsus \"Documentation\" category'sidagi maxsus \"Document\" "
"command'i bilan ochish uchun:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:117
msgid "Filtering commands"
msgstr "Command'larni filtrlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:119
msgid "There are three ways to filter commands:"
msgstr "Command'larni filtrlashning uchta usuli bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:121
msgid ""
"Via the `powerboxFilters` :ref:`Powerbox option <reference/frontend/"
"odoo_editor/powerbox/options>`."
msgstr ""
"`powerboxFilters` :ref:`Powerbox option <reference/frontend/odoo_editor/"
"powerbox/options>` orqali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:123
msgid ""
"Via a given :ref:`command <reference/frontend/odoo_editor/powerbox/"
"command>`'s `isDisabled` entry."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan :ref:`command <reference/frontend/odoo_editor/powerbox/command>` "
"ning `isDisabled` yozuvi orqali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:126
msgid ""
"The user can filter commands by simply typing text after opening the "
"Powerbox. It will fuzzy-match that text with the names of the categories and "
"commands."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi Powerbox'ni ochgandan so'ng shunchaki matn kiritib "
"command'larni filtrlashi mumkin. Bu matn category va command nomlari bilan "
"taxminiy (fuzzy) mos keltiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:None
msgid "The Powerbox with its commands filtered using the word \"head\"."
msgstr "Command'lari \"head\" so'zi bilan filtrlangan Powerbox."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:140
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:107
msgid "Category"
msgstr "Category"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:151
msgid "the name of the category"
msgstr "category nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:152
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:187
msgid "`priority`"
msgstr "`priority`"

