msgstr "`function` (`() => DOMRect`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/odoo_editor.rst:230
msgid ""
"a function that returns the `DOMRect` of an ancestor of the editor (can be "
"useful when the editor is in an iframe)"
msgstr ""
"editor'ning ota elementining `DOMRect` qiymatini qaytaradigan funksiya "
"(editor iframe ichida bo'lganda foydali bo'ladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:5
msgid "Owl components"
msgstr "Owl component'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Odoo Javascript framework uses a custom component framework called Owl. "
"It is a declarative component system, loosely inspired by Vue and React. "
"Components are defined using :doc:`QWeb templates <qweb>`, enriched with "
"some Owl specific directives. The official `Owl documentation <https://"
"github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/readme.md>`_ contains a complete "
"reference and a tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Javascript framework'i Owl deb nomlangan maxsus component framework'ini "
"ishlatadi. Bu deklarativ component tizimi bo'lib, Vue va React'dan qisman "
"ilhomlangan. Component'lar :doc:`QWeb template'lari <qweb>` yordamida "
"aniqlanadi va ba'zi Owl'ga xos direktivalar bilan boyitiladi. Rasmiy `Owl "
"documentation <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/readme.md>`_ "
"to'liq ma'lumotnoma va qo'llanmani o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:16
msgid ""
"Although the code can be found in the `web` module, it is maintained from a "
"separate GitHub repository. Any modification to Owl should therefore be made "
"through a pull request on https://github.com/odoo/owl."
msgstr ""
"Kod `web` module ichida joylashgan bo'lsa-da, u alohida GitHub repozitoriysi "
"orqali yuritiladi. Shu sababli Owl'ga har qanday o'zgartirish https://"
"github.com/odoo/owl manzilidagi pull request orqali kiritilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:21
msgid ""
"Currently, all Odoo versions (starting in version 14) share the same Owl "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Hozirda Odoo'ning barcha versiyalari (14-versiyadan boshlab) bir xil Owl "
"versiyasidan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:24
msgid "Using Owl components"
msgstr "Owl component'laridan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:26
msgid ""
"The `Owl documentation`_ already documents in detail the Owl framework, so "
"this page will only provide Odoo specific information. But first, let us see "
"how we can make a simple component in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"`Owl documentation`_ Owl framework'ini batafsil bayon qilgan, shuning uchun "
"bu sahifada faqat Odoo'ga xos ma'lumotlar keltiriladi. Lekin avval Odoo'da "
"oddiy component'ni qanday yaratishni ko'rib chiqamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:50
msgid ""
"This example shows that Owl is available as a library in the global "
"namespace as `owl`: it can simply be used like most libraries in Odoo. Note "
"that we defined here the template as a static property, but without using "
"the `static` keyword, which is not available in some browsers (Odoo "
"javascript code should be Ecmascript 2019 compliant)."
msgstr ""
