"brauzerlarda mavjud emas (Odoo javascript kodi Ecmascript 2019 talablariga "
"mos bo'lishi kerak)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:56
msgid ""
"We define here the template in the javascript code, with the help of the "
"`xml` helper. However, it is only useful to get started. In practice, "
"templates in Odoo should be defined in an xml file, so they can be "
"translated. In that case, the component should only define the template name."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda biz template'ni javascript kodida `xml` helper yordamida "
"aniqlaymiz. Biroq bu faqat boshlash uchun qulay. Amalda Odoo'dagi "
"template'lar xml faylda aniqlanishi kerak, shunda ular tarjima qilinishi "
"mumkin bo'ladi. Bunday holda component faqat template nomini aniqlashi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:61
msgid ""
"In practice, most components should define 2 or 3 files, located at the same "
"place: a javascript file (`my_component.js`), a template file "
"(`my_component.xml`) and optionally a scss (or css) file "
"(`my_component.scss`). These files should then be added to some assets "
"bundle. The web framework will take care of loading the javascript/css "
"files, and loading the templates into Owl."
msgstr ""
"Amalda ko'pchilik component'lar bir joyda joylashgan 2 yoki 3 faylni "
"aniqlashi kerak: javascript fayl (`my_component.js`), template fayl "
"(`my_component.xml`) va ixtiyoriy ravishda scss (yoki css) fayl "
"(`my_component.scss`). So'ngra bu fayllar biror assets bundle'ga qo'shilishi "
"kerak. Javascript/css fayllarni yuklash va template'larni Owl'ga yuklashni "
"web framework o'zi bajaradi."

