#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:176
msgid ""
"This is a component that can perform actions when an element is swiped "
"horizontally. The swiper is wrapping a target element to add actions to it. "
"The action is executed once the user has released the swiper passed a "
"portion of its width."
msgstr ""
