"component. Swiper maqsadli elementni o'rab oladi va unga action'lar "
"qo'shadi. Foydalanuvchi swiper'ni uning kengligining ma'lum qismidan "
"o'tkazib qo'yib yuborgach, action bajariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:187
msgid ""
"The simplest way to use the component is to use it around your target "
"element directly in an xml template as shown above. But sometimes, you may "
"want to extend an existing element and would not want to duplicate the "
"template. It is possible to do just that."
msgstr ""
"Component'dan foydalanishning eng oddiy usuli — yuqorida ko'rsatilganidek, "
"uni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri xml template ichida maqsadli element atrofida "
"ishlatish. Lekin ba'zan mavjud elementni extend qilishni xohlaysiz va "
"template'ni takrorlashni istamaysiz. Buni ham amalga oshirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:191
msgid ""
"If you want to extend the behavior of an existing element, you must place "
"the element inside, by wrapping it directly. Also, you can conditionnally "
"add props to manage when the element might be swipable, its animation and "
"the minimum portion to swipe to perform the action."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud elementning xatti-harakatini extend qilishni istasangiz, elementni "
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri o'rab, ichiga joylashtirishingiz kerak. Shuningdek, "
"element qachon surilishi mumkinligini, uning animatsiyasini va action "
"bajarilishi uchun surilishi kerak bo'lgan minimal qismni boshqarish uchun "
"shartli ravishda props qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:195
