#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:415
msgid "Dropdown"
msgstr "Dropdown"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:420
msgid "`@web/core/dropdown/dropdown` and `@web/core/dropdown/dropdown_item`"
msgstr "`@web/core/dropdown/dropdown` va `@web/core/dropdown/dropdown_item`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:425
msgid ""
"The Dropdown lets you show a menu with a list of items when a toggle is "
"clicked on. They can be combined with DropdownItems to invoke callbacks and "
"close the menu when items are selected."
msgstr ""
"Dropdown toggle bosilganda element'lar ro'yxatidan iborat menyuni ko'rsatish "
"imkonini beradi. Ularni DropdownItem'lar bilan birgalikda ishlatib, element "
"tanlanganda callback'larni chaqirish va menyuni yopish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:429
msgid ""
"Dropdowns are surprisingly complicated components, the list of features they "
"provide is as follow:"
msgstr ""
"Dropdown'lar kutilganidan ko'ra murakkab component'lar bo'lib, ular taqdim "
"etadigan imkoniyatlar ro'yxati quyidagicha:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:432
msgid "Toggle the item list on click"
msgstr "Bosilganda element'lar ro'yxatini ochish yoki yopish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:433
msgid "Close on outside click"
msgstr "Tashqariga bosilganda yopilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:434
msgid "Call a function when items are selected"
msgstr "Element'lar tanlanganda funksiyani chaqirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:435
msgid "Optionally close the item list when an item is selected"
msgstr "Element tanlanganda element'lar ro'yxatini ixtiyoriy ravishda yopish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:436
msgid "SIY: style it yourself"
msgstr "SIY: uslubini o'zingiz belgilaysiz"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:437
msgid "Support sub dropdowns, up to any level"
msgstr "Har qanday darajadagi ichki dropdown'larni qo'llab-quvvatlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:438
msgid "Configurable hotkey to open/close a dropdown or select a dropdown item"
msgstr ""
"Dropdown'ni ochish/yopish yoki dropdown element'ini tanlash uchun "
"sozlanadigan hotkey"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:439
msgid ""
"Keyboard navigation (arrows, tab, shift+tab, home, end, enter and escape)"
msgstr ""
"Klaviatura orqali navigatsiya (arrows, tab, shift+tab, home, end, enter va "
"escape)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:440
msgid "Reposition itself whenever the page scrolls or is resized"
msgstr ""
"Sahifa scroll qilinganda yoki o'lchami o'zgarganda o'z joyini qayta aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:441
msgid ""
"Smartly chose the direction it should open (right-to-left direction is "
"automatically handled)."
msgstr ""
"Qaysi tomonga ochilishini aqlli tarzda tanlash (o'ngdan chapga yo'nalish "
"avtomatik hisobga olinadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:442
msgid "Direct siblings dropdowns: when one is open, toggle others on hover"
msgstr ""
"Bir xil darajadagi qo'shni dropdown'lar: biri ochiq bo'lganda, boshqalari "
"hover'da almashadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:444
msgid ""
"To properly use a `<Dropdown/>` component, you need to populate two `OWL "
"slots <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/slots.md>`_ :"
msgstr ""
"`<Dropdown/>` component'idan to'g'ri foydalanish uchun ikkita `OWL slots "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/slots.md>`_ ni "
"to'ldirishingiz kerak :"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:447
msgid ""
"`default` slot: it contains the *toggle* elements of your dropdown. By "
"default, click events will be attached to this element to open and close the "
"dropdown."
msgstr ""
"`default` slot: u dropdown'ingizning *toggle* element'larini o'z ichiga "
"oladi. Odatda dropdown'ni ochish va yopish uchun click event'lari shu "
"element'ga bog'lanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:449
msgid ""
"`content` slot: it contains the *elements* of the dropdown menu itself and "
"is rendered inside a popover. Although it is not mandatory, you can put some "
"`DropdownItem` inside this slot, the dropdown will automatically close when "
"these items are selected."
msgstr ""
"`content` slot: u dropdown menyusining *element*'larini o'z ichiga oladi va "
"popover ichida render qilinadi. Majburiy bo'lmasa-da, bu slot ichiga bir "
"nechta `DropdownItem` joylashtirishingiz mumkin — bu element'lar tanlanganda "
"dropdown avtomatik yopiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:469
msgid "Dropdown Props"
msgstr "Dropdown Props"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:478
msgid "`menuClass`"
msgstr "`menuClass`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:480
msgid "Optional classname added to the dropdown's menu"
msgstr "Dropdown menyusiga qo'shiladigan ixtiyoriy classname"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:483
msgid ""
"Optional, if true, disables the dropdown so the user is not able to open it "
"anymore. (default: `false`)"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, agar true bo'lsa, dropdown o'chiriladi va foydalanuvchi uni "
"boshqa ocha olmaydi. (default: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:484
msgid "`items`"
msgstr "`items`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:485
msgid "`Array`"
msgstr "`Array`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:486
msgid ""
"Optional list of items to be displayed as DropdownItems inside the "
"dropdown's menu"
msgstr ""
"Dropdown menyusi ichida DropdownItem sifatida ko'rsatiladigan "
"element'larning ixtiyoriy ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:489
msgid ""
"Optionally defines the desired menu opening position. RTL direction is "
"automatically applied. Should be a valid :ref:`usePosition <frontend/hooks/"
"useposition>` hook position. (default: `bottom-start`)"
msgstr ""
"Menyuning kerakli ochilish position'ini ixtiyoriy ravishda belgilaydi. RTL "
"yo'nalish avtomatik qo'llanadi. :ref:`usePosition <frontend/hooks/"
"useposition>` hook'ining haqiqiy position qiymati bo'lishi kerak. (default: "
"`bottom-start`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:490
msgid "`beforeOpen`"
msgstr "`beforeOpen`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:491
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:494
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:497
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:512
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:529
msgid "`Function`"
msgstr "`Function`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:492
msgid "Optional function called just before opening. May be asynchronous."
msgstr ""
"Ochilishdan bir oz oldin chaqiriladigan ixtiyoriy funksiya. Asinxron "
"bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:493
msgid "`onOpened`"
msgstr "`onOpened`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:495
msgid "Optional function called just after opening."
msgstr "Ochilgandan so'ng darhol chaqiriladigan ixtiyoriy funksiya."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:496
msgid "`onStateChanged`"
msgstr "`onStateChanged`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:498
msgid ""
"Optional function called after opening or closing (gives a boolean as single "
"argument that represents whether the dropdown is open or not)."
msgstr ""
"Ochilgandan yoki yopilgandan keyin chaqiriladigan ixtiyoriy funksiya (yagona "
"argument sifatida dropdown ochiq yoki yopiqligini bildiruvchi boolean "
"beradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:499
msgid "`state`"
msgstr "`state`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:501
msgid ""
"Optional object with `open()`, `close()` and `isOpen` properties to manually "
"control when the dropdown opens and closes."
msgstr ""
"Dropdown qachon ochilishi va yopilishini qo'lda boshqarish uchun `open()`, "
"`close()` va `isOpen` xossalariga ega ixtiyoriy object."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:502
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:103
msgid "`manual`"
msgstr "`manual`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:504
msgid ""
"Optional, when true, the Dropdown component will not add click event "
"listeners to the toggler. This allows for more control as when to open the "
"dropdown. (This should be used in tandem with the `state` prop)"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, true bo'lganda Dropdown component'i toggler'ga click event "
"listener'larini qo'shmaydi. Bu dropdown qachon ochilishini ko'proq nazorat "
"qilish imkonini beradi. (Bu `state` prop bilan birgalikda ishlatilishi kerak)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:505
msgid "`navigationOptions`"
msgstr "`navigationOptions`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:507
msgid ""
"Optionally overrides the navigation options of the dropdown, (see `web/core/"
"navigation/navigation`)."
msgstr ""
"Dropdown'ning navigation option'larini ixtiyoriy ravishda override qiladi "
"(`web/core/navigation/navigation` ga qaralsin)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:508
msgid "`holdOnHover`"
msgstr "`holdOnHover`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:510
msgid ""
"Optional, if true, keeps the Dropdown's menu at the same position while the "
"mouse is hovering it, creating a better UX when the menu's content changes."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, agar true bo'lsa, sichqoncha menyu ustida turganda Dropdown "
"menyusini bir joyda ushlab turadi va menyu mazmuni o'zgarganda yaxshiroq UX "
"yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:511
msgid "`menuRef`"
msgstr "`menuRef`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:513
msgid ""
"Optional, allows to get a ref of the dropdown's menu, (expects a function "
"returned from `useChildRef`)"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, dropdown menyusining ref'ini olish imkonini beradi (`useChildRef` "
"dan qaytarilgan funksiyani kutadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:516
msgid "DropdownItem Props"
msgstr "DropdownItem Props"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:525
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:903
msgid "`class`"
msgstr "`class`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:526
msgid "`String` or `Object`"
msgstr "`String` yoki `Object`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:527
msgid ""
"Optional value added to the root span classname (supports both strings and "
"`OWL classname object notation <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/templates.md#dynamic-class-attribute>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Root span classname'iga qo'shiladigan ixtiyoriy qiymat (satrlarni ham, `OWL "
"classname object notation <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/templates.md#dynamic-class-attribute>`_ ni ham qo'llab-"
"quvvatlaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:528
msgid "`onSelected`"
msgstr "`onSelected`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:530
msgid "Optional function called when the dropdown item is selected."
msgstr "Dropdown element'i tanlanganda chaqiriladigan ixtiyoriy funksiya."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:531
msgid "`closingMode`"
msgstr "`closingMode`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:532
msgid "`\"none\"` | `\"closest\"` | `\"all\"`"
msgstr "`\"none\"` | `\"closest\"` | `\"all\"`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:533
msgid ""
"Optional, controls which parent dropdown should close when the item is "
"selected: `none`: the dropdown will not close, `closest`: the direct parent "
"will close, `all`: every nested parent dropdown will close (default: `all`)"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy, element tanlanganda qaysi parent dropdown yopilishini boshqaradi: "
"`none`: dropdown yopilmaydi, `closest`: bevosita parent yopiladi, `all`: har "
"bir ichki parent dropdown yopiladi (default: `all`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:535
msgid "`attrs`"
msgstr "`attrs`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:537
msgid ""
"Optional object representing attributes that are added to the root element. "
"`<DropdownItem attrs=\"{ title: 'A tooltip', 'data-hotkey': 'shift+a' }\">`. "
"(If `href` is set, the element will automatically become an `a` element)."
msgstr ""
"Root element'ga qo'shiladigan atributlarni ifodalovchi ixtiyoriy object. "
"`<DropdownItem attrs=\"{ title: 'A tooltip', 'data-hotkey': 'shift+a' }\">`. "
"(Agar `href` belgilangan bo'lsa, element avtomatik ravishda `a` element'iga "
"aylanadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:540
msgid ""
"When writing custom css for you components, do not forget that the menu "
"elements are not next to the toggle but inside the overlay container, at the "
"bottom of the document. Thus, use the `menuClass` and `class` props to more "
"easily write your selectors. (This DOM magic let us avoid lots of z-index "
"issues.)"
msgstr ""
"Component'laringiz uchun maxsus css yozayotganda esda tuting: menyu "
"element'lari toggle yonida emas, balki document oxiridagi overlay container "
"ichida joylashadi. Shu sababli selector'laringizni osonroq yozish uchun "
"`menuClass` va `class` prop'laridan foydalaning. (Bu DOM sehri ko'plab z-"
"index muammolaridan qutulish imkonini beradi.)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:546
msgid "Nested Dropdown"
msgstr "Ichma-ich Dropdown"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:548
msgid ""
"Dropdown can be nested, to do this simply put new Dropdown components inside "
"other dropdown's content slot. When the parent dropdown is open, child "
"dropdowns will open automatically on hover."
msgstr ""
"Dropdown'lar ichma-ich joylashtirilishi mumkin; buning uchun boshqa "
"dropdown'ning content slot'i ichiga yangi Dropdown component'larini qo'yish "
"kifoya. Parent dropdown ochiq bo'lganda, child dropdown'lar hover'da "
"avtomatik ochiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:551
msgid ""
"By default, selecting a DropdownItem will close the whole Dropdown tree."
msgstr "Odatda DropdownItem tanlanganda butun Dropdown daraxti yopiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:555
msgid ""
"This example shows how one could make a nested File dropdown menu, with "
"submenus for the New sub elements."
msgstr ""
"Bu misol New ichki element'lari uchun submenyularga ega ichma-ich File "
"dropdown menyusini qanday yasash mumkinligini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:575
msgid ""
"In the example bellow, we recursively call a template to display a tree-like "
"structure."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misolda biz tree ko'rinishidagi strukturani ko'rsatish uchun "
"template'ni rekursiv chaqiramiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:608
msgid "Controlled Dropdown"
msgstr "Boshqariladigan Dropdown"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:610
msgid ""
"If needed, you can also open or close the dropdown using code. To do this "
"you must use the `useDropdownState` hook along with the `state` prop. "
"`useDropdownState` returns an object that has an `open` and a `close` method "
"(as well as an `isOpen` getter). Give the object to the `state` prop of the "
"dropdown you want to control and calling the respective functions should now "
"open and close your dropdown."
msgstr ""
"Kerak bo'lsa, dropdown'ni kod bilan ham ochish yoki yopish mumkin. Buning "
"uchun `useDropdownState` hook'ini `state` prop bilan birga ishlatishingiz "
"kerak. `useDropdownState` `open` va `close` method'lariga (shuningdek "
"`isOpen` getter'iga) ega obyektni qaytaradi. Ushbu obyektni boshqarmoqchi "
"bo'lgan dropdown'ning `state` prop'iga bering — mos funksiyalarni chaqirish "
"endi dropdown'ingizni ochadi va yopadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:615
msgid ""
"You can also set `manual` to `true` if you don't want the default click "
"handlers to be added on the toggle."
msgstr ""
"Agar toggle'ga standart click handler'lari qo'shilishini istamasangiz, "
"`manual` ni `true` qilib ham belgilashingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:619
msgid ""
"The following example shows a dropdown that opens automatically when mounted "
"and only has a 50% chance of closing when clicking on the button inside."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misolda mount qilinganda avtomatik ochiladigan va ichidagi button "
"bosilganda yopilish ehtimoli faqat 50% bo'lgan dropdown ko'rsatilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:658
msgid "DropdownGroup"
msgstr "DropdownGroup"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:660
msgid "**Location:** `@web/core/dropdown/dropdown_group`"
msgstr "**Joylashuv:** `@web/core/dropdown/dropdown_group`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:662
msgid ""
"You can use the DropdownGroup component to make Dropdowns share a common "
"group, this means that when one of these Dropdown is open, the others will "
"automatically open themselves on mouse hover, without the need for a click."
msgstr ""
"DropdownGroup component'idan Dropdown'lar umumiy guruhni bo'lishishi uchun "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin; bu shuni bildiradi: bu Dropdown'lardan biri ochiq "
"bo'lganda, boshqalari sichqoncha ustiga kelganda click'siz avtomatik "
"ochiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:666
msgid ""
"To do this, either surround all the Dropdowns with a single DropdownGroup or "
"surround them with DropdownGroups with the same `group` key."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun barcha Dropdown'larni bitta DropdownGroup ichiga oling yoki "
"ularni bir xil `group` kalitiga ega DropdownGroup'lar bilan o'rab oling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:670
msgid ""
"In the example bellow, all dropdown in the snippet bellow will share the "
"same group:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misolda, quyidagi snippet'dagi barcha dropdown'lar bir xil guruhni "
"bo'lishadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:680
msgid ""
"Whereas in the following snippet, only the first, second and fourth dropdown "
"share the same group:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi snippet'da esa faqat birinchi, ikkinchi va to'rtinchi dropdown bir "
"xil guruhni bo'lishadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:700
msgid "Notebook"
msgstr "Notebook"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:705
msgid "`@web/core/notebook/notebook`"
msgstr "`@web/core/notebook/notebook`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:710
msgid ""
"The Notebook is made to display multiple pages in a tabbed interface. Tabs "
"can be located at the top of the element to display horizontally, or at the "
"left for a vertical layout."
msgstr ""
"Notebook bir nechta sahifani tabbed interfeysda ko'rsatish uchun yaratilgan. "
"Tab'lar gorizontal ko'rinish uchun element'ning yuqorisida, vertikal layout "
"uchun esa chap tomonda joylashishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:713
msgid ""
"There are two ways to define your Notebook pages to instanciate, either by "
"using `slot`'s, or by passing a dedicated `props`."
msgstr ""
"Notebook sahifalarini instansiyalash uchun aniqlashning ikki yo'li bor: "
"`slot`'lardan foydalanish yoki maxsus `props` uzatish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:716
msgid ""
"A page can be disabled with the `isDisabled` attribute, set directly on the "
"slot node, or in the page declaration, if the Notebook is used with the "
"`pages` given as props. Once disabled, the corresponding tab is greyed out "
"and set as inactive as well."
msgstr ""
"Sahifa `isDisabled` atributi bilan o'chirib qo'yilishi mumkin — u to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri slot node'da yoki, agar Notebook `pages` props sifatida berilgan "
"holda ishlatilsa, sahifa deklaratsiyasida belgilanadi. O'chirilgandan so'ng "
"mos tab kulrang bo'lib qoladi va nofaol qilib qo'yiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:730
msgid "`anchors`"
msgstr "`anchors`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:731
msgid "`object`"
msgstr "`object`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:732
msgid ""
"optional. Allow anchors navigation to elements inside tabs that are not "
"visible."
msgstr ""
"ixtiyoriy. Tab'lar ichidagi ko'rinmaydigan element'larga anchor bo'yicha "
"navigatsiyani ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:733
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:446
msgid "`className`"
msgstr "`className`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:735
msgid "optional. Classname set on the root of the component."
msgstr "ixtiyoriy. Component'ning root'iga o'rnatiladigan classname."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:736
msgid "`defaultPage`"
msgstr "`defaultPage`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:738
msgid "optional. Page `id` to display by default."
msgstr "ixtiyoriy. Standart holatda ko'rsatiladigan sahifa `id`'si."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:739
msgid "`icons`"
msgstr "`icons`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:741
msgid "optional. List of icons used in the tabs."
msgstr "ixtiyoriy. Tab'larda ishlatiladigan icon'lar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:742
msgid "`orientation`"
msgstr "`orientation`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:744
msgid "optional. Whether tabs direction is `horizontal` or `vertical`."
msgstr ""
"ixtiyoriy. Tab'lar yo'nalishi `horizontal` yoki `vertical` ekanligini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:745
msgid "`onPageUpdate`"
msgstr "`onPageUpdate`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:747
msgid "optional. Callback executed once the page has changed."
msgstr "ixtiyoriy. Sahifa o'zgargandan keyin bajariladigan callback."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:748
msgid "`pages`"
msgstr "`pages`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:750
msgid "optional. Contain the list of `page`'s to populate from a template."
msgstr ""
"ixtiyoriy. Template'dan to'ldirish uchun `page`'lar ro'yxatini o'z ichiga "
"oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:754
msgid "The first approach is to set the pages in the slots of the component."
msgstr "Birinchi yondashuv — sahifalarni component'ning slot'larida belgilash."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:768
msgid ""
"The other way to define your pages is by passing the props. This can be "
"useful if some pages share the same structure. Create first a component for "
"each page template that you may use."
msgstr ""
"Sahifalarni aniqlashning boshqa yo'li — props uzatish. Bu, agar ba'zi "
"sahifalar bir xil strukturaga ega bo'lsa, foydali bo'ladi. Avval siz "
"ishlatishi mumkin bo'lgan har bir sahifa template'i uchun component yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:811
msgid "Both examples are shown here:"
msgstr "Ikkala misol ham shu yerda ko'rsatilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:0
msgid "Examples with vertical and horizontal layout"
msgstr "Vertikal va gorizontal layout bilan misollar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:822
msgid "Pager"
msgstr "Pager"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:827
msgid "`@web/core/pager/pager`"
msgstr "`@web/core/pager/pager`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:832
msgid ""
"The Pager is a small component to handle pagination. A page is defined by an "
"`offset` and a `limit` (the size of the page). It displays the current page "
"and the `total` number of elements, for instance, \"9-12 / 20\". In the "
"previous example, `offset` is 8, `limit` is 4 and `total` is 20. It has two "
"buttons (\"Previous\" and \"Next\") to navigate between pages."
msgstr ""
"Pager — paginatsiyani boshqarish uchun kichik component. Sahifa `offset` va "
"`limit` (sahifa o'lchami) bilan aniqlanadi. U joriy sahifani va "
"element'larning `total` sonini ko'rsatadi, masalan, \"9-12 / 20\". Oldingi "
"misolda `offset` 8 ga, `limit` 4 ga va `total` 20 ga teng. Unda sahifalar "
"orasida harakatlanish uchun ikkita button bor (\"Previous\" va \"Next\")."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:835
msgid ""
"The pager can be used anywhere but its main use is in the control panel. See "
"the :ref:`usePager <frontend/hooks/usepager>` hook in order to manipulate "
"the pager of the control panel."
msgstr ""
"Pager'dan har qanday joyda foydalanish mumkin, lekin uning asosiy "
"qo'llanilishi control panel'da. Control panel'ning pager'ini boshqarish "
"uchun :ref:`usePager <frontend/hooks/usepager>` hook'iga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:851
msgid "`offset`"
msgstr "`offset`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:853
msgid ""
"Index of the first element of the page. It starts with 0 but the pager "
"displays `offset + 1`."
msgstr ""
"Sahifaning birinchi element'i indeksi. U 0 dan boshlanadi, lekin pager "
"`offset + 1` ni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:854
msgid "`limit`"
msgstr "`limit`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:856
msgid ""
"Size of the page. The sum of `offset` and `limit` corresponds to the index "
"of the last element of the page."
msgstr ""
"Sahifa o'lchami. `offset` va `limit` yig'indisi sahifaning oxirgi element'i "
"indeksiga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:857
msgid "`total`"
msgstr "`total`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:859
msgid "Total number of elements the page can reach."
msgstr "Sahifa yetib borishi mumkin bo'lgan element'larning umumiy soni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:860
msgid "`onUpdate`"
msgstr "`onUpdate`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:862
msgid ""
"Function that is called when page is modified by the pager. This function "
"can be async, the pager cannot be edited while this function is executing."
msgstr ""
"Sahifa pager tomonidan o'zgartirilganda chaqiriladigan funksiya. Bu funksiya "
"async bo'lishi mumkin; u bajarilib turgan vaqtda pager'ni tahrirlash mumkin "
"emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:863
msgid "`isEditable`"
msgstr "`isEditable`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:865
msgid "Allows to click on the current page to edit it (`true` by default)."
msgstr ""
"Joriy sahifani tahrirlash uchun uni bosishga imkon beradi (standart holatda "
"`true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:866
msgid "`withAccessKey`"
msgstr "`withAccessKey`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:868
msgid ""
"Binds access key `p` on the previous page button and `n` on the next page "
"one (`true` by default)."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi sahifa button'iga `p` va keyingi sahifa button'iga `n` access "
"key'ini bog'laydi (standart holatda `true`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:873
msgid "SelectMenu"
msgstr "SelectMenu"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:878
msgid "`@web/core/select_menu/select_menu`"
msgstr "`@web/core/select_menu/select_menu`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:883
msgid ""
"This component can be used when you want to do more than using the native "
"`select` element. You can define your own option template, allowing to "
"search between your options, or group them in subsections."
msgstr ""
"Bu component'dan native `select` element'idan foydalanishdan ko'proq narsa "
"qilmoqchi bo'lganingizda foydalanish mumkin. O'zingizning option "
"template'ingizni aniqlashingiz, option'lar orasidan qidirishga yoki ularni "
"subsection'larga guruhlashga imkon berishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:887
msgid ""
"Prefer the native HTML `select` element, as it provides by default "
"accessibility features, and has a better user interface on mobile devices. "
"This component is designed to be used for more complex use cases, to "
"overcome limitations of the native element."
msgstr ""
"Native HTML `select` element'ini afzal ko'ring, chunki u standart holatda "
"accessibility imkoniyatlarini beradi va mobil qurilmalarda yaxshiroq "
"foydalanuvchi interfeysiga ega. Bu component murakkabroq holatlar uchun, "
"native element'ning cheklovlarini bartaraf etish uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:900
msgid "`choices`"
msgstr "`choices`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:902
msgid "optional. List of `choice`'s to display in the dropdown."
msgstr "ixtiyoriy. Dropdown'da ko'rsatiladigan `choice`'lar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:905
msgid "optional. Classname set on the root of the SelectMenu component."
msgstr ""
"ixtiyoriy. SelectMenu component'ining root'iga o'rnatiladigan classname."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:906
msgid "`groups`"
msgstr "`groups`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:908
msgid ""
"optional. List of `group`'s, containing `choices` to display in the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"ixtiyoriy. Dropdown'da ko'rsatish uchun `choices` ni o'z ichiga olgan "
"`group`'lar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:909
msgid "`multiSelect`"
msgstr "`multiSelect`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:911
msgid ""
"optional. Enable multiple selections. When multiple selection is enabled, "
"selected values are displayed as :ref:`tag <frontend/tags_list>`'s in the "
"SelectMenu input."
msgstr ""
"majburiy emas. Bir nechta tanlovni yoqadi. Bir nechta tanlov yoqilganda, "
"tanlangan qiymatlar SelectMenu input'ida :ref:`tag <frontend/tags_list>`'lar "
"sifatida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:912
msgid "`togglerClass`"
msgstr "`togglerClass`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:914
msgid "optional. classname set on the toggler button."
msgstr "majburiy emas. toggler tugmasiga o'rnatiladigan classname."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:915
msgid "`required`"
msgstr "`required`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:917
msgid "optional. Whether the selected value can be unselected."
msgstr ""
"majburiy emas. Tanlangan qiymatning tanlovini bekor qilish mumkinmi yoki "
"yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:918
msgid "`searchable`"
msgstr "`searchable`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:920
msgid "optional. Whether a search box is visible in the dropdown."
msgstr "majburiy emas. dropdown ichida qidiruv maydoni ko'rinadimi yoki yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:921
msgid "`searchPlaceholder`"
msgstr "`searchPlaceholder`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:923
msgid "optional. Text displayed as the search box placeholder."
msgstr ""
"majburiy emas. Qidiruv maydonining placeholder'i sifatida ko'rsatiladigan "
"matn."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:925
msgid "`any`"
msgstr "`any`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:926
msgid "optional. Current selected value. It can be from any kind of type."
msgstr ""
"majburiy emas. Hozirda tanlangan qiymat. U har qanday turdagi bo'lishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:927
msgid "`onSelect`"
msgstr "`onSelect`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:929
msgid "optional. Callback executed when an option is chosen."
msgstr "majburiy emas. Biror variant tanlanganda bajariladigan callback."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:931
msgid "The shape of a `choice` is the following:"
msgstr "`choice` tuzilishi quyidagicha:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:933
msgid ""
"`value` is actual value of the choice. It is usually a technical string, but "
"can be from `any` type."
msgstr ""
"`value` — choice'ning haqiqiy qiymati. U odatda texnik string bo'ladi, lekin "
"`any` turdan bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:934
msgid ""
"`label` is the displayed text associated with the option. This one is "
"usually a more friendly and translated `string`."
msgstr ""
"`label` — variant bilan bog'liq ko'rsatiladigan matn. Bu odatda "
"foydalanuvchiga tushunarli va tarjima qilingan `string` bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:936
msgid "The shape of a `group` is the following:"
msgstr "`group` tuzilishi quyidagicha:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:938
msgid "`choices` is the list of `choice`'s to display for this group."
msgstr "`choices` — bu group uchun ko'rsatiladigan `choice`'lar ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:939
msgid ""
"`label` is the displayed text associated with the group. This is a `string` "
"displayed at the top of the group."
msgstr ""
"`label` — group bilan bog'liq ko'rsatiladigan matn. Bu group'ning yuqori "
"qismida ko'rsatiladigan `string`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:943
msgid ""
"In the following example, the SelectMenu will display four choices. One of "
"them is displayed on top of the options, since no groups are associated with "
"it, but the other ones are separated by the label of their group."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misolda SelectMenu to'rtta choice ko'rsatadi. Ulardan biri "
"variantlar tepasida ko'rsatiladi, chunki u hech qanday group bilan "
"bog'lanmagan, qolganlari esa o'z group'ining label'i bilan ajratilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:996
msgid ""
"You can also customize the appearance of the toggler and set a custom "
"template for the choices, using the appropriate component `slot`'s."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek, mos component `slot`'laridan foydalanib, toggler ko'rinishini "
"moslashtirishingiz va choice'lar uchun maxsus template o'rnatishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:0
msgid "Example of SelectMenu usage and customization"
msgstr "SelectMenu'dan foydalanish va uni moslashtirish misoli"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1016
msgid ""
"When SelectMenu is used with multiple selection, the `value` props must be "
"an `Array` containing the values of the selected choices."
msgstr ""
"SelectMenu bir nechta tanlov bilan ishlatilganda, `value` props tanlangan "
"choice'lar qiymatlarini o'z ichiga olgan `Array` bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:0
msgid "Example of SelectMenu used with multiple selection"
msgstr "Bir nechta tanlov bilan ishlatilgan SelectMenu misoli"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1023
msgid ""
"For more advanced use cases, you can customize the bottom area of the "
"dropdown, using the `bottomArea` slot. Here, we choose to display a button "
"with the corresponding value set in the search input."
msgstr ""
"Yanada murakkab holatlar uchun `bottomArea` slot'idan foydalanib "
"dropdown'ning pastki sohasini moslashtirishingiz mumkin. Bu yerda biz "
"qidiruv input'iga kiritilgan qiymatga mos tugmani ko'rsatishni tanladik."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:0
msgid "Example of SelectMenu's bottom area customization"
msgstr "SelectMenu'ning pastki sohasini moslashtirish misoli"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1049
msgid "TagsList"
msgstr "TagsList"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1054
msgid "`@web/core/tags_list/tags_list`"
msgstr "`@web/core/tags_list/tags_list`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1059
msgid ""
"This component can display a list of tags in rounded pills. Those tags can "
"either simply list a few values, or can be editable, allowing the removal of "
"items. It can be possible to limit the number of displayed items using the "
"`itemsVisible` props. If the list is longer than this limit, the number of "
"additional items is shown in a circle next to the last tag."
msgstr ""
"Bu component tag'lar ro'yxatini yumaloq pill shaklida ko'rsatishi mumkin. "
"Bunday tag'lar shunchaki bir necha qiymatni sanab o'tishi yoki "
"tahrirlanuvchi bo'lib, elementlarni olib tashlashga imkon berishi mumkin. "
"Ko'rsatiladigan elementlar sonini `itemsVisible` props orqali cheklash "
"mumkin. Agar ro'yxat bu chegaradan uzun bo'lsa, qo'shimcha elementlar soni "
"oxirgi tag yonidagi doirada ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1073
msgid "`displayBadge`"
msgstr "`displayBadge`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1075
msgid "optional. Whether the tag is displayed as a badge."
msgstr "majburiy emas. tag badge sifatida ko'rsatiladimi yoki yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1076
msgid "`displayText`"
msgstr "`displayText`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1078
msgid "optional. Whether the tag is displayed with a text or not."
msgstr "majburiy emas. tag matn bilan ko'rsatiladimi yoki yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1079
msgid "`itemsVisible`"
msgstr "`itemsVisible`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1081
msgid "optional. Limit of visible tags in the list."
msgstr "majburiy emas. Ro'yxatda ko'rinadigan tag'lar chegarasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1082
msgid "`tags`"
msgstr "`tags`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1084
msgid "list of `tag`'s elements given to the component."
msgstr "component'ga berilgan `tag` elementlari ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1086
msgid "The shape of a `tag` is the following:"
msgstr "`tag` tuzilishi quyidagicha:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1088
msgid "`colorIndex` is an optional color id."
msgstr "`colorIndex` — majburiy bo'lmagan rang id'si."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1089
msgid "`icon` is an optional icon displayed just before the displayed text."
msgstr ""
"`icon` — ko'rsatiladigan matndan oldin joylashadigan, majburiy bo'lmagan "
"icon."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1090
msgid "`id` is a unique identifier for the tag."
msgstr "`id` — tag uchun unikal identifikator."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1091
msgid ""
"`img` is an optional image displayed in a circle, just before the displayed "
"text."
msgstr ""
"`img` — ko'rsatiladigan matndan oldin doira ichida ko'rsatiladigan, majburiy "
"bo'lmagan rasm."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1092
msgid ""
"`onClick` is an optional callback that can be given to the element. This "
"allows the parent element to handle any functionality depending on the tag "
"clicked."
msgstr ""
"`onClick` — elementga berilishi mumkin bo'lgan, majburiy bo'lmagan callback. "
"Bu parent element'ga qaysi tag bosilganiga qarab kerakli funksionallikni "
"bajarish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1093
msgid ""
"`onDelete` is an optional callback that can be given to the element. This "
"makes the removal of the item from the list of tags possible, and must be "
"handled by the parent element."
msgstr ""
"`onDelete` — elementga berilishi mumkin bo'lgan, majburiy bo'lmagan "
"callback. Bu element'ni tag'lar ro'yxatidan olib tashlash imkonini beradi va "
"uni parent element bajarishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1094
msgid "`text` is the displayed `string` associated with the tag."
msgstr "`text` — tag bilan bog'liq ko'rsatiladigan `string`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1098
msgid ""
"In the next example, a TagsList component is used to display multiple tags. "
"It's at the developer to handle from the parent what would happen when the "
"tag is pressed, or when the delete button is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi misolda bir nechta tag'ni ko'rsatish uchun TagsList component'i "
"ishlatiladi. Tag bosilganda yoki o'chirish tugmasi bosilganda nima sodir "
"bo'lishini parent tomonidan boshqarish dasturchining vazifasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:1129
msgid ""
"Depending the attributes given to each tag, their appearance and behavior "
"will differ."
msgstr ""
"Har bir tag'ga berilgan attribute'larga qarab, ularning ko'rinishi va xatti-"
"harakati farq qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/owl_components.rst:0
msgid "Examples of TagsList using different props and attributes"
msgstr "Turli props va attribute'lardan foydalanadigan TagsList misollari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:3
msgid "Patching code"
msgstr "Kodni patch qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:5
msgid ""
"Sometimes, we need to customize the way the UI works.  Many common needs are "
"covered by some supported API. For example, all registries are good "
"extension points: the field registry allows adding/removing specialized "
"field components, or the main component registry allows adding components "
"that should be displayed all the time."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zan UI ishlash usulini moslashtirish kerak bo'ladi.  Ko'p uchraydigan "
"ehtiyojlar qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan API'lar bilan qoplangan. Masalan, barcha "
"registry'lar yaxshi kengaytirish nuqtalari hisoblanadi: field registry "
"maxsus field component'larini qo'shish/olib tashlash imkonini beradi, asosiy "
"component registry esa doimo ko'rsatilishi kerak bo'lgan component'larni "
"qo'shishga ruxsat beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:11
msgid ""
"However, there are situations for which it is not sufficient. In those "
"cases, we may need to modify an object or a class in place. To achieve that, "
"Odoo provides the utility function `patch`. It is mostly useful to override/"
"update the behavior of some other component/piece of code that one does not "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Biroq, bu yetarli bo'lmagan holatlar ham bor. Bunday hollarda object yoki "
"class'ni joyida o'zgartirish kerak bo'lishi mumkin. Buning uchun Odoo "
"`patch` yordamchi funksiyasini taqdim etadi. U asosan siz boshqarmaydigan "
"boshqa component yoki kod bo'lagining xatti-harakatini override qilish/"
"yangilash uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:19
msgid "The patch function is located in `@web/core/utils/patch`:"
msgstr "patch funksiyasi `@web/core/utils/patch` ichida joylashgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:23
msgid "the object that should be patched"
msgstr "patch qilinishi kerak bo'lgan object"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:24
msgid "an object mapping each key to an extension"
msgstr "har bir key'ni extension'ga moslashtiruvchi object"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:25
msgid "a function to remove the patch"
msgstr "patch'ni olib tashlash uchun funksiya"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:27
msgid ""
"The `patch` function modifies in place the `objToPatch` object (or class) "
"and applies all key/value described in the `extension` object.  An unpatch "
"function is returned, so it can be used to remove the patch later if "
"necessary."
msgstr ""
"`patch` funksiyasi `objToPatch` object'ini (yoki class'ini) joyida "
"o'zgartiradi va `extension` object'ida tavsiflangan barcha key/value'larni "
"qo'llaydi.  Natijada unpatch funksiyasi qaytariladi, shuning uchun keyinroq "
"zarur bo'lsa patch'ni olib tashlash uchun undan foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:31
msgid ""
"Most patch operations provide access to the parent value by using the native "
"`super` keyword (see below in the examples)."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pchilik patch operatsiyalari native `super` kalit so'zi orqali parent "
"qiymatga kirish imkonini beradi (pastdagi misollarga qaralsin)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:35
msgid "Patching a simple object"
msgstr "Oddiy object'ni patch qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:37
msgid "Here is a simple example of how an object can be patched:"
msgstr "Object'ni qanday patch qilish mumkinligining oddiy misoli:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/patching_code.rst:57
msgid ""
"When patching functions, we usually want to be able to access the ``parent`` "
"function.  To do so, we can simply use the native ``super`` keyword:"
msgstr ""
"Function'larni patch qilganda, biz odatda ``parent`` function'ga murojaat "
"qilish imkoniyatini xohlaymiz. Buning uchun oddiygina native ``super`` kalit "
