"mavjud bo'ladi::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:323
msgid "being called thus::"
msgstr "quyidagicha chaqirilganda::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:339
msgid "Advanced Output"
msgstr "Kengaytirilgan chiqish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:341
msgid ""
"By default, ``out`` should HTML-escape content which needs to be escaped, "
"protecting the system against XSS_"
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha ``out`` escape qilinishi kerak bo'lgan kontentni HTML-escape "
"qiladi va tizimni XSS_ dan himoya qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:344
msgid ""
"Content which does *not* need to be escaped will instead be injected as-is "
"in the document, and may become part of the document's actual markup."
msgstr ""
"Escape qilinishi *shart bo'lmagan* kontent esa hujjatga aynan o'zi holida "
"joylashtiriladi va hujjatning haqiqiy markup'ining qismiga aylanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:347
msgid ""
"The only cross-platform \"safe\" content is the output of :ref:`t-call "
"<reference/qweb/call>` or a :ref:`t-set <reference/qweb/set>` used with a "
"\"body\" (as opposed to ``t-value`` or ``t-valuef``)."
msgstr ""
"Platformalar bo'ylab yagona \"xavfsiz\" kontent — bu :ref:`t-call <reference/"
"qweb/call>` natijasi yoki \"body\" bilan ishlatilgan :ref:`t-set <reference/"
"qweb/set>` (``t-value`` yoki ``t-valuef`` dan farqli ravishda)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:354
msgid ""
"Usually you should not have to care too much: APIs for which it makes sense "
"should generate \"safe\" content automatically, and things should work "
"transparently."
msgstr ""
"Odatda bu haqda ko'p o'ylashingiz shart emas: buni talab qiladigan API'lar "
"\"xavfsiz\" kontentni avtomatik hosil qiladi va hammasi shaffof ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:358
msgid ""
"For the cases where things need to be clearer though the following APIs "
"output safe content which will by default not be (re-)escaped when injected "
"into templates:"
msgstr ""
"Aniqlik zarur bo'lgan holatlar uchun quyidagi API'lar xavfsiz kontent "
"qaytaradi va u template'larga joylashtirilganda sukut bo'yicha (qayta) "
"escape qilinmaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:362
msgid ":class:`HTML fields <odoo.fields.Html>`."
msgstr ":class:`HTML fields <odoo.fields.Html>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:363
msgid ""
":func:`~odoo.tools.misc.html_escape` and :func:`markupsafe.escape` (they are "
"aliases, and have no risk of double-escaping)."
msgstr ""
":func:`~odoo.tools.misc.html_escape` va :func:`markupsafe.escape` (ular "
"alias'lar va ikki marta escape qilish xavfi yo'q)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:365
msgid ":func:`~odoo.tools.mail.html_sanitize`."
msgstr ":func:`~odoo.tools.mail.html_sanitize`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:366
msgid ":class:`markupsafe.Markup`."
msgstr ":class:`markupsafe.Markup`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:368
msgid ""
":class:`markupsafe.Markup` is an unsafe API, it's an *assertion* that you "
"want the content to be markup-safe but necessarily can not check that, it "
"should be used with care."
msgstr ""
":class:`markupsafe.Markup` — xavfsiz bo'lmagan API; u kontent markup uchun "
"xavfsiz bo'lishini xohlayotganingizni bildiruvchi *assertion*, biroq buni "
"tekshirishning imkoni yo'q, shu sababli ehtiyotkorlik bilan ishlatilishi "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:371
msgid ""
":func:`~odoo.tools.pycompat.to_text` does not mark the content as safe, but "
"will not strip that information from safe content."
msgstr ""
":func:`~odoo.tools.pycompat.to_text` kontentni xavfsiz deb belgilamaydi, "
"lekin xavfsiz kontentdan bu ma'lumotni olib tashlamaydi ham."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:375
msgid "forcing double-escaping"
msgstr "ikki marta escape qilishga majburlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:377
msgid ""
"If content is marked as safe but for some reason needs to be escaped anyway "
"(e.g. printing the markup of an HTML fields), it can just be converted back "
"to a normal string to \"strip\" the safety flag e.g. `str(content)` in "
"Python and `String(content)` in Javascript."
msgstr ""
"Agar kontent xavfsiz deb belgilangan bo'lsa-da, biror sababga ko'ra baribir "
"escape qilinishi kerak bo'lsa (masalan, HTML field'ning markup'ini "
"chiqarishda), xavfsizlik flag'ini \"olib tashlash\" uchun uni oddiy "
"string'ga qaytarish kifoya, masalan Python'da `str(content)` va "
"Javascript'da `String(content)`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:384
msgid ""
"Because :class:`~markupsafe.Markup` is a much richer type "
"than :js:class:`Markup`, some operations will strip the safety information "
"from a :js:class:`Markup` but not a :class:`~markupsafe.Markup` e.g. string "
"concatenation (``'' + content``) in Python will result in "
"a :class:`~markupsafe.Markup` with the other operand having been properly "
"escaped, while in Javascript will yield a :js:class:`String` where the other "
"operand was *not* escaped before the concatenation."
msgstr ""
":class:`~markupsafe.Markup` :js:class:`Markup` ga qaraganda ancha boy tur "
"bo'lgani uchun, ba'zi amallar :js:class:`Markup` dan xavfsizlik ma'lumotini "
"olib tashlaydi, :class:`~markupsafe.Markup` dan esa olib tashlamaydi; "
"masalan, Python'da string'larni birlashtirish (``'' + content``) "
"natijasida :class:`~markupsafe.Markup` olinadi va ikkinchi operand to'g'ri "
"escape qilingan bo'ladi, Javascript'da esa :js:class:`String` olinadi va "
"ikkinchi operand birlashtirishdan oldin escape *qilinmagan* bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:393
msgid "Deprecated output directives"
msgstr "Eskirgan (deprecated) chiqish direktivalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:399
msgid "``esc``"
msgstr "``esc``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:398
msgid ""
"An alias for ``out``, would originally HTML-escape its input. Not yet "
"formally deprecated as the only difference between ``out`` and ``esc`` is "
"that the latter is a bit unclear / incorrect."
msgstr ""
"``out`` uchun alias; asli o'z kirishini HTML-escape qilar edi. Hali rasman "
"eskirgan deb e'lon qilinmagan, chunki ``out`` va ``esc`` o'rtasidagi yagona "
"farq — ikkinchisi bir oz tushunarsiz / noto'g'ri nomlangani."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:411
msgid "``raw``"
msgstr "``raw``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:402
msgid ""
"A version of ``out`` which *never* escapes its content. Content is emitted "
"as-is, whether it's safe or not."
msgstr ""
"``out`` ning kontentini *hech qachon* escape qilmaydigan varianti. Kontent "
"xavfsiz bo'ladimi yoki yo'qmi, aynan o'zi holida chiqariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:407
msgid "Use ``out`` with a :class:`markupsafe.Markup` value instead."
msgstr ""
"Buning o'rniga ``out`` ni :class:`markupsafe.Markup` qiymati bilan ishlating."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:409
msgid ""
"``t-raw`` was deprecated because as the code *producting* the content "
"evolves it can be hard to track that it's going to be used for markup, "
"leading to more complicated reviews and more dangerous lapses."
msgstr ""
"``t-raw`` eskirgan deb belgilandi, chunki kontentni *hosil qiluvchi* kod "
"rivojlanib borgani sari uning markup uchun ishlatilishini kuzatib borish "
"qiyinlashadi, bu esa review'larni murakkablashtiradi va xatolarni xavfliroq "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:417
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:532
msgid "Exclusive directives"
msgstr "Eksklyuziv direktivalar"

