"tahrirlash tizimiga integratsiya qilingan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:432
msgid ""
"``t-options`` can be used to customize fields, the most common option is "
"``widget``, other options are field- or widget-dependent."
msgstr ""
"``t-options`` field'larni sozlash uchun ishlatiladi; eng ko'p uchraydigan "
"option — ``widget``, qolgan option'lar field yoki widget'ga bog'liq."

