#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:535
msgid "Defining templates"
msgstr "Template'larni aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:537
msgid ""
"The ``t-name`` directive can only be placed at the top-level of a template "
"file (direct children to the document root)::"
msgstr ""
"``t-name`` directive faqat template faylning eng yuqori darajasida "
"joylashtirilishi mumkin (document root'ning bevosita bolalari)::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:546
msgid ""
"It takes no other parameter, but can be used with a ``<t>`` element or any "
"other. With a ``<t>`` element, the ``<t>`` should have a single child."
msgstr ""
"U boshqa parametr olmaydi, lekin ``<t>`` element yoki boshqa har qanday "
"element bilan ishlatilishi mumkin. ``<t>`` element bilan ishlatilganda, "
"``<t>`` yagona bolaga ega bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:549
msgid ""
"The template name is an arbitrary string, although when multiple templates "
"are related (e.g. called sub-templates) it is customary to use dot-separated "
"names to indicate hierarchical relationships."
msgstr ""
"Template nomi ixtiyoriy satr bo'ladi, biroq bir nechta template'lar bir-biri "
"bilan bog'liq bo'lganda (masalan, sub-template'lar chaqirilganda) ierarxik "
"munosabatlarni ko'rsatish uchun nuqta bilan ajratilgan nomlardan foydalanish "
"odat tusiga kirgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:556
msgid "Template inheritance"
msgstr "Template inheritance"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:558
msgid "Template inheritance is used to either:"
msgstr "Template inheritance quyidagilardan biri uchun ishlatiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:559
msgid "Alter existing templates in-place, e.g. to add information to templates"
msgstr ""
"Mavjud template'larni joyida o'zgartirish, masalan, template'larga ma'lumot "
"qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:561
msgid "created by other modules."
msgstr "boshqa modul'lar tomonidan yaratilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:561
msgid "Create a new template from a given parent template"
msgstr "Berilgan parent template'dan yangi template yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:567
msgid "Template inheritance is performed via the use of two directives:"
msgstr "Template inheritance ikkita directive yordamida amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:564
msgid "``t-inherit`` which is the name of the template to inherit from,"
msgstr "``t-inherit`` — inherit qilinadigan template nomi,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:565
msgid ""
"``t-inherit-mode`` which is the behaviour of the inheritance: it can either "
"be set to ``primary`` to create a new child template from the parented one "
"or to ``extension`` to alter the parent template in place."
msgstr ""
"``t-inherit-mode`` — inheritance xatti-harakati: parent template'dan yangi "
"child template yaratish uchun ``primary``, yoki parent template'ni joyida "
"o'zgartirish uchun ``extension`` qilib belgilanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:569
msgid ""
"An optional ``t-name`` directive can also be specified. It will be the name "
"of the newly created template if used in primary mode, else it will be added "
"as a comment on the transformed template to help retrace inheritances."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy ``t-name`` directive ham ko'rsatilishi mumkin. Primary rejimda "
"ishlatilganda u yangi yaratilgan template nomi bo'ladi, aks holda "
"inheritance'larni kuzatishga yordam berish uchun o'zgartirilgan template'ga "
"comment sifatida qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:573
msgid ""
"For the inheritance itself, the changes are done using xpaths directives. "
"See the XPATH_ documentation for the complete set of available instructions."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance'ning o'zida o'zgarishlar xpath directive'lari yordamida "
"bajariladi. Mavjud ko'rsatmalarning to'liq to'plamini XPATH_ hujjatida "
"ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:576
msgid "Primary inheritance (child template)::"
msgstr "Primary inheritance (child template)::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:584
msgid "Extension inheritance (in-place transformation)::"
msgstr "Extension inheritance (joyida o'zgartirish)::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:593
msgid "Old inheritance mechanism (deprecated)"
msgstr "Eski inheritance mexanizmi (deprecated)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:595
msgid ""
"Template inheritance is performed via the ``t-extend`` directive which takes "
"the name of the template to alter as parameter."
msgstr ""
"Template inheritance ``t-extend`` directive orqali amalga oshiriladi — u "
"o'zgartirilishi kerak bo'lgan template nomini parametr sifatida oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:598
msgid ""
"The directive ``t-extend`` will act as a primary inheritance when combined "
"with ``t-name`` and as an extension one when used alone."
msgstr ""
"``t-extend`` directive ``t-name`` bilan birga ishlatilganda primary "
"inheritance sifatida, yolg'iz ishlatilganda esa extension sifatida ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:601
msgid ""
"In both cases the alteration is then performed with any number of ``t-"
"jquery`` sub-directives::"
msgstr ""
"Ikkala holatda ham o'zgartirish istalgan sondagi ``t-jquery`` sub-"
"directive'lar bilan bajariladi::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:610
msgid ""
"The ``t-jquery`` directives takes a `CSS selector`_. This selector is used "
"on the extended template to select *context nodes* to which the specified "
"``t-operation`` is applied:"
msgstr ""
"``t-jquery`` directive'lar `CSS selector`_ oladi. Bu selector extend "
"qilingan template'da *context node'lar* ni tanlash uchun ishlatiladi va "
"ko'rsatilgan ``t-operation`` ularga qo'llaniladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:617
msgid "``append``"
msgstr "``append``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:617
msgid ""
"the node's body is appended at the end of the context node (after the "
"context node's last child)"
msgstr ""
"node'ning tanasi context node'ning oxiriga qo'shiladi (context node'ning "
"oxirgi bolasidan keyin)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:620
msgid "``prepend``"
msgstr "``prepend``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:620
msgid ""
"the node's body is prepended to the context node (inserted before the "
