#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:675
msgid "``t-js``"
msgstr "``t-js``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:668
msgid ""
"the node's body is javascript code executed during template rendering. Takes "
