"will be available in the ``t-js``'s body::"
msgstr ""
"node'ning tanasi template rendering vaqtida bajariladigan javascript kod. U "
"``context`` parametrini oladi — bu ``t-js`` tanasida rendering context "
"mavjud bo'ladigan nom::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:682
msgid ""
"(core is the ``web.core`` module) An instance of :js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` "
"with all module-defined template files loaded, and references to standard "
"helper objects ``_`` (underscore), ``_t`` (translation function) and JSON_."
msgstr ""
"(core — bu ``web.core`` modul) :js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` instansi, unda "
"modul'larda aniqlangan barcha template fayllar yuklangan bo'ladi, shuningdek "
"standart helper obyektlarga — ``_`` (underscore), ``_t`` (tarjima "
"funksiyasi) va JSON_ ga havolalar mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:686
msgid ""
":js:func:`core.qweb.render <QWeb2.Engine.render>` can be used to easily "
"render basic module templates"
msgstr ""
":js:func:`core.qweb.render <QWeb2.Engine.render>` asosiy modul "
"template'larini oson render qilish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:696
msgid ""
"The QWeb \"renderer\", handles most of QWeb's logic (loading, parsing, "
"compiling and rendering templates)."
msgstr ""
"QWeb \"renderer\" QWeb logikasining ko'p qismini bajaradi (template'larni "
"yuklash, parsing, compiling va rendering)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:699
msgid ""
"Odoo Web instantiates one for the user in the core module, and exports it to "
"``core.qweb``. It also loads all the template files of the various modules "
"into that QWeb instance."
msgstr ""
"Odoo Web core modul'da foydalanuvchi uchun bittasini yaratadi va uni "
"``core.qweb`` ga eksport qiladi. Shuningdek u turli modul'larning barcha "
"template fayllarini o'sha QWeb instansiga yuklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:703
msgid "A :js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` also serves as a \"template namespace\"."
msgstr ""
":js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` shuningdek \"template namespace\" vazifasini ham "
"bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:707
msgid ""
"Renders a previously loaded template to a String, using ``context`` (if "
"provided) to find the variables accessed during template rendering (e.g. "
"strings to display)."
msgstr ""
"Oldin yuklangan template'ni String'ga render qiladi va template rendering "
"vaqtida murojaat qilinadigan o'zgaruvchilarni (masalan, ko'rsatiladigan "
"satrlarni) topish uchun ``context`` dan foydalanadi (agar berilgan bo'lsa)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:711
msgid "the name of the template to render"
msgstr "render qilinadigan template nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:712
msgid "the basic namespace to use for template rendering"
msgstr "template rendering uchun ishlatiladigan asosiy namespace"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:716
msgid ""
"The engine exposes an other method which may be useful in some cases (e.g. "
"if you need a separate template namespace with, in Odoo Web, Kanban views "
"get their own :js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` instance so their templates don't "
"collide with more general \"module\" templates):"
msgstr ""
"Engine ba'zi hollarda foydali bo'lishi mumkin bo'lgan yana bir method'ni "
"taqdim etadi (masalan, sizga alohida template namespace kerak bo'lganda: "
"Odoo Web'da Kanban view'lar o'zlarining :js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` instansini "
"oladi, shunda ularning template'lari umumiyroq \"module\" template'lari "
"bilan to'qnashmaydi):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:724
msgid ""
"Loads a template file (a collection of templates) in the QWeb instance. The "
"templates can be specified as:"
msgstr ""
"QWeb instansiga template fayl (template'lar to'plami) yuklaydi. Template'lar "
"quyidagi shakllarda ko'rsatilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:729
msgid "An XML string"
msgstr "XML satr"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:728
msgid "QWeb will attempt to parse it to an XML document then load it."
msgstr ""
"QWeb uni XML document'ga parse qilishga harakat qiladi, so'ngra yuklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:733
msgid "A URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:732
msgid ""
"QWeb will attempt to download the URL content, then load the resulting XML "
"string."
msgstr ""
"QWeb URL kontentini yuklab olishga harakat qiladi, so'ngra natijada olingan "
"XML satrini yuklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:738
msgid "A ``Document`` or ``Node``"
msgstr "``Document`` yoki ``Node``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:736
msgid ""
"QWeb will traverse the first level of the document (the child nodes of the "
"provided root) and load any named template or template override."
msgstr ""
"QWeb document'ning birinchi darajasini (berilgan root'ning child "
"node'larini) aylanib chiqadi va nomlangan har qanday template yoki template "
"override'ni yuklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:742
msgid ""
"A :js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` also exposes various attributes for behavior "
"customization:"
msgstr ""
":js:class:`QWeb2.Engine` shuningdek xatti-harakatni moslashtirish uchun "
"turli attribute'larni taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:747
msgid ""
"Prefix used to recognize directives during parsing. A string. By default, "
"``t``."
msgstr ""
"Parsing vaqtida directive'larni aniqlash uchun ishlatiladigan prefiks. "
"String. Standart qiymati ``t``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:752
msgid ""
"Boolean flag putting the engine in \"debug mode\". Normally, QWeb intercepts "
"any error raised during template execution. In debug mode, it leaves all "
"exceptions go through without intercepting them."
msgstr ""
"Engine'ni \"debug mode\"ga o'tkazuvchi boolean flag. Odatda QWeb template "
"bajarilishi vaqtida yuzaga kelgan har qanday xatoni ushlab qoladi. Debug "
"mode'da esa barcha exception'larni ushlamasdan o'tkazib yuboradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:759
msgid ""
"The jQuery instance used during template inheritance processing. Defaults to "
"``window.jQuery``."
msgstr ""
"Template inheritance ishlovi vaqtida ishlatiladigan jQuery instance. "
"Standart qiymati ``window.jQuery``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:764
msgid ""
"A ``Function``. If present, called before compiling each DOM node to "
"template code. In Odoo Web, this is used to automatically translate text "
"content and some attributes in templates. Defaults to ``null``."
msgstr ""
"``Function``. Agar mavjud bo'lsa, har bir DOM node template kodiga "
"kompilyatsiya qilinishidan oldin chaqiriladi. Odoo Web'da bu "
"template'lardagi matn kontenti va ba'zi attribute'larni avtomatik tarjima "
"qilish uchun ishlatiladi. Standart qiymati ``null``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:769
msgid ""
"it is similar in that to Genshi_, although it does not use (and has no "
"support for) `XML namespaces`_"
msgstr ""
"bu jihatdan u Genshi_ ga o'xshaydi, garchi `XML namespaces`_ dan "
"foydalanmasa (va ularni qo'llab-quvvatlamasa) ham"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/qweb.rst:772
msgid ""
"although it uses a few others, either for historical reasons or because they "
"remain better fits for the use case. Odoo 9.0 still depends on Jinja_ and "
"Mako_."
msgstr ""
"garchi u tarixiy sabablarga ko'ra yoki tegishli holat uchun ko'proq mos "
"kelgani uchun boshqa bir nechtasini ishlatadi. Odoo 9.0 hanuz Jinja_ va "
"Mako_ ga bog'liq."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:7
msgid ""
"Registries are (ordered) key/value maps. They are the main web client "
"extension points: many features provided by the Odoo javascript framework "
"simply look up into a registry whenever it needs a definition for some "
"object (such as fields, views, client actions or services). Customizing the "
"web client is then simply done by adding specific values in the correct "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"Registry'lar — (tartiblangan) kalit/qiymat map'lari. Ular web client'ning "
"asosiy kengaytirish nuqtalari: Odoo javascript framework taqdim etadigan "
"ko'plab imkoniyatlar biror obyekt (masalan field'lar, view'lar, client "
"action'lar yoki service'lar) uchun ta'rif kerak bo'lganda shunchaki "
"registry'ga qaraydi. Shunday qilib, web client'ni moslashtirish kerakli "
"registry'ga muayyan qiymatlarni qo'shish bilan amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:23
msgid ""
"A useful feature of registries is that they maintain a set of sub "
"registries, obtained by the `category` method. If the sub registry does not "
"exist yet, it is created on the fly. All registries used by the web client "
"are obtained in such a way from one root registry, exported in `@web/core/"
"registry`."
msgstr ""
"Registry'larning foydali xususiyati shundaki, ular `category` method'i "
"orqali olinadigan sub registry'lar to'plamini saqlaydi. Agar sub registry "
"hali mavjud bo'lmasa, u shu zahoti yaratiladi. Web client ishlatadigan "
"barcha registry'lar `@web/core/registry` da eksport qilingan yagona root "
"registry'dan aynan shu yo'l bilan olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:37
msgid "Registry API"
msgstr "Registry API"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:41
msgid ""
"Creates a new registry. Note that a registry is an event bus, so one can "
"listen to the `UPDATE` event if necessary. Registries are ordered: "
"the :js:meth:`getAll <Registry.getAll>` method returns a list of values "
"ordered according to their sequence number."
msgstr ""
"Yangi registry yaratadi. E'tibor bering, registry — bu event bus, shuning "
"uchun kerak bo'lsa `UPDATE` event'ini tinglash mumkin. Registry'lar "
"tartiblangan: :js:meth:`getAll <Registry.getAll>` method'i qiymatlarni "
"sequence raqamiga muvofiq tartiblangan ro'yxat sifatida qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:48
msgid "key for the new entry"
msgstr "yangi yozuv uchun kalit"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:49
msgid "value for the new entry"
msgstr "yangi yozuv uchun qiymat"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:50
msgid "options"
msgstr "options"

