msgid "do not throw if key already exists"
msgstr "agar kalit allaqachon mavjud bo'lsa, xato chiqarmaslik"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:52
msgid "sequence number (useful to order entries)"
msgstr "sequence raqami (yozuvlarni tartiblash uchun foydali)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:53
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:95
msgid "Registry"
msgstr "Registry"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:55
msgid ""
"Inserts a value at a specific key. If the key is already used, this method "
"throws an error (unless the option `force` is set to true). The option "
"`sequence` is useful to insert the value at a specific position. This method "
"also triggers an `UPDATE` event."
msgstr ""
"Qiymatni muayyan kalitga joylashtiradi. Agar kalit allaqachon ishlatilgan "
"bo'lsa, bu method xato chiqaradi (agar `force` opsiyasi true qilib "
"belgilanmagan bo'lsa). `sequence` opsiyasi qiymatni muayyan pozitsiyaga "
"joylashtirish uchun foydali. Bu method shuningdek `UPDATE` event'ini ishga "
"tushiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:60
msgid "Returns the same registry, so `add` method calls can be chained."
msgstr ""
"O'sha registry'ning o'zini qaytaradi, shuning uchun `add` method "
"chaqiruvlarini zanjirlab ishlatish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:64
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:73
msgid "key for the entry"
msgstr "yozuv uchun kalit"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:65
msgid "return value if no entry for key exists"
msgstr "kalit uchun yozuv mavjud bo'lmasa qaytariladigan qiymat"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:67
msgid ""
"Returns the value corresponding to the `key` argument. If the registry does "
"not contain that key, this method returns `defaultValue` if given, or throws "
"an error otherwise."
msgstr ""
"`key` argumentiga mos keladigan qiymatni qaytaradi. Agar registry o'sha "
"kalitni saqlamasa, bu method berilgan bo'lsa `defaultValue` ni qaytaradi, "
"aks holda xato chiqaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:76
msgid "Returns `true` if `key` is present in the registry"
msgstr "Agar `key` registry'da mavjud bo'lsa `true` qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:82
msgid ""
"Returns the list of all elements in the registry. It is ordered according to "
"the sequence numbers."
msgstr ""
"Registry'dagi barcha elementlar ro'yxatini qaytaradi. Ro'yxat sequence "
"raqamlariga muvofiq tartiblangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:87
msgid "the key for the entry that should be removed"
msgstr "o'chirilishi kerak bo'lgan yozuv uchun kalit"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:89
msgid ""
"Removes a key/value pair from the registry. This operation triggers an "
"`UPDATE` event."
msgstr ""
"Registry'dan kalit/qiymat juftligini o'chiradi. Bu amal `UPDATE` event'ini "
"ishga tushiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:94
msgid "the name for the sub category"
msgstr "sub category nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:97
msgid ""
"Returns the sub registry associated with the `subcategory`. If it does not "
"exist yet, the sub registry is created on the fly."
msgstr ""
"`subcategory` bilan bog'langan sub registry'ni qaytaradi. Agar u hali mavjud "
"bo'lmasa, sub registry shu zahoti yaratiladi."

