#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:208
msgid ""
"The service registry (category: `services`) contains all :ref:`services "
"<frontend/services>` that should be activated by the Odoo framework."
msgstr ""
"Service registry (kategoriya: `services`) Odoo framework tomonidan "
"faollashtirilishi kerak bo'lgan barcha :ref:`service'lar <frontend/"
"services>` ni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:228
msgid "Systray registry"
msgstr "Systray registry"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:230
msgid ""
"The systray is the zone on the right of the navbar that contains various "
"small components, that usually display some sort of information (like the "
"number of unread messages), notifications and/or let the user interact with "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Systray — navbar'ning o'ng tomonidagi zona bo'lib, u odatda qandaydir "
"ma'lumotni (masalan, o'qilmagan xabarlar sonini) ko'rsatadigan, "
"notification'lar chiqaradigan va/yoki foydalanuvchiga ular bilan ishlash "
"imkonini beradigan turli kichik component'larni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:234
msgid ""
"The `systray` registry contains a description of these systray items, as "
"objects with the following three keys:"
msgstr ""
"`systray` registry ushbu systray element'larining ta'rifini quyidagi uchta "
"kalitga ega obyektlar shaklida saqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:237
msgid ""
"`Component`: the component class that represents the item. Its root element "
"should be a `<li>` tag, otherwise it might not be styled properly."
msgstr ""
"`Component`: element'ni ifodalovchi component class. Uning ildiz element'i "
"`<li>` tag bo'lishi kerak, aks holda u to'g'ri stillanmasligi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:239
msgid "`props (optional)`: props that should be given to the component"
msgstr "`props (optional)`: component'ga berilishi kerak bo'lgan props"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:240
msgid ""
"`isDisplayed (optional)`: a function that takes the :ref:`env <frontend/"
"framework/environment>` and returns a boolean. If true, the systray item is "
"displayed. Otherwise it is removed."
msgstr ""
"`isDisplayed (optional)`: :ref:`env <frontend/framework/environment>` ni "
"qabul qilib, boolean qaytaradigan funksiya. Agar true bo'lsa, systray "
"element'i ko'rsatiladi. Aks holda u olib tashlanadi."

