msgid ""
"The sequence number defaults to 50. If given, this number will be used to "
"order the items. The lowest sequence is on the right and the highest "
"sequence is on the left in the systray menu."
msgstr ""
"Sequence raqami sukut bo'yicha 50 ga teng. Agar berilsa, bu raqam "
"element'larni tartiblash uchun ishlatiladi. Systray menyusida eng kichik "
"sequence o'ngda, eng katta sequence esa chapda joylashadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:275
msgid "Usermenu registry"
msgstr "Usermenu registry"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:277
msgid ""
"The user menu registry (category: `user_menuitems`) contains all menu items "
"that are shown when opening the user menu (the navbar element with the user "
"name, on the top right)."
msgstr ""
"User menu registry (kategoriya: `user_menuitems`) foydalanuvchi menyusi "
"ochilganda ko'rsatiladigan barcha menyu element'larini o'z ichiga oladi "
"(yuqori o'ngdagi, foydalanuvchi nomi yozilgan navbar element'i)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:281
msgid ""
"User menu items are defined by a function taking the :ref:`env <frontend/"
"framework/environment>` and returning a plain object, containing the "
"following information:"
msgstr ""
"User menu element'lari :ref:`env <frontend/framework/environment>` ni qabul "
"qilib, quyidagi ma'lumotlarni o'z ichiga olgan oddiy obyekt qaytaradigan "
"funksiya orqali aniqlanadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:284
msgid "`description` : the menu item text,"
msgstr "`description` : menyu element'ining matni,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:285
msgid ""
"`href` : (optional) if given (and truthy), the item text is put in a `a` tag "
"with given attribute href,"
msgstr ""
"`href` : (optional) agar berilsa (va truthy bo'lsa), element matni berilgan "
"href atributiga ega `a` tag ichiga joylanadi,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:286
msgid "`callback` : callback to call when the item is selected,"
msgstr "`callback` : element tanlanganda chaqiriladigan callback,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:287
