"`sequence`: (optional) determines the rank of the item among the other "
"dropwdown items (default: 100)."
msgstr ""
"`sequence`: (optional) element'ning boshqa dropdown element'lari orasidagi "
"o'rnini belgilaydi (sukut bo'yicha: 100)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/registries.rst:290
msgid ""
"The user menu calls all the functions defining items every time it is opened."
msgstr ""
"User menu har ochilganda element'larni aniqlovchi barcha funksiyalarni "
"chaqiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:8
msgid ""
"Services are long lived pieces of code that provide a feature. They may be "
"imported by components (with ``useService``) or by other services. Also, "
"they can declare a set of dependencies. In that sense, services are "
"basically a DI :dfn:`dependency injection` system. For example, the "
"``notification`` service provides a way to display a notification, or the "
"``rpc`` service is the proper way to perform a request to the Odoo server."
msgstr ""
"Service'lar — biror imkoniyatni taqdim etadigan uzoq yashovchi kod "
"bo'laklari. Ular component'lar tomonidan (``useService`` yordamida) yoki "
"boshqa service'lar tomonidan import qilinishi mumkin. Shuningdek, ular "
"dependency'lar to'plamini e'lon qilishi mumkin. Shu ma'noda service'lar "
"aslida DI :dfn:`dependency injection` tizimidir. Masalan, ``notification`` "
"service notification ko'rsatish imkonini beradi, ``rpc`` service esa Odoo "
"server'ga request yuborishning to'g'ri usulidir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:15
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:86
msgid ""
"The following example registers a simple service that displays a "
"notification every 5 seconds:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi misol har 5 sekundda notification ko'rsatadigan oddiy service'ni "
"registratsiya qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:34
msgid ""
"At startup, the web client starts all services present in the `services` "
"registry. Note that the name used in the registry is the name of the service."
msgstr ""
"Ishga tushish paytida web client `services` registry'dagi barcha "
"service'larni ishga tushiradi. E'tibor bering, registry'da ishlatilgan nom "
"service'ning nomi hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:39
msgid ""
"Most code that is not a component should be *packaged* in a service, in "
"particular if it performs some side effect.  This is very useful for testing "
"purposes: tests can choose which services are active, so there are less "
"chance for unwanted side effects interfering with the code being tested."
msgstr ""
"Component bo'lmagan kodning ko'p qismi service ichida *paketlangan* bo'lishi "
"kerak, ayniqsa u qandaydir side effect keltirsa.  Bu testlar uchun juda "
"foydali: testlar qaysi service'lar faol bo'lishini tanlashi mumkin, shu "
"sababli keraksiz side effect'lar sinovdan o'tayotgan kodga xalaqit berish "
"ehtimoli kamayadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:45
msgid "Defining a service"
msgstr "Service'ni aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:47
msgid "A service needs to implement the following interface:"
msgstr "Service quyidagi interface'ni amalga oshirishi kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:51
msgid ""
"Optional list of strings. It is the list of all dependencies (other "
"services) that this service needs"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy satrlar ro'yxati. Bu ushbu service uchun zarur bo'lgan barcha "
"dependency'lar (boshqa service'lar) ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:56
msgid "the application environment"
msgstr "ilova environment'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:57
msgid "all requested dependencies"
msgstr "so'ralgan barcha dependency'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:58
msgid "value of service or Promise<value of service>"
msgstr "service qiymati yoki Promise<service qiymati>"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:60
msgid ""
"This is the main definition for the service. It can return either a value or "
"a promise. In that case, the service loader simply waits for the promise to "
"resolve to a value, which is then the value of the service."
msgstr ""
"Bu service'ning asosiy ta'rifi. U qiymat yoki promise qaytarishi mumkin. "
"Ikkinchi holatda service loader promise qiymatga resolve bo'lishini kutadi "
"va shu qiymat service'ning qiymati bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:64
msgid ""
"Some services do not export any value. They may just do their work without a "
"need to be directly called by other code. In that case, their value will be "
"set to ``null`` in ``env.services``."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi service'lar hech qanday qiymat eksport qilmaydi. Ular boshqa kod "
"tomonidan bevosita chaqirilishiga hojat qoldirmasdan o'z ishini bajaradi. Bu "
"holda ularning qiymati ``env.services`` ichida ``null`` qilib belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:70
msgid "Optional value. If given, it should be `true` or a list of strings."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy qiymat. Agar berilsa, u `true` yoki satrlar ro'yxati bo'lishi "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:72
msgid ""
"Some services need to provide an asynchronous API. For example, the `rpc` "
"service is an asynchronous function, or the `orm` service provides a set of "
"functions to call the Odoo server."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi service'lar asinxron API taqdim etishi kerak. Masalan, `rpc` service "
"asinxron funksiya, `orm` service esa Odoo server'ni chaqirish uchun "
"funksiyalar to'plamini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:76
msgid ""
"In that case, it is possible for components that use a service to be "
"destroyed before the end of an asynchronous function call. Most of the time, "
"the asynchronous function call needs to be ignored. Doing otherwise is "
"potentially very risky, because the underlying component is no longer "
"active. The `async` flag is a way to do just that: it signals to the service "
"creator that all asynchronous calls coming from components should be left "
"pending if the component is destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Bunday holatda service'dan foydalanadigan component'lar asinxron funksiya "
"chaqiruvi tugashidan oldin yo'q qilinishi mumkin. Ko'p hollarda asinxron "
"funksiya chaqiruvini e'tiborsiz qoldirish kerak bo'ladi. Aks holda ish "
"tutish juda xatarli, chunki tegishli component endi faol emas. `async` flag "
"aynan shu ishni bajaradi: u service creator'ga component yo'q qilingan "
"bo'lsa, component'lardan kelgan barcha asinxron chaqiruvlar pending holatda "
"qoldirilishi kerakligini bildiradi."

