"ko'rinmaydi va uning o'rniga oddiy notification ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:259
msgid ""
"If effects are enabled and params.Component is given, params.message is not "
"used."
msgstr ""
"Agar effect'lar yoqilgan bo'lsa va params.Component berilsa, params.message "
"ishlatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:261
msgid ""
"The message is a simple string or a string representing html (prefer using "
"params.Component if you want interactions in the DOM)."
msgstr ""
"Message oddiy string yoki html'ni ifodalovchi string bo'ladi (DOM ichida "
"o'zaro ta'sir kerak bo'lsa, params.Component'dan foydalanish afzal)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:263
msgid "`params.messageIsHtml`"
msgstr "`params.messageIsHtml`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:264
msgid "`boolean?=false`"
msgstr "`boolean?=false`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:265
msgid ""
"Set to true if the message represents html, s.t. it will be correctly "
"inserted into the DOM."
msgstr ""
"Agar message html bo'lsa, uni true qilib belgilang — shunda u DOM'ga to'g'ri "
"joylashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:266
msgid "`params.img_url`"
msgstr "`params.img_url`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:267
msgid "`string?=/web/static/img/smile.svg`"
msgstr "`string?=/web/static/img/smile.svg`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:268
msgid "The url of the image to display inside the rainbow."
msgstr "Rainbow ichida ko'rsatiladigan rasmning url manzili."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:269
msgid "`params.fadeout`"
msgstr "`params.fadeout`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:270
msgid "`(\"slow\"|\"medium\"|\"fast\"|\"no\")?=\"medium\"`"
msgstr "`(\"slow\"|\"medium\"|\"fast\"|\"no\")?=\"medium\"`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:271
msgid "Delay for rainbowman to disappear."
msgstr "Rainbowman yo'qolishidan oldingi kechikish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:273
msgid "`\"fast\"` will make rainbowman dissapear quickly."
msgstr "`\"fast\"` rainbowman'ni tezda yo'qolishiga sabab bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:275
msgid ""
"`\"medium\"` and `\"slow\"` will wait little longer before disappearing (can "
"be used when `params.message` is longer)."
msgstr ""
"`\"medium\"` va `\"slow\"` yo'qolishdan oldin bir oz uzoqroq kutadi "
"(`params.message` uzunroq bo'lganda ishlatish mumkin)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:277
msgid ""
"`\"no\"` will keep rainbowman on screen until user clicks anywhere outside "
"rainbowman."
msgstr ""
"`\"no\"` foydalanuvchi rainbowman tashqarisidagi biror joyni bosmaguncha uni "
"ekranda saqlab turadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:281
msgid "How to add an effect"
msgstr "Effect qanday qo'shiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:285
msgid ""
"The effects are stored in a registry called `effects`. You can add new "
"effects by providing a name and a function."
msgstr ""
"Effect'lar `effects` deb nomlangan registry'da saqlanadi. Nom va function "
"berish orqali yangi effect'lar qo'shishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:293
msgid "The function must follow this API:"
msgstr "Function quyidagi API'ga mos bo'lishi kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:297
msgid "the environment received by the service"
msgstr "service qabul qilgan environment"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:299
msgid "the params received from the add function on the service."
msgstr "service'dagi add function'idan olingan param'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:301
msgid "`({Component, props} | void)` A component and its props or nothing."
msgstr ""
"`({Component, props} | void)` Component va uning props'lari yoki hech narsa."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:303
msgid ""
"This function must create a component and return it. This component is "
"mounted inside the effect component container."
msgstr ""
"Bu function component yaratib, uni qaytarishi kerak. Ushbu component effect "
"component container'i ichida mount qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:307
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:390
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Misol"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:309
msgid "Let's say we want to add an effect that add a sepia look at the page."
msgstr "Aytaylik, sahifaga sepia ko'rinishini beradigan effect qo'shmoqchimiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:340
msgid ""
"And then, call it somewhere you want and you will see the result. Here, it "
"is called in webclient.js to make it visible everywhere for the example."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra uni xohlagan joyingizda chaqirsangiz, natijani ko'rasiz. Bu yerda "
"misol uchun u hamma joyda ko'rinishi maqsadida webclient.js ichida "
"chaqirilgan."

