msgstr "Http service"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:361
msgid "Technical name: `http`"
msgstr "Texnik nomi: `http`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:364
msgid ""
"While most interactions between the client and the server in odoo are `RPCs` "
"(`XMLHTTPRequest`), lower level control on requests may sometimes be "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da client va server o'rtasidagi ko'pchilik aloqalar `RPCs` "
