"darajadagi nazorat kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:367
msgid ""
"This service provides a way to send `get` and `post` `http requests <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Methods>`_."
msgstr ""
"Bu service `get` va `post` `http so'rovlarini <https://developer.mozilla.org/"
"en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Methods>`_ yuborish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:374
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:382
msgid "the url to send the request to"
msgstr "so'rov yuboriladigan url"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:375
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:384
msgid ""
"the response content type. Can be \"text\", \"json\", \"formData\", "
"\"blob\", \"arrayBuffer\"."
msgstr ""
"response kontent turi. \"text\", \"json\", \"formData\", \"blob\", "
"\"arrayBuffer\" bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:376
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:385
msgid ""
"the result of the request with the format defined by the readMethod argument."
msgstr "so'rov natijasi, formati readMethod argumenti bilan aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:378
msgid "Sends a get request."
msgstr "get so'rovini yuboradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:383
msgid "key value data to be set in the form data part of the request"
msgstr "so'rovning form data qismiga o'rnatiladigan kalit-qiymat ma'lumotlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:387
msgid "Sends a post request."
msgstr "post so'rovini yuboradi."

