#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:520
msgid "Router Service"
msgstr "Router service"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:525
msgid "Technical name: `router`"
msgstr "Texnik nomi: `router`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:528
msgid "The `router` service provides three features:"
msgstr "`router` service uchta imkoniyatni taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:530
msgid "information about the current route"
msgstr "joriy route haqida ma'lumot"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:531
msgid "a way for the application to update the url, depending on its state"
msgstr "ilovaga o'z holatiga qarab url'ni yangilash imkoniyati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:532
msgid "listens to every hash change, and notifies the rest of the application"
msgstr ""
"har bir hash o'zgarishini kuzatadi va ilovaning qolgan qismini xabardor "
"qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:540
msgid ""
"The current route can be accessed with the ``current`` key. It is an object "
"with the following information:"
msgstr ""
"Joriy route'ga ``current`` kaliti orqali murojaat qilinadi. U quyidagi "
"ma'lumotlarni o'z ichiga olgan object:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:543
msgid ""
"`pathname (string)`: the path for the current location (most likely `/web` )"
msgstr "`pathname (string)`: joriy manzil yo'li (ko'p hollarda `/web` )"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:544
msgid ""
"`search (object)`: a dictionary mapping each search keyword (the "
"querystring) from the url to its value. An empty string is the value if no "
"value was explicitely given"
msgstr ""
"`search (object)`: url'dagi har bir qidiruv kalit so'zini (querystring) "
"uning qiymatiga bog'laydigan lug'at. Agar qiymat aniq ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, "
"qiymat bo'sh satr bo'ladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:547
msgid "`hash (object)`: same as above, but for values described in the hash."
msgstr ""
"`hash (object)`: yuqoridagi kabi, lekin hash'da tavsiflangan qiymatlar uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:559
msgid "Updating the URL is done with the  `pushState` method:"
msgstr "URL'ni yangilash  `pushState` method'i bilan amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:563
msgid "object containing a mapping from some keys to some values"
msgstr "ba'zi kalitlarni ba'zi qiymatlarga bog'lashni o'z ichiga olgan object"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:564
msgid ""
"if true, the url will be replaced, otherwise only key/value pairs from the "
"`hash` will be updated."
msgstr ""
"agar true bo'lsa, url almashtiriladi, aks holda faqat `hash` dagi kalit/"
"qiymat juftliklari yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:567
msgid ""
"Updates the URL with each key/value pair from the `hash` object. If a value "
"is set to an empty string, the key is added to the url without any "
"corresponding value."
msgstr ""
"URL'ni `hash` object'idagi har bir kalit/qiymat juftligi bilan yangilaydi. "
"Agar qiymat bo'sh satrga o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, kalit url'ga hech qanday mos "
"qiymatsiz qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:571
msgid ""
"If true, the `replace` argument tells the router that the url hash should be "
"completely replaced (so values not present in the `hash` object will be "
"removed)."
msgstr ""
"Agar true bo'lsa, `replace` argumenti router'ga url hash'i to'liq "
"almashtirilishi kerakligini bildiradi (ya'ni `hash` object'ida mavjud "
"bo'lmagan qiymatlar olib tashlanadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:574
msgid ""
"This method call does not reload the page. It also does not trigger a "
"`hashchange` event, nor a `ROUTE_CHANGE` in the :ref:`main bus <frontend/"
"framework/bus>`. This is because this method is intended to only updates the "
"url. The code calling this method has the responsibility to make sure that "
"the screen is updated as well."
msgstr ""
"Bu method chaqirilishi sahifani qayta yuklamaydi. Shuningdek, u `hashchange` "
"event'ini ham, :ref:`main bus <frontend/framework/bus>` dagi `ROUTE_CHANGE` "
"ni ham ishga tushirmaydi. Sababi, bu method faqat url'ni yangilash uchun "
"mo'ljallangan. Ekranning ham yangilanishini ta'minlash — bu method'ni "
"chaqiruvchi kodning mas'uliyati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:591
msgid ""
"Finally, the `redirect` method will redirect the browser to a specified url:"
msgstr ""
"Va nihoyat, `redirect` method'i brauzerni ko'rsatilgan url'ga yo'naltiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:595
msgid "a valid url"
msgstr "haqiqiy url"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:596
msgid "if true, wait for the server to be ready, and redirect after"
msgstr ""
"agar true bo'lsa, server tayyor bo'lishini kutadi va keyin redirect qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:598
msgid ""
"Redirect the browser to `url`. This method reloads the page. The `wait` "
"argument is rarely used: it is useful in some cases where we know that the "
"server will be unavailable for a short duration, typically just after an "
"addon update or install operation."
msgstr ""
"Browser'ni `url` ga redirect qiladi. Bu method sahifani qayta yuklaydi. "
"`wait` argumenti kamdan-kam ishlatiladi: u server qisqa vaqt mavjud "
"bo'lmasligini bilgan hollarda, odatda addon update yoki install "
"operatsiyasidan keyin foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:604
msgid ""
"The router service emits a `ROUTE_CHANGE` event on the :ref:`main bus "
"<frontend/framework/bus>` whenever the current route has changed."
msgstr ""
"Router service hozirgi route o'zgargan har safar :ref:`main bus <frontend/"
"framework/bus>` da `ROUTE_CHANGE` event'ini chiqaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:610
msgid "RPC service"
msgstr "RPC service"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:615
msgid "Technical name: `rpc`"
msgstr "Texnik nomi: `rpc`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:618
msgid ""
"The `rpc` service provides a single asynchronous function to send requests "
"to the server. Calling a controller is very simple: the route should be the "
"first argument and optionally, a ``params`` object can be given as a second "
"argument."
msgstr ""
"`rpc` service serverga request'lar yuborish uchun bitta asinxron funksiya "
"taqdim etadi. Controller'ni chaqirish juda oddiy: route birinchi argument "
"bo'lishi kerak, ixtiyoriy ravishda ikkinchi argument sifatida ``params`` "
"object'i berilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:631
msgid ""
"Note that the ``rpc`` service is considered a low-level service. It should "
"only be used to interact with Odoo controllers. To work with models (which "
"is by far the most important usecase), one should use the ``orm`` service "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, ``rpc`` service low-level service hisoblanadi. U faqat Odoo "
"controller'lari bilan ishlash uchun ishlatilishi kerak. Model'lar bilan "
"ishlash uchun (bu eng muhim usecase) uning o'rniga ``orm`` service'dan "
"foydalanish lozim."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:641
msgid "route targeted by the request"
msgstr "request mo'ljallagan route"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:642
msgid "(optional) parameters sent to the server"
msgstr "(ixtiyoriy) serverga yuboriladigan parametrlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:643
msgid "(optional) request settings (see below)"
msgstr "(ixtiyoriy) request sozlamalari (pastga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:645
msgid "The ``settings`` object can contain:"
msgstr "``settings`` object quyidagilarni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:647
msgid ""
"``xhr``, which should be a ``XMLHTTPRequest`` object. In that case, the "
"``rpc`` method will simply use it instead of creating a new one. This is "
"useful when one accesses advanced features of the `XMLHTTPRequest` API."
msgstr ""
"``xhr``, u ``XMLHTTPRequest`` object'i bo'lishi kerak. Bu holda ``rpc`` "
"method yangisini yaratish o'rniga shunchaki undan foydalanadi. Bu "
"`XMLHTTPRequest` API'sining ilg'or imkoniyatlariga murojaat qilinganda "
"foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:650
msgid ""
"``silent (boolean)`` If set to ``true``, the web client will not provide a "
"feedback that there is a pending rpc."
msgstr ""
"``silent (boolean)`` Agar ``true`` qilib belgilansa, web client kutilayotgan "
"rpc borligi haqida feedback bermaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:653
msgid ""
"The ``rpc`` service communicates with the server by using a "
"``XMLHTTPRequest`` object, configured to work with the ``application/json`` "
"content type. So clearly the content of the request should be JSON "
"serializable. Each request done by this service uses the ``POST`` http "
"method."
msgstr ""
"``rpc`` service server bilan ``XMLHTTPRequest`` object'i orqali aloqa "
"qiladi, u ``application/json`` content type bilan ishlashga sozlangan. "
"Shuning uchun request mazmuni JSON serializable bo'lishi kerak. Bu service "
"bajaradigan har bir request ``POST`` http method'idan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:658
msgid ""
"Server errors actually return the response with an http code 200. But the "
"``rpc`` service will treat them as error."
msgstr ""
"Server xatolari aslida response'ni http code 200 bilan qaytaradi. Lekin "
"``rpc`` service ularni xato sifatida ko'rib chiqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:664
msgid "An rpc can fail for two main reasons:"
msgstr "rpc ikki asosiy sabab bo'yicha muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:666
msgid ""
"either the odoo server returns an error (so, we call this a ``server`` "
"error). In that case the http request will return with an http code 200 BUT "
"with a response object containing an ``error`` key."
msgstr ""
"yoki odoo server xato qaytaradi (biz buni ``server`` xatosi deb ataymiz). Bu "
"holda http request http code 200 bilan qaytadi, LEKIN response object'i "
"``error`` key'ini o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:670
msgid "or there is some other kind of network error"
msgstr "yoki boshqa turdagi network xatosi yuz beradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:672
msgid "When a rpc fails, then:"
msgstr "rpc muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lganda:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:674
msgid ""
"the promise representing the rpc is rejected, so the calling code will "
"crash, unless it handles the situation"
msgstr ""
"rpc'ni ifodalovchi promise reject qilinadi, shuning uchun chaqiruvchi kod "
"vaziyatni o'zi boshqarmasa, ishdan chiqadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:676
msgid ""
"an event ``RPC_ERROR`` is triggered on the main application bus. The event "
"payload contains a description of the cause of the error:"
msgstr ""
"asosiy application bus'da ``RPC_ERROR`` event'i chiqariladi. Event payload "
"xato sababining tavsifini o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:679
msgid ""
"If it is a server error (the server code threw an exception). In that case "
"the event payload will be an object with the following keys:"
msgstr ""
"Agar bu server xatosi bo'lsa (server kodi exception tashlagan bo'lsa). Bu "
"holda event payload quyidagi key'larga ega object bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:683
msgid "``type = 'server'``"
msgstr "``type = 'server'``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:684
msgid "``message(string)``"
msgstr "``message(string)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:686
msgid "``code(number)``"
msgstr "``code(number)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:689
msgid ""
"``name(string)`` (optional, used by the error service to look for an "
"appropriate dialog to use when handling the error)"
msgstr ""
"``name(string)`` (ixtiyoriy, error service tomonidan xatoni boshqarishda mos "
"dialog'ni topish uchun ishlatiladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:692
msgid ""
"``subType(string)`` (optional, often used to determine the dialog title)"
msgstr ""
"``subType(string)`` (ixtiyoriy, ko'pincha dialog sarlavhasini aniqlash uchun "
"ishlatiladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:693
msgid ""
"``data(object)`` (optional object that can contain various keys among which "
"``debug`` : the main debug information, with the call stack)"
msgstr ""
"``data(object)`` (turli key'larni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin bo'lgan ixtiyoriy "
"object, ular orasida ``debug`` : call stack bilan asosiy debug ma'lumoti)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:696
msgid ""
"If it is a network error, then the error description is simply an object "
"``{type: 'network'}``. When a network error occurs, a :ref:`notification "
"<frontend/services/notification>` is displayed and the server is regularly "
"contacted until it responds. The notification is closed as soon as the "
"server responds."
msgstr ""
"Agar bu network xatosi bo'lsa, xato tavsifi shunchaki ``{type: 'network'}`` "
"object'i bo'ladi. Network xatosi yuz berganda :ref:`notification <frontend/"
"services/notification>` ko'rsatiladi va server javob berguncha unga muntazam "
"murojaat qilinadi. Server javob berishi bilan notification yopiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:705
msgid "Scroller service"
msgstr "Scroller service"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:710
msgid "Technical name: `scroller`"
msgstr "Texnik nomi: `scroller`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:713
msgid ""
"Whenever the user clicks on an anchor in the web client, this service "
"automatically scrolls to the target (if appropriate)."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi web client'da anchor'ga bosgan har safar bu service avtomatik "
"ravishda maqsadga scroll qiladi (agar mos bo'lsa)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:716
msgid ""
"The service adds an event listener to get `click`'s on the document. The "
"service checks if the selector contained in its href attribute is valid to "
"distinguish anchors and Odoo actions (e.g. `<a href=\"#target_element\"></"
"a>`). It does nothing if it is not the case."
msgstr ""
"Service document'dagi `click`'larni olish uchun event listener qo'shadi. "
"Service anchor'lar va Odoo action'larini ajratish uchun uning href "
"atributidagi selector to'g'ri ekanini tekshiradi (masalan `<a "
"href=\"#target_element\"></a>`). Aks holda hech narsa qilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:720
msgid ""
"An event `SCROLLER:ANCHOR_LINK_CLICKED` is triggered on the main application "
"bus if the click seems to be targeted at an element. The event contains a "
"custom event containing the `element` matching and its `id` as a reference. "
"It may allow other parts to handle a behavior relative to anchors "
"themselves. The original event is also given as it might need to be "
"prevented. If the event is not prevented, then the user interface will "
"scroll to the target element."
msgstr ""
"Agar click biror element'ga mo'ljallangan bo'lib ko'rinsa, asosiy "
"application bus'da `SCROLLER:ANCHOR_LINK_CLICKED` event'i chiqariladi. Event "
"ichida mos kelgan `element` va uning `id` si reference sifatida joylashgan "
"custom event bo'ladi. Bu boshqa qismlarga anchor'larga tegishli xatti-"
"harakatni o'zlari boshqarish imkonini beradi. Asl event ham beriladi, chunki "
"uni to'xtatish kerak bo'lishi mumkin. Agar event to'xtatilmasa, "
"foydalanuvchi interfeysi maqsadli element'ga scroll qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:729
msgid ""
"The following values are contained in the `anchor-link-clicked` custom event "
"explained above."
msgstr ""
"Yuqorida tushuntirilgan `anchor-link-clicked` custom event'i quyidagi "
"qiymatlarni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:738
msgid "`element`"
msgstr "`element`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:739
msgid "`HTMLElement | null`"
msgstr "`HTMLElement | null`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:740
msgid "The anchor element targeted by the href"
msgstr "href mo'ljallagan anchor element"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:741
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:91
msgid "`id`"
msgstr "`id`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:743
msgid "The id contained in the href"
msgstr "href ichidagi id"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:744
msgid "`originalEv`"
msgstr "`originalEv`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:745
msgid "`Event`"
msgstr "`Event`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:746
msgid "The original click event"
msgstr "Asl click event'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:749
msgid ""
"The scroller service emits a `SCROLLER:ANCHOR_LINK_CLICKED` event on "
"the :ref:`main bus <frontend/framework/bus>`. To avoid the default scroll "
"behavior of the scroller service, you must use `preventDefault()` on the "
"event given to the listener so that you can implement your own behavior "
"correctly from the listener."
msgstr ""
"Scroller service :ref:`main bus <frontend/framework/bus>` da "
"`SCROLLER:ANCHOR_LINK_CLICKED` event'ini chiqaradi. Scroller service'ning "
"standart scroll xatti-harakatidan qochish uchun listener'ga berilgan event "
"ustida `preventDefault()` dan foydalanishingiz kerak, shunda listener "
"ichidan o'zingizning xatti-harakatingizni to'g'ri amalga oshirasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:756
msgid "Title Service"
msgstr "Title service"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:761
msgid "Technical name: `title`"
msgstr "Texnik nomi: `title`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:764
msgid ""
"The `title` service offers a simple API that allows to read/modify the "
"document title. For example, if the current document title is \"Odoo\", we "
"can change it to \"Odoo 15 - Apple\" by using the following command:"
msgstr ""
"`title` service document sarlavhasini o'qish/o'zgartirish imkonini beruvchi "
"oddiy API taqdim etadi. Masalan, agar hozirgi document sarlavhasi \"Odoo\" "
"bo'lsa, quyidagi buyruq bilan uni \"Odoo 15 - Apple\" ga o'zgartirishimiz "
"mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:779
msgid "The ``title`` service manipulates the following interface:"
msgstr "``title`` service quyidagi interface bilan ishlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:787
msgid ""
"Each key represents the identity of a part of the title, and each value is "
"the string that is displayed, or `null` if it has been removed."
msgstr ""
"Har bir key sarlavhaning bir qismining identifikatorini ifodalaydi, har bir "
"value esa ko'rsatiladigan string, yoki agar u olib tashlangan bo'lsa `null`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:790
msgid "Its API is:"
msgstr "Uning API'si:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:795
msgid ""
"This is a string representing the current title. It is structured in the "
"following way: ``value_1 - ... - value_n`` where each `value_i` is a (non "
"null) value found in the `Parts` object (returned by the `getParts` function)"
msgstr ""
"Bu hozirgi sarlavhani ifodalovchi string. U quyidagi tarzda tuzilgan: "
"``value_1 - ... - value_n``, bu yerda har bir `value_i` — `Parts` object'ida "
"topilgan (null bo'lmagan) qiymat (`getParts` funksiyasi tomonidan "
"qaytariladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:801
msgid "Parts the current `Parts` object maintained by the title service"
msgstr "Parts — title service tomonidan boshqariladigan hozirgi `Parts` object"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:805
msgid "object representing the required change"
msgstr "kerakli o'zgarishni ifodalovchi object"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:807
msgid ""
"The ``setParts`` method allows to add/replace/delete several parts of the "
"title. Delete a part (a value) is done by setting the associated key value "
"to `null`."
msgstr ""
"``setParts`` method sarlavhaning bir nechta qismini qo'shish/almashtirish/"
"o'chirish imkonini beradi. Qismni (value'ni) o'chirish tegishli key "
"qiymatini `null` ga o'rnatish orqali amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:810
msgid ""
"Note that one can only modify a single part without affecting the other "
"parts. For example, if the title is composed of the following parts:"
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, boshqa qismlarga ta'sir qilmasdan faqat bitta qismni "
"o'zgartirish mumkin. Masalan, agar sarlavha quyidagi qismlardan tashkil "
"topgan bo'lsa:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:817
msgid "with ``current`` value being ``Odoo - Import`` , then"
msgstr "``current`` qiymati ``Odoo - Import`` bo'lganda, u holda"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/services.rst:825
msgid "will change the title to ``Odoo``."
msgstr "sarlavhani ``Odoo`` ga o'zgartiradi."

