#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:6
msgid "JavaScript Unit Testing"
msgstr "JavaScript unit testlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:8
msgid ""
"Writing unit tests is as important as writing the code itself: it helps to "
"ensure that the code is written according to a given specification and that "
"it remains correct as it evolves."
msgstr ""
"Unit testlar yozish kodning o'zini yozish kabi muhim: bu kod berilgan "
"spetsifikatsiyaga muvofiq yozilganiga va rivojlanib borgani sayin to'g'ri "
"qolishiga ishonch beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:13
msgid "Testing Framework"
msgstr "Testlash framework'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:15
msgid ""
"Testing the code starts with a testing framework. The framework provides a "
"level of abstraction that makes it possible to write tests in an easy and "
"efficient way. It also provides a set of tools to run the tests, make "
"assertions and report the results."
msgstr ""
"Kodni testlash testlash framework'idan boshlanadi. Framework testlarni oson "
"va samarali yozish imkonini beruvchi abstraksiya darajasini taqdim etadi. "
"Shuningdek, u testlarni ishga tushirish, assertion'lar qilish va natijalarni "
"hisobot qilish uchun vositalar to'plamini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:20
msgid ""
"Odoo developers use a home-grown testing framework called :abbr:`HOOT "
"(Hierarchically Organized Odoo Tests)`. The main reason for using a custom "
"framework is that it allows us to extend it based on our needs (tags system, "
"mocking of global objects, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo dasturchilari :abbr:`HOOT (Hierarchically Organized Odoo Tests)` deb "
"nomlangan o'zi ishlab chiqilgan testlash framework'idan foydalanadi. Maxsus "
"framework ishlatishning asosiy sababi — uni o'z ehtiyojlarimizga qarab "
"kengaytirish mumkinligi (tag'lar tizimi, global object'larni mock qilish va "
"h.k.)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:24
msgid ""
"On top of that framework we have built a set of tools to help us write tests "
"for the web client (`web_test_helpers`), and a mock server to simulate the "
"server side (`mock_server`)."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu framework ustiga web client uchun testlar yozishga yordam beruvchi "
"vositalar to'plamini (`web_test_helpers`) va server tomonini simulyatsiya "
"qiluvchi mock server (`mock_server`) qurdik."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:27
msgid ""
"You can find links to the reference of each of these parts below, as well as "
"a section filled with examples and best practices for writing tests."
msgstr ""
"Quyida bu qismlarning har biri uchun reference havolalarini, shuningdek "
"testlar yozish uchun misollar va eng yaxshi amaliyotlarga to'la bo'limni "
"topasiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:33
msgid ""
"Before learning how to write tests, it is good to start with the basics. The "
"following steps will ensure that your test files are properly picked up by "
"the test runner."
msgstr ""
"Testlar yozishni o'rganishdan avval asoslardan boshlash foydali. Quyidagi "
"qadamlar test fayllaringiz test runner tomonidan to'g'ri aniqlanishini "
"ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:36
msgid ""
"Note that in existing addons, most of these steps can be skipped since the "
"proper folder structure and asset bundles are probably set up."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, mavjud addon'larda bu qadamlarning ko'pini o'tkazib yuborish "
"mumkin, chunki kerakli papka tuzilmasi va asset bundle'lari, ehtimol, "
"allaqachon sozlangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:39
msgid "Writing files in the right **place**:"
msgstr "Fayllarni to'g'ri **joyda** yozish:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:41
msgid ""
"All JavaScript test files should be put under the `/static/tests` folder of "
"the related addon (e.g. :file:`/web/static/tests/env.test.js`)."
msgstr ""
"Barcha JavaScript test fayllari tegishli addon'ning `/static/tests` "
"papkasiga joylashtirilishi kerak (masalan :file:`/web/static/tests/"
"env.test.js`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:44
msgid "Using the right **name**:"
msgstr "To'g'ri **nom** ishlatish:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:46
msgid ""
"Test files must end with :file:`.test.js`. This is not only a convention, "
"but a requirement for test files to be picked up by the runner. All other "
"JavaScript files will be interpreted either as production code (i.e. the "
"code to be tested), or as test helper files (such as `web_test_helpers "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/tests/"
"web_test_helpers.js>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Test fayllari :file:`.test.js` bilan tugashi kerak. Bu shunchaki kelishuv "
"emas, balki test fayllari runner tomonidan aniqlanishi uchun talab. Boshqa "
"barcha JavaScript fayllari yoki production kod (ya'ni testlanadigan kod), "
"yoki test helper fayllari sifatida talqin qilinadi (masalan "
"`web_test_helpers <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/"
"tests/web_test_helpers.js>`_)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:52
msgid ""
"It is to be noted that there is an exception for :file:`.hoot.js` files, "
"which are not considered as test files, but as global modules for the whole "
"test run, while other JavaScript modules are re-created for each test suite. "
"Since the same instance of these modules will be running for the whole test "
"run, they follow strict constraints, such as restricted imports, or advanced "
"memory management techniques to ensure no side-effects are affecting tests."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, :file:`.hoot.js` fayllari uchun istisno mavjud: ular test "
"fayllari deb emas, balki butun test yurishi uchun global module'lar deb "
"hisoblanadi, boshqa JavaScript module'lari esa har bir test suite uchun "
"qaytadan yaratiladi. Bu module'larning bir xil instance'i butun test yurishi "
"davomida ishlayotgani uchun, ular qattiq cheklovlarga bo'ysunadi — masalan "
"cheklangan import'lar yoki testlarga side-effect ta'sir qilmasligini "
"ta'minlash uchun ilg'or xotira boshqaruvi usullari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:59
msgid "Calling the files in the right **bundle**:"
msgstr "Fayllarni to'g'ri **bundle** ichida chaqirish:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:61
msgid ""
"Test files, added in the right folder, must be included in the "
"`web.assets_unit_tests` bundle. For ease of use, this can be done with glob "
"syntax to import all test and test helper files:"
msgstr ""
"To'g'ri papkaga qo'shilgan test fayllari `web.assets_unit_tests` bundle'iga "
"kiritilishi kerak. Qulaylik uchun buni barcha test va test helper fayllarini "
"import qilish uchun glob sintaksisi bilan bajarish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:72
msgid "Heading to the right **URL**:"
msgstr "To'g'ri **URL** ga o'tish:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:74
msgid "To run tests, you can then go to the `/web/tests` URL."
msgstr ""
"Testlarni ishga tushirish uchun `/web/tests` URL manziliga o'tishingiz "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:77
msgid ""
"This page can be accessed through :icon:`fa-bug` :menuselection:`Debug menu "
"--> Run Unit Tests`."
msgstr ""
"Bu sahifaga :icon:`fa-bug` :menuselection:`Debug menu --> Run Unit Tests` "
"orqali kirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:80
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:143
msgid "Writing tests"
msgstr "Testlar yozish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing.rst:82
msgid ""
"After creating and including test files, it is time to write tests. You may "
"refer to the following documentation sections to learn about the testing "
"framework."
msgstr ""
"Test fayllarini yaratib, ularni kiritganingizdan so'ng testlar yozish vaqti "
"keladi. Testlash framework'i bilan tanishish uchun hujjatlarning quyidagi "
"bo'limlariga murojaat qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:3
msgid "HOOT"
msgstr "HOOT"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:8
msgid ""
":abbr:`HOOT (Hierarchically Organized Odoo Tests)` is a testing framework "
"written with Owl whose key features are:"
msgstr ""
":abbr:`HOOT (Hierarchically Organized Odoo Tests)` — Owl bilan yozilgan "
"testlash framework'i bo'lib, uning asosiy imkoniyatlari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:11
msgid "to register and run tests and test suites;"
msgstr "testlar va test suite'larni ro'yxatga olish va ishga tushirish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:12
msgid "to display an intuitive interface to view and filter test results;"
msgstr ""
"test natijalarini ko'rish va filtrlash uchun intuitiv interfeysni ko'rsatish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:13
msgid "to provide ways to interact with the DOM to simulate user actions;"
msgstr ""
"foydalanuvchi harakatlarini simulyatsiya qilish uchun DOM bilan ishlash "
"usullarini taqdim etish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:14
msgid "to provide low-level helpers allowing to mock various global objects."
msgstr ""
"turli global obyektlarni mock qilish imkonini beruvchi quyi darajadagi "
"helper'larni taqdim etish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:16
msgid ""
"As such, it has been integrated as a :file:`lib/` in the Odoo codebase and "
"exports 2 main modules:"
msgstr ""
"Shu sababli u Odoo codebase'iga :file:`lib/` sifatida integratsiya qilingan "
"va 2 asosiy module'ni export qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:18
msgid ":file:`@odoo/hoot-dom`: (can be used in tours) helpers to:"
msgstr ""
":file:`@odoo/hoot-dom`: (tour'larda ishlatilishi mumkin) quyidagilar uchun "
"helper'lar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:20
msgid ""
"**interact** with the DOM, such as :js:meth:`click` and :js:meth:`press`;"
msgstr "DOM bilan **ishlash**, masalan :js:meth:`click` va :js:meth:`press`;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:21
msgid ""
"**query** elements from the DOM, such as :js:meth:`queryAll` "
"and :js:meth:`waitFor`;"
msgstr ""
"DOM'dan element'larni **so'rash**, masalan :js:meth:`queryAll` "
"va :js:meth:`waitFor`;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:23
msgid ""
":file:`@odoo/hoot`: (only to be used in unit tests) all the test framework "
"features:"
msgstr ""
":file:`@odoo/hoot`: (faqat unit test'larda ishlatiladi) test framework'ining "
"barcha imkoniyatlari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:25
msgid "`test`, `describe` and `expect`"
msgstr "`test`, `describe` va `expect`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:26
msgid "test hooks like `after` and `afterEach`"
msgstr "`after` va `afterEach` kabi test hook'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:27
msgid "fixture handling with `getFixture`"
msgstr "`getFixture` yordamida fixture bilan ishlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:28
msgid "date and time handling like `mockDate` or `advanceTime`"
msgstr "`mockDate` yoki `advanceTime` kabi sana va vaqt bilan ishlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:29
msgid ""
"mocking network responses through :js:meth:`mockFetch` "
"or :js:meth:`mockWebSocket`"
msgstr ""
":js:meth:`mockFetch` yoki :js:meth:`mockWebSocket` orqali tarmoq "
"response'larini mock qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:30
msgid "every helper exported by :file:`@odoo/hoot-dom`"
msgstr ":file:`@odoo/hoot-dom` tomonidan export qilinadigan barcha helper'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:33
msgid ""
"This section of the documentation is not meant to list *all* helpers "
"available in Hoot (the full list can be found in the `@odoo/hoot <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/lib/hoot/hoot.js>`_ module "
"itself). The goal here is to showcase the most used helpers and to justify "
"some of the decisions that have led to the current shape of the testing "
"framework."
msgstr ""
"Hujjatlarning bu bo'limi Hoot'da mavjud *barcha* helper'larni sanab o'tishni "
"maqsad qilmagan (to'liq ro'yxatni `@odoo/hoot <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/19.0/addons/web/static/lib/hoot/hoot.js>`_ module'ining o'zida topish "
"mumkin). Bu yerdagi maqsad — eng ko'p ishlatiladigan helper'larni ko'rsatish "
"va testing framework'ining hozirgi ko'rinishiga olib kelgan ba'zi qarorlarni "
"izohlash."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:41
msgid ""
"In Odoo, frontend unit tests can be run by going to the `/web/tests` URL. "
"Most of the setup for calling the test runner is already in place:"
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da frontend unit test'larini `/web/tests` URL manziliga o'tish orqali "
"ishga tushirish mumkin. Test runner'ni chaqirish uchun kerakli "
"sozlamalarning katta qismi allaqachon tayyor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:44
msgid ""
"the `web.assets_unit_tests` bundle is already defined, and picks up all "
"tests defined in most addons;"
msgstr ""
"`web.assets_unit_tests` bundle allaqachon aniqlangan va ko'pchilik "
"addon'larda aniqlangan barcha test'larni qamrab oladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:47
msgid ""
"a :file:`start.hoot.js` file takes care of calling the test runner with its "
"exported `start` entry point function."
msgstr ""
":file:`start.hoot.js` fayli test runner'ni uning export qilingan `start` "
"kirish nuqtasi funksiyasi bilan chaqirishni o'z zimmasiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:50
msgid ""
"When going to the test page, tests will be run sequentially and the results "
"will be displayed in the console and in the GUI (if not running in "
"`headless` mode)."
msgstr ""
"Test sahifasiga o'tilganda test'lar ketma-ket bajariladi va natijalar "
"console'da hamda GUI'da ko'rsatiladi (agar `headless` rejimda ishlamayotgan "
"bo'lsa)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:54
msgid "Runner options"
msgstr "Runner option'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:56
msgid "The runner can be configured either:"
msgstr "Runner'ni quyidagi usullardan biri bilan sozlash mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:58
msgid ""
"through the interface (with the configuration dropdown and the search bar);"
msgstr ""
"interfeys orqali (konfiguratsiya dropdown'i va qidiruv paneli yordamida);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:59
msgid ""
"or through the URL query parameters (e.g. `?headless` to run in headless "
"mode)."
msgstr ""
"yoki URL query parametrlari orqali (masalan, headless rejimda ishga "
"tushirish uchun `?headless`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:61
msgid "Here is the list of available options for the runner:"
msgstr "Runner uchun mavjud option'lar ro'yxati:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:65
msgid "`bail`"
msgstr "`bail`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:64
msgid ""
"Amount of failed tests after which the test runner will be stopped. A falsy "
"value (including 0) means that the runner should never be aborted. (default: "
"`0`)"
msgstr ""
"Test runner to'xtatilishidan oldin muvaffaqiyatsiz tugagan test'lar soni. "
"Falsy qiymat (0 ham shu jumlada) runner hech qachon to'xtatilmasligini "
"bildiradi. (standart: `0`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:69
msgid "`debugTest`"
msgstr "`debugTest`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:68
msgid ""
"Same as the `FILTER_SCHEMA.test` filter, while also putting the test runner "
"in \"debug\" mode. See `TestRunner.debug` for more info. (default: `false`)"
msgstr ""
"`FILTER_SCHEMA.test` filter bilan bir xil, lekin qo'shimcha ravishda test "
"runner'ni \"debug\" rejimiga o'tkazadi. Batafsil ma'lumot uchun "
"`TestRunner.debug` ga qaralsin. (standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:73
msgid "`fps`"
msgstr "`fps`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:72
msgid ""
"Sets the value of frames per seconds (this will be transformed to "
"milliseconds and used in `advanceFrame`)"
msgstr ""
"Sekundiga kadrlar sonining qiymatini belgilaydi (u millisekundlarga "
"o'giriladi va `advanceFrame` da ishlatiladi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:77
msgid "`filter`"
msgstr "`filter`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:76
msgid ""
"Search string that will filter matching tests/suites, based on their full "
"name (including their parent suite(s)) and their tags. (default: `\"\"`)"
msgstr ""
"Test/suite'larni to'liq nomi (parent suite'lari bilan birga) va tag'lari "
"asosida filtrlaydigan qidiruv satri. (standart: `\"\"`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:81
msgid "`frameRate`"
msgstr "`frameRate`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:80
msgid ""
"*Estimated* amount of frames rendered per second, used when mocking "
"animation frames. (default: `60` fps)"
msgstr ""
"Sekundiga render qilinadigan kadrlarning *taxminiy* soni; animation "
"frame'larni mock qilishda ishlatiladi. (standart: `60` fps)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:84
msgid "`fun`"
msgstr "`fun`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:84
msgid "Lightens the mood. (default: `false`)"
msgstr "Kayfiyatni ko'taradi. (standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:87
msgid "`headless`"
msgstr "`headless`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:87
msgid "Whether to render the test runner user interface. (default: `false`)"
msgstr ""
"Test runner foydalanuvchi interfeysi render qilinishi kerakmi. (standart: "
"`false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:90
msgid ""
"IDs of the suites OR tests to run exclusively. The ID of a job is generated "
"deterministically based on its full name."
msgstr ""
"Faqat ishga tushirilishi kerak bo'lgan suite yoki test'larning ID'lari. "
"Job'ning ID'si uning to'liq nomi asosida deterministik tarzda generatsiya "
"qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:99
msgid "`loglevel`"
msgstr "`loglevel`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:94
msgid ""
"Log level used by the test runner. The higher the level, the more logs will "
"be displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Test runner ishlatadigan log darajasi. Daraja qanchalik yuqori bo'lsa, "
"shunchalik ko'p log ko'rsatiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:96
msgid "`0`: only runner logs are displayed (default)"
msgstr "`0`: faqat runner log'lari ko'rsatiladi (standart)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:97
msgid "`1`: all suite results are also logged"
msgstr "`1`: barcha suite natijalari ham log qilinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:98
msgid "`2`: all test results are also logged"
msgstr "`2`: barcha test natijalari ham log qilinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:99
msgid "`3`: debug information for each test is also logged"
msgstr "`3`: har bir test uchun debug ma'lumotlari ham log qilinadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:102
msgid ""
"Whether the test runner must be manually started after page load (defaults "
"to starting automatically). (default: `false`)"
msgstr ""
"Sahifa yuklangandan keyin test runner qo'lda ishga tushirilishi kerakmi "
"(standart holatda avtomatik ishga tushadi). (standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:107
msgid "`notrycatch`"
msgstr "`notrycatch`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:106
msgid ""
"Removes the safety of `try .. catch` statements around each test's run "
"function to let errors bubble to the browser. (default: `false`)"
msgstr ""
"Xatolar brauzerga chiqishi uchun har bir test'ning run funksiyasi atrofidagi "
"`try .. catch` himoyasini olib tashlaydi. (standart: `false`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:114
msgid "`order`"
msgstr "`order`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:110
msgid "Determines the order of test execution:"
msgstr "Test'lar bajarilish tartibini aniqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:112
msgid ""
"`\"fifo\"`: tests will be run sequentially as declared in the file system;"
msgstr ""
"`\"fifo\"`: test'lar fayl tizimida e'lon qilingan tartibda ketma-ket "
"bajariladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:113
msgid "`\"lifo\"`: tests will be run sequentially in the reverse order;"
msgstr "`\"lifo\"`: test'lar teskari tartibda ketma-ket bajariladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:114
msgid "`\"random\"`: shuffles tests and suites within their parent suite."
msgstr ""
"`\"random\"`: test va suite'larni ularning parent suite'i ichida "
"aralashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:122
msgid "`preset`"
msgstr "`preset`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:117
msgid ""
"Environment in which the test runner is running. This parameter is used to "
"determine the default value of other features, namely:"
msgstr ""
"Test runner ishlayotgan environment. Bu parametr boshqa imkoniyatlarning "
"standart qiymatini aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi, xususan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:120
msgid "the user agent;"
msgstr "user agent;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:121
msgid "touch support;"
msgstr "touch qo'llab-quvvatlashi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:122
msgid "expected size of the viewport."
msgstr "viewport'ning kutilayotgan o'lchami."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:125
msgid "`showdetail`"
msgstr "`showdetail`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:125
msgid ""
"Determines how the failed tests must be unfolded in the UI. (default: "
"`\"first-fail\"`)"
msgstr ""
"Muvaffaqiyatsiz test'lar UI'da qanday ochilishi kerakligini aniqlaydi. "
"(standart: `\"first-fail\"`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:128
msgid "`tag`"
msgstr "`tag`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:128
msgid ""
"Tag names of tests and suites to run exclusively (case insensitive). "
"(default: empty)"
msgstr ""
"Faqat ishga tushirilishi kerak bo'lgan test va suite'larning tag nomlari "
"(katta-kichik harf farqlanmaydi). (standart: bo'sh)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:132
msgid "`timeout`"
msgstr "`timeout`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:131
msgid ""
"Duration (in milliseconds) at the end of which a test will automatically "
"fail. (default: `5` seconds)"
msgstr ""
"Davomiylik (millisekundlarda), u tugagach test avtomatik ravishda "
"muvaffaqiyatsiz hisoblanadi. (standart: `5` sekund)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:135
msgid ""
"When selecting tests and suites to run, an implicit `OR` is applied between "
"the *including* filters. This means that adding more inclusive filters will "
"result in more tests being run. This applies to the `filter`, `id` and `tag` "
"filters (*excluding* filters however will remove matching tests from the "
"list of tests to run)."
msgstr ""
"Ishga tushiriladigan testlar va suite'larni tanlashda *qo'shuvchi* filterlar "
"orasida yashirin `OR` qo'llaniladi. Bu shuni bildiradi: qo'shuvchi filterlar "
"ko'proq bo'lsa, ishga tushadigan testlar ham ko'proq bo'ladi. Bu `filter`, "
"`id` va `tag` filterlariga tegishli (*chiqarib tashlovchi* filterlar esa mos "
"testlarni ishga tushirish ro'yxatidan olib tashlaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:146
msgid "Test"
msgstr "Test"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:148
msgid ""
"Writing a test can be very straightforward, as it is just a matter of "
"calling the `test` function with a name and a function that will contain the "
"test logic."
msgstr ""
"Test yozish juda oson bo'lishi mumkin, chunki bu shunchaki `test` "
"funksiyasini nom va test logikasini o'z ichiga oladigan funksiya bilan "
"chaqirishdan iborat."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:151
msgid "Here is a simple example:"
msgstr "Oddiy misol:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:163
msgid "Describe"
msgstr "Describe"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:165
msgid ""
"Most of the time, tests are not that simple. They often require some setup "
"and teardown, and sometimes they need to be grouped together in a suite. "
"This is where the `describe` function comes into play."
msgstr ""
"Ko'p hollarda testlar unchalik oddiy bo'lmaydi. Ular ko'pincha setup va "
"teardown talab qiladi, ba'zan esa ularni bitta suite ichida guruhlash kerak "
"bo'ladi. Aynan shu yerda `describe` funksiyasi ish beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:169
msgid "Here is how you would declare a suite and a test within it:"
msgstr "Suite va uning ichidagi testni quyidagicha e'lon qilasiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:182
msgid ""
"In Odoo, all test files are run in an isolated environment and are wrapped "
"within a global `describe` block (with the name of the suite being the "
"*path* of the test file)."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da barcha test fayllari izolyatsiya qilingan environment'da ishga "
"tushiriladi va global `describe` bloki ichiga o'raladi (suite nomi sifatida "
"test faylining *yo'li* olinadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:185
msgid ""
"With that in mind you should not need to declare a suite in your test files, "
"although you can still declare sub-suites in the same file if you still want "
"to split the file's suite, for organization or tagging purposes."
msgstr ""
"Shuni hisobga olsak, test fayllaringizda suite e'lon qilish shart emas, "
"biroq fayl suite'ini tartibga solish yoki teglash maqsadida bo'lib "
"tashlashni xohlasangiz, o'sha faylda sub-suite'lar e'lon qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:192
msgid "Expect"
msgstr "Expect"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:194
msgid ""
"The `expect` function is the main assertion function of the framework. It is "
"used to assert that a value or an object is what it is expected to be or in "
"the state it is supposed to be. To do so, it provides a few modifiers and a "
"wide range of matchers."
msgstr ""
"`expect` funksiyasi framework'ning asosiy assertion funksiyasidir. U qiymat "
"yoki obyekt kutilganidek ekanini yoki kutilgan holatda turganini tekshirish "
"uchun ishlatiladi. Buning uchun u bir nechta modifier va keng ko'lamli "
"matcher'lar taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:201
msgid "Modifiers"
msgstr "Modifier'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:203
msgid ""
"An `expect` modifier is a getter that returns another set of *altered* "
"matchers that will behave in a specific way."
msgstr ""
"`expect` modifier'i — bu getter bo'lib, u o'zini muayyan tarzda tutadigan "
"*o'zgartirilgan* matcher'lar to'plamini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:211
msgid "`not`"
msgstr "`not`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:207
msgid ""
"Inverts the result of the following matcher: it will succeed if the matcher "
"fails."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi matcher natijasini teskarisiga aylantiradi: matcher muvaffaqiyatsiz "
"bo'lsa, u muvaffaqiyatli hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:219
msgid "`resolves`"
msgstr "`resolves`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:214
msgid ""
"Waits for the value (`Promise`) to be *\"resolved\"* before running the "
"following matcher with the resolved value."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi matcher'ni resolve qilingan qiymat bilan ishga tushirishdan avval "
"qiymat (`Promise`) *\"resolved\"* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:227
msgid "`rejects`"
msgstr "`rejects`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:222
msgid ""
"Waits for the value (`Promise`) to be *\"rejected\"* before running the "
"following matcher with the rejected reason."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi matcher'ni reject sababi bilan ishga tushirishdan avval qiymat "
"(`Promise`) *\"rejected\"* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:230
msgid ""
"The `resolves` and `rejects` modifiers are only available when the value is "
"a promise, and will return a promise that will resolve once the assertion is "
"done."
msgstr ""
"`resolves` va `rejects` modifier'lari faqat qiymat promise bo'lganda "
"mavjuddir va assertion tugagach resolve bo'ladigan promise qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:236
msgid "Regular matchers"
msgstr "Oddiy matcher'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:238
msgid ""
"The matchers dictate what to do on the value being tested. Some will take "
"that value as-is, while others will *transform* that value before performing "
"the assertion on it (i.e. DOM matchers)."
msgstr ""
"Matcher'lar tekshirilayotgan qiymat ustida nima qilishni belgilaydi. "
"Ba'zilari qiymatni o'zgarishsiz oladi, boshqalari esa assertion'ni "
"bajarishdan avval uni *o'zgartiradi* (masalan, DOM matcher'lar)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:242
msgid ""
"Note that the last argument parameter of all matchers is an optional "
"dictionary with additional options, in which a custom assertion `message` "
"can be given for added context/specificity."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, barcha matcher'larning oxirgi argument parametri qo'shimcha "
"opsiyalar bilan ixtiyoriy dictionary bo'lib, unda qo'shimcha kontekst/"
"aniqlik uchun maxsus assertion `message` berilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:245
msgid ""
"The first list of matchers are primitive or object based and are the most "
"common ones:"
msgstr ""
"Matcher'larning birinchi ro'yxati primitiv yoki obyektga asoslangan bo'lib, "
"eng ko'p ishlatiladiganlaridir:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:249
msgid ""
"Expects the received value to be *strictly equal* to the `expected` value."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat `expected` qiymatga *qat'iy teng* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:253
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:270
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:389
msgid "`expected`: `any`"
msgstr "`expected`: `any`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:254
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:291
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:308
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:324
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:340
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:356
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:373
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:390
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:407
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:431
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:449
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:465
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:507
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:523
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:538
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:550
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:568
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:584
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:602
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:660
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:700
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:743
msgid "`options`: `{ message?: string }`"
msgstr "`options`: `{ message?: string }`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:265
msgid ""
"Expects the received value to be *close to* the `expected` value up to a "
"given amount of digits (default is 2)."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat berilgan raqamlar soni aniqligida (standart 2) "
"`expected` qiymatga *yaqin* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:271
msgid "`options`: `{ message?: string, digits?: number }`"
msgstr "`options`: `{ message?: string, digits?: number }`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:282
msgid "Expects the received value to be empty:"
msgstr "Qabul qilingan qiymat bo'sh bo'lishini kutadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:284
msgid "`iterable`: no items"
msgstr "`iterable`: elementlar yo'q"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:285
msgid "`object`: no keys"
msgstr "`object`: kalitlar yo'q"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:286
msgid "`node`: no content (i.e. no value or text)"
msgstr "`node`: kontent yo'q (ya'ni qiymat yoki matn yo'q)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:287
msgid "anything else: falsy value (`false`, `0`, `\"\"`, `null`, `undefined`)"
msgstr ""
"qolgan hamma narsa: falsy qiymat (`false`, `0`, `\"\"`, `null`, `undefined`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:303
msgid "Expects the received value to be *strictly greater* than `min`."
msgstr "Qabul qilingan qiymat `min` dan *qat'iy katta* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:307
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:371
msgid "`min`: `number`"
msgstr "`min`: `number`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:319
msgid "Expects the received value to be an instance of the given `cls`."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat berilgan `cls` ning instance'i bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:323
msgid "`cls`: `Function`"
msgstr "`cls`: `Function`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:335
msgid "Expects the received value to be *strictly less* than `max`."
msgstr "Qabul qilingan qiymat `max` dan *qat'iy kichik* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:339
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:372
msgid "`max`: `number`"
msgstr "`max`: `number`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:351
msgid "Expects the received value to be of the given `type`."
msgstr "Qabul qilingan qiymat berilgan `type` da bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:355
msgid "`type`: `string`"
msgstr "`type`: `string`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:367
msgid ""
"Expects the received value to be *between* `min` and `max` (both inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat `min` va `max` *orasida* bo'lishini kutadi (ikkisi ham "
"kiritilgan holda)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:385
msgid ""
"Expects the received value to be *deeply equal* to the `expected` value."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat `expected` qiymatga *chuqur teng* bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:401
msgid ""
"Expects the received value to have a length of the given `length`. Received "
"value can be any `Iterable` or `Object`."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat uzunligi berilgan `length` ga teng bo'lishini kutadi. "
"Qabul qilingan qiymat har qanday `Iterable` yoki `Object` bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:406
msgid "`length`: `number`"
msgstr "`length`: `number`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:420
msgid "Expects the received value to include an `item` of a given shape."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat berilgan shakldagi `item` ni o'z ichiga olishini "
"kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:422
msgid ""
"Received value can be an iterable or an object (in case it is an object, the "
"`item` should be a key or a tuple representing an entry in that object)."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan qiymat iterable yoki obyekt bo'lishi mumkin (obyekt bo'lgan "
"holatda `item` kalit yoki o'sha obyektdagi yozuvni ifodalovchi tuple "
"bo'lishi kerak)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:425
msgid ""
"Note that it is NOT a strict comparison: the item will be matched for deep "
"equality against each item of the iterable."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, bu qat'iy taqqoslash EMAS: element iterable'ning har bir "
"elementi bilan chuqur tenglik bo'yicha solishtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:430
msgid "`item`: `any`"
msgstr "`item`: `any`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:444
msgid "Expects the received value to match the given `matcher`."
msgstr "Qabul qilingan qiymat berilgan `matcher` ga mos kelishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:448
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:464
msgid "`matcher`: `string | number | RegExp`"
msgstr "`matcher`: `string | number | RegExp`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:460
msgid "Expects the received `Function` to throw an error after being called."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Function` chaqirilgandan so'ng xato tashlashini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:476
msgid "DOM matchers"
msgstr "DOM matcher'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:478
msgid ""
"This next list of matchers are node-based and are used to assert the state "
"of a node or a list of nodes. They generally take a :ref:`custom selector "
"<hoot/custom-dom-selectors>` as the argument of the `expect` function "
"(although a `Node` or an iterable of `Node` is also accepted)."
msgstr ""
"Matcher'larning keyingi ro'yxati node'ga asoslangan bo'lib, node yoki "
"node'lar ro'yxatining holatini tekshirish uchun ishlatiladi. Ular odatda "
"`expect` funksiyasining argumenti sifatida :ref:`maxsus selector <hoot/"
"custom-dom-selectors>` ni oladi (garchi `Node` yoki `Node` iterable'i ham "
"qabul qilinadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:485
msgid ""
"Expects the received `Target` to be `\"checked\"`, or to be "
"`\"indeterminate\"` if the homonymous option is set to `true`."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` `\"checked\"` bo'lishini kutadi, yoki shu nomdagi "
"opsiya `true` ga o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, `\"indeterminate\"` bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:490
msgid "`options`: `{ message?: string, indeterminate?: boolean }`"
msgstr "`options`: `{ message?: string, indeterminate?: boolean }`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:500
msgid "Expects the received `Target` to be *\"displayed\"*, meaning that:"
msgstr "Qabul qilingan `Target` *\"displayed\"* bo'lishini kutadi, ya'ni:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:502
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:544
msgid "it has a bounding box;"
msgstr "u bounding box'ga ega;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:503
msgid "it is contained in the root document."
msgstr "u root document ichida joylashgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:518
msgid ""
"Expects the received `Target` to be *\"enabled\"*, meaning that it matches "
"the `:enabled` pseudo-selector."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` *\"enabled\"* bo'lishini kutadi, ya'ni u `:enabled` "
"pseudo-selector'ga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:534
msgid ""
"Expects the received `Target` to be *\"focused\"* in its owner document."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` o'z owner document'ida *\"focused\"* bo'lishini "
"kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:542
msgid "Expects the received `Target` to be *\"visible\"*, meaning that:"
msgstr "Qabul qilingan `Target` *\"visible\"* bo'lishini kutadi, ya'ni:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:545
msgid "it is contained in the root document;"
msgstr "u root document ichida joylashgan;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:546
msgid "it is not hidden by CSS properties."
msgstr "u CSS xossalari bilan yashirilmagan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:561
msgid ""
"Expects the received `Target` to have the given attribute set, and for that "
"attribute value to match the given `value` if any."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target`da berilgan attribute o'rnatilgan bo'lishini va agar "
"`value` berilgan bo'lsa, o'sha attribute qiymati unga mos kelishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:566
msgid "`attribute`: `string`"
msgstr "`attribute`: `string`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:567
msgid "`value`: `string | number | RegExp`"
msgstr "`value`: `string | number | RegExp`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:579
msgid "Expects the received `Target` to have the given class name(s)."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` berilgan class nom(lar)iga ega bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:583
msgid "`className`: `string | string[]`"
msgstr "`className`: `string | string[]`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:595
msgid ""
"Expects the received `Target` to contain exactly `amount` element(s). Note "
"that the `amount` parameter can be omitted, in which case the function will "
"expect *at least* one element."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` aynan `amount` ta element saqlashini kutadi. E'tibor "
"bering, `amount` parametri tushirib qoldirilishi mumkin, bunday holda "
"funksiya *kamida* bitta element bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:601
msgid "`amount`: `number`"
msgstr "`amount`: `number`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:614
msgid ""
"Expects the `innerHTML` of the received `Target` to match the `expected` "
"value (upon formatting)."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target`ning `innerHTML` qiymati `expected` qiymatga "
"(formatlashdan keyin) mos kelishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:619
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:637
msgid "`expected`: `string | RegExp`"
msgstr "`expected`: `string | RegExp`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:620
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:638
msgid ""
"`options`: `{ message?: string, type?: \"html\" | \"xml\", tabSize?: number, "
"keepInlineTextNodes?: boolean }`"
msgstr ""
"`options`: `{ message?: string, type?: \"html\" | \"xml\", tabSize?: number, "
"keepInlineTextNodes?: boolean }`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:632
msgid ""
"Expects the `outerHTML` of the received `Target` to match the `expected` "
"value (upon formatting)."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target`ning `outerHTML` qiymati `expected` qiymatga "
"(formatlashdan keyin) mos kelishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:652
msgid ""
"Expects the received `Target` to have its given property value match the "
"given `value`. If no value is given: the matcher will instead check that the "
"given property exists on the target."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target`ning berilgan property qiymati `value` bilan mos "
"kelishini kutadi. Agar qiymat berilmasa: matcher buning o'rniga berilgan "
"property target'da mavjudligini tekshiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:658
msgid "`property`: `string`"
msgstr "`property`: `string`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:659
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:742
msgid "`value`: `any`"
msgstr "`value`: `any`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:672
msgid ""
"Expects the `DOMRect` of the received `Target` to match the given `rect` "
"object. The `rect` object can either be:"
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target`ning `DOMRect` qiymati berilgan `rect` obyektiga mos "
"kelishini kutadi. `rect` obyekti quyidagilardan biri bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:675
msgid "a `DOMRect` object;"
msgstr "`DOMRect` obyekti;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:676
msgid "a CSS selector string (to get the rect of the *only* matching element);"
msgstr ""
"CSS selector satri (*faqat* bitta mos keladigan element'ning rect'ini olish "
"uchun);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:677
msgid "a node."
msgstr "node."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:679
msgid ""
"If the resulting `rect` value is a node, then both nodes' rects will be "
"compared."
msgstr ""
"Agar natijadagi `rect` qiymati node bo'lsa, ikki node'ning rect'lari "
"solishtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:683
msgid "`rect`: `Partial<DOMRect> | Target`"
msgstr "`rect`: `Partial<DOMRect> | Target`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:684
msgid "`options`: `{ message?: string, trimPadding?: boolean }`"
msgstr "`options`: `{ message?: string, trimPadding?: boolean }`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:695
msgid "Expects the received `Target` to match the given style properties."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` berilgan style xossalariga mos kelishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:699
msgid "`style`: `string | Record<string, string | RegExp>`"
msgstr "`style`: `string | Record<string, string | RegExp>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:711
msgid "Expects the `text` content of the received `Target` to either:"
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target`ning `text` mazmuni quyidagilardan birini bajarishini "
"kutadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:713
msgid "be strictly equal to a given string;"
msgstr "berilgan satrga qat'iy teng bo'lishi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:714
msgid "match a given regular expression."
msgstr "berilgan regular expression'ga mos kelishi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:716
msgid ""
"Note: `innerHTML` is used to retrieve the text content to take CSS "
"visibility into account. This also means that text values from child "
"elements will be joined using a line-break as separator."
msgstr ""
"Eslatma: CSS ko'rinuvchanligini hisobga olish uchun matn mazmunini olishda "
"`innerHTML` ishlatiladi. Bu shuni ham anglatadiki, child element'lardan "
"olingan matn qiymatlari ajratuvchi sifatida satr uzilishi bilan "
"birlashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:722
msgid "`text`: `string | RegExp`"
msgstr "`text`: `string | RegExp`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:723
msgid "`options`: `{ message?: string, raw?: boolean }`"
msgstr "`options`: `{ message?: string, raw?: boolean }`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:734
msgid "Expects the value of the received `Target` to either:"
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan `Target` qiymati quyidagilardan birini bajarishini kutadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:736
msgid "be strictly equal to a given string or number;"
msgstr "berilgan satr yoki songa qat'iy teng bo'lishi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:737
msgid "match a given regular expression;"
msgstr "berilgan regular expression'ga mos kelishi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:738
msgid "contain file objects matching the given `files` list."
msgstr "berilgan `files` ro'yxatiga mos keladigan fayl obyektlarini saqlashi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:754
msgid "Static methods"
msgstr "Static method'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:756
msgid ""
"The `expect` helper function also contains static methods that can be used "
"to run through a detached testing flow that isn't bound to one specific "
"value at a certain moment."
msgstr ""
"`expect` helper funksiyasi shuningdek static method'larni ham saqlaydi — "
"ular ma'lum bir momentda aniq bir qiymatga bog'lanmagan alohida test oqimini "
"ishga tushirish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:760
msgid ""
"These methods are mainly used to register steps or errors in the scope of "
"the current test, and to evaluate them later on."
msgstr ""
"Bu method'lar asosan joriy test doirasida step'lar yoki xatolarni ro'yxatga "
"olish va ularni keyinroq baholash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:767
msgid ""
"Expects the current test to have the `expected` amount of assertions. This "
"number cannot be less than 1."
msgstr ""
"Joriy test `expected` miqdorda assertion'ga ega bo'lishini kutadi. Bu son 1 "
"dan kichik bo'lishi mumkin emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:771
msgid ""
"It is generally preferred to use :js:meth:`expect.step` "
"and :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps` instead as it is more reliable and allows "
"to test more extensively."
msgstr ""
"Odatda buning o'rniga :js:meth:`expect.step` "
"va :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps` dan foydalanish afzalroq, chunki bu "
"ishonchliroq va kengroq test qilish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:778
msgid "Expects the current test to have the `expected` amount of errors."
msgstr "Joriy test `expected` miqdorda xatoga ega bo'lishini kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:780
msgid ""
"This also means that from the moment this function is called, the test will "
"accept that amount of errors before being considered as failed."
msgstr ""
"Bu shuni ham anglatadiki, bu funksiya chaqirilgan momentdan boshlab test "
"muvaffaqiyatsiz deb hisoblanishidan oldin shu miqdordagi xatolarni qabul "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:787
msgid ""
"Registers a step for the current test, that can be consumed "
"by :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps`. Unconsumed steps will fail the test."
msgstr ""
"Joriy test uchun step ro'yxatga oladi, uni :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps` "
"iste'mol qilishi mumkin. Iste'mol qilinmagan step'lar testni muvaffaqiyatsiz "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:796
msgid ""
"Expects the received matchers to match the errors thrown since the start of "
"the test or the last call to :js:meth:`expect.verifyErrors`. Calling this "
"matcher will reset the list of current errors."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan matcher'lar test boshlanganidan "
"yoki :js:meth:`expect.verifyErrors` ga oxirgi murojaatdan keyin tashlangan "
"xatolarga mos kelishini kutadi. Bu matcher'ni chaqirish joriy xatolar "
"ro'yxatini tozalaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:810
msgid ""
"Expects the received steps to be equal to the steps emitted since the start "
"of the test or the last call to :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps`. Calling this "
"matcher will reset the list of current steps."
msgstr ""
"Qabul qilingan step'lar test boshlanganidan "
"yoki :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps` ga oxirgi murojaatdan keyin chiqarilgan "
"step'larga teng bo'lishini kutadi. Bu matcher'ni chaqirish joriy step'lar "
"ro'yxatini tozalaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:824
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:842
msgid "`Promise<boolean>`"
msgstr "`Promise<boolean>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:826
msgid ""
"Same as :js:meth:`expect.verifyErrors`, but will not immediatly fail if "
"errors are not caught yet, and will instead wait for a certain timeout "
"(default: 2000ms) to allow errors to be caught later."
msgstr ""
":js:meth:`expect.verifyErrors` bilan bir xil, biroq xatolar hali ushlanmagan "
"bo'lsa darhol muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lmaydi, buning o'rniga xatolar keyinroq "
"ushlanishiga imkon berish uchun ma'lum timeout (standart: 2000ms) kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:830
msgid ""
"Checks are performed initially, at the end of the timeout, and each time an "
"error is detected."
msgstr ""
"Tekshirishlar dastlab, timeout tugashida va har marta xato aniqlanganda "
"amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:844
msgid ""
"Same as :js:meth:`expect.verifySteps`, but will not immediatly fail if steps "
"have not been registered yet, and will instead wait for a certain timeout "
"(default: 2000ms) to allow steps to be registered later."
msgstr ""
":js:meth:`expect.verifySteps` bilan bir xil, biroq step'lar hali ro'yxatga "
"olinmagan bo'lsa darhol muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lmaydi, buning o'rniga step'lar "
"keyinroq ro'yxatga olinishiga imkon berish uchun ma'lum timeout (standart: "
"2000ms) kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:848
msgid ""
"Checks are performed initially, at the end of the timeout, and each time a "
"step is registered."
msgstr ""
"Tekshirishlar dastlab, timeout tugashida va har marta step ro'yxatga "
"olinganda amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:858
msgid "DOM: queries"
msgstr "DOM: query'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:863
msgid "Custom DOM selectors"
msgstr "Maxsus DOM selector'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:865
msgid ""
"Here's a brief section on DOM selectors in Hoot, as they support additional "
"pseudo-classes that can be used to target elements based on non-standard "
"features, such as their text content or their global position in the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda Hoot'dagi DOM selector'lar haqida qisqa bo'lim keltirilgan, chunki "
"ular qo'shimcha pseudo-class'larni qo'llab-quvvatlaydi — ular yordamida "
"element'larni nostandart xususiyatlari, masalan matn mazmuni yoki "
"document'dagi global joylashuvi bo'yicha tanlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:873
msgid "`:contains(text)`"
msgstr "`:contains(text)`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:870
msgid "matches nodes whose text content matches the given `text`"
msgstr "matn mazmuni berilgan `text`ga mos keladigan node'larni tanlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:872
msgid ""
"given *text* supports regular expression syntax (e.g. `:contains(/^foo.+/)`) "
"and is case-insensitive (unless using the `i` flag at the end of the regex)"
msgstr ""
"berilgan *text* regular expression sintaksisini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi (masalan "
"`:contains(/^foo.+/)`) va katta-kichik harfga sezgir emas (regex oxirida `i` "
"flag ishlatilmasa)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:876
msgid "`:displayed`"
msgstr "`:displayed`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:876
msgid "matches nodes that are *\"displayed\"* (see `isDisplayed`)"
msgstr ""
"*\"displayed\"* bo'lgan node'larga mos keladi (`isDisplayed` ga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:879
msgid "`:empty`"
msgstr "`:empty`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:879
msgid "matches nodes that have an empty content (value or text content)"
msgstr ""
"content'i bo'sh bo'lgan node'larga mos keladi (value yoki text content)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:882
msgid "`:eq(n)`"
msgstr "`:eq(n)`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:882
msgid "returns the *nth* node based on its global position (0-based index);"
msgstr ""
"global pozitsiyasiga ko'ra *n-chi* node'ni qaytaradi (0 dan boshlanadigan "
"indeks);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:885
msgid "`:first`"
msgstr "`:first`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:885
msgid "returns the first node matching the selector (in the whole document)"
msgstr ""
"selector'ga mos keladigan birinchi node'ni qaytaradi (butun document ichida)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:888
msgid "`:focusable`"
msgstr "`:focusable`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:888
msgid "matches nodes that can be *\"focused\"* (see `isFocusable`)"
msgstr ""
"*\"focused\"* bo'lishi mumkin bo'lgan node'larga mos keladi (`isFocusable` "
"ga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:891
msgid "`:hidden`"
msgstr "`:hidden`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:891
msgid "matches nodes that are *not* *\"visible\"* (see `isVisible`)"
msgstr ""
"*\"visible\"* *bo'lmagan* node'larga mos keladi (`isVisible` ga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:894
msgid "`:iframe`"
msgstr "`:iframe`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:894
msgid ""
"matches nodes that are `<iframe>` elements, and returns their `body` if it "
"is ready"
msgstr ""
"`<iframe>` element'lari bo'lgan node'larga mos keladi va agar tayyor bo'lsa, "
"ularning `body` sini qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:897
msgid "`:last`"
msgstr "`:last`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:897
msgid "returns the last node matching the selector (in the whole document)"
msgstr ""
"selector'ga mos keladigan oxirgi node'ni qaytaradi (butun document ichida)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:900
msgid "`:selected`"
msgstr "`:selected`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:900
msgid "matches nodes that are selected (e.g. `<option>` elements)"
msgstr "tanlangan node'larga mos keladi (masalan `<option>` element'lari)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:903
msgid "`:shadow`"
msgstr "`:shadow`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:903
msgid "matches nodes that have shadow roots, and returns their shadow root"
msgstr ""
"shadow root'ga ega node'larga mos keladi va ularning shadow root'ini "
"qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:906
msgid "`:scrollable`"
msgstr "`:scrollable`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:906
msgid "matches nodes that are scrollable (see `isScrollable`)"
msgstr "scroll qilinadigan node'larga mos keladi (`isScrollable` ga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:912
msgid "`:value(text)`"
msgstr "`:value(text)`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:909
msgid "matches nodes whose value matches the given `text`"
msgstr "value'si berilgan `text` ga mos keladigan node'larga mos keladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:911
msgid ""
"given *text* supports regular expression syntax (e.g. `:value(/^foo.+/)`) "
"and is case-insensitive (unless using the `i` flag at the end of the regex)"
msgstr ""
"berilgan *text* regular expression sintaksisini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi (masalan "
"`:value(/^foo.+/)`) va katta-kichik harfga sezgir emas (regex oxirida `i` "
"flag ishlatilmasa)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:915
msgid "`:visible`"
msgstr "`:visible`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:915
msgid "matches nodes that are *\"visible\"* (see `isVisible`)"
msgstr "*\"visible\"* bo'lgan node'larga mos keladi (`isVisible` ga qarang)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:918
msgid "Query & node properties helpers"
msgstr "Query va node xossalari uchun helper'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:920
msgid ""
"Hoot provides helpers to query nodes and some of their properties in a "
"streamlined and elegant way. This can mainly be done through the use of "
"`queryX` helpers:"
msgstr ""
"Hoot node'lar va ularning ba'zi xossalarini sodda va nafis usulda so'rash "
"uchun helper'lar taqdim etadi. Bu asosan `queryX` helper'lari yordamida "
"bajariladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:925
msgid ""
"Returns a list of nodes matching the given `Target`. This function can "
"either be used as a `template literal tag <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Template_literals#tagged_templates>`_ (only "
"supports string selector without options) or invoked the usual way."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `Target` ga mos keladigan node'lar ro'yxatini qaytaradi. Bu "
"funksiya `template literal tag <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"JavaScript/Reference/Template_literals#tagged_templates>`_ sifatida "
"ishlatilishi (faqat option'larsiz satrli selector'ni qo'llab-quvvatlaydi) "
"yoki oddiy usulda chaqirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:929
msgid "The target can be:"
msgstr "Target quyidagilar bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:931
msgid "a `Node` (or an iterable of nodes), or `Window` object;"
msgstr "`Node` (yoki node'lar iterable'i), yoki `Window` obyekti;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:932
msgid "a `Document` object (which will be converted to its body);"
msgstr "`Document` obyekti (u o'zining body'siga aylantiriladi);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:933
msgid ""
"a string representing a :ref:`custom selector <hoot/custom-dom-selectors>` "
"(which will be queried from the `root` option)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`custom selector <hoot/custom-dom-selectors>` ni ifodalovchi satr (u "
"`root` option'i ichidan so'raladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:936
msgid "An `options` object can be specified to filter [#]_ the results:"
msgstr ""
"Natijalarni filtrlash [#]_ uchun `options` obyektini ko'rsatish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:938
msgid ""
"`count`: the exact number of nodes to match (throws an error if the number "
"of nodes doesn't match);"
msgstr ""
"`count`: mos kelishi kerak bo'lgan node'larning aniq soni (agar node'lar "
"soni mos kelmasa, xato chiqaradi);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:940
msgid ""
"`displayed`: whether the nodes must be \"displayed\" (see `isDisplayed`);"
msgstr ""
"`displayed`: node'lar \"displayed\" bo'lishi shartmi (`isDisplayed` ga "
"qarang);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:941
msgid ""
"`focusable`: whether the nodes must be \"focusable\" (see `isFocusable`);"
msgstr ""
"`focusable`: node'lar \"focusable\" bo'lishi shartmi (`isFocusable` ga "
"qarang);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:942
msgid ""
"`root`: the root node to query the selector in (defaults to the current "
"fixture);"
msgstr ""
"`root`: selector so'raladigan root node (birlamchi qiymati — joriy fixture);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:943
msgid ""
"`visible`: whether the nodes must be \"visible\" (see `isVisible`). * This "
"option implies `displayed`"
msgstr ""
"`visible`: node'lar \"visible\" bo'lishi shartmi (`isVisible` ga qarang). * "
"Bu option `displayed` ni ham nazarda tutadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:946
msgid ""
"these filters (except for `count` and `root`) achieve the same result as "
"using their homonym pseudo-classes on the final group of the given selector "
"string, e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"bu filtrlar (`count` va `root` dan tashqari) berilgan selector satrining "
"oxirgi guruhida shu nomdagi pseudo-class'larni ishlatish bilan bir xil "
"natijaga erishadi, masalan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:955
msgid "`Node[]`"
msgstr "`Node[]`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:959
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryAll` on the given `target` and returns a list of "
"attribute values."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `target` ustida :js:meth:`queryAll` ni bajaradi va attribute "
"qiymatlari ro'yxatini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:962
msgid "`string[]` list of attribute values"
msgstr "`string[]` attribute qiymatlari ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:966
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryAll` on the given `target` and returns a list of "
"property values."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `target` ustida :js:meth:`queryAll` ni bajaradi va property "
"qiymatlari ro'yxatini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:969
msgid "`unknown[]` list of property values"
msgstr "`unknown[]` property qiymatlari ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:973
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryAll` on the given `target` and returns a list of "
"text contents."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `target` ustida :js:meth:`queryAll` ni bajaradi va text "
"content'lari ro'yxatini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:976
msgid "`string[]` list of text contents"
msgstr "`string[]` text content'lari ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:980
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryAll` on the given `target` and returns a list of "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `target` ustida :js:meth:`queryAll` ni bajaradi va qiymatlar "
"ro'yxatini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:983
msgid "`string[]` a list of values"
msgstr "`string[]` qiymatlar ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:987
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryOne` with the given arguments and returns the "
"value of the given `attribute` of the matching node."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan argumentlar bilan :js:meth:`queryOne` ni bajaradi va mos kelgan "
"node'ning berilgan `attribute` qiymatini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:990
msgid "`string` the attribute value"
msgstr "`string` attribute qiymati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:994
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryAll` with the given arguments and returns the "
"first result or `null`."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan argumentlar bilan :js:meth:`queryAll` ni bajaradi va birinchi "
"natijani yoki `null` ni qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:997
msgid "`Node` | `null` the first matching node"
msgstr "`Node` | `null` mos kelgan birinchi node"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1001
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryAll` with the given arguments, along with a forced "
"`count: 1` option to ensure only one node matches the given `Target`."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan argumentlar bilan :js:meth:`queryAll` ni bajaradi, shu bilan birga "
"majburiy `count: 1` option'ini qo'shadi — bu berilgan `Target` ga faqat "
"bitta node mos kelishini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1004
msgid "The returned value is a single node instead of a list of nodes."
msgstr "Qaytariladigan qiymat node'lar ro'yxati emas, bitta node bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1006
msgid "`Node` a single node"
msgstr "`Node` bitta node"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1010
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryOne` with the given arguments and returns the "
"*text* of the matching node."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan argumentlar bilan :js:meth:`queryOne` ni bajaradi va mos kelgan "
"node'ning *text*ini qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1013
msgid "`string` text of the matching node"
msgstr "`string` mos kelgan node'ning text'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1017
msgid ""
"Performs a :js:meth:`queryOne` with the given arguments and returns the "
"*value* of the matching node."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan argumentlar bilan :js:meth:`queryOne` ni bajaradi va mos keladigan "
"node'ning *qiymatini* qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1020
msgid "`string` value of the matching node"
msgstr "mos keladigan node'ning `string` qiymati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1022
msgid ""
"All of the above helpers are synchronous, meaning that they will attempt to "
"query nodes instantly. Although some use cases require the element to be "
"awaited for an arbitrary amount of time, unknown in advance due to UI "
"fetching and rendering complexity."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi barcha helper'lar sinxron, ya'ni node'larni bir zumda so'rashga "
"harakat qiladi. Ammo ba'zi holatlarda element'ni ma'lum bo'lmagan vaqt "
"davomida kutish kerak bo'ladi, chunki UI ma'lumot olish va rendering "
"murakkabligi tufayli bu vaqtni oldindan bilish mumkin emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1026
msgid ""
"Hoot provides 2 methods to wait for an element to appear / disappear within "
"a certain time frame (by default: `200` milliseconds) for such cases:"
msgstr ""
"Bunday holatlar uchun Hoot element'ning ma'lum vaqt oralig'ida (standart "
"holatda: `200` millisekund) paydo bo'lishi / yo'qolishini kutadigan 2 ta "
"method taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1031
msgid ""
"Combination of :js:meth:`queryAll` and :js:meth:`waitUntil`: waits for a "
"given target to match elements in the DOM and returns the first matching "
"node when it appears (or immediately if it is already present)."
msgstr ""
":js:meth:`queryAll` va :js:meth:`waitUntil` birlashmasi: berilgan target "
"DOM'dagi element'larga mos kelishini kutadi va u paydo bo'lganda birinchi "
"mos node'ni qaytaradi (yoki agar allaqachon mavjud bo'lsa, darhol qaytaradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1035
msgid "`Promise<Node>` containing the first matching node"
msgstr "birinchi mos keladigan node'ni saqlaydigan `Promise<Node>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1039
msgid ""
"Opposite of :js:meth:`waitFor` waits for a given target to disappear from "
"the DOM."
msgstr ""
":js:meth:`waitFor` ning teskarisi — berilgan target DOM'dan yo'qolishini "
"kutadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1041
msgid "`Promise<number>` containing the number of matching nodes"
msgstr "mos keladigan node'lar sonini saqlaydigan `Promise<number>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1045
msgid "DOM: interaction helpers"
msgstr "DOM: interaction helper'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1047
msgid ""
"Along with querying elements, it is often required to interact with them. As "
"such, Hoot provides helpers to simulate various user interactions on "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"Element'larni so'rash bilan bir qatorda, ular bilan o'zaro ishlash ham ko'p "
"talab qilinadi. Shu sababli Hoot element'lar ustida turli foydalanuvchi "
"harakatlarini simulyatsiya qilish uchun helper'lar taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1050
msgid ""
"These can be split into 2 types based on their parameters: **pointer-based** "
"interaction helpers, and the **other** ones."
msgstr ""
"Ularni parametrlariga qarab 2 turga bo'lish mumkin: **pointer'ga "
"asoslangan** interaction helper'lari va **boshqa** helper'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1054
msgid "Pointer interaction helpers:"
msgstr "Pointer interaction helper'lari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1056
msgid ""
"Pointer interaction helpers (such as :js:meth:`click` or :js:meth:`drag`) "
"will simulate actual pointer movements and events on the given target, and "
"on any previous element the pointer was *supposed* to have been."
msgstr ""
"Pointer interaction helper'lari (masalan :js:meth:`click` "
"yoki :js:meth:`drag`) berilgan target ustida, shuningdek pointer *bo'lishi "
"kerak bo'lgan* har qanday oldingi element ustida haqiqiy pointer harakatlari "
"va event'larini simulyatsiya qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1062
msgid "Ensures that the given `Target` is checked."
msgstr "Berilgan `Target` belgilanganligini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1064
msgid ""
"If it is not checked, a :js:meth:`click` is simulated on the input. If the "
"input is still not checked after the click, an error is thrown."
msgstr ""
"Agar u belgilanmagan bo'lsa, input ustida :js:meth:`click` simulyatsiya "
"qilinadi. Agar click'dan keyin ham input belgilanmagan bo'lsa, xato "
"chiqariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1067
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1090
