msgstr "`scroll`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1199
msgid "Sets the given value to the current \"input[type=range]\" `Target`."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan qiymatni joriy \"input[type=range]\" `Target` uchun o'rnatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1204
msgid "`input`"
msgstr "`input`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1205
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1386
msgid "`change`"
msgstr "`change`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1212
msgid "Ensures that the given `Target` is unchecked."
msgstr "Berilgan `Target` belgisi olib tashlanganligini ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1214
msgid ""
"If it is checked, a :js:meth:`click` is triggered on the input. If the input "
"is still checked after the click, an error is thrown."
msgstr ""
"Agar u belgilangan bo'lsa, input ustida :js:meth:`click` ishga tushiriladi. "
"Agar click'dan keyin ham input belgilangan bo'lsa, xato chiqariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1224
msgid "Other interaction helpers:"
msgstr "Boshqa interaction helper'lari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1226
msgid ""
"Other interaction helpers will not have a `target` parameter. It is not "
"needed, since pressing keys on a keyboard (for example) is done on the "
"current *active element*."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa interaction helper'larida `target` parametri bo'lmaydi. U kerak emas, "
"chunki klaviaturada tugmalarni bosish (masalan) joriy *active element* "
"ustida amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1231
msgid "Clears the value of the current *active element*."
msgstr "Joriy *active element* qiymatini tozalaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1233
msgid "This is done using the following sequence:"
msgstr "Bu quyidagi ketma-ketlik yordamida amalga oshiriladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1235
msgid "pressing `\"Control\"` & `\"A\"` to select the whole value;"
msgstr ""
"butun qiymatni tanlash uchun `\"Control\"` va `\"A\"` tugmalarini bosish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1236
msgid "pressing `\"Backspace\"` to delete the value;"
msgstr "qiymatni o'chirish uchun `\"Backspace\"` tugmasini bosish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1237
msgid "(optional) triggering a `\"change\"` event by pressing `\"Enter\"`."
msgstr ""
"(ixtiyoriy) `\"Enter\"` tugmasini bosib `\"change\"` event'ini ishga "
"tushirish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1247
msgid "Combination of :js:meth:`clear` and :js:meth:`fill`:"
msgstr ":js:meth:`clear` va :js:meth:`fill` kombinatsiyasi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1249
msgid "first, clears the input value (if any)"
msgstr "avvalo, input qiymatini tozalaydi (agar mavjud bo'lsa)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1250
msgid "then fills the input with the given value"
msgstr "so'ngra input'ni berilgan qiymat bilan to'ldiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1261
msgid ""
"Fills the current *active element* with the given `value`. This helper is "
"intended for `<input>` and `<textarea>` elements, with the exception of "
"`\"checkbox\"` and `\"radio\"` types, which should be selected using the "
"`check` helper."
msgstr ""
"Joriy *active element*ni berilgan `value` bilan to'ldiradi. Bu helper "
"`<input>` va `<textarea>` elementlari uchun mo'ljallangan, `\"checkbox\"` va "
"`\"radio\"` turlaridan tashqari — ularni `check` helper'i bilan tanlash "
"kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1265
msgid ""
"If the target is an editable input, its string `value` will be input one "
"character at a time, each generating its corresponding keyboard event "
"sequence. This behavior can be overridden by passing the `instantly` option, "
"which will instead simulate a `control` + `v` keyboard sequence, resulting "
"in the whole text being pasted."
msgstr ""
"Agar target tahrirlanadigan input bo'lsa, uning `value` satri bir vaqtda "
"bitta belgi bo'lib kiritiladi va har biri mos keladigan klaviatura event "
"ketma-ketligini hosil qiladi. Bu xatti-harakatni `instantly` option'ini "
"uzatib override qilish mumkin — u buning o'rniga `control` + `v` klaviatura "
"ketma-ketligini simulyatsiya qiladi va natijada butun matn qo'yiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1270
msgid ""
"Note that the given value is appended to the current value of the element."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, berilgan qiymat element'ning joriy qiymatiga qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1272
msgid ""
"If the active element is a `<input type=\"file\"/>`, the `value` should be a "
"`File`/list of `File` object(s)."
msgstr ""
"Agar active element `<input type=\"file\"/>` bo'lsa, `value` `File` yoki "
"`File` object'lari ro'yxati bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1285
msgid "Performs a key down sequence on the current *active element*."
msgstr "Joriy *active element* ustida key down ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1289
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1348
msgid "`keydown`"
msgstr "`keydown`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1291
msgid "Additional actions will be performed depending on the key pressed:"
msgstr "Bosilgan tugmaga qarab qo'shimcha amallar bajariladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1293
msgid "`Tab`: focus next (or previous with `shift`) focusable element;"
msgstr ""
"`Tab`: keyingi (yoki `shift` bilan oldingi) fokus olishi mumkin bo'lgan "
"element'ga fokus beradi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1294
msgid "`c`: copy current selection to clipboard;"
msgstr "`c`: joriy tanlovni clipboard'ga nusxalaydi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1295
msgid "`v`: paste current clipboard content to current element;"
msgstr "`v`: clipboard'ning joriy mazmunini joriy element'ga qo'yadi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1296
msgid ""
"`Enter`: submit the form if the target is a `<button type=\"button\">` or a "
"`<form>` element, or trigger a `change` event on the target if it is an "
"`<input>` element;"
msgstr ""
"`Enter`: agar target `<button type=\"button\">` yoki `<form>` element "
"bo'lsa, form'ni yuboradi; agar `<input>` element bo'lsa, target ustida "
"`change` event'ini ishga tushiradi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1299
msgid ""
"`Space`: trigger a `click` event on the target if it is an `<input "
"type=\"checkbox\">` element."
msgstr ""
"`Space`: agar target `<input type=\"checkbox\">` element bo'lsa, uning "
"ustida `click` event'ini ishga tushiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1310
msgid "Performs a key up sequence on the current *active element*."
msgstr "Joriy *active element* ustida key up ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1314
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1349
msgid "`keyup`"
msgstr "`keyup`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1324
msgid "Performs a leave sequence on the current `Window`."
msgstr "Joriy `Window` ustida leave ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1331
msgid "`pointerout`"
msgstr "`pointerout`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1332
msgid "[desktop] `mouseout`"
msgstr "[desktop] `mouseout`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1333
msgid "`pointerleave`"
msgstr "`pointerleave`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1334
msgid "[desktop] `mouseleave`"
msgstr "[desktop] `mouseleave`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1344
msgid "Performs a keyboard event sequence on the current *active element*."
msgstr ""
"Joriy *active element* ustida klaviatura event ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1364
msgid "Performs a resize event sequence on the current `Window`."
msgstr "Joriy `Window` ustida resize event ketma-ketligini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1368
msgid "`resize`"
msgstr "`resize`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1370
msgid ""
"The target will be resized to the given dimensions, enforced by `!important` "
"style attributes."
msgstr ""
"Target berilgan o'lchamlarga o'zgartiriladi va bu `!important` style "
"atributlari bilan majburlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1381
msgid ""
"Performs a selection event sequence on the current active element. This "
"helper is intended for `<select>` elements only."
msgstr ""
"Joriy active element ustida tanlov event ketma-ketligini bajaradi. Bu helper "
"faqat `<select>` elementlari uchun mo'ljallangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1397
msgid ""
"Gives the given `File` list to the current file input. This helper only "
"works if a file input has been previously interacted with (by clicking on "
"it)."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `File` ro'yxatini joriy fayl input'iga uzatadi. Bu helper faqat "
"fayl input'i bilan avval o'zaro ta'sir bo'lgan bo'lsa (uni bosish orqali) "
"ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1404
msgid "Triggers a \"beforeunload\" event on the current `Window`."
msgstr "Joriy `Window` ustida \"beforeunload\" event'ini ishga tushiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1410
msgid "Mocks"
msgstr "Mock'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1412
msgid ""
"By default, a lot of low-level features are mocked by Hoot: `clipboard`, "
"`fetch`, `localStorage`, etc. These mocks are intended to not produce any "
"side-effect that would disturb the test runner or the context of other "
"tests, while still providing the same interface to allow tests to rely on "
"these features seamlessly."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha Hoot ko'plab quyi darajali imkoniyatlarni mock qiladi: "
"`clipboard`, `fetch`, `localStorage` va h.k. Bu mock'lar test runner'ni yoki "
"boshqa testlarning context'ini buzadigan hech qanday yon ta'sir hosil "
"qilmasligi uchun mo'ljallangan, shu bilan birga testlar bu imkoniyatlarga "
"muammosiz tayanishi uchun bir xil interface'ni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1417
msgid ""
"There is also a need (most of the time) to force actions on these features "
"or change their behavior for a test, so there exist helpers to interact with "
"these mocked features. The following sections will list the main mocked "
"features and the means to interact with them."
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek (ko'p hollarda) bu imkoniyatlar ustida amallarni majburlash yoki "
"test uchun ularning xatti-harakatini o'zgartirish zarurati tug'iladi, shu "
"sababli bu mock qilingan imkoniyatlar bilan ishlash uchun helper'lar mavjud. "
"Quyidagi bo'limlarda asosiy mock qilingan imkoniyatlar va ular bilan ishlash "
"vositalari keltiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1422
msgid "Time"
msgstr "Vaqt"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1424
msgid ""
"Most asynchronous features are mocked: \"timers\" (`setTimeout`, "
"`setInterval` and `requestAnimationFrame`), `Date` and `performance` all "
"behave normally, but can be canceled or sped-up manually to considerably "
"shorten the actual duration of tests. For example: all \"timers\" are "
"canceled at the end of each test to avoid side-effects for the next one."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pchilik asinxron imkoniyatlar mock qilingan: \"timer\"lar (`setTimeout`, "
"`setInterval` va `requestAnimationFrame`), `Date` va `performance` — "
"barchasi odatdagidek ishlaydi, biroq testlarning haqiqiy davomiyligini "
"sezilarli qisqartirish uchun qo'lda bekor qilinishi yoki tezlashtirilishi "
"mumkin. Masalan: keyingi test uchun yon ta'sirlardan qochish maqsadida har "
"bir testning oxirida barcha \"timer\"lar bekor qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1430
msgid "There are 2 main timing behaviors that are *NOT* mocked:"
msgstr "Mock *QILINMAYDIGAN* 2 ta asosiy vaqt xatti-harakati bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1432
msgid "`Promise` objects and related API;"
msgstr "`Promise` object'lari va ular bilan bog'liq API;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1433
msgid ""
"OWL's timer functions: to wait for OWL rendering functions, you'll have to "
"resort to the `animationFrame` helper."
msgstr ""
"OWL'ning timer funksiyalari: OWL rendering funksiyalarini kutish uchun "
"`animationFrame` helper'iga murojaat qilishingiz kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1437
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1550
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1648
msgid "Related helpers"
msgstr "Bog'liq helper'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1441
msgid ""
"Calls `advanceTime` with the duration it would take for a given `frameCount` "
"amount of frames to have rendered in the UI (i.e. (1000 / current FPS) x "
"frame count)."
msgstr ""
"`advanceTime`ni UI'da berilgan `frameCount` miqdoridagi frame'lar render "
"bo'lishi uchun ketadigan davomiylik bilan chaqiradi (ya'ni (1000 / joriy "
"FPS) x frame soni)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1446
msgid ""
"Advances the current time by the given amount of milliseconds. This will "
"affect all timeouts, intervals, animations and date objects."
msgstr ""
"Joriy vaqtni berilgan millisekundlar miqdoriga siljitadi. Bu barcha "
"timeout'lar, interval'lar, animatsiyalar va sana object'lariga ta'sir qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1449
msgid ""
"It returns a promise resolved after all related callbacks have been executed."
msgstr ""
"U barcha bog'liq callback'lar bajarilgandan keyin resolve bo'ladigan promise "
"qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1451
msgid "`Promise<number>` time consumed by timers (in ms)"
msgstr "`Promise<number>` timer'lar sarflagan vaqt (ms'da)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1455
msgid ""
"Returns a promise resolved after the next animation frame, typically "
"allowing Owl components to render."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi animation frame'dan keyin resolve bo'ladigan promise qaytaradi — bu "
"odatda Owl component'lariga render bo'lish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1458
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1472
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1478
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1513
#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1523
msgid "`Promise<void>`"
msgstr "`Promise<void>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1462
msgid "Cancels all current timeouts, intervals and animations."
msgstr ""
"Barcha joriy timeout'lar, interval'lar va animatsiyalarni bekor qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1466
msgid ""
"Returns a promise resolved after a given amount of milliseconds (default to "
"`0`)."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan millisekundlar miqdoridan keyin resolve bo'ladigan promise "
"qaytaradi (sukut bo'yicha `0`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1476
msgid "Returns a promise resolved after the next microtask tick."
msgstr ""
"Keyingi microtask tick'idan keyin resolve bo'ladigan promise qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1482
msgid "Mocks the current date and time, and also the time zone if any."
msgstr ""
"Joriy sana va vaqtni, shuningdek berilgan bo'lsa time zone'ni ham mock "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1484
msgid ""
"Date can either be an object describing the date and time to mock, or a "
"string in SQL or ISO format (time and millisecond values can be omitted). "
"See :js:meth:`mockTimeZone` for the time zone params."
msgstr ""
"Sana mock qilinadigan sana va vaqtni tavsiflovchi object bo'lishi mumkin, "
"yoki SQL yoki ISO formatidagi satr bo'lishi mumkin (vaqt va millisekund "
"qiymatlarini tushirib qoldirish mumkin). Time zone parametrlari "
"uchun :js:meth:`mockTimeZone` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1496
msgid "Mocks the current time zone."
msgstr "Joriy time zone'ni mock qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1498
msgid "Time zone can either be a locale, a time zone or an offset."
msgstr "Time zone locale, time zone yoki offset bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1500
msgid "Returns a function restoring the default zone."
msgstr "Sukut bo'yicha zonani tiklaydigan funksiya qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1510
msgid ""
"Calculates the amount of time needed to run all current timeouts, intervals "
"and animations, and then advances the current time by that amount."
msgstr ""
"Barcha joriy timeout'lar, interval'lar va animatsiyalarni bajarish uchun "
"kerak bo'lgan vaqt miqdorini hisoblaydi, so'ngra joriy vaqtni shu miqdorga "
"siljitadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1517
msgid ""
"Sets the current frame rate (in fps) used by animation frames (default to "
"60fps)."
msgstr ""
"Animation frame'lar tomonidan ishlatiladigan joriy frame tezligini (fps'da) "
"belgilaydi (sukut bo'yicha 60fps)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1521
msgid "Returns a promise resolved after the next task tick."
msgstr "Keyingi task tick'idan keyin resolve bo'ladigan promise qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1527
msgid ""
"Returns a promise fulfilled when the given `predicate` returns a truthy "
"value, with the value of the promise being the return value of the "
"`predicate`."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `predicate` truthy qiymat qaytarganda fulfilled bo'ladigan promise "
"qaytaradi, promise'ning qiymati esa `predicate`ning qaytargan qiymati "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1530
msgid ""
"The `predicate` is run once initially and then each time the DOM is mutated "
"(see `observe` for more information)."
msgstr ""
"`predicate` boshida bir marta, so'ngra DOM har o'zgarganda ishga tushadi "
"(qo'shimcha ma'lumot uchun `observe`ga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1533
msgid ""
"The promise automatically rejects after a given `timeout` (defaults to 5 "
"seconds)."
msgstr ""
"Promise berilgan `timeout`dan keyin avtomatik ravishda reject bo'ladi (sukut "
"bo'yicha 5 sekund)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1535
msgid "`Promise<unknown>` promise with the return value of the predicate"
msgstr "`Promise<unknown>` predicate qaytargan qiymatga ega promise"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1538
msgid "Network"
msgstr "Tarmoq"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1540
msgid ""
"In general, we don't want to perform actual network calls in tests. To "
"ensure this, all calls to `fetch` and `XMLHttpRequest` have been re-routed "
"to a function given to :js:meth:`mockFetch`."
msgstr ""
"Umuman olganda, testlarda haqiqiy network chaqiruvlarini bajarishni "
"xohlamaymiz. Buni ta'minlash uchun `fetch` va `XMLHttpRequest` ga bo'lgan "
"barcha chaqiruvlar :js:meth:`mockFetch` ga berilgan funksiyaga qayta "
"yo'naltirilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1545
msgid ""
"In Odoo, this is generally implicitly handled by a :ref:`MockServer <mock-"
"server/configuration>` which is spawned by the mock environment, i.e. any "
"time a component is rendered using the :ref:`mountWithCleanup <web-test-"
"helpers/components>` helper."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da buni odatda mock environment tomonidan ishga "
"tushiriladigan :ref:`MockServer <mock-server/configuration>` yashirin tarzda "
"bajaradi, ya'ni component :ref:`mountWithCleanup <web-test-helpers/"
"components>` helper'i bilan render qilinganda har doim."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1554
msgid "Mocks the fetch function by replacing it with a given `fetchFn`."
msgstr "fetch funksiyasini berilgan `fetchFn` bilan almashtirib mock qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1556
msgid ""
"The return value of `fetchFn` is used as the response of the mocked fetch, "
"or wrapped in a `MockResponse` object if it does not meet the required "
"format."
msgstr ""
"`fetchFn` qaytargan qiymat mock qilingan fetch'ning response'i sifatida "
"ishlatiladi yoki talab qilingan formatga mos kelmasa, `MockResponse` "
"object'iga o'raladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1579
msgid "Activates mock WebSocket classe:"
msgstr "Mock WebSocket class'ini faollashtiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1581
msgid ""
"websocket connections will be handled by `window.fetch` "
"(see :js:meth:`mockFetch`);"
msgstr ""
"websocket ulanishlari `window.fetch` tomonidan boshqariladi "
"(:js:meth:`mockFetch` ga qarang);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1583
msgid ""
"the `onWebSocketConnected` callback will be called after a websocket has "
"been created."
msgstr ""
"`onWebSocketConnected` callback'i websocket yaratilgandan keyin chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1587
msgid "Activates mock `Worker` and `SharedWorker` classes:"
msgstr "Mock `Worker` va `SharedWorker` class'larini faollashtiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1589
msgid ""
"actual code fetched by worker URLs will then be handled by `window.fetch` "
"(see :js:meth:`mockFetch`);"
msgstr ""
"worker URL manzillari orqali olinadigan haqiqiy kod `window.fetch` tomonidan "
"boshqariladi (:js:meth:`mockFetch` ga qarang);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1591
msgid ""
"the `onWorkerConnected` callback will be called after a worker has been "
"created."
msgstr "`onWorkerConnected` callback'i worker yaratilgandan keyin chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1594
msgid "Notable global features"
msgstr "E'tiborga loyiq global imkoniyatlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1596
msgid ""
"The following features may not have any specific mocked feature added, but "
"they do work as expected without changing the actual properties they were "
"meant to:"
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi imkoniyatlarga alohida mock qilingan xususiyat qo'shilmagan "
"bo'lishi mumkin, lekin ular mo'ljallangan haqiqiy property'larni "
"o'zgartirmasdan kutilganidek ishlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1599
msgid "`Document <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Document <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Document>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1601
msgid ""
"Both `title` and `cookie` can be set and read without changing the actual "
"properties of the current document."
msgstr ""
"`title` ham, `cookie` ham joriy document'ning haqiqiy property'larini "
"o'zgartirmasdan o'rnatilishi va o'qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1604
msgid "`History <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/History>`_"
msgstr "`History <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/History>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1606
msgid ""
"The `history` API is mocked and bound to the `mockLocation` object to return "
"the same values and provide consistency."
msgstr ""
"`history` API mock qilingan va bir xil qiymatlarni qaytarish hamda "
"izchillikni ta'minlash uchun `mockLocation` object'iga bog'langan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1609
msgid "`Location <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Location>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Location <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Location>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1611
msgid ""
"Hoot returns a `mockLocation` object to use instead of `window.location`, "
"but this relies on the use of an indirection in the actual production code."
msgstr ""
"Hoot `window.location` o'rniga ishlatish uchun `mockLocation` object'ini "
"qaytaradi, lekin bu haqiqiy production kodida indirection ishlatilishiga "
"tayanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1615
msgid ""
"This feature will only work if an indirection is set between production code "
"and calls to `window.location`. In Odoo, it works because the `@web/core/"
"browser` module provides such an indirection, and that module is mocked in "
"test environments to redirect to the `mockLocation` object."
msgstr ""
"Bu imkoniyat faqat production kodi va `window.location` chaqiruvlari "
"o'rtasida indirection o'rnatilgan bo'lsa ishlaydi. Odoo'da u ishlaydi, "
"chunki `@web/core/browser` module ana shunday indirection'ni beradi va bu "
"module test environment'larida `mockLocation` object'iga yo'naltirish uchun "
"mock qilingan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1620
msgid ""
"`Navigator <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Navigator <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Navigator>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1622
msgid ""
"Most used navigator features, such as the `clipboard` API and `userAgent`, "
"have been mocked to hijack their actual behaviors. Its `permissions` object "
"has been bound to a global mock of the permissions API."
msgstr ""
"Navigator'ning eng ko'p ishlatiladigan imkoniyatlari, masalan `clipboard` "
"API va `userAgent`, ularning haqiqiy xatti-harakatlarini ushlab olish uchun "
"mock qilingan. Uning `permissions` object'i permissions API'ning global "
"mock'iga bog'langan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1626
msgid ""
"`Notification <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"Notification>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Notification <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"Notification>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1628
msgid ""
"Notifications have been mocked, with the \"notification\" permissions bound "
"to the global mocked permissions API."
msgstr ""
"Notification'lar mock qilingan, \"notification\" permission'lari esa global "
"mock qilingan permissions API'ga bog'langan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1631
msgid ""
"`Permissions <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"Permissions_API>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Permissions <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/"
"Permissions_API>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1633
msgid ""
"Permissions can enable or disable other APIs by being given the "
"`\"granted\"` or `\"denied\"` statuses. This can be done through the "
"`mockPermission` helper."
msgstr ""
"Permission'lar `\"granted\"` yoki `\"denied\"` statuslari berilishi orqali "
"boshqa API'larni yoqishi yoki o'chirishi mumkin. Bu `mockPermission` "
"helper'i orqali amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1636
msgid "`Storage <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage>`_"
msgstr "`Storage <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1638
msgid "`localStorage` and `sessionStorage` both point to \"virtual\" storages."
msgstr ""
"`localStorage` va `sessionStorage` ikkalasi ham \"virtual\" storage'larga "
"ishora qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1640
msgid ""
"`Touch <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Touch_events>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Touch <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Touch_events>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1642
msgid ""
"Touch features can be force-activated or deactivated globally for a given "
"test/suite using the :js:meth:`mockTouch` helper. It will mock both the "
"presence of touch handlers like `ontouchstart` on window, as well as the "
"`\"pointer\"` media being set to `fine` or `coarse`."
msgstr ""
"Touch imkoniyatlari :js:meth:`mockTouch` helper'i yordamida ma'lum bir test/"
"suite uchun global tarzda majburan yoqilishi yoki o'chirilishi mumkin. U "
"window'dagi `ontouchstart` kabi touch handler'larining mavjudligini ham, "
"`\"pointer\"` media'sining `fine` yoki `coarse` ga o'rnatilishini ham mock "
"qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1652
msgid ""
"Sets the given value for the given permission. This allows to enable or "
"prevent certain APIs (see the `Permissions API <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Permissions_API>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Berilgan permission uchun berilgan qiymatni o'rnatadi. Bu ma'lum API'larni "
"yoqish yoki taqiqlash imkonini beradi (`Permissions API <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Permissions_API>`_ ga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/hoot.rst:1662
msgid "Toggles touch features on or off in the current `Window`."
msgstr "Joriy `Window` da touch imkoniyatlarini yoqadi yoki o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:3
msgid "Mock server"
msgstr "Mock server"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:6
msgid "Rationale"
msgstr "Asos"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:8
msgid ""
"Test cases can range in complexity; from testing the return value of a "
"simple helper function, to rendering an entire webclient to simulate "
"interactions across several components/services."
msgstr ""
"Test case'lar murakkabligi bo'yicha turlicha bo'lishi mumkin: oddiy helper "
"funksiyaning qaytargan qiymatini tekshirishdan tortib, bir nechta component/"
"service o'rtasidagi o'zaro ta'sirni simulyatsiya qilish uchun butun "
"webclient'ni render qilishgacha."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:12
msgid ""
"In the latter cases, many interactions will trigger server requests, without "
"which the components or features will stop functioning properly. However, it "
"is important that these requests *do not* land on the actual server, as they "
"could affect the database, which is definitely not something a test should "
"be doing."
msgstr ""
"Ikkinchi holatda ko'plab o'zaro ta'sirlar server request'larini keltirib "
"chiqaradi va ularsiz component'lar yoki imkoniyatlar to'g'ri ishlashdan "
"to'xtaydi. Ammo bu request'lar haqiqiy serverga *tushmasligi* muhim, chunki "
"ular ma'lumotlar bazasiga ta'sir qilishi mumkin, bu esa test qilmasligi "
"kerak bo'lgan ishdir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:17
msgid ""
"To overcome this, each request should be intercepted and replaced by a "
"function emulating actual server responses with test (i.e. fake) data."
msgstr ""
"Buning oldini olish uchun har bir request ushlab olinishi va haqiqiy server "
"response'larini test (ya'ni soxta) ma'lumotlar bilan taqlid qiluvchi "
"funksiya bilan almashtirilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:20
msgid ""
"Since some of these requests are very common (e.g. ORM calls, such as "
"`web_search_read` or `web_save`, or other methods such as `get_views`), a "
"mock server has been implemented by default for every test that spawns "
"an :abbr:`env (Odoo environment)` [#]_."
msgstr ""
"Bu request'larning ba'zilari juda ko'p uchraganligi sababli (masalan "
"`web_search_read` yoki `web_save` kabi ORM chaqiruvlari yoki `get_views` "
"kabi boshqa method'lar), :abbr:`env (Odoo environment)` ishga tushiradigan "
"har bir test uchun standart holda mock server amalga oshirilgan [#]_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:24
msgid ""
"These mock servers act independently for each test, can be configured "
"separately, and provide out of the box helpers for the most used routes in "
"Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Bu mock server'lar har bir test uchun mustaqil ishlaydi, alohida sozlanishi "
"mumkin va Odoo'da eng ko'p ishlatiladigan route'lar uchun tayyor helper'lar "
"taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:27
msgid ""
"A mock server is needed as soon as an environment is spawned because "
"some :doc:`services <../services>` do send server requests as soon as they "
"start."
msgstr ""
"Mock server environment ishga tushirilishi bilanoq kerak bo'ladi, chunki "
"ba'zi :doc:`services <../services>` ishga tushishi bilanoq server "
"request'larini yuboradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:33
msgid ""
"A mock server is actually quite simple in itself: it is an object containing "
"a *collection* of all defined mock models, and a *mapping* between routes "
"and callbacks returning the test data."
msgstr ""
"Mock server o'z-o'zidan ancha oddiy: u aniqlangan barcha mock model'larning "
"*to'plamini* va route'lar bilan test ma'lumotlarini qaytaruvchi callback'lar "
"o'rtasidagi *moslikni* o'z ichiga olgan object'dir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:37
msgid ""
"The mock models themselves hold most of the CRUD logic, as well as the data "
"used to simulate server records."
msgstr ""
"Mock model'larning o'zi CRUD logikasining asosiy qismini, shuningdek server "
"record'larini simulyatsiya qilish uchun ishlatiladigan ma'lumotlarni "
"saqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:40
msgid ""
"Once a mock server starts, it hijacks *all* server requests, and for each of "
"them it will check in its *mapping* whether one of its registered routes "
"matches the requested URL. The most notable example of its pre-defined "
"routes is `/web/dataset/call_kw`, which is responsible for calling an ORM "
"method on the appropriate mock model."
msgstr ""
"Mock server ishga tushgach, *barcha* server request'larini ushlab oladi va "
"ularning har biri uchun o'zining *mosligida* ro'yxatdan o'tgan route'laridan "
"biri so'ralgan URL'ga mos kelishini tekshiradi. Uning oldindan aniqlangan "
"route'larining eng e'tiborli namunasi `/web/dataset/call_kw` bo'lib, u mos "
"mock model'da ORM method'ini chaqirish uchun javobgardir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:47
msgid ""
"Like most test helpers not provided by Hoot, mock server-related helpers and "
"classes can be found in the `\"@web/../tests/web_test_helpers\"` module."
msgstr ""
"Hoot tomonidan taqdim etilmagan ko'pchilik test helper'lari singari, mock "
"server bilan bog'liq helper'lar va class'lar `\"@web/../tests/"
"web_test_helpers\"` module'ida joylashgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:55
msgid ""
"By default, a mock server is *\"empty\"*, meaning that it has no defined "
"mock model."
msgstr ""
"Standart holda mock server *\"bo'sh\"*, ya'ni unda aniqlangan mock model "
"yo'q."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:57
msgid ""
"This does not mean that it is useless though, as it will already handle a "
"few pre-defined routes, such as the ones responsible for fetching `menus` "
"and `translations`, which are spawned by :doc:`services <../services>` as "
"soon as an `env` is spawned."
msgstr ""
"Bu uning foydasiz ekanini bildirmaydi, chunki u allaqachon bir nechta "
"oldindan aniqlangan route'ni boshqaradi, masalan `menus` va `translations` "
"ni olish uchun javobgar bo'lganlarini, ular `env` ishga tushirilishi "
"bilanoq :doc:`services <../services>` tomonidan yuboriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:61
msgid ""
"But this means that ORM methods will fail, as the model that they target has "
"not been defined yet."
msgstr ""
"Lekin bu ORM method'lari muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lishini bildiradi, chunki ular "
"mo'ljallagan model hali aniqlanmagan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:64
msgid "To create and define a mock model, you need 2 things:"
msgstr "Mock model yaratish va aniqlash uchun sizga 2 narsa kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:66
msgid "a `class` extending the `models.Model` class;"
msgstr "`models.Model` class'ini kengaytiruvchi `class`;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:68
msgid ""
"special keys prefixed with a `_` act as metadata holders, like in Python "
"(e.g. `_name`, `_order`, `_description`, etc.) [#]_ [#]_;"
msgstr ""
"`_` bilan boshlanadigan maxsus kalitlar Python'dagi kabi metadata "
"saqlovchisi vazifasini bajaradi (masalan `_name`, `_order`, `_description` "
"va h.k.) [#]_ [#]_;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:71
msgid "`_records` holds the list of objects representing fake record data;"
msgstr ""
"`_records` soxta record ma'lumotlarini ifodalovchi object'lar ro'yxatini "
"saqlaydi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:73
msgid "`_views` can be a mapping of view types and XML arches;"
msgstr "`_views` view turlari va XML arch'lari moslashuvi bo'lishi mumkin;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:75
msgid ""
"other `public class fields <public-class-fields_>`_ will be interpreted as "
"fields (by calling the appropriate method from `fields`);"
msgstr ""
"boshqa `public class fields <public-class-fields_>`_ field sifatida talqin "
"qilinadi (`fields` dan mos method'ni chaqirish orqali);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:78
msgid ""
"model-specific methods (such as `has_group` for `\"res.users\"`) can also be "
"defined here."
msgstr ""
"model'ga xos method'lar (masalan `\"res.users\"` uchun `has_group`) ham shu "
"yerda aniqlanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:81
msgid "calling `defineModels` with the class defined above."
msgstr "yuqorida aniqlangan class bilan `defineModels` ni chaqirish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:83
msgid ""
"Only a subset of these special keys will have an actual effect. For example, "
"`_inherit` will not work as intended, prefer standard class extension."
msgstr ""
"Bu maxsus kalitlarning faqat bir qismi haqiqiy ta'sir ko'rsatadi. Masalan, "
"`_inherit` mo'ljallanganidek ishlamaydi, standart class kengaytmasini "
"tanlang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:86
msgid ""
"These can be altered by each test without thinking about cleaning up: any "
"change performed on a special key will be reverted at the end of a test."
msgstr ""
"Bularni har bir test tozalash haqida o'ylamasdan o'zgartirishi mumkin: "
"maxsus kalitga kiritilgan har qanday o'zgarish test oxirida qaytariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:89
msgid "Here is a basic example of a simple, fake, `\"res.partner\"` model:"
msgstr ""
"Quyida oddiy, soxta `\"res.partner\"` model'ining asosiy misoli keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:120
msgid ""
"This code will make these data available for *all* tests in the current test "
"file. Of course, defining a class and calling `defineModels` can also be "
"done from *within* a given test to limit the scope of that model to the "
"current test."
msgstr ""
"Bu kod ushbu ma'lumotlarni joriy test faylidagi *barcha* testlar uchun "
"mavjud qiladi. Albatta, class aniqlash va `defineModels` ni chaqirish ma'lum "
"bir testning *ichida* ham bajarilishi mumkin, bu esa o'sha model qamrovini "
"joriy test bilan cheklaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:124
msgid ""
"Other methods such as `defineMenus`, `defineActions` or `defineParams` can "
"also be used to configure the current mock server. Most of their API is "
"quite straightforward (i.e. they receive JSON-like descriptions of menus, "
"actions, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Joriy mock server'ni sozlash uchun `defineMenus`, `defineActions` yoki "
"`defineParams` kabi boshqa method'lardan ham foydalanish mumkin. Ularning "
"API'si asosan juda tushunarli (ya'ni ular menu, action va h.k. larning "
"JSON'ga o'xshash tavsiflarini qabul qiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:129
msgid "Mock models: requests"
msgstr "Mock model'lar: request'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:131
msgid ""
"Many test cases only require one or a few mock models to work. But "
"sometimes, it is either too bothersome to implement the mocking logic within "
"a model, or a *route* (i.e. server request URL) is simply not associated to "
"a Python model at all."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pgina test holatlari ishlashi uchun faqat bitta yoki bir nechta mock "
"model talab qiladi. Lekin ba'zan mocking logikasini model ichida amalga "
"oshirish juda noqulay bo'ladi yoki *route* (ya'ni server so'rovi URL "
"manzili) umuman Python model bilan bog'lanmagan bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:135
msgid ""
"In such cases, the `onRpc` method is to be called, to associate a route or "
"an ORM method to a callback."
msgstr ""
"Bunday holatlarda route yoki ORM method'ni callback bilan bog'lash uchun "
"`onRpc` method'i chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:139
msgid ""
"Multiple `onRpc` calls can be associated to the same route / ORM method; in "
"which case they will be called sequentially from last to first defined. "
"Returning a *non-null-or-undefined* value will interrupt the current chain, "
"and return that value as final result of the server request."
msgstr ""
"Bir xil route / ORM method'ga bir nechta `onRpc` chaqiruvi bog'lanishi "
"mumkin; bu holda ular oxirgi aniqlanganidan birinchisiga qarab ketma-ket "
"chaqiriladi. *non-null-or-undefined* qiymat qaytarilishi joriy zanjirni "
"to'xtatadi va o'sha qiymatni server so'rovining yakuniy natijasi sifatida "
"qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:144
msgid "It can be used in 4 different ways:"
msgstr "U 4 xil usulda ishlatilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:147
msgid "`onRpc`: with a route (`\"/\"`)"
msgstr "`onRpc`: route bilan (`\"/\"`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:149
msgid ""
"When the first argument is a `string` starting with a `\"/\"`, the callback "
"is expected to be a *route* callback, receiving a `Request_` object:"
msgstr ""
"Birinchi argument `\"/\"` bilan boshlanadigan `string` bo'lsa, callback "
"*route* callback'i bo'lishi kutiladi va u `Request_` obyektini qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:161
msgid ""
"By default, the return value of these callbacks are wrapped within the "
"`body` of a mock `Response_` object."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha bu callback'larning qaytish qiymati mock `Response_` "
"obyektining `body` ichiga o'raladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:164
msgid ""
"This is fine for most use-cases, but sometimes the callback needs to respond "
"with a `Response_` object with custom `status` or `headers`."
msgstr ""
"Bu ko'pchilik holatlar uchun yetarli, lekin ba'zan callback maxsus `status` "
"yoki `headers` bilan `Response_` obyektini qaytarishi kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:167
msgid ""
"In such cases, an *optional* dictionary can be passed as a 3rd argument to "
"specify whether the callback is to be considered *\"pure\"*, meaning that "
"its return value should be returned as-is to the server caller:"
msgstr ""
"Bunday holatlarda callback *\"pure\"* deb hisoblanishi kerakligini "
"ko'rsatish uchun 3-argument sifatida *majburiy bo'lmagan* dictionary "
"uzatilishi mumkin; bu uning qaytish qiymati server chaqiruvchisiga "
"o'zgarishsiz qaytarilishi kerakligini bildiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:180
msgid ""
"Using *\"pure\"* request callbacks can also be used to return anything else "
"than a `Response_` object, in which case the returned value will still be "
"wrapped in the body of a mock `Response_` to comply with the `fetch_` / "
"`XMLHttpRequest_` APIs."
msgstr ""
"*\"pure\"* so'rov callback'lari `Response_` obyektidan boshqa har qanday "
"narsani qaytarish uchun ham ishlatilishi mumkin; bu holda qaytarilgan qiymat "
"`fetch_` / `XMLHttpRequest_` API'lariga mos kelishi uchun baribir mock "
"`Response_` body'siga o'raladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:186
msgid "`onRpc`: with method name(s)"
msgstr "`onRpc`: method nom(lar)i bilan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:188
msgid ""
"When the first argument is a `string` *NOT* starting with a `\"/\"` or a "
"list of `strings`, the callback is expected to be an ORM callback, only "
"called when the request's `method` matches the one given as argument."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi argument `\"/\"` bilan boshlan*maydigan* `string` yoki `strings` "
"ro'yxati bo'lsa, callback ORM callback'i bo'lishi kutiladi va u faqat "
"so'rovning `method` qiymati argument sifatida berilganiga mos kelganda "
"chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:192
msgid "The callback will receive an object containing:"
msgstr "Callback quyidagilarni o'z ichiga olgan obyektni qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:194
msgid ""
"the *spread* `params` value contained in the request body (typically: "
"`args`, `kwargs`, `model` and `method`);"
msgstr ""
"so'rov body'sida joylashgan *spread* `params` qiymati (odatda: `args`, "
"`kwargs`, `model` va `method`);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:197
msgid ""
"a `parent()` function, which when invoked will call the defined ORM callback "
"*preceding* this one;"
msgstr ""
"`parent()` funksiyasi — chaqirilganda undan *oldin* aniqlangan ORM "
"callback'ini chaqiradi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:200
msgid ""
"a `route` key, containing the `pathname` of the request (typically: `/web/"
"dataset/call_kw`);"
msgstr ""
"`route` kaliti — so'rovning `pathname` qiymatini saqlaydi (odatda: `/web/"
"dataset/call_kw`);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:202
msgid "the `request` object."
msgstr "`request` obyekti."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:214
msgid "`onRpc`: with model name(s) AND method name(s)"
msgstr "`onRpc`: model nom(lar)i VA method nom(lar)i bilan"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:216
msgid "When:"
msgstr "Qachonki:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:218
msgid ""
"the first argument is a `string` *NOT* starting with a `\"/\"` or a list of "
"`strings`;"
msgstr ""
"birinchi argument `\"/\"` bilan boshlan*maydigan* `string` yoki `strings` "
"ro'yxati bo'lsa;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:220
msgid "the second argument is also a `string` or a list of `strings`;"
msgstr "ikkinchi argument ham `string` yoki `strings` ro'yxati bo'lsa;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:222
msgid ""
"Then the callback is expected to be an ORM callback, only called when the "
"request's `method` *AND* `model` match the ones given in the arguments."
msgstr ""
"Unda callback ORM callback'i bo'lishi kutiladi va u faqat so'rovning "
"`method` *VA* `model` qiymatlari argumentlarda berilganlariga mos kelganda "
"chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:225
msgid ""
"This works just the same as the above shape, with an added `model` filter:"
msgstr ""
"Bu yuqoridagi shakl bilan aynan bir xil ishlaydi, faqat qo'shimcha `model` "
"filtri bilan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:234
msgid "`onRpc`: for *every* ORM method/model"
msgstr "`onRpc`: *har bir* ORM method/model uchun"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:236
msgid ""
"When the *only* argument is a callback, it is expected to be an ORM callback "
"to be called for *every* ORM call:"
msgstr ""
"*Yagona* argument callback bo'lsa, u *har bir* ORM chaqiruvi uchun "
"chaqiriladigan ORM callback'i bo'lishi kutiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:246
msgid "Mock models: fields"
msgstr "Mock model'lar: field'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:248
msgid "Model fields can be declared in 2 ways:"
msgstr "Model field'lari 2 usulda e'lon qilinishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:250
msgid "as `public class fields <public-class-fields_>`_;"
msgstr "`public class fields <public-class-fields_>`_ sifatida;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:252
msgid "under the `_fields` special key. For example:"
msgstr "`_fields` maxsus kaliti ostida. Misol uchun:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:261
msgid ""
"Field constructors can take a parameters dictionary to dictate their "
"behaviour. It will be required for some of them, like relational fields, "
"which need a `relation` property to work correctly."
msgstr ""
"Field konstruktorlari o'z xatti-harakatini belgilash uchun parametrlar "
"dictionary'sini qabul qilishi mumkin. Ularning ba'zilari uchun bu majburiy "
"bo'ladi, masalan relational field'lar to'g'ri ishlashi uchun `relation` "
"xususiyatiga muhtoj."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:265
msgid ""
"There are limits to what can be done with a mock field compared to an actual "
"Python server field, but expect the most basic properties to be supported: "
"`readonly`, `required`, `string`, etc."
msgstr ""
"Haqiqiy Python server field'i bilan solishtirganda mock field bilan nima "
"qilish mumkinligining cheklovlari bor, lekin eng asosiy xususiyatlar qo'llab-"
"quvvatlanishini kutish mumkin: `readonly`, `required`, `string` va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:269
msgid ""
"`compute` and `related` do work for the most basic use-cases, but do not "
"expect them to function reliably as they would on the actual server."
msgstr ""
"`compute` va `related` eng oddiy holatlar uchun ishlaydi, lekin ularning "
"haqiqiy serverdagidek ishonchli ishlashini kutmang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:273
msgid ""
"There are 4 default fields pre-defined for each created model: `id`, "
"`display_name`, `created_at` and `updated_at`. They match their server-side "
"counterpart in their behaviour (e.g. `id` is incremental and `display_name` "
"has a `compute` function similar to its server counterpart), and can be "
"overridden if needed."
msgstr ""
"Yaratilgan har bir model uchun oldindan aniqlangan 4 ta standart field bor: "
"`id`, `display_name`, `created_at` va `updated_at`. Ular xatti-harakati "
"jihatidan server tomonidagi o'xshashlariga mos keladi (masalan, `id` "
"inkremental bo'ladi va `display_name` server tomonidagiga o'xshash `compute` "
"funksiyasiga ega) va zarur bo'lsa override qilinishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:279
msgid "Mock models: records"
msgstr "Mock model'lar: record'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:281
msgid ""
"Model records are generated based on each object contained in the `_records` "
"special key *when the model is loaded*. They are validated based on the "
"fields available on the current models; if a property does not match a field "
"defined on the model, an error is thrown."
msgstr ""
"Model record'lari *model yuklanganda* `_records` maxsus kalitida joylashgan "
"har bir obyekt asosida generatsiya qilinadi. Ular joriy model'larda mavjud "
"field'lar asosida tekshiriladi; agar biror xususiyat model'da aniqlangan "
"field'ga mos kelmasa, xato qaytariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:287
msgid ""
"`_records` *cannot* be altered *after* the model has been loaded, i.e. after "
"the mock server has started. This key is only used to generate initial "
"records. If records should be added *after* model creation, do it either "
"form the available components in the UI, or through direct ORM calls on the "
"mock server instance."
msgstr ""
"`_records` model yuklangandan *keyin*, ya'ni mock server ishga tushgandan "
"keyin o'zgartirilishi *mumkin emas*. Bu kalit faqat boshlang'ich "
"record'larni generatsiya qilish uchun ishlatiladi. Agar record'lar model "
"yaratilgandan *keyin* qo'shilishi kerak bo'lsa, buni UI'dagi mavjud "
"component'lar orqali yoki mock server instance'ida to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ORM "
"chaqiruvlari orqali bajaring."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:293
msgid "Mock models: views"
msgstr "Mock model'lar: view'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:295
msgid ""
"Since actual views need an `\"ir.ui.view\"` model to be declared, mock "
"models use a simplified *mapping* to provide view arches."
msgstr ""
"Haqiqiy view'lar e'lon qilinishi uchun `\"ir.ui.view\"` model'iga muhtoj "
"bo'lgani sababli, mock model'lar view arch'larini taqdim etish uchun "
"soddalashtirilgan *mapping* ishlatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:298
msgid ""
"The `_view` special key is a dictionary, with its *keys* being view types, "
"optionally accompanied by a view ID, and its *values* being the XML arch "
"string representation."
msgstr ""
"`_view` maxsus kaliti dictionary bo'lib, uning *kalitlari* view turlari "
"(ixtiyoriy ravishda view ID bilan birga), *qiymatlari* esa XML arch'ning "
"satrli ko'rinishi bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:301
msgid ""
"By default, view IDs are `false`, but can be specified explicitly with a "
"comma-separated key combining the view type and its ID:"
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha view ID'lari `false` bo'ladi, lekin view turi va uning "
"ID'sini birlashtirgan vergul bilan ajratilgan kalit orqali aniq "
"ko'rsatilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:324
msgid "Spawning a mock server"
msgstr "Mock server ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:326
msgid ""
"Just like in most cases, only one server can be active for a given test."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pgina holatlarda bo'lgani kabi, bitta test uchun faqat bitta server faol "
"bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:328
msgid ""
"As mentioned above, creating an `env` will automatically deploy a mock "
"server."
msgstr ""
"Yuqorida aytilganidek, `env` yaratish avtomatik ravishda mock server'ni "
"ishga tushiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:330
msgid ""
"This means that all of these methods will *also* create a mock server, since "
"they do create an `env`:"
msgstr ""
"Bu shuni bildiradi: quyidagi barcha method'lar `env` yaratgani uchun mock "
"server'ni *ham* yaratadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:333
msgid ":ref:`makeMockEnv <web-test-helpers/environment>`;"
msgstr ":ref:`makeMockEnv <web-test-helpers/environment>`;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:335
msgid ""
":ref:`mountWithCleanup <web-test-helpers/components>` "
"(calling :ref:`makeMockEnv <web-test-helpers/environment>`);"
msgstr ""
":ref:`mountWithCleanup <web-test-helpers/components>` (:ref:`makeMockEnv "
"<web-test-helpers/environment>` ni chaqiradi);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:337
msgid ""
":ref:`mountView <web-test-helpers/views>` (calling :ref:`mountWithCleanup "
"<web-test-helpers/components>`)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`mountView <web-test-helpers/views>` (:ref:`mountWithCleanup <web-test-"
"helpers/components>` ni chaqiradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:339
msgid ""
"However, some low-level features may require to spawn a mock server "
"*without* an environment. For that purpose, a `makeMockServer` helper can be "
"called separately to initiate a mock server."
msgstr ""
"Biroq, ba'zi past darajali imkoniyatlar environment *bo'lmagan* holda mock "
"server ishga tushirishni talab qilishi mumkin. Shu maqsadda mock server'ni "
"boshlash uchun `makeMockServer` helper'i alohida chaqirilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:344
msgid ""
"`makeMockServer` should *only* be used by low-level features, such as "
"testing the `rpc` function without the environment. It is not meant to be "
"used as a means to retrieve the current mock server instance. For that "
"purpose, refer to :ref:`MockServer.current <mock-server/interacting>`."
msgstr ""
"`makeMockServer` *faqat* past darajali imkoniyatlar uchun ishlatilishi "
"kerak, masalan `rpc` funksiyasini environment'siz test qilishda. U joriy "
"mock server instance'ini olish vositasi sifatida mo'ljallanmagan. Buning "
"uchun :ref:`MockServer.current <mock-server/interacting>` ga murojaat qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:350
msgid ""
"It is to be noted that subsequent calls to `makeMockServer` after a mock "
"server has been started are simply ignored."
msgstr ""
"Shuni ta'kidlash kerak: mock server ishga tushgandan keyin `makeMockServer` "
"ga qilingan keyingi chaqiruvlar shunchaki e'tiborsiz qoldiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:356
msgid "Interacting with the server"
msgstr "Server bilan o'zaro ishlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:358
msgid ""
"While most of the server interactions are expected to be done directly or "
"indirectly by production code spawned in the test case, it is sometimes "
"meaningful to bypass the UI and call the mock server directly (e.g. to "
"simulate that another user, somewhere else, somehow, has altered the "
"database)."
msgstr ""
"Server bilan aloqalarning ko'pchiligi test holatida ishga tushirilgan "
"production kod tomonidan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri yoki bilvosita bajarilishi "
"kutilsa-da, ba'zan UI'ni chetlab o'tib mock server'ni bevosita chaqirish "
"ma'noga ega bo'ladi (masalan, boshqa foydalanuvchi qayerdami ma'lumotlar "
"bazasini o'zgartirganini simulyatsiya qilish uchun)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:363
msgid ""
"This can be done by retrieving the `MockServer.current` static property "
"containing the current mock server instance (only after initialization):"
msgstr ""
"Buni joriy mock server instance'ini saqlaydigan `MockServer.current` statik "
"xususiyatini olish orqali bajarish mumkin (faqat initsializatsiyadan keyin):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/mock_server.rst:377
msgid "`MockServer.env` is just a shortcut to `MockServer.current.env`."
msgstr ""
"`MockServer.env` — bu shunchaki `MockServer.current.env` uchun qisqartma."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:3
msgid "Web test helpers"
msgstr "Web test helper'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:8
msgid ""
"After the :doc:`\"@odoo/hoot\" <./hoot>` module, the second most-solicited "
"module in test files should be `\"@web/../tests/web_test_helpers\"`."
msgstr ""
":doc:`\"@odoo/hoot\" <./hoot>` module'idan keyin test fayllarida eng ko'p "
"murojaat qilinadigan ikkinchi module `\"@web/../tests/web_test_helpers\"` "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:11
msgid ""
"This module contains all the helpers that combine the low-level helpers "
"provided by Hoot, with all the most common features that are used in tests "
"in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Bu module Hoot tomonidan taqdim etilgan past darajali helper'larni Odoo "
"testlarida ishlatiladigan eng keng tarqalgan imkoniyatlar bilan "
"birlashtiruvchi barcha helper'larni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:14
msgid ""
"These helpers are many, and this section of the documentation will only "
"highlight the most common ones, and the way they interact with one another."
msgstr ""
"Bu helper'lar juda ko'p va hujjatlarning bu bo'limi faqat eng keng "
"tarqalganlarini va ularning bir-biri bilan qanday ishlashini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:17
msgid ""
"For a full list of available helpers, you may refer to the `web_test_helpers "
"file <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/tests/"
"web_test_helpers.js>`_."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud helper'larning to'liq ro'yxati uchun `web_test_helpers fayliga "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/tests/"
"web_test_helpers.js>`_ murojaat qilishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:22
msgid "Mock environment"
msgstr "Mock environment"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:24
msgid "The `makeMockEnv` helper is the lowest helper that can spawn an `env`."
msgstr ""
"`makeMockEnv` helper'i — `env` yaratishi mumkin bo'lgan eng quyi darajadagi "
"helper."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:26
msgid "It will take care of"
msgstr "U quyidagilarni bajaradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:28
msgid ""
"creating the `env` object itself, pre-configured with all the required "
"properties for the proper functioning of web components, such as "
"`getTemplate` or `translateFn`;"
msgstr ""
"`env` obyektining o'zini yaratish — web component'larning to'g'ri ishlashi "
"uchun zarur bo'lgan barcha property'lar, masalan `getTemplate` yoki "
"`translateFn`, bilan oldindan sozlangan holda;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:31
msgid "spawning a `MockServer` (if one did not exist already for that test);"
msgstr ""
"`MockServer` yaratish (agar ushbu test uchun u allaqachon mavjud bo'lmasa);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:33
msgid ""
"starting all registered :doc:`services <../services>`, and awaiting until "
"they are all ready;"
msgstr ""
"barcha ro'yxatga olingan :doc:`service'larni <../services>` ishga tushirish "
"va ularning hammasi tayyor bo'lguncha kutish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:35
msgid ""
"initiating other features that are not tied to a service, such as the web "
"`router`;"
msgstr ""
"service'ga bog'liq bo'lmagan boshqa imkoniyatlarni, masalan web `router`'ni, "
"ishga tushirish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:37
msgid ""
"guaranteeing the teardown of all the features in its setup at the end of the "
"test."
msgstr ""
"test oxirida o'z setup'idagi barcha imkoniyatlarning teardown'ini "
"kafolatlash."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:39
msgid ""
"This method is great for testing low-level features, such as :doc:`services "
"<../services>` that are not tied to a Component_:"
msgstr ""
