#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:140
msgid "Interacting with components"
msgstr "Component'lar bilan ishlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:142
msgid ""
"Hoot provides helpers to interact with the DOM (e.g. `click`, `press`, "
"etc.). However, these helpers present 2 issues when interacting with more "
"complex components:"
msgstr ""
"Hoot DOM bilan ishlash uchun helper'lar taqdim etadi (masalan `click`, "
"`press` va h.k.). Biroq bu helper'lar murakkabroq component'lar bilan "
"ishlashda 2 ta muammoni yuzaga keltiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:145
msgid ""
"helpers try to interact instantly, while sometimes the element has yet to be "
"appended to the document (in an unknown amount of time);"
msgstr ""
"helper'lar bir zumda ta'sir o'tkazishga harakat qiladi, lekin ba'zan element "
"hali document'ga qo'shilmagan bo'ladi (qancha vaqt o'tishi noma'lum);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:148
msgid ""
"helpers only wait a single micro-task tick per dispatched event, while most "
"Owl-based UIs take at least a full animation frame to update."
msgstr ""
"helper'lar har bir yuborilgan event uchun faqat bitta micro-task tick "
"kutadi, holbuki Owl asosidagi UI'larning ko'pchiligi yangilanish uchun "
"kamida to'liq bitta animation frame talab qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:163
msgid ""
"With these constraints in mind, web test helpers provide the `contains` "
"helper:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu cheklovlarni hisobga olib, web test helper'lari `contains` helper'ini "
"taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:173
msgid ""
"This approach, while seemingly drifting a bit further away from the concept "
"of \"unit testing\", is still a nice and convenient way to test more complex "
"units such as `views <View_>`_, the `WebClient <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/19.0/addons/web/static/src/webclient/webclient.js>`_, or interactions "
"between couples of :doc:`services <../services>` and components."
msgstr ""
"Bu yondashuv \"unit testing\" tushunchasidan bir oz uzoqlashayotgandek "
"ko'rinsa-da, `view'lar <View_>`_, `WebClient <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/19.0/addons/web/static/src/webclient/webclient.js>`_ "
"yoki :doc:`service'lar <../services>` va component'lar orasidagi o'zaro "
"ta'sir kabi murakkabroq unit'larni sinash uchun hamon yaxshi va qulay usul."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:178
msgid ""
"It should however not become the default for all interactions, as some of "
"them still need to happen *precisely* within a given time frame, which is a "
"concept completely ignored by `contains`."
msgstr ""
"Biroq u barcha interaksiyalar uchun standart usulga aylanmasligi kerak, "
"chunki ularning ba'zilari *aynan* belgilangan vaqt oralig'ida sodir bo'lishi "
"lozim — bu tushuncha `contains` tomonidan mutlaqo hisobga olinmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/frontend/unit_testing/web_helpers.rst:183
msgid ""
"Most helpers in Hoot are available as methods of a `contains` instance, with "
"(generally) the same shape and API."
msgstr ""
"Hoot'dagi helper'larning ko'pchiligi `contains` instance'ining method'lari "
"sifatida mavjud va (odatda) bir xil shakl va API'ga ega."

