#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:3
msgid "Upgrade scripts"
msgstr "Upgrade script'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:5
msgid ""
"An upgrade script is a Python file containing a function "
"called :meth:`migrate`, which the upgrade process invokes during the update "
"of a module."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade script — bu :meth:`migrate` deb nomlangan funksiyani o'z ichiga "
"olgan Python fayli; yangilanish jarayoni uni modul update qilinayotganda "
"chaqiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:10
msgid "current database cursor"
msgstr "joriy ma'lumotlar bazasi cursor'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:12
msgid "installed version of the module"
msgstr "modulning o'rnatilgan versiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:14
msgid ""
"Typically, this function executes one or multiple SQL queries and can also "
"access Odoo's ORM, as well as the :doc:`./upgrade_utils`."
msgstr ""
"Odatda bu funksiya bir yoki bir nechta SQL so'rovlarini bajaradi va Odoo "
"ORM'iga, shuningdek :doc:`./upgrade_utils` ga ham murojaat qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:18
msgid "Writing upgrade scripts"
msgstr "Upgrade script'larini yozish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:20
msgid ""
"Upgrade scripts follow a specific tree structure with a naming convention "
"which determines when they are executed."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade script'lari ma'lum bir katalog tuzilmasiga va nomlash qoidasiga amal "
"qiladi — bu ularning qachon bajarilishini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:23
msgid ""
"The structure of an upgrade script path is :file:`$module/migrations/"
"$version/{pre,post,end}-*.py`, where `$module` is the module for which the "
"script will run, `$version` is the full version of the module (including "
"Odoo's major version and the module's minor version) and `{pre|post|end}-"
"*.py` is the file that needs to be executed. The file's name will determine "
"the :ref:`phase <upgrade-scripts/phases>` and order in which it is executed "
"for that module and version."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade script yo'lining tuzilishi :file:`$module/migrations/$version/"
"{pre,post,end}-*.py` shaklida bo'ladi; bu yerda `$module` — script ishga "
"tushadigan modul, `$version` — modulning to'liq versiyasi (Odoo'ning major "
"versiyasi va modulning minor versiyasini o'z ichiga oladi), `{pre|post|end}-"
"*.py` esa bajarilishi kerak bo'lgan fayl. Fayl nomi ushbu modul va versiya "
"uchun uning :ref:`phase <upgrade-scripts/phases>` ini va bajarilish "
"tartibini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:30
msgid ""
"From Odoo 13 the top-level directory for the upgrade scripts can also be "
"named `upgrades`. This naming is preferred since it has the correct meaning: "
"*migrate* can be confused with *moving out of Odoo*. Thus :file:`$module/"
"upgrades/$version/` is also valid."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 13'dan boshlab upgrade script'lari uchun yuqori darajadagi katalog "
"`upgrades` deb ham nomlanishi mumkin. Bu nom afzal, chunki u to'g'ri ma'noni "
"beradi: *migrate* so'zi *Odoo'dan chiqib ketish* bilan chalkashtirilishi "
"mumkin. Shunday qilib, :file:`$module/upgrades/$version/` ham to'g'ri "
"hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:35
msgid ""
"Upgrade scripts are only executed when the module is being updated. "
"Therefore, the module's minor version set in the `$version` directory needs "
"to be higher than the module's installed version and equal or lower to the "
"updated version of the module."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade script'lari faqat modul update qilinayotganda bajariladi. Shu "
"sababli `$version` katalogida ko'rsatilgan modulning minor versiyasi "
"modulning o'rnatilgan versiyasidan yuqori, modulning yangilangan versiyasiga "
"teng yoki undan past bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:41
msgid ""
"Directory structure of an upgrade script for a custom module named "
"`awesome_partner` upgraded to version `2.0` on Odoo 17."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 17 da `2.0` versiyasiga yangilangan `awesome_partner` nomli maxsus "
"module uchun upgrade script'ining papka tuzilishi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:51
msgid ""
"Two upgrade scripts examples with the content of the :file:`pre-"
"exclamation.py`, file adding \"!\" at the end of partners' names:"
msgstr ""
"Partner nomlarining oxiriga \"!\" qo'shadigan :file:`pre-exclamation.py` "
"faylining mazmuni bilan ikkita upgrade script misoli:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:82
msgid ""
"Note that in the second example, the script takes advantage of the :doc:`./"
"upgrade_utils` to access the ORM. Check the documentation to find out more "
"about this library."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, ikkinchi misolda script ORM'ga kirish uchun :doc:`./"
"upgrade_utils` dan foydalanadi. Bu kutubxona haqida ko'proq bilish uchun "
"hujjatlarni ko'rib chiqing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:88
msgid "Phases of upgrade scripts"
msgstr "Upgrade script'larining fazalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:90
msgid ""
"The upgrade process consists of three phases for each version of each module:"
msgstr ""
"Upgrade jarayoni har bir module'ning har bir versiyasi uchun uchta fazadan "
"iborat:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:92
msgid "The pre-phase, before the module is loaded."
msgstr "pre-faza — module yuklanishidan oldin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:93
msgid ""
"The post-phase, after the module and its dependencies are loaded and updated."
msgstr ""
"post-faza — module va uning bog'liqliklari yuklangan va yangilangandan keyin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:94
msgid ""
"The end-phase, after all modules have been loaded and updated for that "
"version."
msgstr ""
"end-faza — barcha module'lar o'sha versiya uchun yuklangan va yangilangandan "
"keyin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:96
msgid ""
"Upgrade scripts are grouped according to the first part of their filenames "
"into the corresponding phase. Within each phase, the files are executed "
"according to their lexical order."
msgstr ""
"Upgrade script'lari fayl nomlarining birinchi qismiga qarab mos bosqichga "
"guruhlanadi. Har bir bosqich ichida fayllar leksik tartibda bajariladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_scripts.rst:99
msgid "Execution order of example scripts for one module in one version"
msgstr ""
"Bitta versiyadagi bitta module uchun misol script'larning bajarilish tartibi"

