#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:3
msgid "Upgrade utils"
msgstr "Upgrade utils"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:5
msgid ""
"`Upgrade utils <https://github.com/odoo/upgrade-util/>`_ is a library that "
"contains helper functions to facilitate the writing of upgrade scripts. This "
"library, used by Odoo for the upgrade scripts of standard modules, provides "
"reliability and helps speed up the upgrade process:"
msgstr ""
"`Upgrade utils <https://github.com/odoo/upgrade-util/>`_ — upgrade "
"script'larini yozishni osonlashtiruvchi helper funksiyalarni o'z ichiga "
"olgan kutubxona. Odoo tomonidan standart module'larning upgrade script'lari "
"uchun ishlatiladigan bu kutubxona ishonchlilikni ta'minlaydi va upgrade "
"jarayonini tezlashtirishga yordam beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:9
msgid ""
"The helper functions help make sure the data is consistent in the database."
msgstr ""
"Helper funksiyalar ma'lumotlar bazasidagi ma'lumotlarning izchilligini "
"ta'minlashga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:10
msgid "It takes care of indirect references of the updated records."
msgstr ""
"U yangilangan record'larning bilvosita havolalarini o'zi hisobga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:11
msgid ""
"Allows calling functions and avoid writing code, saving time and reducing "
"development risks."
msgstr ""
"Kod yozish o'rniga funksiyalarni chaqirish imkonini beradi, bu esa vaqtni "
"tejaydi va ishlab chiqish xatarlarini kamaytiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:12
msgid ""
"Helpers allow to focus on what is important for the upgrade and not think of "
"details."
msgstr ""
"Helper'lar upgrade uchun muhim bo'lgan narsaga e'tibor qaratish va mayda "
"tafsilotlar haqida o'ylamaslik imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:15
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "O'rnatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/upgrades/upgrade_utils.rst:17
msgid ""
"Clone the `Upgrade utils repository <https://github.com/odoo/upgrade-util/"
">`_ locally and start ``odoo`` with the ``src`` directory prepended to the "
"``--upgrade-path`` option."
