#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface.rst:5
msgid "User interface"
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi interfeysi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:5
msgid "UI icons"
msgstr "UI ikonkalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo's user interface mostly relies on `FontAwesome4 icons <https://"
"fontawesome.com/v4/icons/>`_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo foydalanuvchi interfeysi asosan `FontAwesome4 icons <https://"
"fontawesome.com/v4/icons/>`_ ga tayanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:9
msgid ""
"To cover FontAwesome's lack of iconography for specific functionalities, we "
"designed our own icons: :ref:`Odoo UI icons <ui/odoo-ui-icons>` "
"and :ref:`Odoo Spreadsheet icons <ui/odoo-spreadsheet-icons>`."
msgstr ""
"FontAwesome'da ayrim funksiyalar uchun ikonkalar yetishmasligini qoplash "
"maqsadida biz o'z ikonkalarimizni yaratdik: :ref:`Odoo UI icons <ui/odoo-ui-"
"icons>` va :ref:`Odoo Spreadsheet icons <ui/odoo-spreadsheet-icons>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:16
msgid "Odoo UI icons"
msgstr "Odoo UI ikonkalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:18
msgid ""
"The Odoo UI icons can be rendered using the main `oi` class in conjunction "
"with the specific icon class."
msgstr ""
"Odoo UI ikonkalarini asosiy `oi` class'ini kerakli ikonka class'i bilan "
"birga qo'llab render qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:524
msgid "RTL adaptations"
msgstr "RTL moslashuvlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:526
msgid ""
"Directional icons have :abbr:`RTL (right-to-left)` adaptations which flip "
"the icons by 180 degrees when an :abbr:`RTL (right-to-left)` language is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Yo'nalishni ko'rsatuvchi ikonkalarda :abbr:`RTL (right-to-left)` "
"moslashuvlari bor: :abbr:`RTL (right-to-left)` til tanlanganda ikonkalar 180 "
"darajaga aylantiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:594
msgid "Odoo Spreadsheet icons"
msgstr "Odoo Spreadsheet ikonkalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/icons.rst:596
msgid ""
"The `Odoo Spreadsheet <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"spreadsheet/static/src/o_spreadsheet>`_ icons are defined as `<svg>` "
"elements and rendered using QWeb `templates <https://github.com/odoo/owl/"
"blob/master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md>`_."
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Spreadsheet <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/spreadsheet/"
"static/src/o_spreadsheet>`_ ikonkalari `<svg>` element'lari sifatida "
"aniqlanadi va QWeb `templates <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/templates.md>`_ yordamida render qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:3
msgid "SCSS inheritance"
msgstr "SCSS inheritance"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:8
msgid ""
"Managing SCSS assets in Odoo is not as straightforward as it is in some "
"other environments, but it's highly efficient."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da SCSS asset'larini boshqarish ba'zi boshqa environment'lardagichalik "
"oddiy emas, lekin juda samarali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:11
msgid ""
"Modularity is key. The inheritance scheme described further allows Odoo to:"
msgstr ""
"Modullilik — eng muhimi. Quyida tavsiflangan inheritance sxemasi Odoo'ga "
"quyidagilarga imkon beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:13
msgid "customize the Bootstrap CSS framework;"
msgstr "Bootstrap CSS framework'ini moslashtirish;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:14
msgid "handle two different webclient designs (Community and Enterprise);"
msgstr "ikki xil webclient dizaynini boshqarish (Community va Enterprise);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:15
msgid ""
"handle backend and frontend bundles separately (including the user's website "
"design);"
msgstr ""
"backend va frontend bundle'larini alohida boshqarish (foydalanuvchining "
"website dizayni ham shu qatorda);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:16
msgid "contextually load only necessary assets;"
msgstr "kontekstga qarab faqat kerakli asset'larni yuklash;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:17
msgid "handle multiple color-schemes (e.g.: dark-mode);"
msgstr "bir nechta rang sxemasini boshqarish (masalan: dark-mode);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:20
msgid "SCSS's `!default` directive"
msgstr "SCSS'ning `!default` direktivasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:22
msgid ""
"\"Direct variables’ overrides\" are technically possible in SCSS but may "
"lead to inconsistent results in complex environments like Odoo."
msgstr ""
"\"Variable'larni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri override qilish\" SCSS'da texnik "
"jihatdan mumkin, lekin Odoo kabi murakkab environment'larda izchil bo'lmagan "
"natijalarga olib kelishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:27
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:57
msgid ":file:`library.scss`"
msgstr ":file:`library.scss`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:32
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:52
msgid ":file:`customization_layer.scss`"
msgstr ":file:`customization_layer.scss`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:37
msgid ""
"Indeed, since the compilation process acts across different interdependent "
"bundles, re-assigning a variable in the \"wrong spot\" may lead to "
"unexpected cascading results."
msgstr ""
"Darhaqiqat, kompilyatsiya jarayoni bir-biriga bog'liq turli bundle'lar "
"bo'ylab amalga oshirilgani uchun variable'ni \"noto'g'ri joyda\" qayta "
"belgilash kutilmagan kaskad natijalarga olib kelishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:40
msgid ""
"SCSS provides several techniques to overcome these issues (e.g.: `shadowing "
"<https://sass-lang.com/documentation/variables#shadowing>`_), but the most "
"critical procedure in Odoo is the use of the `!default` flag."
msgstr ""
"SCSS bu muammolarni yengish uchun bir nechta usul taqdim etadi (masalan: "
"`shadowing <https://sass-lang.com/documentation/variables#shadowing>`_), "
"biroq Odoo'da eng muhim usul — `!default` flag'idan foydalanish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:44
msgid ""
"When using the `!default` flag, the compiler assigns a value **only** if "
"that variable is not yet defined."
msgstr ""
"`!default` flag'i ishlatilganda compiler qiymatni **faqat** o'sha variable "
"hali aniqlanmagan bo'lsa belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:47
msgid ""
"As a result of this technique, the priority in which variables are assigned "
"matches the assets' loading order."
msgstr ""
"Bu usul natijasida variable'lar belgilanish ustuvorligi asset'larning "
"yuklanish tartibiga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:63
msgid ":file:`component.scss`"
msgstr ":file:`component.scss`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:72
msgid ""
"`!default` flag on the `SASS Documentation <https://sass-lang.com/"
"documentation/variables#default-values>`_"
msgstr ""
"`SASS Documentation <https://sass-lang.com/documentation/variables#default-"
"values>`_ dagi `!default` flag"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:76
msgid "Odoo's SCSS inheritance system"
msgstr "Odoo'ning SCSS inheritance tizimi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:78
msgid ""
"The following diagram conceptually illustrates the compilation order in "
"which the CSS and SCSS variables are defined."
msgstr ""
"Quyidagi diagramma CSS va SCSS o'zgaruvchilari aniqlanadigan kompilyatsiya "
"tartibini konseptual tarzda ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/scss_inheritance.rst:105
msgid ""
"This diagram is incomplete and does not match the current bundles' "
"organization. Read more on :ref:`asset bundles <reference/assets_bundle>`."
msgstr ""
"Bu diagramma to'liq emas va joriy bundle'lar tashkiliy tuzilishiga mos "
"kelmaydi. Batafsil ma'lumot: :ref:`asset bundles <reference/assets_bundle>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:5
msgid "View architectures"
msgstr "View arxitekturalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:8
msgid "Generic architecture"
msgstr "Umumiy arxitektura"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:10
msgid ""
"The architecture of a view is defined by XML data interpreted by the "
"JavaScript framework."
msgstr ""
"View arxitekturasi JavaScript framework tomonidan izohlanadigan XML "
"ma'lumotlari bilan aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:12
msgid ""
"For most views, there is a :file:`\\*.rng` file defining the attributes and "
"possible architectures. Some views are not ruled by such a file either "
"because they accept HTML content, or for performance reasons."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pchilik view'lar uchun atributlar va mumkin bo'lgan arxitekturalarni "
"aniqlaydigan :file:`\\*.rng` fayli mavjud. Ba'zi view'lar bunday fayl bilan "
"boshqarilmaydi — chunki ular HTML kontentni qabul qiladi yoki unumdorlik "
"sabablari bor."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:17
msgid ""
"The current context and user access rights may impact the view abilities."
msgstr ""
"Joriy context va foydalanuvchi kirish huquqlari view imkoniyatlariga ta'sir "
"qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:20
msgid ":doc:`view_records`"
msgstr ":doc:`view_records`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:25
msgid "Python expression"
msgstr "Python expression"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:27
msgid ""
"When evaluating node attributes, e.g. the `readonly` modifier, it is "
"possible to provide a **Python expression** that will be executed in an "
"environment that has access to the following variables:"
msgstr ""
"Node atributlarini, masalan `readonly` modifikatorini hisoblashda, quyidagi "
"o'zgaruvchilarga kirish huquqiga ega environment'da bajariladigan **Python "
"expression** berish mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:30
msgid ""
"The names of all fields present in the current view, containing the value of "
"the current record, except for `column_invisible` in :ref:`list view "
"<reference/view_architectures/list/field>`; relational fields are given as a "
"list of IDs;"
msgstr ""
"Joriy view'da mavjud barcha field'lar nomlari — ular joriy record'ning "
"qiymatini o'z ichiga oladi; :ref:`list view <reference/view_architectures/"
"list/field>` dagi `column_invisible` bundan mustasno; relational field'lar "
"ID'lar ro'yxati sifatida beriladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:33
msgid "The ID of the current record;"
msgstr "Joriy record'ning ID'si;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:34
msgid ""
"`parent`: the record that refers to the container; only inside sub-views "
"of :ref:`relational fields <studio/fields/relational-fields>`;"
msgstr ""
"`parent`: container'ga ishora qiluvchi record; faqat :ref:`relational fields "
"<studio/fields/relational-fields>` ning sub-view'lari ichida;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:36
msgid "`context (dict)`: the current view's context;"
msgstr "`context (dict)`: joriy view'ning context'i;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:37
msgid "`uid (int)`: the id of the current user;"
msgstr "`uid (int)`: joriy foydalanuvchining id'si;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:38
msgid "`today (str)`: the current local date in the `YYYY-MM-DD` format;"
msgstr "`today (str)`: `YYYY-MM-DD` formatidagi joriy mahalliy sana;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:39
msgid ""
"`now (str)`: the current local datetime in the `YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss` format."
msgstr ""
"`now (str)`: `YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss` formatidagi joriy mahalliy sana va vaqt."

