"Form views are used to display the data from a single record. They are "
"composed of regular HTML_ with additional semantic and structural components."
msgstr ""
"Form view'lar bitta record ma'lumotlarini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Ular "
"qo'shimcha semantik va strukturaviy komponentlar bilan birga oddiy HTML_ dan "
"tashkil topgan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:66
msgid "The root element of form views is `form`."
msgstr "Form view'larning root elementi — `form`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:77
