"Semantik komponentlar Odoo tizimiga bog'lanadi va u bilan o'zaro ishlash "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:123
msgid ""
"Form views accept the following children semantic components: :ref:`field "
"<reference/view_architectures/form/field>`, :ref:`label <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/label>`, :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/"
"form/button>`, :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/chatter`, "
"and :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/attachment`."
