"Form view'lar quyidagi child semantik komponentlarni qabul "
"qiladi: :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>`, :ref:`label "
"<reference/view_architectures/form/label>`, :ref:`button <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/button>`, :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/"
"chatter` va :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/attachment`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:129
