msgid "Placeholders are denoted in all caps."
msgstr "Placeholder'lar faqat bosh harflar bilan yoziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:134
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1328
msgid "`field`: display field values"
msgstr "`field`: field qiymatlarini ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:136
msgid ""
"The `field` element renders (and allows editing of, possibly) a single field "
"of the current record."
msgstr ""
"`field` element joriy record'ning bitta field'ini render qiladi (va imkon "
"bo'lsa uni tahrirlashga ruxsat beradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:138
msgid ""
"Using the same field multiple times in a form view is supported, and the "
"fields can receive different values for the `invisible` and `readonly` "
"attributes. These fields may have the same values but can be displayed "
"differently. However, the behavior is not guaranteed when several fields "
"exist with different values for the `required` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Form view'da bir xil field'ni bir necha marta ishlatish qo'llab-quvvatlanadi "
"va bu field'lar `invisible` hamda `readonly` atributlari uchun turli "
"qiymatlarni olishi mumkin. Ushbu field'lar bir xil qiymatga ega bo'lishi, "
"lekin turlicha ko'rsatilishi mumkin. Biroq `required` atributi uchun turli "
"qiymatga ega bir nechta field mavjud bo'lganda xatti-harakat kafolatlanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:149
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1341
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1803
