msgstr "Majburiy"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/field_attribute_name.rst:12
msgid ""
"The widget used to represent the field. The selected widget can change the "
"way the field is rendered and/or the way it can be edited. It refers to a "
"Javascript implementation (an Owl component) registered to the `fields` "
"registry."
msgstr ""
"Field'ni ifodalash uchun ishlatiladigan widget. Tanlangan widget field'ning "
"render qilinish usulini va/yoki uni tahrirlash usulini o'zgartirishi mumkin. "
"U `fields` registry'siga ro'yxatdan o'tgan JavaScript implementatsiyaga (Owl "
"component'ga) ishora qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:156
msgid ""
"The node id. Useful when there are several occurrences of the same field in "
"the view (see :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/label`)."
msgstr ""
"Node id. View'da bir xil field bir necha marta uchraganda foydali "
"(:ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/label` ga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:161
msgid "The field name"
msgstr "Field nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/field_attribute_string.rst:4
msgid "The label of the field."
msgstr "Field'ning label'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/field_attribute_string.rst:8
msgid "The `string` attribute of the model's field"
msgstr "Model field'ining `string` atributi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:168
msgid "The tooltip displayed when hovering the field or its label."
msgstr ""
"Field yoki uning label'i ustiga kursor olib borilganda ko'rsatiladigan "
"tooltip."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:177
msgid ""
"The configuration options for the field's widget (including default "
"widgets), as a Python expression that evaluates to a dict."
msgstr ""
"Field widget'i (standart widget'lar ham) uchun konfiguratsiya options'lari — "
"dict'ga hisoblanadigan Python expression sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:180
msgid ""
"For relation fields, the following options are available: `no_create`, "
"`no_quick_create`, `no_open`, and `no_create_edit`."
msgstr ""
"Relation field'lar uchun quyidagi options mavjud: `no_create`, "
"`no_quick_create`, `no_open` va `no_create_edit`."

