#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/field_attribute_readonly.rst:4
msgid ""
"Whether the field can be modified by the user (`False`) or is read-only "
"(`True`), as a Python expression that evaluates to a bool."
msgstr ""
"Field foydalanuvchi tomonidan o'zgartirilishi mumkinmi (`False`) yoki read-"
"only (`True`) — bool'ga hisoblanadigan Python expression sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/field_attribute_required.rst:4
msgid ""
"Whether the field can be left empty (`False`) or must be set (`True`), as a "
"Python expression that evaluates to a bool."
msgstr ""
"field'ni bo'sh qoldirish mumkinmi (`False`) yoki uni to'ldirish shartmi "
"(`True`) — bool qiymatga hisoblanadigan Python ifodasi sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_invisible.rst:4
msgid ""
"Whether the element is visible (`False`) or hidden (`True`), as a Python "
"expression that evaluates to a bool."
msgstr ""
"Element ko'rinadimi (`False`) yoki yashiringanmi (`True`) — bool qiymatga "
"hisoblanadigan Python ifodasi sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_invisible.rst:8
msgid "There are two uses for the `invisible` attribute:"
msgstr "`invisible` atributining ikkita qo'llanilishi bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_invisible.rst:10
msgid ""
"Usability: to avoid overloading the view and to make it easier for the user "
"to read, depending on the content."
msgstr ""
"Qulaylik: kontentga qarab view'ni ortiqcha ma'lumot bilan to'ldirmaslik va "
"foydalanuvchi uchun o'qishni osonlashtirish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_invisible.rst:12
msgid ""
"Technical: a field must be present (invisible is enough) in the view to be "
"used in a Python expression."
msgstr ""
"Texnik: field Python ifodasida ishlatilishi uchun view'da mavjud bo'lishi "
"kerak (invisible bo'lsa ham yetarli)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_groups.rst:4
msgid ""
"The comma-separated list of user groups to whom the element is displayed. "
"Users who do not belong to at least one of these groups are unable to see "
"the element. Groups can be prefixed with the negative `!` operator to "
"exclude them."
msgstr ""
"Element ko'rsatiladigan foydalanuvchi group'larining vergul bilan ajratilgan "
"ro'yxati. Ushbu group'lardan kamida bittasiga tegishli bo'lmagan "
"foydalanuvchilar elementni ko'ra olmaydi. Group'larni chiqarib tashlash "
"uchun ular oldiga inkor `!` operatorini qo'yish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:203
msgid ""
"The filters to apply when displaying existing records for selection, as a "
"Python expression that evaluates to a :ref:`domain <reference/orm/domains>`."
msgstr ""
"Tanlash uchun mavjud record'lar ko'rsatilganda qo'llanadigan filtrlar "
"— :ref:`domain <reference/orm/domains>` ga hisoblanadigan Python ifodasi "
"sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:213
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1845
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1867
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1941
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2326
msgid "`[]`"
msgstr "`[]`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:0
msgid "scope"
msgstr "scope"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:219
msgid ""
"extensive documentation on all the magic context values (TYPE_view_ref, "
"group_by, search_default_FIELD..."
msgstr ""
"barcha magic context qiymatlari haqida batafsil hujjat (TYPE_view_ref, "
"group_by, search_default_FIELD..."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:222
msgid ""
"The context to use when fetching possible values and creating or searching "
"records, as a Python expression that evaluates to a dict."
msgstr ""
"Mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlarni olishda hamda record'larni yaratish yoki "
"qidirishda ishlatiladigan context — dict qiymatga hisoblanadigan Python "
"ifodasi sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:244
msgid "Whether the field label should be hidden."
msgstr "field yorlig'i yashirilishi kerakmi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:249
msgid "Fields that are a direct child of a `group` element"
msgstr "`group` elementining bevosita farzandi bo'lgan field'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:254
msgid ""
"The help message to display on *empty* fields. It can replace field labels "
"in complex forms. However, it *should not* be an example of data, as users "
"may confuse placeholder text with filled fields."
msgstr ""
"*bo'sh* field'larda ko'rsatiladigan yordam xabari. Murakkab form'larda u "
"field yorliqlarini almashtira oladi. Biroq u ma'lumot namunasi *bo'lmasligi "
"kerak*, chunki foydalanuvchilar placeholder matnini to'ldirilgan field'lar "
"bilan aralashtirib yuborishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:265
msgid ""
"The comma-separated list of display modes (view types) to use for the "
"field's linked records. Allowed modes are: `list`, `form`, `kanban`, and "
"`graph`."
msgstr ""
"field'ning bog'langan record'lari uchun ishlatiladigan ko'rsatish mode'lari "
"(view turlari)ning vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati. Ruxsat etilgan "
"mode'lar: `list`, `form`, `kanban` va `graph`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:270
msgid "`list`"
msgstr "`list`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:271
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` and :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` fields"
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` va :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` field'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:4
msgid ""
"The `HTML class <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HTML_attribute>`_ to set on "
"the generated element."
msgstr ""
"Yaratilgan elementga o'rnatiladigan `HTML class <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/HTML_attribute>`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:6
msgid ""
"The styling uses the `Bootstrap <https://getbootstrap.com>`_ framework "
"and :ref:`UI icons <reference/user_interface/ui_icons>`. Common Odoo classes "
"include:"
msgstr ""
"Stillashtirishda `Bootstrap <https://getbootstrap.com>`_ framework'i "
"va :ref:`UI icons <reference/user_interface/ui_icons>` ishlatiladi. Keng "
"tarqalgan Odoo class'lari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:9
msgid ""
"`oe_inline`: prevents the usual line break following fields, and limits "
"their span;"
msgstr ""
"`oe_inline`: field'lardan keyingi odatiy qatordan o'tishni oldini oladi va "
"ularning kengligini cheklaydi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:10
msgid ""
"`oe_left`, `oe_right`: `floats <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"CSS/float>`_ the element to the corresponding direction;"
msgstr ""
"`oe_left`, `oe_right`: elementni mos yo'nalishga `float <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/float>`_ qiladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:12
msgid ""
"`oe_read_only`, `oe_edit_only`: only displays the element in the "
"corresponding form mode;"
msgstr ""
"`oe_read_only`, `oe_edit_only`: elementni faqat mos form mode'ida ko'rsatadi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:13
msgid ""
"`oe_avatar`: for image fields, displays images as an \"avatar\" (max 90x90 "
"square);"
msgstr ""
"`oe_avatar`: rasm field'lari uchun rasmlarni \"avatar\" sifatida ko'rsatadi "
"(maksimal 90x90 kvadrat);"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_class.rst:14
msgid ""
"`oe_stat_button`: defines a particular rendering to dynamically display "
"information while being clickable to target an action."
msgstr ""
"`oe_stat_button`: ma'lumotni dinamik ko'rsatish uchun maxsus rendering "
"aniqlaydi, shu bilan birga bosilganda action'ga o'tadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:278
msgid "The name of the related field providing the name of the file."
msgstr "Fayl nomini ta'minlovchi bog'liq field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:283
msgid ":class:`~odoo.fields.Binary` fields"
msgstr ":class:`~odoo.fields.Binary` field'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:288
msgid ""
"Whether the field stores a password and thus its data should not be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"field parol saqlaydimi va shu sababli uning ma'lumoti ko'rsatilmasligi "
"kerakmi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:293
msgid ":class:`~odoo.fields.Char` fields"
msgstr ":class:`~odoo.fields.Char` field'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:298
msgid ""
"The XMLID of the specific Kanban :doc:`view record <view_records>` that "
"should be used when selecting records in a mobile environment."
msgstr ""
"Mobil muhitda record'lar tanlanganda ishlatilishi kerak bo'lgan maxsus "
"Kanban :doc:`view record <view_records>` ning XMLID'si."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:309
msgid ""
"Whether the field is focused when the view opens. It can be applied to only "
"one field of a view."
msgstr ""
"view ochilganda field fokuslanadimi. U view'ning faqat bitta field'iga "
"qo'llanishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:316
msgid ""
":ref:`Relational fields <studio/fields/relational-fields>` nodes can contain "
"specific subviews."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Relational field <studio/fields/relational-fields>` node'lari maxsus "
"subview'larni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:334
msgid "`label`: display field labels"
msgstr "`label`: field yorliqlarini ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:336
msgid ""
"When a :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` component is "
"not placed directly inside a :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/form/"
"group>`, or when its `nolabel` attribute is set, the field's label is not "
"automatically displayed alongside its value. The `label` component is the "
"manual alternative of displaying the label of a field."
msgstr ""
":ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` "
"component'i :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/form/group>` ichiga "
"bevosita joylashtirilmaganda yoki uning `nolabel` atributi o'rnatilganda, "
"field yorlig'i uning qiymati bilan birga avtomatik ko'rsatilmaydi. `label` "
"component'i field yorlig'ini ko'rsatishning qo'lda bajariladigan "
"alternativasidir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:352
msgid "The `label` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`label` elementi quyidagi atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:357
msgid ""
"The reference to the field associated with the label. It can be either the "
"name of the field, or its id (the `id` attribute set on the :ref:`field "
"<reference/view_architectures/form/field>`)."
msgstr ""
"Yorliq bilan bog'langan field'ga havola. Bu field nomi yoki uning id'si "
"bo'lishi mumkin (:ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` da "
"o'rnatilgan `id` atributi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:360
msgid ""
"When there are several occurrences of the same field in the view, and there "
"are several `label` components associated with these field nodes, these "
"labels must have unique `for` attribute; in this case, referencing the `id` "
"attribute of the corresponding field nodes."
msgstr ""
"view'da bir xil field bir necha marta uchraganda va bu field node'lari bilan "
"bog'langan bir necha `label` component'i bo'lganda, bu yorliqlar noyob `for` "
"atributiga ega bo'lishi shart; bunda mos field node'larining `id` atributiga "
"havola qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:370
msgid "The label to display."
msgstr "Ko'rsatiladigan yorliq."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:374
msgid "The field's label coming from the field definition on the model"
msgstr "model'dagi field ta'rifidan keladigan field yorlig'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:383
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1475
msgid "`button`: display action buttons"
msgstr "`button`: action tugmalarini ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:392
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1484
msgid "The `button` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`button` elementi quyidagi atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_type.rst:4
msgid ""
"The type of the button indicating how it behaves. It can have two different "
"values:"
msgstr ""
"Tugmaning qanday ishlashini ko'rsatuvchi turi. U ikki xil qiymatga ega "
"bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_type.rst:9
msgid ""
"Call a method on the view's model. The button's `name` is the method that is "
"called with the current record ID and the current `context`."
msgstr ""
"view'ning model'idagi method'ni chaqiradi. Tugmaning `name` qiymati joriy "
"record ID'si va joriy `context` bilan chaqiriladigan method hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_type.rst:15
msgid ""
"Load and execute an `ir.actions` action record. The button's `name` is the "
"XMLID of the action to load. The `context` is extended with the view's model "
"(as `active_model`) and with the current record (as `active_id`)."
msgstr ""
"`ir.actions` action record'ini yuklaydi va bajaradi. Tugmaning `name` "
"qiymati yuklanadigan action'ning XMLID'si hisoblanadi. `context` view'ning "
"model'i (`active_model` sifatida) va joriy record (`active_id` sifatida) "
"bilan to'ldiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_type.rst:25
msgid "Mandatory if the `special` attribute is not set"
msgstr "`special` atributi o'rnatilmagan bo'lsa majburiy"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_name.rst:4
msgid ""
"The method to call if the `type` is `object`. The :term:`XMLID <external "
"identifier>` of the action to load if the `type` is `action`, either in raw "
"format or in `%(XMLID)d` format."
msgstr ""
"`type` `object` bo'lsa chaqiriladigan method. `type` `action` bo'lsa "
"yuklanadigan action'ning :term:`XMLID <external identifier>` si — xom "
"formatda yoki `%(XMLID)d` formatda."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_string.rst:4
msgid ""
"The button's text if there is no `icon`, the `alt` text for the icon "
"otherwise."
msgstr "`icon` bo'lmasa tugmaning matni, aks holda icon uchun `alt` matni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_icon.rst:4
msgid ""
"The icon to use to display the button. See :ref:`icons <reference/"
"user_interface/ui_icons>` for the reference list."
msgstr ""
"Tugmani ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladigan icon. To'liq ro'yxat "
"uchun :ref:`icons <reference/user_interface/ui_icons>` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_help.rst:4
msgid "The tooltip message shown when hovering with the mouse cursor."
msgstr ""
"Sichqoncha kursori ustiga olib borilganda ko'rsatiladigan tooltip xabari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/button_attribute_context.rst:4
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1692
msgid ""
"The context that is merged into the view's context when performing the "
"button's call, as a Python expression that evaluates to a dict."
msgstr ""
"Tugma chaqirig'i bajarilganda view'ning context'iga qo'shiladigan context — "
"dict qiymatga hisoblanadigan Python ifodasi sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:415
msgid ""
"The behavior of the button for form views opened in dialog. It can have two "
"different values:"
msgstr ""
"Dialogda ochilgan form view'lar uchun tugmaning xatti-harakati. U ikki xil "
"qiymatga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:420
msgid "Save the record and close the dialog."
msgstr "record'ni saqlaydi va dialogni yopadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:425
msgid "Close the dialog without saving."
msgstr "Dialogni saqlamasdan yopadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:439
msgid ""
"The confirmation message to display (and for the user to accept) before "
"performing the button's action."
msgstr ""
"Tugmaning action'i bajarilishidan oldin ko'rsatiladigan (va foydalanuvchi "
"tomonidan qabul qilinishi kerak bo'lgan) tasdiqlash xabari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:454
msgid ""
"The hotkey (`keyboard_shortcut`_, similar to an accesskey_) that is bound to "
"the button. It is enabled when the `alt` key is pressed together with the "
"selected character, or together with the `shift` key and the selected "
"character when `shift+` is prepended to the value."
msgstr ""
"Tugmaga bog'langan hotkey (`keyboard_shortcut`_, accesskey_ ga o'xshash). U "
"`alt` tugmasi tanlangan belgi bilan birga bosilganda ishlaydi yoki qiymat "
"oldiga `shift+` qo'yilgan bo'lsa, `shift` tugmasi va tanlangan belgi bilan "
"birga bosilganda ishlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:471
msgid "Chatter widget"
msgstr "Chatter widget'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:473
msgid ""
"The :ref:`chatter widget <reference/mixins/mail/chatter>` is the "
"communication and log tool allowing to email colleagues and customers "
"directly from a record (task, order, invoice, event, note...)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`chatter widget <reference/mixins/mail/chatter>` — record'dan (task, "
"order, invoice, event, note...) to'g'ridan-to'g'ri hamkasblar va mijozlarga "
"email yuborish imkonini beruvchi muloqot va log vositasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:476
msgid ""
"It is added with a `div` element with the class `oe_chatter` when the model "
"inherits the `mail.thread` mixin."
msgstr ""
"model `mail.thread` mixin'ini inherit qilganda u `oe_chatter` class'iga ega "
"`div` elementi bilan qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:496
msgid "Attachments preview widget"
msgstr "Attachment'lar ko'rinishi widget'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:498
msgid ""
"The attachment preview widget is added with an *empty* `div` element with "
"the class `o_attachment_preview`."
msgstr ""
"attachment preview widget'i `o_attachment_preview` class'iga ega *bo'sh* "
"`div` elementi bilan qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:514
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4177
msgid "Structural components"
msgstr "Strukturaviy component'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:516
msgid ""
"Structural components provide structure or \"visual\" features with little "
"logic. They are used as elements or sets of elements in form views."
msgstr ""
"Structural component'lar kam logika bilan struktura yoki \"vizual\" "
"imkoniyatlarni ta'minlaydi. Ular form view'larda element yoki element "
"to'plamlari sifatida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:519
msgid ""
"Form views accept the following children structural components: :ref:`group "
"<reference/view_architectures/form/group>`, :ref:`sheet <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/sheet>`, :ref:`notebook <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/notebook>`, :ref:`notebook <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/notebook>`, :ref:`newline <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/newline>`, :ref:`separator <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/separator>`, :ref:`header <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/header>`, :ref:`footer <reference/view_architectures/"
"form/footer>`, :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/button_container`, "
"and :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/title_container`."
msgstr ""
"Form view'lar quyidagi child structural component'larni qabul "
"qiladi: :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/form/group>`, :ref:`sheet "
"<reference/view_architectures/form/sheet>`, :ref:`notebook <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/notebook>`, :ref:`notebook <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/notebook>`, :ref:`newline <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/newline>`, :ref:`separator <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/separator>`, :ref:`header <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/header>`, :ref:`footer <reference/view_architectures/"
"form/footer>`, :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/button_container` "
"va :ref:`reference/view_architectures/form/title_container`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:535
msgid "`group`: define columns layouts"
msgstr "`group`: ustun layout'larini aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:537
msgid ""
"The `group` element is used to define column layouts in forms. By default, "
"groups define 2 columns, and most direct children of groups take a single "
"column."
msgstr ""
"`group` element'i formalarda ustun layout'larini aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi. "
"Odatiy holda group'lar 2 ustun aniqlaydi va group'larning bevosita "
"child'larining ko'pchiligi bitta ustunni egallaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:540
msgid ""
":ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` elements that are "
"direct children of groups display a `label` by default, and the label and "
"the field itself have a `colspan` of `1` each."
msgstr ""
"Group'larning bevosita child'lari bo'lgan :ref:`field <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/field>` element'lari odatiy holda `label` ko'rsatadi "
"va label ham, field'ning o'zi ham `1` ga teng `colspan` ga ega bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:543
msgid ""
"Children are laid out horizontally (they try to fill the next column before "
"changing row)."
msgstr ""
"Child'lar gorizontal joylashtiriladi (ular qatorni almashtirishdan oldin "
"keyingi ustunni to'ldirishga harakat qiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:553
msgid "The `group` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`group` element'i quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:558
msgid "The title displayed for the group."
msgstr "Group uchun ko'rsatiladigan sarlavha."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:567
msgid "The number of columns in a `group`."
msgstr "`group` ichidagi ustunlar soni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:570
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:579
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1284
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1294
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1987
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2004
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2021
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2038
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2308
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3287
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3357
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3388
msgid "int"
msgstr "int"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:576
msgid "The number of columns taken by a child element."
msgstr "Child element egallaydigan ustunlar soni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:584
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:668
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:708
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:753
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:871
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1157
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1455
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1506
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1559
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1629
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1725
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1761
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1873
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2125
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2385
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2948
msgid "Possible structure and representation of its rendering"
msgstr "Mumkin bo'lgan struktura va uning rendering ko'rinishi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:621
msgid "`sheet`: make the layout responsive"
msgstr "`sheet`: layout'ni responsive qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:623
msgid ""
"The `sheet` element can be used as a direct child of the :ref:`form "
"<reference/view_architectures/form>` root element for a narrower and more "
"responsive form layout (centered page, margin...). It usually "
"contains :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/form/group>` elements."
msgstr ""
"`sheet` element'i torroq va yanada responsive form layout "
"(markazlashtirilgan sahifa, margin...) uchun :ref:`form <reference/"
"view_architectures/form>` root element'ining bevosita child'i sifatida "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. U odatda :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/form/"
"group>` element'larini o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:639
msgid "`notebook` & `page`: add tabbed sections"
msgstr "`notebook` va `page`: tab'li bo'limlar qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:641
msgid ""
"The `notebook` element defines a tabbed section. Each tab is defined through "
"a `page` child element."
msgstr ""
"`notebook` element'i tab'li bo'limni aniqlaydi. Har bir tab `page` child "
"element'i orqali aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:643
msgid "The `notebook` element should not be placed within `group` elements."
msgstr ""
"`notebook` element'ini `group` element'lari ichiga joylashtirmaslik kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:655
msgid "The `page` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`page` element'i quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:660
msgid "The title of the tab."
msgstr "Tab sarlavhasi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:663
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:750
msgid "`str`"
msgstr "`str`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:692
msgid "`newline`: start new group rows"
msgstr "`newline`: group'da yangi qatorlarni boshlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:694
msgid ""
"The `newline` element is used within :ref:`group <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/group>` elements to end the current row early and "
"immediately switch to a new row, without filling any remaining column "
"beforehand."
msgstr ""
"`newline` element'i :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/form/group>` "
"element'lari ichida joriy qatorni muddatidan oldin tugatib, oldindan qolgan "
"ustunlarni to'ldirmasdan darhol yangi qatorga o'tish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:730
msgid "`separator`: add horizontal spacing"
msgstr "`separator`: gorizontal bo'shliq qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:732
msgid ""
"The `separator` element adds vertical spacing between elements within a "
"group."
msgstr ""
"`separator` element'i group ichidagi element'lar orasiga vertikal bo'shliq "
"qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:742
msgid "The `<separator>` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`<separator>` element'i quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:747
msgid "The title as a section title."
msgstr "Bo'lim sarlavhasi sifatidagi sarlavha."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:781
msgid ""
"The `separator` element can be used to achieve visual separation between "
"elements within the same inner `group` element while keeping them "
"horizontally aligned."
msgstr ""
"`separator` element'i bir xil ichki `group` element'i ichidagi element'lar "
"orasida vizual ajratishga erishish uchun, ularni gorizontal tekislangan "
"holda saqlab, ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:787
msgid "`header`: display workflow buttons and a status"
msgstr "`header`: workflow button'lari va statusni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:789
msgid ""
"The `header` element combined with the :ref:`sheet <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/sheet>` element provides a full-width location above "
"the sheet itself generally used to display workflow :ref:`button <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/button>` elements and a :ref:`field <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/field>` element rendered as status widget."
msgstr ""
"`header` element'i :ref:`sheet <reference/view_architectures/form/sheet>` "
"element'i bilan birgalikda sheet'ning o'zi ustida to'liq kenglikdagi joyni "
"ta'minlaydi; u odatda workflow :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/"
"form/button>` element'larini va status widget sifatida render "
"qilingan :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` element'ini "
"ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:817
msgid "`footer`: display dialog buttons"
msgstr "`footer`: dialog button'larini ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:819
msgid ""
"The `footer` element is used to display :ref:`buttons <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/button>` elements at the end of dialogs."
msgstr ""
"`footer` element'i dialog'lar oxirida :ref:`buttons <reference/"
"view_architectures/form/button>` element'larini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:842
msgid ""
"When no `footer` element is specified, the view's standard buttons (like "
"Save or Discard) will be present by default. It is also possible to avoid "
"replacing the standard buttons in form or x2many dialogs by using the "
"`replace` attribute. This attribute defaults to `True` if not specified but "
"setting it to `False` (or 0) will make it so that the specified `footer` "
"will be added next to the default buttons instead of replacing them."
msgstr ""
"Agar `footer` element'i ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, view'ning standart "
"button'lari (masalan Save yoki Discard) odatiy holda mavjud bo'ladi. "
"Shuningdek, `replace` attribute'idan foydalanib form yoki x2many "
"dialog'larida standart button'larning almashtirilishini oldini olish mumkin. "
"Bu attribute ko'rsatilmasa, uning qiymati `True` bo'ladi, lekin uni `False` "
"(yoki 0) ga o'rnatish ko'rsatilgan `footer` standart button'larni "
"almashtirish o'rniga ularning yoniga qo'shilishiga olib keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:858
msgid "Buttons container"
msgstr "Button'lar container'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:860
msgid ""
"A :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/form/button>` elements "
"container can be created with a `div` element with the class `button_box`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/form/button>` element'lari "
"container'ini `button_box` class'iga ega `div` element'i bilan yaratish "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:893
msgid "Title container"
msgstr "Sarlavha container'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:895
msgid ""
"A title :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` element "
"container can be created with a `div` element with the class `oe_title`."
msgstr ""
"Sarlavha :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` element'i "
"container'ini `oe_title` class'iga ega `div` element'i bilan yaratish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:911
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Sozlamalar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:913
msgid ""
"Settings views are a customization of the :ref:`form <reference/"
"view_architectures/form>` view. They are used to display settings in a "
"centralized place. They differ from generic form views in that they have a "
"search bar and a sidebar."
msgstr ""
"Settings view'lar :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/form>` view'ining "
"moslashtirilgan ko'rinishidir. Ular sozlamalarni markazlashgan joyda "
"ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Ular umumiy form view'lardan search bar va "
"sidebar'ga ega bo'lishi bilan farq qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:946
msgid ""
"Settings views accept the :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/"
"field>`, :ref:`label <reference/view_architectures/form/label>` "
"and :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/form/button>` elements "
"of :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/form>` views, as well as three "
"additional children elements: :ref:`app <reference/view_architectures/"
"settings/app>`, :ref:`block <reference/view_architectures/settings/block>`, "
"and :ref:`setting <reference/view_architectures/settings/setting>`."
msgstr ""
"Settings view'lar :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/form>` "
"view'larining :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/"
"field>`, :ref:`label <reference/view_architectures/form/label>` "
"va :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/form/button>` element'larini, "
"shuningdek uchta qo'shimcha child element'ni qabul qiladi: :ref:`app "
"<reference/view_architectures/settings/app>`, :ref:`block <reference/"
"view_architectures/settings/block>` va :ref:`setting <reference/"
"view_architectures/settings/setting>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:959
msgid "`app`: declare the application"
msgstr "`app`: application'ni e'lon qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:961
msgid ""
"The `app` element is used to declare the application on the settings view. "
"It creates an entry with the logo of the application on the sidebar of the "
"view. It also acts as delimiter when searching."
msgstr ""
"`app` element'i settings view'da application'ni e'lon qilish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. U view'ning sidebar'ida application logotipi bilan yozuv "
"yaratadi. Shuningdek, u qidirish vaqtida ajratuvchi vazifasini bajaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:972
msgid "The `app` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`app` element'i quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:977
msgid "The name of the application."
msgstr "Application nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:985
msgid "The technical name of the application (the name of the module)."
msgstr "Application'ning texnik nomi (module nomi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:993
msgid "The `relative path`_ to the logo."
msgstr "Logotipga olib boruvchi `relative path`_."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:996
msgid "path_"
msgstr "path_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:997
msgid ""
"A path computed with the `name` attribute: :file:`/{name}/static/description/"
"icon.png`"
msgstr ""
"`name` attribute'i yordamida hisoblangan path: :file:`/{name}/static/"
"description/icon.png`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1008
msgid "`block`: declare a group of settings"
msgstr "`block`: sozlamalar guruhini e'lon qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1010
msgid ""
"The `block` element is used to declare a group of settings. This group can "
"have a title and a description."
msgstr ""
"`block` element'i sozlamalar guruhini e'lon qilish uchun ishlatiladi. Bu "
"guruh sarlavha va tavsifga ega bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1025
msgid "The `block` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`block` element'i quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1030
msgid "The title of the block of settings. One can search on its value."
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalar block'ining sarlavhasi. Uning qiymati bo'yicha qidirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1039
msgid "The description of the block of settings. One can search on its value."
msgstr ""
"Sozlamalar block'ining tavsifi. Uning qiymati bo'yicha qidirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1052
msgid "`setting`: declare the setting"
msgstr "`setting`: sozlamani e'lon qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1054
msgid "The `setting` element is used to declare the setting itself."
msgstr "`setting` element'i sozlamaning o'zini e'lon qilish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1056
msgid ""
"The first :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` element in "
"the setting is used as the main field. It is placed on the left panel if it "
"is a boolean field, and on the top of the right panel otherwise. The field "
"is also used to create the setting label if a `string` attribute is not "
"defined."
msgstr ""
"Setting ichidagi birinchi :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/"
"field>` element'i asosiy field sifatida ishlatiladi. Agar u boolean field "
"bo'lsa, chap panelga joylashtiriladi, aks holda o'ng panelning yuqori "
"qismiga joylashtiriladi. Agar `string` attribute'i aniqlanmagan bo'lsa, "
"setting label'ini yaratish uchun ham shu field ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1061
msgid ""
"The `setting` element can also contain additional elements (e.g., HTML). All "
"of those elements are rendered in the right panel."
msgstr ""
"`setting` element'i qo'shimcha element'larni (masalan, HTML) ham o'z ichiga "
"olishi mumkin. Ushbu element'larning barchasi o'ng panelda render qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1080
msgid "The `<setting>` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`<setting>` element'i quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1085
msgid ""
"By default, a setting is visually separated on two panels (left and right), "
"and is used to edit a given :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/"
"field>`. By defining `type=\"header\"`, a special kind of setting is "
"rendered instead. This setting is used to modify the scope of the other "
"settings. For example, on the Website application, this setting is used to "
"indicate to which website the other settings apply. The header setting is "
"visually represented as a banner on top of the screen."
msgstr ""
"Odatiy holda setting vizual jihatdan ikki panelga (chap va o'ng) ajratiladi "
"va berilgan :ref:`field <reference/view_architectures/form/field>` ni "
"tahrirlash uchun ishlatiladi. `type=\"header\"` ni aniqlash orqali uning "
"o'rniga maxsus turdagi setting render qilinadi. Bu setting boshqa "
"sozlamalarning qamrovini o'zgartirish uchun ishlatiladi. Masalan, Website "
"application'ida bu setting boshqa sozlamalar qaysi website'ga taalluqli "
"ekanini ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladi. Header setting vizual jihatdan ekran "
"yuqorisidagi banner sifatida ifodalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1099
msgid "The text used as the label of the setting."
msgstr "Setting'ning label'i sifatida ishlatiladigan matn."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1103
msgid "The first field's label"
msgstr "Birinchi field'ning label'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1108
msgid "The text used as a tooltip."
msgstr "Tooltip sifatida ishlatiladigan matn."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1117
msgid ""
"The description of the setting. This text is displayed just below the "
"setting label (with the class `text-muted`)."
msgstr ""
"Setting'ning tavsifi. Bu matn setting yorlig'i ostida (`text-muted` class "
"bilan) ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1127
msgid ""
"Whether the setting is company-specific. If set, an icon is displayed next "
"to the setting label."
msgstr ""
"Setting company'ga xos bo'ladimi. Agar belgilangan bo'lsa, setting yorlig'i "
"yonida icon ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1129
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1237
msgid "It accepts only the value `'1'`."
msgstr "U faqat `'1'` qiymatini qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1138
msgid ""
"The `path`_ to the documentation on the setting. If set, a clickable icon is "
"displayed next to the setting label. The path can be both an absolute or a "
"`relative path`_. In the latter case, it is relative to `https://"
"www.odoo.com/documentation/<version>`."
msgstr ""
"Setting bo'yicha hujjatlarga olib boruvchi `path`_. Agar belgilangan bo'lsa, "
"setting yorlig'i yonida bosiladigan icon ko'rsatiladi. Path absolut yoki "
"`relative path`_ bo'lishi mumkin. Ikkinchi holatda u `https://www.odoo.com/"
"documentation/<version>` ga nisbatan hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1143
msgid "`path_`"
msgstr "`path_`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1153
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/06_basicviews.rst:21
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/11_sprinkles.rst:315
msgid "List"
msgstr "List"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1155
msgid ""
"The root element of list views is `list` (the previous name was `tree`)."
msgstr "List view'larning root element'i `list` (avvalgi nomi `tree` bo'lgan)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1176
msgid ""
"Optional attributes can be added to the root element `list` to customize the "
"view."
msgstr ""
"View'ni sozlash uchun `list` root element'iga ixtiyoriy attribute'lar "
"qo'shilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1189
msgid "Disable/enable record import from data on the view."
msgstr "View'da ma'lumotlardan record import qilishni o'chirish/yoqish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1198
msgid "Disable/enable record export to data on the view."
msgstr "View'da record'larni ma'lumotlarga export qilishni o'chirish/yoqish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1207
msgid ""
"Make the view's records editable in-place, and allow creating new records "
"from a row of the list. It can have two different values:"
msgstr ""
"View record'larini joyida tahrirlash imkonini beradi va list qatoridan yangi "
"record'lar yaratishga ruxsat beradi. U ikki xil qiymatga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1213
msgid "New records are created from the top of the list."
msgstr "Yangi record'lar list'ning yuqori qismidan yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1218
msgid "New records are created from the bottom of the list."
msgstr "Yangi record'lar list'ning pastki qismidan yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1220
msgid ""
"The architecture for the inline :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/"
"form>` view is derived from the list view. Most attributes valid on a form "
"view's fields and buttons are thus accepted by list views, although they may "
"not have any meaning if the list view is non-editable."
msgstr ""
"Inline :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/form>` view'ining "
"architecture'i list view'dan olingan. Shu sababli form view'ning field va "
"button'larida amal qiladigan ko'pgina attribute'lar list view'lar tomonidan "
"ham qabul qilinadi, garchi list view tahrirlanmaydigan bo'lsa, ular hech "
"qanday ma'noga ega bo'lmasligi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1225
msgid "This behavior is disabled if the `edit` attribute is set to `False`."
msgstr ""
"Agar `edit` attribute'i `False` ga o'rnatilgan bo'lsa, bu xatti-harakat "
"o'chiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1234
msgid ""
"Activate the multi-editing feature that allows updating a field to the same "
"value for multiple records at once."
msgstr ""
"Bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta record uchun field'ni bir xil qiymatga "
"yangilash imkonini beruvchi multi-editing funksiyasini yoqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1246
msgid ""
"Display a button at the end of each row to open the record in a form view."
msgstr ""
"Record'ni form view'da ochish uchun har bir qator oxirida button ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1248
msgid "It has no effect if the view is non-editable."
msgstr "Agar view tahrirlanmaydigan bo'lsa, u hech qanday ta'sir ko'rsatmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/root_attribute_default_group_by.rst:4
msgid ""
"The name of the field on which the records should be grouped by default if "
"no grouping is specified via the action or the current :ref:`search "
"<reference/view_architectures/search>`."
msgstr ""
"Agar action orqali yoki hozirgi :ref:`search <reference/view_architectures/"
"search>` orqali guruhlash ko'rsatilmagan bo'lsa, record'lar sukut bo'yicha "
"qaysi field bo'yicha guruhlanishini belgilaydigan field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/root_attribute_default_order.rst:4
msgid ""
"A comma-separated list of fields names that overrides the ordering defined "
"on the model through the :attr:`~odoo.models.BaseModel._order` attribute."
msgstr ""
"Model'da :attr:`~odoo.models.BaseModel._order` attribute'i orqali "
"belgilangan tartiblashni bekor qiladigan, vergul bilan ajratilgan field "
"nomlari ro'yxati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/root_attribute_default_order.rst:7
msgid ""
"To inverse the sorting order of a field, postfix it with `desc`, separated "
"by a space."
msgstr ""
"Field'ning saralash tartibini teskari qilish uchun uning oxiriga bo'sh joy "
"bilan ajratib `desc` qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1261
msgid ""
"The style that should be applied to matching records' rows, as a Python "
"expression that evaluates to a bool."
msgstr ""
"Mos keladigan record'lar qatorlariga qo'llanishi kerak bo'lgan style; bool "
"qiymat qaytaradigan Python expression sifatida beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1264
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1390
msgid ""
"`<style>` must be replaced by one of `bf` (bold), `it` (italic), `info`, "
"`warning`, `danger`, `muted`, `primary`, and `success`."
msgstr ""
"`<style>` quyidagilardan biri bilan almashtirilishi kerak: `bf` (bold), `it` "
"(italic), `info`, `warning`, `danger`, `muted`, `primary` va `success`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1281
msgid "The default size of a page. It must be strictly positive."
msgstr "Sahifaning sukut bo'yicha o'lchami. U qat'iy musbat bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1285
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1295
msgid "`80` for list views, `40` for X2many lists in form views"
msgstr "list view'lar uchun `80`, form view'lardagi X2many list'lar uchun `40`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1290
msgid ""
"The default number of groups on a page when the list view is grouped. It "
"must be strictly positive."
msgstr ""
"List view guruhlanganda sahifadagi group'lar sukut bo'yicha soni. U qat'iy "
"musbat bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1300
msgid ""
"Whether the first level of groups should be opened by default when the list "
"view is grouped."
msgstr ""
"List view guruhlanganda group'larning birinchi darajasi sukut bo'yicha "
"ochilishi kerakmi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1303
msgid "It may be slow, depending on the number of groups."
msgstr "Group'lar soniga qarab bu sekin ishlashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/root_attribute_sample.rst:4
msgid ""
"Whether the view should be populated with a set of sample records if none "
"are found for the current model."
msgstr ""
"Agar hozirgi model uchun hech qanday record topilmasa, view namuna (sample) "
"record'lar to'plami bilan to'ldirilishi kerakmi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/root_attribute_sample.rst:7
msgid ""
"These fake records have heuristics for certain field names/models. For "
"example, a field `display_name` on the model `res.users` will be populated "
"with sample people names, while an `email` field will be in the form "
"`firstname.lastname@sample.demo`."
msgstr ""
"Bu soxta record'lar ayrim field nomlari/model'lar uchun evristikaga ega. "
"Masalan, `res.users` model'idagi `display_name` field'i namuna shaxs ismlari "
"bilan to'ldiriladi, `email` field'i esa `firstname.lastname@sample.demo` "
"shaklida bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/root_attribute_sample.rst:11
msgid ""
"The user is unable to interact with these data, and they will be discarded "
"as soon as an action is performed (record created, column added, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi bu ma'lumotlar bilan ishlay olmaydi va biror amal bajarilishi "
"bilan (record yaratilishi, column qo'shilishi va h.k.) ular o'chirib "
"tashlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1316
msgid ""
"List views accept the following children elements: :ref:`field <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/field>`, :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/"
"list/button>`, :ref:`groupby <reference/view_architectures/list/"
"groupby>`, :ref:`header <reference/view_architectures/list/"
"header>`, :ref:`control, and create <reference/view_architectures/list/"
"control>`."
msgstr ""
"List view'lar quyidagi child element'larni qabul qiladi: :ref:`field "
"<reference/view_architectures/list/field>`, :ref:`button <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/button>`, :ref:`groupby <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/groupby>`, :ref:`header <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/header>`, :ref:`control, and create <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/control>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1330
msgid ""
"The `field` element renders (and allows editing of, possibly) a single field "
"of all current records as a column."
msgstr ""
"`field` element barcha hozirgi record'larning bitta field'ini column "
"sifatida render qiladi (va imkoni bo'lsa, uni tahrirlashga ruxsat beradi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1333
msgid "Using the same field multiple times in a list view is not supported"
msgstr ""
"Bitta field'ni list view'da bir necha marta ishlatish qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1350
msgid ""
"Make the visibility of the field optional. The field's column can be hidden "
"or shown through a button on the view's header."
msgstr ""
"Field'ning ko'rinishini ixtiyoriy qiladi. Field'ning column'i view "
"header'idagi button orqali yashirilishi yoki ko'rsatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1353
msgid "It can have two different values:"
msgstr "U ikki xil qiymatga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1358
msgid "The field is shown by default."
msgstr "Field sukut bo'yicha ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1363
msgid "The field is hidden by default."
msgstr "Field sukut bo'yicha yashiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_column_invisible.rst:4
msgid ""
"Whether the column is visible (`False`) or hidden (`True`), as a Python "
"expression that evaluates to a bool."
msgstr ""
"Column ko'rinadigan (`False`) yoki yashirin (`True`) bo'lishi; bool qiymat "
"qaytaradigan Python expression sifatida beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures/generic_attribute_column_invisible.rst:7
msgid ""
"Unlike `invisible`, it affects the entire column, and is evaluated without "
"the subtree values."
msgstr ""
"`invisible` dan farqli ravishda, u butun column'ga ta'sir qiladi va subtree "
"qiymatlarisiz hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1387
msgid ""
"The style that should be applied to matching records' field, as a Python "
"expression that evaluates to a bool."
msgstr ""
"Mos keladigan record'lar field'iga qo'llanishi kerak bo'lgan style; bool "
"qiymat qaytaradigan Python expression sifatida beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1406
msgid ""
"The aggregate to display at the bottom of the column. The aggregation is "
"computed on only records that are currently displayed. The aggregation "
"operation must match the corresponding field's `aggregator`."
msgstr ""
"Column pastida ko'rsatiladigan aggregate. Agregatsiya faqat hozirda "
"ko'rsatilgan record'lar bo'yicha hisoblanadi. Agregatsiya amali mos "
"field'ning `aggregator` qiymatiga muvofiq bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1423
msgid ""
"The list view always tries to optimize the available space among columns. "
"For some field types, this is done by enforcing a width, depending on the "
"field type. For instance, we know exactly the number of pixels required to "
"display a date, so we can ensure that a column for a date field doesn't take "
"more space than what is strictly necessary, thus leaving the extra space for "
"the other columns. However, the framework can't guess the adequate width for "
"every field types. For instance, char fields can be used to encode large "
"values, or 3-letter country codes. In the latter case, one can set the width "
"directly in the arch (e.g. `width=\"40px\"`). It represents the width "
"(always in pixels) required to render the values inside the cells. The width "
"of the column will then be the sum of the given value and the cells' left "
"and right paddings."
msgstr ""
"List view har doim column'lar orasidagi mavjud joyni optimallashtirishga "
"harakat qiladi. Ba'zi field turlari uchun bu field turiga qarab kenglikni "
"majburiy belgilash orqali amalga oshiriladi. Masalan, sanani ko'rsatish "
"uchun qancha piksel kerakligini aniq bilamiz, shu sababli date field'i "
"column'i qat'iy zarur bo'lganidan ko'proq joy egallamasligini ta'minlashimiz "
"va ortgan joyni boshqa column'larga qoldirishimiz mumkin. Biroq framework "
"har bir field turi uchun mos kenglikni taxmin qila olmaydi. Masalan, char "
"field'lar katta qiymatlarni yoki 3 harfli davlat kodlarini yozish uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. Ikkinchi holatda kenglikni to'g'ridan-to'g'ri arch'da "
"belgilash mumkin (masalan `width=\"40px\"`). U cell'lar ichidagi qiymatlarni "
"render qilish uchun zarur bo'lgan kenglikni (har doim pikselda) ifodalaydi. "
"Column kengligi esa berilgan qiymat va cell'ning chap hamda o'ng "
"padding'lari yig'indisiga teng bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1440
msgid ""
"Whether the field's column header should remain empty. If set, the column "
"will not be sortable."
msgstr ""
"Field column'ining header'i bo'sh qolishi kerakmi. Agar belgilangan bo'lsa, "
"column saralanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1442
msgid "It accepts only the value `'1'`"
msgstr "U faqat `'1'` qiymatini qabul qiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1449
msgid ""
"When a list view is grouped, numeric fields are aggregated and displayed for "
"each group. Also, if there are too many records in a group, a pager appears "
"on the right of the group row. For this reason, it is a bad practice to have "
"a numeric field in the last column when the list view is in a situation "
"where it can be grouped. However, it does not pose a problem for X2many "
"fields in a form view, as they cannot be grouped."
msgstr ""
"List view guruhlanganda numeric field'lar agregatlanadi va har bir group "
"uchun ko'rsatiladi. Shuningdek, agar group'da record'lar juda ko'p bo'lsa, "
"group qatorining o'ng tomonida pager paydo bo'ladi. Shu sababli list view "
"guruhlanishi mumkin bo'lgan holatda oxirgi column'da numeric field bo'lishi "
"yaxshi amaliyot emas. Biroq bu form view'dagi X2many field'lar uchun muammo "
"tug'dirmaydi, chunki ular guruhlanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1528
msgid "`groupby`: define group headers"
msgstr "`groupby`: group header'larini aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1530
msgid ""
"The `groupby` element is used to define group headers with :ref:`button "
"<reference/view_architectures/list/button>` elements when grouping records "
"on :attr:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` fields. It also accepts :ref:`field "
"<reference/view_architectures/list/field>` elements, which can be used for "
"modifiers. These fields thus belong on the Many2one co-model. These extra "
"fields are fetched in batch."
msgstr ""
"`groupby` element record'lar :attr:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field'lari "
"bo'yicha guruhlanganda :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/list/"
"button>` element'lari bilan group header'larini aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi. "
"U shuningdek modifier'lar uchun ishlatilishi mumkin bo'lgan :ref:`field "
"<reference/view_architectures/list/field>` element'larini ham qabul qiladi. "
"Shu sababli bu field'lar Many2one co-model'ga tegishli bo'ladi. Bu "
"qo'shimcha field'lar batch holida olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1546
msgid "The `groupby` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`groupby` element quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1551
msgid "The name of the a :attr:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field to use as header."
msgstr ""
"Header sifatida ishlatiladigan :attr:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field'ining "
"nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1553
msgid ""
"A special :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/list/button>` element "
"with `type=\"edit\"` can be defined to open the Many2one field's form view."
msgstr ""
"Many2one field'ining form view'ini ochish uchun `type=\"edit\"` bilan "
"maxsus :ref:`button <reference/view_architectures/list/button>` element'ini "
"aniqlash mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1583
msgid ""
"Fields inside the `groupby` element are used only to fetch and store the "
"value, but they are never displayed."
msgstr ""
"`groupby` element ichidagi field'lar faqat qiymatni olish va saqlash uchun "
"ishlatiladi, lekin ular hech qachon ko'rsatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1589
msgid "`header`: display workflow buttons"
msgstr "`header`: workflow button'larini ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1600
msgid "The `header` element accepts the following children elements:"
msgstr "`header` element quyidagi child element'larni qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1605
msgid ""
"The `button` element allows defining buttons in the control panel. It is the "
"same element as the :ref:`button element in list views <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/button>`, but it accepts one more attribute when "
"placed inside a `header` element:"
msgstr ""
"`button` element control panel'da button'larni aniqlash imkonini beradi. "
"Bu :ref:`list view'lardagi button element <reference/view_architectures/list/"
"button>` bilan bir xil element, lekin `header` element ichiga "
"joylashtirilganda u yana bitta attribute'ni qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1612
msgid ""
"Make the button available at all time, without having to select records."
msgstr ""
"Button'ni record'larni tanlash shart bo'lmagan holda har doim mavjud qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1614
msgid "It accepts only the value `always`."
msgstr "U faqat `always` qiymatini qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1652
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2968
msgid "`control`: customize create and delete actions"
msgstr "`control`: create va delete action'larini sozlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1654
msgid ""
"The `control` element allows to customize the create and delete actions. In "
"particular, it allows to add special create buttons with specific contexts, "
"to use regular view buttons as create actions, and to make the create and "
"delete actions available only under certain conditions."
msgstr ""
"`control` element create va delete action'larini sozlash imkonini beradi. "
"Xususan, u maxsus context'lar bilan alohida create button'lari qo'shishga, "
"oddiy view button'larini create action sifatida ishlatishga va create hamda "
"delete action'larini faqat ma'lum shartlarda mavjud qilishga imkon beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1659
msgid ""
"The `control` element is only supported in list views "
"inside :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` or :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"`control` element faqat :class:`~odoo.fields.One2many` "
"yoki :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` field'lar ichidagi list view'larda "
"qo'llab-quvvatlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1673
msgid ""
"The `control` element takes no attributes. It accepts the following children "
"elements:"
msgstr ""
"`control` element hech qanday attribute qabul qilmaydi. U quyidagi child "
"element'larni qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1678
msgid ""
"The given `create` elements replace the default :guilabel:`Add a line` "
"button. A `create` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Berilgan `create` element'lar standart :guilabel:`Add a line` tugmasini "
"almashtiradi. `create` element quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1684
msgid "The button's text."
msgstr "Tugmaning matni."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1702
msgid ""
"Whether the element is visible (`False`) or hidden (`True`), as a Python "
"expression that evaluates to a bool. The parent record and the context can "
"be used in the expresion."
msgstr ""
"Element ko'rinadigan (`False`) yoki yashirilgan (`True`) bo'lishini bool "
"qiymatga hisoblanadigan Python expression sifatida belgilaydi. Expression "
"ichida parent record va context ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1712
msgid ""
"Like :ref:`regular view buttons <reference/view_architectures/list/button>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`oddiy view tugmalari <reference/view_architectures/list/button>` kabi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1716
msgid ""
"The `delete` element allows to conditionnaly hide the delete icon, row by "
"row. There can only be one child of this type. It can have only one "
"attribute:"
msgstr ""
"`delete` element o'chirish ikonkasini qatorlar bo'yicha shartli ravishda "
"yashirishga imkon beradi. Bu turdagi child faqat bitta bo'lishi mumkin. U "
"faqat bitta attribute'ga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1722
msgid ""
"Same as for `create`, except that in this case the record itself can also be "
"used in the expresion."
msgstr ""
"`create` bilan bir xil, faqat bu holatda expression ichida record'ning o'zi "
"ham ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1750
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/06_basicviews.rst:138
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/11_sprinkles.rst:382
msgid "Search"
msgstr "Search"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1752
msgid ""
"Search views are different from other view types in that they are not used "
"to display content. Although they apply to a specific model, they are used "
"to filter another view's content (usually aggregated views; "
"e.g., :ref:`reference/view_architectures/list` and :ref:`reference/"
"view_architectures/graph`)."
msgstr ""
"Search view'lar boshqa view turlaridan farq qiladi, chunki ular kontentni "
"ko'rsatish uchun ishlatilmaydi. Ular ma'lum bir model'ga tegishli bo'lsa-da, "
"boshqa view kontentini filtrlash uchun ishlatiladi (odatda agregatlangan "
"view'lar; masalan, :ref:`reference/view_architectures/list` "
"va :ref:`reference/view_architectures/graph`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1757
msgid "The root element of search views is `search`."
msgstr "Search view'larning root element'i — `search`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1759
msgid "It takes no attributes."
msgstr "U hech qanday attribute qabul qilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1780
msgid ""
"Search views accept the following children elements: :ref:`field <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/field>`, :ref:`filter <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/filter>`, :ref:`separator <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/separator>`, :ref:`group <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/group>`, and :ref:`searchpanel <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/searchpanel>`."
msgstr ""
"Search view'lar quyidagi child element'larni qabul qiladi: :ref:`field "
"<reference/view_architectures/search/field>`, :ref:`filter <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/filter>`, :ref:`separator <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/separator>`, :ref:`group <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/group>` va :ref:`searchpanel <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/searchpanel>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1792
msgid "`field`: filter based on field values"
msgstr "`field`: field qiymatlariga asoslangan filtrlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1794
msgid ""
"The `field` element defines domains or contexts with user-provided values. "
"When search domains are generated, field domains are joined with each other "
"and with filters using the **AND** operator."
msgstr ""
"`field` element foydalanuvchi kiritgan qiymatlar bilan domain yoki "
"context'larni aniqlaydi. Search domain'lar generatsiya qilinganda, field "
"domain'lar bir-biri bilan va filter'lar bilan **AND** operatori yordamida "
"birlashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1808
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2203
msgid "The name of the field to filter on."
msgstr "Filtrlanadigan field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1818
msgid ""
"By default, fields generate domains of the form :samp:`[(name, {operator}, "
"value)]`, where `name` is the field's name and `value` is the value provided "
"by the user, possibly filtered or transformed (e.g., a user is expected to "
"provide the *label* of a selection field's value, not the value itself)."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda field'lar :samp:`[(name, {operator}, value)]` shaklidagi "
"domain'larni generatsiya qiladi, bunda `name` — field nomi, `value` — "
"foydalanuvchi kiritgan qiymat bo'lib, u filtrlangan yoki o'zgartirilgan "
"bo'lishi mumkin (masalan, foydalanuvchi selection field qiymatining o'zini "
"emas, balki *label*ini kiritishi kutiladi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1823
msgid ""
"The `operator` attribute allows overriding the default operator, which "
"depends on the field's type (e.g., `=` for float fields, but `ilike` for "
"char fields and `child_of` for many2one)."
msgstr ""
"`operator` attribute'i field turiga bog'liq bo'lgan standart operatorni "
"override qilishga imkon beradi (masalan, float field'lar uchun `=`, char "
"field'lar uchun `ilike` va many2one uchun `child_of`)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1828
msgid "`=`"
msgstr "`=`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1833
msgid ""
"The domain to use as the field's search domain, as a Python expression that "
"evaluates to a :ref:`domain <reference/orm/domains>`."
msgstr ""
"Field'ning search domain'i sifatida ishlatiladigan domain, :ref:`domain "
"<reference/orm/domains>` ga hisoblanadigan Python expression sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1836
msgid ""
"It  can use the `self` variable to inject the provided value in the custom "
"domain. It can be used to generate significantly more flexible domains than "
"with the `operator` attribute alone (e.g., search on multiple fields at "
"once)."
msgstr ""
"U kiritilgan qiymatni maxsus domain ichiga joylash uchun `self` "
"o'zgaruvchisidan foydalanishi mumkin. Bu faqat `operator` attribute'i bilan "
"mumkin bo'lganidan ancha moslashuvchan domain'lar yaratishga imkon beradi "
"(masalan, bir vaqtning o'zida bir nechta field bo'yicha qidirish)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1840
msgid ""
"If both the `operator` and `filter_domain` attributes are provided, "
"`filter_domain` takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"Agar `operator` va `filter_domain` attribute'lari ikkisi ham berilgan "
"bo'lsa, `filter_domain` ustunlik qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1850
msgid ""
"The context to merge into the context of the view that the search view is "
"targeting, as a Python expression that evaluates to a dict."
msgstr ""
"Search view mo'ljallagan view context'iga qo'shiladigan context, dict "
"qiymatga hisoblanadigan Python expression sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1853
msgid ""
"It can contain user-provided values, which are available under the `self` "
"variable."
msgstr ""
"U foydalanuvchi kiritgan qiymatlarni o'z ichiga olishi mumkin, ular `self` "
"o'zgaruvchisi ostida mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1862
msgid ""
"The filters to apply to the completion results for fields that allow for "
"auto-completion (e.g., :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`)."
msgstr ""
"Avtomatik to'ldirishga ruxsat beruvchi field'lar "
"(masalan, :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one`) uchun to'ldirish natijalariga "
"qo'llanadigan filter'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1893
msgid "`filter`: create pre-defined filters"
msgstr "`filter`: oldindan aniqlangan filter'lar yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1895
msgid ""
"The `filter` element is used to create pre-defined filters that can be "
"toggled in the search view. It allows adding data to the search "
"context :dfn:`the context passed to the data view for searching/filtering`, "
"or appending new sections to the search filter."
msgstr ""
"`filter` element search view'da yoqib-o'chirilishi mumkin bo'lgan oldindan "
"aniqlangan filter'larni yaratish uchun ishlatiladi. U search "
"context'ga :dfn:`qidirish/filtrlash uchun data view'ga uzatiladigan context` "
"ma'lumot qo'shish yoki search filter'ga yangi bo'limlar qo'shish imkonini "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1905
msgid "The `filter` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`filter` element quyidagi attribute'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1910
msgid ""
"The technical name of the filter. It can be used to :ref:`enable it by "
"default <reference/view_architectures/search/defaults>` or as "
"an :ref:`inheritance hook <reference/view_records/inheritance>`."
msgstr ""
"Filter'ning texnik nomi. U :ref:`uni standart holatda yoqish <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/defaults>` uchun yoki :ref:`inheritance hook "
"<reference/view_records/inheritance>` sifatida ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1920
msgid "The label of the filter."
msgstr "Filter'ning label'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1928
msgid "The tooltip displayed when hovering the filter."
msgstr "Filter ustiga sichqoncha olib borilganda ko'rsatiladigan tooltip."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1937
msgid ""
"The domain to append to the action's domain as part of the search domain."
msgstr ""
"Search domain'ning bir qismi sifatida action domain'iga qo'shiladigan domain."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1946
msgid "The name of the `date` or `datetime` field to filter on."
msgstr "Filtrlanadigan `date` yoki `datetime` field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1948
msgid ""
"When used, this attribute creates a set of filters available in a sub-menu "
"of the :guilabel:`Filters` menu. The available filters are time-dependent "
"but not dynamic in the sense that their domains are evaluated at the time of "
"the control panel instantiation."
msgstr ""
"Ishlatilganda, bu attribute :guilabel:`Filters` menyusining sub-menyusida "
"mavjud bo'lgan filter'lar to'plamini yaratadi. Mavjud filter'lar vaqtga "
"bog'liq, biroq dinamik emas — ularning domain'lari control panel yaratilgan "
"paytda hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1957
msgid ""
"By default, these filters contain a dropdown with different sub-filters that "
"allow you to filter based on months, quarters and years. Additionally, you "
"can create custom sub-filters that allow filtering using domains. These "
"custom filters must have the following attributes: `name`, `string` and "
"`domain`."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda bu filter'lar oylar, choraklar va yillar bo'yicha "
"filtrlashga imkon beruvchi turli sub-filter'lardan iborat dropdown'ni o'z "
"ichiga oladi. Bundan tashqari, domain'lar yordamida filtrlashga imkon "
"beruvchi maxsus sub-filter'lar yaratishingiz mumkin. Bu maxsus filter'larda "
"quyidagi attribute'lar bo'lishi shart: `name`, `string` va `domain`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1968
msgid ""
"Note that all custom filters defined this way are mutually exclusive with "
"each other and with the other sub-filters."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, shu yo'l bilan aniqlangan barcha maxsus filter'lar bir-biri "
"bilan va boshqa sub-filter'lar bilan o'zaro istisno qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1977
msgid ""
"The earliest month that will show up in the dropdown of a date filter, as an "
"offset relative to the current month."
msgstr ""
"Date filter dropdown'ida ko'rinadigan eng erta oy, joriy oyga nisbatan "
"offset sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1984
msgid ""
"If the current month is February, the earliest month selectable in the "
"dropdown will be November."
msgstr ""
"Agar joriy oy fevral bo'lsa, dropdown'da tanlanishi mumkin bo'lgan eng erta "
"oy noyabr bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1988
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2022
msgid "`-2`"
msgstr "`-2`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1989
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2006
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2023
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2040
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2072
msgid "Filters with a non-empty `date` attribute"
msgstr "`date` attribute'i bo'sh bo'lmagan filter'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:1994
msgid ""
"The latest month that will show up in the dropdown of a date filter, as an "
"offset relative to the current month."
msgstr ""
"Date filter dropdown'ida ko'rinadigan eng oxirgi oy, joriy oyga nisbatan "
"offset sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2001
msgid ""
"If the current month is February, the latest month selectable in the "
"dropdown will be March."
msgstr ""
"Agar joriy oy fevral bo'lsa, dropdown'da tanlanishi mumkin bo'lgan eng "
"oxirgi oy mart bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2011
msgid ""
"The earliest year that will show up in the dropdown of a date filter, as an "
"offset relative to the current year."
msgstr ""
"Date filter dropdown'ida ko'rinadigan eng erta yil, joriy yilga nisbatan "
"offset sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2018
msgid ""
"If the current year is 2024, the earliest year selectable in the dropdown "
"will be 2021."
msgstr ""
"Agar joriy yil 2024 bo'lsa, dropdown'da tanlanishi mumkin bo'lgan eng erta "
"yil 2021 bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2028
msgid ""
"The latest year that will show up in the dropdown of a date filter, as an "
"offset relative to the current year."
msgstr ""
"Date filter dropdown'ida ko'rinadigan eng oxirgi yil, joriy yilga nisbatan "
"offset sifatida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2035
msgid ""
"If the current year is 2024, the latest year selectable in the dropdown will "
"be 2025."
msgstr ""
"Agar joriy yil 2024 bo'lsa, dropdown'da tanlanishi mumkin bo'lgan eng oxirgi "
"yil 2025 bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2045
msgid ""
"The default period of the time-based filter (with a `date` attribute). It "
"must be one of, or a comma-separated list of valid filter ids."
msgstr ""
"Vaqtga asoslangan filter'ning (`date` attribute'i bilan) standart davri. U "
"to'g'ri filter id'laridan biri yoki ularning vergul bilan ajratilgan "
"ro'yxati bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2048
msgid "Valid filter ids include the following:"
msgstr "To'g'ri filter id'lari quyidagilarni o'z ichiga oladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2050
msgid ""
"`first_quarter`, `second_quarter`, `third_quarter` and `fourth_quarter`."
msgstr ""
"`first_quarter`, `second_quarter`, `third_quarter` va `fourth_quarter`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2051
msgid ""
"One of `month`, `month-x` and `month+x`, where `x` is a non-zero integer "
"value between `start_month` and `end_month`."
msgstr ""
"`month`, `month-x` va `month+x` dan biri, bunda `x` — `start_month` va "
"`end_month` orasidagi noldan farqli butun son qiymati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2052
msgid ""
"One of `year`, `year-x` and `year+x`, where `x` is a non-zero integer value "
"between `start_year` and `end_year`."
msgstr ""
"`year`, `year-x` va `year+x` dan biri, bunda `x` — `start_year` va "
"`end_year` orasidagi noldan farqli butun son qiymati."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2053
msgid ""
"The `name` of any custom filter defined within the filter, prepended with "
"`custom_`."
msgstr ""
"Filter ichida aniqlangan har qanday maxsus filter'ning `name` qiymati, "
"oldiga `custom_` qo'shilgan holda."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2055
msgid ""
"The filter must be in the default set of filters activated at the view "
"initialization."
msgstr ""
"Filter view initsializatsiyasida faollashtiriladigan standart filter'lar "
"to'plamida bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2071
msgid "`month`, or the closest value to the current month if unavailable"
msgstr "`month`, yoki agar mavjud bo'lmasa, joriy oyga eng yaqin qiymat"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2081
msgid ""
"The context merged into the action's domain to generate the search domain"
msgstr ""
"Search domain'ni generatsiya qilish uchun action domain'iga qo'shiladigan "
"context"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2083
msgid ""
"The context key `group_by` set with a field as value can be used to define a "
"group available in the :guilabel:`Group By` menu. When the field is of type "
"`date` or `datetime`, the filter generates a submenu of the :guilabel:`Group "
"By` menu with the following interval options "
"available: :guilabel:`Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week`, "
"and :guilabel:`Day`."
msgstr ""
"Qiymat sifatida field bilan belgilangan `group_by` context "
"kaliti :guilabel:`Group By` menyusida mavjud bo'lgan guruhni aniqlash uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. Field `date` yoki `datetime` turida bo'lganda, "
"filter :guilabel:`Group By` menyusining sub-menyusini quyidagi interval "
"variantlari bilan generatsiya "
"qiladi: :guilabel:`Year`, :guilabel:`Quarter`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Week` "
"va :guilabel:`Day`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2096
msgid ""
"The results of `formatted_read_group` grouped on a field may be influenced "
"by its `group_expand` attribute, allowing to display empty groups when "
"needed. For more information, please refer to :class:`~odoo.fields.Field`."
msgstr ""
"Field bo'yicha guruhlangan `formatted_read_group` natijalariga uning "
"`group_expand` attribute'i ta'sir qilishi mumkin, bu kerak bo'lganda bo'sh "
"guruhlarni ko'rsatishga imkon beradi. Qo'shimcha ma'lumot "
"uchun :class:`~odoo.fields.Field` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2105
msgid ""
"Sequences of filters (without non-filters elements separating them) are "
"treated as inclusively composited: they will be composed with `OR` rather "
"than the usual `AND`."
msgstr ""
"Ketma-ket kelgan filter'lar (ular orasida filter bo'lmagan element'lar "
"bo'lmasa) inklyuziv tarzda birlashtirilgan deb hisoblanadi: ular odatdagi "
"`AND` emas, balki `OR` bilan birlashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2114
msgid "Records whose `state` field is `draft` or `done` are shown."
msgstr "`state` field'i `draft` yoki `done` bo'lgan record'lar ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2123
msgid ""
"Records whose `state` field is `draft` **and** `delay` field is below 15."
msgstr ""
"`state` field'i `draft` **va** `delay` field'i 15 dan kichik bo'lgan "
"record'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2144
msgid "`separator`: separate groups of filters"
msgstr "`separator`: filter guruhlarini ajratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2146
msgid ""
"The `separator` element is used to separates groups of :ref:`filters "
"<reference/view_architectures/search/filter>` in simple search views. For "
"more complex search views, the :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/"
"search/group>` element is recommended."
msgstr ""
"`separator` element oddiy search view'larda :ref:`filter <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/filter>` guruhlarini ajratish uchun ishlatiladi. "
"Murakkabroq search view'lar uchun :ref:`group <reference/view_architectures/"
"search/group>` element tavsiya etiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2158
msgid "The `separator` element takes no attributes."
msgstr "`separator` element hech qanday attribut qabul qilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2163
msgid "`group`: separate groups of filters"
msgstr "`group`: filter guruhlarini ajratish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2165
msgid ""
"The `group` element is used to separate groups of :ref:`filters <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/filter>` in cluttered search views. In simpler "
"search views, it can be substituted for the :ref:`separator <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/group>` element."
msgstr ""
"`group` element to'planib ketgan search view'larda :ref:`filter <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/filter>` guruhlarini ajratish uchun ishlatiladi. "
"Oddiyroq search view'larda uning o'rniga :ref:`separator <reference/"
"view_architectures/search/group>` element ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2177
msgid "The `group` element takes no attributes."
msgstr "`group` element hech qanday attribut qabul qilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2182
msgid "`searchpanel`: display search panels"
msgstr "`searchpanel`: search panel'larni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2184
msgid ""
"The `searchpanel` element displays a search panel to the left of multi-"
"records views. It allows for quickly filtering data on the basis of given "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"`searchpanel` element ko'p record'li view'larning chap tomonida search "
"panel'ni ko'rsatadi. U berilgan field'lar asosida ma'lumotlarni tez "
"filtrlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2195
msgid "The `searchpanel` element accepts only `field` children elements."
msgstr "`searchpanel` element faqat `field` child element'larini qabul qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2197
msgid ""
"The `field` element used as a child element of a `searchpanel` element can "
"have the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"`searchpanel` element'ining child element'i sifatida ishlatiladigan `field` "
"element quyidagi attribut'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2213
msgid ""
"The behavior and display of the field. It can have two different values:"
msgstr ""
"Field'ning xatti-harakati va ko'rinishi. U ikki xil qiymatga ega bo'lishi "
"mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2218
msgid ""
"At most one value can be selected. Supported field types are `many2one` and "
"`selection`."
msgstr ""
"Ko'pi bilan bitta qiymat tanlanishi mumkin. Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field "
"turlari — `many2one` va `selection`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2223
msgid ""
"Several values can be selected. Supported field types are `many2one`, "
"`many2many` and `selection`."
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta qiymat tanlanishi mumkin. Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan field turlari — "
"`many2one`, `many2many` va `selection`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2228
msgid "`one`"
msgstr "`one`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2235
msgid "The icon of the field."
msgstr "Field'ning icon'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2244
msgid "The color of the field."
msgstr "Field'ning rangi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2250
msgid ""
"When the `field` element has the `select=one` attribute set, it can have the "
"following additional attributes:"
msgstr ""
"`field` element'ida `select=one` attribut'i o'rnatilganda, u quyidagi "
"qo'shimcha attribut'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2256
msgid ""
"Whether child categories should appear under their parent category, or at "
"the same hierarchy level."
msgstr ""
"Child kategoriyalar o'zining parent kategoriyasi ostida yoki bir xil "
"ierarxiya darajasida ko'rinishi kerakligini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2262
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2272
msgid ":class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` fields"
msgstr ":class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` field'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2267
msgid ""
"If set to a non zero integer, the hierarchy (if any) will be unfold up to "
"the given level."
msgstr ""
"Noldan farqli integer qiymat o'rnatilsa, ierarxiya (agar mavjud bo'lsa) "
"berilgan darajagacha ochib ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2270
msgid "integer"
msgstr "integer"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2274
msgid ""
"When the `field` element has the `select=multi` attribute set, it can have "
"the following additional attributes:"
msgstr ""
"`field` element'ida `select=multi` attribut'i o'rnatilganda, u quyidagi "
"qo'shimcha attribut'larga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2280
msgid "Whether the record counters is computed and displayed if non-zero."
msgstr ""
"Record hisoblagichlari hisoblanishi va noldan farqli bo'lsa ko'rsatilishini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2283
msgid ""
"This attribute exists to avoid impacting performance. Another way to address "
"performance issues is to override the `search_panel_select_range` and "
"`search_panel_select_multi_range` methods."
msgstr ""
"Bu attribut unumdorlikka salbiy ta'sir qilmaslik uchun mavjud. Unumdorlik "
"muammolarini hal qilishning yana bir yo'li — `search_panel_select_range` va "
"`search_panel_select_multi_range` method'larini override qilish."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2294
msgid "Whether categories and filters with no records should be shown."
msgstr ""
"Record'i bo'lmagan kategoriya va filter'lar ko'rsatilishi kerakligini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2303
msgid ""
"The maximal number of values to fetch for the field. If the limit is "
"reached, no values are displayed on the search panel, and an error message "
"is shown instead. If set to 0, all values are fetched."
msgstr ""
"Field uchun olinadigan qiymatlarning maksimal soni. Agar limit'ga yetilsa, "
"search panel'da hech qanday qiymat ko'rsatilmaydi va uning o'rniga xato "
"xabari chiqadi. 0 ga o'rnatilsa, barcha qiymatlar olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2309
msgid "`200`"
msgstr "`200`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2314
msgid "The conditions that the records have to satisfy."
msgstr "Record'lar qanoatlantirishi kerak bo'lgan shartlar."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2331
msgid "The name of the field name on which values should be grouped."
msgstr "Qiymatlar guruhlanishi kerak bo'lgan field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2336
msgid ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` and :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` fields"
msgstr ""
":class:`~odoo.fields.Many2one` va :class:`~odoo.fields.Many2many` field'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2341
msgid "Search defaults"
msgstr "Search uchun standart qiymatlar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2343
msgid ""
"Search fields and filters can be configured through the action's `context` "
"using :samp:`search_default_{name}` keys. For fields, the value must be the "
"value to set to the field. For filters, it must be a boolean value or a "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Search field'lari va filter'lari action'ning `context`'i "
"orqali :samp:`search_default_{name}` kalitlari yordamida sozlanishi mumkin. "
"Field'lar uchun qiymat field'ga o'rnatiladigan qiymat bo'lishi kerak. "
"Filter'lar uchun esa bu boolean qiymat yoki son bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2348
msgid ""
"With `foo`, a field, and `bar`, a filter, the following action context will "
"search `foo` on `acro` and enable `bar` by default:"
msgstr ""
"`foo` — field, `bar` — filter bo'lsa, quyidagi action context standart "
"holatda `foo` bo'yicha `acro` ni qidiradi va `bar` ni yoqadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2358
msgid ""
"A numeric value (between 1 and 99) can be used to define the order of "
"default *groupby* filters."
msgstr ""
"Standart *groupby* filter'larining tartibini aniqlash uchun raqamli qiymat "
"(1 dan 99 gacha) ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2361
msgid ""
"With `foo` and `bar`, two *groupby* filters, the following action context "
"will first enable `bar`, then `foo`."
msgstr ""
"`foo` va `bar` — ikkita *groupby* filter bo'lsa, quyidagi action context "
"avval `bar` ni, so'ngra `foo` ni yoqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2374
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1043
msgid "Kanban"
msgstr "Kanban"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2376
msgid ""
"Kanban views are used as a `kanban board <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Kanban_board>`_ visualisation: they display records as \"cards\", halfway "
"between a :ref:`list <reference/view_architectures/list>` and a :ref:`form "
"<reference/view_architectures/form>` view."
msgstr ""
"Kanban view'lar `kanban board <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kanban_board>`_ "
"vizualizatsiyasi sifatida ishlatiladi: ular record'larni \"karta\"lar "
"shaklida ko'rsatadi — :ref:`list <reference/view_architectures/list>` "
"va :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/form>` view o'rtasidagi "
"ko'rinishda."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2380
msgid ""
"Records may be grouped in columns for use in workflow visualisation or "
"manipulation (e.g., tasks or work-progress management), or ungrouped (used "
"simply to visualize records)."
msgstr ""
"Record'lar workflow'ni vizualizatsiya qilish yoki boshqarish uchun "
"ustunlarga guruhlanishi mumkin (masalan, vazifalar yoki ish jarayonini "
"boshqarish), yoki guruhlanmagan holda qoldiriladi (shunchaki record'larni "
"ko'rsatish uchun)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2383
msgid "The root element of Kanban views is `kanban`."
msgstr "Kanban view'larning root element'i — `kanban`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2400
msgid ""
"Kanban views load and display a maximum of ten columns. Any column after "
"that is closed but can still be opened by the user."
msgstr ""
"Kanban view'lar ko'pi bilan o'nta ustunni yuklaydi va ko'rsatadi. Undan "
"keyingi ustunlar yopiq bo'ladi, lekin foydalanuvchi ularni ocha oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2408
msgid ""
"Optional attributes can be added to the root element `kanban` to customize "
"the view."
msgstr ""
"View'ni sozlash uchun `kanban` root element'iga ixtiyoriy attribut'lar "
"qo'shilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2425
msgid "Add HTML classes to the root HTML element of the view."
msgstr "View'ning root HTML element'iga HTML class'lar qo'shadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2434
msgid ""
"The key in the `KanbanExamplesRegistry` of the examples that can be browsed "
"when creating a new column in the grouped kanban view."
msgstr ""
"Guruhlangan kanban view'da yangi ustun yaratilganda ko'rib chiqish mumkin "
"bo'lgan misollarning `KanbanExamplesRegistry` dagi kaliti."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2438
msgid ""
"`Use of the examples attribute in the utm module <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/blob/19.0/addons/utm/static/src/js/utm_campaign_kanban_examples.js>`_"
msgstr ""
"`utm module'da examples attribut'idan foydalanish <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/blob/19.0/addons/utm/static/src/js/utm_campaign_kanban_examples.js>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2448
msgid "Whether the :guilabel:`Add a new column` bar is visible."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Add a new column` paneli ko'rinishini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2457
msgid "Whether columns can be deleted via the cog menu."
msgstr "Ustunlarni cog menyusi orqali o'chirish mumkinligini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2466
msgid "Whether columns can be edited via the cog menu."
msgstr "Ustunlarni cog menyusi orqali tahrirlash mumkinligini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2475
msgid "Whether columns can be reordered."
msgstr "Ustunlar tartibini o'zgartirish mumkinligini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2484
msgid "Whether records can be dragged when the kanban view is grouped."
msgstr ""
"Kanban view guruhlanganda record'larni sudrab ko'chirish mumkinligini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2493
msgid ""
"Whether records belonging to a column can be archived and unarchived when "
"the `active` field is defined on the model."
msgstr ""
"Model'da `active` field aniqlangan bo'lsa, ustunga tegishli record'larni "
"arxivlash va arxivdan chiqarish mumkinligini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2503
msgid ""
"Whether it should be possible to create records without switching to the "
"form view."
msgstr ""
"Form view'ga o'tmasdan record'lar yaratish mumkin bo'lishi kerakligini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2507
msgid ""
"`True` when the kanban view is grouped by many2one, selection, char, or "
"boolean fields, otherwise `False`"
msgstr ""
"Kanban view many2one, selection, char yoki boolean field'lar bo'yicha "
"guruhlanganda `True`, aks holda `False`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2513
msgid ""
"The reference of the :ref:`form <reference/view_architectures/form>` view to "
"open when using the quick creation of records."
msgstr ""
"Record'larni tez yaratishda ochiladigan :ref:`form <reference/"
"view_architectures/form>` view'ning reference'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2523
msgid "The custom action to call when clicking on :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Create` bosilganda chaqiriladigan maxsus action."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2525
msgid ""
"If set to `'quick_create'`, the quick creation of records is used instead. "
"If the quick creation is disabled, the standard create action is called."
msgstr ""
"Agar `'quick_create'` ga o'rnatilsa, uning o'rniga record'larni tez yaratish "
"ishlatiladi. Agar tez yaratish o'chirilgan bo'lsa, standart create action "
"chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2535
msgid ""
"By default, clicking on a kanban card opens the corresponding record in a "
"form view. This behavior can be disabled by setting the attribute `can_open` "
"to `False`."
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda kanban kartasini bosish mos record'ni form view'da ochadi. "
"Bu xatti-harakatni `can_open` attribut'ini `False` ga o'rnatish bilan "
"o'chirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2545
msgid ""
"Name of the integer field used to color the left border of the kanban cards."
msgstr ""
"Kanban kartalarining chap chegarasini bo'yash uchun ishlatiladigan integer "
"field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2557
msgid ""
"Kanban views accept the following children elements: :ref:`templates "
"<reference/view_architectures/kanban/templates>`, :ref:`field <reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban/field>`, :ref:`header <reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban/header>`, :ref:`progressbar <reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban/progressbar>`."
msgstr ""
"Kanban view'lar quyidagi child element'larni qabul qiladi: :ref:`templates "
"<reference/view_architectures/kanban/templates>`, :ref:`field <reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban/field>`, :ref:`header <reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban/header>`, :ref:`progressbar <reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban/progressbar>`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2566
msgid "`templates`: define cards structure"
msgstr "`templates`: kartalar strukturasini aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2568
msgid ""
"The `templates` element is used to define the :ref:`QWeb templates "
"<reference/qweb>` that structure the kanban cards."
msgstr ""
"`templates` element kanban kartalarini strukturalashtiruvchi :ref:`QWeb "
"template'larini <reference/qweb>` aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2571
msgid ""
"The definition of a card's structure can be split into multiple templates "
"for clarity, but at least one root `card` template must be defined."
msgstr ""
"Card tuzilishining ta'rifi aniqlik uchun bir nechta template'larga "
"bo'linishi mumkin, lekin kamida bitta ildiz `card` template'i aniqlanishi "
"shart."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2574
msgid ""
"An additional template can be defined: `menu`. If defined, it is rendered "
"inside a dropdown that can be toggled with a vertical ellipsis "
"(:guilabel:`⋮`) on the top right of the card."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha template aniqlanishi mumkin: `menu`. Agar aniqlansa, u card'ning "
"yuqori o'ng burchagidagi vertikal uch nuqta (:guilabel:`⋮`) yordamida "
"ochiladigan dropdown ichida render qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2577
msgid ""
"The templates are written in :ref:`JavaScript QWeb <reference/qweb/"
"javascript>`."
msgstr ""
"Template'lar :ref:`JavaScript QWeb <reference/qweb/javascript>` da yoziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2591
msgid ""
"These are QWeb templates, not `Owl <https://github.com/odoo/owl>`_ "
"templates, meaning that directives like `t-on-click` aren't available."
msgstr ""
"Bular QWeb template'lari, `Owl <https://github.com/odoo/owl>`_ template'lari "
"emas, ya'ni `t-on-click` kabi direktivalar mavjud emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2597
msgid ""
"Inside those templates, the `field` element allows to render a field. It can "
"have the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Ushbu template'lar ichida `field` elementi field'ni render qilish imkonini "
"beradi. U quyidagi atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2602
msgid ""
"By default, field nodes are replaced by a `span` containing their formatted "
"value, unless the `widget` attribute is specified, in which case their "
"rendering and behavior depends on the corresponding widget. The `widget` "
"attribute can have different values including:"
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha field node'lari o'zining formatlangan qiymatini o'z ichiga "
"olgan `span` bilan almashtiriladi, agar `widget` atributi ko'rsatilmagan "
"bo'lsa; ko'rsatilgan holda ularning render qilinishi va xatti-harakati mos "
"widget'ga bog'liq bo'ladi. `widget` atributi turli qiymatlarga ega bo'lishi "
"mumkin, jumladan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2609
msgid ""
"Allows reordering records with a drag and drop, using the corresponding "
"field as order."
msgstr ""
"Mos field'ni tartib sifatida ishlatib, record'larni drag and drop bilan "
"qayta tartiblash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2614
msgid ""
"Allows editing a color (integer) field. Combined with the root attribute "
"`highlight_color`, allows editing the color of the cards."
msgstr ""
"Rang (integer) field'ini tahrirlash imkonini beradi. Ildiz `highlight_color` "
"atributi bilan birgalikda card'larning rangini tahrirlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2617
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Field section <reference/js/widgets>` to discover various "
"widgets and their options."
msgstr ""
"Turli widget'lar va ularning parametrlari bilan tanishish uchun :ref:`Field "
"section <reference/js/widgets>` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2621
msgid "Rendering Context"
msgstr "Render qilish context'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2623
msgid ""
"Kanban templates being rendered with the :ref:`QWeb engine <reference/qweb/"
"javascript>`, they have a *rendering context*, a set of variables available "
"in the templates, containing useful information and tools. Here're the "
"available variables:"
msgstr ""
"Kanban template'lari :ref:`QWeb engine <reference/qweb/javascript>` bilan "
"render qilinganligi sababli, ularda *rendering context* — template'larda "
"mavjud bo'lgan, foydali ma'lumot va vositalarni o'z ichiga olgan "
"o'zgaruvchilar to'plami bo'ladi. Mavjud o'zgaruvchilar quyidagilar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2630
msgid ""
"An object with all the fields defined in the view. Each field has two "
"attributes: `value` and `raw_value`. The former is formatted according to "
"current user parameters, while the latter is the raw value (e.g. the `id` "
"for a many2one field). This object is useful for instance, for using field "
"values inside `t-if` conditions. For display purposes, we recommend using "
"the `<field>` tag."
msgstr ""
"View'da aniqlangan barcha field'larni o'z ichiga olgan obyekt. Har bir field "
"ikkita atributga ega: `value` va `raw_value`. Birinchisi joriy foydalanuvchi "
"parametrlariga muvofiq formatlanadi, ikkinchisi esa xom qiymat (masalan, "
"many2one field uchun `id`). Bu obyekt, masalan, field qiymatlarini `t-if` "
"shartlari ichida ishlatish uchun foydali. Ko'rsatish maqsadida `<field>` "
"tag'idan foydalanishni tavsiya qilamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2652
msgid "An object with 2 keys defining the available actions for the user:"
msgstr "Foydalanuvchi uchun mavjud amallarni aniqlaydigan 2 kalitli obyekt:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2654
msgid "`editable`: true if the user can edit records, false otherwise;"
msgstr ""
"`editable`: agar foydalanuvchi record'larni tahrirlashi mumkin bo'lsa true, "
"aks holda false;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2655
msgid "`deletable`: true if the user can delete records, false otherwise."
msgstr ""
"`deletable`: agar foydalanuvchi record'larni o'chirishi mumkin bo'lsa true, "
"aks holda false."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2657
msgid ""
"This is useful to conditionally display elements requiring specific access "
"rights."
msgstr ""
"Bu maxsus kirish huquqlarini talab qiladigan elementlarni shartli ravishda "
"ko'rsatish uchun foydali."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2676
msgid ""
"The current context propagated from either the action that opens the kanban "
"view, or the one2many or many2many field that embeds the kanban view in a "
"form view."
msgstr ""
"Kanban view'ni ochadigan action'dan yoki kanban view'ni form view ichiga "
"joylashtiruvchi one2many yoki many2many field'dan tarqatilgan joriy context."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2682
msgid "Indicates that the view is readonly."
msgstr "View readonly ekanini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2689
msgid ""
"Whether the kanban view is opened when selecting a many2one or many2many "
"field (in mobile environment)."
msgstr ""
"Kanban view many2one yoki many2many field'ni tanlashda ochiladimi yoki yo'q "
"(mobil environment'da)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2697
msgid ""
"The `luxon <https://moment.github.io/luxon/api-docs/index.html>`_ object, "
"allowing to manipulate date and datetime field values."
msgstr ""
"`luxon <https://moment.github.io/luxon/api-docs/index.html>`_ obyekti — date "
"va datetime field qiymatlari bilan ishlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2703
msgid ""
"The Javascript `JSON <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/"
"JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/JSON>`_ namespace object containing a "
"`parse` method allowing to parse json field values into Javascript Objects."
msgstr ""
"json field qiymatlarini Javascript Object'larga parse qilish imkonini "
"beruvchi `parse` method'ini o'z ichiga olgan Javascript `JSON <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/"
"JSON>`_ namespace obyekti."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2708
msgid "Buttons and links"
msgstr "Button'lar va havolalar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2710
msgid ""
"While most of the kanban templates are standard :ref:`QWeb templates "
"<reference/qweb>`, the kanban view processes `button` and `a` elements is a "
"special way. Buttons and links with a `type` attribute perform different "
"operations than their standard HTML function. The `type` attribute can have "
"the values `action` and `object` of :ref:`regular buttons <reference/"
"view_architectures/list/button>`, or the following values:"
msgstr ""
"Kanban template'larining ko'pchiligi standart :ref:`QWeb templates "
"<reference/qweb>` bo'lsa-da, kanban view `button` va `a` elementlarini "
"maxsus tarzda qayta ishlaydi. `type` atributiga ega button'lar va havolalar "
"standart HTML funksiyasidan farqli amallarni bajaradi. `type` "
"atributi :ref:`regular buttons <reference/view_architectures/list/button>` "
"ning `action` va `object` qiymatlariga yoki quyidagi qiymatlarga ega "
"bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2719
msgid "Clicking the element opens the card's record in form view."
msgstr "Elementni bosish card'ning record'ini form view'da ochadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2724
msgid "Clicking the element deletes the card's record and removes the card."
msgstr ""
"Elementni bosish card'ning record'ini o'chiradi va card'ni olib tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2729
msgid "Clicking the element archives the card's record and removes the card."
msgstr ""
"Elementni bosish card'ning record'ini arxivlaydi va card'ni olib tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2734
msgid "Clicking the element unarchives the card's record and removes the card."
msgstr ""
"Elementni bosish card'ning record'ini arxivdan chiqaradi va card'ni olib "
"tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2739
msgid ""
"Clicking the element allows to select an image to set as cover image of the "
"record."
msgstr ""
"Elementni bosish record'ning cover rasmi sifatida o'rnatiladigan rasmni "
"tanlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2744
msgid ""
"The `widget` element allows to insert dynamically generated (in Javascript) "
"html inside the cards. It has a mandatory `name` attribute, referring to a "
"Javascript implementation (an Owl component) registered to the "
"`view_widgets` registry."
msgstr ""
"`widget` elementi card'lar ichiga dinamik tarzda (Javascript'da) yaratilgan "
"html'ni joylashtirish imkonini beradi. U majburiy `name` atributiga ega "
"bo'lib, u `view_widgets` registry'ga ro'yxatga olingan Javascript "
"implementatsiyasiga (Owl component'ga) ishora qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2750
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`Widget section <reference/javascript_reference/view_widgets>` "
"to discover various widgets and their options."
msgstr ""
"Turli widget'lar va ularning parametrlari bilan tanishish uchun :ref:`Widget "
"section <reference/javascript_reference/view_widgets>` ga qarang."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2754
msgid "Layouts"
msgstr "Layout'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2756
msgid ""
"Several card layouts can be easily obtained using standard html elements and "
"`Bootstrap utility classes <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/api/"
">`_. By default, the card is a `flexbox container <https://"
"developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_flexible_box_layout/"
"Basic_concepts_of_flexbox>`_ with `column` direction."
msgstr ""
"Bir nechta card layout'larini standart html elementlari va `Bootstrap "
"utility classes <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/api/>`_ "
"yordamida osongina olish mumkin. Sukut bo'yicha card `column` yo'nalishiga "
"ega `flexbox container <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/"
"CSS_flexible_box_layout/Basic_concepts_of_flexbox>`_ hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2774
msgid ""
"The `footer` html element is styled to stick to the bottom of the card, and "
"is as a flexbox container with `row` direction, allowing to easily display "
"several fields on the same line."
msgstr ""
"`footer` html elementi card'ning pastiga yopishib turadigan qilib stillangan "
"va `row` yo'nalishiga ega flexbox container bo'lib, bir nechta field'ni "
"bitta qatorda osongina ko'rsatish imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2794
msgid ""
"To display some content, like an image, on the side of the card, one can use "
"`aside` and `main` html elements, with the `flex-row` classname on the card. "
"The `main` node is a flexbox container like the card is when there's no "
"`aside`."
msgstr ""
"Card'ning yon tomonida biror kontentni, masalan rasmni, ko'rsatish uchun "
"card'da `flex-row` class nomi bilan `aside` va `main` html elementlaridan "
"foydalanish mumkin. `main` node `aside` bo'lmagan holatdagi card kabi "
"flexbox container hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2821
msgid ""
"The classname `o_kanban_aside_full` set on the `aside` element removes the "
"padding so that the image spreads to the borders of the card."
msgstr ""
"`aside` elementiga o'rnatilgan `o_kanban_aside_full` class nomi padding'ni "
"olib tashlaydi, natijada rasm card chegaralariga qadar cho'ziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2827
msgid "`field`: declare more fields to fetch"
msgstr "`field`: olib kelinadigan qo'shimcha field'larni e'lon qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2829
msgid ""
"The `field` element can also be used *outside* the kanban :ref:`templates "
"<reference/view_architectures/kanban/templates>`. In that case, it allows to "
"declare fields that are not displayed in the card, but still need to be "
"fetched, for instance because their value is used in a `t-if` condition."
msgstr ""
"`field` elementi kanban :ref:`templates <reference/view_architectures/kanban/"
"templates>` dan *tashqarida* ham ishlatilishi mumkin. Bu holda u card'da "
"ko'rsatilmaydigan, lekin baribir olib kelinishi kerak bo'lgan field'larni "
"e'lon qilish imkonini beradi, masalan ularning qiymati `t-if` shartida "
"ishlatilgani uchun."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2850
msgid "`header`: display buttons in the control panel"
msgstr "`header`: control panel'da button'larni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2852
msgid ""
"The `header` element is used to insert custom buttons in the control panel."
msgstr ""
"`header` elementi control panel'ga maxsus button'lar joylashtirish uchun "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2863
msgid ""
"The `header` element accepts only `button` children elements, similar "
"to :ref:`list views' button <reference/view_architectures/list/button>` "
"elements."
msgstr ""
"`header` elementi faqat `button` farzand elementlarini qabul qiladi, "
"bu :ref:`list views' button <reference/view_architectures/list/button>` "
"elementlariga o'xshash."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2866
msgid ""
"The `button` element used as a child element of the `header` element can "
"have the following additional attributes:"
msgstr ""
"`header` elementining farzand elementi sifatida ishlatiladigan `button` "
"elementi quyidagi qo'shimcha atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2872
msgid "The display mode of the button. It can have two different values:"
msgstr ""
"Button'ning ko'rsatish rejimi. U ikkita turli qiymatga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2877
msgid ""
"The button is displayed only when some records are selected; their action "
"applies to the selected records."
msgstr ""
"Button faqat ba'zi record'lar tanlangandagina ko'rsatiladi; ularning "
"action'i tanlangan record'larga qo'llaniladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2884
msgid "The button is displayed at all times, even if no records are selected."
msgstr ""
"Button doimo ko'rsatiladi, hatto hech qanday record tanlanmagan bo'lsa ham."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2887
msgid ""
"Only the `always` display mode is available because it is not yet possible "
"to select records in a kanban view."
msgstr ""
"Faqat `always` ko'rsatish rejimi mavjud, chunki kanban view'da record'larni "
"tanlash hozircha imkonsiz."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2900
msgid "`display`"
msgstr "`display`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2905
msgid "`progressbar`: show progress bars on top of columns"
msgstr "`progressbar`: ustunlar tepasida progress bar'larni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2907
msgid ""
"The `progressbar` element is used to define a progress bar to display on top "
"of kanban columns in grouped kanban views."
msgstr ""
"`progressbar` elementi guruhlangan kanban view'larda kanban ustunlari "
"tepasida ko'rsatiladigan progress bar'ni aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2917
msgid "The `progressbar` element can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "`progressbar` elementi quyidagi atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2922
msgid "The name of the field on which the progress bar's sub-groups are based."
msgstr "Progress bar'ning sub-guruhlari asoslangan field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2931
msgid ""
"The mapping of the progress bar's field values to the color values `muted`, "
"`success`, `warning`, and `danger`."
msgstr ""
"Progress bar field qiymatlarining `muted`, `success`, `warning` va `danger` "
"rang qiymatlariga moslashtirilishi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2935
msgid ""
"`JSON <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Global_Objects/JSON>`_"
msgstr ""
"`JSON <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/"
"Global_Objects/JSON>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2941
msgid ""
"The name of the field to use in a sum displayed next to the progress bar. If "
"not set, the total number of records is displayed instead."
msgstr ""
"Progress bar yonida ko'rsatiladigan yig'indida ishlatiladigan field nomi. "
"Agar o'rnatilmagan bo'lsa, uning o'rniga record'larning umumiy soni "
"ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2970
msgid "Like for :ref:`list views <reference/view_architectures/list/control>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`list views <reference/view_architectures/list/control>` uchun bo'lgani "
"kabi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2973
msgid "kanban-specific CSS"
msgstr "kanban'ga xos CSS"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2974
msgid "kanban structures/widgets (vignette, details, ...)"
msgstr "kanban tuzilmalari/widget'lari (vignette, details, ...)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2983
msgid ""
"QWeb views are standard :ref:`reference/qweb` templates inside a view's "
"``arch``. They don't have a specific root element. Because QWeb views don't "
"have a specific root element, their type must be specified explicitly (it "
"can not be inferred from the root element of the ``arch`` field)."
msgstr ""
"QWeb view'lar view'ning ``arch`` maydoni ichidagi standart :ref:`reference/"
"qweb` template'laridir. Ularda maxsus ildiz elementi bo'lmaydi. QWeb "
"view'larda maxsus ildiz elementi bo'lmagani uchun, ularning turi aniq "
"ko'rsatilishi shart (u ``arch`` field'ining ildiz elementidan aniqlab "
"olinmaydi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2988
msgid "QWeb views have two use cases:"
msgstr "QWeb view'larning ikkita qo'llanish holati bor:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2990
msgid ""
"they can be used as frontend templates, in which case :ref:`reference/data/"
"template` should be used as a shortcut."
msgstr ""
"ular frontend template'lari sifatida ishlatilishi mumkin, bu holda qisqartma "
"sifatida :ref:`reference/data/template` dan foydalanish kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2992
msgid ""
"they can be used as actual qweb views (opened inside an action), in which "
"case they should be defined as regular view with an explicit ``type`` (it "
"can not be inferred) and a model."
msgstr ""
"ular haqiqiy qweb view'lar sifatida (action ichida ochiladigan) ishlatilishi "
"mumkin, bu holda ular aniq ``type`` (u aniqlab olinmaydi) va model bilan "
"oddiy view sifatida aniqlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2996
msgid "The main additions of qweb-as-view to the basic qweb-as-template are:"
msgstr ""
"qweb-as-view oddiy qweb-as-template'ga qo'shadigan asosiy imkoniyatlar "
"quyidagilar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:2998
msgid ""
"qweb-as-view has a special case for a ``<nav>`` element bearing the CSS "
"class ``o_qweb_cp_buttons``: its contents should be buttons and will be "
"extracted and moved to the control panel's button area, the ``<nav>`` itself "
"will be removed, this is a work-around to control panel views not existing "
"yet"
msgstr ""
"qweb-as-view ``o_qweb_cp_buttons`` CSS class'iga ega ``<nav>`` element uchun "
"maxsus holatga ega: uning ichidagi narsalar button'lar bo'lishi kerak va "
"ular ajratib olinib, control panel'ning button maydoniga ko'chiriladi, "
"``<nav>`` elementning o'zi esa olib tashlanadi; bu hozircha control panel "
"view'lari mavjud emasligi uchun qilingan vaqtinchalik yechim"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3003
msgid ""
"qweb-as-view rendering adds several items to the standard qweb rendering "
"context:"
msgstr ""
"qweb-as-view rendering standart qweb rendering context'iga bir nechta "
"element qo'shadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3009
msgid "the model to which the qweb view is bound"
msgstr "qweb view bog'langan model"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3010
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3838
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3887
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3900
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:932
msgid "``domain``"
msgstr "``domain``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3011
msgid "the domain provided by the search view"
msgstr "search view tomonidan berilgan domain"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3013
msgid "the context provided by the search view"
msgstr "search view tomonidan berilgan context"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3016
msgid "``records``"
msgstr "``records``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3015
msgid ""
"a lazy proxy to ``model.search(domain)``, this can be used if you just want "
"to iterate the records and not perform more complex operations (e.g. "
"grouping)"
msgstr ""
"``model.search(domain)`` uchun lazy proxy; agar siz shunchaki record'lar "
"bo'ylab iteratsiya qilmoqchi bo'lsangiz va murakkabroq amallarni (masalan "
"grouping) bajarmasangiz, undan foydalanish mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3018
msgid "qweb-as-view also provides additional rendering hooks:"
msgstr "qweb-as-view qo'shimcha rendering hook'larini ham taqdim etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3020
msgid ""
"``_qweb_prepare_context(view_id, domain)`` prepares the rendering context "
"specific to qweb-as-view"
msgstr ""
"``_qweb_prepare_context(view_id, domain)`` qweb-as-view'ga xos rendering "
"context'ini tayyorlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3022
msgid ""
"``qweb_render_view(view_id, domain)`` is the method called by the client and "
"will call the context-preparation methods and ultimately "
"``env['ir.qweb'].render()``."
msgstr ""
"``qweb_render_view(view_id, domain)`` — client tomonidan chaqiriladigan "
"method; u context tayyorlash method'larini, oxir-oqibat esa "
"``env['ir.qweb'].render()`` ni chaqiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3029
msgid "Graph"
msgstr "Graph"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3031
msgid ""
"The graph view is used to visualize aggregations over a number of records or "
"record groups. Its root element is ``<graph>`` which can take the following "
"attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Graph view bir qancha record'lar yoki record guruhlari ustidagi "
"agregatsiyalarni vizuallashtirish uchun ishlatiladi. Uning root elementi "
"``<graph>`` bo'lib, quyidagi atributlarni qabul qilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3038
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3074
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3157
msgid "``type`` (optional)"
msgstr "``type`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3038
msgid ""
"one of ``bar`` (default), ``pie`` and ``line``, the type of graph to use"
msgstr ""
"``bar`` (standart), ``pie`` va ``line`` dan biri — ishlatiladigan graph turi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3042
msgid "``stacked`` (optional)"
msgstr "``stacked`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3041
msgid ""
"only used for ``bar`` charts. Set to ``0`` to prevent the bars within a "
"group to be stacked initially."
msgstr ""
"faqat ``bar`` diagrammalari uchun ishlatiladi. Guruh ichidagi ustunlar "
"boshida bir-birining ustiga yig'ilmasligi uchun ``0`` qiymatini bering."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3045
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3115
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3627
msgid "``disable_linking`` (optional)"
msgstr "``disable_linking`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3045
msgid "set to ``1`` to prevent from redirecting clicks on graph to list view"
msgstr ""
"graph ustidagi bosishlar list view'ga yo'naltirilmasligi uchun ``1`` "
"qiymatini bering"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3050
msgid "``order`` (optional)"
msgstr "``order`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3048
msgid ""
"if set, x-axis values will be sorted by default according their measure with "
"respect to the given order (``asc`` or ``desc``). Only used for ``bar`` and "
"``pie`` charts."
msgstr ""
"agar belgilangan bo'lsa, x o'qi qiymatlari standart holda o'z measure'iga "
"ko'ra berilgan tartibda (``asc`` yoki ``desc``) saralanadi. Faqat ``bar`` va "
"``pie`` diagrammalari uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3053
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3085
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3140
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3657
msgid "``string`` (optional)"
msgstr "``string`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3053
msgid "string displayed in the breadcrumbs when redirecting to list view."
msgstr "list view'ga o'tilganda breadcrumb'larda ko'rsatiladigan matn."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3057
msgid ""
"The only allowed element within a graph view is ``field`` which can have the "
"following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Graph view ichida ruxsat etilgan yagona element — ``field``, u quyidagi "
"atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3063
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3135
msgid ""
"the name of a field to use in the view. If used for grouping (rather than "
"aggregating)"
msgstr ""
"view'da ishlatiladigan field nomi. Agar (agregatsiya emas) grouping uchun "
"ishlatilsa"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3068
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3162
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3663
msgid "``invisible`` (optional)"
msgstr "``invisible`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3067
msgid ""
"if true, the field will not appear either in the active measures nor in the "
"selectable measures."
msgstr ""
"agar true bo'lsa, field na faol measure'larda, na tanlanadigan measure'larda "
"ko'rinmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3071
msgid ""
"if set to ``measure``, the field will be used as an aggregated value within "
"a group instead of a grouping criteria. It only works for the last field "
"with that attribute but it is useful for other fields with string attribute "
"(see below)."
msgstr ""
"agar ``measure`` qilib belgilansa, field grouping mezoni sifatida emas, "
"guruh ichidagi agregatlangan qiymat sifatida ishlatiladi. U faqat shu "
"atributga ega oxirgi field uchun ishlaydi, lekin string atributiga ega "
"boshqa field'lar uchun ham foydali (pastga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3080
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3642
msgid "``interval`` (optional)"
msgstr "``interval`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3077
msgid ""
"on date and datetime fields, groups by the specified interval (``day``, "
"``week``, ``month``, ``quarter`` or ``year``) instead of grouping on the "
"specific datetime (fixed second resolution) or date (fixed day resolution). "
"Default is ``month``."
msgstr ""
"date va datetime field'larida aniq datetime (soniya aniqligida) yoki date "
"(kun aniqligida) bo'yicha guruhlash o'rniga ko'rsatilgan interval (``day``, "
"``week``, ``month``, ``quarter`` yoki ``year``) bo'yicha guruhlaydi. "
"Standart qiymat — ``month``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3083
msgid ""
"only used for field with ``type=\"measure\"``. The name that will be used to "
"display the field in the graph view, overrides the default python String "
"attribute of the field."
msgstr ""
"faqat ``type=\"measure\"`` bo'lgan field uchun ishlatiladi. Graph view'da "
"field'ni ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladigan nom; field'ning standart python "
"String atributini override qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3087
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3166
msgid ""
"The measures are automatically generated from the model fields; only the "
"aggregatable fields are used. Those measures are also alphabetically sorted "
"on the string of the field."
msgstr ""
"Measure'lar model field'laridan avtomatik hosil qilinadi; faqat agregatlash "
"mumkin bo'lgan field'lar ishlatiladi. Bu measure'lar field'ning string "
"qiymati bo'yicha alifbo tartibida saralanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3093
msgid ""
"graph view aggregations are performed on database content, non-stored "
"function fields can not be used in graph views"
msgstr ""
"graph view agregatsiyalari ma'lumotlar bazasi tarkibida bajariladi, shu "
"sababli saqlanmaydigan (non-stored) function field'larni graph view'larda "
"ishlatib bo'lmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3097
msgid ""
"In Graph views, a ``field`` can have a ``widget`` attribute to dictate its "
"format. The widget should be a field formatter, of which the most "
"interesting are ``float_time``, and ``monetary``."
msgstr ""
"Graph view'larda ``field`` o'z formatini belgilash uchun ``widget`` "
"atributiga ega bo'lishi mumkin. Widget field formatter bo'lishi kerak; "
"ularning eng qiziqarlilari — ``float_time`` va ``monetary``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3108
msgid "Pivot"
msgstr "Pivot"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3110
msgid ""
"The pivot view is used to visualize aggregations as a `pivot table`_. Its "
"root element is ``<pivot>`` which can take the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Pivot view agregatsiyalarni `pivot table`_ shaklida vizuallashtirish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Uning root elementi ``<pivot>`` bo'lib, quyidagi atributlarni "
"qabul qilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3116
msgid "Set to ``1`` to remove table cell's links to list view."
msgstr ""
"Jadval yacheykalaridagi list view'ga havolalarni olib tashlash uchun ``1`` "
"qiymatini bering."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3117
msgid "``display_quantity`` (optional)"
msgstr "``display_quantity`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3118
msgid "Set to ``1`` to display the Quantity column by default."
msgstr ""
"Quantity ustunini standart holda ko'rsatish uchun ``1`` qiymatini bering."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3127
msgid "``default_order`` (optional)"
msgstr "``default_order`` (majburiy emas)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3120
msgid ""
"The name of the measure and the order (asc or desc) to use as default order "
"in the view."
msgstr ""
"View'da standart saralash tartibi sifatida ishlatiladigan measure nomi va "
"tartib (asc yoki desc)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3129
msgid ""
"The only allowed element within a pivot view is ``field`` which can have the "
"following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Pivot view ichida ruxsat etilgan yagona element — ``field``, u quyidagi "
"atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3139
msgid ""
"the name that will be used to display the field in the pivot view, overrides "
"the default python String attribute of the field."
msgstr ""
"pivot view'da field'ni ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladigan nom; field'ning "
"standart python String atributini override qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3143
msgid ""
"indicates whether the field should be used as a grouping criteria or as an "
"aggregated value within a group. Possible values are:"
msgstr ""
"field grouping mezoni sifatida yoki guruh ichidagi agregatlangan qiymat "
"sifatida ishlatilishini bildiradi. Mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3148
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1021
msgid "``row`` (default)"
msgstr "``row`` (standart)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3149
msgid "groups by the specified field, each group gets its own row."
msgstr ""
"ko'rsatilgan field bo'yicha guruhlaydi, har bir guruh o'z qatoriga ega "
"bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3150
msgid "``col``"
msgstr "``col``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3151
msgid "creates column-wise groups"
msgstr "ustunlar bo'yicha guruhlar yaratadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3152
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1024
msgid "``measure``"
msgstr "``measure``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3153
msgid "field to aggregate within a group"
msgstr "guruh ichida agregatlanadigan field"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3157
msgid "``interval``"
msgstr "``interval``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3155
msgid ""
"on date and datetime fields, groups by the specified interval (``day``, "
"``week``, ``month``, ``quarter`` or ``year``) instead of grouping on the "
"specific datetime (fixed second resolution) or date (fixed day resolution)."
msgstr ""
"date va datetime field'larida aniq datetime (soniya aniqligida) yoki date "
"(kun aniqligida) bo'yicha guruhlash o'rniga ko'rsatilgan interval (``day``, "
"``week``, ``month``, ``quarter`` yoki ``year``) bo'yicha guruhlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3160
msgid ""
"if true, the field will not appear either in the active measures nor in the "
"selectable measures (useful for fields that do not make sense aggregated, "
"such as fields in different units, e.g. € and $)."
msgstr ""
"agar true bo'lsa, field na faol measure'larda, na tanlanadigan measure'larda "
"ko'rinmaydi (agregatlash ma'nosiz bo'lgan field'lar uchun foydali, masalan "
"turli o'lchov birliklaridagi field'lar — € va $)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3172
msgid ""
"like the graph view, the pivot aggregates data on database content which "
"means that non-stored function fields can not be used in pivot views"
msgstr ""
"graph view kabi, pivot ham ma'lumotlarni ma'lumotlar bazasi tarkibida "
"agregatlaydi, ya'ni saqlanmaydigan (non-stored) function field'larni pivot "
"view'larda ishlatib bo'lmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3176
msgid ""
"In Pivot view a ``field`` can have a ``widget`` attribute to dictate its "
"format. The widget should be a field formatter, of which the most "
"interesting are ``date``, ``datetime``, ``float_time``, and ``monetary``."
msgstr ""
"Pivot view'da ``field`` o'z formatini belgilash uchun ``widget`` atributiga "
"ega bo'lishi mumkin. Widget field formatter bo'lishi kerak; ularning eng "
"qiziqarlilari — ``date``, ``datetime``, ``float_time`` va ``monetary``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3180
msgid "For instance a timesheet pivot view could be defined as::"
msgstr "Masalan, timesheet pivot view'ini quyidagicha aniqlash mumkin::"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3191
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Calendar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3193
msgid ""
"Calendar views display records as events in a daily, weekly, monthly or "
"yearly calendar."
msgstr ""
"Calendar view'lari record'larni kunlik, haftalik, oylik yoki yillik "
"kalendarda event'lar sifatida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3196
msgid ""
"By default the calendar view will be centered around the current date "
"(today). You can pass a specific initial date to the context of the action "
"in order to set the initial focus of the calendar on the period (see `mode`) "
"around this date (the context key to use being `initial_date`)"
msgstr ""
"Standart holda calendar view joriy sana (bugun) atrofida markazlashtiriladi. "
"Kalendarning boshlang'ich fokusini shu sana atrofidagi davrga (`mode` ga "
"qarang) qaratish uchun action'ning context'iga aniq boshlang'ich sanani "
"uzatishingiz mumkin (ishlatiladigan context kaliti — `initial_date`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3201
msgid ""
"Their root element is ``<calendar>``. Available attributes on the root node "
"are:"
msgstr ""
"Ularning root element'i — ``<calendar>``. Root node'da mavjud atributlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3208
msgid "Name of the record's field holding the start date for the event."
msgstr "Event boshlanish sanasini saqlaydigan record field'ining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3216
msgid "Name of the record's field holding the end date for the event."
msgstr "Event tugash sanasini saqlaydigan record field'ining nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3224
msgid ""
"Alternative to ``date_stop``. Provides the duration of the event instead of "
"its end date (unit: hour)."
msgstr ""
"``date_stop`` ga alternativa. Event'ning tugash sanasi o'rniga uning "
"davomiyligini beradi (birlik: soat)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3233
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of available scales, among ``day``, ``week``, "
"``month``, ``year``. By default, all scales are available."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud masshtablarning vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati: ``day``, ``week``, "
"``month``, ``year``. Sukut bo'yicha barcha masshtablar mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3238
msgid "`\"day,week,month,year\"`"
msgstr "`\"day,week,month,year\"`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3243
msgid "Default scale of the calendar."
msgstr "Calendar'ning sukut bo'yicha masshtabi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3246
msgid "`\"day\"`, `\"week\"`, `\"month\"` or `\"year\"`"
msgstr "`\"day\"`, `\"week\"`, `\"month\"` yoki `\"year\"`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3247
msgid "`\"week\"`"
msgstr "`\"week\"`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3252
msgid ""
"Name of the record's field to use for *color segmentation*. Records in the "
"same color segment are allocated the same highlight color in the calendar."
msgstr ""
"*Rang bo'yicha segmentatsiya* uchun ishlatiladigan record field'ining nomi. "
"Bir xil rang segmentidagi record'larga calendar'da bir xil ajratib "
"ko'rsatish rangi beriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3261
msgid ""
"Name of the record's boolean field indicating whether the corresponding "
"event is flagged as day-long, in which case duration is irrelevant."
msgstr ""
"Mos event kun bo'yi davom etadigan deb belgilanganini ko'rsatuvchi record "
"boolean field'ining nomi; bu holda davomiylik ahamiyatga ega bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3270
msgid ""
"Name of the record's field to use to display aggregated values next to "
"filters, in the filter side panel. The aggregator can be explicitly given "
"(e.g. `aggregate=\"expected_revenue:sum\"`). If not given, the aggregator of "
"the field is used. Supported aggregators are `sum`, `avg`, `min`, `max`, "
"`count` and `count_distinct`."
msgstr ""
"Filter yon panelida filter'lar yonida agregatlangan qiymatlarni ko'rsatish "
"uchun ishlatiladigan record field'ining nomi. Aggregator'ni aniq ko'rsatish "
"mumkin (masalan `aggregate=\"expected_revenue:sum\"`). Agar ko'rsatilmasa, "
"field'ning aggregator'i ishlatiladi. Qo'llab-quvvatlanadigan aggregator'lar: "
"`sum`, `avg`, `min`, `max`, `count` va `count_distinct`."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3282
msgid ""
"Limits the number of events displayed in calendar cells, in `month` scale, "
"and for all-day events in `week` and `day` scales. If there are more events "
"than the limit, a \"more\" button is added to show the rest of the events in "
"a popover."
msgstr ""
"`month` masshtabida calendar cell'larida, hamda `week` va `day` "
"masshtablarida kun bo'yi davom etadigan event'lar uchun ko'rsatiladigan "
"event'lar sonini cheklaydi. Agar event'lar limitdan ko'p bo'lsa, qolgan "
"event'larni popover'da ko'rsatish uchun \"more\" tugmasi qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3288
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3293
msgid ""
"If set to true weekend days and public holidays have a greyed out background."
msgstr ""
"Agar true qilib belgilansa, dam olish kunlari va bayram kunlari kulrang "
"fonda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3302
msgid "Set it to true to hide the date part in the record's popover."
msgstr "Record popover'ida sana qismini yashirish uchun uni true qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3311
msgid "Set it to true to hide the time part in the record's popover."
msgstr "Record popover'ida vaqt qismini yashirish uchun uni true qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3315
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:184
msgid "False"
msgstr "False"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3320
msgid ""
"By default, in month mode, the last days of the previous month and the first "
"days of the next months are displayed, as well as their events. This option "
"allows to disable this such that those sibling days are greyed out and their "
"events aren't displayed."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha, month rejimida oldingi oyning oxirgi kunlari va keyingi "
"oyning birinchi kunlari, shuningdek ularning event'lari ko'rsatiladi. Bu "
"option shu xatti-harakatni o'chirish imkonini beradi — natijada bu qo'shni "
"kunlar kulrang bo'lib qoladi va ularning event'lari ko'rsatilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3332
msgid ""
"By default, a mini calendar (in month mode) is displayed in the side panel, "
"next to the main calendar. This option allows to remove it by setting it to "
"`False`."
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha, asosiy calendar yonidagi yon panelda mini calendar (month "
"rejimida) ko'rsatiladi. Bu option uni `False` qilib belgilash orqali olib "
"tashlash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3343
msgid ""
"If true, open events in dialog to edit them, otherwise, open them in a "
"classical form view."
msgstr ""
"Agar true bo'lsa, event'lar tahrirlash uchun dialog'da ochiladi, aks holda "
"ular klassik form view'da ochiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3353
msgid ""
"View to open when the user creates or edits an event. By default, uses the "
"form view of the current action, if any."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi event yaratganda yoki tahrirlaganda ochiladigan view. Sukut "
"bo'yicha, agar mavjud bo'lsa, joriy action'ning form view'i ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3362
msgid ""
"Enables quick event creation on click: only asks the user for a ``name`` and "
"tries to create a new event with just that and the clicked event time. Falls "
"back to a full form view if the quick creation fails."
msgstr ""
"Bosishda tezkor event yaratishni yoqadi: foydalanuvchidan faqat ``name`` "
"so'raladi va shu nom hamda bosilgan event vaqti bilan yangi event yaratishga "
"harakat qiladi. Agar tezkor yaratish muvaffaqiyatsiz bo'lsa, to'liq form "
"view'ga qaytadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3373
msgid ""
"Name of the record's field holding the display name of the record. This "
"field is used when creating records through the 'quick create' mechanism."
msgstr ""
"Record'ning ko'rinadigan nomini saqlaydigan record field'ining nomi. Bu "
"field record'lar 'quick create' mexanizmi orqali yaratilganda ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3383
msgid ""
"Id of the form view to open when the attribute ``quick_create`` is set and "
"the user creates an event, instead of the default dialog which only allows "
"to specify a name."
msgstr ""
"``quick_create`` atributi belgilanganda va foydalanuvchi event yaratganda, "
"faqat nom ko'rsatishga imkon beruvchi sukut bo'yicha dialog o'rniga "
"ochiladigan form view'ning Id'si."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3393
msgid ""
"Reference of a form view. When set, in **month** scale, allows to create "
"(and delete) records in batches by clicking on calendar cells or by "
"selecting an area of calendar cells. One record is then created for each "
"selected cell and for each active filter's value, with the values of the "
"multi create form view, which is displayed in the side panel. In delete "
"mode, all records displayed in selected cells are deleted."
msgstr ""
"Form view'ning reference'i. Belgilanganda, **month** masshtabida calendar "
"cell'lariga bosish yoki calendar cell'lari sohasini tanlash orqali "
"record'larni to'p-to'p yaratish (va o'chirish) imkonini beradi. Keyin har "
"bir tanlangan cell uchun va har bir aktiv filter qiymati uchun, yon panelda "
"ko'rsatiladigan multi create form view qiymatlari bilan bittadan record "
"yaratiladi. O'chirish rejimida tanlangan cell'larda ko'rsatilgan barcha "
"record'lar o'chiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3400
msgid ""
"Note: if the side panel contains multiple filter sections, only the first "
"one is used, to avoid a combinatorial explosion."
msgstr ""
"Eslatma: agar yon panel bir nechta filter bo'limini o'z ichiga olsa, "
"kombinatorik portlashdan qochish uchun faqat birinchisi ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3413
msgid "Disable/enable record deletion on the view."
msgstr "View'da record o'chirishni o'chiradi/yoqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3426
msgid ""
"Calendar views accept a single type of child elements: ``<field>``. Those "
"fields are displayed in a popover, in the given order, which opens when a "
"record (a calendar event) is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Calendar view'lar faqat bitta turdagi child element'ni qabul qiladi: "
"``<field>``. Bu field'lar record (calendar event) bosilganda ochiladigan "
"popover'da, berilgan tartibda ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3430
msgid ""
"Fields in the popover are readonly. If the `edit` action is available, an "
"`Edit` button is displayed in the popover, to open a form view where fields "
"can be edited."
msgstr ""
"Popover'dagi field'lar readonly. Agar `edit` action mavjud bo'lsa, "
"field'larni tahrirlash mumkin bo'lgan form view'ni ochish uchun popover'da "
"`Edit` tugmasi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3434
msgid "Field nodes can have the following attributes:"
msgstr "Field node'lari quyidagi atributlarga ega bo'lishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3441
msgid ""
"Python expression indicating whether the field should be displayed or not. "
"Other fields of the model can be used in the expression, as long as those "
"fields are also declared here."
msgstr ""
"Field ko'rsatilishi kerakmi yoki yo'qmi — buni bildiruvchi Python ifodasi. "
"Ifodada model'ning boshqa field'lari ham ishlatilishi mumkin, agar ular ham "
"shu yerda e'lon qilingan bo'lsa."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3452
msgid ""
"Python expression encoding an object of options for the field. In "
"particular, the option `icon`, allowing to specify, as classnames, which "
"icon to display in front of the field in the popover (for instance, `fa fa-"
"users`). If no icon is given, the option `string` can be set, and its value "
"is then used as label, displayed in front of the field."
msgstr ""
"Field uchun options obyektini kodlaydigan Python ifodasi. Xususan, `icon` "
"option'i popover'da field oldida qaysi icon ko'rsatilishini classname'lar "
"shaklida ko'rsatish imkonini beradi (masalan, `fa fa-users`). Agar icon "
"berilmasa, `string` option'ini belgilash mumkin va uning qiymati field "
"oldida ko'rsatiladigan yorliq sifatida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3462
msgid ""
"Specifying a ``<field>`` in a calendar arch also allows to customize the "
"filter side panel, by setting the `filters` attribute. Extra attributes are "
"then available for that matter:"
msgstr ""
"Calendar arch'ida ``<field>`` ni ko'rsatish `filters` atributini belgilash "
"orqali filter yon panelini sozlash imkonini ham beradi. Shu maqsadda "
"qo'shimcha atributlar mavjud bo'ladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3469
msgid ""
"If set to true, the field can be used as filter, from the side panel of the "
"calendar."
msgstr ""
"Agar true qilib belgilansa, field calendar'ning yon panelidan filter "
"sifatida ishlatilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3479
msgid ""
"Only for relational fields. Specify the name of the field on the co-model to "
"use to display as avatar in front of field values in the side panel filters."
msgstr ""
"Faqat relational field'lar uchun. Yon panel filter'larida field qiymatlari "
"oldida avatar sifatida ko'rsatish uchun co-model'dagi field nomini "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3488
msgid ""
"Specify which field to use to colorize the checkbox in the side panel "
"filters. By default, the color attribute of the calendar view is used to "
"match events with values in the filters."
msgstr ""
"Yon panel filter'laridagi checkbox'ni rangga bo'yash uchun qaysi field "
"ishlatilishini ko'rsatadi. Sukut bo'yicha, event'larni filter'lardagi "
"qiymatlar bilan moslashtirish uchun calendar view'ning color atributi "
"ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3498
msgid ""
"Allows to create new filter values on the fly. The given model is then used "
"as model for those filters.  To combine with `write_field`."
msgstr ""
"Yangi filter qiymatlarini tezda yaratish imkonini beradi. Berilgan model "
"keyin bu filter'lar uchun model sifatida ishlatiladi.  `write_field` bilan "
"birga ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3507
msgid ""
"Combined with `write_model`, specifies the field name, in the given model, "
"to use to encode the filter value."
msgstr ""
"`write_model` bilan birgalikda, filter qiymatini kodlash uchun berilgan "
"model'dagi field nomini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3516
msgid ""
"Combined with `write_model`, specifies the field name, in the given model, "
"to use to encode the status of the filter (whether it is checked or not)."
msgstr ""
"`write_model` bilan birgalikda, filter holatini (u belgilangan yoki "
"belgilanmaganini) kodlash uchun berilgan model'dagi field nomini ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3525
msgid "Activity"
msgstr "Activity"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3527
msgid ""
"The Activity view is used to display the activities linked to the records. "
"The data are displayed in a chart with the records forming the rows and the "
"activity types the columns. The first cell of each row displays a "
"(customizable, see ``templates``, quite similarly to :ref:`reference/"
"view_architectures/kanban`) card representing the corresponding record. When "
"clicking on others cells, a detailed description of all activities of the "
"same type for the record is displayed."
msgstr ""
"Activity view record'lar bilan bog'langan activity'larni ko'rsatish uchun "
"ishlatiladi. Ma'lumotlar chart'da ko'rsatiladi: record'lar qatorlarni, "
"activity turlari esa ustunlarni tashkil qiladi. Har bir qatorning birinchi "
"cell'i mos record'ni ifodalovchi kartani (sozlanadigan, ``templates`` ga "
"qarang, :ref:`reference/view_architectures/kanban` ga juda o'xshash) "
"ko'rsatadi. Boshqa cell'larga bosilganda, record uchun bir xil turdagi "
"barcha activity'larning batafsil tavsifi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3536
msgid ""
"The Activity view is only available when the ``mail`` module is installed, "
"and for the models that inherit from the ``mail.activity.mixin``."
msgstr ""
"Activity view faqat ``mail`` module o'rnatilganda va ``mail.activity.mixin`` "
"dan inherit qiladigan model'lar uchun mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3539
msgid ""
"The root element of the Activity view is ``<activity>``, it accepts the "
"following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Activity view'ning root element'i — ``<activity>``, u quyidagi atributlarni "
"qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3545
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3616
msgid "``string`` (mandatory)"
msgstr "``string`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3545
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3616
msgid "A title, which should describe the view"
msgstr "View'ni tavsiflashi kerak bo'lgan sarlavha"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3547
msgid "Possible children of the view element are:"
msgstr "View element'ining mumkin bo'lgan child'lari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3552
msgid ""
"declares fields to use in activity *logic*. If the field is simply displayed "
"in the activity view, it does not need to be pre-declared."
msgstr ""
"activity *mantiqida* ishlatiladigan field'larni e'lon qiladi. Agar field "
"shunchaki activity view'da ko'rsatilsa, uni oldindan e'lon qilish shart emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3555
msgid "Possible attributes are:"
msgstr "Mumkin bo'lgan atributlar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3560
msgid "``name`` (required)"
msgstr "``name`` (talab qilinadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3560
msgid "the name of the field to fetch"
msgstr "olinadigan field'ning nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3580
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4118
msgid "``templates``"
msgstr "``templates``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3563
msgid ""
"defines the :ref:`reference/qweb` templates. Cards definition may be split "
"into multiple templates for clarity, but activity views *must* define at "
"least one root template ``activity-box``, which will be rendered once for "
"each record."
msgstr ""
":ref:`reference/qweb` template'larini aniqlaydi. Karta ta'rifi ravshanlik "
"uchun bir nechta template'ga bo'linishi mumkin, lekin activity view'lar "
"kamida bitta root template ``activity-box`` ni aniqlashi *shart*, u har bir "
"record uchun bir marta render qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3568
msgid ""
"The activity view uses mostly-standard :ref:`javascript qweb <reference/qweb/"
"javascript>` and provides the following context variables "
"(see :ref:`reference/view_architectures/kanban` for more details):"
msgstr ""
"Activity view asosan standart :ref:`javascript qweb <reference/qweb/"
"javascript>` dan foydalanadi va quyidagi context o'zgaruvchilarini beradi "
"(batafsil ma'lumot uchun :ref:`reference/view_architectures/kanban` ga "
"qarang):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3576
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4114
msgid "``widget``"
msgstr "``widget``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3575
msgid ""
"the current :js:class:`ActivityRecord`, can be used to fetch some meta-"
"information. These methods are also available directly in the template "
"context and don't need to be accessed via ``widget``"
msgstr ""
"joriy :js:class:`ActivityRecord`, ba'zi meta-ma'lumotlarni olish uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. Bu method'lar template context'ida ham bevosita mavjud "
"va ularga ``widget`` orqali murojaat qilish shart emas"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3579
msgid ""
"an object with all the requested fields as its attributes. Each field has "
"two attributes ``value`` and ``raw_value``"
msgstr ""
"so'ralgan barcha field'lar atributlari sifatida bo'lgan obyekt. Har bir "
"field ikkita atributga ega: ``value`` va ``raw_value``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3585
msgid "Cohort"
msgstr "Cohort"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3591
msgid ""
"The cohort view is used to display and understand the way some data changes "
"over a period of time.  For example, imagine that for a given business, "
"clients can subscribe to some service.  The cohort view can then display the "
"total number of subscriptions each month, and study the rate at which client "
"leave the service (churn). When clicking on a cell, the cohort view will "
"redirect you to a new action in which you will only see the records "
"contained in the cell's time interval; this action contains a list view and "
"a form view."
msgstr ""
"Cohort view ba'zi ma'lumotlarning vaqt o'tishi bilan qanday o'zgarishini "
"ko'rsatish va tushunish uchun ishlatiladi.  Masalan, ma'lum bir biznesda "
"mijozlar qaysidir xizmatga obuna bo'lishi mumkin deb tasavvur qiling.  "
"Cohort view keyin har oydagi obunalarning umumiy sonini ko'rsatishi va "
"mijozlarning xizmatdan ketish tezligini (churn) o'rganishi mumkin. Cell'ga "
"bosilganda, cohort view sizni yangi action'ga yo'naltiradi, unda siz faqat "
"cell'ning vaqt oralig'iga kiradigan record'larni ko'rasiz; bu action list "
"view va form view'ni o'z ichiga oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3599
msgid ""
"By default the cohort view will use the same list and form views as those "
"defined on the action. You can pass a list view and a form view to the "
"context of the action in order to set/override the views that will be used "
"(the context keys to use being `form_view_id` and `list_view_id`)"
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha cohort view action'da aniqlangan list va form view'larning "
"o'zini ishlatadi. Ishlatiladigan view'larni belgilash/override qilish uchun "
"action context'iga list view va form view'ni uzatishingiz mumkin "
"(ishlatiladigan context kalitlari — `form_view_id` va `list_view_id`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3604
msgid "For example, here is a very simple cohort view:"
msgstr "Masalan, quyida juda oddiy cohort view keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3610
msgid ""
"The root element of the Cohort view is <cohort>, it accepts the following "
"attributes:"
msgstr ""
"Cohort view'ning root element'i <cohort> bo'lib, u quyidagi atributlarni "
"qabul qiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3620
msgid "``date_start`` (mandatory)"
msgstr "``date_start`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3619
msgid ""
"A valid date or datetime field. This field is understood by the view as the "
"beginning date of a record"
msgstr ""
"To'g'ri date yoki datetime field. Bu field'ni view record'ning boshlanish "
"sanasi sifatida tushunadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3624
msgid "``date_stop`` (mandatory)"
msgstr "``date_stop`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3623
msgid ""
"A valid date or datetime field. This field is understood by the view as the "
"end date of a record.  This is the field that will determine the churn."
msgstr ""
"To'g'ri date yoki datetime field. Bu field'ni view record'ning tugash sanasi "
"sifatida tushunadi.  Aynan shu field churn'ni aniqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3627
msgid ""
"Set to ``1`` to prevent from redirecting clicks on cohort cells to list view."
msgstr ""
"Cohort yacheykalaridagi bosishlarni list view'ga yo'naltirishni to'xtatish "
"uchun ``1`` qiymatini bering."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3632
msgid "``mode`` (optional)"
msgstr "``mode`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3630
msgid ""
"A string to describe the mode. It should be either 'churn' or 'retention' "
"(default). Churn mode will start at 0% and accumulate over time whereas "
"retention will start at 100% and decrease over time."
msgstr ""
"Rejimni tavsiflaydigan matn. U 'churn' yoki 'retention' (standart) bo'lishi "
"kerak. Churn rejimi 0% dan boshlanadi va vaqt o'tishi bilan ortadi, "
"retention esa 100% dan boshlanib vaqt o'tishi bilan kamayadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3638
msgid "``timeline`` (optional)"
msgstr "``timeline`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3635
msgid ""
"A string to describe the timeline. It should be either 'backward' or "
"'forward' (default). Forward timeline will display data from date_start to "
"date_stop, whereas backward timeline will display data from date_stop to "
"date_start (when the date_start is in future / greater than date_stop)."
msgstr ""
"Vaqt o'qini tavsiflaydigan matn. U 'backward' yoki 'forward' (standart) "
"bo'lishi kerak. Forward timeline ma'lumotlarni date_start dan date_stop ga "
"qarab ko'rsatadi, backward timeline esa date_stop dan date_start ga qarab "
"ko'rsatadi (date_start kelajakda bo'lganda / date_stop dan katta bo'lganda)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3641
msgid ""
"A string to describe a time interval. It should be 'day', 'week', 'month'' "
"(default) or 'year'."
msgstr ""
"Vaqt oralig'ini tavsiflaydigan matn. U 'day', 'week', 'month'' (standart) "
"yoki 'year' bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3646
msgid "``measure`` (optional)"
msgstr "``measure`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3645
msgid ""
"A field that can be aggregated.  This field will be used to compute the "
"values for each cell.  If not set, the cohort view will count the number of "
"occurrences."
msgstr ""
"Agregatsiya qilinishi mumkin bo'lgan field.  Bu field har bir yacheyka "
"qiymatini hisoblash uchun ishlatiladi.  Agar belgilanmasa, cohort view "
"takrorlanishlar sonini hisoblaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3649
msgid ""
"allows to specify a particular field in order to manage it from the "
"available measures, it's main use is for hiding a field from the selectable "
"measures:"
msgstr ""
"mavjud measure'lar orasidan aniq bir field'ni boshqarish uchun uni "
"ko'rsatishga imkon beradi; asosan field'ni tanlanadigan measure'lardan "
"yashirish uchun ishlatiladi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3655
msgid "the name of the field to use in the view."
msgstr "view'da ishlatiladigan field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3657
msgid ""
"the name that would be used to display the field in the cohort view, "
"overrides the default python String attribute of the field."
msgstr ""
"field'ni cohort view'da ko'rsatish uchun ishlatiladigan nom; field'ning "
"standart python String atributini override qiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3660
msgid ""
"if true, the field will not appear either in the active measures nor in the "
"selectable measures (useful for fields that do not make sense aggregated, "
"such as fields in different units, e.g. € and $). If the value is a domain, "
"the domain is evaluated in the context of the current row's record, if "
"``True`` the corresponding attribute is set on the cell."
msgstr ""
"agar true bo'lsa, field na faol measure'larda, na tanlanadigan measure'larda "
"ko'rinmaydi (agregatsiya qilish ma'nosiz bo'lgan field'lar uchun qulay, "
"masalan turli birliklardagi field'lar, € va $ kabi). Agar qiymat domain "
"bo'lsa, domain joriy qatordagi record kontekstida hisoblanadi; ``True`` "
"bo'lsa, mos atribut yacheykaga o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3666
msgid "``widget`` (optional)"
msgstr "``widget`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3666
msgid "alternate representations for a field's display."
msgstr "field'ni ko'rsatishning muqobil shakllari."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3682
msgid "This view is a work in progress and may have to be expanded or altered."
msgstr ""
"Bu view hali ishlab chiqilmoqda va kengaytirilishi yoki o'zgartirilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3684
msgid ""
"only ``date`` column fields have been tested, ``selection`` and ``many2one`` "
"are nominally implemented and supported but have not been tested, "
"``datetime`` is not implemented at all."
msgstr ""
"faqat ``date`` turidagi ustun field'lari test qilingan; ``selection`` va "
"``many2one`` rasman amalga oshirilgan va qo'llab-quvvatlanadi, lekin test "
"qilinmagan; ``datetime`` esa umuman amalga oshirilmagan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3687
msgid "column cells are hardly configurable and must be numerical"
msgstr ""
"ustun yacheykalarini sozlash deyarli imkonsiz va ular raqamli bo'lishi kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3688
msgid ""
"cell adjustment is disabled by default and must be configured to be enabled"
msgstr ""
"yacheykani moslash standart holatda o'chirilgan va uni yoqish uchun sozlash "
"kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3689
msgid ""
"``create``, ``edit`` and ``delete`` ACL metadata doesn't get automatically "
"set on the view root due to limitations in ``fields_view_get`` post-"
"processing (there's a fixed explicit list of the view types getting those "
"attributes)"
msgstr ""
"``create``, ``edit`` va ``delete`` ACL metama'lumotlari view root'ida "
"avtomatik o'rnatilmaydi, chunki ``fields_view_get`` post-processing'ida "
"cheklovlar bor (bu atributlarni oladigan view turlarining qat'iy belgilangan "
"ro'yxati mavjud)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3695
msgid "Schema"
msgstr "Sxema"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3697
msgid ""
"The grid view has its own schema and additional validation in this module. "
"The view architecture is:"
msgstr ""
"Grid view'ning ushbu modulda o'z sxemasi va qo'shimcha validatsiyasi mavjud. "
"View arxitekturasi quyidagicha:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3754
msgid "``<grid>`` (1)"
msgstr "``<grid>`` (1)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3701
msgid "architecture root element"
msgstr "arxitekturaning root element'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3703
msgid "mandatory ``string`` attribute"
msgstr "majburiy ``string`` atributi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3704
msgid "optional ``create``, ``edit`` and ``delete`` attributes"
msgstr "ixtiyoriy ``create``, ``edit`` va ``delete`` atributlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3705
msgid "optional ``adjustment`` and ``adjust_name`` attributes"
msgstr "ixtiyoriy ``adjustment`` va ``adjust_name`` atributlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3707
msgid ""
"``adjustment`` can be either ``object`` or ``action`` to indicate whether a "
"cell's adjustment should be performed through a method call or an action "
"execution. ``adjust_name`` provides respectively the method name and the "
"action id."
msgstr ""
"``adjustment`` ``object`` yoki ``action`` bo'lishi mumkin — bu yacheykani "
"moslash method chaqiruvi orqali yoki action bajarilishi orqali amalga "
"oshirilishini bildiradi. ``adjust_name`` esa mos ravishda method nomini yoki "
"action id'sini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3712
msgid ""
"In both cases, the adjustment parameters are provided as a ``grid_adjust`` "
"context member, in the ``object`` case, the parameters are also provided as "
"positional function parameters (next to an empty list of ids):"
msgstr ""
"Ikkala holatda ham moslash parametrlari ``grid_adjust`` context a'zosi "
"sifatida beriladi; ``object`` holatida parametrlar shu bilan birga pozitsion "
"funksiya parametrlari sifatida ham beriladi (bo'sh id'lar ro'yxati bilan "
"birga):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3717
msgid "``row_domain``"
msgstr "``row_domain``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3718
msgid "the domain matching the entire row of the adjusted cell"
msgstr "moslangan yacheykaning butun qatoriga mos keladigan domain"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3719
msgid "``column_field``"
msgstr "``column_field``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3720
msgid "the name of the column for the adjusted cell"
msgstr "moslangan yacheyka uchun ustun nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3721
msgid "``column_value``"
msgstr "``column_value``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3722
msgid "the value of the column for the adjusted cell"
msgstr "moslangan yacheyka uchun ustun qiymati"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3723
msgid "``cell_field``"
msgstr "``cell_field``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3724
msgid "the measure field of the adjusted cell"
msgstr "moslangan yacheykaning measure field'i"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3727
msgid "``change``"
msgstr "``change``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3726
msgid ""
"the difference between the old value of the cell and the adjusted one, may "
"be positive or negative"
msgstr ""
"yacheykaning eski qiymati va moslangan qiymati orasidagi farq; musbat yoki "
"manfiy bo'lishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3729
msgid "optional ``hide_line_total`` and ``hide_column_total`` attributes"
msgstr "ixtiyoriy ``hide_line_total`` va ``hide_column_total`` atributlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3731
msgid "``hide_line_total``"
msgstr "``hide_line_total``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3732
msgid "set to true to hide total line (default false)"
msgstr "jami qatorini yashirish uchun true qilib belgilang (standart false)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3734
msgid "``hide_column_total``"
msgstr "``hide_column_total``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3734
msgid "set to true to hide total column (default false)"
msgstr "jami ustunini yashirish uchun true qilib belgilang (standart false)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3736
msgid "optional ``barchart_total`` attribute"
msgstr "ixtiyoriy ``barchart_total`` atributi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3740
msgid "``barchart_total``"
msgstr "``barchart_total``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3739
msgid ""
"set to ``true`` in order to display a bar chart at the bottom of the grid, "
"based on the totals of the columns (default false)."
msgstr ""
"ustunlar jamiga asoslangan bar chart'ni grid ostida ko'rsatish uchun "
"``true`` qilib belgilang (standart false)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3742
msgid "optional ``create_inline`` and ``display_empty`` attributes"
msgstr "ixtiyoriy ``create_inline`` va ``display_empty`` atributlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3748
msgid "``create_inline``"
msgstr "``create_inline``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3745
msgid ""
"set to ``true`` in order to display an additional row at bottom of the grid "
"with an ``Add a line`` button (default false). When this option is set to "
"``true``, the ``Add a line`` button from the control panel is hidden. When "
"no data is available and when ``display_empty`` is not set (so when the help "
"content is displayed), the the ``Add a line`` button from the control panel "
"is shown in order to let the user create a first record."
msgstr ""
"grid ostida ``Add a line`` tugmasi bilan qo'shimcha qator ko'rsatish uchun "
"``true`` qilib belgilang (standart false). Bu parametr ``true`` bo'lganda, "
"control panel'dagi ``Add a line`` tugmasi yashiriladi. Ma'lumot mavjud "
"bo'lmaganda va ``display_empty`` belgilanmaganda (ya'ni yordam kontenti "
"ko'rsatilganda), foydalanuvchi birinchi record'ni yaratishi uchun control "
"panel'dagi ``Add a line`` tugmasi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3754
msgid "``display_empty``"
msgstr "``display_empty``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3751
msgid ""
"set to ``true`` in order to keep displaying the grid when there is no data "
"(default false). This can be useful when you want the user to be able to "
"keep track of the current period (as dates are displayed in the columns "
"headers). As a reminder, when no data are present and when this attribute is "
"no set, the help content is displayed instead of the grid."
msgstr ""
"ma'lumot bo'lmaganda ham grid'ni ko'rsatishda davom etish uchun ``true`` "
"qilib belgilang (standart false). Bu foydalanuvchi joriy davrni kuzatib "
"borishini xohlaganingizda qulay bo'ladi (chunki sanalar ustun sarlavhalarida "
"ko'rsatiladi). Eslatma: ma'lumot bo'lmaganda va bu atribut belgilanmaganda, "
"grid o'rniga yordam kontenti ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3770
msgid "``<button>`` (0+)"
msgstr "``<button>`` (0+)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3757
msgid "Regular Odoo action buttons, displayed in the view header"
msgstr "View sarlavhasida ko'rsatiladigan oddiy Odoo action tugmalari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3759
msgid "mandatory ``string`` attribute (the button label)"
msgstr "majburiy ``string`` atributi (tugma yorlig'i)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3760
msgid "mandatory ``type`` attribute, either ``object`` or ``action``"
msgstr "majburiy ``type`` atributi, yoki ``object``, yoki ``action``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3762
msgid "workflow buttons are not supported"
msgstr "workflow tugmalari qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3764
msgid ""
"mandatory ``name`` attribute, either the name of the method to call, or the "
"ID of the action to execute"
msgstr ""
"majburiy ``name`` atributi — yoki chaqiriladigan method nomi, yoki "
"bajariladigan action'ning ID'si"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3766
msgid "optional ``context``"
msgstr "ixtiyoriy ``context``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3768
msgid ""
"The server callback is provided with all the record ids displayed in the "
"view, either as the ids passed to the method (``object`` button) or as the "
"context's ``active_ids`` (``action`` buttons)"
msgstr ""
"Server callback'iga view'da ko'rsatilgan barcha record id'lari beriladi — "
"yoki method'ga uzatiladigan id'lar sifatida (``object`` tugmasi), yoki "
"context'ning ``active_ids`` qiymati sifatida (``action`` tugmalari)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3778
msgid "``<field type=\"row\">`` (1+)"
msgstr "``<field type=\"row\">`` (1+)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3773
msgid ""
"Row grouping fields, will be replaced by the search view's groupby filter if "
"any."
msgstr ""
"Row bo'yicha guruhlash field'lari; agar search view'da groupby filtri "
"bo'lsa, u bilan almashtiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3776
msgid ""
"The order of ``row`` fields in the view provides their grouping depth: if "
"the first field is ``school`` and the second is ``age`` the records will be "
"grouped by ``school`` first and by ``age`` within each school."
msgstr ""
"View'dagi ``row`` field'larining tartibi guruhlash chuqurligini belgilaydi: "
"agar birinchi field ``school``, ikkinchisi ``age`` bo'lsa, record'lar avval "
"``school`` bo'yicha, so'ngra har bir school ichida ``age`` bo'yicha "
"guruhlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3799
msgid "``<field type=\"col\">`` (1)"
msgstr "``<field type=\"col\">`` (1)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3781
msgid "Column grouping field."
msgstr "Column bo'yicha guruhlash field'i."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3783
msgid ""
"The col field can contain 0+ ``<range>`` elements which specify customisable "
"column ranges. ``range`` elements have the following mandatory attributes"
msgstr ""
"col field'i 0 yoki undan ko'p ``<range>`` elementlarini o'z ichiga olishi "
"mumkin — ular moslashtiriladigan column diapazonlarini belgilaydi. ``range`` "
"elementlarida quyidagi majburiy atributlar bo'ladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3788
msgid ""
"can be used to override the default range (the first one by default) through "
"the ``grid_range`` context value"
msgstr ""
"``grid_range`` context qiymati orqali standart diapazonni (odatda "
"birinchisi) override qilish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3791
msgid "the range button's label (user-visible)"
msgstr "diapazon tugmasining yorlig'i (foydalanuvchiga ko'rinadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3795
msgid "``span``"
msgstr "``span``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3793
msgid ""
"symbolic name of the span of all columns to display at once in the view, may "
"trigger pagination."
msgstr ""
"view'da bir vaqtning o'zida ko'rsatiladigan barcha column'lar span'ining "
"ramziy nomi; pagination'ni ishga tushirishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3796
msgid "For ``date`` fields, valid spans are currently ``week`` and ``month``."
msgstr ""
"``date`` field'lari uchun hozirda amaldagi span'lar — ``week`` va ``month``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3799
msgid "``step``"
msgstr "``step``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3798
msgid "symbolic name of the step between one column and the previous/next"
msgstr ""
"bir column bilan oldingi/keyingi column orasidagi qadamning ramziy nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3800
msgid "For ``date`` fields, the only valid span is currently ``day``."
msgstr "``date`` field'lari uchun hozirda yagona amaldagi span — ``day``."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3805
msgid "``<field type=\"measure\">`` (1)"
msgstr "``<field type=\"measure\">`` (1)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3802
msgid "Cell field, automatically accumulated (by ``read_group``)."
msgstr "Cell field'i, avtomatik jamlanadi (``read_group`` orqali)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3804
msgid ""
"The measure field can take a ``widget`` attribute to customise its display."
msgstr ""
"measure field'i o'z ko'rinishini moslashtirish uchun ``widget`` atributini "
"qabul qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3808
msgid "Server interactions"
msgstr "Server bilan o'zaro aloqalar"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3810
msgid "Aside from optional buttons, the grid view currently calls two methods:"
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy tugmalardan tashqari, grid view hozirda ikkita method'ni chaqiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3812
msgid ""
"``read_grid`` (provided on all models by the module) returns almost the "
"entirety of the grid's content as a dict:"
msgstr ""
"``read_grid`` (modul tomonidan barcha model'larda taqdim etiladi) grid "
"tarkibining deyarli barchasini dict sifatida qaytaradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3815
msgid "the row titles is a list of dictionaries with the following keys:"
msgstr "row sarlavhalari — quyidagi kalitlarga ega dictionary'lar ro'yxati:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3818
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3826
msgid "``values`` (required)"
msgstr "``values`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3818
msgid ""
"this maps to a dictionary with a key per ``row`` field, the values are "
"*always* of the form ``[value, label]``."
msgstr ""
"bu har bir ``row`` field'i uchun bittadan kalitga ega dictionary'ga mos "
"keladi; qiymatlar *doimo* ``[value, label]`` shaklida bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3822
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3828
msgid "``domain`` (required)"
msgstr "``domain`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3821
msgid ""
"the domain of any record at the source of this row, in case it's necessary "
"to copy a record during cell adjustment"
msgstr ""
"ushbu row manbaidagi biror record'ning domain'i — cell'ni sozlash vaqtida "
"record'ni nusxalash zarur bo'lgan holat uchun"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3824
msgid "the column titles is a list of dictionaries with at least one key:"
msgstr ""
"column sarlavhalari — kamida bitta kalitga ega dictionary'lar ro'yxati:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3827
msgid "see row title values"
msgstr "row sarlavhasi qiymatlariga qarang"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3829
msgid "see column domain value"
msgstr "column domain qiymatiga qarang"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3831
msgid "``current`` (optional)"
msgstr "``current`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3831
msgid "boolean, marks/highlights a column"
msgstr "boolean; column'ni belgilaydi/ajratib ko'rsatadi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3833
msgid ""
"the grid data as a list (of rows) of list (of cells) of cell dicts each with "
"the following keys:"
msgstr ""
"grid ma'lumotlari — (row'lar) ro'yxati ichidagi (cell'lar) ro'yxati "
"sifatida; har bir cell dict quyidagi kalitlarga ega:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3837
msgid "the numeric value associated with the cell"
msgstr "cell bilan bog'langan raqamli qiymat"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3839
msgid "the domain matching the cell's records (should be assumed opaque)"
msgstr ""
"cell record'lariga mos keladigan domain (opaque deb qabul qilinishi kerak)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3840
msgid "``size``"
msgstr "``size``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3841
msgid "the number of records grouped in the cell"
msgstr "cell ichida guruhlangan record'lar soni"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3843
msgid "``readonly`` (optional)"
msgstr "``readonly`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3843
msgid ""
"a boolean indicating that this specific cell should not be client-editable"
msgstr ""
"ushbu aniq cell client tomonida tahrirlanmasligi kerakligini bildiruvchi "
"boolean"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3850
msgid "``classes`` (optional)"
msgstr "``classes`` (ixtiyoriy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3846
msgid ""
"a list of classes (as strings) to add on the cell's container (between the "
"cell's TD and the cell's potentially-editable element)."
msgstr ""
"cell container'iga qo'shiladigan class'lar ro'yxati (satrlar sifatida) — "
"cell'ning TD'si va cell'ning ehtimoliy tahrirlanadigan elementi orasida."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3849
msgid ""
"In case of conflicts between this list and the base classes (prefixed with "
"``o_grid_cell_``), the classes in this list are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Bu ro'yxat va asosiy class'lar (``o_grid_cell_`` prefiksi bilan) o'rtasida "
"ziddiyat bo'lsa, bu ro'yxatdagi class'lar e'tiborga olinmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3852
msgid ""
"Note that the grid data is *dense*, if querying the database yields no group "
"matching a cell a cell will generate an \"empty\" cell with default values "
"for required keys."
msgstr ""
"E'tibor bering, grid ma'lumotlari *zich* bo'ladi: agar ma'lumotlar bazasiga "
"so'rov cell'ga mos guruhni qaytarmasa, majburiy kalitlar uchun standart "
"qiymatlarga ega \"bo'sh\" cell yaratiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3855
msgid ""
"``prev`` and ``next`` which can be either falsy (no pagination) or a context "
"item to merge into the view's own context to ``read_grid`` the previous or "
"next page, it should be assumed to be opaque"
msgstr ""
"``prev`` va ``next`` — bular yoki falsy bo'ladi (pagination yo'q), yoki "
"oldingi yoxud keyingi sahifani ``read_grid`` qilish uchun view'ning o'z "
"context'iga qo'shiladigan context elementi bo'ladi; ular opaque deb qabul "
"qilinishi kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3859
msgid ""
"``read_grid_domain(field, range)`` (provided on al models by the module) "
"returns the domain matching the current configured \"span\" of the grid. "
"This is also done internally by ``read_grid``, but can be useful or "
"necessary to call independently to use with separate e.g. ``search_count`` "
"or ``read_group``."
msgstr ""
"``read_grid_domain(field, range)`` (modul tomonidan barcha model'larda "
"taqdim etiladi) grid'ning hozirda sozlangan \"span\" qiymatiga mos domain'ni "
"qaytaradi. Bu ``read_grid`` ichida ham bajariladi, biroq alohida, masalan "
"``search_count`` yoki ``read_group`` bilan ishlatish uchun uni mustaqil "
"chaqirish foydali yoki zarur bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3865
msgid ""
"``adjust_grid``, for which there currently isn't a blanket implementation "
"and whose semantics are likely to evolve with time and use cases"
msgstr ""
"``adjust_grid`` — buning uchun hozirda umumiy implementatsiya yo'q va uning "
"semantikasi vaqt hamda foydalanish holatlariga qarab o'zgarishi ehtimoli bor"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3869
msgid "Server Hooks"
msgstr "Server hook'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3871
msgid ""
"``read_grid`` calls a number of hooks allowing the customisation of its "
"operations from within without having to override the entire method:"
msgstr ""
"``read_grid`` bir qancha hook'larni chaqiradi; ular butun method'ni override "
"qilmasdan uning operatsiyalarini ichdan moslashtirishga imkon beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3875
msgid "``_grid_format_cell(group, cell_field)``"
msgstr "``_grid_format_cell(group, cell_field)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3875
msgid ""
"converts the output of a read_group (group-by-group) into cells in the "
"format described above (as part of \"the grid data\")"
msgstr ""
"read_group natijasini (guruh-guruh bo'yicha) yuqorida tavsiflangan "
"formatdagi cell'larga aylantiradi (\"grid ma'lumotlari\"ning bir qismi "
"sifatida)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3877
msgid "``_grid_make_empty_cell(row_domain, column_domain, view_domain)``"
msgstr "``_grid_make_empty_cell(row_domain, column_domain, view_domain)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3878
msgid ""
"generates an empty version of a cell (if there is no corresponding group)"
msgstr "cell'ning bo'sh versiyasini yaratadi (agar mos guruh bo'lmasa)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3908
msgid "``_grid_column_info(name, range)``"
msgstr "``_grid_column_info(name, range)``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3880
msgid ""
"generates a ColumnMetadata object based on the column type, storing values "
"either returned directly (as part of ``read_grid``) or used query and "
"reformat ``read_group`` into ``read_grid``:"
msgstr ""
"column turiga asoslanib ColumnMetadata obyektini yaratadi; u to'g'ridan-"
"to'g'ri qaytariladigan (``read_grid`` qismi sifatida) yoki ``read_group``ni "
"so'rash va uni ``read_grid``ga qayta formatlash uchun ishlatiladigan "
"qiymatlarni saqlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3884
msgid "``grouping``"
msgstr "``grouping``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3885
msgid "the actual grouping field/query for the columns"
msgstr "column'lar uchun haqiqiy guruhlash field'i/so'rovi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3887
msgid ""
"domain to apply to ``read_group`` in case the column field is paginated, can "
"be an empty list"
msgstr ""
"column field'i pagination qilingan bo'lsa ``read_group``ga qo'llanadigan "
"domain; bo'sh ro'yxat bo'lishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3891
msgid "``prev`` and ``next``"
msgstr "``prev`` va ``next``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3890
msgid ""
"context segments which will be sent to ``read_grid`` for pages before and "
"after the current one. If ``False``, disables pagination in that direction"
msgstr ""
"joriy sahifadan oldingi va keyingi sahifalar uchun ``read_grid`` ga "
"yuboriladigan context segmentlari. Agar ``False`` bo'lsa, o'sha yo'nalishda "
"pagination o'chiriladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3908
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3898
msgid "``values``"
msgstr "``values``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3894
msgid ""
"column values to display on the \"current page\", each value is a dictionary "
"with the following keys:"
msgstr ""
"\"joriy sahifa\"da ko'rsatiladigan ustun qiymatlari; har bir qiymat quyidagi "
"kalitlarga ega dictionary:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3898
msgid ""
"dictionary mapping field names to values for the entire column, usually just "
"``name`` -> a value"
msgstr ""
"butun ustun uchun field nomlarini qiymatlarga moslashtiruvchi dictionary, "
"odatda faqat ``name`` -> qiymat"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3901
msgid "domain matching this specific column"
msgstr "aynan shu ustunga mos keluvchi domain"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3903
msgid "``is_current``"
msgstr "``is_current``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3903
msgid ""
"``True`` if the current column should be specifically outlined in the grid, "
"``False`` otherwise"
msgstr ""
"agar joriy ustun grid'da alohida ajratib ko'rsatilishi kerak bo'lsa "
"``True``, aks holda ``False``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3906
msgid ""
"how to format the values of that column/type from ``read_group`` formatting "
"to ``read_grid`` formatting (matching ``values`` in ColumnInfo)"
msgstr ""
"o'sha ustun/turdagi qiymatlarni ``read_group`` formatidan ``read_grid`` "
"formatiga qanday o'tkazish (ColumnInfo'dagi ``values`` ga mos)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3911
msgid "ACL"
msgstr "ACL"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3913
msgid "if the view is not editable, individual cells won't be editable"
msgstr ""
"agar view tahrirlanadigan bo'lmasa, alohida katakchalar ham tahrirlanmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3914
msgid ""
"if the view is not creatable, the ``Add a Line`` button will not be "
"displayed (it currently creates a new empty record)"
msgstr ""
"agar view'da yaratishga ruxsat bo'lmasa, ``Add a Line`` tugmasi "
"ko'rsatilmaydi (u hozirda yangi bo'sh record yaratadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3918
msgid "Context Keys"
msgstr "Context kalitlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3921
msgid "``grid_range``"
msgstr "``grid_range``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3921
msgid ""
"selects which range should be used by default if the view has multiple ranges"
msgstr ""
"agar view'da bir nechta range bo'lsa, sukut bo'yicha qaysi biri "
"ishlatilishini tanlaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3928
msgid "``grid_anchor``"
msgstr "``grid_anchor``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3924
msgid ""
"if applicable, used as the default anchor of column ranges instead of "
"whatever ``read_grid`` defines as its default."
msgstr ""
"agar qo'llanilsa, ``read_grid`` sukut bo'yicha aniqlagan qiymat o'rniga "
"ustun range'larining standart anchor'i sifatida ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3927
msgid ""
"For date fields, the reference date around which the initial span will be "
"computed. The default date anchor is \"today\" (in the user's timezone)"
msgstr ""
"date field'lari uchun — boshlang'ich oraliq hisoblanadigan tayanch sana. "
"Standart sana anchor'i \"today\" (foydalanuvchining timezone'ida)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3933
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:971
msgid "Gantt"
msgstr "Gantt"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3939
msgid "Gantt views appropriately display Gantt charts (for scheduling)."
msgstr ""
"Gantt view'lari Gantt diagrammalarini (rejalashtirish uchun) mos ravishda "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3941
msgid ""
"The root element of gantt views is ``<gantt/>``, it has no children but can "
"take the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"gantt view'larining ildiz elementi ``<gantt/>``; uning child elementlari "
"yo'q, lekin quyidagi atributlarni qabul qilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3945
msgid "string (default: ``''``)"
msgstr "string (sukut bo'yicha: ``''``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3947
msgid ""
"This view title is displayed only if you open an action that has no name and "
"whose target is 'new' (opening a dialog)"
msgstr ""
"Bu view sarlavhasi faqat nomi berilmagan va target'i 'new' bo'lgan action'ni "
"ochganingizda ko'rsatiladi (dialog ochilishi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:0
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:159
msgid "create"
msgstr "create"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3951
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3956
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3961
msgid "bool (default: ``True``)"
msgstr "bool (sukut bo'yicha: ``True``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:0
msgid "edit"
msgstr "edit"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:0
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:159
msgid "delete"
msgstr "delete"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3963
msgid ""
"Disable/enable record deletion on the view through the **Action** dropdown."
msgstr ""
"View'da **Action** dropdown orqali record o'chirishni yoqadi/o'chiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3968
msgid "``date_start`` (required)"
msgstr "``date_start`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3968
msgid ""
"name of the field providing the start datetime of the event for each record."
msgstr ""
"har bir record uchun hodisaning boshlanish datetime'ini beruvchi field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3971
msgid "``date_stop`` (required)"
msgstr "``date_stop`` (majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3971
msgid ""
"name of the field providing the end duration of the event for each record."
msgstr "har bir record uchun hodisaning tugash vaqtini beruvchi field nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3976
msgid "``dependency_field``"
msgstr "``dependency_field``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3974
msgid ""
"name of the ``many2many`` field that provides the dependency relation "
"between two records. If B depends on A, ``dependency_field`` is the field "
"that allows getting A from B. Both this field and "
"``dependency_inverted_field`` field are used to draw dependency arrows "
"between pills and reschedule them."
msgstr ""
"ikki record o'rtasidagi dependency munosabatini beruvchi ``many2many`` field "
"nomi. Agar B A ga bog'liq bo'lsa, ``dependency_field`` — B dan A ni olish "
"imkonini beruvchi field. Bu field ham, ``dependency_inverted_field`` field "
"ham pill'lar orasida dependency strelkalarini chizish va ularni qayta "
"rejalashtirish uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3980
msgid ""
"``dependency_inverted_field`` (required if ``dependency_field`` is provided)"
msgstr ""
"``dependency_inverted_field`` (agar ``dependency_field`` berilgan bo'lsa, "
"majburiy)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3979
msgid ""
"name of the ``many2many`` field that provides the invert dependency relation "
"than ``dependency_field``. If B depends on A, ``dependency_inverted_field`` "
"is the field that allows getting B from A."
msgstr ""
"``dependency_field`` ga teskari dependency munosabatini beruvchi "
"``many2many`` field nomi. Agar B A ga bog'liq bo'lsa, "
"``dependency_inverted_field`` — A dan B ni olish imkonini beruvchi field."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3982
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:901
msgid "``color``"
msgstr "``color``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3983
msgid "name of the field used to color the pills according to its value"
msgstr "pill'larni o'z qiymatiga qarab bo'yash uchun ishlatiladigan field nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4011
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:879
msgid "``decoration-{$name}``"
msgstr "``decoration-{$name}``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3985
msgid "`python expression`_ that evaluates to a bool"
msgstr "bool qiymat qaytaradigan `python expression`_"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3987
msgid ""
"allow changing the style of a cell's text based on the corresponding "
"record's attributes."
msgstr ""
"mos record atributlariga qarab katakcha matnining style'ini o'zgartirish "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3990
msgid ""
"``{$name}`` can be one of the following `bootstrap contextual color`_ "
"(``danger``, ``info``, ``secondary``, ``success`` or ``warning``)."
msgstr ""
"``{$name}`` quyidagi `bootstrap contextual color`_ lardan biri bo'lishi "
"mumkin (``danger``, ``info``, ``secondary``, ``success`` yoki ``warning``)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3993
msgid ""
"Define a conditional display of a record in the style of a row's text based "
"on the corresponding record's attributes."
msgstr ""
"Mos record atributlariga qarab qator matni style'ida record'ning shartli "
"ko'rinishini aniqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:3996
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:858
msgid ""
"Values are Python expressions. For each record, the expression is evaluated "
"with the record's attributes as context values and if ``true``, the "
"corresponding style is applied to the row. Here are some of the other values "
"available in the context:"
msgstr ""
"Qiymatlar Python expression'lari. Har bir record uchun expression record "
"atributlari context qiymatlari sifatida olinib hisoblanadi va agar ``true`` "
"bo'lsa, mos style qatorga qo'llaniladi. Context'da mavjud boshqa "
"qiymatlardan ba'zilari:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4001
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:863
msgid "``uid``: the id of the current user,"
msgstr "``uid``: joriy foydalanuvchining id'si,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4002
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:864
msgid ""
"``today``: the current local date as a string of the form ``YYYY-MM-DD``,"
msgstr ""
"``today``: joriy mahalliy sana ``YYYY-MM-DD`` shaklidagi string sifatida,"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4003
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:865
msgid ""
"``now``: same as ``today`` with the addition of the current time. This value "
"is formatted as ``YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss``."
msgstr ""
"``now``: ``today`` bilan bir xil, ustiga joriy vaqt ham qo'shiladi. Bu "
"qiymat ``YYYY-MM-DD hh:mm:ss`` formatida bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4013
msgid "``default_group_by``"
msgstr "``default_group_by``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4014
msgid "name of a field to group tasks by"
msgstr "vazifalarni guruhlash uchun field nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4015
msgid "``disable_drag_drop``"
msgstr "``disable_drag_drop``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4016
msgid "if set to true, the gantt view will not have any drag&drop support"
msgstr ""
"agar true qilib belgilansa, gantt view'da drag&drop qo'llab-quvvatlanmaydi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4017
msgid "``consolidation``"
msgstr "``consolidation``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4018
msgid "field name to display consolidation value in record cell"
msgstr ""
"record katakchasida consolidation qiymatini ko'rsatish uchun field nomi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4021
msgid "``consolidation_max``"
msgstr "``consolidation_max``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4020
msgid ""
"dictionary with the \"group by\" field as key and the maximum consolidation "
"value that can be reached before displaying the cell in red (e.g. "
"``{\"user_id\": 100}``)"
msgstr ""
"kalit sifatida \"group by\" field'iga va katakcha qizil rangda "
"ko'rsatilishidan oldin erishilishi mumkin bo'lgan maksimal consolidation "
"qiymatiga ega dictionary (masalan ``{\"user_id\": 100}``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4025
msgid "``consolidation_exclude``"
msgstr "``consolidation_exclude``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4024
msgid ""
"name of the field that describes if the task has to be excluded from the "
"consolidation if set to true it displays a striped zone in the consolidation "
"line"
msgstr ""
"vazifa consolidation'dan chiqarilishi kerakligini tavsiflovchi field nomi; "
"agar true qilib belgilansa, consolidation qatorida chiziqli zona ko'rsatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4042
msgid "``create``, ``cell_create``, ``edit``, ``delete``, ``plan``"
msgstr "``create``, ``cell_create``, ``edit``, ``delete``, ``plan``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4028
msgid ""
"allows *dis*\\ abling the corresponding action in the view by setting the "
"corresponding attribute to ``false`` (default: ``true``)."
msgstr ""
"mos atributni ``false`` qilib belgilash orqali view'dagi mos action'ni "
"*o'chirish* imkonini beradi (sukut bo'yicha: ``true``)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4031
msgid ""
"``create``: If enabled, an ``Add`` button will be available in the control "
"panel to create records."
msgstr ""
"``create``: yoqilgan bo'lsa, record yaratish uchun control panel'da ``Add`` "
"tugmasi mavjud bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4033
msgid ""
"``cell_create``: If enabled and ``create`` enabled, a \"**+**\" button will "
"be displayed while hovering on a time slot cell to create a new record on "
"that slot."
msgstr ""
"``cell_create``: agar yoqilgan bo'lsa va ``create`` ham yoqilgan bo'lsa, "
"vaqt oralig'i katagi ustiga kursor kelganda o'sha oraliqda yangi record "
"yaratish uchun \"**+**\" tugmasi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4035
msgid ""
"``edit``: If enabled, the opened records will be in edit mode (thus "
"editable)."
msgstr ""
"``edit``: agar yoqilgan bo'lsa, ochilgan record'lar edit rejimida bo'ladi "
"(ya'ni tahrirlanadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4036
msgid ""
"``plan``: If enabled and ``edit`` enabled, a \"magnifying glass\" button "
"will be displayed on time slots to plan unassigned records into that time "
"slot."
msgstr ""
"``plan``: agar yoqilgan bo'lsa va ``edit`` ham yoqilgan bo'lsa, "
"biriktirilmagan record'larni o'sha vaqt oralig'iga rejalashtirish uchun vaqt "
"oraliqlarida \"lupa\" tugmasi ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4041
msgid ""
"When you do not want to create records on the gantt view and the beginning "
"and end dates are required on the model, the planning feature should be "
"disabled because no record will ever be found."
msgstr ""
"Agar siz gantt view'da record yaratishni xohlamasangiz va model'da "
"boshlanish va tugash sanalari majburiy bo'lsa, rejalashtirish imkoniyatini "
"o'chirish kerak, chunki hech qanday record topilmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4047
msgid "``offset``"
msgstr "``offset``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4045
msgid ""
"Depending on the scale, the number of units to add to today to compute the "
"default period. Examples: An offset of +1 in default_scale week will open "
"the gantt view for next week, and an offset of -2 in default_scale month "
"will open the gantt view of 2 months ago."
msgstr ""
"Miqyosga qarab, standart davrni hisoblash uchun bugungi kunga qo'shiladigan "
"birliklar soni. Misollar: default_scale week bo'lganda +1 offset gantt "
"view'ni keyingi hafta uchun ochadi, default_scale month bo'lganda -2 offset "
"esa 2 oy oldingi gantt view'ni ochadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4050
msgid "``progress``"
msgstr "``progress``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4050
msgid ""
"name of a field providing the completion percentage for the record's event, "
"between 0 and 100"
msgstr ""
"record hodisasining bajarilish foizini beruvchi field nomi, 0 va 100 orasida"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4053
msgid "title of the gantt view"
msgstr "gantt view sarlavhasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4078
msgid "``precision``"
msgstr "``precision``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4055
msgid "JSON object specifying snapping precisions for the pills in each scale."
msgstr ""
"Har bir miqyosdagi pill'lar uchun yopishish (snapping) aniqligini "
"belgilovchi JSON object."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4057
msgid "Possible values for scale ``day`` are (default: ``hour``):"
msgstr "``day`` miqyosi uchun mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar (standart: ``hour``):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4059
msgid "``hour``: records times snap to full hours (ex: 7:12 becomes 8:00)"
msgstr ""
"``hour``: record vaqtlari to'liq soatlarga yopishadi (masalan: 7:12 → 8:00)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4061
msgid "``hour:half``: records times snap to half hours (ex: 7:12 becomes 7:30)"
msgstr ""
"``hour:half``: record vaqtlari yarim soatlarga yopishadi (masalan: 7:12 → "
"7:30)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4063
msgid ""
"``hour:quarter``: records times snap to half hours (ex: 7:12 becomes 7:15)"
msgstr ""
"``hour:quarter``: record vaqtlari yarim soatlarga yopishadi (masalan: 7:12 → "
"7:15)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4065
msgid "Possible values for scale ``week`` are (default: ``day:half``):"
msgstr ""
"``week`` miqyosi uchun mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar (standart: ``day:half``):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4067
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4073
msgid ""
"``day``: records times snap to full days (ex: 7:28 AM becomes 11:59:59 PM of "
"the previous day, 10:32 PM becomes 12:00 PM of the current day)"
msgstr ""
"``day``: record vaqtlari to'liq kunlarga yopishadi (masalan: 7:28 AM oldingi "
"kunning 11:59:59 PM ga, 10:32 PM esa joriy kunning 12:00 PM ga aylanadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4069
#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4075
msgid ""
"``day:half``: records times snap to half hours (ex: 7:28 AM becomes 12:00 PM)"
msgstr ""
"``day:half``: record vaqtlari yarim soatlarga yopishadi (masalan: 7:28 AM → "
"12:00 PM)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4071
msgid "Possible values for scale ``month`` are (default: ``day:half``):"
msgstr ""
"``month`` miqyosi uchun mumkin bo'lgan qiymatlar (standart: ``day:half``):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4077
msgid "Scale ``year`` always snap to full day."
msgstr "``year`` miqyosi doimo to'liq kunga yopishadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4079
msgid ""
"Example of precision attribute: ``{\"day\": \"hour:quarter\", \"week\": "
"\"day:half\", \"month\": \"day\"}``"
msgstr ""
"precision atributiga misol: ``{\"day\": \"hour:quarter\", \"week\": "
"\"day:half\", \"month\": \"day\"}``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4081
msgid "``total_row``"
msgstr "``total_row``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4081
msgid ""
"boolean to control whether the row containing the total count of records "
"should be displayed. (default: ``false``)"
msgstr ""
"record'larning umumiy sonini o'z ichiga olgan qator ko'rsatilishini "
"boshqaruvchi boolean. (standart: ``false``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4084
msgid "``collapse_first_level``"
msgstr "``collapse_first_level``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4084
msgid ""
"boolean to control whether it is possible to collapse each row if grouped by "
"one field. (default: ``false``, the collapse starts when grouping by two "
"fields)"
msgstr ""
"bitta field bo'yicha guruhlanganda har bir qatorni yig'ish mumkinligini "
"boshqaruvchi boolean. (standart: ``false``, yig'ish ikkita field bo'yicha "
"guruhlanganda boshlanadi)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4088
msgid "``display_unavailability``"
msgstr "``display_unavailability``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4087
msgid ""
"boolean to mark the dates returned by the ``gantt_unavailability`` function "
"of the model as available inside the gantt view. Records can still be "
"scheduled in them, but their unavailability is visually displayed. (default: "
"``false``)"
msgstr ""
"model'ning ``gantt_unavailability`` funksiyasi qaytargan sanalarni gantt "
"view ichida mavjud deb belgilovchi boolean. Ularda record'larni "
"rejalashtirish hamon mumkin, lekin ularning mavjud emasligi ko'rinadigan "
"tarzda aks etadi. (standart: ``false``)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4096
msgid "``default_scale``"
msgstr "``default_scale``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4091
msgid ""
"default scale when rendering the view. Possible values are (default: "
"``month``):"
msgstr ""
"view render qilinganda ishlatiladigan standart miqyos. Mumkin bo'lgan "
"qiymatlar (standart: ``month``):"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4093
msgid "``day``"
msgstr "``day``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4094
msgid "``week``"
msgstr "``week``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4095
msgid "``month``"
msgstr "``month``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4096
msgid "``year``"
msgstr "``year``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4100
msgid "``scales``"
msgstr "``scales``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4099
msgid ""
"comma-separated list of allowed scales for this view. By default, all scales "
"are allowed. For possible scale values to use in this list, see "
"``default_scale``."
msgstr ""
"bu view uchun ruxsat etilgan miqyoslarning vergul bilan ajratilgan ro'yxati. "
"Standart holatda barcha miqyoslarga ruxsat beriladi. Bu ro'yxatda "
"ishlatiladigan mumkin bo'lgan miqyos qiymatlari uchun ``default_scale`` ga "
"qaralsin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4103
msgid ""
"defines the :ref:`reference/qweb` template ``gantt-popover`` which is used "
"when the user hovers over one of the records in the gantt view."
msgstr ""
"foydalanuvchi gantt view'dagi record'lardan biri ustiga kursorni olib "
"kelganda ishlatiladigan ``gantt-popover`` :ref:`reference/qweb` template'ini "
"aniqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4106
msgid ""
"The gantt view uses mostly-standard :ref:`javascript qweb <reference/qweb/"
"javascript>` and provides the following context variables:"
msgstr ""
"Gantt view asosan standart :ref:`javascript qweb <reference/qweb/"
"javascript>` dan foydalanadi va quyidagi context o'zgaruvchilarini taqdim "
"etadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4112
msgid ""
"the current :js:class:`GanttRow`, can be used to fetch some meta-"
"information. The ``getColor`` method to convert in a color integer is also "
"available directly in the template context without using ``widget``."
msgstr ""
"joriy :js:class:`GanttRow`, ba'zi meta-ma'lumotlarni olish uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin. Rang butun soniga aylantiruvchi ``getColor`` method'i "
"ham ``widget`` dan foydalanmasdan to'g'ridan-to'g'ri template context'ida "
"mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4118
msgid "``on_create``"
msgstr "``on_create``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4117
msgid ""
"If specified when clicking the add button on the view, instead of opening a "
"generic dialog, launch a client action. this should hold the xmlid of the "
"action (eg: ``on_create=\"%(my_module.my_wizard)d\"``"
msgstr ""
"Agar belgilangan bo'lsa, view'dagi qo'shish tugmasi bosilganda umumiy dialog "
"ochish o'rniga client action ishga tushiriladi. Bu action'ning xmlid'ini "
"saqlashi kerak (masalan: ``on_create=\"%(my_module.my_wizard)d\"``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4123
msgid "``form_view_id``"
msgstr "``form_view_id``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4121
msgid ""
"view to open when the user create or edit a record. Note that if this "
"attribute is not set, the gantt view will fall back to the id of the form "
"view in the current action, if any."
msgstr ""
"foydalanuvchi record yaratganda yoki tahrirlaganda ochiladigan view. E'tibor "
"bering, agar bu atribut belgilanmagan bo'lsa, gantt view joriy action'dagi "
"form view id'siga qaytadi (agar mavjud bo'lsa)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4127
msgid "``dynamic_range``"
msgstr "``dynamic_range``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4126
msgid ""
"if set to true, the gantt view will start at the first record, instead of "
"starting at the beginning of the year/month/day."
msgstr ""
"agar true qilib belgilansa, gantt view yil/oy/kun boshidan boshlanish "
"o'rniga birinchi record'dan boshlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4131
msgid "``pill_label``"
msgstr "``pill_label``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4130
msgid ""
"If set to true, the time appears in the pill label when the scale is set on "
"week or month. (e.g. `7:00 AM - 11:00 AM (4h) - DST Task 1`)"
msgstr ""
"Agar true qilib belgilansa, miqyos week yoki month ga qo'yilganda vaqt pill "
"yorlig'ida ko'rinadi. (masalan `7:00 AM - 11:00 AM (4h) - DST Task 1`)"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4150
msgid "``thumbnails``"
msgstr "``thumbnails``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4134
msgid ""
"This allows to display a thumbnail next to groups name if the group is a "
"relationnal field. This expects a python dict which keys are the name of the "
"field on the active model. Values are the names of the field holding the "
"thumbnail on the related model."
msgstr ""
"Bu guruh relatsion field bo'lsa, guruh nomi yonida thumbnail ko'rsatish "
"imkonini beradi. Bunda kalitlari aktiv model'dagi field nomlari bo'lgan "
"python dict kutiladi. Qiymatlar esa bog'liq model'da thumbnail'ni saqlovchi "
"field nomlaridir."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4138
msgid ""
"Example: tasks have a field user_id that reference res.users. The res.users "
"model has a field image that holds the avatar, then:"
msgstr ""
"Misol: task'larda res.users ga havola qiluvchi user_id field'i bor. "
"res.users model'ida esa avatarni saqlovchi image field'i bor, u holda:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4150
msgid ""
"will display the users avatars next to their names when grouped by user_id."
msgstr ""
"user_id bo'yicha guruhlanganda foydalanuvchilarning avatarlarini ularning "
"nomlari yonida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4163
msgid ""
"This view is able to display records on a map and the routes between them. "
"The records are represented by pins. It also allows the visualization of "
"fields from the model in a popup tied to the record's pin."
msgstr ""
"Bu view record'larni xaritada va ular orasidagi marshrutlarni ko'rsatishi "
"mumkin. Record'lar pin'lar bilan tasvirlanadi. Shuningdek, u model'dagi "
"field'larni record pin'iga bog'langan popup ichida ko'rsatish imkonini "
"beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4167
msgid ""
"The model on which the view is applied should contain a `res.partner` "
"many2one since the view relies on the `res.partner`'s address and "
"coordinates fields to localize the records."
msgstr ""
"View qo'llaniladigan model `res.partner` many2one'ni o'z ichiga olishi "
"kerak, chunki view record'larning joyini aniqlash uchun `res.partner`'ning "
"manzil va koordinata field'lariga tayanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4172
msgid ""
"The view uses location data platforms' API to fetch the tiles (the map's "
"background), do the geoforwarding (converting addresses to a set of "
"coordinates) and fetch the routes. The view implements two API, "
"OpenStreetMap and MapBox. OpenStreetMap is used by default and is able to "
"fetch `tiles`_ and do `geoforwarding`_. This API does not require a token. "
"As soon as a valid `MapBox`_ token is provided in the general settings the "
"view switches to the MapBox API. This API is faster and allows the "
"computation of routes. A token can be obtained by `signing up`_ to MapBox."
msgstr ""
"View tile'larni (xaritaning foni) olish, geoforwarding qilish (manzillarni "
"koordinatalar to'plamiga aylantirish) va marshrutlarni olish uchun joylashuv "
"ma'lumotlari platformalarining API'sidan foydalanadi. View ikkita API'ni "
"amalga oshiradi: OpenStreetMap va MapBox. Standart holatda OpenStreetMap "
"ishlatiladi, u `tiles`_ ni olishi va `geoforwarding`_ qilishi mumkin. Bu API "
"token talab qilmaydi. Umumiy sozlamalarda haqiqiy `MapBox`_ token "
"kiritilishi bilan view MapBox API'siga o'tadi. Bu API tezroq va "
"marshrutlarni hisoblash imkonini beradi. Token MapBox'ga `signing up`_ "
"orqali olinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4179
msgid ""
"The view's root element is ``<map>``. It can have the following attributes:"
msgstr ""
"View'ning ildiz elementi ``<map>``. U quyidagi atributlarga ega bo'lishi "
"mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4184
msgid "``res_partner``"
msgstr "``res_partner``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4185
msgid ""
"Contains the `res.partner` many2one. If not provided the view resorts to "
"create an empty map."
msgstr ""
"`res.partner` many2one'ni o'z ichiga oladi. Agar berilmasa, view bo'sh "
"xarita yaratish bilan cheklanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4186
msgid "``default_order``"
msgstr "``default_order``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4187
msgid ""
"If a field is provided the view overrides the model's default order. The "
"field must be part of the model on which the view is applied, not from "
"`res.partner`."
msgstr ""
"Agar field berilsa, view model'ning standart tartibini override qiladi. "
"Field view qo'llaniladigan model'ning qismi bo'lishi kerak, `res.partner` "
"dan emas."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4188
msgid "``routing``"
msgstr "``routing``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4189
msgid ""
"if ``1`` display the routes between the records. The view needs a valid "
"MapBox token and at least two located records (i.e the records have a "
"`res.partner` many2one and the partner has an address or valid coordinates)."
msgstr ""
"agar ``1`` bo'lsa, record'lar orasidagi marshrutlarni ko'rsatadi. View uchun "
"haqiqiy MapBox token va joylashuvi aniqlangan kamida ikkita record kerak "
"(ya'ni record'larda `res.partner` many2one bor va partner'da manzil yoki "
"haqiqiy koordinatalar bor)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4190
msgid "``hide_name``"
msgstr "``hide_name``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4191
msgid "if ``1`` hide the name from the pin's popup (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "agar ``1`` bo'lsa, nomni pin popup'idan yashiradi (standart: ``0``)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4192
msgid "``hide_address``"
msgstr "``hide_address``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4193
msgid "if ``1`` hide the address from the pin's popup (default: ``0``)."
msgstr ""
"agar ``1`` bo'lsa, manzilni pin popup'idan yashiradi (standart: ``0``)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4194
msgid "``hide_title``"
msgstr "``hide_title``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4195
msgid "if ``1`` hide the title from the pin list (default: ``0``)."
msgstr ""
"agar ``1`` bo'lsa, sarlavhani pin ro'yxatidan yashiradi (standart: ``0``)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4196
msgid "``panel_title``"
msgstr "``panel_title``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4197
msgid ""
"String to display as title of the pin list. If not provided, the title is "
"the action's name or \"Items\" if the view is not in an action."
msgstr ""
"Pin ro'yxati sarlavhasi sifatida ko'rsatiladigan satr. Agar ko'rsatilmagan "
"bo'lsa, sarlavha action nomi bo'ladi yoki view action ichida bo'lmasa, "
"\"Items\" bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4199
msgid "``limit``"
msgstr "``limit``"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4199
msgid ""
"Maximum number of records to fetch (default: ``80``). It must be a positive "
"integer."
msgstr ""
"Olinadigan record'larning maksimal soni (standart: ``80``). U musbat butun "
"son bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4201
msgid ""
"The ``<map>`` element can contain multiple ``<field>`` elements. Each "
"``<field>`` element is interpreted as a line in the pin's popup. The field's "
"attributes are the following:"
msgstr ""
"``<map>`` elementi bir nechta ``<field>`` elementini o'z ichiga olishi "
"mumkin. Har bir ``<field>`` elementi pin popup'idagi qator sifatida talqin "
"qilinadi. Field atributlari quyidagilar:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4206
msgid "The field to display."
msgstr "Ko'rsatiladigan field."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4208
msgid ""
"String to display before the field's content. It can be used as a "
"description."
msgstr ""
"Field mazmunidan oldin ko'rsatiladigan satr. U tavsif sifatida ishlatilishi "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_architectures.rst:4215
msgid "For example here is a map:"
msgstr "Masalan, quyida map keltirilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:3
msgid "View records"
msgstr "View record'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:5
msgid ""
"Views are what define how records should be displayed to end-users. They are "
"specified in XML and stored as records themselves, meaning they can be "
"edited independently from the models that they represent. They are flexible "
"and allow a high level of customization of the screens that they control. "
"There exist various :ref:`types of views <reference/view_records/types>`. "
"Each represents a visualization mode: *form*, *list*, *kanban*, etc."
msgstr ""
"View'lar record'lar oxirgi foydalanuvchilarga qanday ko'rsatilishini "
"belgilaydi. Ular XML'da aniqlanadi va o'zlari ham record sifatida saqlanadi, "
"ya'ni ular ifodalaydigan model'lardan mustaqil ravishda tahrirlanishi "
"mumkin. Ular moslashuvchan bo'lib, o'zlari boshqaradigan ekranlarni yuqori "
"darajada sozlash imkonini beradi. :ref:`view turlari <reference/view_records/"
"types>` xilma-xildir. Har biri vizualizatsiya rejimini ifodalaydi: *form*, "
"*list*, *kanban* va h.k."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:14
msgid "Generic structure"
msgstr "Umumiy tuzilma"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:16
msgid ""
"Basic views generally share the common minimal structure defined below. "
"Placeholders are denoted in all caps."
msgstr ""
"Asosiy view'lar odatda quyida keltirilgan umumiy minimal tuzilmaga ega. "
"O'rin egallovchilar (placeholder) bosh harflar bilan belgilangan."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:34
msgid "View types"
msgstr "View turlari"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:36
msgid ":ref:`Form <reference/view_architectures/form>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Form <reference/view_architectures/form>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:37
msgid "Display and edit the data from a single record."
msgstr "Bitta record ma'lumotlarini ko'rsatadi va tahrirlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:38
msgid ":ref:`List <reference/view_architectures/list>`"
msgstr ":ref:`List <reference/view_architectures/list>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:39
msgid "View and edit multiple records."
msgstr "Bir nechta record'ni ko'radi va tahrirlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:40
msgid ":ref:`Search <reference/view_architectures/search>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Search <reference/view_architectures/search>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:41
msgid ""
"Apply filters and perform searches. The results are displayed in the current "
"list, kanban... view."
msgstr ""
"Filtrlarni qo'llaydi va qidiruvni bajaradi. Natijalar joriy list, kanban... "
"view'ida ko'rsatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:42
msgid ":ref:`Kanban <reference/view_architectures/kanban>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Kanban <reference/view_architectures/kanban>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:43
msgid "Display records as \"cards\", configurable as a small template."
msgstr ""
"Record'larni \"kartalar\" sifatida ko'rsatadi, kichik template kabi "
"sozlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:44
msgid ":ref:`Qweb <reference/view_architectures/qweb>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Qweb <reference/view_architectures/qweb>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:45
msgid "Templating of reporting, website..."
msgstr "Hisobotlar, website va boshqalar uchun template tuzish..."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:46
msgid ":ref:`Graph <reference/view_architectures/graph>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Graph <reference/view_architectures/graph>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:47
msgid "Visualize aggregations over a number of records or record groups."
msgstr ""
"Bir qator record'lar yoki record guruhlari bo'yicha agregatsiyalarni "
"vizuallashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:48
msgid ":ref:`Pivot <reference/view_architectures/pivot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Pivot <reference/view_architectures/pivot>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:49
msgid ""
"Display aggregations as a `pivot table <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Pivot_table>`_."
msgstr ""
"Agregatsiyalarni `pivot table <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pivot_table>`_ "
"shaklida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:50
msgid ":ref:`Calendar <reference/view_architectures/calendar>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Calendar <reference/view_architectures/calendar>`"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:51
msgid ""
"Display records as events in a daily, weekly, monthly, or yearly calendar."
msgstr ""
"Record'larni kunlik, haftalik, oylik yoki yillik kalendarda tadbir sifatida "
"ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:52
msgid ":ref:`Cohort <reference/view_architectures/cohort>` |enterprise|"
msgstr ":ref:`Cohort <reference/view_architectures/cohort>` |enterprise|"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:53
msgid "Display and understand the way some data changes over a period of time."
msgstr ""
"Ba'zi ma'lumotlar vaqt o'tishi bilan qanday o'zgarishini ko'rsatadi va "
"tushunishga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:54
msgid ":ref:`Gantt <reference/view_architectures/gantt>` |enterprise|"
msgstr ":ref:`Gantt <reference/view_architectures/gantt>` |enterprise|"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:55
msgid "Display records as a Gantt chart."
msgstr "Record'larni Gantt diagrammasi sifatida ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:56
msgid ":ref:`Grid <reference/view_architectures/grid>` |enterprise|"
msgstr ":ref:`Grid <reference/view_architectures/grid>` |enterprise|"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:57
msgid ""
"Display computed information in numerical cells; are hardly configurable."
msgstr ""
"Hisoblangan ma'lumotni raqamli kataklarda ko'rsatadi; deyarli sozlanmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:59
msgid ":ref:`Map <reference/view_architectures/map>` |enterprise|"
msgstr ":ref:`Map <reference/view_architectures/map>` |enterprise|"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:59
msgid "Display records on a map, and the routes between them."
msgstr "Record'larni xaritada va ular orasidagi yo'nalishlarni ko'rsatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:70
msgid "View records expose a number of fields."
msgstr "View record'lari bir qator field'ni taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:154
msgid ""
"The current context and user access rights may also impact the view "
"abilities."
msgstr ""
"Joriy context va foydalanuvchining kirish huquqlari ham view imkoniyatlariga "
"ta'sir qilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:159
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:521
msgid "Inheritance"
msgstr "Inheritance"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:161
msgid ""
"Inheritance allows for customizing delivered views. It makes it possible, "
"for example, to add content as modules are installed, or to deliver "
"different displays according to the action."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance yetkazib berilgan view'larni sozlash imkonini beradi. Masalan, "
"module'lar o'rnatilgan sari kontent qo'shish yoki action'ga qarab turli "
"ko'rinishlarni taqdim etish mumkin bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:164
msgid ""
"Inherit views generally share the common structure defined below. "
"Placeholders are denoted in all caps. This synthetic view will update a node "
"targeted by an XPath, and another targeted by its name and attributes."
msgstr ""
"Inherit view'lar odatda quyida keltirilgan umumiy tuzilmaga ega. O'rin "
"egallovchilar (placeholder) bosh harflar bilan belgilangan. Bu sun'iy view "
"XPath orqali mo'ljallangan node'ni va nomi hamda atributlari orqali "
"mo'ljallangan boshqa node'ni yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:184
msgid ""
"The `inherit_id` and `mode` fields determine the :ref:`view resolution "
"<reference/view_records/inheritance/resolution>`. The `xpath` or `NODE` "
"elements indicate the :ref:`inheritance specs <reference/view_records/"
"inheritance/specs>`. The `expr` and `position` attributes specify "
"the :ref:`inheritance position <reference/view_records/inheritance/"
"position>`."
msgstr ""
"`inherit_id` va `mode` field'lari :ref:`view resolution <reference/"
"view_records/inheritance/resolution>` ni belgilaydi. `xpath` yoki `NODE` "
"elementlari :ref:`inheritance specs <reference/view_records/inheritance/"
"specs>` ni ko'rsatadi. `expr` va `position` atributlari :ref:`inheritance "
"position <reference/view_records/inheritance/position>` ni aniqlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:192
msgid "View resolution"
msgstr "View resolution"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:194
msgid ""
"Resolution generates the final `arch` for a requested/matched `primary` view "
"as follow:"
msgstr ""
"Resolution so'ralgan/mos kelgan `primary` view uchun yakuniy `arch` ni "
"quyidagicha shakllantiradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:196
msgid ""
"if the view has a parent, the parent is fully resolved, then the current "
"view's inheritance specs are applied;"
msgstr ""
"agar view parent'ga ega bo'lsa, parent to'liq resolve qilinadi, so'ngra "
"joriy view'ning inheritance specs'lari qo'llanadi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:198
msgid "if the view has no parent, its `arch` is used as-is;"
msgstr ""
"agar view parent'ga ega bo'lmasa, uning `arch` i o'zgarishsiz ishlatiladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:199
msgid ""
"the current view's children with mode `extension` are looked up, and their "
"inheritance specs are applied depth-first (a child view is applied, then its "
"children, then its siblings)."
msgstr ""
"joriy view'ning `extension` rejimidagi child'lari izlanadi va ularning "
"inheritance specs'lari chuqurlik bo'yicha qo'llanadi (avval child view, "
"so'ngra uning child'lari, keyin esa yonma-yon turgan view'lar)."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:202
msgid ""
"The inheritance is applied according to the `inherit_id` field. If several "
"view records inherit the same view, the order is determined by the "
"`priority`."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance `inherit_id` field'iga muvofiq qo'llanadi. Agar bir nechta view "
"record bir xil view'dan inherit qilsa, tartib `priority` bilan belgilanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:205
msgid "The result of applying children views yields the final `arch`."
msgstr "Child view'larni qo'llash natijasi yakuniy `arch` ni beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:207
msgid "NOTE on fields_view_get and link to ORM ?"
msgstr "fields_view_get haqida IZOH va ORM'ga havola?"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:212
msgid "Inheritance specs"
msgstr "Inheritance specs"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:214
msgid "Inheritance specs are applied sequentially and are comprised of:"
msgstr ""
"Inheritance specs'lar ketma-ket qo'llanadi va quyidagilardan tashkil topadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:216
msgid "an element locator to match the inherited element in the parent view;"
msgstr ""
"parent view'da inherit qilingan elementni topish uchun element locator;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:217
msgid "children element to modify the inherited element."
msgstr "meros olingan element'ni o'zgartirish uchun children element."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:219
msgid "There are three types of element locators:"
msgstr "Element locator'larning uchta turi mavjud:"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:221
msgid ""
"An `xpath` element with an `expr` attribute. `expr` is an `XPath <https://"
"en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XPath>`_ expression\\ [#hasclass]_ applied to the "
"current `arch`, matching the first node it finds;"
msgstr ""
"`expr` attribute'iga ega `xpath` element. `expr` — joriy `arch` ga "
"qo'llaniladigan `XPath <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XPath>`_ ifodasi\\ "
"[#hasclass]_ bo'lib, u topgan birinchi node'ga mos keladi;"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:224
msgid ""
"A `field` element with a `name` attribute, matching the first field with the "
"same `name`."
msgstr ""
"`name` attribute'iga ega `field` element — xuddi shu `name` ga ega birinchi "
"field'ga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:227
msgid "All other attributes are ignored."
msgstr "Boshqa barcha attribute'lar e'tiborga olinmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:229
msgid ""
"Any other element, matching the first element with the same `name` and "
"identical attributes."
msgstr ""
"Boshqa har qanday element — xuddi shu `name` va bir xil attribute'larga ega "
"birinchi element'ga mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:232
msgid "The attributes `position` and `version` are ignored."
msgstr "`position` va `version` attribute'lari e'tiborga olinmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:234
msgid ""
"An extension function is added for simpler matching in QWeb views: "
"`hasclass(*classes)` matches if the context node has all the specified "
"classes."
msgstr ""
"QWeb view'larida moslashtirishni osonlashtirish uchun qo'shimcha extension "
"function mavjud: `hasclass(*classes)` context node'da ko'rsatilgan barcha "
"class'lar bo'lsa mos keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:251
msgid "Inheritance position"
msgstr "Inheritance pozitsiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:253
msgid ""
"The inheritance specs accept an optional `position` attribute, defaulting to "
"`inside`, that specifies how the matched node should be modified."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance spec'lari ixtiyoriy `position` attribute'ini qabul qiladi "
"(standart qiymati `inside`); u mos kelgan node qanday o'zgartirilishini "
"belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:258
msgid "The content of the inheritance spec is appended to the matched node."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance spec'ining mazmuni mos kelgan node ichiga, oxiriga qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:272
msgid ""
"The content of the inheritance spec is appended to the matched node's parent "
"after the matched node."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance spec'ining mazmuni mos kelgan node'ning parent'iga, mos kelgan "
"node'dan keyin qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:285
msgid ""
"The content of the inheritance spec is appended to the matched node's parent "
"before the matched node."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance spec'ining mazmuni mos kelgan node'ning parent'iga, mos kelgan "
"node'dan oldin qo'shiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:298
msgid ""
"The content of the inheritance spec replaces the matched node. Any text node "
"containing only `$0` within the contents of the spec is replaced by a copy "
"of the matched node, effectively wrapping the matched node."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance spec'ining mazmuni mos kelgan node'ni almashtiradi. Spec "
"mazmunida faqat `$0` dan iborat har qanday text node mos kelgan node'ning "
"nusxasi bilan almashtiriladi — bu esa mos kelgan node'ni o'rab olish "
"imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:314
msgid ""
"The content of the inheritance spec should be made of only `attribute` "
"elements, each with a `name` attribute and an optional body."
msgstr ""
"Inheritance spec'ining mazmuni faqat `attribute` element'laridan iborat "
"bo'lishi kerak; ularning har biri `name` attribute'iga va ixtiyoriy body'ga "
"ega bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:317
msgid ""
"If the `attribute` element has a body, a new attributed named after its "
"`name` is added to the matched node with the `attribute` element's text as "
"value."
msgstr ""
"Agar `attribute` element body'ga ega bo'lsa, uning `name` qiymati bilan "
"nomlangan yangi attribute mos kelgan node'ga qo'shiladi va `attribute` "
"element'ining matni uning qiymati bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:319
msgid ""
"If the `attribute` element has no body, the attribute named after its `name` "
"is removed from the matched node."
msgstr ""
"Agar `attribute` element body'ga ega bo'lmasa, uning `name` qiymati bilan "
"nomlangan attribute mos kelgan node'dan olib tashlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:321
msgid ""
"If the `attribute` element has an `add` attribute, a `remove` attribute, or "
"both, the value of the matched node's attribute named after `name` is "
"recomputed to account for the value(s) of `add`, `remove`, and an optional "
"`separator` attribute defaulting to `,`. `add` includes its value(s), "
"separated by `separator`. `remove` removes its value(s), separated by "
"`separator`."
msgstr ""
"Agar `attribute` element `add` attribute'iga, `remove` attribute'iga yoki "
"ikkalasiga ega bo'lsa, mos kelgan node'ning `name` bilan nomlangan "
"attribute'i qiymati `add`, `remove` hamda standart qiymati `,` bo'lgan "
"ixtiyoriy `separator` attribute'i qiymat(lar)ini hisobga olib qayta "
"hisoblanadi. `add` o'z qiymat(lar)ini `separator` bilan ajratib qo'shadi. "
"`remove` o'z qiymat(lar)ini `separator` bilan ajratib olib tashlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/reference/user_interface/view_records.rst:336
msgid ""
"The attribute `position=\"move\"` is set on the content of the inheritance "
"spec to specify how nodes are moved relatively to the inheritance spec's "
"element locator, on which the attribute `position` must also be set, with "
"values `inside`, `replace`, `after`, or `before`."
msgstr ""
"`position=\"move\"` attribute'i inheritance spec mazmuniga o'rnatiladi va "
"node'lar inheritance spec'ining element locator'iga nisbatan qanday "
"ko'chirilishini belgilaydi; ushbu locator'da ham `position` attribute'i "
"`inside`, `replace`, `after` yoki `before` qiymatlaridan biri bilan "
"o'rnatilgan bo'lishi shart."

