"barcha model'larda ``name`` field'ini ham talab qiladi. Bu maqsadlarda "
"ishlatiladigan field'ni :attr:`~odoo.models.Model._rec_name` ni belgilash "
"orqali override qilish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:207
msgid "Define a model"
msgstr "Model aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:209
msgid ""
"Define a new data model *Course* in the *openacademy* module. A course has a "
