msgstr ""
"*openacademy* modulida yangi *Course* ma'lumot model'ini aniqlang. Course'da "
"title va description bo'ladi. Course'lar albatta title'ga ega bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:213
msgid "Data files"
msgstr "Ma'lumot fayllari"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:215
msgid ""
"Odoo is a highly data driven system. Although behavior is customized using "
"Python_ code part of a module's value is in the data it sets up when loaded."
msgstr ""
"Odoo — juda ma'lumotga tayangan tizim. Xatti-harakat Python_ kodi bilan "
"sozlansa ham, modul qiymatining bir qismi u yuklanganda o'rnatadigan "
"ma'lumotlarda bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:218
msgid "some modules exist solely to add data into Odoo"
msgstr "ba'zi modullar faqat Odoo'ga ma'lumot qo'shish uchun mavjud"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:221
msgid ""
"Module data is declared via :ref:`data files <reference/data>`, XML files "
"with ``<record>`` elements. Each ``<record>`` element creates or updates a "
"database record."
msgstr ""
"Modul ma'lumotlari :ref:`ma'lumot fayllari <reference/data>` orqali e'lon "
"qilinadi — bular ``<record>`` elementlariga ega XML fayllar. Har bir "
"``<record>`` elementi ma'lumotlar bazasi record'ini yaratadi yoki yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:235
msgid "``model`` is the name of the Odoo model for the record."
msgstr "``model`` — record uchun Odoo model nomi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:236
msgid ""
"``id`` is an :term:`external identifier`, it allows referring to the record "
"(without having to know its in-database identifier)."
msgstr ""
"``id`` — bu :term:`external identifier`, u record'ga murojaat qilish "
"imkonini beradi (uning ma'lumotlar bazasidagi identifikatorini bilish shart "
"emas)."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:238
msgid ""
"``<field>`` elements have a ``name`` which is the name of the field in the "
"model (e.g. ``description``). Their body is the field's value."
msgstr ""
"``<field>`` elementlarida ``name`` bo'ladi — bu model'dagi field nomi "
"(masalan ``description``). Ularning tanasi esa field qiymatidir."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:241
msgid ""
"Data files have to be declared in the manifest file to be loaded, they can "
"be declared in the ``'data'`` list (always loaded) or in the ``'demo'`` list "
"(only loaded in demonstration mode)."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumot fayllari yuklanishi uchun manifest faylida e'lon qilinishi kerak; "
"ular ``'data'`` ro'yxatida (har doim yuklanadi) yoki ``'demo'`` ro'yxatida "
"(faqat demonstratsiya rejimida yuklanadi) e'lon qilinishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:245
msgid "Define demonstration data"
msgstr "Demonstratsiya ma'lumotlarini aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:247
msgid ""
"Create demonstration data filling the *Courses* model with a few "
"demonstration courses."
msgstr ""
"*Courses* model'ini bir nechta namunaviy kurs bilan to'ldiradigan "
"demonstratsiya ma'lumotlarini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:250
msgid ""
"The content of the data files is only loaded when a module is installed or "
"updated."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumot fayllarining mazmuni faqat module o'rnatilganda yoki yangilanganda "
"yuklanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:252
msgid ""
"After making some changes, do not forget to use :ref:`odoo-bin -u "
"openacademy <reference/cmdline>` to save the changes to your database."
msgstr ""
"Ayrim o'zgarishlar kiritgach, ularni ma'lumotlar bazasiga saqlash "
"uchun :ref:`odoo-bin -u openacademy <reference/cmdline>` dan foydalanishni "
"unutmang."

