msgstr "Asosiy view'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:300
msgid ""
"Views define the way the records of a model are displayed. Each type of view "
"represents a mode of visualization (a list of records, a graph of their "
"aggregation, …). Views can either be requested generically via their type "
"(e.g. *a list of partners*) or specifically via their id. For generic "
"requests, the view with the correct type and the lowest priority will be "
"used (so the lowest-priority view of each type is the default view for that "
"type)."
msgstr ""
"View'lar model record'lari qanday ko'rsatilishini aniqlaydi. Har bir view "
"turi vizualizatsiyaning bir usulini ifodalaydi (record'lar ro'yxati, "
"ularning agregatsiya grafigi, …). View'lar yoki umumiy tarzda o'z turi "
"bo'yicha (masalan *partner'lar ro'yxati*), yoki aniq id'si bo'yicha "
"so'ralishi mumkin. Umumiy so'rovlarda to'g'ri turga ega va priority'si eng "
"past bo'lgan view ishlatiladi (ya'ni har bir turdagi eng past priority'li "
"view o'sha tur uchun standart view hisoblanadi)."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:308
msgid ""
":ref:`View inheritance <reference/view_records/inheritance>` allows altering "
"views declared elsewhere (adding or removing content)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`View inheritance <reference/view_records/inheritance>` boshqa joyda "
"e'lon qilingan view'larni o'zgartirish (mazmun qo'shish yoki olib tashlash) "
"imkonini beradi."

