msgstr ""
"Agar model uchun search view mavjud bo'lmasa, Odoo faqat ``name`` field'i "
"bo'yicha qidirishga ruxsat beradigan view yaratadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:438
msgid "Search courses"
msgstr "Kurslarni qidirish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:440
msgid "Allow searching for courses based on their title or their description."
msgstr ""
"Kurslarni ularning sarlavhasi yoki tavsifi bo'yicha qidirish imkonini bering."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:443
msgid "Relations between models"
msgstr "Model'lar orasidagi aloqalar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:445
msgid ""
"A record from a model may be related to a record from another model. For "
"instance, a sale order record is related to a client record that contains "
"the client data; it is also related to its sale order line records."
msgstr ""
"Bir model'ning record'i boshqa model'ning record'i bilan bog'langan bo'lishi "
"mumkin. Masalan, sale order record'i mijoz ma'lumotlarini saqlaydigan client "
"record'i bilan bog'langan; shuningdek, u o'zining sale order line "
"record'lari bilan ham bog'langan."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:449
msgid "Create a session model"
msgstr "Session model'ini yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:451
msgid ""
"For the module Open Academy, we consider a model for *sessions*: a session "
"is an occurrence of a course taught at a given time for a given audience."
msgstr ""
"Open Academy module'i uchun *session*'lar model'ini ko'rib chiqamiz: session "
"— bu ma'lum vaqtda ma'lum auditoriya uchun o'qitiladigan kursning bir marta "
"o'tkazilishi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:454
msgid ""
"Create a model for *sessions*. A session has a name, a start date, a "
"duration and a number of seats. Add an action and a menu item to display "
"them. Make the new model visible via a menu item."
msgstr ""
"*session*'lar uchun model yarating. Session nom, boshlanish sanasi, "
"davomiylik va o'rinlar soniga ega bo'ladi. Ularni ko'rsatish uchun action va "
"menyu bandi qo'shing. Yangi model'ni menyu bandi orqali ko'rinadigan qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:461
msgid ""
"Relational fields link records, either of the same model (hierarchies) or "
"between different models."
msgstr ""
"Relational field'lar record'larni bog'laydi — yoki bir xil model ichida "
"(ierarxiyalar), yoki turli model'lar orasida."

