msgstr ""
"Relational field many2many'dan foydalanib, *Session* model'ini har bir "
"session'ni *attendees* to'plami bilan bog'laydigan qilib o'zgartiring. "
"Attendee'lar partner record'lari orqali ifodalanadi, shuning uchun biz ichki "
"``res.partner`` model'iga bog'lanamiz. View'larni shunga mos moslashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:524
msgid "Model inheritance"
msgstr "Model inheritance"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:526
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/12_inheritance.rst:112
msgid ""
"Odoo provides two *inheritance* mechanisms to extend an existing model in a "
"modular way."
msgstr ""
"Odoo mavjud model'ni modulli tarzda kengaytirish uchun ikkita *inheritance* "
"mexanizmini taqdim etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:529
msgid ""
"The first inheritance mechanism allows a module to modify the behavior of a "
"model defined in another module:"
msgstr ""
"Birinchi inheritance mexanizmi module'ga boshqa module'da aniqlangan "
"model'ning xatti-harakatini o'zgartirish imkonini beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:532
msgid "add fields to a model,"
msgstr "model'ga field'lar qo'shish,"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:533
msgid "override the definition of fields on a model,"
msgstr "model'dagi field'lar ta'rifini override qilish,"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:534
msgid "add constraints to a model,"
msgstr "model'ga constraint'lar qo'shish,"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:535
msgid "add methods to a model,"
msgstr "model'ga method'lar qo'shish,"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:536
msgid "override existing methods on a model."
msgstr "model'dagi mavjud method'larni override qilish."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:538
msgid ""
"The second inheritance mechanism (delegation) allows to link every record of "
"a model to a record in a parent model, and provides transparent access to "
"the fields of the parent record."
msgstr ""
"Ikkinchi inheritance mexanizmi (delegation) model'ning har bir record'ini "
"parent model'dagi record bilan bog'lash imkonini beradi va parent "
"record'ning field'lariga shaffof kirishni ta'minlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:546
msgid ":attr:`~odoo.models.Model._inherit`"
msgstr ":attr:`~odoo.models.Model._inherit`"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:547
msgid ":attr:`~odoo.models.Model._inherits`"
msgstr ":attr:`~odoo.models.Model._inherits`"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:550
msgid "View inheritance"
msgstr "View inheritance"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:552
msgid ""
"Instead of modifying existing views in place (by overwriting them), Odoo "
"provides view inheritance where children \"extension\" views are applied on "
"top of root views, and can add or remove content from their parent."
msgstr ""
"Mavjud view'larni joyida o'zgartirish (ularning ustiga yozish) o'rniga, Odoo "
"view inheritance'ni taqdim etadi: bunda child \"extension\" view'lar root "
"view'lar ustiga qo'llaniladi va o'z parent'idan kontentni qo'shishi yoki "
"olib tashlashi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:556
msgid ""
"An extension view references its parent using the ``inherit_id`` field, and "
"instead of a single view its ``arch`` field is composed of any number of "
"``xpath`` elements selecting and altering the content of their parent view:"
msgstr ""
"Extension view o'z parent'iga ``inherit_id`` field'i orqali murojaat qiladi "
"va uning ``arch`` field'i bitta view o'rniga parent view kontentini tanlab "
"o'zgartiradigan har qanday sondagi ``xpath`` elementlaridan tashkil topadi:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:577
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/12_inheritance.rst:202
msgid "``expr``"
msgstr "``expr``"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:577
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/12_inheritance.rst:202
msgid ""
"An XPath_ expression selecting a single element in the parent view. Raises "
