msgstr ""
"``xpath``ning tanasidagi maxsus ``attribute`` elementlaridan foydalanib mos "
"kelgan elementning attribute'larini o'zgartiradi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:596
msgid ""
"When matching a single element, the ``position`` attribute can be set "
