msgstr ""
"View inheritance'dan foydalanib, bu field'larni partner form view'ida "
"ko'rsating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:620
msgid ""
"In Odoo, :ref:`reference/orm/domains` are values that encode conditions on "
"records. A domain is a  list of criteria used to select a subset of a "
"model's records. Each criteria is a triple with a field name, an operator "
"and a value."
msgstr ""
"Odoo'da :ref:`reference/orm/domains` — record'lar bo'yicha shartlarni "
"kodlaydigan qiymatlardir. Domain — model record'larining bir qismini tanlash "
"uchun ishlatiladigan mezonlar ro'yxati. Har bir mezon field nomi, operator "
"va qiymatdan tashkil topgan uchlikdir."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:624
msgid ""
"For instance, when used on the *Product* model the following domain selects "
"all *services* with a unit price over *1000*::"
msgstr ""
"Masalan, *Product* model'ida ishlatilganda quyidagi domain birlik narxi "
"*1000* dan yuqori bo'lgan barcha *services*'ni tanlaydi::"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:629
msgid ""
"By default criteria are combined with an implicit AND. The logical operators "
"``&`` (AND), ``|`` (OR) and ``!`` (NOT) can be used to explicitly combine "
"criteria. They are used in prefix position (the operator is inserted before "
"its arguments rather than between). For instance to select products \"which "
"are services *OR* have a unit price which is *NOT* between 1000 and 2000\"::"
msgstr ""
"Sukut bo'yicha mezonlar yashirin AND bilan birlashtiriladi. Mezonlarni aniq "
"birlashtirish uchun ``&`` (AND), ``|`` (OR) va ``!`` (NOT) mantiqiy "
"operatorlaridan foydalanish mumkin. Ular prefiks holatida ishlatiladi "
"(operator argumentlar orasiga emas, ulardan oldin qo'yiladi). Masalan, "
"\"service bo'lgan *OR* birlik narxi 1000 va 2000 orasida *NOT* bo'lgan\" "
"mahsulotlarni tanlash uchun::"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:641
msgid ""
"A ``domain`` parameter can be added to relational fields to limit valid "
"records for the relation when trying to select records in the client "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"Client interface'da record'larni tanlashda relation uchun yaroqli "
"record'larni cheklash uchun relational field'larga ``domain`` parametri "
"qo'shilishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:644
msgid "Domains on relational fields"
msgstr "Relational field'larda domain'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:646
msgid ""
"When selecting the instructor for a *Session*, only instructors (partners "
"with ``instructor`` set to ``True``) should be visible."
msgstr ""
"*Session* uchun instructor tanlanganda faqat instructor'lar (``instructor`` "
"qiymati ``True`` bo'lgan partner'lar) ko'rinishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:649
msgid "More complex domains"
msgstr "Murakkabroq domain'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:651
msgid ""
"Create new partner categories *Teacher / Level 1* and *Teacher / Level 2*. "
"The instructor for a session can be either an instructor or a teacher (of "
"any level)."
msgstr ""
"*Teacher / Level 1* va *Teacher / Level 2* yangi partner kategoriyalarini "
"yarating. Session uchun instructor yoki instructor, yoki (har qanday "
"darajadagi) teacher bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:656
msgid "Computed fields and default values"
msgstr "Computed field'lar va default qiymatlar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:658
msgid ""
"So far fields have been stored directly in and retrieved directly from the "
"database. Fields can also be *computed*. In that case, the field's value is "
"not retrieved from the database but computed on-the-fly by calling a method "
"of the model."
msgstr ""
"Hozirgacha field'lar to'g'ridan-to'g'ri ma'lumotlar bazasida saqlanib, undan "
"olinardi. Field'lar *computed* ham bo'lishi mumkin. Bu holda field qiymati "
"ma'lumotlar bazasidan olinmaydi, balki model'ning method'ini chaqirish "
"orqali darhol hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:663
msgid ""
"To create a computed field, create a field and set its "
"attribute :attr:`~odoo.fields.Field.compute` to the name of a method. The "
"computation method should simply set the value of the field to compute on "
"every record in ``self``."
msgstr ""
"Computed field yaratish uchun field yarating va "
"uning :attr:`~odoo.fields.Field.compute` attribute'ini method nomiga "
"tenglashtiring. Hisoblash method'i shunchaki ``self`` ichidagi har bir "
"record uchun hisoblanadigan field qiymatini belgilashi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:668
msgid "``self`` is a collection"
msgstr "``self`` — bu collection"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:671
msgid ""
"The object ``self`` is a *recordset*, i.e., an ordered collection of "
"records. It supports the standard Python operations on collections, like "
"``len(self)`` and ``iter(self)``, plus extra set operations like ``recs1 + "
"recs2``."
msgstr ""
"``self`` obyekti — bu *recordset*, ya'ni record'larning tartiblangan "
"collection'i. U collection'lar ustidagi standart Python amallarini, masalan "
"``len(self)`` va ``iter(self)``, hamda ``recs1 + recs2`` kabi qo'shimcha "
"to'plam amallarini qo'llab-quvvatlaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:675
msgid ""
"Iterating over ``self`` gives the records one by one, where each record is "
"itself a collection of size 1. You can access/assign fields on single "
"records by using the dot notation, like ``record.name``."
msgstr ""
"``self`` bo'yicha iteratsiya record'larni birma-bir beradi, bunda har bir "
"record o'zi hajmi 1 bo'lgan collection hisoblanadi. Bitta record'lardagi "
"field'larga ``record.name`` kabi nuqta notatsiyasi orqali murojaat qilish / "
"qiymat berish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:695
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/08_compute_onchange.rst:57
msgid "Dependencies"
msgstr "Dependency'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:697
msgid ""
"The value of a computed field usually depends on the values of other fields "
"on the computed record. The ORM expects the developer to specify those "
"dependencies on the compute method with the "
"decorator :func:`~odoo.api.depends`. The given dependencies are used by the "
"ORM to trigger the recomputation of the field whenever some of its "
"dependencies have been modified::"
msgstr ""
"Computed field qiymati odatda hisoblanadigan record'dagi boshqa field'lar "
"qiymatlariga bog'liq bo'ladi. ORM dasturchidan bu dependency'larni compute "
"method'ida :func:`~odoo.api.depends` decorator'i bilan ko'rsatishni kutadi. "
"Berilgan dependency'lar ORM tomonidan, dependency'laridan biri o'zgargan har "
"safar field'ni qayta hisoblashni ishga tushirish uchun ishlatiladi::"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:718
msgid "Add the percentage of taken seats to the *Session* model"
msgstr "*Session* model'iga egallangan joylar foizini qo'shing"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:719
msgid "Display that field in the list and form views"
msgstr "Bu field'ni list va form view'larida ko'rsating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:720
msgid "Display the field as a progress bar"
msgstr "Field'ni progress bar sifatida ko'rsating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:723
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/importable_modules.rst:249
msgid "Default values"
msgstr "Default qiymatlar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:725
msgid ""
"Any field can be given a default value. In the field definition, add the "
"option ``default=X`` where ``X`` is either a Python literal value (boolean, "
"integer, float, string), or a function taking a recordset and returning a "
"value::"
msgstr ""
"Har qanday field'ga default qiymat berilishi mumkin. Field ta'rifida "
"``default=X`` opsiyasini qo'shing, bunda ``X`` — yoki Python literal qiymati "
"(boolean, integer, float, string), yoki recordset qabul qilib qiymat "
"qaytaruvchi funksiya::"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:733
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:113
msgid ""
"The object ``self.env`` gives access to request parameters and other useful "
"things:"
msgstr ""
"``self.env`` obyekti request parametrlariga va boshqa foydali narsalarga "
"kirish imkonini beradi:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:735
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:116
msgid ""
"``self.env.cr`` or ``self._cr`` is the database *cursor* object; it is used "
"for querying the database"
msgstr ""
"``self.env.cr`` yoki ``self._cr`` — ma'lumotlar bazasi *cursor* obyekti; u "
"ma'lumotlar bazasiga so'rov yuborish uchun ishlatiladi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:737
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:118
msgid "``self.env.uid`` or ``self._uid`` is the current user's database id"
msgstr ""
"``self.env.uid`` yoki ``self._uid`` — joriy foydalanuvchining ma'lumotlar "
"bazasidagi id'si"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:738
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:119
msgid "``self.env.user`` is the current user's record"
msgstr "``self.env.user`` — joriy foydalanuvchining record'i"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:739
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:120
msgid "``self.env.context`` or ``self._context`` is the context dictionary"
msgstr "``self.env.context`` yoki ``self._context`` — context dictionary'si"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:740
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:121
msgid "``self.env.ref(xml_id)`` returns the record corresponding to an XML id"
msgstr "``self.env.ref(xml_id)`` XML id'ga mos keladigan record'ni qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:741
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/07_relations.rst:122
msgid "``self.env[model_name]`` returns an instance of the given model"
msgstr "``self.env[model_name]`` berilgan model'ning instance'ini qaytaradi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:743
msgid "Active objects – Default values"
msgstr "Active object'lar – Standart qiymatlar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:745
msgid ""
"Define the start_date default value as today "
"(see :class:`~odoo.fields.Date`)."
msgstr ""
"start_date uchun standart qiymatni bugungi sana qilib aniqlang "
"(:class:`~odoo.fields.Date` ga qarang)."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:747
msgid ""
"Add a field ``active`` in the class Session, and set sessions as active by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Session class'iga ``active`` field'ini qo'shing va session'larni standart "
"bo'yicha active qilib belgilang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:751
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/08_compute_onchange.rst:0
msgid "Onchange"
msgstr "Onchange"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:753
msgid ""
"The \"onchange\" mechanism provides a way for the client interface to update "
"a form whenever the user has filled in a value in a field, without saving "
"anything to the database."
msgstr ""
"\"onchange\" mexanizmi client interface'ga foydalanuvchi field'ga qiymat "
"kiritgan zahoti ma'lumotlar bazasiga hech narsa saqlamasdan form'ni "
"yangilash imkonini beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:757
msgid ""
"For instance, suppose a model has three fields ``amount``, ``unit_price`` "
"and ``price``, and you want to update the price on the form when any of the "
"other fields is modified. To achieve this, define a method where ``self`` "
"represents the record in the form view, and decorate it "
"with :func:`~odoo.api.onchange` to specify on which field it has to be "
"triggered. Any change you make on ``self`` will be reflected on the form."
msgstr ""
"Masalan, model'da ``amount``, ``unit_price`` va ``price`` degan uchta field "
"bor deb tasavvur qiling va boshqa field'lardan biri o'zgartirilganda "
"form'dagi price'ni yangilamoqchisiz. Buning uchun ``self`` form view'dagi "
"record'ni ifodalaydigan method aniqlang va u qaysi field'da ishga tushishini "
"ko'rsatish uchun uni :func:`~odoo.api.onchange` bilan decorate qiling. "
"``self`` ustida qilgan har qanday o'zgarishingiz form'da aks etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:786
msgid ""
"For computed fields, valued ``onchange`` behavior is built-in as can be seen "
"by playing with the *Session* form: change the number of seats or "
"participants, and the ``taken_seats`` progressbar is automatically updated."
msgstr ""
"Computed field'lar uchun ``onchange`` xatti-harakati o'rnatilgan holda "
"keladi; buni *Session* form'i bilan ishlab ko'rish orqali kuzatish mumkin: "
"o'rindiqlar yoki qatnashchilar sonini o'zgartirsangiz, ``taken_seats`` "
"progressbar avtomatik yangilanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:790
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Ogohlantirish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:792
msgid ""
"Add an explicit onchange to warn about invalid values, like a negative "
"number of seats, or more participants than seats."
msgstr ""
"Noto'g'ri qiymatlar haqida ogohlantirish uchun aniq onchange qo'shing, "
"masalan o'rindiqlarning manfiy soni yoki o'rindiqlardan ko'p qatnashchi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:796
msgid "Model constraints"
msgstr "Model constraint'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:798
msgid ""
"Odoo provides two ways to set up automatically verified "
"invariants: :func:`Python constraints <odoo.api.constrains>` and :attr:`SQL "
"constraints <odoo.models.Constraint>`. In a similar way, you can add more "
