"ikkisi bo'yicha qidirish uchun ishlatilgan."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:929
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/06_basicviews.rst:185
msgid ""
"Search views can also contain ``<filter>`` elements, which act as toggles "
