#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1065
msgid ""
"Access control mechanisms must be configured to achieve a coherent security "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"Izchil xavfsizlik siyosatiga erishish uchun kirish huquqlarini nazorat "
"qilish mexanizmlari sozlanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1069
msgid "Group-based access control mechanisms"
msgstr "Guruhlarga asoslangan kirish nazorati mexanizmlari"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1071
msgid ""
"Groups are created as normal records on the model ``res.groups``, and "
"granted menu access via menu definitions. However even without a menu, "
"objects may still be accessible indirectly, so actual object-level "
"permissions (read, write, create, unlink) must be defined for groups. They "
"are usually inserted via CSV files inside modules. It is also possible to "
"restrict access to specific fields on a view or object using the field's "
"groups attribute."
msgstr ""
"Guruhlar ``res.groups`` model'ida oddiy record'lar sifatida yaratiladi va "
"menyu ta'riflari orqali menyuga kirish huquqi beriladi. Biroq menyu "
"bo'lmaganda ham obyektlarga bilvosita murojaat qilish mumkin, shu sababli "
"guruhlar uchun obyekt darajasidagi haqiqiy huquqlar (read, write, create, "
"unlink) aniqlanishi shart. Ular odatda modul ichidagi CSV fayllar orqali "
"kiritiladi. Shuningdek, field'ning groups atributidan foydalanib view yoki "
"obyektdagi muayyan field'larga kirishni cheklash ham mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1079
msgid "Access rights"
msgstr "Kirish huquqlari (access rights)"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1081
msgid ""
"Access rights are defined as records of the model ``ir.model.access``. Each "
"access right is associated to a model, a group (or no group for global "
"access), and a set of permissions: read, write, create, unlink. Such access "
"rights are usually created by a CSV file named after its model: "
"``ir.model.access.csv``."
msgstr ""
"Access right'lar ``ir.model.access`` model'ining record'lari sifatida "
"aniqlanadi. Har bir access right bitta model, bitta guruh (global kirish "
"uchun guruh ko'rsatilmaydi) va huquqlar to'plami: read, write, create, "
"unlink bilan bog'lanadi. Bunday access right'lar odatda o'z model'i nomi "
"bilan nomlangan CSV fayl orqali yaratiladi: ``ir.model.access.csv``."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1093
msgid "Add access control through the Odoo interface"
msgstr "Odoo interfeysi orqali kirish nazoratini qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1095
msgid ""
"Create a new user \"John Smith\". Then create a group \"OpenAcademy / "
"Session Read\" with read access to the *Session* model."
msgstr ""
"\"John Smith\" nomli yangi foydalanuvchi yarating. So'ngra *Session* "
"model'iga read huquqi bo'lgan \"OpenAcademy / Session Read\" guruhini "
"yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1098
msgid "Add access control through data files in your module"
msgstr "Modulingizdagi data fayllar orqali kirish nazoratini qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1100
msgid "Using data files,"
msgstr "Data fayllardan foydalanib,"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1102
msgid ""
"Create a group *OpenAcademy / Manager* with full access to all OpenAcademy "
"models"
msgstr ""
"Barcha OpenAcademy model'lariga to'liq kirish huquqi bo'lgan *OpenAcademy / "
"Manager* guruhini yarating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1104
msgid "Make *Session* and *Course* readable by all users"
msgstr ""
"*Session* va *Course* barcha foydalanuvchilar uchun o'qish mumkin bo'lsin"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1107
msgid "Record rules"
msgstr "Record rule'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1109
msgid ""
"A record rule restricts the access rights to a subset of records of the "
"given model. A rule is a record of the model ``ir.rule``, and is associated "
"to a model, a number of groups (many2many field), permissions to which the "
"restriction applies, and a domain. The domain specifies to which records the "
"access rights are limited."
msgstr ""
"Record rule kirish huquqlarini berilgan model'ning record'lari qism "
"to'plamiga cheklaydi. Rule — bu ``ir.rule`` model'ining record'i bo'lib, u "
"bitta model, bir qancha guruh (many2many field), cheklov qo'llaniladigan "
"huquqlar va domain bilan bog'lanadi. Domain kirish huquqlari qaysi "
"record'lar bilan cheklanganini belgilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1115
msgid ""
"Here is an example of a rule that prevents the deletion of leads that are "
"not in state ``cancel``. Notice that the value of the field ``groups`` must "
"follow the same convention as the method :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.write` of "
"the ORM."
msgstr ""
"Quyida ``cancel`` holatida bo'lmagan lead'larni o'chirishga to'sqinlik "
"qiluvchi rule misoli keltirilgan. E'tibor bering, ``groups`` field'ining "
"qiymati ORM'ning :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.write` method'i bilan bir xil "
"qoidaga amal qilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1132
msgid "Record rule"
msgstr "Record rule"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1134
msgid ""
"Add a record rule for the model Course and the group \"OpenAcademy / "
"Manager\", that restricts ``write`` and ``unlink`` accesses to the "
"responsible of a course. If a course has no responsible, all users of the "
"group must be able to modify it."
msgstr ""
"Course model'i va \"OpenAcademy / Manager\" guruhi uchun record rule "
"qo'shing: u ``write`` va ``unlink`` huquqlarini kursning mas'ul shaxsi bilan "
"cheklasin. Agar kursda mas'ul shaxs bo'lmasa, guruhning barcha "
"foydalanuvchilari uni o'zgartira olishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1142
msgid "Wizards"
msgstr "Wizard'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1144
msgid ""
"Wizards describe interactive sessions with the user (or dialog boxes) "
"through dynamic forms. A wizard is simply a model that extends the "
"class :class:`~odoo.models.TransientModel` instead "
"of :class:`~odoo.models.Model`. The "
"class :class:`~odoo.models.TransientModel` "
"extends :class:`~odoo.models.Model` and reuse all its existing mechanisms, "
"with the following particularities:"
msgstr ""
"Wizard'lar dinamik form'lar orqali foydalanuvchi bilan interaktiv "
"session'larni (yoki dialog oynalarini) tasvirlaydi. Wizard — bu "
"shunchaki :class:`~odoo.models.Model` "
"o'rniga :class:`~odoo.models.TransientModel` class'ini kengaytiruvchi "
"model. :class:`~odoo.models.TransientModel` "
"class'i :class:`~odoo.models.Model` ni kengaytiradi va uning barcha mavjud "
"mexanizmlaridan qayta foydalanadi, quyidagi xususiyatlar bilan:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1151
msgid ""
"Wizard records are not meant to be persistent; they are automatically "
"deleted from the database after a certain time. This is why they are called "
"*transient*."
msgstr ""
"Wizard record'lari doimiy saqlanish uchun mo'ljallanmagan; ular ma'lum vaqt "
"o'tgach ma'lumotlar bazasidan avtomatik o'chiriladi. Shu sababli ular "
"*transient* deb ataladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1154
msgid ""
"Wizard records may refer to regular records or wizard records through "
"relational fields(many2one or many2many), but regular records *cannot* refer "
"to wizard records through a many2one field."
msgstr ""
"Wizard record'lari relational field'lar (many2one yoki many2many) orqali "
"oddiy record'larga yoki wizard record'lariga murojaat qilishi mumkin, biroq "
"oddiy record'lar many2one field orqali wizard record'lariga murojaat qila "
"*olmaydi*."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1158
msgid ""
"We want to create a wizard that allow users to create attendees for a "
"particular session, or for a list of sessions at once."
msgstr ""
"Biz foydalanuvchilarga muayyan session uchun yoki bir vaqtning o'zida "
"session'lar ro'yxati uchun qatnashuvchilar yaratish imkonini beruvchi wizard "
"tuzmoqchimiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1161
msgid "Define the wizard"
msgstr "Wizard'ni aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1163
msgid ""
"Create a wizard model with a many2one relationship with the *Session* model "
"and a many2many relationship with the *Partner* model."
msgstr ""
"*Session* model'i bilan many2one va *Partner* model'i bilan many2many "
"aloqasi bo'lgan wizard model yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1167
msgid "Launching wizards"
msgstr "Wizard'larni ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1169
msgid ""
"Wizards are simply :ref:`window actions <howtos/module/actions>` with a "
"``target`` field set to the value ``new``, which opens the view "
"(usually :ref:`a form <howtos/module/views/form>`) in a separate dialog. The "
"action may be triggered via a menu item, but is more generally triggered by "
"a button."
msgstr ""
"Wizard'lar — bu shunchaki ``target`` field'i ``new`` qiymatiga "
"o'rnatilgan :ref:`window action'lar <howtos/module/actions>` bo'lib, ular "
"view'ni (odatda :ref:`form <howtos/module/views/form>`) alohida dialog "
"oynasida ochadi. Action menyu elementi orqali ishga tushirilishi mumkin, "
"ammo ko'proq tugma orqali chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1175
msgid ""
"An other way to launch wizards is through the :menuselection:`Action` menu "
"of a list or form view. This is done through the ``binding_model_id`` field "
"of the action. Setting this field will make the action appear on the views "
"of the model the action is \"bound\" to."
msgstr ""
"Wizard'larni ishga tushirishning boshqa usuli — list yoki form "
"view'ning :menuselection:`Action` menyusi orqali. Bu action'ning "
"``binding_model_id`` field'i yordamida amalga oshiriladi. Bu field'ni "
"o'rnatish action'ning u \"bog'langan\" model view'larida paydo bo'lishiga "
"olib keladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1191
msgid ""
"While wizards use regular views and buttons, normally clicking any button in "
"a form would first save the form then close the dialog. Because this is "
"often undesirable in wizards, a special attribute ``special=\"cancel\"`` is "
"available which immediately closes the wizard without saving the form."
msgstr ""
"Wizard'lar oddiy view va tugmalardan foydalansa-da, odatda form'dagi biror "
"tugmani bosish avval form'ni saqlaydi, keyin dialogni yopadi. Bu "
"wizard'larda ko'pincha keraksiz bo'lgani uchun ``special=\"cancel\"`` maxsus "
"atributi mavjud: u form'ni saqlamasdan wizard'ni darhol yopadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1196
msgid "Launch the wizard"
msgstr "Wizard'ni ishga tushirish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1198
msgid "Define a form view for the wizard."
msgstr "Wizard uchun form view aniqlang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1199
msgid "Add the action to launch it in the context of the *Session* model."
msgstr "Uni *Session* model'i context'ida ishga tushiruvchi action qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1200
msgid ""
"Define a default value for the session field in the wizard; use the context "
"parameter ``self._context`` to retrieve the current session."
msgstr ""
"Wizard'dagi session field uchun standart qiymat aniqlang; joriy session'ni "
"olish uchun ``self._context`` context parametridan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1203
msgid "Register attendees"
msgstr "Qatnashuvchilarni ro'yxatga olish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1205
msgid ""
"Add buttons to the wizard, and implement the corresponding method for adding "
"the attendees to the given session."
msgstr ""
"Wizard'ga tugmalar qo'shing va berilgan session'ga qatnashuvchilarni "
"qo'shish uchun mos method'ni amalga oshiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1208
msgid "Register attendees to multiple sessions"
msgstr "Qatnashuvchilarni bir nechta session'ga ro'yxatga olish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1210
msgid ""
"Modify the wizard model so that attendees can be registered to multiple "
"sessions."
msgstr ""
"Wizard model'ini shunday o'zgartiring-ki, qatnashuvchilarni bir nechta "
"session'ga ro'yxatga olish mumkin bo'lsin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1214
msgid "Internationalization"
msgstr "Xalqarolashtirish (internationalization)"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1216
msgid ""
"Each module can provide its own translations within the i18n directory, by "
"having files named LANG.po where LANG is the locale code for the language, "
"or the language and country combination when they differ (e.g. pt.po or "
"pt_BR.po). Translations will be loaded automatically by Odoo for all enabled "
"languages. Developers always use English when creating a module, then export "
"the module terms using Odoo's gettext POT export feature "
"(:menuselection:`Settings --> Translations --> Import/Export --> Export "
"Translation` without specifying a language), to create the module template "
"POT file, and then derive the translated PO files. Many IDE's have plugins "
"or modes for editing and merging PO/POT files."
msgstr ""
"Har bir modul o'z tarjimalarini i18n papkasida, LANG.po deb nomlangan "
"fayllar shaklida taqdim etishi mumkin, bunda LANG — til uchun locale kodi "
"yoki ular farq qilganda til va davlat birikmasi (masalan pt.po yoki "
"pt_BR.po). Tarjimalar Odoo tomonidan yoqilgan barcha tillar uchun avtomatik "
"yuklanadi. Dasturchilar modul yaratishda doim ingliz tilidan foydalanadi, "
"so'ngra modul atamalarini Odoo'ning gettext POT eksport imkoniyati orqali "
"eksport qiladi (:menuselection:`Settings --> Translations --> Import/Export "
"--> Export Translation`, tilni ko'rsatmasdan) va shu yo'l bilan modulning "
"shablon POT faylini yaratadi, keyin undan tarjima qilingan PO fayllarni "
"hosil qiladi. Ko'p IDE'larda PO/POT fayllarni tahrirlash va birlashtirish "
"uchun plagin yoki maxsus rejimlar mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1228
msgid ""
"The Portable Object files generated by Odoo are published on `Odoo's "
"Translations Platform <https://translate.odoo.com/>`_, making it easy to "
"translate the software."
msgstr ""
"Odoo tomonidan generatsiya qilingan Portable Object fayllar `Odoo's "
"Translations Platform <https://translate.odoo.com/>`_ da e'lon qilinadi, bu "
"esa dasturni tarjima qilishni osonlashtiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1241
msgid ""
"By default Odoo's POT export only extracts labels inside XML files or inside "
"field definitions in Python code, but any Python string can be translated "
"this way by surrounding it with the function :func:`odoo._` (e.g. "
"``_(\"Label\")``)"
msgstr ""
"Standart holatda Odoo'ning POT eksporti faqat XML fayllar ichidagi yoki "
"Python koddagi field ta'riflari ichidagi yorliqlarni ajratib oladi, biroq "
"istalgan Python satrini :func:`odoo._` funksiyasi bilan o'rab shu yo'sinda "
"tarjima qilish mumkin (masalan ``_(\"Label\")``)"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1246
msgid "Translate a module"
msgstr "Modulni tarjima qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1248
msgid ""
"Choose a second language for your Odoo installation. Translate your module "
"using the facilities provided by Odoo."
msgstr ""
"Odoo o'rnatmangiz uchun ikkinchi tilni tanlang. Odoo taqdim etgan vositalar "
"yordamida modulingizni tarjima qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1252
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "Hisobot berish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1255
msgid "Printed reports"
msgstr "Chop etiladigan hisobotlar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1257
msgid ""
"Odoo uses a report engine based on :ref:`reference/qweb`, `Twitter "
"Bootstrap`_ and Wkhtmltopdf_."
msgstr ""
"Odoo :ref:`reference/qweb`, `Twitter Bootstrap`_ va Wkhtmltopdf_ ga "
"asoslangan hisobot engine'idan foydalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1260
msgid "A report is a combination two elements:"
msgstr "Hisobot ikki elementning birlashmasidan iborat:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1262
msgid ""
"an ``ir.actions.report`` which configures various basic parameters for the "
"report (default type, whether the report should be saved to the database "
"after generation,…)"
msgstr ""
"``ir.actions.report`` — hisobot uchun turli asosiy parametrlarni sozlaydi "
"(standart tur, hisobot yaratilgandan keyin ma'lumotlar bazasiga saqlanishi "
"kerakmi,…)"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1283
msgid ""
"Because it largerly a standard action, as with :ref:`howto/module/wizard` it "
"is generally useful to add the report as a *contextual item* on the list "
"and / or form views of the model being reported on via the "
"``binding_model_id`` field."
msgstr ""
"Bu asosan standart action bo'lgani uchun, :ref:`howto/module/wizard` "
"dagidek, hisobotni ``binding_model_id`` field'i orqali hisobot olinadigan "
"model'ning list va/yoki form view'lariga *contextual item* sifatida qo'shish "
"odatda foydali bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1288
msgid ""
"Here we are also using ``binding_type`` in order for the report to be in the "
"*report* contextual menu rather than the *action* one. There is no technical "
"difference but putting elements in the right place helps users."
msgstr ""
"Bu yerda biz ``binding_type`` dan ham foydalanamiz — shunda hisobot *action* "
"contextual menyusida emas, *report* menyusida ko'rinadi. Texnik jihatdan "
"farqi yo'q, biroq elementlarni to'g'ri joyga qo'yish foydalanuvchilarga "
"yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1292
msgid ""
"A standard :ref:`QWeb view <reference/view_architectures/qweb>` for the "
"actual report:"
msgstr ""
"Hisobotning o'zi uchun standart :ref:`QWeb view <reference/"
"view_architectures/qweb>`:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1306
msgid ""
"the standard rendering context provides a number of elements, the most "
"important being:"
msgstr ""
"standart rendering context bir qancha elementlarni taqdim etadi, ulardan eng "
"muhimlari:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1310
msgid "the records for which the report is printed"
msgstr "hisobot chop etiladigan record'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1312
msgid "the user printing the report"
msgstr "hisobotni chop etayotgan foydalanuvchi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1314
msgid ""
"Because reports are standard web pages, they are available through a URL and "
"output parameters can be manipulated through this URL, for instance the HTML "
"version of the *Invoice* report is available through http://localhost:8069/"
"report/html/account.report_invoice/1 (if ``account`` is installed) and the "
"PDF version through http://localhost:8069/report/pdf/account.report_invoice/"
"1."
msgstr ""
"Hisobotlar oddiy web sahifalar bo'lgani uchun ular URL orqali mavjud bo'ladi "
"va chiqish parametrlarini shu URL orqali boshqarish mumkin. Masalan, "
"*Invoice* hisobotining HTML versiyasi http://localhost:8069/report/html/"
"account.report_invoice/1 manzilida (agar ``account`` o'rnatilgan bo'lsa), "
"PDF versiyasi esa http://localhost:8069/report/pdf/account.report_invoice/1 "
"manzilida mavjud."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1325
msgid ""
"If it appears that your PDF report is missing the styles (i.e. the text "
"appears but the style/layout is different from the html version), probably "
"your wkhtmltopdf_ process cannot reach your web server to download them."
msgstr ""
"Agar PDF hisobotingizda stillar yo'qday ko'rinsa (ya'ni matn chiqadi, lekin "
"stil/tuzilish html versiyadan farq qiladi), ehtimol wkhtmltopdf_ process'i "
"ularni yuklab olish uchun web server'ingizga ulanolmayapti."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1329
msgid ""
"If you check your server logs and see that the CSS styles are not being "
"downloaded when generating a PDF report, most surely this is the problem."
msgstr ""
"Agar server log'larini ko'rib, PDF hisobot yaratilayotganda CSS stillari "
"yuklanmayotganini aniqlasangiz, muammo aynan shunda."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1332
msgid ""
"The wkhtmltopdf_ process will use the ``web.base.url`` system parameter as "
"the *root path* to all linked files, but this parameter is automatically "
"updated each time the Administrator is logged in. If your server resides "
"behind some kind of proxy, that could not be reachable. You can fix this by "
"adding one of these system parameters:"
msgstr ""
"wkhtmltopdf_ process'i barcha bog'langan fayllarga *root path* sifatida "
"``web.base.url`` tizim parametridan foydalanadi, biroq bu parametr "
"Administrator har marta tizimga kirganda avtomatik yangilanadi. Agar "
"server'ingiz qanday bo'lmasin proxy orqasida joylashgan bo'lsa, u manzil "
"ochilmasligi mumkin. Buni quyidagi tizim parametrlaridan birini qo'shib "
"tuzatishingiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1338
msgid ""
"``report.url``, pointing to an URL reachable from your server (probably "
"``http://localhost:8069`` or something similar). It will be used for this "
"particular purpose only."
msgstr ""
"``report.url`` — server'ingizdan ochiladigan URL manzilga ishora qiladi "
"(ehtimol ``http://localhost:8069`` yoki shunga o'xshash). U faqat shu maqsad "
"uchun ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1342
msgid ""
"``web.base.url.freeze``, when set to ``True``, will stop the automatic "
"updates to ``web.base.url``."
msgstr ""
"``web.base.url.freeze`` — ``True`` qilib belgilansa, ``web.base.url`` ning "
"avtomatik yangilanishini to'xtatadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1345
msgid "Create a report for the Session model"
msgstr "Session model'i uchun hisobot yarating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1347
msgid ""
"For each session, it should display session's name, its start and end, and "
"list the session's attendees."
msgstr ""
"Har bir session uchun uning nomi, boshlanish va tugash vaqti ko'rsatilishi "
"hamda session qatnashchilari ro'yxati chiqarilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1351
msgid "Dashboards"
msgstr "Dashboard'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1353
msgid "Define a Dashboard"
msgstr "Dashboard aniqlash"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1355
msgid ""
"Define a dashboard containing the graph view you created, the sessions "
"calendar view and a list view of the courses (switchable to a form view). "
"This dashboard should be available through a menuitem in the menu, and "
"automatically displayed in the web client when the OpenAcademy main menu is "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"Siz yaratgan graph view'ni, session'lar calendar view'ini va kurslarning "
"list view'ini (form view'ga o'tish imkoniyati bilan) o'z ichiga olgan "
"dashboard aniqlang. Bu dashboard menyudagi menuitem orqali mavjud bo'lishi "
"va OpenAcademy asosiy menyusi tanlanganda web client'da avtomatik "
"ko'rsatilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1361
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/03_basicmodel.rst:293
msgid ""
"it is possible to :ref:`disable the automatic creation of some fields "
"<reference/fields/automatic/log_access>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ba'zi field'larning avtomatik yaratilishini o'chirib qo'yish "
"<reference/fields/automatic/log_access>` mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/backend.rst:1363
msgid ""
"writing raw SQL queries is possible, but requires care as it bypasses all "
"Odoo authentication and security mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri SQL so'rovlar yozish mumkin, biroq bu Odoo'ning barcha "
"autentifikatsiya va xavfsizlik mexanizmlarini chetlab o'tgani uchun ehtiyot "
"bo'lish talab etiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:6
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/pdf_reports.rst:6
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:6
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/unit_tests.rst:6
msgid ""
"This tutorial is an extension of the :doc:`server_framework_101` tutorial. "
"Make sure you have completed it and use the `estate` module you have built "
"as a base for the exercises in this tutorial."
msgstr ""
"Bu qo'llanma :doc:`server_framework_101` qo'llanmasining davomi. Uni "
"tugatganingizga ishonch hosil qiling va o'zingiz qurgan `estate` modulini "
"ushbu qo'llanmadagi mashqlar uchun asos qilib oling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:11
msgid "Data Types"
msgstr "Ma'lumot turlari"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:14
msgid "Master Data"
msgstr "Master data"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:16
msgid ""
"Master data is usually part of the technical or business requirements for "
"the module. In other words, such data is often necessary for the module to "
"work properly. This data will always be installed when installing the module."
msgstr ""
"Master data odatda modulning texnik yoki biznes talablarining bir qismi "
"bo'ladi. Boshqacha aytganda, bunday ma'lumot modul to'g'ri ishlashi uchun "
"ko'pincha zarur. Bu ma'lumot modul o'rnatilganda har doim o'rnatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:20
msgid ""
"We already met technical data previously since we have defined :doc:`views "
"<../reference/user_interface/view_records>` and :doc:`actions <../reference/"
"backend/actions>`. Those are one kind of master data."
msgstr ""
"Biz texnik ma'lumot bilan avval ham tanishganmiz, chunki :doc:`view'lar <../"
"reference/user_interface/view_records>` va :doc:`action'lar <../reference/"
"backend/actions>` ni aniqlaganmiz. Ular master data'ning bir turi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:24
msgid ""
"On top of technical data, business data can be defined, e.g. countries, "
"currencies, units of measure, as well as complete country localization "
"(legal reports, tax definitions, chart of account), and much more..."
msgstr ""
"Texnik ma'lumotdan tashqari biznes ma'lumotini ham aniqlash mumkin, masalan "
"davlatlar, valyutalar, o'lchov birliklari, shuningdek to'liq davlat "
"lokalizatsiyasi (rasmiy hisobotlar, soliq ta'riflari, hisoblar rejasi) va "
"boshqa ko'p narsalar..."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:32
msgid "Demo Data"
msgstr "Demo data"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:34
msgid ""
"In addition to master data, which is required for a module to work properly, "
"we can also provide data for demonstration purposes:"
msgstr ""
"Modul to'g'ri ishlashi uchun zarur bo'lgan master data'dan tashqari, biz "
"namoyish maqsadida ham ma'lumot taqdim etishimiz mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:36
msgid "Help the sales representatives make their demos quickly."
msgstr "Savdo vakillariga namoyishlarini tez o'tkazishga yordam beradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:37
msgid ""
"Have a set of working data for developers to test new features and see how "
"these new features look with data they might not have added themselves."
msgstr ""
"Dasturchilar yangi funksiyalarni sinab ko'rishi va bu funksiyalar o'zlari "
"kiritmagan ma'lumotlar bilan qanday ko'rinishini bilishi uchun ishlaydigan "
"ma'lumotlar to'plami bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:39
msgid "Test that the data is loaded correctly, without raising an error."
msgstr "Ma'lumot xatosiz, to'g'ri yuklanayotganini tekshiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:40
msgid ""
"Setup most of the features to be used quickly when creating a new database."
msgstr ""
"Yangi ma'lumotlar bazasi yaratilganda funksiyalarning ko'pini tezda "
"ishlatishga sozlab beradi."

