"Ma'lumot CSV yoki XML formatida e'lon qilinadi. Ma'lumot saqlanadigan har "
"bir fayl yuklanishi uchun manifest'ga qo'shilishi shart."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:73
msgid ""
"The keys to use in the manifest to add new data are ``data`` for the master "
"data and ``demo`` for the demo data. Both values should be a list of strings "
"representing the relative paths to the files declaring the data."
msgstr ""
"Yangi ma'lumot qo'shish uchun manifest'da ishlatiladigan kalitlar: master "
"data uchun ``data``, demo data uchun ``demo``. Ikkala qiymat ham ma'lumotni "
"e'lon qiluvchi fayllarga nisbiy yo'llarni ko'rsatuvchi satrlar ro'yxati "
"bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:77
msgid ""
"Usually, demo data is in a ``demo`` folder, views and actions are in a "
"``views`` folder, security related data is in a ``security`` folder, and "
"other data is in a ``data`` folder."
msgstr ""
"Odatda demo data ``demo`` papkasida, view'lar va action'lar ``views`` "
"papkasida, xavfsizlikka tegishli ma'lumot ``security`` papkasida, qolgan "
"ma'lumot esa ``data`` papkasida joylashadi."

