#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:193
msgid ""
"During the Core Training, we saw in "
"the :doc:`server_framework_101/12_inheritance` chapter we could inherit "
"(extend) an existing view. This was a special case of data extension: any "
"data can be extended in a module."
msgstr ""
"Core Training davomida :doc:`server_framework_101/12_inheritance` bobida "
"mavjud view'ni inherit qilish (kengaytirish) mumkinligini ko'rdik. Bu "
"ma'lumotlarni kengaytirishning maxsus holati edi: modulda har qanday "
"ma'lumotni kengaytirish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:197
msgid ""
"When you are adding new fields to an existing model in a new module, you "
"might want to populate those fields on the records created in the modules "
"you are depending on. This is done by giving the `xml_id` of the record you "
"want to extend. It won't replace it, in this case we will set the "
"``field_c`` to the given value for both records."
msgstr ""
"Yangi modulda mavjud model'ga yangi field'lar qo'shganingizda, siz bog'liq "
"bo'lgan modullarda yaratilgan record'larda ushbu field'larni to'ldirishni "
"xohlashingiz mumkin. Buning uchun kengaytirmoqchi bo'lgan record'ning "
"`xml_id` si ko'rsatiladi. Bu uni almashtirmaydi; bu holatda biz ikkala "
"record uchun ham ``field_c`` ni berilgan qiymatga o'rnatamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/define_module_data.rst:218
msgid ""
"Related fields can be set using the ``ref`` key. The value of that key is "
"the ``xml_id`` of the record you want to link. Remember the ``xml_id`` is "
"composed of the name of the module where the data is first declared, "
"followed by a dot, followed by the ``id`` of the record (just the ``id`` "
"works too if you are in the module declaring it)."
msgstr ""
"Related field'lar ``ref`` kaliti yordamida o'rnatiladi. Bu kalitning qiymati "
"siz bog'lamoqchi bo'lgan record'ning ``xml_id`` sidir. Esda tuting: "
"``xml_id`` ma'lumot birinchi bo'lib e'lon qilingan modul nomidan, undan "
"keyin nuqtadan, so'ngra record'ning ``id`` sidan tashkil topadi (agar siz "
"uni e'lon qilayotgan modul ichida bo'lsangiz, faqat ``id`` ham ishlaydi)."

