msgstr ""
"`Rasmiy Odoo tutorials repository'sini <https://github.com/odoo/tutorials>`_ "
"clone qiling va `19.0` branch'ga o'ting."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework.rst:40
#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/master_odoo_web_framework.rst:54
msgid ""
"Add the cloned repository to your :option:`--addons-path <odoo-bin --addons-"
"path>`."
msgstr ""
"Clone qilingan repository'ni :option:`--addons-path <odoo-bin --addons-"
"path>` ga qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework.rst:41
msgid ""
"Start a new Odoo database and install the modules `awesome_owl` (for chapter "
"1) and `awesome_dashboard` (for chapter 2)."
msgstr ""
"Yangi Odoo ma'lumotlar bazasini ishga tushiring va `awesome_owl` (1-bob "
"uchun) hamda `awesome_dashboard` (2-bob uchun) module'larini o'rnating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`discover_js_framework/01_owl_components`"
msgstr ":doc:`discover_js_framework/01_owl_components`"

