#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:3
msgid "Chapter 1: Owl components"
msgstr "1-bob: Owl component'lari"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:5
msgid ""
"This chapter introduces the `Owl framework <https://github.com/odoo/owl>`_, "
"a tailor-made component system for Odoo. The main building blocks of OWL are "
"`components <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"component.md>`_ and `templates <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/templates.md>`_."
msgstr ""
"Bu bob Odoo uchun maxsus yaratilgan component tizimi - `Owl framework "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl>`_ bilan tanishtiradi. OWL'ning asosiy qurilish "
"bloklari `component'lar <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/component.md>`_ va `template'lar <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md>`_ hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:9
msgid ""
"In Owl, every part of user interface is managed by a component: they hold "
"the logic and define the templates that are used to render the user "
"interface. In practice, a component is represented by a small JavaScript "
"class subclassing the `Component` class."
msgstr ""
"Owl'da foydalanuvchi interfeysining har bir qismi component tomonidan "
"boshqariladi: ular logikani saqlaydi va foydalanuvchi interfeysini render "
"qilish uchun ishlatiladigan template'larni aniqlaydi. Amalda component "
"`Component` class'idan meros oluvchi kichik JavaScript class bilan "
"ifodalanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:13
msgid ""
"To get started, you need a running Odoo server and a development environment "
"setup. Before getting into the exercises, make sure you have followed all "
"the steps described in this :ref:`tutorial introduction <tutorials/"
"discover_js_framework/setup>`."
msgstr ""
"Boshlash uchun sizga ishlab turgan Odoo server va sozlangan development "
"environment kerak bo'ladi. Mashqlarga o'tishdan oldin :ref:`qo'llanma "
"kirishida <tutorials/discover_js_framework/setup>` tavsiflangan barcha "
"qadamlarni bajarganingizga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:18
msgid ""
"If you use Chrome as your web browser, you can install the `Owl Devtools` "
"extension. This extension provides many features to help you understand and "
"profile any Owl application."
msgstr ""
"Agar web browser sifatida Chrome'dan foydalansangiz, `Owl Devtools` "
"extension'ini o'rnatishingiz mumkin. Bu extension har qanday Owl ilovasini "
"tushunish va profillashga yordam beradigan ko'plab imkoniyatlarni taqdim "
"etadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:21
msgid ""
"`Video: How to use the DevTools <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=IUyQjwnrpzM>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Video: DevTools'dan qanday foydalanish <https://www.youtube.com/watch?"
"v=IUyQjwnrpzM>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:23
msgid ""
"In this chapter, we use the `awesome_owl` addon, which provides a simplified "
"environment that only contains Owl and a few other files. The goal is to "
"learn Owl itself, without relying on Odoo web client code."
msgstr ""
"Bu bobda faqat Owl va bir nechta boshqa fayllardan iborat soddalashtirilgan "
"environment beradigan `awesome_owl` addon'idan foydalanamiz. Maqsad - Odoo "
"web client kodiga tayanmasdan Owl'ning o'zini o'rganish."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:29
msgid ""
"The solutions for each exercise of the chapter are hosted on the `official "
"Odoo tutorials repository <https://github.com/odoo/tutorials/commits/19.0-"
"discover-js-framework-solutions/awesome_owl>`_. It is recommended to try to "
"solve them first without looking at the solution!"
msgstr ""
"Bu bobning har bir mashqi uchun yechimlar `rasmiy Odoo tutorials "
"repository'sida <https://github.com/odoo/tutorials/commits/19.0-discover-js-"
"framework-solutions/awesome_owl>`_ joylashgan. Avval yechimga qaramasdan "
"ularni o'zingiz hal qilishga harakat qilish tavsiya etiladi!"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:35
msgid "Example: a `Counter` component"
msgstr "Misol: `Counter` component'i"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:37
msgid ""
"First, let us have a look at a simple example. The `Counter` component shown "
"below is a component that maintains an internal number value, displays it, "
"and updates it whenever the user clicks on the button."
msgstr ""
"Avvalo, oddiy misolni ko'rib chiqamiz. Quyida keltirilgan `Counter` "
"component'i ichki son qiymatini saqlaydi, uni ko'rsatadi va foydalanuvchi "
"tugmani bosgan har safar uni yangilaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:57
msgid ""
"The `Counter` component specifies the name of a template that represents its "
"html. It is written in XML using the QWeb language:"
msgstr ""
"`Counter` component'i o'zining html'ini ifodalaydigan template nomini "
"ko'rsatadi. U QWeb tilida XML'da yozilgan:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:71
msgid "1. Displaying a counter"
msgstr "1. Counter'ni ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:76
msgid ""
"As a first exercise, let us modify the `Playground` component located "
"in :file:`awesome_owl/static/src/` to turn it into a counter. To see the "
"result, you can go to the `/awesome_owl` route with your browser."
msgstr ""
"Birinchi mashq sifatida :file:`awesome_owl/static/src/` da joylashgan "
"`Playground` component'ini counter'ga aylantirish uchun o'zgartiramiz. "
"Natijani ko'rish uchun browser'ingizda `/awesome_owl` route'iga o'tishingiz "
"mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:81
msgid ""
"Modify :file:`playground.js` so that it acts as a counter like in the "
"example above. Keep `Playground` for the class name. You will need to use "
"the `useState hook <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"hooks.md#usestate>`_ so that the component is re-rendered whenever any part "
"of the state object that has been read by this component is modified."
msgstr ""
":file:`playground.js` ni yuqoridagi misoldagidek counter vazifasini "
"bajaradigan qilib o'zgartiring. Class nomi uchun `Playground` ni saqlab "
"qoling. Component o'qigan state object'ining biror qismi o'zgargan har safar "
"component qayta render qilinishi uchun `useState hook <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#usestate>`_ dan "
"foydalanishingiz kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:85
msgid "In the same component, create an `increment` method."
msgstr "Xuddi shu component'da `increment` method'ini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:86
msgid ""
"Modify the template in :file:`playground.xml` so that it displays your "
"counter variable. Use `t-esc <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/templates.md#outputting-data>`_ to output the data."
msgstr ""
":file:`playground.xml` dagi template'ni counter o'zgaruvchingizni "
"ko'rsatadigan qilib o'zgartiring. Ma'lumotni chiqarish uchun `t-esc <https://"
"github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#outputting-"
"data>`_ dan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:88
msgid ""
"Add a button in the template and specify a `t-on-click <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/event_handling.md#event-handling>`_ "
"attribute in the button to trigger the `increment` method whenever the "
"button is clicked."
msgstr ""
"Template'ga tugma qo'shing va tugma bosilgan har safar `increment` "
"method'ini ishga tushirish uchun tugmada `t-on-click <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/event_handling.md#event-handling>`_ "
"atributini ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:93
msgid ""
"The Odoo JavaScript files downloaded by the browser are minified. For "
"debugging purpose, it's easier when the files are not minified. Switch "
"to :ref:`debug mode with assets <developer-mode/activation>` so that the "
"files are not minified."
msgstr ""
"Browser yuklab oladigan Odoo JavaScript fayllari minify qilingan bo'ladi. "
"Debug qilish uchun fayllar minify qilinmagan bo'lsa qulayroq. Fayllar minify "
"qilinmasligi uchun :ref:`assets bilan debug rejimiga <developer-mode/"
"activation>` o'ting."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:97
msgid ""
"This exercise showcases an important feature of Owl: the `reactivity system "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/reactivity.md>`_. "
"The `useState` function wraps a value in a proxy so Owl can keep track of "
"which component needs which part of the state, so it can be updated whenever "
"a value has been changed. Try removing the `useState` function and see what "
"happens."
msgstr ""
"Bu mashq Owl'ning muhim imkoniyatini - `reactivity tizimini <https://"
"github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/reactivity.md>`_ namoyish "
"etadi. `useState` funksiyasi qiymatni proxy'ga o'raydi, shu tariqa Owl qaysi "
"component state'ning qaysi qismiga muhtoj ekanini kuzatib boradi va qiymat "
"o'zgargan zahoti uni yangilay oladi. `useState` funksiyasini olib tashlab, "
"nima bo'lishini ko'rib ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:103
msgid "2. Extract `Counter` in a sub component"
msgstr "2. `Counter` ni sub component'ga ajratish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:105
msgid ""
"For now we have the logic of a counter in the `Playground` component, but it "
"is not reusable. Let us see how to create a `sub-component <https://"
"github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/component.md#sub-"
"components>`_ from it:"
msgstr ""
"Hozircha counter logikasi `Playground` component'ida joylashgan, lekin u "
"qayta foydalanishga yaroqli emas. Undan `sub-component <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/component.md#sub-components>`_ qanday "
"yaratishni ko'rib chiqamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:108
msgid ""
"Extract the counter code from the `Playground` component into a new "
"`Counter` component."
msgstr ""
"Counter kodini `Playground` component'idan yangi `Counter` component'iga "
"ajratib chiqaring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:109
msgid ""
"You can do it in the same file first, but once it's done, update your code "
"to move the `Counter` in its own folder and file. Import it relatively from "
"`./counter/counter`. Make sure the template is in its own file, with the "
"same name."
msgstr ""
"Avval buni xuddi shu faylda qilishingiz mumkin, lekin tugagach, `Counter` ni "
"o'zining papkasi va fayliga ko'chirish uchun kodingizni yangilang. Uni `./"
"counter/counter` dan nisbiy yo'l bilan import qiling. Template ham xuddi shu "
"nomdagi alohida faylda bo'lishiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:112
msgid ""
"Use `<Counter/>` in the template of the `Playground` component to add two "
"counters in your playground."
msgstr ""
"Playground'ingizga ikkita counter qo'shish uchun `Playground` component'i "
"template'ida `<Counter/>` dan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:119
msgid ""
"By convention, most components code, template and css should have the same "
"snake-cased name as the component. For example, if we have a `TodoList` "
"component, its code should be in `todo_list.js`, `todo_list.xml` and if "
"necessary, `todo_list.scss`"
msgstr ""
"Kelishuvga ko'ra, ko'pchilik component'larning kodi, template'i va css'i "
"component nomining snake_case shakli bilan bir xil nomlanishi kerak. "
"Masalan, agar bizda `TodoList` component'i bo'lsa, uning kodi "
"`todo_list.js`, `todo_list.xml` va zarur bo'lsa `todo_list.scss` fayllarida "
"bo'lishi kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:126
msgid "3. A simple `Card` component"
msgstr "3. Oddiy `Card` component'i"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:128
msgid ""
"Components are really the most natural way to divide a complicated user "
"interface into multiple reusable pieces. But to make them truly useful, it "
"is necessary to be able to communicate some information between them. Let us "
"see how a parent component can provide information to a sub component by "
"using attributes (most commonly known as `props <https://github.com/odoo/owl/"
"blob/master/doc/v2/reference/props.md>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Component'lar murakkab foydalanuvchi interfeysini qayta foydalanishga "
"yaroqli bir nechta bo'lakka bo'lishning eng tabiiy usulidir. Lekin ularni "
"haqiqatan foydali qilish uchun ular orasida ma'lumot almashish imkoniyati "
"zarur. Parent component sub component'ga atributlar (ko'pincha `props "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/props.md>`_ deb "
"ataladi) yordamida qanday ma'lumot bera olishini ko'rib chiqamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:133
msgid ""
"The goal of this exercise is to create a `Card` component, that takes two "
"props: `title` and `content`. For example, here is how it could be used:"
msgstr ""
"Bu mashqning maqsadi - ikkita props: `title` va `content` qabul qiladigan "
"`Card` component'ini yaratish. Masalan, u quyidagicha ishlatilishi mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:140
msgid ""
"The above example should produce some html using bootstrap that look like "
"this:"
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi misol bootstrap yordamida quyidagi ko'rinishdagi html hosil "
"qilishi kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:153
msgid "Create a `Card` component"
msgstr "`Card` component'ini yarating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:154
msgid "Import it in `Playground` and display a few cards in its template"
msgstr ""
"Uni `Playground` da import qiling va uning template'ida bir nechta card'ni "
"ko'rsating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:160
msgid "4. Using `markup` to display html"
msgstr "4. Html'ni ko'rsatish uchun `markup` dan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:162
msgid ""
"If you used `t-esc` in the previous exercise, then you may have noticed that "
"Owl automatically escapes its content. For example, if you try to display "
"some html like this: `<Card title=\"'my title'\" content=\"this.html\"/>` "
"with `this.html = \"<div>some content</div>\"\"`, the resulting output will "
"simply display the html as a string."
msgstr ""
"Agar oldingi mashqda `t-esc` dan foydalangan bo'lsangiz, Owl uning "
"kontentini avtomatik ravishda escape qilishini sezgan bo'lishingiz mumkin. "
"Masalan, agar `this.html = \"<div>some content</div>\"\"` bilan birga `<Card "
"title=\"'my title'\" content=\"this.html\"/>` kabi html ko'rsatishga harakat "
"qilsangiz, natijada html oddiy satr sifatida chiqadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:167
msgid ""
"In this case, since the `Card` component may be used to display any kind of "
"content, it makes sense to allow the user to display some html. This is done "
"with the `t-out directive <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/templates.md#outputting-data>`_."
msgstr ""
"Bu holatda `Card` component har qanday turdagi kontentni ko'rsatish uchun "
"ishlatilishi mumkin bo'lgani sababli, foydalanuvchiga html ko'rsatishga "
"ruxsat berish o'rinli. Bu `t-out direktivi <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#outputting-data>`_ yordamida amalga "
"oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:171
msgid ""
"However, displaying arbitrary content as html is dangerous, it could be used "
"to inject malicious code, so by default, Owl will always escape a string "
"unless it has been explicitely marked as safe with the `markup` function."
msgstr ""
"Biroq, ixtiyoriy kontentni html sifatida ko'rsatish xavfli — u zararli kodni "
"kiritish uchun ishlatilishi mumkin, shu sababli Owl sukut bo'yicha satrni "
"doimo escape qiladi, agar u `markup` funksiyasi bilan aniq ravishda xavfsiz "
"deb belgilanmagan bo'lsa."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:175
msgid "Update `Card` to use `t-out`"
msgstr "`Card` ni `t-out` dan foydalanadigan qilib yangilang"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:176
msgid "Update `Playground` to import `markup`, and use it on some html values"
msgstr ""
"`Playground` ni `markup` ni import qiladigan qilib yangilang va uni ba'zi "
"html qiymatlarga qo'llang"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:177
msgid ""
"Make sure that you see that normal strings are always escaped, unlike "
"markuped strings."
msgstr ""
"Oddiy satrlar, markup qilingan satrlardan farqli ravishda, doimo escape "
"qilinishini ko'rganingizga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:181
msgid ""
"The `t-esc` directive can still be used in Owl templates. It is slightly "
"faster than `t-out`."
msgstr ""
"`t-esc` direktivi hamon Owl template'larida ishlatilishi mumkin. U `t-out` "
"dan bir oz tezroq."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:187
msgid "5. Props validation"
msgstr "5. Props validatsiyasi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:189
msgid ""
"The `Card` component has an implicit API. It expects to receive two strings "
"in its props: the `title` and the `content`. Let us make that API more "
"explicit. We can add a props definition that will let Owl perform a "
"validation step in `dev mode <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/app.md#dev-mode>`_. You can activate the dev mode in the `App "
"configuration <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"app.md#configuration>`_ (but it is activated by default on the `awesome_owl` "
"playground)."
msgstr ""
"`Card` component'ining yashirin API'si bor. U o'z props'ida ikkita satr "
"olishni kutadi: `title` va `content`. Keling, bu API'ni aniqroq qilamiz. Biz "
"props ta'rifini qo'shishimiz mumkin, bu Owl'ga `dev mode <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/app.md#dev-mode>`_ da validatsiya "
"bosqichini bajarishga imkon beradi. Dev mode'ni `App konfiguratsiyasi "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"app.md#configuration>`_ da faollashtirishingiz mumkin (lekin `awesome_owl` "
"playground'ida u sukut bo'yicha faollashtirilgan)."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:196
msgid "It is a good practice to do props validation for every component."
msgstr ""
"Har bir component uchun props validatsiyasini bajarish yaxshi amaliyot."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:198
msgid ""
"Add `props validation <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/props.md#props-validation>`_ to the `Card` component."
msgstr ""
"`Card` component'iga `props validatsiyasi <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/props.md#props-validation>`_ ni qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:200
msgid ""
"Rename the `title` props into something else in the playground template, "
"then check in the :guilabel:`Console` tab of your browser's dev tools that "
"you can see an error."
msgstr ""
"Playground template'ida `title` props nomini boshqa nomga o'zgartiring, "
"so'ngra brauzeringizning dev tools'idagi :guilabel:`Console` yorlig'ida xato "
"ko'rinishini tekshiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:204
msgid "6. The sum of two `Counter`"
msgstr "6. Ikki `Counter` yig'indisi"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:206
msgid ""
"We saw in a previous exercise that `props` can be used to provide "
"information from a parent to a child component. Now, let us see how we can "
"communicate information in the opposite direction: in this exercise, we want "
"to display two `Counter` components, and below them, the sum of their "
"values. So, the parent component (`Playground`) need to be informed whenever "
"one of the `Counter` value is changed."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi mashqda `props` yordamida ma'lumotni ota component'dan bola "
"component'ga uzatish mumkinligini ko'rdik. Endi ma'lumotni teskari "
"yo'nalishda qanday uzatish mumkinligini ko'ramiz: bu mashqda biz ikkita "
"`Counter` component'ini va ular ostida qiymatlari yig'indisini "
"ko'rsatmoqchimiz. Ya'ni, `Counter` qiymatlaridan biri o'zgarganda ota "
"component (`Playground`) bundan xabardor bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:212
msgid ""
"This can be done by using a `callback prop <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/props.md#binding-function-props>`_: a prop that is a "
"function meant to be called back. The child component can choose to call "
"that function with any argument. In our case, we will simply add an optional "
"`onChange` prop that will be called whenever the `Counter` component is "
"incremented."
msgstr ""
"Buni `callback prop <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/props.md#binding-function-props>`_ yordamida bajarish mumkin: bu "
"qayta chaqirilishi ko'zda tutilgan funksiya bo'lgan prop. Bola component bu "
"funksiyani xohlagan argument bilan chaqirishi mumkin. Bizning holatda biz "
"shunchaki ixtiyoriy `onChange` prop'ini qo'shamiz, u `Counter` component har "
"marta oshirilganda chaqiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:217
msgid ""
"Add prop validation to the `Counter` component: it should accept an optional "
"`onChange` function prop."
msgstr ""
"`Counter` component'iga prop validatsiyasini qo'shing: u ixtiyoriy "
"`onChange` funksiya prop'ini qabul qilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:219
msgid ""
"Update the `Counter` component to call the `onChange` prop (if it exists) "
"whenever it is incremented."
msgstr ""
"`Counter` component'ini har marta oshirilganda `onChange` prop'ini (agar u "
"mavjud bo'lsa) chaqiradigan qilib yangilang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:221
msgid ""
"Modify the `Playground` component to maintain a local state value (`sum`), "
"initially set to 2, and display it in its template"
msgstr ""
"`Playground` component'ini lokal state qiymatini (`sum`) saqlaydigan qilib "
"o'zgartiring, uning boshlang'ich qiymati 2 bo'lsin va uni o'z template'ida "
"ko'rsating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:223
msgid "Implement an `incrementSum` method in `Playground`"
msgstr "`Playground` da `incrementSum` method'ini amalga oshiring"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:224
msgid "Give that method as a prop to two (or more!) sub `Counter` components."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu method'ni ikkita (yoki undan ko'p!) quyi `Counter` component'iga prop "
"sifatida bering."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:231
msgid ""
"There is a subtlety with callback props: they usually should be defined with "
"the `.bind` suffix. See the `documentation <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/props.md#binding-function-props>`_."
msgstr ""
"Callback props bilan bir nozik jihat bor: ular odatda `.bind` suffiksi bilan "
"aniqlanishi kerak. `Hujjatlarni <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/props.md#binding-function-props>`_ ko'ring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:235
msgid "7. A todo list"
msgstr "7. Todo ro'yxati"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:237
msgid ""
"Let us now discover various features of Owl by creating a todo list.  We "
"need two components: a `TodoList` component that will display a list of "
"`TodoItem` components. The list of todos is a state that should be "
"maintained by the `TodoList`."
msgstr ""
"Keling, endi todo ro'yxatini yaratish orqali Owl'ning turli imkoniyatlarini "
"o'rganamiz. Bizga ikkita component kerak: `TodoItem` component'lari "
"ro'yxatini ko'rsatadigan `TodoList` component'i. Todo'lar ro'yxati "
"`TodoList` tomonidan saqlanishi kerak bo'lgan state hisoblanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:241
msgid ""
"For this tutorial, a `todo` is an object that contains three values: an `id` "
"(number), a `description` (string) and a flag `isCompleted` (boolean):"
msgstr ""
"Bu qo'llanmada `todo` — uchta qiymatni o'z ichiga olgan obyekt: `id` "
"(raqam), `description` (satr) va `isCompleted` flag'i (boolean):"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:248
msgid "Create a `TodoList` and a `TodoItem` components."
msgstr "`TodoList` va `TodoItem` component'larini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:249
msgid ""
"The `TodoItem` component should receive a `todo` as a prop, and display its "
"`id` and `description` in a `div`."
msgstr ""
"`TodoItem` component prop sifatida `todo` ni olishi va uning `id` va "
"`description` qiymatlarini `div` ichida ko'rsatishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:250
msgid "For now, hardcode the list of todos:"
msgstr "Hozircha todo'lar ro'yxatini kodda qat'iy belgilang:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:257
msgid ""
"Use `t-foreach <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"templates.md#loops>`_ to display each todo in a `TodoItem`."
msgstr ""
"Har bir todo'ni `TodoItem` ichida ko'rsatish uchun `t-foreach <https://"
"github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#loops>`_ dan "
"foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:258
msgid "Display a `TodoList` in the playground."
msgstr "Playground'da `TodoList` ni ko'rsating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:259
msgid "Add props validation to `TodoItem`."
msgstr "`TodoItem` ga props validatsiyasini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:265
msgid ""
"Since the `TodoList` and `TodoItem` components are so tightly coupled, it "
"makes sense to put them in the same folder."
msgstr ""
"`TodoList` va `TodoItem` component'lari bir-biriga juda zich bog'liq "
"bo'lgani uchun, ularni bitta papkaga joylashtirish o'rinli."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:269
msgid ""
"The `t-foreach` directive is not exactly the same in Owl as the QWeb python "
"implementation: it requires a `t-key` unique value, so that Owl can properly "
"reconcile each element."
msgstr ""
"Owl'dagi `t-foreach` direktivi QWeb python implementatsiyasidagidan bir oz "
"farq qiladi: u `t-key` unikal qiymatini talab qiladi, shunda Owl har bir "
"elementni to'g'ri moslashtira oladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:273
msgid "8. Use dynamic attributes"
msgstr "8. Dinamik atributlardan foydalanish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:275
msgid ""
"For now, the `TodoItem` component does not visually show if the `todo` is "
"completed. Let us do that by using a `dynamic attributes <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#dynamic-attributes>`_."
msgstr ""
"Hozircha `TodoItem` component `todo` bajarilganini vizual ravishda "
"ko'rsatmaydi. Keling, buni `dinamik atributlar <https://github.com/odoo/owl/"
"blob/master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#dynamic-attributes>`_ yordamida "
"amalga oshiramiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:278
msgid ""
"Add the Bootstrap classes `text-muted` and `text-decoration-line-through` on "
"the `TodoItem` root element if it is completed."
msgstr ""
"Agar `TodoItem` bajarilgan bo'lsa, uning ildiz elementiga `text-muted` va "
"`text-decoration-line-through` Bootstrap class'larini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:280
msgid ""
"Change the hardcoded `this.todos` value to check that it is properly "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"To'g'ri ko'rsatilayotganini tekshirish uchun kodda qat'iy belgilangan "
"`this.todos` qiymatini o'zgartiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:282
msgid ""
"Even though the directive is named `t-att` (for attribute), it can be used "
"to set a `class` value (and html properties such as the `value` of an input)."
msgstr ""
"Direktiv `t-att` (attribute uchun) deb nomlangan bo'lsa-da, undan `class` "
"qiymatini (va input'ning `value` kabi html xossalarini) o'rnatish uchun ham "
"foydalanish mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:290
msgid ""
"Owl let you combine static class values with dynamic values. The following "
"example will work as expected:"
msgstr ""
"Owl statik class qiymatlarini dinamik qiymatlar bilan birlashtirishga imkon "
"beradi. Quyidagi misol kutilganidek ishlaydi:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:296
msgid ""
"See also: `Owl: Dynamic class attributes <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#dynamic-class-attribute>`_"
msgstr ""
"Shuningdek ko'ring: `Owl: Dynamic class attributes <https://github.com/odoo/"
"owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/templates.md#dynamic-class-attribute>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:299
msgid "9. Adding a todo"
msgstr "9. Todo qo'shish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:301
msgid ""
"So far, the todos in our list are hard-coded. Let us make it more useful by "
"allowing the user to add a todo to the list."
msgstr ""
"Hozirgacha ro'yxatimizdagi todo'lar kodda qat'iy belgilangan. Keling, "
"foydalanuvchiga ro'yxatga todo qo'shishga ruxsat berib, uni foydaliroq "
"qilamiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:304
msgid "Remove the hardcoded values in the `TodoList` component:"
msgstr ""
"`TodoList` component'idagi qat'iy belgilangan qiymatlarni olib tashlang:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:310
msgid "Add an input above the task list with placeholder *Enter a new task*."
msgstr ""
"Vazifalar ro'yxati ustiga *Enter a new task* placeholder'i bilan input "
"qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:311
msgid ""
"Add an `event handler <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/event_handling.md>`_ on the `keyup` event named `addTodo`."
msgstr ""
"`keyup` event'iga `addTodo` nomli `event handler <https://github.com/odoo/"
"owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/event_handling.md>`_ qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:313
msgid ""
"Implement `addTodo` to check if enter was pressed (:code:`ev.keyCode === "
"13`), and in that case, create a new todo with the current content of the "
"input as the description and clear the input of all content."
msgstr ""
"`addTodo` ni enter bosilganini tekshiradigan (:code:`ev.keyCode === 13`) "
"qilib amalga oshiring va bu holatda input'ning hozirgi kontentini "
"description sifatida olib yangi todo yarating hamda input kontentini to'liq "
"tozalang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:316
msgid ""
"Make sure the todo has a unique id. It can be just a counter that increments "
"at each todo."
msgstr ""
"Todo unikal id'ga ega bo'lishiga ishonch hosil qiling. Bu har bir todo'da "
"oshib boradigan oddiy hisoblagich bo'lishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:317
msgid "Bonus point: don't do anything if the input is empty."
msgstr "Qo'shimcha ball: agar input bo'sh bo'lsa, hech narsa qilmang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:324
msgid ""
"`Owl: Reactivity <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"reactivity.md>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Owl: Reactivity <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"reactivity.md>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:327
msgid "Theory: Component lifecycle and hooks"
msgstr "Nazariya: Component lifecycle va hook'lar"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:329
msgid ""
"So far, we have seen one example of a hook function: `useState`. A `hook "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_ is a "
"special function that *hook into* the internals of the component. In the "
"case of `useState`, it generates a proxy object linked to the current "
"component. This is why hook functions have to be called in the `setup` "
"method, and no later!"
msgstr ""
"Hozirgacha biz hook funksiyasining bitta misolini ko'rdik: `useState`. `hook "
"<https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_ — bu "
"component'ning ichki tuzilishiga *ulanadigan* maxsus funksiya. `useState` "
"holatida u hozirgi component'ga bog'langan proxy obyektini yaratadi. Shu "
"sababli hook funksiyalari `setup` method'ida chaqirilishi kerak, undan keyin "
"emas!"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:379
msgid ""
"An Owl component goes through a lot of phases: it can be instantiated, "
"rendered, mounted, updated, detached, destroyed... This is the `component "
"lifecycle <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"component.md#lifecycle>`_. The figure above show the most important events "
"in the life of a component (hooks are shown in purple). Roughly speaking, a "
"component is created, then updated (potentially many times), then is "
"destroyed."
msgstr ""
"Owl component ko'plab fazalardan o'tadi: u instantiate qilinishi, render "
"qilinishi, mount qilinishi, yangilanishi, ajratilishi, yo'q qilinishi "
"mumkin... Bu `component lifecycle <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/"
"doc/v2/reference/component.md#lifecycle>`_ deb ataladi. Yuqoridagi rasmda "
"component hayotidagi eng muhim event'lar ko'rsatilgan (hook'lar binafsha "
"rangda). Umuman aytganda, component yaratiladi, so'ngra yangilanadi (ehtimol "
"bir necha marta), keyin yo'q qilinadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:384
msgid ""
"Owl provides a variety of built-in `hooks functions <https://github.com/odoo/"
"owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_. All of them have to be called "
"in the `setup` function. For example, if you want to execute some code when "
"your component is mounted, you can use the `onMounted` hook:"
msgstr ""
"Owl turli xil ichki `hook funksiyalarini <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/"
"master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_ taqdim etadi. Ularning barchasi `setup` "
"funksiyasida chaqirilishi kerak. Masalan, agar component mount qilinganda "
"biror kodni bajarishni xohlasangiz, `onMounted` hook'idan foydalanishingiz "
"mumkin:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:398
msgid ""
"All hook functions start with `use` or `on`. For example: `useState` or "
"`onMounted`."
msgstr ""
"Barcha hook funksiyalari `use` yoki `on` bilan boshlanadi. Masalan: "
"`useState` yoki `onMounted`."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:402
msgid "10. Focusing the input"
msgstr "10. Input'ga fokus berish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:404
msgid ""
"Let's see how we can access the DOM with `t-ref <https://github.com/odoo/owl/"
"blob/master/doc/v2/reference/refs.md>`_ and `useRef <https://github.com/odoo/"
"owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_. The main idea is that "
"you need to mark the target element in the component template with a `t-ref`:"
msgstr ""
"Keling, `t-ref <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"refs.md>`_ va `useRef <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/hooks.md#useref>`_ yordamida DOM'ga qanday kirish mumkinligini "
"ko'ramiz. Asosiy g'oya shundan iborat: component template'idagi maqsadli "
"elementni `t-ref` bilan belgilashingiz kerak:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:412
msgid ""
"Then you can access it in the JS with the `useRef hook <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_. However, there is "
"a problem if you think about it: the actual html element for a component "
"does not exist when the component is created. It only exists when the "
"component is mounted. But hooks have to be called in the `setup` method. So, "
"`useRef` return an object that contains a `el` (for element) key that is "
"only defined when the component is mounted."
msgstr ""
"So'ngra unga JS'da `useRef hook <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/hooks.md#useref>`_ yordamida murojaat qilishingiz mumkin. "
"Biroq, o'ylab ko'rsangiz, bir muammo bor: component yaratilganda uning "
"haqiqiy html elementi mavjud bo'lmaydi. U faqat component mount qilinganda "
"paydo bo'ladi. Ammo hook'lar `setup` method'ida chaqirilishi kerak. Shu "
"sababli `useRef` `el` (element uchun) kalitini o'z ichiga olgan obyektni "
"qaytaradi va bu kalit faqat component mount qilinganda aniqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:429
msgid ""
"Focus the `input` from the previous exercise. This this should be done from "
"the `TodoList` component (note that there is a `focus` method on the input "
"html element)."
msgstr ""
"Oldingi mashqdagi `input` ga fokus bering. Bu `TodoList` component'idan "
"bajarilishi kerak (e'tibor bering, input html elementida `focus` method'i "
"mavjud)."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:431
msgid ""
"Bonus point: extract the code into a specialized `hook <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/hooks.md>`_ `useAutofocus` in a "
"new :file:`awesome_owl/utils.js` file."
msgstr ""
"Qo'shimcha ball: kodni yangi :file:`awesome_owl/utils.js` faylidagi maxsus "
"`useAutofocus` `hook <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/hooks.md>`_ ichiga chiqarib oling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:439
