#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:446
msgid "11. Toggling todos"
msgstr "11. Todo'lar holatini almashtirish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:448
msgid ""
"Now, let's add a new feature: mark a todo as completed. This is actually "
"trickier than one might think. The owner of the state is not the same as the "
"component that displays it. So, the `TodoItem` component needs to "
"communicate to its parent that the todo state needs to be toggled. One "
"classic way to do this is by adding a `callback prop <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/props.md#binding-function-props>`_ "
"`toggleState`."
msgstr ""
"Endi yangi funksiya qo'shamiz: todo'ni bajarilgan deb belgilash. Bu "
"ko'rinishidan ko'ra murakkabroq. State egasi uni ko'rsatadigan component "
"bilan bir xil emas. Shu sababli `TodoItem` component o'z parent'iga todo "
"state'ini o'zgartirish kerakligini yetkazishi lozim. Buni amalga "
"oshirishning klassik usullaridan biri — `callback prop <https://github.com/"
"odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/props.md#binding-function-props>`_ "
"`toggleState` qo'shish."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:454
msgid ""
"Add an input with the attribute :code:`type=\"checkbox\"` before the id of "
"the task, which must be checked if the state `isCompleted` is true."
msgstr ""
"Task id'sidan oldin :code:`type=\"checkbox\"` atributiga ega input qo'shing; "
"agar `isCompleted` state'i true bo'lsa, u belgilangan bo'lishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:458
msgid ""
"Owl does not create attributes computed with the `t-att` directive if it "
"evaluates to a falsy value."
msgstr ""
"Agar qiymat falsy bo'lsa, Owl `t-att` direktivasi bilan hisoblangan "
"atributlarni yaratmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:461
msgid "Add a callback props `toggleState` to `TodoItem`."
msgstr "`TodoItem`ga `toggleState` callback prop'ini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:462
msgid ""
"Add a `change` event handler on the input in the `TodoItem` component and "
"make sure it calls the `toggleState` function with the todo id."
msgstr ""
"`TodoItem` component'idagi input'ga `change` event handler qo'shing va u "
"`toggleState` funksiyasini todo id bilan chaqirishiga ishonch hosil qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:464
