msgid "Make it work!"
msgstr "Uni ishga tushiring!"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:470
msgid "12. Deleting todos"
msgstr "12. Todo'larni o'chirish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:472
msgid "The final touch is to let the user delete a todo."
msgstr "Oxirgi qadam — foydalanuvchiga todo'ni o'chirish imkonini berish."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:474
msgid "Add a new callback prop `removeTodo` in `TodoItem`."
msgstr "`TodoItem`da yangi `removeTodo` callback prop'ini qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:475
msgid ""
