msgstr ""
"`TodoItem` component'ining template'iga :code:`<span class=\"fa fa-remove\"/"
">` ni joylashtiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:476
msgid "Whenever the user clicks on it, it should call the `removeTodo` method."
msgstr ""
"Foydalanuvchi uni bosganda, u `removeTodo` method'ini chaqirishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:480
msgid ""
"If you're using an array to store your todo list, you can use the JavaScript "
"`splice` function to remove a todo from it."
msgstr ""
"Agar todo ro'yxatini saqlash uchun array ishlatayotgan bo'lsangiz, undan "
"todo'ni olib tashlash uchun JavaScript'ning `splice` funksiyasidan "
"foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:498
msgid "13. Generic `Card` with slots"
msgstr "13. Slot'lar bilan universal `Card`"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:500
msgid ""
"In a :ref:`previous exercise <tutorials/discover_js_framework/simple_card>`, "
"we built a simple `Card` component. But it is honestly quite limited. What "
"if we want to display some arbitrary content inside a card, such as a sub-"
"component? Well, it does not work, since the content of the card is "
"described by a string. It would however be very convenient if we could "
"describe the content as a piece of template."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Oldingi mashqda <tutorials/discover_js_framework/simple_card>` biz "
"oddiy `Card` component'ini yaratdik. Ammo u, rostini aytganda, ancha "
"cheklangan. Agar card ichida ixtiyoriy kontentni, masalan sub-component'ni "
"ko'rsatmoqchi bo'lsak-chi? Bu ishlamaydi, chunki card kontenti string bilan "
"tavsiflanadi. Kontentni template parchasi sifatida tavsiflay olsak, bu juda "
"qulay bo'lardi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:506
msgid ""
"This is exactly what Owl's `slot <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/"
"doc/v2/reference/slots.md>`_ system is designed for: allowing to write "
"generic components."
msgstr ""
"Owl'ning `slot <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"slots.md>`_ tizimi aynan shu uchun mo'ljallangan: universal component'lar "
"yozish imkonini berish."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:509
msgid "Let us modify the `Card` component to use slots:"
msgstr ""
"Keling, `Card` component'ini slot'lardan foydalanadigan qilib o'zgartiramiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:511
msgid "Remove the `content` prop."
msgstr "`content` prop'ini olib tashlang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:512
msgid "Use the default slot to define the body."
msgstr "Body'ni aniqlash uchun default slot'dan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:513
msgid ""
"Insert a few cards with arbitrary content, such as a `Counter` component."
msgstr ""
"Ixtiyoriy kontentga ega bir nechta card qo'shing, masalan `Counter` "
"component'i."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:514
msgid "(bonus) Add prop validation."
msgstr "(bonus) Prop validation qo'shing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:520
msgid ""
"`Bootstrap: documentation on cards <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/"
