msgstr ""
"`Bootstrap: card'lar bo'yicha hujjatlar <https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.2/"
"components/card/>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:523
msgid "14. Minimizing card content"
msgstr "14. Card kontentini yig'ish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:527
msgid ""
"Finally, let's add a feature to the `Card` component, to make it more "
"interesting: we want a button to toggle its content (show it or hide it)"
msgstr ""
"Nihoyat, `Card` component'ini qiziqarliroq qilish uchun unga yangi funksiya "
"qo'shamiz: kontentni ko'rsatish yoki yashirish uchun tugma kerak"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/01_owl_components.rst:530
