msgstr "2-bob: Dashboard yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:5
msgid ""
"The first part of this tutorial introduced you to most of Owl ideas. It is "
"now time to learn about the Odoo JavaScript framework in its entirety, as "
"used by the web client."
