#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:41
msgid "1. A new Layout"
msgstr "1. Yangi Layout"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:43
msgid ""
"Most screens in the Odoo web client uses a common layout: a control panel on "
"top, with some buttons, and a main content zone just below. This is done "
"using the `Layout component <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/"
"web/static/src/search/layout.js>`_, available in `@web/search/layout`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo web client'idagi ko'pchilik ekranlar umumiy layout'dan foydalanadi: "
"yuqorida bir nechta tugmalarga ega control panel, uning ostida esa asosiy "
"kontent zonasi. Bu `@web/search/layout` da mavjud bo'lgan `Layout component "
"<https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/static/src/search/"
"layout.js>`_ yordamida amalga oshiriladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:47
msgid ""
"Update the `AwesomeDashboard` component located in :file:`awesome_dashboard/"
"static/src/` to use the `Layout` component. You can "
"use :code:`{controlPanel: {} }` for the `display` props of the `Layout` "
"component."
msgstr ""
":file:`awesome_dashboard/static/src/` da joylashgan `AwesomeDashboard` "
"component'ini `Layout` component'idan foydalanadigan qilib yangilang. "
"`Layout` component'ining `display` prop'i uchun :code:`{controlPanel: {} }` "
"dan foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:51
