msgstr ""
"`Layout`ga `className` prop'ini qo'shing: `className=\"'o_dashboard h-100'\"`"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:52
msgid ""
"Add a `dashboard.scss` file in which you set the background-color of "
"`.o_dashboard` to gray (or your favorite color)"
msgstr ""
"`dashboard.scss` faylini qo'shing va unda `.o_dashboard` ning background-"
"color'ini kulrangga (yoki o'zingizga yoqqan rangga) o'rnating"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:55
