#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:234
msgid "5. Cache network calls, create a service"
msgstr "5. Network chaqiruvlarini cache'lash, service yaratish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:236
msgid ""
"If you open the :guilabel:`Network` tab of your browser's dev tools, you "
"will see that the call to `/awesome_dashboard/statistics` is done every time "
"the client action is displayed. This is because the `onWillStart` hook is "
"called each time the `Dashboard` component is mounted. But in this case, we "
"would prefer to do it only the first time, so we actually need to maintain "
"some state outside of the `Dashboard` component. This is a nice use case for "
"a service!"
msgstr ""
"Agar brauzeringiz dev tools'idagi :guilabel:`Network` tab'ini ochsangiz, `/"
"awesome_dashboard/statistics` chaqiruvi client action har ko'rsatilganda "
"bajarilayotganini ko'rasiz. Buning sababi shundaki, `onWillStart` hook "
"`Dashboard` component har mount qilinganda chaqiriladi. Ammo bu holatda biz "
"buni faqat birinchi marta bajarishni afzal ko'ramiz, shuning uchun "
"`Dashboard` component'idan tashqarida ma'lum bir holatni saqlab turishimiz "
"kerak. Bu service uchun juda mos keladigan holat!"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:242
msgid "Register and import a new `awesome_dashboard.statistics` service."
msgstr ""
"Yangi `awesome_dashboard.statistics` service'ini ro'yxatdan o'tkazing va "
"import qiling."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:243
msgid ""
"It should provide a function `loadStatistics` that, once called, performs "
"the actual rpc, and always return the same information."
msgstr ""
"U `loadStatistics` funksiyasini taqdim etishi kerak: chaqirilganda haqiqiy "
"rpc'ni bajaradi va har doim bir xil ma'lumotni qaytaradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:245
msgid ""
"Use the `memoize <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/core/utils/"
"functions.js#L11>`_ utility function from `@web/core/utils/functions` that "
"allows caching the statistics."
msgstr ""
"Statistikani cache'lash imkonini beruvchi `@web/core/utils/functions` dagi "
"`memoize <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/core/utils/"
"functions.js#L11>`_ yordamchi funksiyasidan foydalaning."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:248
msgid "Use this service in the `Dashboard` component."
msgstr "Bu service'ni `Dashboard` component'ida ishlating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:249
msgid "Check that it works as expected."
msgstr "Kutilganidek ishlayotganini tekshiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:252
msgid ""
"`Example: simple service <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/"
"static/src/core/network/http_service.js>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Misol: oddiy service <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/addons/web/"
