"`Misol: dependency'ga ega service <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/19.0/"
"addons/web/static/src/core/user_service.js>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:257
msgid "6. Display a pie chart"
msgstr "6. Doiraviy diagramma ko'rsatish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:259
msgid ""
"Everyone likes charts (!), so let us add a pie chart in our dashboard. It "
"will display the proportions of t-shirts sold for each size: S/M/L/XL/XXL."
msgstr ""
"Hamma diagrammalarni yaxshi ko'radi (!), shuning uchun dashboard'imizga "
"doiraviy diagramma qo'shamiz. U har bir o'lcham uchun sotilgan futbolkalar "
"nisbatini ko'rsatadi: S/M/L/XL/XXL."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:262
msgid ""
"For this exercise, we will use `Chart.js <https://www.chartjs.org/>`_. It is "
"the chart library used by the graph view. However, it is not loaded by "
"default, so we will need to either add it to our assets bundle, or lazy load "
"it. Lazy loading is usually better since our users will not have to load the "
"chartjs code every time if they don't need it."
msgstr ""
"Bu mashq uchun biz `Chart.js <https://www.chartjs.org/>`_ dan foydalanamiz. "
"Bu graph view tomonidan ishlatiladigan diagramma kutubxonasi. Biroq u sukut "
"bo'yicha yuklanmaydi, shuning uchun uni yoki assets bundle'imizga "
"qo'shishimiz, yoki lazy load qilishimiz kerak bo'ladi. Lazy loading odatda "
"yaxshiroq, chunki foydalanuvchilarimizga chartjs kodi kerak bo'lmasa, uni "
"har doim yuklashlari shart bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:267
msgid "Create a `PieChart` component."
msgstr "`PieChart` component yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:268
msgid ""
"In its `onWillStart` method, load chartjs, you can use the `loadJs <https://"
"github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/"
"web/static/src/core/assets.js#L23>`_ function to load :file:`/web/static/lib/"
"Chart/Chart.js`."
msgstr ""
"Uning `onWillStart` method'ida chartjs'ni yuklang; :file:`/web/static/lib/"
"Chart/Chart.js` faylini yuklash uchun `loadJs <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/core/"
"assets.js#L23>`_ funksiyasidan foydalanishingiz mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:272
msgid ""
"Use the `PieChart` component in a `DashboardItem` to display a `pie chart "
"<https://www.chartjs.org/docs/2.8.0/charts/doughnut.html>`_ that shows the "
"quantity for each sold t-shirts in each size (that information is available "
"in the `/statistics` route). Note that you can use the `size` property to "
"make it look larger."
msgstr ""
"Har bir o'lchamdagi sotilgan futbolkalar sonini ko'rsatuvchi `pie chart "
"<https://www.chartjs.org/docs/2.8.0/charts/doughnut.html>`_ ni chiqarish "
"uchun `DashboardItem` ichida `PieChart` component'ini ishlating (bu ma'lumot "
"`/statistics` route'da mavjud). Uni kattaroq ko'rinishi uchun `size` "
"property'sidan foydalanishingiz mumkinligini yodda tuting."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:276
msgid ""
"The `PieChart` component will need to render a canvas, and draw on it using "
"`chart.js`."
msgstr ""
"`PieChart` component canvas render qilishi va unda `chart.js` yordamida "
"chizishi kerak bo'ladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:284
msgid ""
"`Example: lazy loading a js file <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/views/graph/"
"graph_renderer.js#L57>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Misol: js faylni lazy loading qilish <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/views/graph/"
"graph_renderer.js#L57>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:287
msgid ""
"`Example: rendering a chart in a component <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/"
"blob/1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/views/"
"graph/graph_renderer.js#L618>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Misol: component ichida diagramma render qilish <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/blob/1f4e583ba20a01f4c44b0a4ada42c4d3bb074273/ addons/web/static/src/"
"views/graph/graph_renderer.js#L618>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:292
msgid "7. Real life update"
msgstr "7. Real hayotdagi yangilanish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:294
msgid ""
"Since we moved the data loading in a cache, it never updates. But let us say "
"that we are looking at fast moving data, so we want to periodically (for "
"example, every 10min) reload fresh data."
msgstr ""
"Ma'lumot yuklanishini cache'ga ko'chirganimiz sababli, u endi hech qachon "
"yangilanmaydi. Ammo tez o'zgaruvchi ma'lumot bilan ishlayotganimizni "
"tasavvur qilsak, biz vaqti-vaqti bilan (masalan, har 10 daqiqada) yangi "
"ma'lumotni qayta yuklashni xohlaymiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:298
msgid ""
"This is quite simple to implement, with a `setTimeout` or `setInterval` in "
"the statistics service. However, here is the tricky part: if the dashboard "
"is currently being displayed, it should be updated immediately."
msgstr ""
"Buni amalga oshirish juda oson: statistics service'ida `setTimeout` yoki "
"`setInterval` ishlatish kifoya. Biroq murakkab jihati shunda: agar dashboard "
"shu paytda ko'rsatilib turgan bo'lsa, u darhol yangilanishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:302
msgid ""
"To do that, one can use a `reactive` object: it is just like the proxy "
"returned by `useState`, but not linked to any component. A component can "
"then do a `useState` on it to subscribe to its changes."
msgstr ""
"Buning uchun `reactive` obyektidan foydalanish mumkin: u `useState` "
"qaytaradigan proxy'ga o'xshaydi, lekin hech qanday component'ga "
"bog'lanmagan. Keyin component uning o'zgarishlariga obuna bo'lish uchun unda "
"`useState` ishlatishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:307
msgid ""
"Update the statistics service to reload data every 10 minutes (to test it, "
"use 10s instead!)"
msgstr ""
"Statistics service'ini har 10 daqiqada ma'lumotni qayta yuklaydigan qilib "
"o'zgartiring (sinash uchun 10 daqiqa emas, 10 soniya ishlating!)"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:308
msgid ""
"Modify it to return a `reactive <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/"
"v2/reference/reactivity.md#reactive>`_ object. Reloading data should update "
"the reactive object in place."
msgstr ""
"Uni `reactive <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/reference/"
"reactivity.md#reactive>`_ obyekt qaytaradigan qilib o'zgartiring. Ma'lumotni "
"qayta yuklash reactive obyektni joyida yangilashi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:310
msgid "The `Dashboard` component can now use it with a `useState`"
msgstr "`Dashboard` component endi uni `useState` bilan ishlatishi mumkin"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:313
msgid ""
"`Documentation on reactivity <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/reactivity.md>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Reactivity haqida hujjat <https://github.com/odoo/owl/blob/master/doc/v2/"
"reference/reactivity.md>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:314
msgid ""
"`Example: Use of reactive in a service <https://github.com/odoo/odoo/blob/"
"bb1b5aed9b6d96ae1b0d044341812b51ed72a05d/ addons/mail/static/src/discuss/"
"call/common/rtc_service.js#L124>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Misol: service ichida reactive'dan foydalanish <https://github.com/odoo/"
"odoo/blob/bb1b5aed9b6d96ae1b0d044341812b51ed72a05d/ addons/mail/static/src/"
"discuss/call/common/rtc_service.js#L124>`_"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:319
msgid "8. Lazy loading the dashboard"
msgstr "8. Dashboard'ni lazy loading qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:321
msgid ""
"Let us imagine that our dashboard is getting quite big, and is only of "
"interest to some of our users. In that case, it could make sense to lazy "
"load our dashboard, and all related assets, so we only pay the cost of "
"loading the code when we actually want to look at it."
msgstr ""
"Dashboard'imiz ancha kattalashib borayotganini va faqat ba'zi "
"foydalanuvchilarimizga qiziq bo'lishini tasavvur qilaylik. Bunday holatda "
"dashboard'ni va unga tegishli barcha asset'larni lazy load qilish maqsadga "
"muvofiq bo'ladi: shunda kodni yuklash xarajatini faqat unga qarashni "
"xohlaganimizda to'laymiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:326
msgid ""
"One way to do this is to use `LazyComponent` (from `@web/core/assets`) as an "
"intermediate that will load an asset bundle before displaying our component."
msgstr ""
"Buning bir yo'li: component'imizni ko'rsatishdan oldin asset bundle'ni "
"yuklaydigan oraliq bo'g'in sifatida `LazyComponent` (`@web/core/assets` dan) "
"dan foydalanish."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:331
msgid ":file:`example_action.js`:"
msgstr ":file:`example_action.js`:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:344
msgid ""
"Move all dashboard assets into a sub folder :file:`/dashboard` to make it "
"easier to add to a bundle."
msgstr ""
"Barcha dashboard asset'larini bundle'ga qo'shishni osonlashtirish "
"uchun :file:`/dashboard` ichki papkasiga ko'chiring."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:346
msgid ""
"Create a `awesome_dashboard.dashboard` assets bundle containing all content "
"of the :file:`/dashboard` folder."
msgstr ""
":file:`/dashboard` papkasining butun mazmunini o'z ichiga olgan "
"`awesome_dashboard.dashboard` assets bundle'ini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:348
msgid ""
"Modify :file:`dashboard.js` to register itself to the `lazy_components` "
"registry instead of `actions`."
msgstr ""
":file:`dashboard.js` ni o'zgartirib, uni `actions` o'rniga `lazy_components` "
"registry'ga ro'yxatdan o'tkazing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:349
msgid ""
"In :file:`src/dashboard_action.js`, create an intermediate component that "
"uses `LazyComponent` and register it to the `actions` registry."
msgstr ""
":file:`src/dashboard_action.js` da `LazyComponent` dan foydalanadigan oraliq "
"component yarating va uni `actions` registry'ga ro'yxatdan o'tkazing."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:353
msgid "9. Making our dashboard generic"
msgstr "9. Dashboard'imizni generic qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:355
msgid ""
"So far, we have a nice working dashboard. But it is currently hardcoded in "
"the dashboard template. What if we want to customize our dashboard? Maybe "
"some users have different needs and want to see other data."
msgstr ""
"Hozirgacha bizda yaxshi ishlaydigan dashboard bor. Ammo u dashboard "
"template'ida qattiq yozilgan (hardcoded). Agar dashboard'imizni "
"moslashtirishni xohlasak-chi? Ehtimol, ba'zi foydalanuvchilarning "
"ehtiyojlari boshqacha va ular boshqa ma'lumotlarni ko'rishni xohlashadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:359
msgid ""
"So, the next step is to make our dashboard generic: instead of hard-coding "
"its content in the template, it can just iterate over a list of dashboard "
"items. But then, many questions come up: how to represent a dashboard item, "
"how to register it, what data should it receive, and so on. There are many "
"different ways to design such a system, with different trade-offs."
msgstr ""
"Shunday qilib, keyingi qadam dashboard'imizni generic qilish: uning "
"mazmunini template'da qattiq yozish o'rniga, u shunchaki dashboard item'lari "
"ro'yxati bo'ylab iteratsiya qilishi mumkin. Lekin shunda ko'p savollar paydo "
"bo'ladi: dashboard item'ni qanday tasvirlash, uni qanday ro'yxatdan "
"o'tkazish, u qanday ma'lumot olishi kerak va h.k. Bunday tizimni "
"loyihalashning turli xil, har biri o'z murosalariga ega yo'llari bor."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:365
msgid ""
"For this tutorial, we will say that a dashboard item is an object with the "
"following structure:"
msgstr ""
"Bu qo'llanma uchun biz dashboard item deb quyidagi tuzilishga ega obyektni "
"tushunamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:381
msgid ""
"The `description` value will be useful in a later exercise to show the name "
"of items that the user can add to their dashboard. The `size` number is "
"optional, and simply describes the size of the dashboard item that will be "
"displayed. Finally, the `props` function is optional. If not given, we will "
"simply give the `statistics` object as data. But if it is defined, it will "
"be used to compute specific props for the component."
msgstr ""
"`description` qiymati keyingi mashqda foydalanuvchi o'z dashboard'iga "
"qo'shishi mumkin bo'lgan item'lar nomini ko'rsatish uchun foydali bo'ladi. "
"`size` soni majburiy emas va shunchaki ko'rsatiladigan dashboard item "
"o'lchamini tavsiflaydi. Nihoyat, `props` funksiyasi ham majburiy emas. Agar "
"berilmasa, biz ma'lumot sifatida shunchaki `statistics` obyektini beramiz. "
"Ammo agar u aniqlangan bo'lsa, component uchun maxsus props'larni "
"hisoblashda ishlatiladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:387
msgid ""
"The goal is to replace the content of the dashboard with the following "
"snippet:"
msgstr "Maqsad dashboard mazmunini quyidagi parcha bilan almashtirish:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:398
msgid ""
"Note that the above example features two advanced features of Owl: dynamic "
"components and dynamic props."
msgstr ""
"Yuqoridagi misol Owl'ning ikki ilg'or imkoniyatidan foydalanishini yodda "
"tuting: dinamik component'lar va dinamik props."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:400
msgid ""
"We currently have two kinds of item components: number cards with a title "
"and a number, and pie cards with some label and a pie chart."
msgstr ""
"Hozirda bizda ikki xil item component bor: sarlavha va son bilan number "
"card'lar, hamda biror yorliq va doiraviy diagramma bilan pie card'lar."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:403
msgid ""
"Create and implement two components: `NumberCard` and `PieChartCard`, with "
"the corresponding props."
msgstr ""
"Mos props'lar bilan ikkita component yarating va amalga oshiring: "
"`NumberCard` va `PieChartCard`."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:404
msgid ""
"Create a file :file:`dashboard_items.js` in which you define and export a "
"list of items, using `NumberCard` and `PieChartCard` to recreate our current "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Joriy dashboard'imizni qayta yaratish uchun `NumberCard` va `PieChartCard` "
"dan foydalanib, item'lar ro'yxatini aniqlaydigan va export "
"qiladigan :file:`dashboard_items.js` faylini yarating."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:406
msgid ""
"Import that list of items in our `Dashboard` component, add it to the "
"component, and update the template to use a `t-foreach` like shown above."
msgstr ""
"O'sha item'lar ro'yxatini `Dashboard` component'imizga import qiling, uni "
"component'ga qo'shing va template'ni yuqorida ko'rsatilganidek `t-foreach` "
"ishlatadigan qilib yangilang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:415
msgid "And now, our dashboard template is generic!"
msgstr "Va endi dashboard template'imiz generic bo'ldi!"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:418
msgid "10. Making our dashboard extensible"
msgstr "10. Dashboard'imizni kengaytiriladigan qilish"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:420
msgid ""
"However, the content of our item list is still hardcoded. Let us fix that by "
"using a registry:"
msgstr ""
"Biroq item ro'yxatimiz mazmuni hamon qattiq yozilgan. Buni registry "
"yordamida tuzatamiz:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:422
msgid ""
"Instead of exporting a list, register all dashboard items in a "
"`awesome_dashboard` registry"
msgstr ""
"Ro'yxatni export qilish o'rniga, barcha dashboard item'larini "
"`awesome_dashboard` registry'ga ro'yxatdan o'tkazing"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:423
msgid ""
"Import all the items of the `awesome_dashboard` registry in the `Dashboard` "
"component"
msgstr ""
"`awesome_dashboard` registry'ning barcha item'larini `Dashboard` "
"component'iga import qiling"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:425
msgid ""
"The dashboard is now easily extensible. Any other Odoo addon that wants to "
"register a new item to the dashboard can just add it to the registry."
msgstr ""
"Dashboard endi osongina kengaytiriladi. Dashboard'ga yangi item ro'yxatdan "
"o'tkazishni xohlagan har qanday boshqa Odoo addon uni shunchaki registry'ga "
"qo'shishi mumkin."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:429
msgid "11. Add and remove dashboard items"
msgstr "11. Dashboard item'larini qo'shish va olib tashlash"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:431
msgid ""
"Let us see how we can make our dashboard customizable. To make it simple, we "
"will save the user dashboard configuration in the local storage so that it "
"is persistent, but we don't have to deal with the server for now."
msgstr ""
"Keling, dashboard'imizni qanday sozlanadigan qilish mumkinligini ko'rib "
"chiqamiz. Ishni oddiy qilish uchun foydalanuvchi dashboard "
"konfiguratsiyasini local storage'da saqlaymiz — shunda u saqlanib qoladi, "
"ammo hozircha server bilan ishlashimiz shart bo'lmaydi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:435
msgid ""
"The dashboard configuration will be saved as a list of removed item ids."
msgstr ""
"Dashboard konfiguratsiyasi olib tashlangan element id'lari ro'yxati sifatida "
"saqlanadi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:437
msgid ""
"Add a button in the control panel with a gear icon to indicate that it is a "
"settings button."
msgstr ""
"Control panel'ga shesterna belgisi (gear icon) bilan tugma qo'shing — bu "
"uning sozlamalar tugmasi ekanini bildiradi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:438
msgid "Clicking on that button should open a dialog."
msgstr "Bu tugmani bosganda dialog ochilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:439
msgid ""
"In that dialog, we want to see a list of all existing dashboard items, each "
"with a checkbox."
msgstr ""
"Ushbu dialog ichida mavjud barcha dashboard element'lari ro'yxatini "
"ko'rishni xohlaymiz, har biri checkbox bilan."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:440
msgid ""
"There should be a `Apply` button in the footer. Clicking on it will build a "
"list of all item ids that are unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Footer'da `Apply` tugmasi bo'lishi kerak. Uni bosganda belgilanmagan barcha "
"element id'lari ro'yxati tuziladi."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:442
msgid "We want to store that value in the local storage."
msgstr "Ushbu qiymatni local storage'da saqlamoqchimiz."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:443
msgid ""
"And modify the `Dashboard` component to filter the current items by removing "
"the ids of items from the configuration."
msgstr ""
"Hamda `Dashboard` component'ini o'zgartirib, konfiguratsiyadagi element "
"id'larini olib tashlash orqali joriy element'larni filtrlang."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:451
msgid "12. Going further"
msgstr "12. Yanada chuqurroq"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:453
msgid ""
"Here is a list of some small improvements you could try to do if you have "
"the time:"
msgstr ""
"Agar vaqtingiz bo'lsa, sinab ko'rishingiz mumkin bo'lgan bir nechta kichik "
"yaxshilanishlar ro'yxati:"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:455
msgid ""
"Make sure your application can be :ref:`translated <reference/translations>` "
"(with `env._t`)."
msgstr ""
"Ilovangiz :ref:`tarjima qilinishi <reference/translations>` mumkinligiga "
"ishonch hosil qiling (`env._t` bilan)."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:457
msgid ""
"Clicking on a section of the pie chart should open a list view of all orders "
"that have the corresponding size."
msgstr ""
"Pie chart'ning biror bo'limini bosganda mos o'lchamga ega barcha "
"order'larning list view'i ochilishi kerak."

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:459
msgid "Save the content of the dashboard in a user setting on the server!"
msgstr "Dashboard tarkibini serverdagi foydalanuvchi sozlamasida saqlang!"

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/discover_js_framework/02_build_a_dashboard.rst:460
msgid ""
"Make it responsive: in mobile mode, each card should take 100% of the width."
msgstr ""
"Uni moslashuvchan (responsive) qiling: mobil rejimda har bir card "
"kenglikning 100% ini egallashi kerak."

