"the invoice (as creating the invoice accesses the property, therefore "
"triggers an ACL check) e.g.::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:336
msgid ""
"You should see ``reached`` in your Odoo log, followed by an access error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/restrict_data_access.rst:338
msgid ""
"Just because you're already in Python code does not mean any access right or "
"rule has or will be checked."
