msgid ""
"It is also important to note that even though we can directly override "
"the :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.unlink` method, you will almost always want to "
"write a new method with the decorator :func:`~odoo.api.ondelete` instead. "
"Methods marked with this decorator will be called "
"during :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.unlink` and avoids some issues that can "
"occur during uninstalling the model's module "
"when :meth:`~odoo.models.Model.unlink` is directly overridden."
