msgstr ""

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/14_qwebintro.rst:57
msgid ""
"``<templates>``: defines a list of :ref:`reference/qweb` templates. Kanban "
"views *must* define at least one root template ``card``, which will be "
"rendered once for each record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/14_qwebintro.rst:59
msgid ""
"``<t t-name=\"card\">``: ``<t>`` is a placeholder element for QWeb "
"directives. In this case, it is used to set the ``name`` of the template to "
"``card``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../content/developer/tutorials/server_framework_101/14_qwebintro.rst:61
msgid ""
"``<field name=\"name\"/>``: this will add the ``name`` field to the view."
msgstr ""

